INSERT INTO `catalog_product_entity_text` VALUES (172687,75,0,66317,'144 serving bucket of powdered eggs for emergency outdoor or everyday use. No refrigeration required. Easy to prepare. Convenient to store. 25-year shelf-life.'),(172688,75,1,66317,'<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.999999999999998pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Emergency Freeze Dried Powdered Eggs - 144 Servings</span></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">144 serving bucket of powdered eggs for emergency, outdoor, or everyday use. </span></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">No refrigeration required. Easy to prepare. Convenient to store. 25-year shelf-life.</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Additional Product Details:</span></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Includes 1 total bucket</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">11,520 total calories</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Each pouch contains 24 servings</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">25 year shelf life</span></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Total Weight: 7 lbs (per bucket)</span></p>'),(584609,76,1,66317,'<p>No refrigeration required. Easy to prepare. Convenient to store. 25-year shelf-life.</p>\r\n<p>• Includes 1 total bucket</p>\r\n<p>• 11,520 total calories</p>\r\n<p>• Each pouch contains 24 servings</p>'),(584610,85,1,66317,'ReadyWise Emergency Freeze Dried Powdered Eggs 144 Servings '),(174968,75,0,67623,'<p><span>The TRiLIGHT ShopLight V2 quickly transforms from a 360-degree 5000 True Lumen drop light, into an omni-directional shop light, and any light pattern in-between. This adaptability offers a wider variety of more useful light arrays in comparison to traditional shop lighting.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>STKR Concepts is proud to announce the evolution of its successful TRiLIGHT with the new TRiLIGHT ShopLight V2. The patent-pending TRiLIGHT ShopLight V2 combines the features of a shop light with the benefits of a drop light, to introduce to the market never before seen versatility and blinding light output.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>Quickly transform from a 360-degree drop light, into an omni-directional shop light, and any light pattern in-between. This adaptability offers a wider variety of more useful light arrays in comparison to traditional lighting.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>5000 True Lumens of light from the 3 aluminum LED heads. These aluminum heads function as a heat sink, ensuring the LEDs always operate at the lowest temperature possible. Keeping LEDs cool allows them to achieve their highest performance level while simultaneously safeguarding the LEDs lifespan.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>We have intentionally and unintentionally drop-tested the TRiLIGHT ShopLight V2 numerous times. Use the TRiLIGHT ShopLight V2 with confidence, knowing it was constructed to be durable and survive a demanding work environment.</span></p>'),(4537259,75,1,67623,'<p>The TRiLIGHT ShopLight V2 quickly transforms from a 360-degree 5000 True Lumen drop light, into an omni-directional shop light, and any light pattern in-between. This adaptability offers a wider variety of more useful light arrays in comparison to traditional shop lighting.</p>\r\n<p>STKR Concepts is proud to announce the evolution of its successful TRiLIGHT with the new TRiLIGHT ShopLight V2. The patent-pending TRiLIGHT ShopLight V2 combines the features of a shop light with the benefits of a drop light, to introduce to the market never before seen versatility and blinding light output.</p>\r\n<p>Quickly transform from a 360-degree drop light, into an omni-directional shop light, and any light pattern in-between. This adaptability offers a wider variety of more useful light arrays in comparison to traditional lighting.</p>\r\n<p>5000 True Lumens of light from the 3 aluminum LED heads. These aluminum heads function as a heat sink, ensuring the LEDs always operate at the lowest temperature possible. Keeping LEDs cool allows them to achieve their highest performance level while simultaneously safeguarding the LEDs lifespan.</p>\r\n<p>We have intentionally and unintentionally drop-tested the TRiLIGHT ShopLight V2 numerous times. Use the TRiLIGHT ShopLight V2 with confidence, knowing it was constructed to be durable and survive a demanding work environment.</p>'),(4537260,85,1,67623,NULL),(175054,75,0,67701,'FEATURES:-Broad array multi-flood flashlight-Waterproof-160&deg; Flood & High intensity spot-400 Lumens'),(175055,75,1,67701,'<p>STKR is proud to announce their latest innovation in flashlights, the BAMFF Tactical Series. The BAMFF’s are a series of Dual LED Tactical Flashlights. BAMFF aka “Broad Array Multi Flood Flashlight” (among other creative acronyms), combines a powerful spotlight for long-distance visibility, with a wide-angle flood light for close range area lighting. These two LEDs can be used simultaneously or independently to provide you with more useful light and increase your overall visibility.</p>\r\n<p>A few flashlights offer flood and spotlight options, but they accomplish the two light options by using a zoom lens, making the user pick between flood or spot. The BAMFF series offers the user the option to flood the immediate area and cast a blinding spotlight into the distance, at the same time. This dual LED combination illuminates the users’ peripheral vision as well as their focal point. Users can now see far down the hiking trail, while also lighting up the area around their feet and both sides of the path.</p>\r\n<p>The BAMFF 4.0 features a Dual LED head, aircraft-grade aluminum body, waterproof construction, removable belt clip, S.O.S. and disorienting strobe modes, and tactical style bludgeon tip for self-defense. The 4.0 touts a respectable 400 lumens, is powered by 3 “AAA” batteries. The BAMFF 4.0 provides an optimum field of view for a wide array of activities including camping, hunting, hiking, police, military, repair, and daily carry.</p>\r\n<p>The BAMFF 4.0 will open your eyes to a whole new way of seeing at night. It eliminates the tunnel vision you get with a traditional flashlight and allows you to utilize your peripheral vision. The broader range of light greatly increases your field of view by illuminating objects, or even dangerous situations, that otherwise would have been left in the shadows.</p>'),(539077,76,1,67701,'<ul>\r\n<li>Dual LED Tactical Flashlight </li>\r\n<li>Use the wide-angle Floodlight and blinding spotlight at the same time or independently</li>\r\n<li>Aircraft Grade Aluminum with bludgeon tip</li>\r\n<li>400 lumens with 6 modes including SOS and disorienting strobe</li>\r\n<li>Lanyard for easy carry</li>\r\n</ul>'),(539078,85,1,67701,NULL),(175056,75,0,67702,'<p>FEATURES:-Broad array multi-flood flashlight-Waterproof-160° Flood &amp; High intensity spot-600 Lumens</p>'),(175057,75,1,67702,'<p>STKR is proud to announce their latest innovation in flashlights, the BAMFF Tactical Series. The BAMFF’s are a series of Dual LED Tactical Flashlights. BAMFF aka “Broad Array Multi Flood Flashlight” (among other creative acronyms), combines a powerful spotlight for long-distance visibility, with a wide-angle flood light for close range area lighting. These two LEDs can be used simultaneously or independently to provide you with more useful light and increase your overall visibility. A few flashlights offer flood and spotlight options, but they accomplish the two light options by using a zoom lens, making the user pick between flood or spot. The BAMFF series offers the user the option to flood the immediate area and cast a blinding spotlight into the distance, at the same time. This dual LED combination illuminates the users’ peripheral vision as well as their focal point. Users can now see far down the hiking trail, while also lighting up the area around their feet and both sides of the path. The BAMFF 6.0 features a Dual LED head, aircraft-grade aluminum body, waterproof construction, removable belt clip, S.O.S. and disorienting strobe modes, and tactical style bludgeon tip for self-defense. The 6.0 comes with a 18650 rechargeable Lithium-Ion battery (2000mAh) and USB charging kit. Also, as a unique emergency feature, the BAMFF 6.0 comes with a “AAA” battery cartridge for those times when you can’t charge your rechargeable 18650 battery, thus ensuring you are never left in the dark. The BAMFF 6.0 pierces the night sky with 600 lumens, providing an optimum field of view for a wide array of activities including camping, hunting, hiking, police, military, repair. The BAMFF 6.0 will open your eyes to a whole new way of seeing at night. It eliminates the tunnel vision you get with a traditional flashlight and allows you to utilize your peripheral vision. The broader range of light greatly increases your field of view by illuminating objects, or even dangerous situations, that otherwise would have been left in the shadows.</p>'),(539079,76,1,67702,'<ul>\r\n<li>Dual LED Tactical Flashlight featuring CREE LEDs</li>\r\n<li>Use the wide-angle Floodlight and blinding spotlight at the same time or independently</li>\r\n<li>Aircraft Grade Aluminum with bludgeon tip</li>\r\n<li>2000 mAh rechargeable 18650 battery + charging kit and \"AAA\" backup battery cartridge</li>\r\n<li>600 Lumens with 6 modes including SOS and disorienting strobe!</li>\r\n</ul>'),(697653,85,1,67702,NULL),(175058,75,0,67703,'Striker LIGHTS AND ACCESSORIES STRIKER TRILIGHT MOTION ACTIVATED GARAGE/WORK LIGHT 00342 894717003429'),(175059,75,1,67703,'<p>The TRiLIGHT is a motion-activated ceiling light for the garage, basement, or any room in the home that requires more light than a traditional light bulb can produce. Most importantly, it delivers the power of a lighting system that typically requires an expensive install by a licensed electrician, but it is as easy as screwing in a light bulb.</p>\r\n<p>The TRiLIGHT boasts an impressive 4000 lumens of light output! Compare that to a traditional 60-watt bulb producing 800 lumens of light and you will see that the TRiLIGHT is a powerhouse. Additionally, the TRiLIGHT only draws 24 watts of power making it both friendly to the environment and to your wallet by saving you money on the power bill every month.</p>\r\n<p>The TRiLIGHT also features an ultra-sensitive motion sensor, which will detect your presence when you enter the room or detect the motion of the garage door when you drive home at night. The motion sensor is fully adjustable allowing the sensitivity to be turned down for smaller rooms, or turned off completely allowing the Trilight to be 100% controlled by the light switch. Additionally, users can bypass the motion-sensing feature for 2 hours by flipping the light switch off, then on, twice. A great feature if you want to prevent the light from turning off when there is no motion.</p>\r\n<p>The TRiLIGHT produces 5 times the illumination of a traditional garage door opener light, ensuring that garages are well lit when drivers arrive home at night. Illuminate your entire garage, basement, attic, or any space just as easy as screwing in a light bulb!</p>'),(539081,76,1,67703,'<p>The TRiLIGHT is a motion-activated ceiling light for the garage, basement, or any room in the home that requires more light than a traditional light bulb can produce.</p>\r\n<p>• 4000 lumens - 5 times the brightness of a 60 watt bulb</p>\r\n<p>• Only draws 24 watts of power</p>\r\n<p>• Adjustable Motion Sensor</p>'),(539082,85,1,67703,NULL),(175060,75,0,67704,'<p><span>The FLEXIT Solar has 1 CREE LED for the spot light, 12 Lumen Tech premium LEDs and 4 bright red LEDs. The light features 5 light modes (high spot and flood, high flood, low flood, red night vision, strobe). The durable base has two large neodymium magnets with a non-marring rubber pad, so users can stick the FLEXIT to any steel surface, as well as an integrated hang hook giving the user even more options for hands-free use.</span></p>'),(175061,75,1,67704,'<p><strong>STKR is proud to announce the evolution of its successful FLEXIT light with the new FLEXIT Solar. </strong></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>The FLEXIT SOLAR Light is a new addition to the FLEXIT family of hands-free, flexible LED flashlights.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Now with a built-in rechargeable lithium-ion battery, which charges via the sun or with a USB cable. Its ultra-thin, flexible body allows an unlimited amount of light projections.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Create a focused spot light, a broad flood light, or a lantern with 360 degrees of light output. It also features a powerful CREE LED spot light, allowing the user to see further.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>The durable Shape-Loc frame will hold the desired shape and make it easy for users to bend, fold, wrap, stick or hook the FLEXIT around objects to position and aim the light hands-free.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• 500 lumens</p>\r\n<p>• Center CREE LED spotlight</p>\r\n<p>• Dual charging via solar panel or micro-USB port</p>\r\n<p>• Red night reading LEDs</p>\r\n<p>• Fully flexible body</p>\r\n<p>• Non-marring rubber magnetic durable base</p>\r\n<p>• Shape-Loc frame</p>\r\n<p>• 5 light modes</p>\r\n<p>• Weather resistant</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• Model# 00346</p>\r\n<p>• 500 lumens</p>\r\n<p>• 12 Lumen-Tech white LEDs</p>\r\n<p>• 4 Lumen-Tech red LEDs</p>\r\n<p>• Solar Panel</p>\r\n<p>• Micro-USB port</p>\r\n<p>• Fully flexible body 3D</p>\r\n<p>• 2 Neodymium magnets</p>\r\n<p>• Durable A.B.S. body with non-marring rubber base</p>\r\n<p>• Shape-Loc frame</p>\r\n<p>• On/off button</p>\r\n<p>• mode button</p>\r\n<p>• Runtime: 70 hours on low setting</p>\r\n<p>• Integrated Lithium-ion battery</p>\r\n<p>• Size: 11.5 in. height x 5.75 in. width</p>\r\n<p>• Weather resistant</p>\r\n<p>• 1 year warranty</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><strong>5 modes:</strong></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• High Spot &amp; High Flood</p>\r\n<p>• High Flood</p>\r\n<p>• Low Flood</p>\r\n<p>• Red Night Vision</p>\r\n<p>• Strobe</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>The FLEXIT Solar has 1 CREE LED for the spot light, 12 Lumen Tech premium LEDs and 4 bright red LEDs.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>The light features 5 light modes (high spot and flood, high flood, low flood, red night vision, strobe).</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>The durable base has two large neodymium magnets with a non-marring rubber pad, so users can stick the FLEXIT to any steel surface, as well as an integrated hang hook giving the user even more options for hands-free use.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><strong>Why Customers Who Chose This Product:</strong></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><em>\"Awesome light. I use it for work, my job requires a lot of time spent in various basements and then I have been using the Flexit when I go fishing at night. Have not been using the solar feature yet to charge it, just using USB method. I love it\" Jason R.</em></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><em>\"As a mechanic I use this every single day. It is perfect with the magnets and the hook. I had the 4.0 and loved it so much that I had to try this one, with more light and the recharging aspect.\" Kody E.</em></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><em>\"The weather finally warmed up enough for me to take my annual hiking/camping trip in the Cloudcroft, NM area. I was a little nervous that this light wouldn\'t be what it claimed, so I took my arsenal of flashlights with me as well. I left them all in the TRUCK!! The Flexit solar was the only flashlight I needed the whole weekend. Perfect for everything I needed in the tent -- night time nature calls-- and finding wood for my fire. I couldn\'t be happier and I will be purchasing one for a couple of my camping buddys soon. This light ROCKS!!!\" Sam</em></p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(388407,76,0,67704,'<p>The FLEXIT Solar has 1 CREE LED for the spot light, 12 Lumen Tech premium LEDs and 4 bright red LEDs. The light features 5 light modes (high spot and flood, high flood, low flood, red night vision, strobe). The durable base has two large neodymium magnets with a non-marring rubber pad, so users can stick the FLEXIT to any steel surface, as well as an integrated hang hook giving the user even more options for hands-free use.</p>\r\n<p><br /><br /></p>\r\n<p>• 500 lumens</p>\r\n<p>• Center CREE LED spot light</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• Dual charging via solar panel or micro-USB port</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• Red night reading LEDs</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• Fully flexible body</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• 5 light modes</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• Weather resistant</p>\r\n<p></p>'),(655768,76,1,67704,'<p>The light features 5 light modes (high spot and flood, high flood, low flood, red night vision, strobe).</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• Weather Resistant</p>\r\n<p>• 5 Light Modes</p>\r\n<p>• 500 Lumens</p>'),(388408,85,0,67704,'Flexible Flashlight with Solar Charging'),(539084,85,1,67704,'Flexible Flashlight with Solar Charging'),(190125,75,0,82778,'FEATURES:-Ideal balance between capacity & transportability-Shoulder straps have breathable padding & quick-release buckles-5 zippered storage areas-4 pen holders-Internal organization system for securing flashlights, knives, tools, etc.-Hook & Loop panel for patches-Back-relief panel for added comfort during extended use-MOLLE webbing allows attachment of load-bearing equipment-Hydration reservoir compatible-ID card window'),(199695,75,1,82778,'FEATURES:-Ideal balance between capacity & transportability-Shoulder straps have breathable padding & quick-release buckles-5 zippered storage areas-4 pen holders-Internal organization system for securing flashlights, knives, tools, etc.-Hook & Loop panel for patches-Back-relief panel for added comfort during extended use-MOLLE webbing allows attachment of load-bearing equipment-Hydration reservoir compatible-ID card window'),(374472,85,0,82778,'DRAGO TRACKER BACKPACK GREEN'),(676540,85,1,82778,'DRAGO TRACKER BACKPACK GREEN'),(190376,75,0,83113,'<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Fuego LT series of spinning reels, state of the art fishing tools that define Daiwa&rsquo;s commitment to the LT Concept of lighter, tougher material. With conventional, heavier spinning reels, long hours of casting and retrieving can fatigue the arms and hands.The Fuego LT housing is light but sturdy constructed from a Carbon based material. The innovative Magsealed main shaft delivers butter smooth performance while preventing water or dirt intrusion. The technology uses a Mag Oil that can be magnetically solidified similar to a packing on a boat&rsquo;s propeller shaft. Oil smooth operation as well as a water and impurities barrier makes the design and function unparalleled. The Machined Aluminum handle is ergonomically correct and screws easily into the body.&nbsp;</span></p>'),(201627,75,1,83113,'<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Fuego LT series of spinning reels, state of the art fishing tools that define Daiwa&rsquo;s commitment to the LT Concept of lighter, tougher material. With conventional, heavier spinning reels, long hours of casting and retrieving can fatigue the arms and hands.The Fuego LT housing is light but sturdy constructed from a Carbon based material. The innovative Magsealed main shaft delivers butter smooth performance while preventing water or dirt intrusion. The technology uses a Mag Oil that can be magnetically solidified similar to a packing on a boat&rsquo;s propeller shaft. Oil smooth operation as well as a water and impurities barrier makes the design and function unparalleled. The Machined Aluminum handle is ergonomically correct and screws easily into the body.&nbsp;</span></p>'),(191219,75,0,84364,'<p><span style=\"caret-color: #666666; color: #666666; font-family: roboto, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: #fefefe;\">Bling is constructed on a light wire frame for maximum vibration and uses River2Sea&rsquo;s new ultrathin blades and a premium ball bearing swivel for easier rotation at slower speeds.</span></p>'),(248915,75,1,84364,'<p><span style=\"caret-color: #666666; color: #666666; font-family: roboto, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: #fefefe;\">Bling is constructed on a light wire frame for maximum vibration and uses River2Sea&rsquo;s new ultrathin blades and a premium ball bearing swivel for easier rotation at slower speeds.</span></p>'),(201317,75,0,90106,'Offered in a wide variety of sizes to suit your specific angling needs, Daiwa\'s new Silvercast-A reels feature HardbodyzT rigid aluminum alloy construction, plus three ball bearings for smooth operation. Spincast anglers will also appreciate the new Soft Touch handle knob for increased cranking comfort and a more secure grip. FEATURES:: HardbodyzT Rigid Aluminum Alloy Construction; Three ball bearings; Rotating, Titanium Nitrided line pickup turns with the line for less wear, easier casting; Oversized line aperture for optimum performance; Smooth disc drag with dial adjustment; Soft Touch handle knob; Pre-wound with premium line.'),(207258,75,1,90106,'Offered in a wide variety of sizes to suit your specific angling needs, Daiwa\'s new Silvercast-A reels feature HardbodyzT rigid aluminum alloy construction, plus three ball bearings for smooth operation. Spincast anglers will also appreciate the new Soft Touch handle knob for increased cranking comfort and a more secure grip. FEATURES:: HardbodyzT Rigid Aluminum Alloy Construction; Three ball bearings; Rotating, Titanium Nitrided line pickup turns with the line for less wear, easier casting; Oversized line aperture for optimum performance; Smooth disc drag with dial adjustment; Soft Touch handle knob; Pre-wound with premium line.'),(208242,75,0,94228,'<p><span style=\"caret-color: #7b858a; color: #7b858a; font-family: roboto, sans-serif; font-size: small; letter-spacing: 0.20000000298023224px; background-color: #fefefe;\">River2Sea&rsquo;s Whopper Plopper, designed by the legendary angler Larry Dahlberg, is his secret weapon for musky fishing. The soft, pliable tail rotates on the harness and creates muskie alluring rumbles at variety retrieve speeds and depths. The tail is designed to withstand the punishment rendered rocks, stumps and muskies.</span></p>'),(248999,75,1,94228,'<p><span style=\"caret-color: #7b858a; color: #7b858a; font-family: roboto, sans-serif; font-size: small; letter-spacing: 0.20000000298023224px; background-color: #fefefe;\">River2Sea&rsquo;s Whopper Plopper, designed by the legendary angler Larry Dahlberg, is his secret weapon for musky fishing. The soft, pliable tail rotates on the harness and creates muskie alluring rumbles at variety retrieve speeds and depths. The tail is designed to withstand the punishment rendered rocks, stumps and muskies.</span></p>'),(212576,75,0,97970,'FEATURES:-Broad array & beam-200 Lumens-Weather resistant'),(229974,75,1,97970,'<p>The BAMFF’s are a series of Dual LED Tactical Flashlights. BAMFF aka “Broad Array Multi Flood Flashlight” (among other creative acronyms), combines a powerful spotlight for long-distance visibility, with a wide-angle flood light for close range area lighting.</p>\r\n<p>These two LEDs can be used simultaneously or independently to provide you with more useful light and increase your overall visibility.</p>\r\n<p>A few flashlights offer flood and spotlight options, but they accomplish the two light options by using a zoom lens, making the user pick between flood or spot. The BAMFF series offers the user the option to flood the immediate area and cast a blinding spotlight into the distance, at the same time.</p>\r\n<p>This dual LED combination illuminates the users’ peripheral vision as well as their focal point.</p>\r\n<p>Users can now see far down the hiking trail, while also lighting up the area around their feet and both sides of the path. The BAMFF 2.0 features a Dual LED head, aircraft-grade aluminum body, waterproof construction, removable belt clip, S.O.S. and disorienting strobe modes, and tactical style bludgeon tip for self-defense.</p>\r\n<p>The 2.0produces a respectable 200 lumens and is powered by 3 “AAA” batteries. The BAMFF 2.0 provides an optimum field of view for a wide array of activities including camping, hunting, hiking, police, military, repair, and daily carry.</p>\r\n<p>The BAMFF 2.0 will open your eyes to a whole new way of seeing at night. It eliminates the tunnel vision you get with a traditional flashlight and allows you to utilize your peripheral vision. The broader range of light greatly increases your field of view by illuminating objects, or even dangerous situations, that otherwise would have been left in the shadows.</p>'),(539085,76,1,97970,'<p>This dual LED combination illuminates the users’ peripheral vision as well as their focal point.</p>\r\n<p>• Dual LED tactical flashlight</p>\r\n<p>• Use the wide angle flood light and blinding spotlight at the same time or independently</p>\r\n<p>• Aircraft-grade aluminum with bludgeon tip</p>'),(539086,85,1,97970,'STKR BAMFF 2.0- 200 Lumen DUAL LED Flashlight'),(212582,75,0,97976,'<p><span>About the size of a baseball, The light mine professional provides 250 lumens of brightness power! The Functionally designed protruding Posts can be used as tripods or quad pods creating a 360-degree freestanding light. Twelve powerful Neodymium (rare earth) magnets are located the end of each post, allowing the user to attach and aim the light accurately and securely in any direction. Powerful lumen tech LEDs are used in the front white Lens (8 LEDs) and back Red lens (4 LEDs). The light mine professional has four electronic light functions; low power spot, high output flood, red night vision, and a high visibility signal beacon. The light mine professional easily fits into your car\'s glove compartment as a roadside repair light or into your saddle bag to be used as a hazard light for your motorcycle. Keep one in the shop as a Machinist light to attach to your drill Press or attach a lanyard and use it as a magnetic pickup tool for a dropped screw. Use one in the garage to stick to your car\'s hood for engine repairs or on a creeper when sliding under a car. Keep one in your home for repairs in small tight spaces, such as under the counter, behind a stereo, or when upgrading Computer equipment. Have one as your \'go-to\' Light; stick it to your refrigerator for emergency situations during a power outage, such as finding and flipping The circuit breaker. The potential uses are endless!</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">11 neodymium rare Earth magnets used to attach and aim light hands-free</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Use posts as tripods/quad-pods, creating a freestanding 360-degree light</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Four electronic light functions: low power, high output, red night vision, blinking red signal</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Lumen Tech high-output, wide-angle, intensely bright LEDs</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">AAA batteries are included</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(229973,75,1,97976,'<p>Based on the hugely successful Magnetic Light Mine, STKR has created a bigger, brighter, and more powerful version called the Light Mine Professional. The functionally designed protruding posts can be used as tripods or quad pods creating a 360-degree freestanding light. Due to the spherical shape and the 12 neodymium posts, the user can accurately and securely aim the light in any direction. The magnetic posts can be utilized as an easy-to-use pick-up tool or a nut &amp; bolt holder. The magnetic legs also act as tripods allowing the user to aim the light on non-metallic surfaces The Light Mine Professional offers rear-facing red LEDs that allow for night vision without dilating eyes. Switch from the solid red setting to the rapid flashing hazard signal for added safety during roadside repairs. Keep one stuck to the side of your refrigerator so it is easily accessed during a power outage. Stick the Light Mine to your fuse box to find that flipped breaker or use it to properly light home repair jobs or DIY projects. Keep another one stuck to the side of the toolbox in your garage for quick access. Stick it to your car’s hood for engine repairs or drop it under the sink for a quick plumbing fix. At the size of a baseball, it’s small enough to store in your cars’ glove compartment, or motorcycle saddlebags, yet powerful enough for roadside repairs or hazard light. The potential uses are endless. Boasting 250 True Lumens with 4 light settings, the Light Mine Pro will be your new favorite light for any task at hand.</p>'),(382541,76,0,97976,'<p><span>About the size of a baseball, The light mine professional provides 250 lumens of brightness power! The Functionally designed protruding Posts can be used as tripods or quad pods creating a 360-degree freestanding light. Twelve powerful Neodymium (rare earth) magnets are located the end of each post, allowing the user to attach and aim the light accurately and securely in any direction. Powerful lumen tech LEDs are used in the front white Lens (8 LEDs) and back Red lens (4 LEDs). The light mine professional has four electronic light functions; low power spot, high output flood, red night vision, and a high visibility signal beacon. The light mine professional easily fits into your car\'s glove compartment as a roadside repair light or into your saddle bag to be used as a hazard light for your motorcycle. Keep one in the shop as a Machinist light to attach to your drill Press or attach a lanyard and use it as a magnetic pickup tool for a dropped screw. Use one in the garage to stick to your car\'s hood for engine repairs or on a creeper when sliding under a car. Keep one in your home for repairs in small tight spaces, such as under the counter, behind a stereo, or when upgrading Computer equipment. Have one as your \'go-to\' Light; stick it to your refrigerator for emergency situations during a power outage, such as finding and flipping The circuit breaker. The potential uses are endless!</span></p>'),(382538,76,1,97976,'<ul>\r\n<li>12 Neodymium (Rare-Earth) magnets used to attach and aim light hands-free</li>\r\n<li>Use posts as tripods/quad-pods creating a freestanding 360-degree aim-able light</li>\r\n<li>250 True Lumens with 4 Electronic Light Functions: low power, high output, red night vision, red flashing hazard</li>\r\n<li>SMD high-output, wide-angle, intensely bright white LEDs + rear facing red LEDs</li>\r\n<li>Makes a great gift or stocking stuffer!  \"AAA\" Batteries included.</li>\r\n</ul>'),(382539,85,1,97976,NULL),(213055,75,0,98587,'FEATURES-Black-4.4\"-3 pack-Easily slides onto a Mil-Std Picatinny rail-Locks into place with a built-in retaining clip-Can be adjusted with a bullet tip-No tools required-Constructed from durable, heat & chemical-resistant synthetic polymer resin-Proven to reduce heat transfer & hand abrasions'),(229044,75,1,98587,'<p><span>Troy Industries\' Battle Rail Covers are engineered to survive the most extreme conditions. Constructed from durable, heat- &amp; chemical-resistant synthetic polymer resin, the Troy Battle Rail Cover quickly and easily slides onto a 1913 Picatinny Rail and locks into place with a built-in retaining clip. No tools required. The Battle Rail Cover protects unused rail space from damage and is more comfortable to grasp than a bare handguard. Made in the USA. Package of 3.</span></p>'),(539687,76,1,98587,'<p>The Troy Battle Rail Cover quickly and easily slides onto a 1913 Picatinny Rail</p>\r\n<p>4.4\"</p>\r\n<p>Locks into Place</p>\r\n<p>Not Tools Required</p>'),(388254,85,1,98587,'troy,industries,battle,rail,covers,engineered,survive,most,extreme,conditions,constructed,from,durable,heat-,chemical-resistant'),(213056,75,0,98588,'FEATURES-Black-6.2\"-3 pack-Easily slides onto a Mil-Std Picatinny rail-Locks into place with a built-in retaining clip-Can be adjusted with a bullet tip-No tools required-Constructed from durable, heat & chemical-resistant synthetic polymer resin-Proven to reduce heat transfer & hand abrasions'),(218692,75,1,98588,'<p><span>Troy Industries\' Battle Rail Covers are engineered to survive the most extreme conditions. Constructed from durable, heat- &amp; chemical-resistant synthetic polymer resin, the Troy Battle Rail Cover quickly and easily slides onto a 1913 Picatinny Rail and locks into place with a built-in retaining clip. No tools required. The Battle Rail Cover protects unused rail space from damage and is more comfortable to grasp than a bare handguard. Made in the USA. Package of 3.</span></p>'),(539688,76,1,98588,'<p><span>Rail Cover, 6.2\" 3-Pack -BLK</span></p>\r\n<p>No Tools Required</p>\r\n<p>Quickly and Easily Slides and Locks Into Place</p>'),(388255,85,1,98588,'troy,industries,battle,rail,covers,engineered,survive,most,extreme,conditions,constructed,from,durable,heat-,chemical-resistant'),(213057,75,0,98590,'FEATURES-Black-Sight can be moved or taken off without permanent modification to the firearm-A stainless-steel cross-locking system ensures sights remain upright & zeroed under extreme combat conditions-A push of a button folds the sights securely out of the way until you need them again-Machined from hardened aircraft aluminum with stainless steel components-Mil-Spec hardcoat anodized finish-Each click adjusts .50 MOA-No tools required for adjustment'),(218706,75,1,98590,'<p><span>Durability and dead-on accuracy make Troy BattleSights™ the hands-down first choice of Special Ops and Tactical Users Worldwide. </span></p>\r\n<p><span>Troy’s HK Front Folding BattleSight is easy to install and deploy, with no levers or springs to fumble with. No tools required for adjustment. </span></p>\r\n<p><span></span><strong>Features:</strong><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span>• Sight can be moved or taken off without permanent modification to the firearm. </span></p>\r\n<p><span>• A stainless-steel cross-locking system ensures sights remain upright and zeroed under extreme combat conditions. </span></p>\r\n<p><span>• A push of a button folds the sights securely out of the way until you need them again. </span></p>\r\n<p><span></span><strong>Technical Specifications:</strong><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span>• Machined from hardened Aircraft Aluminum with stainless steel components and finished in MIL-SPEC hardcoat anodizing. </span></p>\r\n<p><span>• Each click adjusts .50 MOA. Available in Black</span></p>'),(539503,76,1,98590,'<p><span>A push of a button folds the sights securely out of the way until you need them again.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>Front Flip-Up Battle Sight HK-Style </span></p>\r\n<p><span>Each click adjusts .50 MOA.</span></p>'),(388259,85,1,98590,'troy,industries,folding,front,battle,sights,feature,push-button,operation,tool-less,adjustment,constructed,aircraft,aluminum,with'),(213058,75,0,98591,'FEATURES-Black-Sight can be moved or taken off without permanent modification to the firearm-A stainless-steel cross-locking system ensures sights remain upright & zeroed under extreme combat conditions-A push of a button folds the sights securely out of the way until you need them again-Machined from hardened aircraft aluminum with stainless steel components-Mil-Spec hardcoat anodized finish-Each click adjusts .50 MOA-No tools required for adjustment'),(218707,75,1,98591,'<p><span>The Troy Industries folding front Battle Sights are easy to install and deply featuring push-button operation and tool-less adjustment. </span></p>\r\n<p><span></span><strong>Features:</strong><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><span>• Sight can be moved or taken off without permanent modification to the firearm. </span></p>\r\n<p><span>• A stainless-steel cross-locking system ensures sights remain upright and zeroed under extreme combat conditions. </span></p>\r\n<p><span>• A push of a button folds the sights securely out of the way until you need them again. </span></p>\r\n<p><span></span><strong>Technical Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n<p><span></span><span>• Machined from hardened Aircraft Aluminum with stainless steel components and finished in MIL-SPEC hardcoat anodizing. </span></p>\r\n<p><span>• Each click adjusts .50 MOA.</span></p>'),(539504,76,1,98591,'<p><span>Sight can be moved or taken off without permanent modification to the firearm.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>A push of a button folds the sights securely out of the way until you need them again.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>Each click adjusts .50 MOA.</span></p>'),(388260,85,1,98591,'troy,industries,folding,front,battle,sights,feature,push-button,operation,tool-less,adjustment,constructed,aircraft,aluminum,with'),(213059,75,0,98592,'FEATURES-Black-Sight can be moved or taken off without permanent modification to the firearm-A stainless-steel cross-locking system ensures sights remain upright & zeroed under extreme combat conditions-A push of a button folds the sights securely out of the way until you need them again-Machined from hardened aircraft aluminum with stainless steel components-Mil-Spec hardcoat anodized finish-Each click adjusts .50 MOA-No tools required for adjustment'),(218708,75,1,98592,'<p><span>Durability and dead-on accuracy make Troy BattleSights™ the hands-down first choice of Special Ops and Tactical Users Worldwide. </span></p>\r\n<p><span>Troy’s Rear Folding BattleSight is easy to install and deploy, with no levers or springs to fumble with. No tools required for adjustment. </span></p>\r\n<p><span></span><strong>Features:</strong><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><span>• Sight can be moved or taken off without permanent modification to the firearm. </span></p>\r\n<p><span>• A stainless-steel cross-locking system ensures sights remain upright and zeroed under extreme combat conditions. </span></p>\r\n<p><span>• A push of a button folds the sights securely out of the way until you need them again. </span></p>\r\n<p><span></span><strong>Technical Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n<p><span></span><span>• Machined from hardened Aircraft Aluminum with stainless steel components and finished in MIL-SPEC hardcoat anodizing. </span></p>\r\n<p><span>• Each click adjusts .50 MOA. Available in Black</span></p>'),(539505,76,1,98592,'<p><span>A stainless-steel cross-locking system ensures sights remain upright and zeroed under extreme combat conditions.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>Each click adjusts .50 MOA.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>A push of a button folds the sights securely out of the way until you need them again.</span></p>'),(388261,85,1,98592,'Troy Industries Rear Flip-Up Battle Sight AR-15 Flat-Top Aluminum Black  '),(213060,75,0,98593,'FEATURES-Black-Low-profile-Designed for firearms with top rails higher than the standard M4-For shooters who favor a sightline that&rsquo;s as close to the barrel as possible-Also for those with raised top rail systems'),(218709,75,1,98593,'<p><span>The Troy Micro Sight Sets provide the ideal solutions for shooters who favor a sightline that is as close to the barrel as possible, or for those with raised top rail systems. The Micro Sights greatly enhance weapons such as the IAR, Sig Sauer 556® Pistol and Carbine, POF 416®, 417® FN SCAR®, Robinson Armament XCR® Heckler &amp; Koch 416, 417 and other weapons with raised top rails. The Micro Sights are rugged, and reliable. </span></p>\r\n<p><span></span><strong>Technical Specifications:</strong><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><span>• Sold as a set only </span></p>\r\n<p><span>• Machined from hardened Aircraft Grade 6061-T6 Aluminum with stainless steel components. </span></p>\r\n<p><span>• Finish: Mil-Spec Hard Coat Anodized</span></p>'),(539704,76,1,98593,'<p><span> Sold as a set only </span></p>\r\n<p><span>Machined from hardened Aircraft Grade 6061-T6 Aluminum with stainless steel components. </span></p>\r\n<p><span>Finish: Mil-Spec Hard Coat Anodized</span></p>'),(388262,85,1,98593,'Troy Industries Micro Flip-Up Battle Sight Set HK-Style Front & Standard Rear AR-15 Aluminum Black '),(213062,75,0,98595,'FEATURES-Black-Made from hardened aircraft aluminum-Easily releases or holds bolt open with one hand to streamline firearm clearing & reloading after a malfunction-Ambidextrous - Eliminates hand changeovers, improving control of rifle when in use'),(218691,75,1,98595,'<p><span>The Troy Industries Ambidextrous bolt release is an indispensable device that easily releases or holds bolt open with one hand to streamline firearm clearing and reloading after a malfunction. By being ambidextrous, this bolt release eliminates hand changeovers improving control of rifle when in use. Made from hardened aircraft aluminum.</span></p>'),(539686,76,1,98595,'<p>The Troy Industries Ambidextrous bolt release is an indispensable device that easily releases or holds bolt open with one hand to streamline firearm clearing and reloading after a malfunction.</p>'),(388253,85,1,98595,'troy,industries,ambidextrous,bolt,release,extended,lever,standard,ar-15,bolt,catch,troy,lever,allows,user'),(213063,75,0,98596,'FEATURES-Black-Made from Troy proprietary military-grade, chemical, biological & impact resistant polymer-Attaches to any Mil-Std rail without tools-Will not heat up during rapid fire or full auto fire-Waterproof storage compartment-Aggressive ridged pattern for an enhanced grip'),(218696,75,1,98596,'<p><span>The Troy Industries CQB Polymer Vertical Grip features a lightweight polymer design, waterproof storage compartment, and aggressive ridged pattern for enhanced grip. The Troy CQB Vertical Grip - Polymer is made from advanced proprietary polymer that is chemical, biological, and impact resistant. Troy CQB Polymer Vertical Grips can withstand harsh environments, rapidly changing mission conditions and is compatible with any MIL-SPEC M1913 Picatinny rail system.</span></p>'),(539501,76,1,98596,'<p><span>ForeGrip, CQB Vertical, Polymer -BLK</span></p>'),(539502,85,1,98596,'Troy Industries CQB Polymer Vertical Grip Ar-15 Black'),(213065,75,0,98598,'FEATURES-0.750 low-profile gas block-Machined from 4140 pre-hardened steel-Mil-Std Manganese phosphate finish-Fits tightly to the barrel using 2 set screws*Gas tube roll pin not included'),(218695,75,1,98598,'<p><span>The Troy 0.750 Low-Profile Gas Block is made specifically for rifle barrels that have a 0.750 gas block seat. The low-profile design allows for clearance of most aftermarket rails that require a smaller gas block. Machined from 4140 pre-hardened steel finished with MIL-STD Manganese Phosphate. The Troy low profile gas block fits tightly to the barrel using two set screws. Gas tube roll pin not included.</span></p>'),(539689,76,1,98598,'<p><span>Gas Block, .750, 1\"</span></p>'),(388256,85,1,98598,'troy,industries,profile,block,replaces,standard,ar-15,front,sight,slim,design,allows,users,install,rail'),(213076,75,0,98610,'FEATURES-Black-7\"-No gunsmithing required-Installs in minutes-Includes MIL-STD Picatinny rails at 12, 3, 6, & 9 o\'clock & 4 built-in sockets for Q.D. swivels-Machined from hardened aircraft aluminum with stainless steel components-Finished in Mil-Spec hardcoat anodizing'),(218700,75,1,98610,'<p><span>The Troy Industries Enhanced Drop-In Rail is a non free-floating direct replacement for all M4/AR15 Carbine length plastic hand guards with a round end plate. The Troy patented clamping design ensures a solid mounting platform and provides a true optical mounting platform that increases the modularity and accuracy of the M4. </span></p>\r\n<p><span></span><strong>Features</strong><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><span>• No gunsmithing required. </span></p>\r\n<p><span>• Installs in minutes </span></p>\r\n<p><span>• Includes MIL-STD Picatinny rails at 12, 3, 6, and 9 o\'clock and four built-in sockets for Q.D. swivels. </span></p>\r\n<p><span></span><strong>Technical Specifications</strong><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><span>• Machined from hardened aircraft aluminum with stainless steel components. </span></p>\r\n<p><span>• Finished in MIL-SPEC hardcoat anodizing.</span></p>'),(539697,76,1,98610,'<p>No gunsmithing required.<br />Installs in minutes<br />Includes MIL-STD Picatinny rails at 12, 3, 6, and 9 o\'clock and four built-in sockets for Q.D. swivels.</p>'),(388257,85,1,98610,'troy,industries,enhanced,drop-in,rail,free-floating,direct,replacement,m4/ar15,carbine,length,plastic,hand,guards,with'),(218240,75,0,99495,'<p>We are proud to introduce a very robust, incredibly adjustable (5) pin precision archery sight to the market with the A5. With all the A5 parts precision CNC Machined, an innovative toolless design for adjustments and ultra-fine audible and tactile click adjustments, this sight offers all the fine adjustment necessary for a zero compromise in shot placement. The A5 has a bright (5) pin set of fiber optics offering a operator settable sight picture sure to allow your sliver slinging to reach.</p>'),(344914,75,1,99495,'<p>We are proud to introduce a very robust, incredibly adjustable (5) pin precision archery sight to the market with the A5. With all the A5 parts precision CNC Machined, an innovative toolless design for adjustments and ultra-fine audible and tactile click adjustments, this sight offers all the fine adjustment necessary for a zero compromise in shot placement. The A5 has a bright (5) pin set of fiber optics offering a operator settable sight picture sure to allow your sliver slinging to reach.</p>'),(218241,76,0,99495,'<p>5 Pin Fiber Optic Fully adjustable Archery Sight</p>'),(344915,76,1,99495,'<p>5 Pin Fiber Optic Fully adjustable Archery Sight</p>'),(218282,75,0,99496,'<p>The M7 has the new and proven M5 reticle. This reticle geometry has been proven to shave time getting on target by over 25% as compared to a conventional dot. The M5 reticle is set in the M7 with (11) brightness settings to provide a clear reticle sight picture in bright sunlight all the way down to NVG compatible operation. With a quality battery installed, the M7 offers over 1000 hours of battery Life, making sure you enjoy the match or stay on mission without fail.</p>'),(218287,75,1,99496,'<p>The M7 has the new and proven M5 reticle. This reticle geometry has been proven to shave time getting on target by over 25% as compared to a conventional dot. The M5 reticle is set in the M7 with (11) brightness settings to provide a clear reticle sight picture in bright sunlight all the way down to NVG compatible operation. With a quality battery installed, the M7 offers over 1000 hours of battery Life, making sure you enjoy the match or stay on mission without fail.</p>'),(218283,76,0,99496,'<p>The M7’s modular mounting system allows the optic to be placed on a picatinny rail in a low (AK) setting to an (AR) Mil Spec, Lower 1/3 Co-witness height, making it very versitile for the operator in platform adaptability.</p>'),(218288,76,1,99496,'<p>The M7’s modular mounting system allows the optic to be placed on a picatinny rail in a low (AK) setting to an (AR) Mil Spec, Lower 1/3 Co-witness height, making it very versitile for the operator in platform adaptability.</p>'),(219705,75,0,99509,'<p>The AIM Hunting™ Rifle Scope Watch captures the thrill of aiming at a trophy whitetail buck while “keeping the TIME in your SIGHTS”. This quality wristwatch features a high-resolution image of a monster whitetail buck in our patented “crosshairs clock” design. The watch features a black zinc alloy plating watch case, glass face, a comfortable silicone strap, and stainless steel clasp. These uniquely designed hunting watches make the perfect gift for hunters. (Waterproof 30m)</p>'),(359675,75,1,99509,'<p>The AIM Hunting™ Rifle Scope Watch captures the thrill of aiming at a trophy whitetail buck while “keeping the TIME in your SIGHTS”. This quality wristwatch features a high-resolution image of a monster whitetail buck in our patented “crosshairs clock” design. The watch features a black zinc alloy plating watch case, glass face, a comfortable silicone strap, and stainless steel clasp. These uniquely designed hunting watches make the perfect gift for hunters. (Waterproof 30m)</p>'),(219706,76,0,99509,'<p>Keep the time in your sights with this rifle scope watch</p>'),(359676,76,1,99509,'<p>Keep the time in your sights with this rifle scope watch</p>'),(382787,85,0,99509,'AIM Hunting Rifle Scope Watch - Whitetail Deer, watch, outdoors, accessories, '),(670604,85,1,99509,'AIM Hunting Rifle Scope Watch - Whitetail Deer, watch, outdoors, accessories, '),(219707,75,0,99510,'<p>Our handgun cases have the same construction features and internal locking system as do all our cases except the handgun cases have an added security of a side locking system and an airline strength cable that works in conjunction with the internal locking system. The cases can be secured with the cable to luggage for travel or to another stationary object. This model is so compact that it will easily fit underneath the seat of a vehicle and either secured with the cable to the brackets of the seat or directly to the floor of the vehicle with the optional mounting plates(Model #HGMP)or Mounting Bracket(Model #12163MB)</p>\r\n<p>Outside dimensions - 12X12X3</p>\r\n<p>Inside dimensions - 10X10X3</p>'),(219708,76,0,99510,'<p>This model is so compact it can easily fit under the seat of your vehicle. </p>'),(219709,75,0,99511,'<p><span>This slimline case measures 16\" x 12\" x 3\". This handgun size has the same construction features and internal locking system as do all our cases except this case is large enough for 2-3 handguns yet still has the added security of a side locking system and an airline strength cable that works in conjunction with the internal locking system. This case can be secured with the cable to luggage for travel or to another stationary object and to the floor of a vehicle with the optional mounting plates(Model #HGMP)or the Mounting Bracket(Model #12163MB)for more security.</span></p>'),(219710,76,0,99511,'<p>Slimline case large enought to hold 2 to 3 handguns.</p>'),(219711,75,0,99512,'<p><span>This handgun case measures 16\" x 12\" x 4\". This case is perfect for your \"Bianchi\" competition gun. This case is deeper that our standard cases which allows plenty of room for guns with wings to be stored or transported. Includes side locking cable and can also be mounted to a stationary object with the optional mounting plates (Model #HGMP)for added security.</span></p>'),(219712,76,0,99512,'<p>The perfect case for your Bianchi competition gun. </p>'),(219718,75,0,99514,'<p><span>This handy tool removes the firing pin stop and then safely replaces it in 1911\'s and 1911 clones. Made from nylon it is oil and solvent resistant. The interior of the tool also is a handy bushing removal tool. Fits both standard bushings and commander style.</span></p>'),(657404,75,1,99514,'<p><span>This handy tool removes the firing pin stop and then safely replaces it in 1911\'s and 1911 clones. Made from nylon it is oil and solvent resistant. The interior of the tool also is a handy bushing removal tool. Fits both standard bushings and commander style.</span></p>'),(219719,76,0,99514,'<p>This tool will assist in removing the firing pin stop from 1911\'s. </p>'),(657405,76,1,99514,'<p>This tool will assist in removing the firing pin stop from 1911\'s. </p>'),(657406,85,1,99514,NULL),(219720,75,0,99515,'<p><span>This tool helps sort recoil springs as well as other types of firearm springs by pull weight so you can use the correct spring for your load. This tester comes with a digital scale. Use is simple, just insert spring on bolt, insert in tool, attach couplar and scale. Pull until proper compression is achieved. Tool is marked with a line at 1.625\" which is the Mil-Spec compression length of a 1911 recoil spring.NOTE: Batteries NOT included with Digital Scale</span></p>'),(657401,75,1,99515,'<p><span>This tool helps sort recoil springs as well as other types of firearm springs by pull weight so you can use the correct spring for your load. This tester comes with a digital scale. Use is simple, just insert spring on bolt, insert in tool, attach couplar and scale. Pull until proper compression is achieved. Tool is marked with a line at 1.625\" which is the Mil-Spec compression length of a 1911 recoil spring.NOTE: Batteries NOT included with Digital Scale</span></p>'),(219721,76,0,99515,'<p>This tool helps sort recoil springs as well as other types of firearm springs by pull weight so you can use the correct spring for your load. </p>'),(657402,76,1,99515,'<p>This tool helps sort recoil springs as well as other types of firearm springs by pull weight so you can use the correct spring for your load. </p>'),(657403,85,1,99515,NULL),(219722,75,0,99516,'<p><span>Organize and keep all your Dillon tool Head Assemblies and Caliber Conversion Kits in one convenient space. Free up more space on your work bench. See available models for Dillon 550/650/750. Available with 3 posts for toolhead stands and corresponding shelves for boxed kits. Construction: 16 ga. Aluminum (non painted) Delrin Posts Predrilled for 24 &amp; 16 inch stud centers</span></p>'),(219723,76,0,99516,'<p><span>Tool Head Assembly and Caliber Conversion Kit Organizer for Dillon Reloading Press Model 550/650/750. 3 posts for tool head stand and corresponding shelves for boxed kits.</span></p>'),(219724,75,0,99517,'<p><span>Free up more space on your work bench. See available models for Dillon 550/650/750. Available with 5 posts for toolhead stands and corresponding shelves for boxed kits. Construction: 16 ga. Aluminum (non painted) Delrin Posts Predrilled for 24 &amp; 16 inch stud centers</span></p>'),(219725,76,0,99517,'<p>Organize and keep all your Dillon tool Head Assemblies and Caliber Conversion Kits in one convenient space.</p>'),(219726,75,0,99518,'<p><span>Organize and keep all your Dillon tool Head Assemblies and Caliber Conversion Kits in one convenient space. Free up more space on your work bench. See available models for Dillon 1050. Available with 3 posts for toolhead stands and corresponding shelves for boxed kits. Construction: 16 ga. Aluminum (non painted) Delrin Posts Predrilled for 24 &amp; 16 inch stud centers</span></p>'),(219727,76,0,99518,'<p>Organize and keep all your Dillon tool Head Assemblies and Caliber Conversion Kits in one convenient space</p>'),(219728,75,0,99519,'<p><span>Free up more space on your work bench. See available models for Dillon 1050. Available with 5 posts for toolhead stands and corresponding shelves for boxed kits. Construction: 16 ga. Aluminum (non painted) Delrin Posts Predrilled for 24 &amp; 16 inch stud centers</span></p>'),(219729,76,0,99519,'<p><span>Organize and keep all your Dillon tool Head Assemblies and Caliber Conversion Kits in one convenient space. Dillon Model 1050.</span></p>'),(219730,75,0,99520,'<p><span>Constructed from Alum for long life. This shelf has a post made for RCBS Pro Chucker 5 or 7 tool head. Convenient shelf storage under shelf to store small parts needed to set up press.</span></p>'),(219734,75,1,99520,'<p><span>Convenient shelf to store your tool heads. Constructed from Alum for long life. Contains shelf to store box containing small parts used to set up press.</span></p>'),(219731,76,0,99520,'<p>This shelf has a post made for RCBS Pro Chucker 5 or 7 tool head. </p>'),(219735,76,1,99520,'<p>Convenient shelf to store your tool heads.</p>'),(219736,85,1,99520,NULL),(219732,75,0,99521,'<p><span>Constructed from Alum for long life. This shelf has a post made for RCBS Pro Chucker 5 or 7 tool head. Convenient shelf storage under shelf to store small parts needed to set up press.</span></p>'),(219733,76,0,99521,'<p>This shelf has a post made for RCBS Pro Chucker 5 or 7 tool head.</p>'),(219741,75,0,99522,'<p>LUCID OPTICS was born in the RED DOT space. The natural and careful evolution of the popular HD7 to the NEW HDx was inevitable.  This incredibly durable, predictably overbuilt, mid sized optic is breaking new ground in the “mid sized” red dot space.</p>\r\n<p>Designed with direct input from our Pro Staff. PCC competitors. the HDx is built to take the rigors of competitive hard use at an accelerated pace with a clear, wide field of view for transition between targets very quickly.</p>'),(222509,75,1,99522,'<p>LUCID OPTICS was born in the RED DOT space. The natural and careful evolution of the popular HD7 to the NEW HDx was inevitable.  This incredibly durable, predictably overbuilt, mid sized optic is breaking new ground in the “mid sized” red dot space.</p>\r\n<p>Designed with direct input from our Pro Staff. PCC competitors. The HDx is built to take the rigors of competitive hard use at an accelerated pace with a clear, wide field of view for transition between targets very quickly.</p>'),(219742,76,0,99522,'<ul>\r\n<li>Model:HDx</li>\r\n<li>Reticle: 3MOA Base</li>\r\n<li>Waterproof, Shockproof (.458 SOCOM)</li>\r\n<li>Manufactured by: LUCID OPTICS CORP</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>'),(222510,76,1,99522,'<p>This incredibly durable, predictably overbuilt, mid sized optic is breaking new ground in the “mid sized” red dot space.</p>\r\n<p>• Waterproof and Shockproof</p>\r\n<p>• 3MOA Base</p>\r\n<p>• Lucid Optics was born in the Red Dot space</p>'),(219856,75,0,99578,'<p>Our Multi-Purpose Quick Wipes act as a cleaner, lubricant, and protectant designed to clean and condition in one quick &amp; easy step, without sacrificing performance. Formulated from the same chemical platform as our flagship Military-Grade Solvent and High-Purity Oil, our Quick Wipes are odorless, non-toxic, non-staining, and eco-friendly. The 100% synthetic-based oil will provide exceptional protection across a wide range of temperatures and the extreme-pressure additives provide superior resistance against rust and corrosion.  This low viscosity solution penetrates deep into metal surface disparities to loosen stubborn carbon fouling and other contaminants and leaves behind a protective film that seals out moisture and minimizes friction and wear.  Safe to use on all metal alloys, polymers, and finished stocks.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Perfect for quick field applications</li>\r\n<li>Eliminates moisture and removes fingerprints</li>\r\n<li>Odorless, non-toxic, non-staining and non-carcinogenic</li>\r\n<li>100% Synthetic—won’t gum up or freeze in extreme temperatures</li>\r\n<li>Extra durable wipes that won’t tear during cleaning</li>\r\n<li>Temperature range: -54˚F to +281˚F</li>\r\n</ul>'),(345222,75,1,99578,'<p>Our Multi-Purpose Quick Wipes act as a cleaner, lubricant, and protectant designed to clean and condition in one quick &amp; easy step, without sacrificing performance. Formulated from the same chemical platform as our flagship Military-Grade Solvent and High-Purity Oil, our Quick Wipes are odorless, non-toxic, non-staining, and eco-friendly. The 100% synthetic-based oil will provide exceptional protection across a wide range of temperatures and the extreme-pressure additives provide superior resistance against rust and corrosion.  This low viscosity solution penetrates deep into metal surface disparities to loosen stubborn carbon fouling and other contaminants and leaves behind a protective film that seals out moisture and minimizes friction and wear.  Safe to use on all metal alloys, polymers, and finished stocks.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Perfect for quick field applications</li>\r\n<li>Eliminates moisture and removes fingerprints</li>\r\n<li>Odorless, non-toxic, non-staining and non-carcinogenic</li>\r\n<li>100% Synthetic—won’t gum up or freeze in extreme temperatures</li>\r\n<li>Extra durable wipes that won’t tear during cleaning</li>\r\n<li>Temperature range: -54˚F to +281˚F</li>\r\n</ul>'),(219857,76,0,99578,'<p><span>Our Multi-Purpose Quick Wipes act as a cleaner, lubricant, and protectant designed to clean and condition in one quick &amp; easy step, without sacrificing performance. </span></p>'),(345223,76,1,99578,'<p><span>Our Multi-Purpose Quick Wipes act as a cleaner, lubricant, and protectant designed to clean and condition in one quick &amp; easy step, without sacrificing performance. </span></p>'),(219858,85,0,99578,'Multi-Purpose Quick Wipes'),(345224,85,1,99578,'Multi-Purpose Quick Wipes'),(219859,75,0,99579,'<p><span>Breakthrough Clean Technologies proudly releases their new Anti-Fog Gel Kit. This Anti-Fog Gel provides a superior, streak-free finish and long-lasting prevention, effectively eliminating fogging on all kinds of surfaces including multi-coated lenses. With its no-mess brush applicator tip, easily apply a thin layer of the Anti-Fog Gel then simply wipe clean with the included lens cloth. Trust the care of your lenses, optics and goggles to the finest and most effective anti-fogging solution. Breakthrough Clean Technologies— The Difference is Clear™</span></p>'),(345225,75,1,99579,'<p><span>Breakthrough Clean Technologies proudly releases their new Anti-Fog Gel Kit. This Anti-Fog Gel provides a superior, streak-free finish and long-lasting prevention, effectively eliminating fogging on all kinds of surfaces including multi-coated lenses. With its no-mess brush applicator tip, easily apply a thin layer of the Anti-Fog Gel then simply wipe clean with the included lens cloth. Trust the care of your lenses, optics and goggles to the finest and most effective anti-fogging solution. Breakthrough Clean Technologies— The Difference is Clear™</span></p>'),(219860,76,0,99579,'<p><span>This Anti-Fog Gel provides a superior, streak-free finish and long-lasting prevention, effectively eliminating fogging on all kinds of surfaces including multi-coated lenses. </span></p>'),(345226,76,1,99579,'<p><span>This Anti-Fog Gel provides a superior, streak-free finish and long-lasting prevention, effectively eliminating fogging on all kinds of surfaces including multi-coated lenses. </span></p>'),(219861,85,0,99579,'Anti-Fog Lens Gel Kit'),(345227,85,1,99579,'Anti-Fog Lens Gel Kit'),(220100,75,0,99689,'<p><span>Make your move behind the Spike Elk from Montana Decoy. It\'s the first ever bull Elk decoy designed forn the aggressive bowhunter looking to get in tight and fire up that dominant bull. Pair it with the relaxed pose of the RMEF Elk or Miss September for the ultimate in lightweight versatility. Aluminum leg poles are available but can be used without them for additional weight savings.</span></p>'),(220102,75,1,99689,'<p>Make your move behind the Spike Elk from Montana Decoy. It\'s the first ever bull Elk decoy designed for the aggressive bowhunter looking to get in tight and fire up that dominant bull. Pair it with the relaxed pose of the RMEF Elk or Miss September for the ultimate in lightweight versatility. Aluminum leg poles are available but can be used without them for additional weight savings. <br /><br /> • Folds for easy transport<br /> • This spike is designed to pull bulls in close and away from cows. <br /> • NEVER use on public land or when other hunters may be present.<br /> • Equally realistic up close or at a distance. <br /> • Package Weight: 1.901 kilograms</p>'),(652282,76,1,99689,'Montana Decoy takes real pride in these realistic looking decoys.  The Spike Elk Decoy is no exception. This decoy will catch an elk\'s eye and bring them over to check things out. There is no better tool for stalking, you will be so close the elk. This decoy allows cover when there isn\'t any around. The decoy stands tall for increased visibility in scrub brush or on the open plains.<br /><br />Features:<br /> • Large size great for stalking.<br /> • Works any time during the season <br />• Folds up and portable! '),(220101,75,0,99690,'<p><span>Big bulls cannot resist the tempting look of the RMEF cow Elk decoy. It provides the most detail and definition that has ever been created in an Elk decoy. Proceeds are donated to the Rocky Mountain Elk Foundation.</span></p>'),(220105,75,1,99690,'<p><span>Big bulls cannot resist the tempting look of the RMEF cow Elk decoy. It provides the most detail and definition that has ever been created in an Elk decoy. <span>Looking pose designed to catch and hold a bull\'s attention, <span>HD printed for ultra-realism. <span>Folds down into the size of a large frisbee. 10% of the p</span></span></span>roceeds are donated to the Rocky Mountain Elk Foundation.</span></p>'),(220108,75,0,99691,'<p><span>In hard-hunted areas or late season situations, a feeding pose can be the perfect addition to any setup. It calms wary bulls and the feeding urge gives that shy bull a reason to approach outside the rut. Weighing in at an easy-carrying 33 oz and twist folding down to 22” X 13” means this decoy is easy to add to even the longest hikes. Miss September also works on cow elk by taking advantage of their herd instinct. Used alone or in connection with other Montana Elk Decoys, Miss September is a dangerous diva in elk country.</span></p>'),(221132,75,1,99691,'<p><span>In hard-hunted areas or late season situations, a feeding pose can be the perfect addition to any setup. It calms wary bulls and the feeding urge gives that shy bull a reason to approach outside the rut. Weighing in at an easy-carrying 33 oz and twist folding down to 22” X 13” means this decoy is easy to add to even the longest hikes. Miss September also works on cow elk by taking advantage of their herd instinct. Used alone or in connection with other Montana Elk Decoys, Miss September is a dangerous diva in elk country.</span></p>'),(220109,76,0,99691,'<p>Effective through elk season. Built using an actual elk photo and only weighs 33 ounces inlcuding the leg poles. This can be added to other elk decoys to build a heard and as a flasher when hunting in groups. </p>'),(221133,76,1,99691,'<p>Effective through elk season. Built using an actual elk photo and only weighs 33 ounces inlcuding the leg poles. This can be added to other elk decoys to build a heard and as a flasher when hunting in groups. </p>'),(220110,75,0,99692,'<p><span>When noted hunter, outfitter and writer Fred Eichler wants a decoy, he reaches for a Montana Decoy. As a matter of fact, he likes them so much he worked hand-in-hand to design his signature elk decoy: the Eichler Elk. It incorporates a string hanging system that is faster than the leg poles and allows you to hang the decoy from brush or tree limbs. His pose of choice is a head up decoy and it has to look real. Built using an actual elk photo, the Eichler Elk is realistic, portable and easy to use. It also comes with a DVD showcasing elk hunts using decoys, as well as Fred explaining exactly how and why he uses his decoy. Weighing in at a lightweight 40 oz with leg poles and folding down to 19” X 12,” the Eichler Elk is easy to pack and a great tool for any phase of the elk season.</span></p>'),(221135,75,1,99692,'<p><span>When noted hunter, outfitter and writer Fred Eichler wants a decoy, he reaches for a Montana Decoy. As a matter of fact, he likes them so much he worked hand-in-hand to design his signature elk decoy: the Eichler Elk. It incorporates a string hanging system that is faster than the leg poles and allows you to hang the decoy from brush or tree limbs. His pose of choice is a head up decoy and it has to look real. Built using an actual elk photo, the Eichler Elk is realistic, portable and easy to use. It also comes with a DVD showcasing elk hunts using decoys, as well as Fred explaining exactly how and why he uses his decoy. Weighing in at a lightweight 40 oz with leg poles and folding down to 19” X 12,” the Eichler Elk is easy to pack and a great tool for any phase of the elk season.</span></p>'),(220111,76,0,99692,'<p>Includes DVD with how to tips and hunts using decoys. Can be set up with leg poles or Eichler\'s string hanging system.  Built using an actual image of an elk. <span>Twist folds down to a packable 19” X 12”</span></p>'),(221136,76,1,99692,'<p>Includes DVD with how to tips and hunts using decoys. Can be set up with leg poles or Eichler\'s string hanging system.  Built using an actual image of an elk. <span>Twist folds down to a packable 19” X 12”</span></p>'),(220112,75,0,99693,'<p><span>Ultra Light weight and designed for the backcountry hunter looking to cut weight from their pack. Can be used with or without aluminum leg pole. The double-sided cow rump can be used for stalking or standing alone. </span></p>'),(220262,75,1,99693,'<p><span>Ultra Light weight and designed for the backcountry hunter looking to cut weight from their pack. Can be used with or without aluminum leg pole. The double-sided cow rump can be used for stalking or standing alone. </span></p>'),(220113,76,0,99693,'<p><span><span>Developed by hunting fanatics. </span>Folds down into the size of a large frisbee by use of a figure-8 pattern while collapsing the decoy. <span>Draw in and distract the bull so you can make the shot.</span></span></p>'),(220263,76,1,99693,'<p><span><span>Developed by hunting fanatics. </span>Folds down into the size of a large frisbee by use of a figure-8 pattern while collapsing the decoy. <span>Draw in and distract the bull so you can make the shot.</span></span></p>'),(220114,75,0,99694,'<p><span>No matter if you call it a stalking shield or a confidence decoy, this cow can help you get your buck, bull or bird. Famous with antelope hunters, the Big Red Moo Cow can be a secret weapon on your next goose hunt. Take it to the back pasture for pass shooting doves, or use it as a confidence decoy on call-shy coyotes. Special stalking handles and a view-through mesh make it the stealth bomber of the decoy world. The options are endless. Built using an actual cow photograph, this bovine looks the part. Like all Montana Decoys, Big Red twist folds to an easy-to-pack 12x24,” while weighing only 48 oz with leg poles.</span></p>'),(220116,75,1,99694,'<p><span>No matter if you call it a stalking shield or a confidence decoy, this cow can help you get your buck, bull or bird. Famous with antelope hunters, the Big Red Moo Cow can be a secret weapon on your next goose hunt. Take it to the back pasture for pass shooting doves, or use it as a confidence decoy on call-shy coyotes. Special stalking handles and a view-through mesh make it the stealth bomber of the decoy world. The options are endless. Built using an actual cow photograph, this bovine looks the part. Like all Montana Decoys, Big Red twist folds to an easy-to-pack 12x24,” while weighing only 48 oz with leg poles.</span></p>'),(220115,76,0,99694,'<p><span>Great for big game, waterfowl or predators. <span>Only weighs 48 oz including leg poles. <span>Special view-through mesh and stalking handles for ease of use. <span>Photorealism fools even the wariest of animals.</span></span></span></span></p>'),(220117,76,1,99694,'<p><span>Great for big game, waterfowl or predators. <span>Only weighs 48 oz including leg poles. <span>Special view-through mesh and stalking handles for ease of use. <span>Photorealism fools even the wariest of animals.</span></span></span></span></p>'),(220119,75,0,99695,'<p><span>A new design on an old favorite, the head on Bessie is built to move forward with cover. Use it as a decoy or stalking shield, it\'s equally effective on any game that shares space with cattle.</span></p>'),(220265,75,1,99695,'<p><span>A new design on an old favorite, the head on Bessie is built to move forward with cover. Use it as a decoy or stalking shield, it\'s equally effective on any game that shares space with cattle.</span></p>'),(220120,76,0,99695,'<p><span>Great for big game, waterfowl or predator hunting. <span>Stalking friendy handles are included. <span>Folds down into the size of a large frisbee by use of a figure-8 pattern while collapsing the decoy. </span></span></span></p>'),(220266,76,1,99695,'<p><span>Great for big game, waterfowl or predator hunting. <span>Stalking friendy handles are included. <span>Folds down into the size of a large frisbee by use of a figure-8 pattern while collapsing the decoy. </span></span></span></p>'),(220131,75,0,99698,'<p><span>The result of countless conversations with guides and outfitters, Montana’s Moose II decoy is ready to make your once-in-a-lifetime hunt worth all the sleepless nights. With super realistic color and body posture, this moose is the ultimate add-on for a calling setup or to put your moose in the right spot for a shot. Moose are big animals, but thanks to Montana’s patented Twist Fold decoy design, this cow is easy to pack and light enough to carry all day. Built using an actual moose photograph, this decoy is designed to catch that lovesick bull’s attention and distract him for the shot. Think of her as a little moose insurance.</span></p>'),(231924,75,1,99698,'<p><span>The result of countless conversations with guides and outfitters, Montana’s Moose II decoy is ready to make your once-in-a-lifetime hunt worth all the sleepless nights. With super realistic color and body posture, this moose is the ultimate add-on for a calling setup or to put your moose in the right spot for a shot. Moose are big animals, but thanks to Montana’s patented Twist Fold decoy design, this cow is easy to pack and light enough to carry all day. Built using an actual moose photograph, this decoy is designed to catch that lovesick bull’s attention and distract him for the shot. Think of her as a little moose insurance.</span></p>'),(220132,76,0,99698,'<p><span><span>Built using an actual moose photograph. </span>Twist folds to an easy-to-carry 23” X 40” package. <span><span>Works to draw in hard-hunted bulls</span></span></span></p>'),(231925,76,1,99698,'<p><span><span>Built using an actual moose photograph. </span>Twist folds to an easy-to-carry 23” X 40” package. <span><span>Works to draw in hard-hunted bulls</span></span></span></p>'),(220133,75,0,99699,'<p><span>Built using in the field input from Ralph and Vicki Cianciarulo, the Archer\'s Choice Moose Rack embodies the spirit of Montana Decoy\'s lightweight, super-realistic and easily portable decoys</span></p>'),(231934,75,1,99699,'<p><span>Built using in the field input from Ralph and Vicki Cianciarulo, the Archer\'s Choice Moose Rack embodies the spirit of Montana Decoy\'s lightweight, super-realistic and easily portable decoys</span></p>'),(220134,76,0,99699,'<p><span>Essential when hunting solo. <span>Easiest to pack Moose ever developed. <span>Use the handle behind the neck, when in cover, to flash the bull and draw him in.</span></span></span></p>'),(231935,76,1,99699,'<p><span>Essential when hunting solo. <span>Easiest to pack Moose ever developed. <span>Use the handle behind the neck, when in cover, to flash the bull and draw him in.</span></span></span></p>'),(220146,75,0,99704,'<p>sads</p>'),(220147,76,0,99704,'<p>sdsd</p>'),(220148,85,0,99704,'ai'),(220256,75,0,99705,'<p><span>When noted hunter, outfitter and writer Fred Eichler wants a decoy, he reaches for a Montana Decoy. He likes them so much he worked hand-in-hand with us to design his signature antelop decoy, The Eichler Antelope.</span></p>'),(231930,75,1,99705,'<p><span>When noted hunter, outfitter and writer Fred Eichler wants a decoy, he reaches for a Montana Decoy. He likes them so much he worked hand-in-hand with us to design his signature antelop decoy, The Eichler Antelope.</span></p>'),(220257,76,0,99705,'<p><span>Special view-thru mesh and stalking handle. <span>Includes quickstand that helps the hunter press the leg poles into the hard ground making it easy to use. <span>Stalking handle included.</span></span></span></p>'),(231931,76,1,99705,'<p><span>Special view-thru mesh and stalking handle. <span>Includes quickstand that helps the hunter press the leg poles into the hard ground making it easy to use. <span>Stalking handle included.</span></span></span></p>'),(220258,75,0,99706,'<p><span>Hunting antelope during the rut may be the most exciting decoying a bowhunter can try. When that Pronghorn sees some upstart intruder making a move on his does, he HAS to charge over to run him out of town. Great for spot-and-stalk or water hole setups, Montana’s Antelope Buck decoy is lightweight, easy-to-pack Pronghorn poison. Use a challenge call to add even more realism. Built using an actual photo for the best realism possible, the Antelope Buck can bring them to you or buy you enough time after a stalk to make the shot.</span></p>'),(221129,75,1,99706,'<p><span>Hunting antelope during the rut may be the most exciting decoying a bowhunter can try. When that Pronghorn sees some upstart intruder making a move on his does, he HAS to charge over to run him out of town. Great for spot-and-stalk or water hole setups, Montana’s Antelope Buck decoy is lightweight, easy-to-pack Pronghorn poison. Use a challenge call to add even more realism. Built using an actual photo for the best realism possible, the Antelope Buck can bring them to you or buy you enough time after a stalk to make the shot.</span></p>'),(220259,76,0,99706,'<p><span><span>Built using an actual Pronghorn Buck photograph. </span>Only weighs 28 oz with poles and t<span>wist folds to an easy-to-carry 13” X 10”.</span></span></p>'),(221130,76,1,99706,'<p><span><span>Built using an actual Pronghorn Buck photograph. </span>Only weighs 28 oz with poles and t<span>wist folds to an easy-to-carry 13” X 10”.</span></span></p>'),(220260,75,0,99707,'<p>This was missing from the spreadsheet</p>'),(231920,75,1,99707,'<p><span>The new and improved Antelope Combo features better detail and resolution on both decoys as well as an all new pose for the doe decoy. Designed to be used through the season, this combo gives a bowhunter plenty of options from Waterhole, fence crossing or stalk hunting. Match your decoy set up to the phase of the rut or the area you\'re hunting. Use the decoys together or separate for a tag punching mix and match strategy.</span></p>'),(220261,76,0,99707,'<p><span>Easy to transport and set-up. <span>Great for use at watering holes. <span>Can be use for spot and stalk or blind hunting and f<span>olds down to the size of a large frisbee.</span></span></span></span></p>'),(231921,76,1,99707,'<p><span>Easy to transport and set-up. <span>Great for use at watering holes. <span>Can be use for spot and stalk or blind hunting and f<span>olds down to the size of a large frisbee.</span></span></span></span></p>'),(220268,75,0,99708,'<p><span>Montana Decoy is thrilled to announce the launch of arguably the best reaping decoy to ever hit the woods-the all new Wiley Tom. Built using Montana Decoys life like HD photo process employing only images of actual wild turkeys this decoy is a stand out in the looks department. “As an inventor and turkey nut, I always have ideas bouncing around in my head. ” said Tom Wiley, Owner of Professional Marketing Incorporated. “Once I had the basics for the Wiley Tom, it was obvious I needed to work with Montana Decoy on bringing this idea to life! Known for lightweight, realism and ease of carry, Montana Decoy has been bringing to market true innovation in the turkey space for the last few years. “Products like Miss Purr-fect and Jake Purr-fect really made us a truly unique turkey decoy company. Add in the Fanatic or Fanatic XL and suddenly we’re the one stop shop for any turkey hunting style, ” said Montana Decoy President CJ Davis. The Wiley Tom allows hunters to use the real wild printed fabric or add their own feathers. The use of individual feathers allows easy replacement just for the damaged ones without needing an entirely new fan. And like all Montana Decoys, the Wiley Tom folds for easy carry, with the special trifold panels helping to protect real feathers no matter if the decoy is transported in a vest, backpack or the include slip sack. Double sided printing means users can face the decoy directly at or away from the approaching gobbler. A folding handle for hands on use and a peep hole let the decoy adapt to any turkey hunters style.</span></p>'),(220270,75,1,99708,'<p><span>Montana Decoy is thrilled to announce the launch of arguably the best reaping decoy to ever hit the woods-the all new Wiley Tom. Built using Montana Decoys life like HD photo process employing only images of actual wild turkeys this decoy is a stand out in the looks department. “As an inventor and turkey nut, I always have ideas bouncing around in my head. ” said Tom Wiley, Owner of Professional Marketing Incorporated. “Once I had the basics for the Wiley Tom, it was obvious I needed to work with Montana Decoy on bringing this idea to life! Known for lightweight, realism and ease of carry, Montana Decoy has been bringing to market true innovation in the turkey space for the last few years. “Products like Miss Purr-fect and Jake Purr-fect really made us a truly unique turkey decoy company. Add in the Fanatic or Fanatic XL and suddenly we’re the one stop shop for any turkey hunting style, ” said Montana Decoy President CJ Davis. The Wiley Tom allows hunters to use the real wild printed fabric or add their own feathers. The use of individual feathers allows easy replacement just for the damaged ones without needing an entirely new fan. And like all Montana Decoys, the Wiley Tom folds for easy carry, with the special trifold panels helping to protect real feathers no matter if the decoy is transported in a vest, backpack or the include slip sack. Double sided printing means users can face the decoy directly at or away from the approaching gobbler. A folding handle for hands on use and a peep hole let the decoy adapt to any turkey hunters style.</span></p>'),(220269,76,0,99708,'<p><span>Realistic 3-D Head with taxidermy-lie eyes fires up toms for the crucial moment when closing in the distance. <span>See-through slot for effective stalking. <span>18 individual tail feather sleeves allow you to create your own jake or longbeard configuration using your own feathers. <span>Side sleeves to add wing feathers for extra realism. <span>Foldable ground stake for hands-free or hand held use. Stake and decoy are attached together to make it a one-piece set-up. <span>Easily fold with or without tail feathers into your vest</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>'),(220271,76,1,99708,'<p><span>Realistic 3-D Head with taxidermy-like eyes fires up toms for the crucial moment when closing in the distance. <span>See-through slot for effective stalking. <span>18 individual tail feather sleeves allow you to create your own jake or longbeard configuration using your own feathers. <span>Side sleeves to add wing feathers for extra realism. <span>Foldable ground stake for hands-free or hand held use. Stake and decoy are attached together to make it a one-piece set-up. <span>Easily fold with or without tail feathers into your vest</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>'),(382780,85,0,99708,'Montana Decoy Wiley Tom, Decoy, turkey decoy, hunting gear'),(675989,85,1,99708,'Montana Decoy Wiley Tom, Decoy, turkey decoy, hunting gear'),(220273,75,0,99709,'<p><span>The different poses of this decoy will get a gobbler’s attention, but the realism will bring him in. The body features feather cuts for genuine movement in the field. They will flutter in a breeze and provides a life-like soft edge to the profile. Montana Decoy is already known for making the most mobile turkey decoys on the market. Now, you can add most realistic and most versatile to the list.</span></p>'),(220311,75,1,99709,'<p><span>The different poses of this decoy will get a gobbler’s attention, but the realism will bring him in. The body features feather cuts for genuine movement in the field. They will flutter in a breeze and provides a life-like soft edge to the profile. Montana Decoy is already known for making the most mobile turkey decoys on the market. Now, you can add most realistic and most versatile to the list.</span></p>'),(220274,76,0,99709,'<p><span>Built from an actual photo of a wild turkey hen. <span>Weighs only 8 oz and folds down to 9” X 6”. <span>Pair with other hens to mimic a feeding flock. <span>Works any time of year and anywhere in the country</span></span></span></span></p>'),(220312,76,1,99709,'<p><span>Built from an actual photo of a wild turkey hen. <span>Weighs only 8 oz and folds down to 9” X 6”. <span>Pair with other hens to mimic a feeding flock. <span>Works any time of year and anywhere in the country</span></span></span></span></p>'),(220275,75,0,99710,'<p><span>Creating a feeding flock scene is one of the best ways to bring in your target Tom. Smaller hens while feeding in grass can look nearly concealed in real life. These decoys are built spot on to create the kind of life-life setting the keen eyes of a Tom are built to catch on to. Surround your flock with other decoys like Montana Decoy\'s Dinner Belle, Miss Purr-fect and Jake Purr-fect and you\'ll tag out without any issues.</span></p>'),(220676,75,1,99710,'<p><span>Creating a feeding flock scene is one of the best ways to bring in your target Tom. Smaller hens while feeding in grass can look nearly concealed in real life. These decoys are built spot on to create the kind of life-life setting the keen eyes of a Tom are built to catch on to. Surround your flock with other decoys like Montana Decoy\'s Dinner Belle, Miss Purr-fect and Jake Purr-fect and you\'ll tag out without any issues.</span></p>'),(220276,76,0,99710,'<p><span>Built using an actual photo of a ready-to-breed hen. <span>Weighs only 8 oz and folds down to 9” X 6”. <span>Allows more mobility and sets up in seconds and a<span>dds realistic visual to calling sequences</span></span></span></span></p>'),(220677,76,1,99710,'<p><span>Built using an actual photo of a ready-to-breed hen. <span>Weighs only 8 oz and folds down to 9” X 6”. <span>Allows more mobility and sets up in seconds and a<span>dds realistic visual to calling sequences</span></span></span></span></p>'),(220277,75,0,99711,'<p><span>If Turkey Hunters had to only carry one hen decoy, MISS PURR-FECT™ 3D is the one. It features PERFECT POSE TECHNOLOGY™ so you can match the pose of the decoy to the situation. Choosing one of two leg pole slots will change the position of the hen decoy to a feeding pose or looker pose. The head position of the turkey decoy can also be fine tuned as its wire construction allows hunters to change the pose.</span></p>'),(220684,75,1,99711,'<p><span>Miss Purr-fect XD is the result of years of constant tweaking and research to find the perfect balance between realism, portability and lightweight. We added an all new fabric that better replicates the natural iridescence of turkey feathers while still allowing the decoy to compress for easy transport. The addition of taxidermy eyes adds another level of realism. And we didn\'t stop there. We listen to our customers and some didn\'t like the compression straps. So we developed a special zippered stuff pouch to make carrying the folded decoy even easier. Don\'t worry, if you like the straps we included them as well. And with our Perfect Pose Technology you can put this hen in a feeder, looker or breeder pose. It\'s the only decoy on the market with that kind of versatility!</span></p>\r\n<p>The “courting” game between hens and toms is really no different than women and men. The most attractive of both sexes usually wins out. If there is such a thing as seduction in a hen turkey decoy, then MISS PURRFECT XD has it. </p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p>Using an improved printing process with enhanced color and details to model a hen’s natural iridescence, MISS PURRFECT XD is designed to grab a gobbler’s attention from long distances. The taxidermy eyes will make him commit those last crucial yards.</p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p>MISS PURRFECT XD goes from a folded 9” x 3” dinner plate to a full, 34-inch long hen decoy in a matter of seconds. Perfect Pose Technology™ allows you to adjust the head and neck depending on your hunting situation, as well as set the decoy in a standing, feeding, or breeding pose. The latter of which is a surefire way to draw in weary toms when paired with JAKE PURRFECT XD standing behind. </p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>'),(220278,76,0,99711,'<p><span>Miss Purr-fect is an easily collapsible product for extremely quick set-up and take-down in the field. It can be done in seconds! The combination of realistic appeal, durability, lightweight construction and condensable nature make Miss Purr-fect a must have for long days in the field. The feather cuts in the fabric allow her to appear more real in the field than plastic decoys and will deliver the grand prize you\'re looking for.</span></p>'),(220685,76,1,99711,'<p><span>Miss Purr-fect is an easily collapsible product for extremely quick set-up and take-down in the field. It can be done in seconds! The combination of realistic appeal, durability, lightweight construction and condensable nature make Miss Purr-fect a must have for long days in the field. The feather cuts in the fabric allow her to appear more real in the field than plastic decoys and will deliver the grand prize you\'re looking for.</span></p>'),(220686,85,1,99711,'Montana Decoy Miss Purr-Fect XD 3D'),(220279,75,0,99712,'<p><span>In the early season, gobblers are trying to establish dominance by claiming territory and the presence of an inferior will not be taken kindly. In the peak of the mating season into late spring, place MISS PURR-FECT in the breeding position with JAKE PURR-FECT behind her to get any gobbler looking for one last hen to come running. “The PURR-FECT PAIR is extremely quiet to set up and take down. Plus, I can carry it all season without extra bags or sore shoulders. The days of leaving decoys at home because they’re too noisy or too much trouble are over.” – Grant Woods, Renowned Wildlife Biologist and Host of Growing Deer TV</span></p>'),(220681,75,1,99712,'<p><span>All the benefits of Jake Purrfect XD and the Miss Purrfect XD in a single package. A new Fabric better replicates a turkey\'s natural iridescence while new realism based details like taxidermy eyes adds the finishing touches. Each decoy comes with a zippered carry pouch for easy transport and fast deployment. And don\'t overlook how each decoy can be used in several different poses allowing you to create any turkey teasing set up you want</span></p>\r\n<p>Oftentimes two is better than one. This couldn’t be more true in the matrimony of MISS PURRFECT XD and JAKE PURRFECT XD. The PURRFECT PAIR XD is built to fuel a turkey’s springtime love making obsession as well as his blood-thirsty rage. The use of our Perfect Pose Technology™ allows you to quickly set the decoys in a standing, feeding, or breeding pose. If you want to see an old dominant gobbler go truly mad, place JAKE PURRFECT XD in the looker pose with MISS PURRFECT XD in the breeding pose slightly underneath and directly in front.  </p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p>“From the improved printing to reflect a wild turkey’s iridescence to the taxidermy eyes that will make a ol’ tom commit those last few yards, the evolution of our turkey decoys toward ultimate realism and functionality have really put them in a league of their own,” said Jerry McPherson.</p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>'),(220280,76,0,99712,'<p><span>The ONLY super light, realistic and portable 3D turkey decoy system that will fit in your vest. <span>Ultra-realistic features are proven to fool the wiliest of toms. <span>Thanks to PERFECT POSE TECHNOLOGY, these two decoys allows for seven unique setups. <span>An essential visual aid for calling in pressured birds.</span></span></span></span></p>'),(220682,76,1,99712,'<p><span>The ONLY super light, realistic and portable 3D turkey decoy system that will fit in your vest. <span>Ultra-realistic features are proven to fool the wiliest of toms. <span>Thanks to PERFECT POSE TECHNOLOGY, these two decoys allows for seven unique setups. <span>An essential visual aid for calling in pressured birds.</span></span></span></span></p>'),(220281,75,0,99713,'<p><span>The combination of its realistic feathers, 3D body, short beard and red head gives every indication of authenticity to the discerning eye of hens and toms alike. The different poses of this decoy will get a gobbler’s attention, but the realism will bring him in. Folding down to the size of a dinner plate, Jake Purr-fect fits perfectly in your vest and is always there when you need him.  The spring coil system is built so the hunter can easily pack up and move to the next location without wasting time. The body features feather cuts for genuine movement in the field. They will flutter in a breeze and provide a life-like soft edge to the profile. Montana Decoy is already known for making the most mobile turkey decoys on the market</span></p>'),(220314,75,1,99713,'<p><span>An improved printing process uses an all new fabric that better replicates the natural iridescence of real turkey feathers. Just like our Miss Purrfect XD, Jake Purrfect XD can be used in several different poses including Looker, Feeder and Brawler allowing hunters to match their set ups perfectly to the phase of the season and the specific location they are hunting. An all new zippered carry pouch makes compression and transporting this lightweight decoy even easier!</span></p>\r\n<p>The tried and true JAKE PURR-FECT turkey decoy has become an absolute favorite among turkey hunting fanatics over the past several seasons. Bottom line, when spring rolls around and dominant tom turkeys are actively breeding hens, they can’t tolerate the intrusion of a lesser gobbler.</p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p>To enhance an already realistic jake decoy, we are releasing JAKE PURRFECT XD. Perfect Pose Technology™ allows you to set this decoy in a looker, brawler, or feeder pose. An improved printing process enabled us to enhance the color and details to model a wild turkey’s natural iridescence. </p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p>JAKE PURRFECT XD’s redhead is designed to let the local turkey population know that he’s aggressively pursuing hens and won’t back down from bigger birds. Plus, we used taxidermy eyes to give the extra detail that will make longbeards commit to the challenge of JAKE PURRFECT’s head-up, aggressive posture.</p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p>As with all of Montana Decoy’s turkey decoys, JAKE PURRFECT XD folds down small and packs easily but snuggly into your turkey vest. The circumference of this decoy is 9 inches whether it’s in action or packed. It’s length is a whole ‘nother story. JAKE PURRFECT goes from a mere 3 inches folded to 34 inches unfolded. That’s the 10x difference Montana Decoy is known for when it comes to creating not only the most realistic decoys on the market, but also the lightest, most packable, and easy to use. </p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>'),(220282,76,0,99713,'<p><span>Perfect Pose Technology allows the hunter to mold the neck into any position that is needed for the moment. <span>Two leg pole placements are marked \"Brawler\" and \"Feeder\" for easy identification in the field and quick set-up. <span></span></span></span></p>'),(220315,76,1,99713,'<p><span>Perfect Pose Technology allows the hunter to mold the neck into any position that is needed for the moment. <span>Two leg pole placements are marked \"Brawler\" and \"Feeder\" for easy identification in the field and quick set-up. <span></span></span></span></p>'),(220316,85,1,99713,'Montana Decoy Jake Purr-Fect XD 3D'),(220283,75,0,99714,'<p><span>The Fanatic\'s life-likesize and photgraphic realism is sure to rile up and gobbler that sees it. With the attached stake, push it into the ground within seconds for a quick set-up or use it to stalk a hung-up bird while peering through the mesh window. <span>Secure handle allows for one handed operation and better gun control</span></span></p>'),(220711,75,1,99714,'<p><span>The Fanatic\'s life-likesize and photgraphic realism is sure to rile up and gobbler that sees it. With the attached stake, push it into the ground within seconds for a quick set-up or use it to stalk a hung-up bird while peering through the mesh window. <span>Secure handle allows for one handed operation and better gun control</span></span></p>'),(220284,76,0,99714,'<p><span>See-Through mesh window for total concealment. <span>Sewn-in foldable stake can be used as a handle. <span>Folding up to the size of a paper plate, the Fanatic decoy is made for the run-and-gun hunter. <span>2-D Decoy for portability.</span></span></span></span></p>'),(220712,76,1,99714,'<p><span>See-Through mesh window for total concealment. <span>Sewn-in foldable stake can be used as a handle. <span>Folding up to the size of a paper plate, the Fanatic decoy is made for the run-and-gun hunter. <span>2-D Decoy for portability.</span></span></span></span></p>'),(220285,75,0,99715,'<p><span>A foolproof way to add realism to your calling setup, Miss Hoptober is a sneaky tool that can easily ride in your vest or pack all season. No batteries to replace or moving parts to break, she’s ready to hunt when you are. Built using an actual cottontail photograph for realism, the life-size Miss Hoptober sets up a scenario too tempting for even the cagiest of coyotes to resist. Using Montana’s patented twist fold design, Miss Hoptober has a transport size of only 10” X 5,” while weighing a mere 7 oz including leg pole. <span>Use with the Song Dog decoy for extra realism.</span></span></p>'),(220287,75,1,99715,'<p><span>A foolproof way to add realism to your calling setup, Miss Hoptober is a sneaky tool that can easily ride in your vest or pack all season. No batteries to replace or moving parts to break, she’s ready to hunt when you are. Built using an actual cottontail photograph for realism, the life-size Miss Hoptober sets up a scenario too tempting for even the cagiest of coyotes to resist. Using Montana’s patented twist fold design, Miss Hoptober has a transport size of only 10” X 5,” while weighing a mere 7 oz including leg pole. <span>Use with the Song Dog decoy for extra realism.</span></span></p>'),(220286,76,0,99715,'<p><span>Built using an actual cottontail photo. <span>Folds to 10” X 5” for easy transport. <span>Fast and quiet set up</span></span></span></p>'),(220288,76,1,99715,'<p><span>Built using an actual cottontail photo. <span>Folds to 10” X 5” for easy transport. <span>Fast and quiet set up</span></span></span></p>'),(220453,75,0,99732,'<p>AMBIDEXTROUS DESIGN</p>\r\n<p>Loaded with 10 total pockets (seven in the waistband and one on each leg) as well as reflective detail to keep you safe in low lit areas. These technical leggings boast a <span>completely ambidextrous</span> design to store a personal protection tool such as a pepper blaster, taser, stun gun, firearm (23oz loaded or less) or anything else you want to carry. There are also special pockets to hold your extra magazines, phone, keys, credit cards and more. Our leggings have a patent pending double pocket system designed to hold a credit card or ID in front of your firearm for added trigger guard protection.</p>\r\n<p><span>FIT</span></p>\r\n<p>Chic 7/8 length with extreme compression to lift you up, suck you in and smooth you out.</p>\r\n<p><span>FABRIC</span></p>\r\n<p>85% Polyester/15% Spandex</p>\r\n<p><span>CARE</span></p>\r\n<p>Machine wash cold inside out with like fabrics and colors to prevent fading and lay flat to dry. Do not use bleach. Each piece is dyed with a special process and washing in cold water can help even any subtle dye inconsistencies.</p>'),(670605,75,1,99732,'<p>AMBIDEXTROUS DESIGN</p>\r\n<p>Loaded with 10 total pockets (seven in the waistband and one on each leg) as well as reflective detail to keep you safe in low lit areas. These technical leggings boast a <span>completely ambidextrous</span> design to store a personal protection tool such as a pepper blaster, taser, stun gun, firearm (23oz loaded or less) or anything else you want to carry. There are also special pockets to hold your extra magazines, phone, keys, credit cards and more. Our leggings have a patent pending double pocket system designed to hold a credit card or ID in front of your firearm for added trigger guard protection.</p>\r\n<p><span>FIT</span></p>\r\n<p>Chic 7/8 length with extreme compression to lift you up, suck you in and smooth you out.</p>\r\n<p><span>FABRIC</span></p>\r\n<p>85% Polyester/15% Spandex</p>\r\n<p><span>CARE</span></p>\r\n<p>Machine wash cold inside out with like fabrics and colors to prevent fading and lay flat to dry. Do not use bleach. Each piece is dyed with a special process and washing in cold water can help even any subtle dye inconsistencies.</p>'),(220454,76,0,99732,'<p>Loaded with 10 total pockets (seven in the waistband and one on each leg) as well as reflective detail to keep you safe in low lit areas.</p>'),(670606,76,1,99732,'<p>Loaded with 10 total pockets (seven in the waistband and one on each leg) as well as reflective detail to keep you safe in low lit areas.</p>'),(220455,75,0,99733,'<p>AMBIDEXTROUS DESIGN</p>\r\n<p>Loaded