ocket system designed to hold a credit card or ID in front of your firearm for added trigger guard protection.</p>\r\n<p><span>FIT</span></p>\r\n<p>Chic 7/8 length with extreme compression to lift you up, suck you in and smooth you out.</p>\r\n<p><span>FABRIC</span></p>\r\n<p>85% Polyester/15% Spandex</p>\r\n<p><span>CARE</span></p>\r\n<p>Machine wash cold inside out with like fabrics and colors to prevent fading and lay flat to dry. Do not use bleach. Each piece is dyed with a special process and washing in cold water can help even any subtle dye inconsistencies.</p>'),(220464,76,0,99737,'<p>Loaded with 10 total pockets (seven in the waistband and one on each leg) as well as reflective detail to keep you safe in low lit areas.</p>'),(220466,76,1,99737,'<p>Loaded with 10 total pockets (seven in the waistband and one on each leg) as well as reflective detail to keep you safe in low lit areas.</p>'),(220964,75,0,99938,'<p>hi</p>'),(220965,76,0,99938,'<p>hello</p>'),(220966,85,0,99938,'hi'),(221116,75,0,99994,'<p>The US Mint updated the design of the iconic silver American Eagle for the first time since the series was launched in 1986. The change was made midway through 2021. 2023 is the third year of issue for the updated design featuring a majestic bald eagle carrying an oak branch on the coin\'s obverse side.</p>'),(234969,75,1,99994,'<p>The obverse (heads) features Adolph A. Weinman’s full-length figure of Liberty in full stride, enveloped in folds of the flag, with her right hand extended and branches of laurel and oak in her left.</p>\r\n<p>The reverse (tails) features a heraldic eagle with shield, an olive branch in the right talon and arrows in the left.</p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(221117,76,0,99994,'<ul>\r\n<li>2023 American Silver Eagle</li>\r\n<li>.999 fine</li>\r\n<li>1 ounce</li>\r\n</ul>'),(234970,76,1,99994,'<ul>\r\n<li>2023 American Silver Eagle</li>\r\n<li>1 Ounce</li>\r\n<li>.999 Fine</li>\r\n</ul>'),(3972909,85,1,99994,NULL),(221118,75,0,99995,'<p><span>The Ryker Grip™ is the first in a new class of side mounted, forward supports. The Ryker Grip is an innovative, patent-pending, biomechanically optimized shooting method that has been proven on the battle field and on the range. By offsetting the operator’s support hand, Ryker Grip enables the shooter to engage targets faster and move naturally. The Ryker Grip was engineered and developed with the input and support of Special Operations Professionals, Special Operations Physicians, Law Enforcement Professionals, and Professional Competitive Shooters. The Ryker Grip is simply the next evolution in shooting.</span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Warning:</strong><span> Observe safe firearms handling practices at all times. Install Ryker Grip™ so it is entirely mounted on the rail at least 3\" aft of the muzzle. Failure to do so may result in serious injury or death. RYKER USA shall not be responsible for injury, death, or property damage resulting from faulty installation, misuse, illegal use, or modification of this product.</span></p>'),(221119,76,0,99995,'<p><span>The Ryker Grip™ is the first in a new class of side mounted, forward supports.</span></p>'),(221147,75,0,100000,'<p><span>PSA Complete Upper. GEN4 8\" 9MM 1/10 NITRIDE 7\" LIGHTWEIGHT M-LOK UPPER - WITH BCG &amp; CH</span><br /><br /><span>Barrel Length: 8\"</span><br /><span>Barrel Profile: Heavy</span><br /><span>Barrel Steel: Chrome Moly Vanadium</span><br /><span>Barrel Finish: Nitride</span><br /><span>Chrome Lining: No</span><br /><span>Muzzle Thread: 1/2-36</span><br /><span>Chamber: 9mm (9x19)</span><br /><span>Twist Rate: 1 in 10\"</span><br /><span>Barrel Extension: 9mm</span><br /><span>Muzzle Device: A2 Style Flash Hider</span><br /><span>Receiver Material: Billet 7075 T6</span><br /><span>Receiver Type: Slick Side</span><br /><span>Handguard Type: PSA 7\" Lightweight M-Lok Rail</span><br /><span>Bolt Included: Yes, (Gen 4, Hybrid)</span><br /><span>Bolt Steel: 8620, Nitride Treated</span><br /><span>Charging Handle included: Yes</span></p>'),(221148,75,1,100000,'<p><span>PSA Complete Upper. GEN4 8\" 9MM 1/10 NITRIDE 7\" LIGHTWEIGHT M-LOK UPPER - WITH BCG &amp; CH</span><br /><br /><span>Barrel Length: 8\"</span><br /><span>Barrel Profile: Heavy</span><br /><span>Barrel Steel: Chrome Moly Vanadium</span><br /><span>Barrel Finish: Nitride</span><br /><span>Chrome Lining: No</span><br /><span>Muzzle Thread: 1/2-36</span><br /><span>Chamber: 9mm (9x19)</span><br /><span>Twist Rate: 1 in 10\"</span><br /><span>Barrel Extension: 9mm</span><br /><span>Muzzle Device: A2 Style Flash Hider</span><br /><span>Receiver Material: Billet 7075 T6</span><br /><span>Receiver Type: Slick Side</span><br /><span>Handguard Type: PSA 7\" Lightweight M-Lok Rail</span><br /><span>Bolt Included: Yes, (Gen 4, Hybrid)</span><br /><span>Bolt Steel: 8620, Nitride Treated</span><br /><span>Charging Handle included: Yes</span></p>'),(221149,76,1,100000,NULL),(221150,85,1,100000,NULL),(221151,75,0,100001,'<p><span>New Fully CNC Machined Modified Bolt</span></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><br /><br /><span>Breach face machined to correct head space (.044\').</span></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><br /><br /><span>Rear face machined to correct firing pin protrusion (.040\').</span></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><br /><br /><span>Power Custom Titanium Extractor Claw installed and tuned.</span></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><br /><br /><span>Rear of bolt radiused for easier cocking.</span></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><br /><br /><span>Beveled Power Custom Titanium firing pin.</span></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><span>Firing pin is pinned so, it keeps it from coming up in the action.</span></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><br /><br /><span>Drops right in.</span></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><br /><br /><span>Designed to work with the CST Last shot hold open. You will not need a modified magazine for last shot hold open will work with our bolt.</span></p>'),(221152,75,0,100002,'<p><span>Holds 3 factory Ruger® 10-22® 10 round magazines together. Easy to assemble. Very Strong and Durable.</span></p>'),(221256,75,0,100007,'<p>This new <span>open reflex ROMEO1 sight withstands the punishment of deployment while maintaining a confident zero. TruHold™ twin adjustment springs provide a lock-less zeroing system that is on-target shot after shot. Designed to fit the most popular pistols, or you can mount it low and co-witness your iron sights on a SIG SAUER® pistol with a custom-machined slide. CNC-machined from a solid billet of Magnesium for lightweight strength. The molded aspherical lens is bright and distortion free, and the red-notch coating ensures a brilliant red dot. Manual brightness controls with our MOTAC™ (Motion Activated Illumination) system remember your last setting after powering off. Powered by a top-loading battery so you never have to lose your zero.</span></p>'),(221258,75,1,100007,'<p>This new <span>open reflex ROMEO1 sight withstands the punishment of deployment while maintaining a confident zero. TruHold™ twin adjustment springs provide a lock-less zeroing system that is on-target shot after shot. Designed to fit the most popular pistols, or you can mount it low and co-witness your iron sights on a SIG SAUER® pistol with a custom-machined slide. CNC-machined from a solid billet of Magnesium for lightweight strength. The molded aspherical lens is bright and distortion free, and the red-notch coating ensures a brilliant red dot. Manual brightness controls with our MOTAC™ (Motion Activated Illumination) system remember your last setting after powering off. Powered by a top-loading battery so you never have to lose your zero.</span></p>'),(221257,76,0,100007,'<p>New open reflex ROMEO1 sight mounted on a Sig P320 slide with suppressor height white dot sights.</p>'),(221259,76,1,100007,'<p>New open reflex ROMEO1 sight mounted on a Sig P320 slide with suppressor height white dot sights.</p>'),(221260,85,1,100007,NULL),(221331,75,0,100018,'<p><span>The Blackhound Optics Genesis Series 6-24x50 FFP MOA provides shooters with long-rang