p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Visual support</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Supports Brain and nerves</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(221508,76,1,100058,'<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Helps Joint Flexibility</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Visual support</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Supports Brain and nerves</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(221509,85,1,100058,NULL),(221494,75,0,100059,'<div>Your most important ability is your availability right?</div>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><span></span><span>Whether you\'re trying to recover from a brutal hike into remote backcountry chasing bugling bulls, shredding your thighs on leg day at the gym, or just from the pains of \"adulting\" Resto Recovery is there to help you get back at it better and faster!</span></p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span>Benefits to Resto Night Time Recovery:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Great for Athletes and Outdoor enthusiasts</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong><span>Contains amino acids</span></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Supports muscles</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong> Great for Muscle</strong></span><span><span><strong> Recovery</strong> </span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><span></span><span></span>Amino Acids are the building blocks your body uses to create lean muscle. </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>Resto contains BCAAs, (branch chain amino acids) the most abundant and most readily absorbed group of amino acids found in lean muscle. </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>Glutamine is one of the most abundant amino acids in the body and plays a key role in muscle growth and recovery. </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>If you are sore and exhausted after a hard day in the field just take 5 capsules, enjoy a great night\'s sleep and wake up feeling refreshed and ready for your new Horizon.</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><b>Servings per bottle:</b><span> 30</span></p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><b>Usage</b><span>: Take five (5) veggie capsules 20 minutes before bedtime</span></p>'),(221496,75,1,100059,'<div>Your most important ability is your availability right?</div>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><span></span><span>Whether you\'re trying to recover from a brutal hike into remote backcountry chasing bugling bulls, shredding your thighs on leg day at the gym, or just from the pains of \"adulting\" Resto Recovery is there to help you get back at it better and faster!</span></p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span>Benefits to Resto Night Time Recovery:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Great for Athletes and Outdoor enthusiasts</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong><span>Contains amino acids</span></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Supports muscles</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong> Great for Muscle</strong></span><span><span><strong> Recovery</strong> </span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><span></span><span></span>Amino Acids are the building blocks your body uses to create lean muscle. </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>Resto contains BCAAs, (branch chain amino acids) the most abundant and most readily absorbed group of amino acids found in lean muscle. </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>Glutamine is one of the most abundant amino acids in the body and plays a key role in muscle growth and recovery. </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>If you are sore and exhausted after a hard day in the field just take 5 capsules, enjoy a great night\'s sleep and wake up feeling refreshed and ready for your new Horizon.</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><b>Servings per bottle:</b><span> 30</span></p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><b>Usage</b><span>: Take five (5) veggie capsules 20 minutes before bedtime</span></p>'),(221495,76,0,100059,'<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Great for Athletes and Outdoor enthusiasts</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong><span>Contains amino acids</span></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Supports muscles</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong> Great for Muscle</strong></span><span><span><strong> Recovery</strong> </span></span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(221497,76,1,100059,'<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Great for Athletes and Outdoor enthusiasts</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong><span>Contains amino acids</span></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Supports muscles</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong> Great for Muscle</strong></span><span><span><strong> Recovery</strong> </span></span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(221498,85,1,100059,NULL),(221499,75,0,100060,'<div>Most of us have heard of the benefits of Vitamin D3, but did you know that the addition of Vitamin K2 creates a full body powerhouse! </div>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>With benefits like immune function, bone growth and density, cardiovascular health, blood sugar balance, mood, mental clarity, and focus.</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>We even add extra calcium because of the combination of D3+K2 drastically and safely improves calcium uptake and directs the calcium to the bones rather than joints and arteries.</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><br />Vitamin K2 also has amazing benefits for the kidneys, blood flow and even weight loss.  North Americans rarely get adequate sunlight to allow the body to metabolize enough D3, so supplementing is vital for your active outdoor lifestyle!</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Benefits of Sportsman\'s Horizon Vitamin K2/D3:</strong></p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Supports bone health</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Promotes immune system</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Helps with healthy muscles</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Boosts Cardiovascular Health </strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Helps Mental Clarity</strong></span> </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><b>Servings per bottle:</b><span> 60</span></p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><b>Usage</b><span>: As a dietary supplement take one (1) capsule once a day. For best results take 20-30 minutes before a meal with and 8 oz glass of water or as directed by your healthcare professional. </span></p>'),(345278,75,1,100060,'<div>Most of us have heard of the benefits of Vitamin D3, but did you know that the addition of Vitamin K2 creates a full body powerhouse! </div>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>With benefits like immune function, bone growth and density, cardiovascular health, blood sugar balance, mood, mental clarity, and focus.</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>We even add extra calcium because of the combination of D3+K2 drastically and safely improves calcium uptake and directs the calcium to the bones rather than joints and arteries.</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><br />Vitamin K2 also has amazing benefits for the kidneys, blood flow and even weight loss.  North Americans rarely get adequate sunlight to allow the body to metabolize enough D3, so supplementing is vital for your active outdoor lifestyle!</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Benefits of Sportsman\'s Horizon Vitamin K2/D3:</strong></p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Supports bone health</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Promotes immune system</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Helps with healthy muscles</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Boosts Cardiovascular Health </strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Helps Mental Clarity</strong></span> </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><b>Servings per bottle:</b><span> 60</span></p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><b>Usage</b><span>: As a dietary supplement take one (1) capsule once a day. For best results take 20-30 minutes before a meal with and 8 oz glass of water or as directed by your healthcare professional. </span></p>'),(221500,76,0,100060,'<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Supports bone health</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Promotes immune system</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Helps with healthy muscles</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Boosts Cardiovascular Health </strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Helps Mental Clarity</strong></span> </li>\r\n</ul>'),(345279,76,1,100060,'<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Supports bone health</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Promotes immune system</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Helps with healthy muscles</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Boosts Cardiovascular Health </strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Helps Mental Clarity</strong></span> </li>\r\n</ul>'),(345280,85,1,100060,NULL),(221501,75,0,100061,'<div>Outdoor enthusiasts require energy, focus, and stamina!  Our Vitamin B-12 Complex can help!! B vitamins play<br /> a vital role in maintaining good health and well-being. As the building blocks of a healthy body, B vitamins have a direct impact on your energy levels, brain function, eyesight, digestion, nerve function, hormone production, and cell metabolism. Get out easier, stay out longer and recover quicker by giving your body the nutrition it <br />needs!!</div>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<div>We combine 5 powerhouse B vitamins that benefit you in many ways.</div>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<div>Riboflavin (B-2) is required for the proper development and function of the skin and the lining of the digestive tract. Since it helps the body break down carbohydrates, proteins, and fats to produce energy, B-2 is needed for growth and overall good health. It can help with elevation related issues because it allows oxygen to be used by the body. <br />Niacin (B-3) is required for the proper function of fats and sugars in the body. It helps maintain healthy cell metabolism and healthy tissue by making and repairing DNA. It helps improve memory and acts as an antioxidant, helping to heal the skin following sun exposure.  As with all B vitamins, niacin combats fatigue by converting food into energy. <br />Pyridoxine (B-6) is needed to maintain proper energy levels. It helps improve brain health and mood and decreases depression.  It promotes hemoglobin production which can be helpful with altitude-related issues. <br /> B-6 is important for heart and eye health due to its ability to decrease homocysteine levels. Lower homocysteine level means less inflammation, decreased arthritis pain and less risk of cancer. For our ladies, B-6 helps with <br />PMS and nausea during pregnancy.</div>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<div><br />Pantothenic Acid (B-5) creates red blood cells which aids in increasing energy levels and easing altitude related issues.  B-5 helps maintain a healthy digestive tract, helps metabolize proteins, fats and carbs and processes other vitamins, particularly B2 (riboflavin).  It synthesizes cholesterol and is beneficial for depression and hormone balance.</div>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<div>Cobalamin (B-12) is another B that can help with energy production and altitude-related issues because of its role in red blood cell production. B12 can help improve mood, depression, cognitive function, and memory loss.  It is vital for hair, skin, nail and bone health.  Its ability to decrease homocysteine levels helps protect from macular degeneration.</div>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><b>Servings per bottle:</b><span> 60</span></p>\r\n<p><b>Usage</b><span>: Shake well before use. Adults place one dropper (1mL) under tongue and hold for 20 seconds before swallowing. Vitamin b-12 complex is essential for the maintenance of healthy nervous tissue. B Vitamins play a role in energy metabolism. </span></p>\r\n</div>'),(345281,75,1,100061,'<div>Outdoor enthusiasts require energy, focus, and stamina!  Our Vitamin B-12 Complex can help!! B vitamins play<br /> a vital role in maintaining good health and well-being. As the building blocks of a healthy body, B vitamins have a direct impact on your energy levels, brain function, eyesight, digestion, nerve function, hormone production, and cell metabolism. Get out easier, stay out longer and recover quicker by giving your body the nutrition it <br />needs!!</div>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<div>We combine 5 powerhouse B vitamins that benefit you in many ways.</div>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<div>Riboflavin (B-2) is required for the proper development and function of the skin and the lining of the digestive tract. Since it helps the body break down carbohydrates, proteins, and fats to produce energy, B-2 is needed for growth and overall good health. It can help with elevation related issues because it allows oxygen to be used by the body. <br />Niacin (B-3) is required for the proper function of fats and sugars in the body. It helps maintain healthy cell metabolism and healthy tissue by making and repairing DNA. It helps improve memory and acts as an antioxidant, helping to heal the skin following sun exposure.  As with all B vitamins, niacin combats fatigue by converting food into energy. <br />Pyridoxine (B-6) is needed to maintain proper energy levels. It helps improve brain health and mood and decreases depression.  It promotes hemoglobin production which can be helpful with altitude-related issues. <br /> B-6 is important for heart and eye health due to its ability to decrease homocysteine levels. Lower homocysteine level means less inflammation, decreased arthritis pain and less risk of cancer. For our ladies, B-6 helps with <br />PMS and nausea during pregnancy.</div>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<div><br />Pantothenic Acid (B-5) creates red blood cells which aids in increasing energy levels and easing altitude related issues.  B-5 helps maintain a healthy digestive tract, helps metabolize proteins, fats and carbs and processes other vitamins, particularly B2 (riboflavin).  It synthesizes cholesterol and is beneficial for depression and hormone balance.</div>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<div>Cobalamin (B-12) is another B that can help with energy production and altitude-related issues because of its role in red blood cell production. B12 can help improve mood, depression, cognitive function, and memory loss.  It is vital for hair, skin, nail and bone health.  Its ability to decrease homocysteine levels helps protect from macular degeneration.</div>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><b>Servings per bottle:</b><span> 60</span></p>\r\n<p><b>Usage</b><span>: Shake well before use. Adults place one dropper (1mL) under tongue and hold for 20 seconds before swallowing. Vitamin b-12 complex is essential for the maintenance of healthy nervous tissue. B Vitamins play a role in energy metabolism. </span></p>\r\n</div>'),(221502,76,0,100061,'<p><span>Outdoor enthusiasts require energy, focus, and stamina!  Our Vitamin B-12 Complex can help!! B vitamins play</span><br /><span> a vital role in maintaining good health and well-being.</span></p>'),(345282,76,1,100061,'<p><span>Outdoor enthusiasts require energy, focus, and stamina!  Our Vitamin B-12 Complex can help!! B vitamins play</span><br /><span> a vital role in maintaining good health and well-being.</span></p>'),(345283,85,1,100061,NULL),(221503,75,0,100062,'<p>Part of enjoying the Great Outdoors is partaking of the tremendous bounty of delicious foods it provides right? </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>Food is at the root of so much of our outdoor passions, yet utilizing our food to it\'s fullest extent is often neglected, if not completely ignored. </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>Why do we do this? </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>Well for one, it used to be A LOT of work, making sure you got the right balance of foods rich with beneficial bacteria (which never seem to be the tasty foods...) along with a whole host of other things.</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>Not so much anymore...</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>Make sure your body is gaining the full benefit of these gifts by supplementing with digestive enzymes. Digestive enzyme supplements help the body break down proteins, fats, carbohydrates and sugars in the food you eat so you can properly assimilate them. This process is vital to energy production, cell repair, tissue growth, and DNA health.</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>Now that may be a lot of nutritionist lingo, but here\'s what you need to know: to get more benefit no matter your diet, you need to be helping out your gut with beneficial enzymes. So get yours today!</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>As we age, our body makes fewer enzymes, so supplementation is vital for health.  This full-spectrum blend of digestive enzymes helps to digest your food, assimilate nutrients and eliminate what isn’t needed! </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>You’ll enjoy increased energy, decreased pain and inflammation and even some possible weight loss as your body releases stored proteins, fats and toxins.   The added benefits of a probiotic blend help digestion by improving gut health.</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>Plus... you don\'t have to eat any of those horrible green yogurts to do it!</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>Grab your Digestive Pro Blend today and start maximizing your foods!</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Servings per bottle:</strong> 60</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><br /><strong>Usage:</strong> As a dietary supplement take one (1) capsule twice a day. For best results take 20-30 minutes before a meal with and 8 oz glass of water or as directed by your healthcare professional.</p>'),(345284,75,1,100062,'<p>Part of enjoying the Great Outdoors is partaking of the tremendous bounty of delicious foods it provides right? </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>Food is at the root of so much of our outdoor passions, yet utilizing our food to it\'s fullest extent is often neglected, if not completely ignored. </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>Why do we do this? </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>Well for one, it used to be A LOT of work, making sure you got the right balance of foods rich with beneficial bacteria (which never seem to be the tasty foods...) along with a whole host of other things.</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>Not so much anymore...</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>Make sure your body is gaining the full benefit of these gifts by supplementing with digestive enzymes. Digestive enzyme supplements help the body break down proteins, fats, carbohydrates and sugars in the food you eat so you can properly assimilate them. This process is vital to energy production, cell repair, tissue growth, and DNA health.</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>Now that may be a lot of nutritionist lingo, but here\'s what you need to know: to get more benefit no matter your diet, you need to be helping out your gut with beneficial enzymes. So get yours today!</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>As we age, our body makes fewer enzymes, so supplementation is vital for health.  This full-spectrum blend of digestive enzymes helps to digest your food, assimilate nutrients and eliminate what isn’t needed! </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>You’ll enjoy increased energy, decreased pain and inflammation and even some possible weight loss as your body releases stored proteins, fats and toxins.   The added benefits of a probiotic blend help digestion by improving gut health.</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>Plus... you don\'t have to eat any of those horrible green yogurts to do it!</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>Grab your Digestive Pro Blend today and start maximizing your foods!</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Servings per bottle:</strong> 60</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p><br /><strong>Usage:</strong> As a dietary supplement take one (1) capsule twice a day. For best results take 20-30 minutes before a meal with and 8 oz glass of water or as directed by your healthcare professional.</p>'),(345285,76,1,100062,NULL),(345286,85,1,100062,NULL),(221522,75,0,100066,'<h3 class=\"text-center\"><span class=\"text-gray-dark\"><b>Specifications for R-COM™ Series (Combat Optic Mount)</b></span></h3>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-center text-muted\">GENERAL FEATURES:</h3>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"mb16 mt16 col-md-9 col-md-offset-3\">\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><span class=\"text-gray-dark\">MSRP: $199.99</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"text-gray-dark\">For use with Trijicon® RCO-ACOG Sights</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"text-gray-dark\">Retains Zero under extensive live fire usage and while subjected to harsh mechanical stresses</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n            Value:  .01 MOA [Lab Tested]   .01 MOA [Live Fire]<br />\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><span class=\"text-gray-dark\">Return to Zero following repeated removal-remount cycles during extensive live fire usage  </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span class=\"text-gray-dark\">            Value:  .01 MOA [Lab Tested]   &lt; .20 MOA [Live Fire]</span></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><span class=\"text-gray-dark\">Adjustable to Out-of-Spec / Worn M1913 Picatinny Rails</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"text-gray-dark\">Auto-Locking Quick Detach™ (ALQD™) Lever System</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"text-gray-dark\">Non-Abrading / Gouging Picatinny Rail Lockdown Feature</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"text-gray-dark\">Lightweight Rugged Design</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"text-gray-dark\">American Made</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<h3>Features:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For use with Trijicon ACOG &amp; Reflex Series Optical Sights</li>\r\n<li>Eye-Relief Enhancement: 3.5” – Adjustable in 3/8” increments</li>\r\n<li>Retains Zero under extensive live fire usage and while subjected to harsh mechanical stresses: .01 MOA</li>\r\n<li>Returns to Zero following repeated removal-remount cycles during extensive live fire usage:</li>\r\n<li>Value: .01 MOA [Lab Tested] &lt; .20 MOA [Live Fire]</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable to Out-of-Spec / Worn M1913 Picatinny Rails</li>\r\n<li>Auto-Locking Quick Detach (ALQD) Lever System</li>\r\n<li>Non-Abrading / Gouging Picatinny Rail Lockdown Feature</li>\r\n<li>Lightweight Rugged Design</li>\r\n<li>American Made</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Specifications:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Description: Sight Mount for Trijicon RCO‐ACOG &amp; Reflex Sights on M1913 Picatinny Rail</li>\r\n<li>P/N: RCME</li>\r\n<li>Materials: CNC Machined Aerospace Grade Aluminum, Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: MIL-SPEC Type III Hardcoat Anodize</li>\r\n<li>Category: Patent Pending</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span>NSN:</span> 1240-01-567-4490</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(221524,75,1,100066,'<h3><strong>Specifications for R-COM™ Series (Combat Optic Mount)</strong></h3>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p>• For use with Trijicon ACOG &amp; Reflex Series Optical Sights</p>\r\n<p>• Eye-Relief Enhancement: 3.5” – Adjustable in 3/8” increments</p>\r\n<p>• Retains Zero under extensive live fire usage and while subjected to harsh mechanical stresses: .01 MOA</p>\r\n<p>• Returns to Zero following repeated removal-remount cycles during extensive live fire usage:</p>\r\n<p>• Value: .01 MOA [Lab Tested] &lt; .20 MOA [Live Fire]</p>\r\n<p>• Adjustable to Out-of-Spec / Worn M1913 Picatinny Rails</p>\r\n<p>• Auto-Locking Quick Detach (ALQD) Lever System</p>\r\n<p>• Non-Abrading / Gouging Picatinny Rail Lockdown Feature</p>\r\n<p>• Lightweight Rugged Design</p>\r\n<p>• American Made</p>\r\n<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n<p>• Description: Sight Mount for Trijicon RCO‐ACOG &amp; Reflex Sights on M1913 Picatinny Rail</p>\r\n<p>• P/N: RCME</p>\r\n<p>• Materials: CNC Machined Aerospace Grade Aluminum, Stainless Steel</p>\r\n<p>• Finish: MIL-SPEC Type III Hardcoat Anodize</p>\r\n<p>• Category: Patent Pending</p>\r\n<p>• NSN: 1240-01-567-4490</p>\r\n</div>'),(221523,76,0,100066,'<p>GDI R-COM E-Model Combat Optic Mount RCME</p>'),(221525,76,1,100066,'<p>For use with Trijicon ACOG &amp; Reflex Series Optical Sights</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• Eye-Relief Enhancement: 3.5” – Adjustable in 3/8” increments</p>\r\n<p>• Retains Zero under extensive live fire usage and while subjected to harsh mechanical stresses: .01 MOA</p>\r\n<p>• Lightweight Rugged Design</p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(374292,85,1,100066,'GDI R-COM E-Model Combat Optic Mount RCME'),(221551,75,0,100072,'<p>The Pop Pack multi-variable and reactive targets are developed by a Navy SEAL to facilitate cognitive shooting drills, refine marksmanship, and add another degree of fun to a day at the range. Pop Packs are available in a box of 10 packs. Each pack has 10 unique variable arrangements consisting of different colors, &amp; shapes. This variety is great for advanced defensive shooters practicing \'call-out\' drills. Place the packs down range, and when the variable is called out from the firing line - race your friends to identify and engage the designated target! Not only is it a lot of fun, but it also reinforces positive identification as well as engaging the target until it is completely impacted. The end result is a highly visible pop! of environmentally safe gel that is water soluble and will not stain your clothes. Pop packs illustrate the nuances of shooting, and are a great way to introduce children and beginners to the sport.</p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Instant feedback- bright &amp; highly visible impact. Target is great for long and short range Shooting. When you hit the pop pack it will splatter &amp; burst with bright colors</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Designed to challenge- 12 high-visibility targets, 3 colors variations, 4 shapes &amp; numbered Stickers. This allows for multi-variable training to promote thinking first &amp; Shooting second</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Filled with fun- Great for Technical drills, &amp; also a ton of fun for a relaxed day at the range. Use with steel targets or stand them upright &amp; Watch THE targets burst and splatter everywhere</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Works best with pistol, rifle &amp; shotgun- for the best experience Use pistol calibers . 380 and above, rifle calibers . 30 carbine and above, and any shotgun round you wish</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Us patent no. 9, 885, 547- patented technology &amp; manufacturing trade secret was developed by a Navy seal and a team of product designers in the heartland of the USA</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Recommended for outdoor use. Proudly designed in the USA. </p>'),(221554,75,1,100072,'<p>The Pop Pack multi-variable and reactive targets are developed by a Navy SEAL to facilitate cognitive shooting drills, refine marksmanship, and add another degree of fun to a day at the range. Pop Packs are available in a box of 10 packs. Each pack has 10 unique variable arrangements consisting of different colors, &amp; shapes. This variety is great for advanced defensive shooters practicing \'call-out\' drills. Place the packs down range, and when the variable is called out from the firing line - race your friends to identify and engage the designated target! Not only is it a lot of fun, but it also reinforces positive identification as well as engaging the target until it is completely impacted. The end result is a highly visible pop! of environmentally safe gel that is water soluble and will not stain your clothes. Pop packs illustrate the nuances of shooting, and are a great way to introduce children and beginners to the sport.</p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Instant feedback- bright &amp; highly visible impact. Target is great for long and short range Shooting. When you hit the pop pack it will splatter &amp; burst with bright colors</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><sp