pact location.</span></p>'),(221573,76,1,100077,'<p>Shot Seeker adhesive bullseye targets show a big shot burst with a bright yellow halo at the impact location. </p>\r\n<p>Identify and score your shot from the firing line. This adhesive targets is great for applying to cardboard backs or other silhouette targets. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• 1 inch grids are ideal for sighting in</p>\r\n<p>• Identify your shot easy</p>\r\n<p>• Adhesive target can be applied on cardboard </p>\r\n<p>• 10 targets included </p>'),(221571,85,0,100077,'bullseye targets for the range, reactive targets for the range, best shooting targets, Triumph Systems'),(221574,85,1,100077,'bullseye targets for the range, reactive targets for the range, best shooting targets, Triumph Systems'),(221575,75,0,100078,'<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Shot Seeker NON-Adhesive bullseye targets show a big shot burst with a bright yellow halo at the impact location. Identify and score your shot from the firing line. This target is 12\"x12\" that has five 4\" targets to perfect your aim. The Shot Seekers 1-inch grids are ideal for sighting in your firearm quickly and easily!</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<div><span><br /></span></div>'),(221578,75,1,100078,'<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Shot Seeker NON-Adhesive bullseye targets show a big shot burst with a bright yellow halo at the impact location. Identify and score your shot from the firing line. This target is 12\"x12\" that has five 4\" targets to perfect your aim. The Shot Seekers 1-inch grids are ideal for sighting in your firearm quickly and easily!</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<div><span><br /></span></div>'),(221576,76,0,100078,'<p><span>The Shot Seekers 1 inch grids are ideal for sighting in your firearm quickly and easily. </span></p>'),(221579,76,1,100078,'<p>The Shot Seekers 1 inch grids are ideal for sighting in your firearm quickly and easily. </p>\r\n<p>10 pack</p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>'),(221577,85,0,100078,'best shooting target, sight in shooting target, bullseye target'),(221580,85,1,100078,'best shooting target, sight in shooting target, bullseye target'),(221581,75,0,100079,'<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The Threat Down shooting target provides instant feedback, leaving no doubt as to where your rounds have impacted. The vital organs are made of environmentally safe, highly visible gel. This 100+ round target was developed for most calibers. It is a great training tool for shooters of all skill levels, from beginners to the advanced level shooter. Developed with a Navy SEAL, the targets are ideal for defensive training, but are also great for a fun day on the range. Each organ is represented by a different color, providing easy-to-identify round placement. The water-soluble gel will not stain clothing. Additional grid targets are located in the corners to maximize use of this fully reactive target.</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<div><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>INSTANT FEEDBACK- targets provide a bright &amp; highly visible impact. It is great for long and short range shooting. No need to go down range to check on your precision and accuracy, the target will react and bleed showing you where the impact took place</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>HIGH CAPACITY TARGET- 104 individual cells allow for extended training and a lot of use out of just one target. Paper targets and shoot &amp; see targets get destroyed fast. The targets take a lot of rounds before they need to be replaced</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>PACKED WITH FUN- The more you shoot at the target the more patriotic it will become. The more you shoot the terrorist target, the more red, white and blue it becomes. Share your patriotic work with your friends</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>ENVIRONMENTALLY FRIENDLY- Our proprietary, water soluble, non-toxic material is safe to you and the environment</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>'),(221593,75,1,100079,'<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The Threat Down shooting target provides instant feedback, leaving no doubt as to where your rounds have impacted. The vital organs are made of environmentally safe, highly visible gel. This 100+ round target was developed for most calibers. It is a great training tool for shooters of all skill levels, from beginners to the advanced level shooter. Developed with a Navy SEAL, the targets are ideal for defensive training, but are also great for a fun day on the range. Each organ is represented by a different color, providing easy-to-identify round placement. The water-soluble gel will not stain clothing. Additional grid targets are located in the corners to maximize use of this fully reactive target.</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<div><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>INSTANT FEEDBACK- targets provide a bright &amp; highly visible impact. It is great for long and short range shooting. No need to go down range to check on your precision and accuracy, the target will react and bleed showing you where the impact took place</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>HIGH CAPACITY TARGET- 104 individual cells allow for extended training and a lot of use out of just one target. Paper targets and shoot &amp; see targets get destroyed fast. The targets take a lot of rounds before they need to be replaced</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>PACKED WITH FUN- The more you shoot at the target the more patriotic it will become. The more you shoot the Humanoid target, the more red, white a