d display the impact location vividly.</p>\r\n<p>Boasting a high capacity with 104 individual cells, these targets offer extended training sessions and durability. Unlike paper targets and shoot &amp; see targets that quickly wear out, Triumph Systems targets withstand numerous rounds before requiring replacement.</p>\r\n<p>With a commitment to being environmentally friendly, the proprietary water-soluble, non-toxic material ensures both user and environmental safety, making the Ethical Harvest Turkey 2-Pack a responsible and effective choice for your shooting training needs.</p>'),(221609,76,0,100086,'<p>This 8.5 x 11\" responsive target provides instant feedback, leaving no doubt as to where your rounds have impacted the vital organs.</p>'),(222478,76,1,100086,'<p>This 8.5 x 11\" responsive target provides instant feedback, leaving no doubt as to where your rounds have impacted the vital organs.</p>'),(221610,85,0,100086,'Turkey shooting targets, turkey hunting, shooting targets'),(222479,85,1,100086,'Turkey shooting targets, turkey hunting, shooting targets'),(221611,75,0,100087,'<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Specifically designed targets for use with our Pivotal Trainer,</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Design includes: Threat/No Threat, Vital Organs, T-Zone, and Central Nervous System.</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Connect the target to the Pivotal Trainer with either clips or zip ties.</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<div><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>DESIGNED FOR THE PIVOTAL TRAINER- this replacement target can be used on any System or just as a stand-alone target; however, it is designed to work seamlessly with our pivotal Trainer</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>DURABLE CARDBOARD TARGET- Cardboard targets take more rounds than paper targets before they Fall apart. Get the most Use out of you training time by using our Cardboard targets</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>PROMOTES GOOD SHOT PLACEMENT- practice discretionary training by striking the target where it counts: t-zone, spinal column, lungs or head</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>DRY-FIRE, AIR SOFT, AIR RIFLE, PISTOL, RIFLE, SIMUNITION -Target can be used for air soft training, air rifle, as well as live fire with pistols, rifles and when training with simunition</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>TARGET BACKER- these targets work great as a target back if you want to adhere paper targets to them</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>'),(221612,76,0,100087,'<p>Specifically designed targets for use with our Pivotal Trainer.</p>\r\n<p>10 pack.</p>\r\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-a9ff46a1-7fff-27ce-e084-50d9a47c048e\"><span></span></span></p>'),(221613,85,0,100087,'Cardboard shooting targets, good targets for the range, practice shooting targets'),(221614,75,0,100088,'<ul>\r\n<li><strong><span>Blocks the enzyme alpha-amylase</span></strong></li>\r\n<li><strong><span>Prevents the breaking down of carbohydrates</span></strong></li>\r\n<li><strong><span>Accelerates weight loss</span></strong></li>\r\n<li><strong><span>Improves the way the body metabolizes carbohydrates</span></strong></li>\r\n<li><strong><span>Lowers glycemic index of high-carb foods</span></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>Are you struggling with weight loss because of your high-carb diet? Or are you looking to lose weight without giving up the pasta, potatoes, and other carbohydrates that you really enjoy? If so, then White Kidney Bean Extract may be the perfect supplement to help you reach your goals. The way this supplement works is by blocking alpha-amylase, which controls how the body metabolizes carbs. Instead of breaking down carbohydrates into sugar, it leaves them whole to lower the glycemic index of high-carb foods and help you reach your weight loss goals.</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul></ul>\r\n<p><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span></p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(345288,75,1,100088,'<ul>\r\n<li><strong><span>Blocks the enzyme alpha-amylase</span></strong></li>\r\n<li><strong><span>Prevents the breaking down of carbohydrates</span></strong></li>\r\n<li><strong><span>Accelerates weight loss</span></strong></li>\r\n<li><strong><span>Improves the way the body metabolizes carbohydrates</span></strong></li>\r\n<li><strong><span>Lowers glycemic index of high-carb foods</span></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p>Are you struggling with weight loss because of your high-carb diet? Or are you looking to lose weight without giving up the pasta, potatoes, and other carbohydrates that you really enjoy? If so, then White Kidney Bean Extract may be the perfect supplement to help you reach your goals. The way this supplement works is by blocking alpha-amylase, which controls how the body metabolizes carbs. Instead of breaking down carbohydrates into sugar, it leaves them whole to lower the glycemic index of high-carb foods and help you reach your weight loss goals.</p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<ul></ul>\r\n<p><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span></p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(221615,76,0,100088,'<ul>\r\n<li><strong><span>Blocks the enzyme alpha-amylase</span></strong></li>\r\n<li><strong><span>Prevents the breaking down of carbohydrates</span></strong></li>\r\n<li><strong><span>Accelerates weight loss</span></strong></li>\r\n<li><strong><span>Improves the way the body metabolizes carbohydrates</span></strong></li>\r\n<li><strong><span>Lowers glycemic index of high-carb foods</span></strong></li>\r\n</ul>'),(345289,76,1,100088,'<ul>\r\n<li><strong><span>Blocks the enzyme alpha-amylase</span></strong></li>\r\n<li><strong><span>Prevents the breaking down of carbohydrates</span></strong></li>\r\n<li><strong><span>Accelerates weight loss</span></strong></li>\r\n<li><strong><span>Improves the way the body metabolizes carbohydrates</span></strong></li>\r\n<li><strong><span>Lowers glycemic index of high-carb foods</span></strong></li>\r\n</ul>'),(345290,85,1,100088,NULL),(221616,75,0,100089,'<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Boosts mood</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span><strong>Controls appetite</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span><strong>Supports weight loss</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span><strong>Natural sleep aid</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"yiv7794969295ydp4a6877a1MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n<p><span> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"yiv7794969295ydp4a6877a1MsoNormal\"><span>5-Hydroxytryptophan (5-HTP) is an amino acid that your body naturally produces. Your body uses it to produce serotonin, a chemical messenger that sends signals between your nerve cells. Low serotonin levels are associated with depression, anxiety, sleep disorders, weight gain and other health problems. </span></p>\r\n<p><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"yiv7794969295ydp4a6877a1MsoNormal\"><span>Our 5HTP can help overcome depression, symptoms of fibromyalgia, migraine headaches, improve sleep and help with weight loss.</span></p>\r\n<p><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"yiv7794969295ydp4a6877a1MsoNormal\"><span>Some people may experience nausea, diarrhea, vomiting and stomach pain when taking 5-HTP supplements. These side effects are dose-dependent, meaning they get worse when increasing your dose.</span></p>\r\n<p><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"yiv7794969295ydp4a6877a1MsoNormal\"><span>To minimize these side effects, start with a dose of 50–100 mg two times per day and increase to the appropriate dose over a two-week period</span></p>'),(345291,75,1,100089,'<ul>\r\n<li><span><strong>Boosts mood</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span><strong>Controls appetite</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span><strong>Supports