ar exercise are the best ways to keep your blood sugar under control‚ our Blood Sugar Ultra may provide more help. These capsules contain a blend of ingredients that work to keep your pancreas functioning optimally in order to regulate blood sugar levels. </span></p>'),(345340,76,1,100100,'<p><span>While a healthy diet and regular exercise are the best ways to keep your blood sugar under control‚ our Blood Sugar Ultra may provide more help. These capsules contain a blend of ingredients that work to keep your pancreas functioning optimally in order to regulate blood sugar levels. </span></p>'),(345341,85,1,100100,'Sportsman\'s Horizon Blood Sugar Ultra, Sportsman\'s horizon, Everest storefront, vitamins, supplements, antioxidants, anti aging, sleep aids, supplements for hunters, supplements for the outdoors '),(221640,75,0,100101,'<p><span>Cinnamon is a delicious spice that has been prized for its medicinal properties for thousands of years, however Ceylon cinnamon is the only type that has these benefits. Some of these include antioxidant support, is anti-inflammatory which can be beneficial for heart conditions.</span><span>  </span><span>It can improve insulin sensitivity, which can lower blood sugar levels and can inhibit the build up of protein in the brain which can lead to neurodegenerative disorders.</span><span>  </span><span>Ceylon Cinnamon helps fight bacterial and fungal infections.</span><span>  </span><span>This makes it valuable for dental health.</span></p>'),(231876,75,1,100101,'<p><span>Cinnamon is a delicious spice that has been prized for its medicinal properties for thousands of years, however Ceylon cinnamon is the only type that has these benefits. Some of these include antioxidant support, is anti-inflammatory which can be beneficial for heart conditions.</span><span>  </span><span>It can improve insulin sensitivity, which can lower blood sugar levels and can inhibit the build up of protein in the brain which can lead to neurodegenerative diso