oiling water, let them cool and shape them to your ears. It’s that easy. If you don’t get a perfect fit the first time, don’t worry. Decibullz are the only custom earplugs that are re-moldable. Decibullz Custom Molded Earplugs are perfect for shooting, traveling, swimming, loud concerts, and musicians. </p>\r\n<p><span>Included: Two Decibullz Thermoplastic Custom Molds, Three Sets of Triple Flange Tips S, M, L, One Set of Max Protect MEDIUM Foam Tips, Earplug Carrying Pouch with Decibullz Logo</span></p>\r\n<p><span>Weight 0.15 lbs</span></p>\r\n<p><span>Rating: Meet ANSI S12.6 (ANSI s3.9) with independently tested NRR of 31</span></p>\r\n<p><span><em>Improper fitting or misuse of earplugs will reduce their effectiveness and could result in hearing loss or injury.</em></span></p>'),(232143,76,0,100580,'<p><span>Decibullz Custom Molded Earplugs are easily and quickly fitted to the exact shape of your ear for an NRR of 31.</span></p>'),(232248,76,1,100580,'<p><span>Decibullz Custom Molded Earplugs are easily and quickly fitted to the exact shape of your ear for an NRR of 31.</span></p>'),(232144,85,0,100580,'earplugs,  hearing protection for shooting, custom hearing protection for shooters, hearing protection'),(232249,85,1,100580,'earplugs,  hearing protection for shooting, custom hearing protection for shooters, hearing protection'),(232145,75,0,100581,'<p><span>Decibullz DIY Thermo-fit Molded Earpieces combined with new cutting edge percussive impulse filter technology. Decibullz Percussive Filters protect users from the peak sound pressure of gun shots, artillery fire, and explosions, suppressing them to safe levels and protecting users from hearing damage. Custom molding is easy, simply warm the earpieces in water and shape to your ears. The earpieces can even be re-heated and re-shaped if needed. Unlike electronic hearing protection, Decibullz Filters never need batteries.</span></p>\r\n<p><span> 1 Set of Decibullz Thermo-fit Earpieces, 2 Percussive Filters, (S, M, L) Max Isolation Foam Tips, (S, M, L) Open Triple Flange Silicone Tips, Premium Hard Carrying Case, Filter Lanyard.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>The Percussive Filters protect users from the peak sound pressure of gunshots, and explosions, suppressing them to safe levels. When a percussive noise is not present the filters allow you to hear ambient noise.</span><span></span></p>'),(234327,75,1,100581,'<p><span>Decibullz DIY Thermo-fit Molded Earpieces combined with new cutting edge percussive impulse filter technology. Decibullz Percussive Filters protect users from the peak sound pressure of gun shots, artillery fire, and explosions, suppressing them to safe levels and protecting users from hearing damage. Custom molding is easy, simply warm the earpieces in water and shape to your ears. The earpieces can even be re-heated and re-shaped if needed. Unlike electronic hearing protection, Decibullz Filters never need batteries.</span></p>\r\n<p><span> 1 Set of Decibullz Thermo-fit Earpieces, 2 Percussive Filters, (S, M, L) Max Isolation Foam Tips, (S, M, L) Open Triple Flange Silicone Tips, Premium Hard Carrying Case, Filter Lanyard.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>The Percussive Filters protect users from the peak sound pressure of gunshots, and explosions, suppressing them to safe levels. When a percussive noise is not present the filters allow you to hear ambient noise.</span><span></span></p>'),(232146,76,0,100581,'<p><span>The Percussive Filters protect users from the peak sound pressure of gunshots, and explosions, suppressing them to safe levels. When a percussive noise is not present the filters allow you to hear ambient noise.</span></p>'),(234328,76,1,100581,'<p><span>The Percussive Filters protect users from the peak sound pressure of gunshots, and explosions, suppressing them to safe levels. When a percussive noise is not present the filters allow you to hear ambient noise.</span></p>'),(232147,85,0,100581,'Earplug, custom molded earplugs, hearing protection'),(234329,85,1,100581,'Earplug, custom molded earplugs, hearing protection'),(232148,75,0,100582,'<p><span>Keep your Decibullz Custom Molded Earplugs together with this premium lanyard. Designed specifically for Decibullz Earplugs the lanyard is easily attached allowing for convenience and wear around the neck. Simply remove the back plugs from your Decibullz Custom Molded Earplugs and insert the lanyard plug.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>This is an accessory item for the standard custom molded ear plugs. Ther Percussive ear plug comes with it\'s own lanyard in the package.</span><span></span></p>'),(234330,75,1,100582,'<p><span>Keep your Decibullz Custom Molded Earplugs together with this premium lanyard. Designed specifically for Decibullz Earplugs the lanyard is easily attached allowing for convenience and wear around the neck. Simply remove the back plugs from your Decibullz Custom Molded Earplugs and insert the lanyard plug.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>This is an accessory item for the standard custom molded ear plugs. Ther Percussive ear plug comes with it\'s own lanyard in the package.</span><span></span></p>'),(232149,76,0,100582,'<p><span>Designed specifically for the Decibullz Filter line the lanyard is easily attached to your custom molds allowing you to keep the filters around your neck for improved convenience. ITEM DOES NOT INCLUDE FILTER</span></p>'),(234331,76,1,100582,'<p><span>Designed specifically for the Decibullz Filter line the lanyard is easily attached to your custom molds allowing you to keep the filters around your neck for improved convenience. ITEM DOES NOT INCLUDE FILTER</span></p>'),(232150,85,0,100582,'Lanyard, earplug lanyards for sale, Decibullz for sale'),(234332,85,1,100582,'Lanyard, earplug lanyards for sale, Decibullz for sale'),(232202,75,0,100597,'<p>Dynamic speaker with switchable noise filter</p>\r\n<p>6 Watts</p>\r\n<p>8-ohm</p>\r\n<p>Swivel base bracket</p>\r\n<p>5-foot cable with 3.5mm plug</p>\r\n<p>Works with all Midland CB radios</p>\r\n<p>