Sound Tube</li>\r\n<li>Vibration Sensors</li>\r\n<li>Works with ALL Midland GMRS/FRS</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232262,76,0,100608,'<ul>\r\n<li>Front</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232426,76,1,100608,'<ul>\r\n<li>Front</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232263,85,0,100608,'Midland Radio mic, acoustic, mic, microphone, electronics'),(232427,85,1,100608,'Midland Radio mic, acoustic, mic, microphone, electronics'),(232264,75,0,100609,'<ul>\r\n<li>Push-to-Talk Button</li>\r\n<li>1/8” (3.5mm) Audio Jack Port for Earpiece (not included)</li>\r\n<li>Dual Pin Connector</li>\r\n<li>360 ° Rotatable Clip</li>\r\n<li>90-Day Warranty</li>\r\n<li>Works with Midland X-Talker Radios</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232428,75,1,100609,'<ul>\r\n<li>Push-to-Talk Button</li>\r\n<li>1/8” (3.5mm) Audio Jack Port for Earpiece (not included)</li>\r\n<li>Dual Pin Connector</li>\r\n<li>360 ° Rotatable Clip</li>\r\n<li>90-Day Warranty</li>\r\n<li>Works with Midland X-Talker Radios</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232265,76,0,100609,'<p>The Shoulder Speaker Mic attaches to your Midland X-Talker Radio and has a rotating clip for ease of use while on your shoulder. Simply plug into the microphone/headphone port on the side of your radio and it’s ready to use. Communicate by using the simple On/Off switch on the side of the microphone.</p>'),(232429,76,1,100609,'<p>The Shoulder Speaker Mic attaches to your Midland X-Talker Radio and has a rotating clip for ease of use while on your shoulder. Simply plug into the microphone/headphone port on the side of your radio and it’s ready to use. Communicate by using the simple On/Off switch on the side of the microphone.</p>'),(232266,85,0,100609,'Midland Radio Shoulder Speaker Mic, Microphone, electronics, x-talker, mic'),(232430,85,1,100609,'Midland Radio Shoulder Speaker Mic, Microphone, electronics, x-talker, mic'),(232267,75,0,100610,'<ul>\r\n<li>NOAA Weather Information Anytime, Anywhere\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Weather Alerts and info direct from the National Weather Service. AM/FM also available.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Multiple Sustainable Power Sources\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solar Panel - rechargeable internal lithium ion battery from direct sunlight</li>\r\n<li>Hand Crank – Recharge the radio during a power outage or anytime away from a power source. Perfect for a short charge to get a cell phone call made.</li>\r\n<li>Rechargeable 2000 mAh Battery – Replaceable, long life lithium ion battery. Lasts up to 25 hours of radio operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Charges Devices through USB Connection\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Works with most cell phones, tablets and more.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Flashlight with SOS Strobe\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bright CREE® LED; Can be used to signal for help.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232377,75,1,100610,'<ul>\r\n<li>NOAA Weather Information Anytime, Anywhere\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Weather Alerts and info direct from the National Weather Service. AM/FM also available.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Multiple Sustainable Power Sources\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solar Panel - rechargeable internal lithium ion battery from direct sunlight</li>\r\n<li>Hand Crank – Recharge the radio during a power outage or anytime away from a power source. Perfect for a short charge to get a cell phone call made.</li>\r\n<li>Rechargeable 2000 mAh Battery – Replaceable, long life lithium ion battery. Lasts up to 25 hours of radio operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Charges Devices through USB Connection\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Works with most cell phones, tablets and more.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Flashlight with SOS Strobe\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bright CREE® LED; Can be used to signal for help.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232268,76,0,100610,'<p>This compact emergency crank radio with weather alert is perfect for both emergency preparedness and everyday use. Easily stowed anywhere, the ER210 is a convenient companion in any preparedness kit or gear bag. This tool boasts multiple power options, including a solar panel, hand crank, and rechargeable batteries, LED flashlight with SOS strobe lighting, AM/FM radio, and the ability to charge a cell phone via USB charging port. Should severe weather conditions arise in your area, the ER210 can alert you to current warnings from the National Weather Service. Take this handy and compact emergency radio with you when camping or hiking, or keep it in your home or vehicle for constant preparedness.</p>'),(232378,76,1,100610,'<p>This compact emergency crank radio with weather alert is perfect for both emergency preparedness and everyday use. Easily stowed anywhere, the ER210 is a convenient companion in any preparedness kit or gear bag. This tool boasts multiple power options, including a solar panel, hand crank, and rechargeable batteries, LED flashlight with SOS strobe lighting, AM/FM radio, and the ability to charge a cell phone via USB charging port. Should severe weather conditions arise in your area, the ER210 can alert you to current warnings from the National Weather Service. Take this handy and compact emergency radio with you when camping or hiking, or keep it in your home or vehicle for constant preparedness.</p>'),(232269,85,0,100610,'Midland Radio ER210, radio, Emergency radio, electronics, E+Ready'),(232379,85,1,100610,'Midland Radio ER210, radio, Emergency radio, electronics, E+Ready'),(232272,75,0,100611,'<ul>\r\n<li>NOAA Weather Information Anytime, Anywhere\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Weather Alerts and info direct from the National Weather Service. AM/FM also available.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Multiple Power Sources\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solar Panel - rechargeable internal lithium ion battery from direct sunlight</li>\r\n<li>Hand Crank – Recharge the radio during a power outage or anytime away from a power source. Perfect for a short charge to get a cell phone call made.</li>\r\n<li>Rechargeable 2600 mAh Battery – Replaceable, long life lithium ion battery. Lasts up to 32 hours of radio operation.</li>\r\n<li>Can also be powered by 6 standard “AA” batteries (not included)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Charges Devices through USB Connection\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Works with most cell phones, tablets and more.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Flashlight with SOS Strobe\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bright CREE® LED; Can be used to signal for help.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Ultrasonic Dog Whistle\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Can assist canine search and rescue teams in locating individuals during an emergency.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232431,75,1,100611,'<ul>\r\n<li>NOAA Weather Information Anytime, Anywhere\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Weather Alerts and info direct from the National Weather Service. AM/FM also available.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Multiple Power Sources\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solar Panel - rechargeable internal lithium ion battery from direct sunlight</li>\r\n<li>Hand Crank – Recharge the radio during a power outage or anytime away from a power source. Perfect for a short charge to get a cell phone call made.</li>\r\n<li>Rechargeable 2600 mAh Battery – Replaceable, long life lithium ion battery. Lasts up to 32 hours of radio operation.</li>\r\n<li>Can also be powered by 6 standard “AA” batteries (not included)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Charges Devices through USB Connection\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Works with most cell phones, tablets and more.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Flashlight with SOS Strobe\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bright CREE® LED; Can be used to signal for help.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Ultrasonic Dog Whistle\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Can assist canine search and rescue teams in locating individuals during an emergency.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232273,76,0,100611,'<p>A must for emergency preparedness, the ER310 emergency crank radio keeps you informed of severe weather conditions or civil emergency situations providing information directly from the National Weather Service. This versitile tool offers multiple power options, including solar panel, hand crank, and rechargeable batteries, LED flashlight with SOS strobe lighting for power outages or navigating in low-light areas, high frequency dog whistle, and the ability to charge a mobile device via USB charging port. Take this handy and compact emergency radio with you when camping or hiking, or keep it in your home or vehicle for constant preparedness.</p>'),(232432,76,1,100611,'<p>A must for emergency preparedness, the ER310 emergency crank radio keeps you informed of severe weather conditions or civil emergency situations providing information directly from the National Weather Service. This versitile tool offers multiple power options, including solar panel, hand crank, and rechargeable batteries, LED flashlight with SOS strobe lighting for power outages or navigating in low-light areas, high frequency dog whistle, and the ability to charge a mobile device via USB charging port. Take this handy and compact emergency radio with you when camping or hiking, or keep it in your home or vehicle for constant preparedness.</p>'),(232274,85,0,100611,'Midland Radio Emergency Crank Radio, radio, emergency, electronics, National Weather Service'),(232433,85,1,100611,'Midland Radio Emergency Crank Radio, radio, emergency, electronics, National Weather Service'),(232275,75,0,100612,'<ul>\r\n<li>Full 5 Watt Radio</li>\r\n<li>Compatible with Midland FRS/GMRS Walkie Talkies</li>\r\n<li>15 Hi Power Channels</li>\r\n<li>142 Privacy Codes</li>\r\n<li>Xtreme Range* - Up to 40 miles</li>\r\n<li>NOAA Weather Radio</li>\r\n<li>Compact Design</li>\r\n<li>Magnetic Mount Antenna</li>\r\n<li>Channel Scan</li>\r\n<li>Keypad Lock</li>\r\n<li>Monitor Mode</li>\r\n<li>Silent Operation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><b>In the Box</b></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MXT105 MicroMobile® 2-Way Radio</li>\r\n<li>Mount with Hardware</li>\r\n<li>Detachable Antenna with Magnetic Mount</li>\r\n<li>Microphone</li>\r\n<li>Microphone Holder</li>\r\n<li>12V Power Cord with Car Power Adapter</li>\r\n<li>Owner\'s Manual</li>\r\n<li>Quick Start Guide</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232434,75,1,100612,'<ul>\r\n<li>Full 5 Watt Radio</li>\r\n<li>Compatible with Midland FRS/GMRS Walkie Talkies</li>\r\n<li>15 Hi Power Channels</li>\r\n<li>142 Privacy Codes</li>\r\n<li>Xtreme Range* - Up to 40 miles</li>\r\n<li>NOAA Weather Radio</li>\r\n<li>Compact Design</li>\r\n<li>Magnetic Mount Antenna</li>\r\n<li>Channel Scan</li>\r\n<li>Keypad Lock</li>\r\n<li>Monitor Mode</li>\r\n<li>Silent Operation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><b>In the Box</b></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MXT105 MicroMobile® 2-Way Radio</li>\r\n<li>Mount with Hardware</li>\r\n<li>Detachable Antenna with Magnetic Mount</li>\r\n<li>Microphone</li>\r\n<li>Microphone Holder</li>\r\n<li>12V Power Cord with Car Power Adapter</li>\r\n<li>Owner\'s Manual</li>\r\n<li>Quick Start Guide</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232276,76,0,100612,'<p>Communicate confidently with 5-Watts of GMRS power in your vehicle or build out your own GMRS base station with the MXT105 MicroMobile® GMRS Two-Way Radio. This radio boasts double the range of traditional handheld two-way radios. It easily mounts in most vehicles and communicates with all Midland FRS/GMRS walkie talkies. Featuring Xtreme Range* of up to 40 miles and NOAA weather alert channels.  <br /> </p>'),(232435,76,1,100612,'<p>Communicate confidently with 5-Watts of GMRS power in your vehicle or build out your own GMRS base station with the MXT105 MicroMobile® GMRS Two-Way Radio. This radio boasts double the range of traditional handheld two-way radios. It easily mounts in most vehicles and communicates with all Midland FRS/GMRS walkie talkies. Featuring Xtreme Range* of up to 40 miles and NOAA weather alert channels.  </p>'),(232277,85,0,100612,'Midland Radio two way radio, two way radio, radio, electronics, micromobile'),(232436,85,1,100612,'Midland Radio two way radio, two way radio, radio, electronics, micromobile'),(232278,75,0,100613,'<ul>\r\n<li>Full 15 Watt Radio</li>\r\n<li>8 Repeater Channels</li>\r\n<li>Compatible with Midland FRS/GMRS Walkie Talkies</li>\r\n<li>15 Hi Power Channels</li>\r\n<li>Fully Integrated Control Mic</li>\r\n<li>142 Privacy Codes</li>\r\n<li>Xtreme Range* - Up to 50 miles</li>\r\n<li>NOAA Weather Scan + Alert</li>\r\n<li>Magnetic Mount Antenna</li>\r\n<li>Channel Scan</li>\r\n<li>Keypad Lock</li>\r\n<li>Monitor Mode</li>\r\n<li>Silent Operation</li>\r\n<li>USB Jack</li>\r\n<li>Speaker Mic Jack</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><b>In the Box</b></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MXT275 MicroMobile® 2-Way Radio</li>\r\n<li>Fully Integrated Control Microphone and low profile hide away unit</li>\r\n<li>Mount with Hardware</li>\r\n<li>Detachable Antenna with Magnetic Mount</li>\r\n<li>Microphone Holder</li>\r\n<li>12V Power Cord with Car Power Adapter</li>\r\n<li>Owner\'s Manual</li>\r\n<li>Quick Start Guide</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232437,75,1,100613,'<p>Full 15 Watt Radio 8 Repeater Channels Compatible with Midland FRS/GMRS Walkie Talkies 15 Hi Power Channels Fully Integrated Control Mic 142 Privacy Codes Xtreme Range* - Up to 50 miles NOAA Weather Scan + Alert Magnetic Mount Antenna Channel Scan Keypad Lock Monitor Mode Silent Operation USB Jack Speaker Mic Jack In the Box MXT275 MicroMobile® 2-Way Radio Fully Integrated Control Microphone and low profile hide away unit Mount with Hardware Detachable Antenna with Magnetic Mount Microphone Holder 12V Power Cord with Car Power Adapter Owner\'s Manual Quick Start Guide</p>'),(232279,76,0,100613,'<p>The Midland MXT275 MicroMobile® 15 Watt GMRS two-way radio features a Fully Integrated Control Microphone ideal for vehicles with limited dashboard space, allowing the radio base unit to be stashed away. Transmit with authority on 15 GMRS channels and 8 repeater channels. The MXT275 is equipped with NOAA Weather Scan + Alert technology to keep you informed on local weather conditions. Inside the box with control microphone and low profile hide away radio unit is a flip frame detachable mount, magnetic mount antenna, 12 Volt power cord, and user’s manual. As with all of the MicroMobiles, the MXT275 is compatible with all Midland FRS/GMRS hand held walkie talkies.<b> </b><br /> </p>'),(232438,76,1,100613,'<p>The Midland MXT275 MicroMobile® 15 Watt GMRS two-way radio features a Fully Integrated Control Microphone ideal for vehicles with limited dashboard space, allowing the radio base unit to be stashed away. Transmit with authority on 15 GMRS channels and 8 repeater channels. The MXT275 is equipped with NOAA Weather Scan + Alert technology to keep you informed on local weather conditions. Inside the box with control microphone and low profile hide away radio unit is a flip frame detachable mount, magnetic mount antenna, 12 Volt power cord, and user’s manual. As with all of the MicroMobiles, the MXT275 is compatible with all Midland FRS/GMRS hand held walkie talkies.</p>'),(232280,85,0,100613,'Midland Radio two way radio, two way radio, radio, electronics, MicroMobile'),(232439,85,1,100613,'Midland Radio two way radio, two way radio, radio, electronics, MicroMobile'),(232281,75,0,100614,'<p>Maximize your communication range with an all out assault of 40-Watts of GMRS power in your vehicle or build out your own GMRS base station with the MXT400 MicroMobile® GMRS Two-Way Radio. This radio is the most powerful GMRS radio made by Midland. It easily mounts in most vehicles and communicates with all Midland FRS/GMRS walkie talkies. Featuring 15 GMRS channels and 8 high powered repeater channels, backlit display, channel scan. For the best performance, use with an antenna and mount.<br /> </p>'),(232440,75,1,100614,'<p>Maximize your communication range with an all out assault of 40-Watts of GMRS power in your vehicle or build out your own GMRS base station with the MXT400 MicroMobile® GMRS Two-Way Radio. This radio is the most powerful GMRS radio made by Midland. It easily mounts in most vehicles and communicates with all Midland FRS/GMRS walkie talkies. Featuring 15 GMRS channels and 8 high powered repeater channels, backlit display, channel scan. For the best performance, use with an antenna and mount.</p>'),(232282,76,0,100614,'<ul>\r\n<li>Full 40 Watt Radio</li>\r\n<li>8 Repeater Channels</li>\r\n<li>Compatible with Midland FRS/GMRS Walkie Talkies</li>\r\n<li>15 Hi Power Channels</li>\r\n<li>142 Privacy Codes</li>\r\n<li>Xtreme Range* - Up to 65 miles</li>\r\n<li>Channel Scan</li>\r\n<li>Keypad Lock</li>\r\n<li>Monitor Mode</li>\r\n<li>Keystroke Tones</li>\r\n<li>Digital Volume</li>\r\n<li>Silent Operation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><b>In the Box</b></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MXT400 MicroMobile® 2-Way Radio</li>\r\n<li>Mount with Hardware</li>\r\n<li>Microphone</li>\r\n<li>12V Power Cord with Car Power Adapter</li>\r\n<li>Owner\'s Manual</li>\r\n<li>Quick Start Guide</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232441,76,1,100614,'<ul>\r\n<li>Full 40 Watt Radio</li>\r\n<li>8 Repeater Channels</li>\r\n<li>Compatible with Midland FRS/GMRS Walkie Talkies</li>\r\n<li>15 Hi Power Channels</li>\r\n<li>142 Privacy Codes</li>\r\n<li>Xtreme Range* - Up to 65 miles</li>\r\n<li>Channel Scan</li>\r\n<li>Keypad Lock</li>\r\n<li>Monitor Mode</li>\r\n<li>Keystroke Tones</li>\r\n<li>Digital Volume</li>\r\n<li>Silent Operation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><b>In the Box</b></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MXT400 MicroMobile® 2-Way Radio</li>\r\n<li>Mount with Hardware</li>\r\n<li>Microphone</li>\r\n<li>12V Power Cord with Car Power Adapter</li>\r\n<li>Owner\'s Manual</li>\r\n<li>Quick Start Guide</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232283,85,0,100614,'Midland Radio, two way radio, electronics, communication, MicroMobile'),(232442,85,1,100614,'Midland Radio, two way radio, electronics, communication, MicroMobile'),(232284,75,0,100615,'<ul>\r\n<li>Magnetic Mount for use with Micromobile antennas</li>\r\n<li>Includes rubber boot</li>\r\n<li>Cable length: 12 ft</li>\r\n<li>Cable type: RG-58A/U</li>\r\n<li>Specific Frequency: 0 – 1000MHz</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232443,75,1,100615,'<ul>\r\n<li>Magnetic Mount for use with Micromobile antennas</li>\r\n<li>Includes rubber boot</li>\r\n<li>Cable length: 12 ft</li>\r\n<li>Cable type: RG-58A/U</li>\r\n<li>Specific Frequency: 0 – 1000MHz</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232285,76,0,100615,'<p>The Magnetic Antenna Mount is a mobile antenna mount with NMO connector that can be easily removed. No drilling into the vehicle is required for installation making the location of the magnetic mount easy to adjust. *Antenna not included.</p>'),(232444,76,1,100615,'<p>The Magnetic Antenna Mount is a mobile antenna mount with NMO connector that can be easily removed. No drilling into the vehicle is required for installation making the location of the magnetic mount easy to adjust. *Antenna not included.</p>'),(232286,85,0,100615,'Midland Radio Antenna Mag Mount, antenna accessory, electronics, MicroMobile, mount'),(232445,85,1,100615,'Midland Radio Antenna Mag Mount, antenna accessory, electronics, MicroMobile, mount'),(232287,75,0,100616,'<ul>\r\n<li>Fits up to 2” diameter roll bar or mirror</li>\r\n<li>Works with ¾ inch NMO connector for antenna</li>\r\n<li>Color – black</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><b>In the Box</b></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bracket</li>\r\n<li>4) mounting bolts, 4) nut, 4) washers</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232446,75,1,100616,'<ul>\r\n<li>Fits up to 2” diameter roll bar or mirror</li>\r\n<li>Works with ¾ inch NMO connector for antenna</li>\r\n<li>Color – black</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><b>In the Box</b></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bracket</li>\r\n<li>4) mounting bolts, 4) nut, 4) washers</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232288,76,0,100616,'<p>The MXTA23 Roll Bar/ Mirror Mounting bracket makes antenna installation easy. This heavy duty mount is designed to clamp on any roll bar, cargo rack, tractor mirror or semi mirror, providing for a sturdy location for your upgraded MicroMobile antenna. This mount accepts bars up to 2” in diameter, comes complete with mounting harware, and accepts ¾ inch NMO connectors. <i>(NMO Connector Not Included)</i></p>'),(232447,76,1,100616,'<p>The MXTA23 Roll Bar/ Mirror Mounting bracket makes antenna installation easy. This heavy duty mount is designed to clamp on any roll bar, cargo rack, tractor mirror or semi mirror, providing for a sturdy location for your upgraded MicroMobile antenna. This mount accepts bars up to 2” in diameter, comes complete with mounting harware, and accepts ¾ inch NMO connectors. <i>(NMO Connector Not Included)</i></p>'),(232289,85,0,100616,'Midland Radio Mount, mount, bracket for antenna, roll bar/mirror mounting bracket, bracket'),(232448,85,1,100616,'Midland Radio Mount, mount, bracket for antenna, roll bar/mirror mounting bracket, bracket'),(232290,75,0,100617,'<ul>\r\n<li>UHF to NMO adapter included</li>\r\n<li>FME to UHF adapter included</li>\r\n<li>Large diameter cable – RG58U</li>\r\n<li>6-meter length</li>\r\n<li>Color – black</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232449,75,1,100617,'<ul>\r\n<li>UHF to NMO adapter included</li>\r\n<li>FME to UHF adapter included</li>\r\n<li>Large diameter cable – RG58U</li>\r\n<li>6-meter length</li>\r\n<li>Color – black</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232291,76,0,100617,'<p>The MXTA24 6-Meter Antenna Cable is perfect for connecting your MicroMobile two-way radio to your antenna. This heavy-duty cable features quality shielding and a low profile NMO connector for low-clearance installations. The cable is also equipped with a removable UHF connection that unscrews making wire routing and installation through gromets and firewalls easier.  Works with all Midland MicroMobile antennas and mounts.<br /> </p>'),(232450,76,1,100617,'<p>The MXTA24 6-Meter Antenna Cable is perfect for connecting your MicroMobile two-way radio to your antenna. This heavy-duty cable features quality shielding and a low profile NMO connector for low-clearance installations. The cable is also equipped with a removable UHF connection that unscrews making wire routing and installation through gromets and firewalls easier.  Works with all Midland MicroMobile antennas and mounts.</p>'),(232292,85,0,100617,'Midland 6 meter low profile antenna cable, cable, antenna accessory, low profile, electronic '),(232451,85,1,100617,'Midland 6 meter low profile antenna cable, cable, antenna accessory, low profile, electronic '),(232293,75,0,100618,'<ul>\r\n<li>3.5” overall height</li>\r\n<li>1.5” base diameter</li>\r\n<li>Gain - 3dB</li>\r\n<li>Color – black</li>\r\n<li>Mobile Antenna Mounting Type – NMO</li>\r\n<li>Frequency – 462 MHz</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232452,75,1,100618,'<ul>\r\n<li>3.5” overall height</li>\r\n<li>1.5” base diameter</li>\r\n<li>Gain - 3dB</li>\r\n<li>Color – black</li>\r\n<li>Mobile Antenna Mounting Type – NMO</li>\r\n<li>Frequency – 462 MHz</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232294,76,0,100618,'<p>The compact design of the MXTA25 3dB Gain Antenna ensures a solid connection to your vehicle and reliable, clear communication while you’re on the road.  At only 3.5” tall, the low-profile antenna blends in so well to your vehicle you won’t even know it’s there, all the while withstanding anything the environment can throw at it.</p>'),(232453,76,1,100618,'<p>The compact design of the MXTA25 3dB Gain Antenna ensures a solid connection to your vehicle and reliable, clear communication while you’re on the road.  At only 3.5” tall, the low-profile antenna blends in so well to your vehicle you won’t even know it’s there, all the while withstanding anything the environment can throw at it.</p>'),(232295,85,0,100618,'Midland radio Ghost Antenna, antenna, accessory, ghost antenna, electronics'),(232454,85,1,100618,'Midland radio Ghost Antenna, antenna, accessory, ghost antenna, electronics'),(232296,75,0,100619,'<ul>\r\n<li>Spring base for maximum flexibility</li>\r\n<li>Coil center for maximum durability</li>\r\n<li>32” overall height</li>\r\n<li>1.5” base diameter</li>\r\n<li>Gain - 6dB</li>\r\n<li>Color – black</li>\r\n<li>Mobile Antenna Mounting Type – NMO</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Frequency – 462 MHz</p>'),(232455,75,1,100619,'<ul>\r\n<li>Spring base for maximum flexibility</li>\r\n<li>Coil center for maximum durability</li>\r\n<li>32” overall height</li>\r\n<li>1.5” base diameter</li>\r\n<li>Gain - 6dB</li>\r\n<li>Color – black</li>\r\n<li>Mobile Antenna Mounting Type – NMO</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Frequency – 462 MHz</p>'),(232297,76,0,100619,'<p>When maximum range is your goal, the MXTA26 6dB gain antenna is a perfect choice. Great for off-roaders, overlanders, farmers and more, this long-range antenna is designed with a spring at the base and a coil at the center. The spring allows for extra flexibility to prevent damage from light, incidental contact when you’re traveling off the beaten path.</p>'),(232456,76,1,100619,'<p>When maximum range is your goal, the MXTA26 6dB gain antenna is a perfect choice. Great for off-roaders, overlanders, farmers and more, this long-range antenna is designed with a spring at the base and a coil at the center. The spring allows for extra flexibility to prevent damage from light, incidental contact when you’re traveling off the beaten path.</p>'),(232298,85,0,100619,'Midland Radio Gain Antenna, antenna, accessory, 6dB, electronics'),(232457,85,1,100619,'Midland Radio Gain Antenna, antenna, accessory, 6dB, electronics'),(232299,75,0,100620,'<ul>\r\n<li>Universal mount fits most trunks or car hoods</li>\r\n<li>6 meter cable attached to mount</li>\r\n<li>UHF to NMO adapter included</li>\r\n<li>FME to UHF adapter included</li>\r\n<li>Large diameter cable – RG58U</li>\r\n<li>6-meter length</li>\r\n<li>Color – black</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232458,75,1,100620,'<ul>\r\n<li>Universal mount fits most trunks or car hoods</li>\r\n<li>6 meter cable attached to mount</li>\r\n<li>UHF to NMO adapter included</li>\r\n<li>FME to UHF adapter included</li>\r\n<li>Large diameter cable – RG58U</li>\r\n<li>6-meter length</li>\r\n<li>Color – black</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232300,76,0,100620,'<p>Easily connect your antenna and MicroMobile with the MXTA27 Universal Lip Mount. The NMO mount attaches to almost any trunk or hood without drilling. The 6-meter cable features a UHF connection that unscrews for easy install in your vehicle. This simple device is perfect for anyone who doesn’t want to drill holes in their vehicle but needs a solid mount to provide reliable communication while on the road or off-road</p>'),(232459,76,1,100620,'<p>Easily connect your antenna and MicroMobile with the MXTA27 Universal Lip Mount. The NMO mount attaches to almost any trunk or hood without drilling. The 6-meter cable features a UHF connection that unscrews for easy install in your vehicle. This simple device is perfect for anyone who doesn’t want to drill holes in their vehicle but needs a solid mount to provide reliable communication while on the road or off-road</p>'),(232301,85,0,100620,'Midland Universal Lip Mount, lip mount, accessories, cables, electronics'),(232460,85,1,100620,'Midland Universal Lip Mount, lip mount, accessories, cables, electronics'),(232302,75,0,100621,'<ul>\r\n<li>22 Channels</li>\r\n<li>38 Privacy Codes</li>\r\n<li>License Free</li>\r\n<li>Clear, crisp communication with easy button access</li>\r\n<li>Xtreme Range* - Up to 20 miles</li>\r\n<li>Water Resistant</li>\r\n<li>Weather Alert Radio</li>\r\n<li>eVOX – Hands-Free Operation</li>\r\n<li>Channel Scan</li>\r\n<li>Silent Operation</li>\r\n<li>Power Options – 3 “AAA” Batteries each (not included)</li>\r\n<li>3-Year Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232461,75,1,100621,'<ul>\r\n<li>22 Channels</li>\r\n<li>38 Privacy Codes</li>\r\n<li>License Free</li>\r\n<li>Clear, crisp communication with easy button access</li>\r\n<li>Xtreme Range* - Up to 20 miles</li>\r\n<li>Water Resistant</li>\r\n<li>Weather Alert Radio</li>\r\n<li>eVOX – Hands-Free Operation</li>\r\n<li>Channel Scan</li>\r\n<li>Silent Operation</li>\r\n<li>Power Options – 3 “AAA” Batteries each (not included)</li>\r\n<li>3-Year Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232303,76,0,100621,'<p>A low cost yet reliable solution that provides clear reception, clear transmission, and clear sound quality. The X-Talker T10 walkie talkie offers you the ability to communicate with up to a 20-mile range and features 22 Channels, Channel Scan, and our legendary Weather Alert technology - NOAA Weather Alert will sound an alarm indicating that there is a risk of severe weather in your area. Each radio is powered by three “AAA” batteries (not included).  </p>'),(232462,76,1,100621,'<p>A low cost yet reliable solution that provides clear reception, clear transmission, and clear sound quality. The X-Talker T10 walkie talkie offers you the ability to communicate with up to a 20-mile range and features 22 Channels, Channel Scan, and our legendary Weather Alert technology - NOAA Weather Alert will sound an alarm indicating that there is a risk of severe weather in your area. Each radio is powered by three “AAA” batteries (not included).  </p>'),(232304,85,0,100621,'Midland Radio Walkie Talkie, walkie talkie, two way radio, communication, electronics'),(232463,85,1,100621,'Midland Radio Walkie Talkie, walkie talkie, two way radio, communication, electronics'),(232305,75,0,100622,'<ul>\r\n<li>22 Channels</li>\r\n<li>38 Privacy Codes</li>\r\n<li>License Free</li>\r\n<li>Water Resistant</li>\r\n<li>Clear, crisp communication with easy button access</li>\r\n<li>Xtreme Range* - Up to 28 miles</li>\r\n<li>Weather Alert Radio</li>\r\n<li>Silent Operation</li>\r\n<li>eVOX – Hands-Free Operation (3 levels)</li>\r\n<li>Power Options – Rechargeable battery packs included or 3 “AAA” batteries each (not included)</li>\r\n<li>Charging Options – Desktop charger or Micro USB</li>\r\n<li>Headphone Jack</li>\r\n<li>3-Year Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232464,75,1,100622,'<ul>\r\n<li>22 Channels</li>\r\n<li>38 Privacy Codes</li>\r\n<li>License Free</li>\r\n<li>Water Resistant</li>\r\n<li>Clear, crisp communication with easy button access</li>\r\n<li>Xtreme Range* - Up to 28 miles</li>\r\n<li>Weather Alert Radio</li>\r\n<li>Silent Operation</li>\r\n<li>eVOX – Hands-Free Operation (3 levels)</li>\r\n<li>Power Options – Rechargeable battery packs included or 3 “AAA” batteries each (not included)</li>\r\n<li>Charging Options – Desktop charger or Micro USB</li>\r\n<li>Headphone Jack</li>\r\n<li>3-Year Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232306,76,0,100622,'<p>Featuring a Mossy Oak® Break Up Country Camo pattern faceplate, the X-Talker T55VP3 two-way radio offers you the ability to communicate license free with up to a 28 mile range and features 22 Channels, 38 Privacy Codes, Channel Scan, and our legendary Weather Alert technology - NOAA Weather Alert will sound an alarm indicating that there is a risk of severe weather in your area. With clear reception, clear transmission, and clear sound quality you will have confidence that your communication needs will be supported</p>'),(232465,76,1,100622,'<p>Featuring a Mossy Oak® Break Up Country Camo pattern faceplate, the X-Talker T55VP3 two-way radio offers you the ability to communicate license free with up to a 28 mile range and features 22 Channels, 38 Privacy Codes, Channel Scan, and our legendary Weather Alert technology - NOAA Weather Alert will sound an alarm indicating that there is a risk of severe weather in your area. With clear reception, clear transmission, and clear sound quality you will have confidence that your communication needs will be supported</p>'),(232307,85,0,100622,'Midland Radio Two Way Radio, two-way radio, walkie talkie, communication, electronics'),(232466,85,1,100622,'Midland Radio Two Way Radio, two-way radio, walkie talkie, communication, electronics'),(232308,75,0,100623,'<ul>\r\n<li>22 Channels (14 extra privacy code channels)</li>\r\n<li>121 Privacy Codes</li>\r\n<li>License Free</li>\r\n<li>Water Resistant</li>\r\n<li>Clear, crisp communication with easy button access</li>\r\n<li>Xtreme Range* - Up to 38 miles</li>\r\n<li>Weather Alert Radio w/ Weather Scan</li>\r\n<li>Vibrate Alert</li>\r\n<li>eVOX – Hands-Free Operation (9 levels)</li>\r\n<li>Power Options – Rechargeable battery packs included or 3 “AA” batteries each (not included)</li>\r\n<li>Headphone Jack</li>\r\n<li>5 Animal Call Alerts</li>\r\n<li>3-Year Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232467,75,1,100623,'<ul>\r\n<li>22 Channels (14 extra privacy code channels)</li>\r\n<li>121 Privacy Codes</li>\r\n<li>License Free</li>\r\n<li>Water Resistant</li>\r\n<li>Clear, crisp communication with easy button access</li>\r\n<li>Xtreme Range* - Up to 38 miles</li>\r\n<li>Weather Alert Radio w/ Weather Scan</li>\r\n<li>Vibrate Alert</li>\r\n<li>eVOX – Hands-Free Operation (9 levels)</li>\r\n<li>Power Options – Rechargeable battery packs included or 3 “AA” batteries each (not included)</li>\r\n<li>Headphone Jack</li>\r\n<li>5 Animal Call Alerts</li>\r\n<li>3-Year Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232309,76,0,100623,'<p>Gear up for your wilderness adventure with the X-Talker T75VP3 FRS Two-way radio.  Designed with the hunter in mind, this radio features the Mossy Oak® Break Up Country Camo pattern.  A durable design that has a range of up to 38 miles and features 22 FRS/GMRS channels with an additional 14 channels with pre-programmed privacy codes.  The T75VP3 is fully loaded with features to keep you and your group safe as well as supporting your communications needs while out on the big hunt.  Featuring Midland’s signature Weather Scan + Alert Technology - NOAA Weather Scan will automatically scan through 10 available weather (WX) band channels and will lock onto the strongest weather channel to alert you of severe weather updates.  NOAA Weather Alert will sound an alarm indicating that there is a risk of severe weather in your area, animal call alerts, hands free communication, 121 Privacy codes, and silent operation.</p>'),(232468,76,1,100623,'<p>Gear up for your wilderness adventure with the X-Talker T75VP3 FRS Two-way radio.  Designed with the hunter in mind, this radio features the Mossy Oak® Break Up Country Camo pattern.  A durable design that has a range of up to 38 miles and features 22 FRS/GMRS channels with an additional 14 channels with pre-programmed privacy codes.  The T75VP3 is fully loaded with features to keep you and your group safe as well as supporting your communications needs while out on the big hunt.  Featuring Midland’s signature Weather Scan + Alert Technology - NOAA Weather Scan will automatically scan through 10 available weather (WX) band channels and will lock onto the strongest weather channel to alert you of severe weather updates.  NOAA Weather Alert will sound an alarm indicating that there is a risk of severe weather in your area, animal call alerts, hands free communication, 121 Privacy codes, and silent operation.</p>'),(232310,85,0,100623,'Midland Walkie Talkie, walkie talkie, radio, electronics, talker'),(232469,85,1,100623,'Midland Walkie Talkie, walkie talkie, radio, electronics, talker'),(232311,75,0,100624,'<ul>\r\n<li>22 Channels (14 extra privacy code channels)</li>\r\n<li>121 Privacy Codes</li>\r\n<li>Xtreme Range* - Up to 40 miles</li>\r\n<li>NOAA Weather Alert Radio w/ Weather Scan</li>\r\n<li>5 Call Tones</li>\r\n<li>Silent Operation</li>\r\n<li>Channel Scan</li>\r\n<li>eVOX – Hands-Free Operation (9 levels)</li>\r\n<li>High/Medium/Low Power</li>\r\n<li>Rechargeable battery pack</li>\r\n<li>Battery Meter</li>\r\n<li>3-Year Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232470,75,1,100624,'<ul>\r\n<li>22 Channels (14 extra privacy code channels)</li>\r\n<li>121 Privacy Codes</li>\r\n<li>Xtreme Range* - Up to 40 miles</li>\r\n<li>NOAA Weather Alert Radio w/ Weather Scan</li>\r\n<li>5 Call Tones</li>\r\n<li>Silent Operation</li>\r\n<li>Channel Scan</li>\r\n<li>eVOX – Hands-Free Operation (9 levels)</li>\r\n<li>High/Medium/Low Power</li>\r\n<li>Rechargeable battery pack</li>\r\n<li>Battery Meter</li>\r\n<li>3-Year Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232312,76,0,100624,'<p>The X-Talker T290 two-way radio is the perfect solution for reliable communication on your next adventure. Whether you are hiking, camping, rock climbing, skiing or enjoying any other activity where communication is vital, rest assured these powerful GMRS radios will provide you excellent range and clarity. The sleek yet durable design fits perfect in the palm of your hand and the multiple power levels will ensure that the radio’s battery lasts all day. The T290 features Midland’s signature Weather Scan + Alert Technology, which automatically scans through 10 available weather (WX) band channels and locks onto the strongest weather channel, alerting you of severe weather in the area. Communicate with confidence with the X-Talker T290 GMRS two-way radios.</p>'),(232471,76,1,100624,'<p>The X-Talker T290 two-way radio is the perfect solution for reliable communication on your next adventure. Whether you are hiking, camping, rock climbing, skiing or enjoying any other activity where communication is vital, rest assured these powerful GMRS radios will provide you excellent range and clarity. The sleek yet durable design fits perfect in the palm of your hand and the multiple power levels will ensure that the radio’s battery lasts all day. The T290 features Midland’s signature Weather Scan + Alert Technology, which automatically scans through 10 available weather (WX) band channels and locks onto the strongest weather channel, alerting you of severe weather in the area. Communicate with confidence with the X-Talker T290 GMRS two-way radios.</p>'),(232313,85,0,100624,'Midland Walkie Talkie, two way radio, walkie talkie, radio, electronics '),(232472,85,1,100624,'Midland Walkie Talkie, two way radio, walkie talkie, radio, electronics '),(232314,75,0,100625,'<ul>\r\n<li>22 Channels (14 extra privacy code channels)</li>\r\n<li>121 Privacy Codes</li>\r\n<li>Xtreme Range* - Up to 40 miles</li>\r\n<li>NOAA Weather Alert Radio w/ Weather Scan</li>\r\n<li>5 Call Tones</li>\r\n<li>Silent Operation</li>\r\n<li>Channel Scan</li>\r\n<li>eVOX – Hands-Free Operation (9 levels)</li>\r\n<li>Mossy Oak® Breakup Country Camouflage</li>\r\n<li>High/Medium/Low Power</li>\r\n<li>Rechargeable battery pack</li>\r\n<li>Battery Meter</li>\r\n<li>3-Year Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232473,75,1,100625,'<ul>\r\n<li>22 Channels (14 extra privacy code channels)</li>\r\n<li>121 Privacy Codes</li>\r\n<li>Xtreme Range* - Up to 40 miles</li>\r\n<li>NOAA Weather Alert Radio w/ Weather Scan</li>\r\n<li>5 Call Tones</li>\r\n<li>Silent Operation</li>\r\n<li>Channel Scan</li>\r\n<li>eVOX – Hands-Free Operation (9 levels)</li>\r\n<li>Mossy Oak® Breakup Country Camouflage</li>\r\n<li>High/Medium/Low Power</li>\r\n<li>Rechargeable battery pack</li>\r\n<li>Battery Meter</li>\r\n<li>3-Year Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232315,76,0,100625,'<p>Stay concealed on your next expedition with the X-Talker T295 two-way radio cloaked in Mossy Oak® Breakup Country camouflage. Maintain contact with your group while hunting, scouting, checking feeders or enjoying any other activities where safety and communication are essential. The powerful T295 GMRS two-way radio is durably constructed, provides excellent range and is equipped with a backlit display making adjustments easy in low light conditions. Featuring Midland’s signature Weather Scan + Alert Technology, which automatically scans through 10 available weather (WX) band channels and locks onto the strongest weather channel, alerting you of severe weather in the area. Communicate with confidence while staying hidden with the X-Talker T295 GMRS two-way radios.<br /> </p>'),(232474,76,1,100625,'<p>Stay concealed on your next expedition with the X-Talker T295 two-way radio cloaked in Mossy Oak® Breakup Country camouflage. Maintain contact with your group while hunting, scouting, checking feeders or enjoying any other activities where safety and communication are essential. The powerful T295 GMRS two-way radio is durably constructed, provides excellent range and is equipped with a backlit display making adjustments easy in low light conditions. Featuring Midland’s signature Weather Scan + Alert Technology, which automatically scans through 10 available weather (WX) band channels and locks onto the strongest weather channel, alerting you of severe weather in the area. Communicate with confidence while staying hidden with the X-Talker T295 GMRS two-way radios.</p>'),(232316,85,0,100625,'Midland Walkie Talkie, walkie talkie, two way radio, radio, electronics, '),(232475,85,1,100625,'Midland Walkie Talkie, walkie talkie, two way radio, radio, electronics, '),(232317,75,0,100626,'<ul>\r\n<li>Tactical Action Boom Mic with PTT</li>\r\n<li>Compatible with all GXT &amp; LXT models</li>\r\n<li>MIL-SPEC Grade cord, PTT and headset connector</li>\r\n<li>Great for hunting!</li>\r\n<li>Large Tactical PTT makes transmitting simple when wearing bulky gloves</li>\r\n<li>Sensitive boom mic makes stealth communications easy</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232476,75,1,100626,'<ul>\r\n<li>Tactical Action Boom Mic with PTT</li>\r\n<li>Compatible with all GXT &amp; LXT models</li>\r\n<li>MIL-SPEC Grade cord, PTT and headset connector</li>\r\n<li>Great for hunting!</li>\r\n<li>Large Tactical PTT makes transmitting simple when wearing bulky gloves</li>\r\n<li>Sensitive boom mic makes stealth communications easy</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232318,76,0,100626,'<p>Sensitive boom mic makes stealth communications easy.</p>'),(232477,76,1,100626,'<p>Sensitive boom mic makes stealth communications easy.</p>'),(232319,85,0,100626,'Midland Tactical Action Boom Mic, mic, microphone, electronics, accessories '),(232478,85,1,100626,'Midland Tactical Action Boom Mic, mic, microphone, electronics, accessories '),(232502,75,0,100633,'<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">The Mantis X2 is the most powerful training aid for dry fire only practice.</p>\r\n<p>There is nothing at this price point that will give you this level of feedback for dry fire.</p>\r\n<p>The X2 mounts to any firearm accessory rail.</p>\r\n<p>No picatinny rail, no problem, we have adapters.</p>\r\n<p>Collecting thousands of data points per second, the X2 analyzes your shooting in real-time. For both pistols and rifles, the X2 works with dry fire on your actual firearm.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><strong>Ships with:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Mantis X2 sensor</p>\r\n<p>USB charging cable</p>\r\n<p>Mantis X2 Case + Foam Insert</p>\r\n<p>Quick Start insert</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Dimensions: 1.3\" x 1\" x 0.75\" LxWxH</p>'),(232503,75,1,100633,'<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">The Mantis X2 is the most powerful training aid for dry fire only practice.</p>\r\n<p>There is nothing at this price point that will give you this level of feedback for dry fire.</p>\r\n<p>The X2 mounts to any firearm accessory rail.</p>\r\n<p>No picatinny rail, no problem, we have adapters.</p>\r\n<p>Collecting thousands of data points per second, the X2 analyzes your shooting in real-time. For both pistols and rifles, the X2 works with dry fire on your actual firearm.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><strong>Ships with:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Mantis X2 sensor</p>\r\n<p>USB charging cable</p>\r\n<p>Mantis X2 Case + Foam Insert</p>\r\n<p>Quick Start insert</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Dimensions: 1.3\" x 1\" x 0.75\" LxWxH</p>'),(232504,76,1,100633,NULL),(232505,85,1,100633,NULL),(232506,75,0,100634,'<p>Covid19...2020...Civil unrest. All reasons to be prepared. Everest has the utlimate survival package for you in one spot. Brought to you by 12 Survivors, this Family Survival Package has all the gear you need.</p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<h5 dir=\"ltr\"><span>Headlamps -  </span><span>Ignite-110 </span></h5>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Whether you’re heading off the grid for a weekend adventure or in survival mode searching for a way out, the 12 Survivors Ignite 110 Headlamp lights the way.Built to last with rugged, dependable IP54 waterproof ABS plastic construction and robust operation buttons, the 12 Survivors Ignite 110 Headlamp is GO READY for any situation, in nearly any environment. The Ignite 110 headlamp boasts an ultra-bright 3-watt 110 lumen LED capable of a maximum beam throw 105 meters, a glow-in-the-dark 3-stage push-on/mode/off switch and 6 operating modes: Motion sensor, 110 lumen (high), 75 lumens (mid), 50 lumens (low), S.O.S. and red light. The red LED is perfect for movement without spooking wildlife or compromising night vision.</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The 12 Survivors Ignite 110 Headlamp is powered by (3) AAA batteries and delivers runtimes of 5 hrs. at 110 lumens, 7.5 hrs. at 75 lumens and 10 hrs. at 50 lumens for long lasting torch and signaling reliability.Lightweight and compact, with a body size of just 2.5” x 2.2” x 1.5”, the 12 Survivors Ignite 110 Headlamp, complete with a comfortable, adjustable, one-size-fits-all head strap, is the perfect hands-free flashlight for prepping, camping, hunting, hiking and even late-night outdoor work.</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Length - 3 in</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Weight - 2.5 in</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Height - 2.5 in</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Weight - 3.2 oz</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Bulb Type - 3W White LED, Red LED</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Max Beam Distance - 105 meters</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Modes - Motion Sensor, 110 Lumens, 75 Lumens, 50 Lumens, S.O.S, Red Light</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Battery life, hours - 110 Lumen-5, 75 Lumen-7.5, 50 Lumen-10</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Battery Type - AAA (X3)</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Material - ABS Plastic</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Waterproof Rating - IP54</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Dimensions, mm - 63x56x37 (2.5x2.2x1.5 inches)</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Weight, (w/ battery) ,oz. - 2.9 oz</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<h5 dir=\"ltr\"><span>Terra-pod Sleeping Bag-Regular</span></h5>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>This 12 Survivors Terra-pod Sleeping bag is primed for all weather over 20 degrees Fahrenheit. Its polyester filled, mummy hybrid shaped construction provides protection from the outside-in while only weighing 4 lbs. With comfort and versatility in mind, the Terra-pod features an interior chest pocket for holding important items such as keys and cell phones, while its full foot box gives you the ability to increase airflow on those hot muggy nights. When cooler weather strikes, keep warm with its added draft collar and hood drawstring. Ideal for long treks and family camping trips, this Terra-pod Sleeping Bag is able to fit individuals up to 6 ft. tall and offers hang loops for easy storage. Fits individuals up to 6/ft tall, has an interior chest pocket, full foot box with double zipper and draft collar. </span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Shape - Mummy Hybrid</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Fits Up To - 6 Feet</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Shell Material - 380T Nylon Ripstop</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Lining Material - 210T Polyester Pongee</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Zipper Location - Left</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Filling - Polyester Wadding</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Operating temperature, F/C - 20/-7</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Bag Dimensions (Rolled up) - 15x10 in.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Dimensions - 80x34 inches</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Weight - 3lb 4.7oz</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<h5 dir=\"ltr\"></h5>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<h5><span>Tools - </span><span>Sharp &amp; Spark</span></h5>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A unique tool for any outdoor adventure or survival situation, this compact, two-in-one device provides the components needed to sharpen your blade and start a fire. The 12 Survivors™ Sharp &amp; Spark is equipped with four sharpening methods to quickly sharpen a dull blade:</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>1. Coarse triangular bit sharpener to repair and re-profile a damaged/dented blade</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>2. Fine triangular bit sharpener to smoothen and shape the blade</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>3. Diamond serration file that sharpens serrated blades</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>4. Diamond-coated sharpener that provides both a coarse and fine sharpening method when moving the blade manually back and forth</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Its leather strop (part of sharpening process) removes small blade particles left over from sharpening, honing the blade, while the magnesium fire starter creates a shower of hot sparks to start a fire. Small enough to carry in your pack, pocket, or around the neck (designed with a lanyard hole), the Sharp &amp; Spark is an integral item for every survivor to have on hand.</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<h5 dir=\"ltr\"><span>Pocket Water Purifier</span></h5>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Go Ready with the 12 Survivors Pocket Water Purifier. Whether you’re on a morning hike, spending a week in the mountains, or clawing your way out of a survival situation, this compact, 1.2” x 6.5”, 2.1 oz. water filtration straw provides 0.4 liters per minute of thirst-quenching potable water you can depend on. Constructed of BPS-free ABS plastic and Tested by TUV SUD, this lightweight, portable water filtering straw reduces bacteria by 99.9999%. With filtration down to just .03 microns for up to 1500 liters, this life-saving straw prevents major illnesses such as Salmonella, Giardia, Cholera, Diarrhea, and more. This pocket sized purifier threads easily onto a standard soda or water bottle and keeps you from putting your hands or face in potentially dangerous water for a drink. No matter where your outdoor adventures take you, Go Ready with 12 Survivor Pocket Water Purifier. Includes a pre-filter and cotton replacements.</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Dimensions - 1.2 in diameter</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Dimensions - 6.5 in height</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Filter Capacity - 396 gallons</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Filter Capacity - 1500 liters</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Filter Elements - Antibacterial Granular Activated Carbon and Hollow Fiber UF Membrane</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Material - ABS and BPA free food grade plastic</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Output Flow Rate - .4 liters per minute</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Weight - 2.1 oz</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232524,75,1,100634,'<p>Covid19...2020...Civil unrest. All reasons to be prepared. Everest has the utlimate survival package for you in one spot. Brought to you by 12 Survivors, this Personal Survival Package has all the gear you need.</p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<h5 dir=\"ltr\"><span>Headlamps -  </span><span>Ignite-110 </span></h5>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Whether you’re heading off the grid for a weekend adventure or in survival mode searching for a way out, the 12 Survivors Ignite 110 Headlamp lights the way.Built to last with rugged, dependable IP54 waterproof ABS plastic construction and robust operation buttons, the 12 Survivors Ignite 110 Headlamp is GO READY for any situation, in nearly any environment. The Ignite 110 headlamp boasts an ultra-bright 3-watt 110 lumen LED capable of a maximum beam throw 105 meters, a glow-in-the-dark 3-stage push-on/mode/off switch and 6 operating modes: Motion sensor, 110 lumen (high), 75 lumens (mid), 50 lumens (low), S.O.S. and red light. The red LED is perfect for movement without spooking wildlife or compromising night vision.</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The 12 Survivors Ignite 110 Headlamp is powered by (3) AAA batteries and delivers runtimes of 5 hrs. at 110 lumens, 7.5 hrs. at 75 lumens and 10 hrs. at 50 lumens for long lasting torch and signaling reliability.Lightweight and compact, with a body size of just 2.5” x 2.2” x 1.5”, the 12 Survivors Ignite 110 Headlamp, complete with a comfortable, adjustable, one-size-fits-all head strap, is the perfect hands-free flashlight for prepping, camping, hunting, hiking and even late-night outdoor work.</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Length - 3 in</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Weight - 2.5 in</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Height - 2.5 in</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Weight - 3.2 oz</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Bulb Type - 3W White LED, Red LED</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Max Beam Distance - 105 meters</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Modes - Motion Sensor, 110 Lumens, 75 Lumens, 50 Lumens, S.O.S, Red Light</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Battery life, hours - 110 Lumen-5, 75 Lumen-7.5, 50 Lumen-10</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Battery Type - AAA (X3)</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Material - ABS Plastic</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Waterproof Rating - IP54</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Dimensions, mm - 63x56x37 (2.5x2.2x1.5 inches)</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Weight, (w/ battery) ,oz. - 2.9 oz</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<h5 dir=\"ltr\"><span>Terra-pod Sleeping Bag-Regular</span></h5>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>This 12 Survivors Terra-pod Sleeping bag is primed for all weather over 20 degrees Fahrenheit. Its polyester filled, mummy hybrid shaped construction provides protection from the outside-in while only weighing 4 lbs. With comfort and versatility in mind, the Terra-pod features an interior chest pocket for holding important items such as keys and cell phones, while its full foot box gives you the ability to increase airflow on those hot muggy nights. When cooler weather strikes, keep warm with its added draft collar and hood drawstring. Ideal for long treks and family camping trips, this Terra-pod Sleeping Bag is able to fit individuals up to 6 ft. tall and offers hang loops for easy storage. Fits individuals up to 6/ft tall, has an interior chest pocket, full foot box with double zipper and draft collar. </span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Shape - Mummy Hybrid</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Fits Up To - 6 Feet</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Shell Material - 380T Nylon Ripstop</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Lining Material - 210T Polyester Pongee</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Zipper Location - Left</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Filling - Polyester Wadding</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Operating temperature, F/C - 20/-7</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Bag Dimensions (Rolled up) - 15x10 in.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Dimensions - 80x34 inches</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Weight - 3lb 4.7oz</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<h5 dir=\"ltr\"> <span style=\"font-size: 0.83em;\">First Aid Kit - </span><span style=\"font-size: 0.83em;\">UltraLite Mini First Aid Kit</span></h5>\r\n<h5 dir=\"ltr\"><span></span></h5>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Whether you’re a soccer mom preparing for your child’s upcoming bumps and bruises or a casual weekend hiker, the 12 Survivors UltraLite First Aid Kit provides you with the essentials to get through any misadventure. Weighing less than a single pound, the UltraLite First Aid Kit provides 90 pieces of various safety supplies including bandages, gauze, alcohol pads, scissors, tweezers, tape and moleskin. Wrapped in a moisture wicking, Honeycomb ripstop rollup kit, these first aid supplies come well organized and easy-to-find in six interior zipper pockets, allowing them to be restocked with new first aid necessities.</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Bag Dimensions (Opened) - 13.5 x 9.75 in. (342.9 x 247.7 mm.) in/mm</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Bag Dimensions (Rolled up) - 3 x 9.75 in. in.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Bag Material - Honeycomb ripstop nylon</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Weight (filled) - 11.3 oz oz</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Number of Pieces - 90</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<h5><span>Tools - </span><span>Sharp &amp; Spark</span></h5>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A unique tool for any outdoor adventure or survival situation, this compact, two-in-one device provides the components needed to sharpen your blade and start a fire. The 12 Survivors™ Sharp &amp; Spark is equipped with four sharpening methods to quickly sharpen a dull blade:</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>1. Coarse triangular bit sharpener to repair and re-profile a damaged/dented blade</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>2. Fine triangular bit sharpener to smoothen and shape the blade</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>3. Diamond serration file that sharpens serrated blades</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>4. Diamond-coated sharpener that provides both a coarse and fine sharpening method when moving the blade manually back and forth</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Its leather strop (part of sharpening process) removes small blade particles left over from sharpening, honing the blade, while the magnesium fire starter creates a shower of hot sparks to start a fire. Small enough to carry in your pack, pocket, or around the neck (designed with a lanyard hole), the Sharp &amp; Spark is an integral item for every survivor to have on hand.</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<h5 dir=\"ltr\"><span>Pocket Water Purifier</span></h5>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Go Ready with the 12 Survivors Pocket Water Purifier. Whether you’re on a morning hike, spending a week in the mountains, or clawing your way out of a survival situation, this compact, 1.2” x 6.5”, 2.1 oz. water filtration straw provides 0.4 liters per minute of thirst-quenching potable water you can depend on. Constructed of BPS-free ABS plastic and Tested by TUV SUD, this lightweight, portable water filtering straw reduces bacteria by 99.9999%. With filtration down to just .03 microns for up to 1500 liters, this life-saving straw prevents major illnesses such as Salmonella, Giardia, Cholera, Diarrhea, and more. This pocket sized purifier threads easily onto a standard soda or water bottle and keeps you from putting your hands or face in potentially dangerous water for a drink. No matter where your outdoor adventures take you, Go Ready with 12 Survivor Pocket Water Purifier. Includes a pre-filter and cotton replacements.</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Dimensions - 1.2 in diameter</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Dimensions - 6.5 in height</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Filter Capacity - 396 gallons</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Filter Capacity - 1500 liters</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Filter Elements - Antibacterial Granular Activated Carbon and Hollow Fiber UF Membrane</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Material - ABS and BPA free food grade plastic</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Output Flow Rate - .4 liters per minute</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Weight - 2.1 oz</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232507,76,0,100634,'<p><span data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;12 Survivors Ignite-110 Headlamp&quot;}\">12 Survivors Ignite-110 Headlamp</span></p>\r\n<p><span>12 Survivors 20F Sleeping Bag - Regular</span></p>\r\n<p><span>12 Survivors Sharp &amp; Spark</span></p>\r\n<p><span>Survivors Pocket Water Purifier</span></p>'),(232525,76,1,100634,'<p>The Personal Survival Package features all the innovative gear you need to get you through an unexpected adventure or a last-minute overnight expedition.  Each package comes equipped with supplies by 12 Survivors including an Ignite-110 Headlamp, 20F Sleeping Bag, Ultra Mini First Aid Kit, a Sharp & Spark fire starter and Pocket Water Purifier.</p>'),(232508,85,0,100634,'survival tools, what tools do you need to survive, how to drink water from a river, best sleeping bag for survival, first aid kit for go bag, best gear for go bag, Everest, 12 survivors'),(232526,85,1,100634,'survival tools, what tools do you need to survive, how to drink water from a river, best sleeping bag for survival, first aid kit for go bag, best gear for go bag, Everest, 12 survivors'),(232610,75,0,100658,'<p>Whether you’re a soccer mom preparing for your child’s upcoming bumps and bruises or a casual weekend hiker, the 12 Survivors UltraLite First Aid Kit provides you with the essentials to get through any misadventure. Weighing less than a single pound, the UltraLite First Aid Kit provides 90 pieces of various safety supplies including bandages, gauze, alcohol pads, scissors, tweezers, tape and moleskin. Wrapped in a moisture wicking, Honeycomb ripstop rollup kit, these first aid supplies come well organized and easy-to-find in six interior zipper pockets, allowing them to be restocked with new first aid necessities.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span>Bag Dimensions (Opened) - 13.5 x 9.75 in. (342.9 x 247.7 mm.) in/mm</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Bag Dimensions (Rolled up) - 3 x 9.75 in. in.</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Bag Material - Honeycomb ripstop nylon</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Weight (filled) - 11.3 oz oz</span></li>\r\n<li><span><span>Number of Pieces - 90</span></span>\r\n<h5 class=\"color-light text-uppercase mb0 pb0 \">INCLUDED IN PACKAGE</h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adhesive bandage - 1x3 in.</li>\r\n<li>Adhesive bandage - .75x2.8 in.</li>\r\n<li>Adhesive bandage - Butterfly</li>\r\n<li>Butterfly closure</li>\r\n<li>Alcohol prep pads</li>\r\n<li>Tweezers</li>\r\n<li>Elastic bandage</li>\r\n<li>Scissors</li>\r\n<li>Gauze pads</li>\r\n<li>Moleskin</li>\r\n<li>Tape</li>\r\n<li>Rollup kit</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<p><span></span></p>'),(232864,75,1,100658,'<