Collapsible Water Bottle is an incredibly lightweight water bottle, collapsible to a very small size.</span></p>'),(232962,76,1,100672,'<p><span>The 12 Survivors Reservoir 17: Collapsible Water Bottle is an incredibly lightweight water bottle, collapsible to a very small size.</span></p>'),(232656,85,0,100672,'collapsible water bottle, water bottle, water to-go, camping, survival gear'),(232963,85,1,100672,'collapsible water bottle, water bottle, water to-go, camping, survival gear'),(232663,75,0,100675,'<p><span>Defy the odds of survival in emergency situations with the new 12 Survivors Paracord</span><br /><span>Survival Pod. Designed to keep you alive, the compact, lightweight Paracord Pod features 30 essential first aid and survival items. The kit includes a fishing and snare rig, fire starter rod and striker kit complete with tinder, a compass, mini-carabiner, warning and safety whistle, and 40 ft. of rugged 7-strand paracord capable of being stripped to 275 ft. of usable cord. Whether survival means food, fire or shelter, the 12 Survivors Paracord Survival Pod is there to save the day.</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ml15\">\r\n<li><span>Dimensions - 3.35 x 4.75 x 1.4 inches</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Weight, oz - 7</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Paracord Length - 40 feet</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Number of Pieces - 30</span>\r\n<h5 class=\"color-light text-uppercase mb0 pb0 \">INCLUDED IN PACKAGE</h5>\r\n<small class=\"heading heading-solid color-light\"></small>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Whistle</li>\r\n<li>Fire starting rod</li>\r\n<li>Rubber tubing</li>\r\n<li>Tinder</li>\r\n<li>Safety pin</li>\r\n<li>Fishing line</li>\r\n<li>Fishing weights - 2 pieces</li>\r\n<li>Fishing swivels - 2 pieces</li>\r\n<li>Fishing floats - 2 pieces</li>\r\n<li>Fishing hooks- 2 pieces</li>\r\n<li>Alcohol pad</li>\r\n<li>Carabiner</li>\r\n<li>Knife blade</li>\r\n<li>Tin foil</li>\r\n<li>Iron wire</li>\r\n<li>Sewing needle</li>\r\n<li>Shackle</li>\r\n<li>Compass</li>\r\n<li>Cotton ball - 2 pieces</li>\r\n<li>Wire saw</li>\r\n<li>Metal box</li>\r\n<li>Glow in the dark paper</li>\r\n<li>Zip lock bag</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232974,75,1,100675,'<p><span>Defy the odds of survival in emergency situations with the new 12 Survivors Paracord</span><br /><span>Survival Pod. Designed to keep you alive, the compact, lightweight Paracord Pod features 30 essential first aid and survival items. The kit includes a fishing and snare rig, fire starter rod and striker kit complete with tinder, a compass, mini-carabiner, warning and safety whistle, and 40 ft. of rugged 7-strand paracord capable of being stripped to 275 ft. of usable cord. Whether survival means food, fire or shelter, the 12 Survivors Paracord Survival Pod is there to save the day.</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ml15\">\r\n<li><span>Dimensions - 3.35 x 4.75 x 1.4 inches</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Weight, oz - 7</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Paracord Length - 40 feet</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Number of Pieces - 30</span>\r\n<h5 class=\"color-light text-uppercase mb0 pb0 \">INCLUDED IN PACKAGE</h5>\r\n<small class=\"heading heading-solid color-light\"></small>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Whistle</li>\r\n<li>Fire starting rod</li>\r\n<li>Rubber tubing</li>\r\n<li>Tinder</li>\r\n<li>Safety pin</li>\r\n<li>Fishing line</li>\r\n<li>Fishing weights - 2 pieces</li>\r\n<li>Fishing swivels - 2 pieces</li>\r\n<li>Fishing floats - 2 pieces</li>\r\n<li>Fishing hooks- 2 pieces</li>\r\n<li>Alcohol pad</li>\r\n<li>Carabiner</li>\r\n<li>Knife blade</li>\r\n<li>Tin foil</li>\r\n<li>Iron wire</li>\r\n<li>Sewing needle</li>\r\n<li>Shackle</li>\r\n<li>Compass</li>\r\n<li>Cotton ball - 2 pieces</li>\r\n<li>Wire saw</li>\r\n<li>Metal box</li>\r\n<li>Glow in the dark paper</li>\r\n<li>Zip lock bag</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232664,76,0,100675,'<p><span>Defy the odds of survival in emergency situations with the new 12 Survivors Paracord</span><br /><span>Survival Pod.</span></p>'),(232975,76,1,100675,'<p><span>Defy the odds of survival in emergency situations with the new 12 Survivors Paracord</span><br /><span>Survival Pod.</span></p>'),(232665,85,0,100675,'survival pod, paracord, pod, survival gear, accessories'),(232976,85,1,100675,'survival pod, paracord, pod, survival gear, accessories'),(232666,75,0,100676,'<p><span>The 12 Survivors Hand Pump Water Purifier is as necessary to preppers, survivalists and outdoor enthusiasts as water itself. Contained in a slender, easy-to-carry 1.8”D x 8.5”H housing and capable of filtering up to 22 gallons of water through the ceramic filter and 1,320 gallons through the accompanying carbon filter at a rate of 0.5 liters per minute, the Hand Pump Water Purifier eliminates 99.9999% of bacteria. The aircraft grade aluminum body is built for rugged outdoor use, yet remains lightweight at just 12.8 oz. Protected by its versatile carry bag, the 12 Survivors Hand Pump Water Purifier is Go Ready and waiting to be your most trusted potable water source.   </span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ml15\">\r\n<li><span>Dimensions - 1.8x8.5in</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Filter Capacity - 80 Liters (22 Gallons)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Filter Elements - Antibacterial Granular Activated Carbon Filter and Diatomite Ceramic Filter</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Material - Aircraft grade aluminum and BPA free food grade plastic</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Operating temperature, F/C - 32 to 122 / 0 to 50</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Output Flow Rate - .5 liters per Minute</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Weight, oz - 12.8</span>\r\n<h5 class=\"color-light text-uppercase mb0 pb0 \">INCLUDED IN PACKAGE</h5>\r\n<small class=\"heading heading-solid color-light\"></small>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>O-Ring Lubricant</li>\r\n<li>Ceramic Scrubber</li>\r\n<li>Filter Cotton</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Hose (2) </li>\r\n<li>Manual</li>\r\n<li>O-Ring Replacement (8)</li>\r\n<li>Pre-filter Float</li>\r\n<li>Pre-filter</li>\r\n<li>Carry Bag Carry Bag</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232977,75,1,100676,'<p><span>The 12 Survivors Hand Pump Water Purifier is as necessary to preppers, survivalists and outdoor enthusiasts as water itself. Contained in a slender, easy-to-carry 1.8”D x 8.5”H housing and capable of filtering up to 22 gallons of water through the ceramic filter and 1,320 gallons through the accompanying carbon filter at a rate of 0.5 liters per minute, the Hand Pump Water Purifier eliminates 99.9999% of bacteria. The aircraft grade aluminum body is built for rugged outdoor use, yet remains lightweight at just 12.8 oz. Protected by its versatile carry bag, the 12 Survivors Hand Pump Water Purifier is Go Ready and waiting to be your most trusted potable water source.   </span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ml15\">\r\n<li><span>Dimensions - 1.8x8.5in</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Filter Capacity - 80 Liters (22 Gallons)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Filter Elements - Antibacterial Granular Activated Carbon Filter and Diatomite Ceramic Filter</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Material - Aircraft grade aluminum and BPA free food grade plastic</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Operating temperature, F/C - 32 to 122 / 0 to 50</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Output Flow Rate - .5 liters per Minute</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Weight, oz - 12.8</span>\r\n<h5 class=\"color-light text-uppercase mb0 pb0 \">INCLUDED IN PACKAGE</h5>\r\n<small class=\"heading heading-solid color-light\"></small>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>O-Ring Lubricant</li>\r\n<li>Ceramic Scrubber</li>\r\n<li>Filter Cotton</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Hose (2) </li>\r\n<li>Manual</li>\r\n<li>O-Ring Replacement (8)</li>\r\n<li>Pre-filter Float</li>\r\n<li>Pre-filter</li>\r\n<li>Carry Bag Carry Bag</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232667,76,0,100676,'<p><span>The 12 Survivors Hand Pump Water Purifier is as necessary to preppers, survivalists and outdoor enthusiasts as water itself. </span></p>'),(232978,76,1,100676,'<p><span>The 12 Survivors Hand Pump Water Purifier is as necessary to preppers, survivalists and outdoor enthusiasts as water itself. </span></p>'),(232668,85,0,100676,'hand pump water purifier, hand pump, water accessories, camping, survival gear'),(232979,85,1,100676,'hand pump water purifier, hand pump, water accessories, camping, survival gear'),(232669,75,0,100677,'<p><span>Go Ready with the 12 Survivors Pocket Water Purifier. Whether you’re on a morning hike, spending a week in the mountains, or clawing your way out of a survival situation, this compact, 1.2” x 6.5”, 2.1 oz. water filtration straw provides 0.4 liters per minute of thirst-quenching potable water you can depend on. Constructed of BPS-free ABS plastic and Tested by TUV SUD, this lightweight, portable water filtering straw reduces bacteria by 99.9999%. With filtration down to just .03 microns for up to 1500 liters, this life-saving straw prevents major illnesses such as Salmonella, Giardia, Cholera, Diarrhea, and more. This pocket sized purifier threads easily onto a standard soda or water bottle and keeps you from putting your hands or face in potentially dangerous water for a drink. No matter where your outdoor adventures take you, Go Ready with 12 Survivor Pocket Water Purifier. Includes a pre-filter and cotton replacements.</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ml15\">\r\n<li><span>Dimensions - 6.5 in height</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Dimensions - 1.2 in diameter</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Filter Capacity - 1500 liters</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Filter Capacity - 396 gallons</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Filter Elements - Antibacterial Granular Activated Carbon and Hollow Fiber UF Membrane</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Material - ABS and BPA free food grade plastic</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Output Flow Rate - .4 liters per minute</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Weight - 2.1 oz</span>\r\n<h5 class=\"color-light text-uppercase mb0 pb0 \">INCLUDED IN PACKAGE</h5>\r\n<small class=\"heading heading-solid color-light\"></small>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Extra Cotton Replacements</li>\r\n<li>Manual</li>\r\n<li>Pre-Filter</li>\r\n<li>Carrying case</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(250269,75,1,100677,'<p><span>Go Ready with the 12 Survivors Pocket Water Purifi