irst-quenching potable water you can depend on.</span></p>'),(250270,76,1,100677,'<p><span>Go Ready with the 12 Survivors Pocket Water Purifier. Whether you’re on a morning hike, spending a week in the mountains, or clawing your way out of a survival situation, this compact, 1.2” x 6.5”, 2.1 oz. water filtration straw provides 0.4 liters per minute of thirst-quenching potable water you can depend on.</span></p>'),(232671,85,0,100677,'pocket water purifier, water accessory, survival gear, compact water accessory, '),(250271,85,1,100677,'pocket water purifier, water accessory, survival gear, compact water accessory, '),(232675,75,0,100679,'<p><span>The 12 Survivors SolarFlare 16 packs a whopping 15.9 watts of power in a lightweight, ultra-compact 10.1 x 13 inch tablet. SolarFlare 16’s monocrystalline cell material absorbs sunlight, creating your own self-reliant 2.1 amp dual USB power source. Hanging hooks and corner grommets make securing the panel quick and easy; hang it on your tent or tie it to a rock in seconds! Weighing in just shy of 1 lb., the ultra-thin, foldable design makes charging and preparing your devices both portable and versatile.</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ml15\">\r\n<li><span>Current - 2.1 Amp. (Max Available)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Dimensions - 10.1 x 19 in (length/width)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Dimensions - 17.3 mm (USB port thickness)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Dimensions - 10.1 x 19 mm (length/width)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Dimensions - .09 in (panel thickness)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Dimensions - 2.3 mm (panel thickness)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Dimensions - .68 in (USB port thickness)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Material - Monocrystalline cells</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Power - 15.9 Watts (Max. Output)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Voltage (V) - 5 Volts (Max. Output)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Weight - 1 lb</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Weight - 16 oz</span>\r\n<h5 class=\"color-light text-uppercase mb0 pb0 \">INCLUDED IN PACKAGE</h5>\r\n<small class=\"heading heading-solid color-light\"></small>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hanging hooks</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(250272,75,1,100679,'<p><span>The 12 Survivors SolarFlare 16 packs a whopping 15.9 watts of power in a lightweight, ultra-compact 10.1 x 13 inch tablet. SolarFlare 16’s monocrystalline cell material absorbs sunlight, creating your own self-reliant 2.1 amp dual USB power source. Hanging hooks and corner grommets make securing the panel quick and easy; hang it on your tent or tie it to a rock in seconds! Weighing in just shy of 1 lb., the ultra-thin, foldable design makes charging and preparing your devices both portable and versatile.</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ml15\">\r\n<li><span>Current - 2.1 Amp. (Max Available)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Dimensions - 10.1 x 19 in (length/width)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Dimensions - 17.3 mm (USB port thickness)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Dimensions - 10.1 x 19 mm (length/width)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Dimensions - .09 in (panel thickness)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Dimensions - 2.3 mm (panel thickness)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Dimensions - .68 in (USB port thickness)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Material - Monocrystalline cells</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Power - 15.9 Watts (Max. Output)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Voltage (V) - 5 Volts (Max. Output)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Weight - 1 lb</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Weight - 16 oz</span>\r\n<h5 class=\"color-light text-uppercase mb0 pb0 \">INCLUDED IN PACKAGE</h5>\r\n<small class=\"heading heading-solid color-light\"></small>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hanging hooks</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232676,76,0,100679,'<p><span>The 12 Survivors SolarFlare 16 packs a whopping 15.9 watts of power in a lightweight, ultra-compact 10.1 x 13 inch tablet.</span></p>'),(250273,76,1,100679,'<p><span>The 12 Survivors SolarFlare 16 packs a whopping 15.9 watts of power in a lightweight, ultra-compact 10.1 x 13 inch tablet.</span></p>'),(232677,85,0,100679,'solarflare16, solar panel, solar accessories, outdoor accessories, survival gear'),(250274,85,1,100679,'solarflare16, solar panel, solar accessories, outdoor accessories, survival gear'),(232690,75,0,100684,'<p><span>Whether a first-time camper or a seasoned outdoor adventurer, the 12 Survivors Shire 4P Tent is easy for anyone to assemble or take down by themselves with its linked, collapsable poles. The three season structure can fit up to four people and its lightweight design makes hiking to the campsite effortless. Enjoy the versatility of options; either remove the fly for a solid mesh tent to sleep under the stars, or keep it attached for windy and rainy nights. The rainfly also extends over the doors providing cover outside of your tent. The 12 Survivors Shire 4P Tent comes in a Nylon carry bag for transportation with individual pouches for poles and stakes, and has two vestibules for gear storage and weather protection.</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ml15\">\r\n<li><span>Seasons (3 seasons/ 4 seasons) - 3 season</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Sleeping capacity - 4 person</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Minimum trail weight - 6 lb 10 oz</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Fly/ footprint pitch weight - Fly- 2 lb 8 oz (No Footprint)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Packaged weight - 7 lb 10 oz</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Packed size - 23\'\' x 6.5\'\' x 7.5\'\'</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Floor dimensions - 72\'\' x 97\'\' x 54\'\' LxWxH</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Floor area - 48.5 ft2</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Vestibule area - 17 ft2 x 2</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Peak height - 54\'\'</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Number of doors - 2</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Number of poles - 2</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Pole material - aluminum alloy pole</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Pole diameter - 8.5mm</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Canopy fabirc - Blue mesh</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Floor fabric - 150D Oxford, PU2000mm</span>\r\n<h5 class=\"color-light text-uppercase mb0 pb0 \">INCLUDED IN PACKAGE</h5>\r\n<small class=\"heading heading-solid color-light\"></small>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Nylon carrying bag</li>\r\n<li>Tent Stakes</li>\r\n<li>Tent poles</li>\r\n<li>Gear Loft</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(250275,75,1,100684,'<p><span>Whether a first-time camper or a seasoned outdoor adventurer, the 12 Survivors Shire 4P Tent is easy for anyone to assemble or take down by themselves with its linked, collapsable poles. The three season structure can fit up to four people and its lightweight design makes hiking to the campsite effortless. Enjoy the versatility of options; either remove the fly for a solid mesh tent to sleep under the stars, or keep it attached for windy and rainy nights. The rainfly also extends over the doors providing cover outside of your tent. The 12 Survivors Shire 4P Tent comes in a Nylon carry bag for transportation with individual pouches for poles and stakes, and has two vestibules for gear storage and weather protection.</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ml15\">\r\n<li><span>Seasons (3 seasons/ 4 seasons) - 3 season</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Sleeping capacity - 4 person</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Minimum trail weight - 6 lb 10 oz</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Fly/ footprint pitch weight - Fly- 2 lb 8 oz (No Footprint)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Packaged weight - 7 lb 10 oz</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Packed size - 23\'\' x 6.5\'\' x 7.5\'\'</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Floor dimensions - 72\'\' x 97\'\' x 54\'\' LxWxH</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Floor area - 48.5 ft2</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Vestibule area - 17 ft2 x 2</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Peak height - 54\'\'</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Number of doors - 2</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Number of poles - 2</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Pole material - aluminum alloy pole</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Pole diameter - 8.5mm</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Canopy fabirc - Blue mesh</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Floor fabric - 150D Oxford, PU2000mm</span>\r\n<h5 class=\"color-light text-uppercase mb0 pb0 \">INCLUDED IN PACKAGE</h5>\r\n<small class=\"heading heading-solid color-light\"></small>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Nylon carrying bag</li>\r\n<li>Tent Stakes</li>\r\n<li>Tent poles</li>\r\n<li>Gear Loft</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232691,76,0,100684,'<p><span>Whether a first-time camper or a seasoned outdoor adventurer, the 12 Survivors Shire 4P Tent is easy for anyone to assemble or take down by themselves with its linked, collapsable poles.</span></p>'),(250276,76,1,100684,'<p><span>Whether a first-time camper or a seasoned outdoor adventurer, the 12 Survivors Shire 4P Tent is easy for anyone to assemble or take down by themselves with its linked, collapsable poles.</span></p>'),(232692,85,0,100684,'survival tent, survival gear, outdoor accessories, tent, camping'),(250277,85,1,100684,'survival tent, survival gear, outdoor accessories, tent, camping'),(232693,75,0,100685,'<p><span>Whether a first-time camper or a seasoned outdoor adventurer, the 12 Survivors Shire 6P Tent is easy for anyone to assemble or take down by themselves with its linked, collapsable poles. The three season structure can fit up to six people and its lightweight design makes hiking to the campsite effortless. Enjoy the versatility of options; either remove the fly for a solid mesh tent to sleep under the stars, or keep it attached for windy and rainy nights. The rainfly also extends over the doors providing cover outside of your tent. The 12 Survivors Shire 6P Tent comes in a Nylon carry bag for transportation with individual pouches for poles and stakes, and has two vestibules for gear storage and weather protection.</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ml15\">\r\n<li><span>Seasons (3 seasons/ 4 seasons) - 3 season</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Sleeping capacity - 6 person</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Minimum trail weight - 11 lb 14 oz</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Fly/ footprint pitch weight - Fly- 4 lb 8 oz (No Foortprint)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Packaged weight - 12 lb 10 oz</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Floor dimensions - 109\'\' x 121\'\' x 73\'\' LxWxH</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Floor area - 91.6 ft2</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Vestibule area - two - 18.6 ft2 </