ade type - Fixed</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Blade material - AUS 8 Steel</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Finish/Color - Black anodized</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Handle Material - Micarta</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Size (overall) - 7.75\'\' (196.85 mm)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Size (handle) - 3.3\'\' (84 mm)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Weight - 3.0 oz</span>\r\n<h5 class=\"color-light text-uppercase mb0 pb0 \">INCLUDED IN PACKAGE</h5>\r\n<small class=\"heading heading-solid color-light\"></small>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Sheath (ABS plastic)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(359677,75,1,100690,'<p><span>Featuring a rock solid AUS 8 steel blade and a thick micarta handle, the 12 Survivors™ BKE Knife™ yields exceptional durability, edge sharpness and corrosion resistance. Its finger ring grip keeps your finger from getting sliced, while the jimping above the grip allows for increased friction and stability. The micarta scales can be removed, exposing the full tang steel blade. Users can then wrap the blade in paracord or attach it to wood and turn it into a spear. Weighing just a few ounces, the BKE Knife can be hung around your neck, belt loop or on your pack.</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ml15\">\r\n<li><span>Length - 7 in</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Width - 0.5 in</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Height - 1.5 in</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Weight - 6 oz</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Blade type - Fixed</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Blade material - AUS 8 Steel</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Finish/Color - Black anodized</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Handle Material - Micarta</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Size (overall) - 7.75\'\' (196.85 mm)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Size (handle) - 3.3\'\' (84 mm)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Weight - 3.0 oz</span>\r\n<h5 class=\"color-light text-uppercase mb0 pb0 \">INCLUDED IN PACKAGE</h5>\r\n<small class=\"heading heading-solid color-light\"></small>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Sheath (ABS plastic)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232709,76,0,100690,'<p><span>Featuring a rock solid AUS 8 steel blade and a thick micarta handle, the 12 Survivors™ BKE Knife™ yields exceptional durability, edge sharpness and corrosion resistance. </span></p>'),(359678,76,1,100690,'<p><span>Featuring a rock solid AUS 8 steel blade and a thick micarta handle, the 12 Survivors™ BKE Knife™ yields exceptional durability, edge sharpness and corrosion resistance. </span></p>'),(232710,85,0,100690,'knife, blade, survival gear, accessories, sharp'),(359679,85,1,100690,'knife, blade, survival gear, accessories, sharp'),(232714,75,0,100692,'<p><span>The 12 Survivors First Aid Rollup Kit offers the basics in life saving medical intervention. Its contents will treat injuries ranging from the basic knee scrape to the life threatening extremity hemorrhage and offer you the ability to provide the intervention necessary to save a life. The kit unrolls to reveal zipped pouches for organized storage and do-it-yourself labels so you can easily identify all of your supplies under critical stress. With snap button straps, the kit easily attaches to the exterior of existing gear, freeing up space in your pack and offering you unimpeded access to your medical supplies. Regardless of your environment, the 12 Survivors First Aid Rollup Kit provides the tools necessary to survive until help can be reached.</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ml15\">\r\n<li><span>Length - 15 in</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Width - 6 in</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Height - 5.5 in</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Weight - 2.02 lb</span>\r\n<h5 class=\"color-light text-uppercase mb0 pb0 \">INCLUDED IN PACKAGE</h5>\r\n<small class=\"heading heading-solid color-light\"></small>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1 emergency blanket</li>\r\n<li>1 poncho</li>\r\n<li>8 PBT elastic bandages</li>\r\n<li>4 sterile non woven gauze pads</li>\r\n<li>2 wet cleaning wipes</li>\r\n<li>4 BZK antiseptic swabs</li>\r\n<li>4 alcohol prep pads</li>\r\n<li>1 Pair of PVC gloves</li>\r\n<li>10 adhesive band aids</li>\r\n<li>1 breath mask for mouth to mouth</li>\r\n<li>1 pair of tweezers</li>\r\n<li>1 zinc 