the basic knee scrape to the life threatening extremity hemorrhage and offer you the ability to provide the intervention necessary to save a life. </span></p>'),(676037,76,1,100692,'<p><span>The 12 Survivors First Aid Rollup Kit offers the basics in life saving medical intervention. Its contents will treat injuries ranging from the basic knee scrape to the life threatening extremity hemorrhage and offer you the ability to provide the intervention necessary to save a life. </span></p>'),(232716,85,0,100692,'first aid rollup kit, first aid kit, survival gear, camping gear, accessories'),(676036,85,1,100692,'first aid rollup kit, first aid kit, survival gear, camping gear, accessories'),(232717,75,0,100693,'<p><span>Offering the basic tools needed to start a fire and fish for food, the 12 Survivors™ FNF (Fish and Fire)™ Emergency Kit is a must-have accessory to have handy when planning an outdoor excursion or on the go. Small enough to throw in your purse, bugout bag or glove compartment, this pocket-sized emergency kit includes more than 30 feet of fishing line, two hooks, two floats, two swivels, two weights, an alcohol pad, a fire starter, knife blade, tin foil, tinder and seven feet of paracord.</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ml15\">\r\n<li><span>Dimensions - 3.9x1.71x0.9 in</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Dimensions - 100x43x24 mm</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Length - 3.5 in</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Width - 2 in</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Height - 1 in</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Weight, oz - 1.5 oz</span>\r\n<h5 class=\"color-light text-uppercase mb0 pb0 \">INCLUDED IN PACKAGE</h5>\r\n<small class=\"heading heading-solid color-light\"></small>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>7ft of Paracord</li>\r\n<li>Flint rod and tinder</li>\r\n<li>Knife blade</li>\r\n<li>Tin foil</li>\r\n<li>32.8ft of fishing line</li>\r\n<li>2 weights</li>\r\n<li>2 swivels</li>\r\n<li>2 floats</li>\r\n<li>2 fishing hooks</li>\r\n<li>Alcohol pad</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(250281,75,1,100693,'<p><span>Offering the basic tools needed to start a fire and fish for food, the 12 Survivors™ FNF (Fish and Fire)™ Emergency Kit is a must-have accessory to have handy when planning an outdoor excursion or on the go. Small enough to throw in your purse, bugout bag or glove compartment, this pocket-sized emergency kit includes more than 30 feet of fishing line, two hooks, two floats, two swivels, two weights, an alcohol pad, a fire starter, knife blade, tin foil, tinder and seven feet of paracord.</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ml15\">\r\n<li><span>Dimensions - 3.9x1.71x0.9 in</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Dimensions - 100x43x24 mm</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Length - 3.5 in</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Width - 2 in</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Height - 1 in</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Weight, oz - 1.5 oz</span>\r\n<h5 class=\"color-light text-uppercase mb0 pb0 \">INCLUDED IN PACKAGE</h5>\r\n<small class=\"heading heading-solid color-light\"></small>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>7ft of Paracord</li>\r\n<li>Flint rod and tinder</li>\r\n<li>Knife blade</li>\r\n<li>Tin foil</li>\r\n<li>32.8ft of fishing line</li>\r\n<li>2 weights</li>\r\n<li>2 swivels</li>\r\n<li>2 floats</li>\r\n<li>2 fishing hooks</li>\r\n<li>Alcohol pad</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232718,76,0,100693,'<p><span>Offering the basic tools needed to start a fire and fish for food, the 12 Survivors™ FNF (Fish and Fire)™ Emergency Kit is a must-have accessory to have handy when planning an outdoor excursion or on the go.</span></p>'),(250282,76,1,100693,'<p><span>Offering the basic tools needed to start a fire and fish for food, the 12 Survivors™ FNF (Fish and Fire)™ Emergency Kit is a must-have accessory to have handy when planning an outdoor excursion or on the go.</span></p>'),(232719,85,0,100693,'fishing and fire emergency kit, fishing, camping, survival gear, outdoors'),(250283,85,1,100693,'fishing and fire emergency kit, fishing, camping, survival gear, outdoors'),(232733,75,0,100698,'<p><span>For outdoor hiking excursions in regions with challenging terrain, 12 Survivors’ GeoTrek Trekking Poles are essential for added stability and covering ground more quickly. For both climbing and descending, these light weight, durable trekking poles feature an easily adjusted twist-locking mechanism for length adjustment, an anti-shock mechanism with interior springs and no-slip grips that easily support hikers for reliable on-trail performance. Our GeoTrek poles feature trekking baskets for additional support and a durable carbide tip and snow baskets for handling rocky and icy terrain with confidence. These multipurpose poles also provide a surefire way to hold up the rain fly on your tent, providing added shelter from the elements.</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ml15\">\r\n<li><span>Length - 25.5 in</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Width - 2 in</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Height - 2 in</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Weight - 1.5 lb</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Shaft Material - Aluminum alloy 6061</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Extended Length (mm) - 1308.1 (51.5 inches)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Closed Length (mm) - 647.7 (25.5 inches)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Shaft Diameters (mm) (Top/Middle/Bottom) - 18/16/14 (0.71/0.63/0.55 inches)</span></li>\r\n<li><span><span>Weight, oz - 22.8 per pair (1.425lb)</span></span>\r\n<h5 class=\"color-light text-uppercase mb0 pb0 \">INCLUDED IN PACKAGE</h5>\r\n<span><span><small class=\"heading heading-solid color-light\"></small></span></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Trekking Basket</li>\r\n<li>Removeable rubber tip</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(250324,75,1,100698,'<p><span>For outdoor hiking excursions in regions with challenging terrain, 12 Survivors’ GeoTrek Trekking Poles are essential for added stability and covering ground more quickly. For both climbing and descending, these light weight, durable trekking poles feature an easily adjusted twist-locking mechanism for length adjustment, an anti-shock mechanism with interior springs and no-slip grips that easily support hikers for reliable on-trail performance. Our GeoTrek poles feature trekking baskets for additional support and a durable carbide tip and snow baskets for handling rocky and icy terrain with confidence. These multipurpose poles also provide a surefire way to hold up the rain fly on your tent, providing added shelter from the elements.</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ml15\">\r\n<li><span>Length - 25.5 in</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Width - 2 in</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Height - 2 in</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Weight - 1.5 lb</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Shaft Material - Aluminum alloy 6061</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Extended Length (mm) - 1308.1 (51.5 inches)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Closed Length (mm) - 647.7 (25.5 inches)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Shaft Diameters (mm) (Top/Middle/Bottom) - 18/16/14 (0.71/0.63/0.55 inches)</span></li>\r\n<li><span><span>Weight, oz - 22.8 per pair (1.425lb)</span></span>\r\n<h5 class=\"color-light text-uppercase mb0 pb0 \">INCLUDED IN PACKAGE</h5>\r\n<span><span><small class=\"heading heading-solid color-light\"></small></span></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Trekking Basket</li>\r\n<li>Removeable rubber tip</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232734,76,0,100698,'<p><span>For outdoor hiking excursions in regions with challenging terrain, 12 Survivors’ GeoTrek Trekking Poles are essential for added stability and covering ground more quickly.</span></p>'),(250325,76,1,100698,'<p><span>For outdoor hiking excursions in regions with challenging terrain, 12 Survivors’ GeoTrek Trekking Poles are essential for added stability and covering ground more quickly.</span></p>'),(232735,85,0,100698,'trekking Poles, survival gear, outdoor accessories, hiking pole, camping gear'),(250326,85,1,100698,'trekking Poles, survival gear, outdoor accessories, hiking pole, camping gear'),(232736,75,0,100699,'<p><span>The 12 Survivors Hunter Knife is constructed out of full tang steel to bring you a quality slicing, cutting or stabbing instrument. Equipped with a paracord handle, the 12 Survivors Hunter Knife is easy to grip and maintain positive control while in use. The paracord can be removed and be used for a multitude of applications ranging from securing it to a stick for use as a spear, setting up a snare, starting a fire or any other applications that may arise. The 12 Survivors Hunter Knife can be hung from a belt loop or secured to the shoulder strap of your pack, ensuring an offensive hunting tool or defensive lifesaver is never out of reach.</span></p>\r\n<h5 class=\"color-light text-uppercase mb0 pb0 \">INCLUDED IN PACKAGE</h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Nylon Sheath with buckle pocket</li>\r\n</ul>'),(250329,75,1,100699,'<p><span>The 12 Survivors Hunter Knife is constructed out of full tang steel to bring you a quality slicing, cutting or stabbing instrument. Equipped with a paracord handle, the 12 Survivors Hunter Knife is easy to grip and maintain positive control while in use. The paracord can be removed and be used for a multitude of applications ranging from securing it to a stick for use as a spear, setting up a snare, starting a fire or any other applications that may arise. The 12 Survivors Hunter Knife can be hung from a belt loop or secured to the shoulder strap of your pack, ensuring an offensive hunting tool or defensive lifesaver is never out of reach.</span></p>\r\n<h5 class=\"color-light text-uppercase mb0 pb0 \">INCLUDED IN PACKAGE</h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Nylon Sheath with buckle pocket</li>\r\n</ul>'),(232737,76,0,100699,'<p><span>The 12 Survivors Hunter Knife is constructed out of full tang steel to bring you a quality slicing, cutting or stabbing instrument.</span></p>'),(250330,76,1,100699,'<p><span>The 12 Survivors Hunter Knife is constructed out of full tang steel to bring you a quality slicing, cutting or stabbing instrument.</span></p>'),(232738,85,0,100699,'knife, blade, sharp, outdoor accessories, survival gear'),(250331,85,1,100699,'knife, blade, sharp, outdoor accessories, survival gear'),(232861,75,0,100756,'<p>A unique tool for any outdoor adventure or survival situation, this compact, two-in-one device provides the components needed to sharpen your blade and start a fire. The 12 Survivors™ Sharp &amp; Spark is equipped with four sharpening methods to quickly sharpen a dull blade:</p>\r\n<p><br />1. Coarse triangular bit sharpener to repair and re-profile a damaged/dinged blade<br />2. Fine triangular bit sharpener to smoothen and shape the blade<br />3. Diamond serration file that sharpens serrated blades<br />4. Diamond-coated sharpener that provides both a coarse and fine sharpening method when moving the blade manually back and forth</p>\r\n<p><br />Its leather strop (part of sharpening process) removes small blade particles left over from sharpening, honing the blade, while the magnesium fire starter creates a shower of hot sparks to start a fire. Small enough to carry in your pack, pocket, or around the neck (designed with a lanyard hole), the Sharp &amp; Spark is an integral item for every survivor to have on hand.</p>'),(676059,75,1,100756,'<p>A unique tool for any outdoor adventure or survival situation, this compact, two-in-one device provides the components needed to sharpen your blade and start a fire. The 12 Survivors™ Sharp &amp; Spark is equipped with four sharpening methods to quickly sharpen a dull blade:</p>\r\n<p><br />1. Coarse triangular bit sharpener to repair and re-profile a damaged/dinged blade<br />2. Fine triangular bit sharpener to smoothen and shape the blade<br />3. Diamond serration file that sharpens serrated blades<br />4. Diamond-coated sharpener that provides both a coarse and fine sharpening method when moving the blade manually back and forth</p>\r\n<p><br />Its leather strop (part of sharpening process) removes small blade particles left over from sharpening, honing the blade, while the magnesium fire starter creates a shower of hot sparks to start a fire. Small enough to carry in your pack, pocket, or around the neck (designed with a lanyard hole), the Sharp &amp; Spark is an integral item for every survivor to have on hand.</p>'),(232862,76,0,100756,'<p><span>A unique tool for any outdoor adventure or survival situation, this compact, two-in-one device provides the components needed to sharpen your blade and start a fire. </span></p>'),(676061,76,1,100756,'<p><span>A unique tool for any outdoor adventure or survival situation, this compact, two-in-one device provides the components needed to sharpen your blade and start a fire. </span></p>'),(232863,85,0,100756,'Sharp & spark, fire starter kit, outdoor gear, survival gear, outdoor kit'),(676060,85,1,100756,'Sharp & spark, fire starter kit, outdoor gear, survival gear, outdoor kit'),(234357,75,0,101476,'<p>Backup Tactical Thread Protector - HASH2-FDE 1/2x28</p>\r\n<p><span>DIAMOND-PATTERN DESIGN RIFLE THREAD PROTECTOR 1/2\" X 28 FOR .223/5.56 &amp; AR15</span></p>\r\n<h2>Specs:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Constructed from the strongest firearms grade 7075 aluminum alloy.</li>\r\n<li>Strong but lightweight enough to keep unwanted ounces off your gun.</li>\r\n<li>Machined using the absolute latest CNC machines and techniques.</li>\r\n<li>Designed for optimum protection of your threaded barrel.</li>\r\n<li>Looks bad-ass so others will envy you. Score.</li>\r\n<li>MSRP: $32.99</li>\r\n</ul>'),(234359,75,1,101476,'<p>Backup Tactical Thread Protector - SKULLX-FDE 1/2x28 FDE</p>\r\n<p><span>PUNISHER SKULL PATTERN THREAD PROTECTOR 1/2\" X 28 for pistol barrels, FDE</span></p>\r\n<h2>Specs:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Constructed from the strongest firearms grade 7075 aluminum alloy.</li>\r\n<li>Strong but lightweight enough to keep unwanted ounces off your gun.</li>\r\n<li>Machined using the absolute latest CNC machines and techniques.</li>\r\n<li>Designed for optimum protection of your threaded barrel.</li>\r\n<li>Looks bad-ass so others will envy you. Score.</li>\r\n<li><strong>MSRP: $32.99</strong></li>\r\n</ul>'),(234358,76,0,101476,'<p>Backup Tactical Thread Protector - HASH2-FDE 1/2x28</p>'),(234360,76,1,101476,'<p>Backup Tactical 