ng that you will want to carry every day. Carried tip Up, inside the picket with the low profile, snag proof clip, the Sweetwater EDC is a solid folder with a fast spring assist for rapid deploy-ment from either hand.</p>\r\n<p>The 3.5-inch blade forged and flat ground from 154CM steel, elegant design and the proven, G10 scales insure superior control in all conditions.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 7.75”</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: .140”</li>\r\n<li>Blade Length: 3.5”</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 5oz</li>\r\n<li>54CM Stainless</li>\r\n<li>G10 Handle</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 5oz</li>\r\n<li>Short Pocket Clip</li>\r\n<li>Lanyard hole</li>\r\n</ul>'),(344796,75,1,101615,'<p><strong>Put it in your Pocket<br /></strong>In a world where everything is “Tacticool” this and “Multicam” that. At Fremont Knives we believe form follows function there is no need for hype.</p>\r\n<p>We pride ourselves in making edged tools that are meant to be used. The new Sweetwater EDC is a back to basics design, sturdy useful, some-thing that you will want to carry every day. Carried tip Up, inside the picket with the low profile, snag proof clip, the Sweetwater EDC is a solid folder with a fast spring assist for rapid deploy-ment from either hand.</p>\r\n<p>The 3.5-inch blade forged and flat ground from 154CM steel, elegant design and the proven, G10 scales insure superior control in all conditions.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 7.75”</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: .140”</li>\r\n<li>Blade Length: 3.5”</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 5oz</li>\r\n<li>54CM Stainless</li>\r\n<li>G10 Handle</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 5oz</li>\r\n<li>Short Pocket Clip</li>\r\n<li>Lanyard hole</li>\r\n</ul>'),(234850,76,0,101615,'<p><strong>Specifications:</strong><br />• Length: 7.75”<br />• Thickness: .140”<br />• Blade Length: 3.5”<br />• 54CM Stainless<br />• G10 Handle<br />• Weight: 5oz<br />• Short Pocket Clip<br />• Lanyard hole</p>'),(344797,76,1,101615,'<p><strong>Specifi