CALIBER - ODG\r\n\r\nSuit-up your rifle with this slick yet tactical threaded-barrel protector that looks like something out of the Terminator movies. The only difference is this thing’s got a longer shelf-life than Arnold himself.\r\n\r\nSpecs:\r\nConstructed from the strongest firearms grade 7075 aluminum alloy.\r\nStrong but lightweight enough to keep unwanted ounces off your gun.\r\nMachined using the absolute latest CNC machines and techniques.\r\nDesigned for optimum protection of your threaded barrel.\r\nLooks bad-ass so others will envy you. Score.\r\nMSRP: $32.99.'),(235011,75,0,101663,'<p>The Plesiosaur lived during the Triassic and Jurassic period starting about 200 million years ago and spanned a period of nearly 140 million years before they became extinct about 66 million years ago.</p>\r\n<p>With its streamlined body, strong flippers, and rows of sharp teeth paired with one of the strongest jaws of the era, they were the perfect sea predators. The Plesiosaur is featured on this large 65 mm 3 oz silver colorized proof. The fossil is shown in very high detail against a blue background made to simulate the rock these fossils were found in. Capture yours before it becomes extinct!</p>'),(235636,75,1,101663,'<p>The Plesiosaur lived during the Triassic and Jurassic period starting about 200 million years ago and spanned a period of nearly 140 million years before they became extinct about 66 million years ago.</p>\r\n<p>With its streamlined body, strong flippers, and rows of sharp teeth paired with one of the strongest jaws of the era, they were the perfect sea predators. The Plesiosaur is featured on this large 65 mm 3 oz silver colorized proof. The fossil is shown in very high detail against a blue background made to simulate the rock these fossils were found in. Capture yours before it becomes extinct!</p>'),(235012,76,0,101663,'<p>The Plesiosaur is featured on this large 65 mm 3 oz silver colorized proof. The fossil is shown in very high detail against a blue background made to simulate the rock these fossils were found in. Capture yours before it becomes extinct!</p>'),(235637,76,1,101663,'<p>The Plesiosaur is featured on this large 65 mm 3 oz silver colorized proof. The fossil is shown in very high detail against a blue background made to simulate the rock these fossils were found in. Capture yours before it becomes extinct!</p>'),(235013,85,0,101663,'Silver, investment, collector, dinosaur, skeleton, silver coin'),(235638,85,1,101663,'Silver, investment, collector, dinosaur, skeleton, silver coin'),(235020,75,0,101665,'<p>Fishing is one of mankind’s favorite activity. It has been said that a bad day of fishing is still far better than a good day at work!</p>\r\n<p>One of the pioneers of the way we fish was a man by the name of Julio T. Buel. He created a fishing lure that revolutionized the industry. He was out fishing one day in 1834 on Lake Bomoseen in Vermont. Legend has it that his boat hit a rock as he was eating and he dropped his spoon into the water. As he watched it wiggle it\'s way to the bottom, he noticed a fish came and grabbed his spoon and made off with it.</p>\r\n<p>Realizing the potential, he quickly made his way back home and “borrowed” a spoon from his mother. He sawed off the handle and drilled a hole on one end and soldered a hook on the other. He went back out and ended up catching two large brown trouts that he had been trying for years to catch. He then went about town to tell his story and soon people wanted him to make the Buel Lure for themselves. He ended up receiving a patent for his design and was recognized worldwide for his invention. His lure is still being sold today!</p>\r\n<p>Struck from a 1/2 oz of pure silver in silk finish, this amazing coin would be the perfect gift for your avid fisher! Be sure to get yours before the BIG one gets away!</p>'),(235642,75,1,101665,'<p>Fishing is one of mankind’s favorite activity. It has been said that a bad day of fishing is still far better than a good day at work!</p>\r\n<p>One of the pioneers of the way we fish was a man by the name of Julio T. Buel. He created a fishing lure that revolutionized the industry. He was out fishing one day in 1834 on Lake Bomoseen in Vermont. Legend has it that his boat hit a rock as he was eating and he dropped his spoon into the water. As he watched it wiggle it\'s way to the bottom, he noticed a fish came and grabbed his spoon and made off with it.</p>\r\n<p>Realizing the potential, he quickly made his way back home and “borrowed” a spoon from his mother. He sawed off the handle and drilled a hole on one end and soldered a hook on the other. He went back out and ended up catching two large brown trouts that he had been trying for years to catch. He then went about town to tell his story and soon people wanted him to make the Buel Lure for themselves. He ended up receiving a patent for his design and was recognized worldwide for his invention. His lure is still being sold today!</p>\r\n<p>Struck from a 1/2 oz of pure silver in silk finish, this amazing coin would be the perfect gift for your avid fisher! Be sure to get yours before the BIG one gets away!</p>'),(235021,76,0,101665,'<p>Struck from a 1/2 oz of pure silver in silk finish, this amazing coin would be the perfect gift for your avid fisher! Be sure to get yours before the BIG one gets away!</p>'),(235643,76,1,101665,'<p>Struck from a 1/2 oz of pure silver in silk finish, this amazing coin would be the perfect gift for your avid fisher! Be sure to get yours before the BIG one gets away!</p>'),(235022,85,0,101665,'silver, investment, collector, fishing, lure, silver coin, unique'),(235644,85,1,101665,'silver, investment, collector, fishing, lure, silver coin, unique'),(235023,75,0,101666,'<p>Coins are often referred to as miniature pieces of art in metal. This release called Madonna of Bruges certainly lives up to that description! Struck in 3 ounces of silver and then covered with gold, this piece of art pays tribute to Michelangelo’s sculpture of Mary and Jesus. Unlike many other sculptures and paintings that show her looking down upon an Infant, this sculpture is unique as it shows Mary showing sorrow for the future that Jesus must bear.</p>\r\n<p>This moving sculpture is the Michelangelo’s only work that was removed outside of Italy during his life. In fact, it has been moved multiple times and the recovery efforts after WWII were a subject in a big budget Hollywood film called “The Monuments Men.” Whereas the original was sculpted out of one solid piece of marble, this piece of art has been minted out of 3 ounces of precious metal! Limited to only 501 pieces for the world!</p>'),(235645,75,1,101666,'<p>Coins are often referred to as miniature pieces of art in metal. This release called Madonna of Bruges certainly lives up to that description! Struck in 3 ounces of silver and then covered with gold, this piece of art pays tribute to Michelangelo’s sculpture of Mary and Jesus. Unlike many other sculptures and paintings that show her looking down upon an Infant, this sculpture is unique as it shows Mary showing sorrow for the future that Jesus must bear.</p>\r\n<p>This moving sculpture is the Michelangelo’s only work that was removed outside of Italy during his life. In fact, it has been moved multiple times and the recovery efforts after WWII were a subject in a big budget Hollywood film called “The Monuments Men.” Whereas the original was sculpted out of one solid piece of marble, this piece of art has been minted out of 3 ounces of precious metal! Limited to only 501 pieces for the world!</p>'),(235024,76,0,101666,'<p>Struck in 3 ounces of silver and then covered with gold, this piece of art pays tribute to Michelangelo’s sculpture of Mary and Jesus.This moving sculpture is the Michelangelo’s only work that was removed outside of Italy during his life.</p>'),(235646,76,1,101666,'<p>Struck in 3 ounces of silver and then covered with gold, this piece of art pays tribute to Michelangelo’s sculpture of Mary and Jesus.This moving sculpture is the Michelangelo’s only work that was removed outside of Italy during his life.</p>'),(235025,85,0,101666,'silver, investment, collector, madonna, unique'),(235647,85,1,101666,'silver, investment, collector, madonna, unique'),(235029,75,0,101667,'<p><span>Handleitgrips is a Veteran owned business that believes in providing our customers the Best Quality and Most Affordable gun grips on the market. We base our business practices solely on integrity and making sure our customers have the best buying experience and 100% satisfaction in our products. Without our customers, were not in business! Our textured rubber grip enhancements provide outstanding comfort, control, and greatly improved recoil management. Whether you’re the Law Enforcement, Military, Competition Shooter, range shooter, or just a weekend plinking away with the kids… our grip enhancements will improve your shooting experience!!</span></p>'),(235031,75,1,101667,'<p>Handleitgrips is a Veteran owned business that believes in providing our customers the Best Quality and Most Affordable gun grips on the market. We base our business practices solely on integrity and making sure our customers have the best buying experience and 100% satisfaction in our products. Without our customers, were not in business! Our textured rubber grip enhancements provide outstanding comfort, control, and greatly improved recoil management. Whether you’re the Law Enforcement, Military, Competition Shooter, range shooter, or just a weekend plinking away with the kids… our grip enhancements will improve your shooting experience!!</p>'),(235030,76,0,101667,'<p>Handleitgrips designs and laser cut textured rubber, sandpaper, and vinyl grips for firearms.  Handleitgrips products cover more surface area, are more versatile, and the most inovated gun grips on the market today. </p>'),(235032,76,1,101667,'<p>Handleitgrips designs and laser cut textured rubber, san