 red dot in Aimpoint sights as the aiming reticle</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"> </span></li>\r\n<li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Ergonomic design for sure grip when used as a handheld observation tool</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"> </span></li>\r\n<li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Shockproof and Waterproof</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"> </span></li>\r\n<li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Premium Aimpoint ruggedness at an entry level price point</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"> </span></li>\r\n<li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Screws and </span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">allen</span><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> key included</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"> </span></li>\r\n<li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Field of view (FOV): 7°</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"> </span></li>\r\n<li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Eye relief: 2.2in (56mm)</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"> </span></li>\r\n<li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Submersible to 3 Feet (1 meter)</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"> </span></li>\r\n<li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Temperature range -50°F to +160°F (-45°C to +70°C)</span><span> </span></li>\r\n<li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Weight 7.1 oz / 200g</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"> </span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(236614,76,0,102110,'<ul>\r\n<li>3X optical magnification</li>\r\n<li>Compatible with Aimpoint red dot sights for longer range aiming or observation</li>\r\n<li>Ergonomic design for sure grip when used as a handheld observation tool; Shockproof</li>\r\n<li>Weight 7.1 oz / 200g (magnifier only)</li>\r\n<li>Submersible to 3 feet (1 meter)</li>\r\n<li>No re-zeroing needed when shifting between non-magnified and magnified aiming</li>\r\n<li>Professional Grade: Aimpoint ruggedness at incredible value</li>\r\n<li><strong>INCLUDES: HEX key</strong></li>\r\n<ul></ul>\r\n</ul>'),(236932,76,1,102110,'<ul>\r\n<li>3X optical magnification</li>\r\n<li>Compatible with Aimpoint red dot sights for longer range aiming or observation</li>\r\n<li>Ergonomic design 