 Spacer, Flip-Up lens covers, CR2032 battery, Micro tool, Aimpoint HAT</strong></li>\r\n<ul></ul>\r\n</ul>'),(236957,76,1,102166,'<ul>\r\n<li>2 MOA dot size</li>\r\n<li>50,000 hours (over 5 years) of constant operation</li>\r\n<li>1 Off position, 4 night vision compatible settings, and 8 daylight settings</li>\r\n<li>Weight 3.0 oz / 84 g (sight only)</li>\r\n<li>Submersible to 80 feet (25 meters)</li>\r\n<li>Advanced optical lenses for enhanced light transmission and ultimate dot clarity</li>\r\n<li><strong>INCLUDES: LRP Mount &amp; Spacer, Flip-Up lens covers, CR2032 battery, Micro tool</strong></li>\r\n<ul></ul>\r\n</ul>'),(382695,85,1,102166,NULL),(236966,75,0,102168,'<p>Dry your hydration bladder quickly and easily using <span>BōnDry the world\'s only true hydration bladder dryer. No more air-drying, freezing, or destroying bladders. Simply rinse the bladder, insert <span>BōnDry, and put your gear away. It works by quickly absorbing all the moisture in the bladder and wicking it out the top to be evaporated. Manufactured in the USA, made from sustainably sourced biodegradable fibers, as well as, fibers made from recycled plastic bottles. </span></span></p>'),(236968,75,1,102168,'<p>Dry your hydration bladder quickly and easily using <span>BōnDry the world\'s only true hydration bladder dryer. No more air-drying, freezing, or destroying bladders. Simply rinse the bladder, insert <span>BōnDry, and put your gear away. It works by quickly absorbing all the moisture in the bladder and wicking it out the top to be evaporated. Manufactured in the USA, made from sustainably sourced biodegradable fibers, as well as, fibers made from recycled plastic bottles. </span></span></p>'),(236967,76,0,102168,'<ul>\r\n<li>Dries Fast</li>\r\n<li>Moisture transport technology</li>\r\n<li>Eco-friendly </li>\r\n<li>Reusable</li>\r\n<li>Fresh Tasting Bladder</li>\r\n</ul>'),(236969,76,1,102168,'<p>Dries Fast<br />Moisture transport technology<br />Eco-friendly <br />Reusable<br />Fresh 