and off easily. </span></p>'),(382773,85,0,102213,'Pizza Peel, food and cooking supplies, pizza,'),(240627,85,1,102213,'pizza peel, blazing bull grills,'),(237083,75,0,102214,'This adapter allows you to connect your Blazing Bull to any 1 lb propane cylinder. Simply screw the adapter to your Blazing Bull regular hose for even more portability. Made of high quality and durable Copper and small enough to carry around. '),(237089,75,1,102214,'<p>This adapter allows you to connect your Blazing Bull to any 1 lb propane cylinder. Simply screw the adapter to your Blazing Bull regular hose for even more portability. Made of high quality and durable Copper and small enough to carry around.</p>'),(240628,76,1,102214,'<p><span>This adapter allows you to connect your Blazing Bull to any 1 lb propane cylinder.</span></p>'),(240629,85,1,102214,'propane adapter, blazing bull grills, propane grills, propane, Schwank Grills'),(237084,75,0,102215,'Perfect for outdoor barbecues, the Blazing Bull apron makes you look like a true grill master. Made of black denim and features a sleek 3D embroidered Blazing Bull logo on the front. '),(237090,75,1,102215,'<p>Perfect for outdoor barbecues, the Blazing Bull apron makes you look like a true grill master. Made of black denim and features a sleek 3D embroidered Schwank Grills logo on the front.</p>'),(240630,76,1,102215,'<p><span>Perfect for outdoor barbecues, the Schwank Grills apron makes you look like a true grill master.</span></p>'),(240631,85,1,102215,'grilling apron, blazing bull grills, outdoor bbq apron'),(237085,75,0,102216,'The stylish Blazing Bull cap is a great complement to any outfit and features a sleek Blazing Bull logo. Available in a red and black color scheme or a special edition white Blazing Bull logo with a red and white color scheme. The cap is adjustable for a comfortable and secure fit.'),(237091,75,1,102216,'<p>The stylish Blazing Bull cap is a great complement to any outfit and features a sleek Schwank Grills logo. The cap is adjustable for a comfortable and secure fit.</p>'),(240632,76,1,102216,'<p><span>The stylish Schwank Grills cap is a great complement to any outfit and features a sleek Blazing Bull logo. </span></p>'),(240633,85,1,102216,'apparel, blazing bull hats, best hats'),(237086,75,0,102217,'The stylish Blazing Bull cap is a great complement to any outfit and features a sleek Blazing Bull logo. Available in a red and black color scheme or a special edition white Blazing Bull logo with a red and white color scheme. The cap is adjustable for a comfortable and secure fit.'),(237092,75,1,102217,'<p>The stylish Schwank Grills cap is a great complement to any outfit and features a sleek Blazing Bull logo. The cap is adjustable for a comfortable and secure fit.</p>'),(240634,76,1,102217,'<p><span>The stylish Schwank Grills cap is a great complement to any outfit and features a sleek Blazing Bull logo. </span></p>'),(240635,85,1,102217,'apparel, blazing bull hats, best hats'),(237087,75,0,102218,'Made from 100% natural Cherry wood, this cutting board features a juice grove around the board to prevent juices from spill'),(237088,75,1,102218,'<p>Made from 100% natural Cherry wood, this cutting board features a juice grove around the board to prevent juices from spill</p>'),(240636,76,1,102218,'<p><span>Schwank Grills Cutting Board</span></p>\r\n<p><span>17\"L x 11\"W x 0.75\"H</span><span></span></p>'),(240637,85,1,102218,'cutting board, cherrywood cutting board, best cutting boards, blazing bull grills'),(240621,75,0,104227,'<h2><strong>The Schwank Grill fires up instantly with an electronic push button igniter and reaches 1500°F in less than 3 minutes. </strong> </h2>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>This infrared steak grill features overhead burners that heat from above to prevent flare ups. We’re excited to introduce a new and innovative way of grilling at home or on-the-go.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>No matter where you are, our portable infrared grill will perfectly sear your steak at 1500°F in only 60 seconds per side. This produces a delicious golden-brown crust without overcooking or drying out the steak.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Our 1500 degree grill will produce flavorful meat drippings that you’ll want to put to good use. The drip tray allows you to collect the juices to enhance the flavor of your steak. Add butter, spices, or oils to the drip pan to enhance the flavor even more.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Uses the exact same heating technology supplied to the world\'s best steakhouses such as Morton\'s, Del Frisco\'s, Palm Restaurant, CUT432, and many others to grill steak at 1500 degrees F and produce the juiciest and most flavorful steak possible.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Delicious golden-brown crust on the outside, tender and juicy on the inside. Grill your steak with the exact same infrared salamander broiler technology used only by the world\'s best steakhouses...well not anymore.</p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(657378,75,1,104227,'<h2><strong>The Schwank Grill fires up instantly with an electronic push button igniter and reaches 1500°F in less than 3 minutes. </strong> </h2>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>This infrared steak grill features overhead burners that heat from above to prevent flare ups. We’re excited to introduce a new and innovative way of grilling at home or on-the-go.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>No matter where you are, our portable infrared grill will perfectly sear your steak at 1500°F in only 60 seconds per side. This produces a delicious golden-brown crust without overcooking or drying out the steak.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Our 1500 degree grill will produce flavorful meat drippings that you’ll want to put to good use. The drip tray allows you to collect the juices to enhance the flavor of your steak. Add butter, spices, or oils to the drip pan to enhance the flavor even more.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Uses the exact same heating technology supplied to the world\'s best steakhouses such as Morton\'s, Del Frisco\'s, Palm Restaurant, CUT432, and many others to grill steak at 1500 degrees F and produce the juiciest and most flavorful steak possible.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Delicious golden-brown crust on the outside, tender and juicy on the inside. Grill your steak with the exact same infrared salamander broiler technology used only by the world\'s best steakhouses...well not anymore.</p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(240622,76,0,104227,'<p>Uses the exact same heating technology supplied to the world\'s best steakhouses such as Morton\'s, Del Frisco\'s, Palm Restaurant, CUT432, and many others to grill steak at 1500 degrees F and produce the juiciest and most flavorful steak possible. <span>While Blazing Bull is known for it\'s superior steaks, the intense radiant heat also intensities the flavor of chicken wings, seafood, hamburgers, vegetables and more! You can also cook delicious pizza with the pizza stone accessory.</span></p>'),(240623,85,0,104227,'grill, infrared grill, blazing bull grills, steaks, best grill for steaks, best infrared grill'),(240640,85,1,104227,'grill, infrared grill, blazing bull grills, steaks, best grill for steaks, best infrared grill'),(245533,75,0,106554,'<p><span>It\'s the product that started it all, KYSEK® The Ultimate Ice Chest! Engineered using the latest cooling technology and cutting-edge features, our cooler maximizes frigid temperatures to keep your goods colder longer. </span></p>\r\n<p><span>1. Code BlueTM Mini Temperature Sensor (*Sold separately) </span></p>\r\n<p><span>2. DuroColdTM Construction </span></p>\r\n<p><span>3. PosiLatchTM </span></p>\r\n<p><span>4. Cutting Board Lid </span></p>\r\n<p><span>5. BearClawTM Lock Plate/Bottle Opener </span></p>\r\n<p><span>6. Heavy-Duty EasyGripTM Handles </span></p>\r\n<p><span>7. HeavyHaulersTM Inset Wheels </span></p>\r\n<p><span>8. 2\" Drain Plug with Tethered Chain </span></p>\r\n<p><span>9. ZeroSkid™ Non-Slip Feet </span></p>\r\n<p><span>10. 3/4\" Drain Plug with Hose Adapter</span></p>'),(373479,75,1,106554,'<p><span>It\'s the product that started it all,