r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<div><span><span>External: 33.5\" x 20.5\" x 21.5\"</span><br /><span>Internal: 24.25\" x 12\" x 14.25\"</span></span></div>'),(247935,85,0,107790,'cooler, ice chest, best cooler for fishing, best coolers, best ice chests, kysek cooler,  best place for coolers '),(359700,85,1,107790,'cooler, ice chest, best cooler for fishing, best coolers, best ice chests, kysek cooler,  best place for coolers '),(247966,85,0,107804,'Ready gunner, Neal currey, Casey Currey, logo shirt, tshirt'),(249760,85,1,107804,'Ready gunner, Neal currey, Casey Currey, logo shirt, tshirt'),(247990,75,0,107813,'<p>This do-it-yourself antler mounting kit allows you to display both shed antlers and \'cut-off\' antlers EASILY. Simply change the width, change the angle, change antlers, and change the location based on your preference (wall or table mounted). The antlers are removable and the product allows for 360 degree ball rotation so you can display your antlers perfectly. This product is TOUGH (all metal construction), ADJUSTABLE (most versatility in the market), and emulates QUALITY. \'THE CHANGE UP\' uses: -Display shed antlers -Display antlers from a harvest (kids first buck) -European mount antlers (no need to clean the skull, just cut off the antlers) (Antlers not included)</p>'),(247992,75,1,107813,'<p>This do-it-yourself antler mounting kit allows you to display both shed antlers and \'cut-off\' antlers EASILY. Simply change the width, change the angle, change antlers, and change the location based on your preference (wall or table mounted). The antlers are removable and the product allows for 360 degree ball rotation so you can display your antlers perfectly. This product is TOUGH (all metal construction), ADJUSTABLE (most versatility in the market), and emulates QUALITY. \'THE CHANGE UP\' uses: -Display shed antlers -Display antlers from a harvest (kids first buck) -European mount antlers (no need to clean the skull, just cut off the antlers) (Antlers not included)</p>'),(247991,76,0,107813,'<p><span>Universal Match Set Antler mount (change antlers out, change spread, change direction, change position, change display location (wall to table), etc.) Manufactured out of cast aluminum mostly for strength and lightweight.</span></p>'),(247993,76,1,107813,'<p><span>Universal Match Set Antler mount (change antlers out, change spread, change direction, change position, change display location (wall to table), etc.) Manufactured out of cast aluminum mostly for strength and lightweight.</span></p>'),(247994,85,1,107813,NULL),(247998,75,0,107815,'<p>Designed for a single shed antler, the patent pending RH1 is manufactured from high-strength aluminum that has been anodized in a matte black finish. Our ball joint rotates on all axes allowing your trophy to be displayed in virtually any position. After you find that perfect position, simply tighten the top knurled cap. Your display orientation will remain intact and you’ll be able to remove your antler at any time, show it off, and then dock it back in place. Our clean minimal aesthetic ensures all of the focus will be on your trophy. Note: There is a set screw located on the bottom of the ball joint that can be tightened to ensure maximum security; this feature is optional and not necessary. - Display your son or daughters first set of antlers and change them out as they grow - If you\'re not into european mounts with the full skull look, you can cut off the antlers and display them - Showcase that buck you harvested as a 5 year old by displaying his match set shed beside his shoulder mount Package includes: - Fully assembled RH1 - Installation instructions - Antler insert - 5/16\" Brad point drill bit - 3/32” hex wrench - Mounting screws (x2) - (Antler Not Included) ADDED BENEFITS: | on/off removability | new antlers (insert packs) | toolless updating | just need a charged drill | simplest taxidermy available - mount your antlers in minutes! Installation Instructions Mount the RH1 bracket to a wall or desired location. Use the included 5/16\" brad point bit to drill into the base of the antler. (approximately 1 inch in depth) Place the provided insert into the base of the antler. Place the antler onto the hex stem (attached to the ball). Adjust antler positioning by rotating the ball and tightening the knurled top cap. Step back and enjoy your trophy, knowing that you can remove the antlers at any time.</p>'),(247999,76,0,107815,'<p><span>Single Antler Display (Modern antler display product. Mount shed antlers or cut-off antlers. Designed for any deer antler (whitetail, mule deer, coues deer, blacktail deer, fallow, sitka, Caribou, etc). Antlers can be positioned on the ball joint, and removed at any time. High-End all metal product.)</span></p>'),(248000,75,0,107816,'<p>Designed for a pair of shed antlers, the patent pending RH2 is manufactured from high-strength aluminum that has been anodized in a matte black finish. The two ball joint assemblies rotate on all axes allowing your antlers to be displayed in virtually any position. After you find that perfect position, simply tighten the top knurled cap. Your trophy orientation will remain intact and you’ll be able to remove your antlers at any time, show them off, and then dock them back in place. Our clean minimal aesthetic ensures all of the focus will be on your trophy. Note: There is a set screw located on the bottom of the ball joint that can be tightened to ensure maximum security; this feature is optional and not necessary. - Display your son or daughters first set of antlers and change them out as they grow - If you\'re not into european mounts with the full skull look, you can cut off the antlers and display them - Showcase that buck you harvested as a 5 year old by displaying his match set shed beside his shoulder mount Package includes: - Fully assembled RH2 - Installation instructions - Antler inserts (x2) - 5/16\" Brad point drill bit - 3/32” hex wrench - Mounting screws (x2) (antlers not included) Installation Instructions Mount the RH2 bracket to a wall or desired location. Use the included 5/16\" bit to drill into the base of the antler. (approximately 1 inch in depth) Place the provided insert into the base of the antler. Place each antler onto the hex stem (attached to the ball). Adjust antler positioning by rotating the ball and tightening the top knurled cap. Step back and enjoy your trophy, knowing that you can remove the antlers at any time. ADDED BENEFITS: | on/off removability | new antlers (insert packs) | toolless updating | just need a charged drill | simplest taxidermy available - mount your antlers in minutes!</p>'),(248001,76,0,107816,'<p><span>Match Set Antler Display (Modern antler display product. Mount shed antlers or cut-off antlers. Designed for any deer antler (whitetail, mule deer, coues deer, blacktail deer, fallow, sitka, Caribou, etc). Antlers can be positioned on the ball joints, and removed at any time. High-End all metal product.)</span></p>'),(248277,75,0,107835,'<p>One Piece Construction, Aggressive Bone Splitting Tanto Tip, Rear Cutting Blades For Maximum Wound Channels, No Vents For Silent Flight, Designed For Re-Use, Easy To Sharpen, Field Point accuracy 1 1/8\'\', Cutting Diameter, 3 Pack</p>'),(248279,75,1,107835,'<p>One Piece Construction, Aggressive Bone Splitting Tanto Tip, Rear Cutting Blades For Maximum Wound Channels, No Vents For Silent Flight, Designed For Re-Use, Easy To Sharpen, Field Point accuracy 1 1/8\'\', Cutting Diameter, 3 Pack</p>'),(248278,76,0,107835,'<p>Elite Series 3 Blade 100 gr.</p>'),(248280,76,1,107835,'<p>Elite Series 3 Blade 100 gr.</p>'),(248282,75,0,107836,'<p>3 Blade, 1 piece construction. Simply, flawless design with Field point accuracy and bone splitting tanto tip. Rear cutting blades and easy to sharpen for maximum longevity and re-use.</p>'),(315317,75,1,107836,'<p>3 Blade, 1 piece construction. Simply, flawless design