6 AR15 extractor</li>\r\n<li>17-4 stainless steel firing pin with spring</li>\r\n<li>Functions with all AR15 style PCC systems including:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Colt Style Magazine</li>\r\n<li>Glock Style Magazine</li>\r\n<li>Endomag</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 14.6 oz</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>100% USA Made</li>\r\n</ul>'),(265938,76,0,108934,'<p>The perfect 9mm bolt for your pistol caliber build. Meticulous machining and a gorgeous blue IonBond Deco PVD finish ensures perfect fit and function in your 9mm build.  This is probably the best 9mm bolt on the market.  And as always, if you break it during intended use, we’ll repair or replace it!</p>'),(252461,76,1,108934,NULL),(252394,85,0,108934,'9mm, ar, bolt, pvd, blue, '),(252462,85,1,108934,'9mm, ar, bolt, pvd, blue, ar15, bcg, bolt carrier group'),(254452,75,0,110069,'<p><strong>Product Summary: </strong><span></span><br /><span>This beautiful compact concealment purse by Roma Leathers features genuine cowhide leather, reinforced stitching, and quality gold-tone hardware. This small cross-body is crafted with a front decorative pocket with magnetic closure for your cell phone or other necessities. It has two main interiors with zip closures. The front interior compartment features two open pockets. The back compartment adds additional storage for your daily essentials.The adjustable cross-body strap is wire reinforced for added security.</span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><strong>Concealment Pocket Specifications:</strong><span> </span><br /><span>The concealed carry compartment is designed for right or left-handed use, zips open on 3 sides, and measures approximately 8\" W x 5-1/2\" H. It is secured with a locking YKK zipper with 2 keys. It is constructed of ballistic nylon and can accommodate a medium frame handgun. A universal holster is included which features Velcro hooks on both sides for a secure fit in the concealment pocket.</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Three sided/key-locking YKK zipper / includes 2 keys</li>\r\n<li>Universal elastic/nylon adjustable holster included</li>\r\n<li>Can accommodate medium framed handguns</li>\r\n<li>Concealment pocket measures 8” W x 5-1/2” H</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Quality genuine leather</li>\r\n<li>Front decorative pocket with magnetic closure</li>\r\n<li>Two main interiors/ two open pockets in front compartment</li>\r\n<li>Attractive gold-tone hardware</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable cross-body strap with wire reinforcement measures 48\" (Strap Drop - 12\" - 23\")</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Purse Dimensions:  </strong><span>9” W x 6.5” H x 2”</span></p>'),(670623,75,1,110069,'<p><strong>Product Summary: </strong><span></span><br /><span>This beautiful compact concealment purse by Roma Leathers features genuine cowhide leather, reinforced stitching, and quality gold-tone hardware. This small cross-body is crafted with a front decorative pocket with magnetic closure for your cell phone or other necessities. It has two main interiors with zip closures. The front interior compartment features two open pockets. The back compartment adds additional storage for your daily essentials.The adjustable cross-body strap is wire reinforced for added security.</span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><strong>Concealment Pocket Specifications:</strong><span> </span><br /><span>The concealed carry compartment is designed for right or left-handed use, zips open on 3 sides, and measures approximately 8\" W x 5-1/2\" H. It is secured with a locking YKK zipper with 2 keys. It is constructed of ballistic nylon and can accommodate a medium frame handgun. A universal holster is included which features Velcro hooks on both sides for a secure fit in the concealment pocket.</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Three sided/key-locking YKK zipper / includes 2 keys</li>\r\n<li>Universal elastic/nylon adjustable holster included</li>\r\n<li>Can accommodate medium framed handguns</li>\r\n<li>Concealment pocket measures 8” W x 5-1/2” H</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Quality genuine leather</li>\r\n<li>Front decorative pocket with magnetic closure</li>\r\n<li>Two main interiors/ two open pockets in front compartment</li>\r\n<li>Attractive gold-tone hardware</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable cross-body strap with wire reinforcement measures 48\" (Strap Drop - 12\" - 23\")</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Purse Dimensions:  </strong><span>9” W x 6.5” H x 2”</span></p>'),(254453,85,0,110069,'conceal, carry, purse, purple, small, crossbody, gold, holster'),(670624,85,1,110069,'conceal, carry, purse, purple, small, crossbody, gold, holster'),(254909,75,0,110517,'Take the high road in the Desert Adventure Pant. Sending out vintage vibes with a high rise cut and paper bag waist, the woven pant is finished with a tied rope belt and front and back pockets.'),(637387,75,1,110517,'Take the high road in the Desert Adventure Pant. Sending out vintage vibes with a high rise cut and paper bag waist, the woven pant is finished with a tied rope belt and front and back pockets.'),(254914,75,0,110573,'A Nixon icon that doesn’t take itself too seriously. Press a button and it yells the time and much more. Comes fully juiced, but when it does run low just plug in to your USB. This is easy, eye-free time telling that’s easy on the eyes.'),(637392,75,1,110573,'A Nixon icon that doesn’t take itself too seriously. Press a button and it yells the time and much more. Comes fully juiced, but when it does run low just plug in to your USB. This is easy, eye-free time telling that’s easy on the eyes.'),(255017,75,0,110705,'<div id=\"tab-description\" class=\"woocommerce-Tabs-panel woocommerce-Tabs-panel--description panel entry-content wc-tab\">\r\n<p class=\"pros_product_description\">Made from high quality premium faux/imitation leather decorated colored flowers, crosses and sugar skulls print with large colorful skull in the center on the front. Secure your possesions with its zip top closure. Spacious and designed to keep you organized with its single compartment fabric lined interior divided with a medium zipper pocket and a zippered wall pocket on inside rear. One secure zippered pocket on the back for a concealed carry handgun (8 x 5) and one open pocket that can fit 5 inch smartphone. Double flat chain handles. Two side pockets with flap that snap closed magnetically that can store your tissues, lipstick or any items you need to access quickly and easily. Metal feet on the bottom to keep the bag clean, protected and stable. Suitable for work, shopping, vacations, evenings out with friends or just to stand out and show off your western bling style and celebrate the day of the dead. 12.75 inches long X 8 inches tall x 4.5 inches wide.</p>\r\n<p class=\"pros_product_description\">Features</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made from high quality premium faux/imitation leather decorated colored flowers, crosses and sugar skulls print with large colorful skull in the center on the front</li>\r\n<li>Secure your possesions with its zip top closure; double flat chain handles</li>\r\n<li>Spacious and designed to keep you organized with its single compartment fabric lined interior divided with a medium zipper pocket and a zippered wall pocket on inside rear</li>\r\n<li>One secure zippered pocket on the back for a concealed carry handgun (8 x 5) and one open pocket that can fit 5 inch smartphone</li>\r\n<li>12.75 inches long X 8 inches tall x 4.5 inches wide</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>'),(255727,75,1,110705,'<div id=\"tab-description\" class=\"woocommerce-Tabs-panel woocommerce-Tabs-panel--description panel entry-content wc-tab\">\r\n<p class=\"pros_product_description\">Made from high quality premium faux/imitation leather decorated colored flowers, crosses and sugar skulls print with large colorful skull in the center on the front. Secure your possesions with its zip top closure. Spacious and designed to keep you organized with its single compartment fabric lined interior divided with a medium zipper pocket and a zippered wall pocket on inside rear. One secure zippered pocket on the back for a concealed carry handgun (8 x 5) and one open pocket that can fit 5 inch smartphone. Double flat chain handles. Two side pockets with flap that snap closed magnetically that can store your tissues, lipstick or any items you need to access quickly and easily. Metal feet on the bottom to keep the bag clean, protected and stable. Suitable for work, shopping, vacations, evenings out with friends or just to stand out and show off your western bling style and celebrate the day of the dead. 12.75 inches long X 8 inches tall x 4.5 inches wide.</p>\r\n<p class=\"pros_product_description\">Features</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made from high quality premium faux/imitation leather decorated colored flowers, crosses and sugar skulls print with large colorful skull in the center on the front</li>\r\n<li>Secure your possesions with its zip top closure; double flat chain handles</li>\r\n<li>Spacious and designed to keep you organized with its single compartment fabric lined interior divided with a medium zipper pocket and a zippered wall pocket on inside rear</li>\r\n<li>One secure zippered pocket on the back for a concealed carry handgun (8 x 5) and one open pocket that can fit 5 inch smartphone</li>\r\n<li>12.75 inches long X 8 inches tall x 4.5 inches wide</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>'),(255018,76,0,110705,'<p><span>Sugar Skull Purse with Gun Pocket</span></p>'),(255728,76,1,110705,'<p><span>Sugar Skull Purse with Gun Pocket</span></p>'),(255019,85,0,110705,'Sugar, Skull, Purse, conceal, pocket, pink, '),(255729,85,1,110705,'Sugar, Skull, Purse, conceal, pocket, pink, '),(255123,75,0,110877,'17\\\" Outseam\nHyperfreak Stretch\nO\'Neill Hyperdry\nAnti-rash Hyperthread\nSide zip pocket'),(637590,75,1,110877,'17\\\" Outseam\nHyperfreak Stretch\nO\'Neill Hyperdry\nAnti-rash Hyperthread\nSide zip pocket'),(255254,75,0,111081,'A short made to go wherever the trade winds lead you, the Kiss The Wind pairs an airy woven fabric with elevated style lines thanks to a slight paper bag waist. The high waisted woven short is finished with a broken-in feel, side pockets and a wide tie belt.'),(637715,75,1,111081,'A short made to go wherever the trade winds lead you, the Kiss The Wind pairs an airy woven fabric with elevated style lines thanks to a slight paper bag waist. The high waisted woven short is finished with a broken-in feel, side pockets and a wide tie belt.'),(255346,75,0,111188,'<div class=\\\"shogun-root\\\" data-shogun-id=\\\"5ae0d85a281399006dbeddf5\\\" data-shogun-site-id=\\\"1dcbcd2c-918e-435b-a768-aa607bb162ed\\\" data-shogun-page-id=\\\"5ae0d85a281399006dbeddf5\\\" data-shogun-page-version-id=\\\"5ae74e6c1c77a1007d93aaae\\\" data-region=\\\"main\\\"><div id=\\\"s-9b62e6fa-e995-48c6-9f9a-7b8635c35bc0\\\" class=\\\"shg-c  \\\"><p>A new and inspired, slim, straight fit, travel pant. Drawstring closure waistband with zipper fly, front extended long zip pocket with internal stash sleeve intended to accommodate all travel documents. Back patch pocket with button closure and small stash pocket at back yoke for quick cell phone storage. Back yoke vented mesh panel for breathability and comfort.</p></div></div>'),(637801,75,1,111188,'<div class=\\\"shogun-root\\\" data-shogun-id=\\\"5ae0d85a281399006dbeddf5\\\" data-shogun-site-id=\\\"1dcbcd2c-918e-435b-a768-aa607bb162ed\\\" data-shogun-page-id=\\\"5ae0d85a281399006dbeddf5\\\" data-shogun-page-version-id=\\\"5ae74e6c1c77a1007d93aaae\\\" data-region=\\\"main\\\"><div id=\\\"s-9b62e6fa-e995-48c6-9f9a-7b8635c35bc0\\\" class=\\\"shg-c  \\\"><p>A new and inspired, slim, straight fit, travel pant. Drawstring closure waistband with zipper fly, front extended long zip pocket with internal stash sleeve intended to accommodate all travel documents. Back patch pocket with button closure and small stash pocket at back yoke for quick cell phone storage. Back yoke vented mesh panel for breathability and comfort.</p></div></div>'),(255495,75,0,111383,'These slight cat-eye sunglasses have quickly become every girl\'s first essential on the packing list. The Norie gives off a certain something and channels your inner lady. They\'re slightly oversized and yet lightweight, the essential answer to everything.'),(637940,75,1,111383,'These slight cat-eye sunglasses have quickly become every girl\'s first essential on the packing list. The Norie gives off a certain something and channels your inner lady. They\'re slightly oversized and yet lightweight, the essential answer to everything.'),(255508,75,0,111408,'Jam/Volley - OPPOSITES ELASTIC'),(637952,75,1,111408,'Jam/Volley - OPPOSITES ELASTIC'),(255551,75,0,111476,'<p>When we hopped on the bikes to ride through the Highlands toward the Isle of Skye, the heaviest rains in a year decided to drop, putting us all in survival mode. Of course, it‚Äôs not a real trip if Nature doesn‚Äôt have her way with you.</p>'),(637992,75,1,111476,'<p>When we hopped on the bikes to ride through the Highlands toward the Isle of Skye, the heaviest rains in a year decided to drop, putting us all in survival mode. Of course, it‚Äôs not a real trip if Nature doesn‚Äôt have her way with you.</p>'),(255621,75,0,111559,'<p>Originally designed for the Jamaican Orcabessa Sanctuary Fishing Wardens, with mixed fabric construction and 4-way stretch body paneling with non-stretch durable Nylon Supplex in the back and thru the waistband. Nylon Supplex adds durability for extended wear. Side zipper pocket with internal drainage holes and side utility tool pocket. Specifically placed seam angles drive performance and eliminate chafing and seam obstruction.</p>'),(373551,75,1,111559,'<p>Originally designed for the Jamaican Orcabessa Sanctuary Fishing Wardens, with mixed fabric construction and 4-way stretch body paneling with non-stretch durable Nylon Supplex in the back and thru the waistband. Nylon Supplex adds durability for extended wear. Side zipper pocket with internal drainage holes and side utility tool pocket. Specifically placed seam angles drive performance and eliminate chafing and seam obstruction.</p>'),(255638,75,0,111582,'<p>A classic Roark signature style. Midweight brushed cotton stretch twill. Slim straight fit, slash front pockets, front coin pocket and custom back welt pockets.</p><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">'),(638078,75,1,111582,'<p>A classic Roark signature style. Midweight brushed cotton stretch twill. Slim straight fit, slash front pockets, front coin pocket and custom back welt pockets.</p><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">'),(255731,75,0,111707,'Your copilot for chilled-out days and weekend wanderings, the Road Trippin takes you from lounge to lunch dates with a comfort-driven elastic waist. The womens striped short takes on retro-inspired lines with a scalloped hem, while a well-worn wash seals in lived-in lines.'),(638167,75,1,111707,'Your copilot for chilled-out days and weekend wanderings, the Road Trippin takes you from lounge to lunch dates with a comfort-driven elastic waist. The womens striped short takes on retro-inspired lines with a scalloped hem, while a well-worn wash seals in lived-in lines.'),(255796,75,0,111810,'High waisted swim is in, and with the Simply Solid Retro, you will be too. Made with Econyl® regenerated fibers, REPREVE® recycled fibers and water-saving digital sublimated printing technology, this black retro bottom is truly sustainable swimwear - a perfect fit for your conscious lifestyle.\n\nFull Coverage Fit\n78% Econyl Regenerated Nylon / 22% Elastane Tricot, Lining: 92% Repreve Polyester / 8% Elastane Digitally Sublimated Printed Jersey\nPull on retro bottom with multi strap knotted cut outs at wearer\'s sides\nVolcom Stone contrast embroidery at wearer\'s back right waist opening\nMade of Italian fabric\nEco-True: Made with Econyl® regerated nylon, Repreve® recycled fibers, &amp; water saving Digital Sublimation Printing'),(638231,75,1,111810,'High waisted swim is in, and with the Simply Solid Retro, you will be too. Made with Econyl® regenerated fibers, REPREVE® recycled fibers and water-saving digital sublimated printing technology, this black retro bottom is truly sustainable swimwear - a perfect fit for your conscious lifestyle.\n\nFull Coverage Fit\n78% Econyl Regenerated Nylon / 22% Elastane Tricot, Lining: 92% Repreve Polyester / 8% Elastane Digitally Sublimated Printed Jersey\nPull on retro bottom with multi strap knotted cut outs at wearer\'s sides\nVolcom Stone contrast embroidery at wearer\'s back right waist opening\nMade of Italian fabric\nEco-True: Made with Econyl® regerated nylon, Repreve® recycled fibers, &amp; water saving Digital Sublimation Printing'),(255889,75,0,112412,'Separate Top - SOLID TIE FRONT'),(638314,75,1,112412,'Separate Top - SOLID TIE FRONT'),(256076,75,0,112744,'A calculated dose of fresh print, the Stacked Fill serves up graphics and a modern logo, neatly boxed for a minimalist aesthetic. Made from premium cotton jersey, the men’s pocket t-shirt offers up custom artwork printed in soft hand ink at the left chest pocket and center back. The short sleeve pocket tee is finished with a heat sealed neck label to maintain a comfortable feel throughout.'),(638500,75,1,112744,'A calculated dose of fresh print, the Stacked Fill serves up graphics and a modern logo, neatly boxed for a minimalist aesthetic. Made from premium cotton jersey, the men’s pocket t-shirt offers up custom artwork printed in soft hand ink at the left chest pocket and center back. The short sleeve pocket tee is finished with a heat sealed neck label to maintain a comfortable feel throughout.'),(256139,75,0,112832,'Boardshort - TRIBONG PRO'),(638560,75,1,112832,'Boardshort - TRIBONG PRO'),(258131,75,0,114716,'ScentLok hunters are not only some of the most knowledgeable hunters in the woods, they are also some of the most dedicated throughout the year. Our durable logowear helps them proudly show off their ScentLok loyalty whether they\'re planting food plots or talk