ut with natural variability in size (7.5-8.5 oz) Carefully wrapped in parchment paper prior to vacuum sealing. This extra step ensures the salmon never touches plastic, and provides an extra barrier that locks in premium quality. </span></p>'),(262915,76,0,117110,'<p><span>Wild Alaskan Copper River Coho are a popular salmon known for a bright color, firm texture and mild flavor. </span></p>'),(262916,85,0,117110,'Alaskan salmon, sena sea, copper river salmon'),(262917,75,0,117111,'<p><span>Wild Alaskan Copper River Coho are a popular salmon that run in August and September. Coho are know for a mild flavor and firm texture. They are bigger, fatter fish than sockeye so we cut them into larger 8oz portions, with pin-bones removed. Our Copper River Coho salmon are wild and sustainably caught out of Cordova, AK using small gillnet boats. 2020 season Copper River Coho: Known as one of the best tasting Salmon Rich reddish-orange color Medium fat, mild buttery flavor and firm texture Good source of healthy Omega 3’s (EPA and DHA) Sushi quality Wild caught, never farmed! Our 8 oz portions: Arrive individually frozen and are packed to last in your freezer for up to 1 year Defrost quickly for a gourmet meal at home pin bones pulled out Hand cut with natural variability in size (7.5-8.5 oz) Carefully wrapped in parchment paper prior to vacuum sealing. This extra step ensures the salmon never touches plastic, and provides an extra barrier that locks in premium quality. </span></p>'),(262918,76,0,117111,'<p><span>Wild Alaskan Copper River Coho are a popular salmon known for a bright color, firm texture and mild flavor. </span></p>'),(262919,85,0,117111,'Alaskan salmon, sena sea, copper river salmon'),(262920,75,0,117112,'<p>The original all-in-one Brute Box kit with everything you need to start magnet fishing now comes in a double-sided version.  This handy waterproof hardshell plastic carrying case includes one double sided magnet (3.70\" - 1,200 lb combined pull), cut resistant