n>Our smoked salmon jars are a beautiful, delicious and healthy gift that you can be proud to give or serve.</span></p>'),(263233,85,0,117273,'sena sea, wild alaskan smoked salmon jar, '),(263304,75,0,117309,'Whether you\'re going from the office to the gym or the course to the clubhouse, the Everyday Sock was designed for one thing, everyday life.'),(263306,75,1,117309,'Whether you\'re going from the office to the gym or the course to the clubhouse, the Everyday Sock was designed for one thing, everyday life.'),(263307,75,0,117311,'Whether you\'re going from the office to the gym or the course to the clubhouse, the Everyday Sock was designed for one thing, everyday life.'),(263308,75,1,117311,'Whether you\'re going from the office to the gym or the course to the clubhouse, the Everyday Sock was designed for one thing, everyday life.'),(263311,75,0,117313,'It is ScentLok’s mission to make sure each step you take with our socks gives you more comfort, determination and confidence than the one before it.'),(263312,75,1,117313,'It is ScentLok’s mission to make sure each step you take with our socks gives you more comfort, determination and confidence than the one before it.'),(263512,75,0,117413,'It is ScentLok’s mission to make sure each step you take with our socks gives you more comfort, determination and confidence than the one before it.'),(263514,75,1,117413,'It is ScentLok’s mission to make sure each step you take with our socks gives you more comfort, determination and confidence than the one before it.'),(263520,75,0,117418,'It is ScentLok’s mission to make sure each step you take with our socks gives you more comfort, determination and confidence than the one before it.'),(670627,75,1,117418,'It is ScentLok’s mission to make sure each step you take with our socks gives you more comfort, determination and confidence than the one before it.'),(263532,75,0,117423,'It is ScentLok’s mission to make sure each step you take with our socks gives you more comfort, determination and confidence than the one before it.'),(263535,75,1,117423,'It is ScentLok’s mission to make sure each step you take with our socks gives you more comfort, determination and confidence than the one before it.'),(263735,75,0,117523,'<p><span>Ideal for a wide range of applications including hunting, shooting, home defense or tactical, this lightweight but powerful flashlight features a selector switch with 3 modes: 600 lumens, 100 lumens and strobe. Its exceptionally bright Cree® T6 LED bulb delivers a solid beam of light essential for emergency situations or decoying specific targets. The Sightmark® SS600 Flashlight includes red, green and blue filters to maximize product use. Green filters assist in map reading, while red filters help to preserve night vision and assist with varmint hunting, helping to avoid being detected by targeted prey. Blue filters assist in illuminating blood trails. Featuring an Aircraft-grade aluminum construction and type II MIL-SPEC anodizing, this high-intensity flashlight is extremely durable, resistant against corrosion and heavy recoil. With a weather resistance rating of IP67, the unit is dustproof and waterproof, ready for the harshest climates and tactical situations. The SS600 Flashlight is designed with a 3-prong, glass-breaking bezel, equipping operators with a powerful self-defense tool to escape out of windows when desperately needed. It also includes a lanyard for secure attachment to a user\'s wrist, belt loop or backpack.</span></p>'),(268205,75,1,117523,'<p><span>Ideal for a wide range of applications including hunting, shooting, home defense or tactical, this lightweight but powerful flashlight features a selector switch with 3 modes: 600 lumens, 100 lumens and strobe. Its exceptionally bright Cree® T6 LED bulb delivers a solid beam of light essential for emergency situations or decoying specific targets. The Sightmark® SS600 Flashlight includes red, green and blue filters to maximize product use. Green filters assist in map reading, while red filters help to preserve night vision and assist with varmint hunting, helping to avoid being detected by targeted prey. Blue filters assist in illuminating blood trails. Featuring an Aircraft-grade aluminum construction and type II MIL-SPEC anodizing, this high-intensity flashlight is extremely durable, resistant against corrosion and heavy recoil. With a weather resistance rating of IP67, the unit is dustproof and waterproof, ready for the harshest climates and tactical situations. The SS600 Flashlight is designed with a 3-prong, glass-breaking bezel, equipping operators with a powerful self-defense tool to escape out of windows when desperately needed. It also includes a lanyard for secure attachment to a user\'s wrist, belt loop or backpack.</span></p>'),(263736,76,0,117523,'<p>600 Lumen Cree LED<br />2-stage push on / off button<br />3 stage selector switch with variable brightness and strobe<br />Aircraft grade aluminum construction<br />3-prong glass breaking bezel<br />Waterproof and dustproof<br />Type II Mil-spec anodizing<br />Shockproof<br />Weapons Mountable</p>'),(268206,76,1,117523,'<p>600 Lumen Cree LED<br />2-stage push on / off button<br />3 stage selector switch with variable brightness and strobe<br />Aircraft grade aluminum construction<br />3-prong glass breaking bezel<br />Waterproof and dustproof<br />Type II Mil-spec anodizing<br />Shockproof<br />Weapons Mountable</p>'),(263737,85,0,117523,'flashlight, ss600 flashlight, sightmark, 600 lumen flashlight'),(268207,85,1,117523,'flashlight, ss600 flashlight, sightmark, 600 lumen flashlight'),(263858,75,0,117585,'It is ScentLok’s mission to make sure each step you take with our socks gives you more comfort, determination and confidence than the one before it.'),(263860,75,1,117585,'It is ScentLok’s mission to make sure each step you take with our socks gives you more comfort, determination and confidence than the one before it.'),(263861,75,0,117586,'<p><span>Equipped with a high output 280 Cree® LED light beam, the Sightmark® RC280 Triple Duty Tactical Flashlight illuminates the darkest paths. The RC280 is rechargeable and comes with plugs for both U.S. and European outlets. In emergency situations, the rechargeable battery can be replaced with CR123 batteries to extend operation longer. Yielding an IP67 weather rating, the RC280 is 100% dustproof and submergible to 1 meter for 1 hour. Its aircraft-grade aluminum construction and type II MIL-SPEC anodizing makes this tool both incredibly durable and resistant to abuse on AR-15s. Featuring Sightmark\'s patented 3-prong Glass-Breaking Bezel head ring and tail cap. This device operates with the Rechargeable Battery Pack (SM28016).</span></p>'),(268240,75,1,117586,'<p><span>Equipped with a high output 280 Cree® LED light beam, the Sightmark® RC280 Triple Duty Tactical Flashlight illuminates the darkest paths. The RC280 is rechargeable and comes with plugs for both U.S. and European outlets. In emergency situations, the rechargeable battery can be replaced with CR123 batteries to extend operation longer. Yielding an IP67 weather rating, the RC280 is 100% dustproof and submergible to 1 meter for 1 hour. Its aircraft-grade aluminum construction and type II MIL-SPEC anodizing makes this tool both incredibly durable and resistant to abuse on AR-15s. Featuring Sightmark\'s patented 3-prong Glass-Breaking Bezel head ring and tail cap. This device operates with the Rechargeable Battery Pack (SM28016).</span></p>'),(263862,76,0,117586,'<p>280 lumen Cree LED<br />2-stage push on/off button<br />Rechargeable<br />Type II mil-spec anodizing<br />Multi-faceted reflector<br />Aircraft grade aluminum<br />Waterproof and dustproof<br />Shockproof<br />Weapons Mountable</p>'),(268241,76,1,117586,'<p>280 lumen Cree LED<br />2-stage push on/off button<br />Rechargeable<br />Type II mil-spec anodizing<br />Multi-faceted reflector<br />Aircraft grade aluminum<br />Waterproof and dustproof<br />Shockproof<br />Weapons Mountable</p>'),(263863,85,0,117586,'flashlight, weapon light, ar15 mountable light, sightmark light'),(268242,85,1,117586,'flashlight, weapon light, ar15 mountable light, sightmark light'),(263866,75,0,117589,'It is ScentLok’s mission to make sure each step you take with our socks gives you more comfort, determination and confidence than the one before it.'),(670628,75,1,117589,'It is ScentLok’s mission to make sure each step you take with our socks gives you more comfort, determination and confidence than the one before it.'),(263877,75,0,117594,'It is ScentLok’s mission to make sure each step you take with our socks gives you more comfort, determination and confidence than the one before.'),(263879,75,1,117594,'It is ScentLok’s mission to make sure each step you take with our socks gives you more comfort, determination and confidence than the one before.'),(263938,75,0,117624,'<p><span>The Solitude 11-33x50SE Spotting Scope Kit is ideal for a wide range of applications including target shooting, game scouting/tracking, police surveillance, or sniper spotting. Built with quality materials in a variety of ranges, Sightmark spotting scopes are designed with comfortable eye-relief for long periods of use.All spotting scopes come equipped with a versatile tripod and carry case that keep the optics protected in the field. Designed with a straight eye piece and rotatable mount ring, Sightmark spotting scopes feature an advanced aluminum prism coating for optimal light transmission. The Solitude spotting scopes are developed with a porro prism optical system to provide a wide field of view to easily scout and track game. The straight eyepiece design allows users to comfortably spot for long periods of time, in many conditions. Sightmark spotting scopes boast a rugged, lightweight, rubber-armored body that are nitrogen-filled and O-ring sealed, making them waterproof and fogproof. Adjustable eye cups provide a comfortable, custom fit for all users whether they are wearing glasses or not. Featuring a dustproof construction, Sightmark spotting scopes are exceptionally reliable for a lifetime of use.</span></p>'),(359640,75,1,117624,'<p>The Solitude 11-33x50SE Spotting Scope Kit is ideal for a wide range of applications including target shooting, game scouting/tracking, police surveillance, or sniper spotting.</p>\r\n<p>Built with quality materials in a variety of ranges, Sightmark spotting scopes are designed with comfortable eye-relief for long periods of use.All spotting scopes come equipped with a versatile tripod and carry case that keep the optics protected in the field.</p>\r\n<p>Designed with a straight eye piece and rotatable mount ring, Sightmark spotting scopes feature an advanced aluminum prism coating for optimal light transmission.</p>\r\n<p>The Solitude spotting scopes are developed with a porro prism optical system to provide a wide field of view to easily scout and track game. The straight eyepiece design allows users to comfortably spot for long periods of time, in many conditions.</p>\r\n<p>Sightmark spotting scopes boast a rugged, lightweight, rubber-armored body that are nitrogen-filled and O-ring sealed, making them waterproof and fogproof.</p>\r\n<p>Adjustable eye cups provide a comfortable, custom fit for all users whether they are wearing glasses or not. Featuring a dustproof construction, Sightmark spotting scopes are exceptionally reliable for a lifetime of use.</p>'),(263939,76,0,117624,'<p>Fully multi-coated optics<br />100% reflective advanced aluminum prism coatings<br />Porro prism optical system<br />Straight eyepiece design<br />Compact design<br />Lightweight<br />Twist-up eyecup<br />Built-in tripod adapter<br />Waterproof and fogproof</p>'),(359641,76,1,117624,'<p>Fully multi-coated optics<br />100% reflective advanced aluminum prism coatings<br />Porro prism optical system<br />Straight eyepiece design<br />Compact design<br /><br /></p>'),(263940,85,0,117624,'spotting scope, sightmark solitude'),(359642,85,1,117624,'spotting scope, sightmark solitude'),(264026,75,0,117668,'<p><span>Designed with reticle holdover points out to 200 yards, the Sightmark Core SX 4x32 .22 LR Rimfire Riflescope is the perfect optic for small game hunters and target shooters. This specialty scope features a .22 LR BDC reticle, calibrated for 40gr standard velocity and 29gr high velocity, for increased accuracy in a variety of conditions. Constructed from a single piece of aircraft grade aluminum, this riflescope is built with a one inch tube and a hard anodized finish that is shockproof, fogproof, and waterproof. This Core SX 4x32 scope features multi-coated lenses and resettable capped turrets for exceptional dependability, rain or shine.</span></p>'),(268316,75,1,117668,'<p><span>Designed with reticle holdover points out to 200 yards, the Sightmark Core SX 4x32 .22 LR Rimfire Riflescope is the perfect optic for small game hunters and target shooters. This specialty scope features a .22 LR BDC reticle, calibrated for 40gr standard velocity and 29gr high velocity, for increased accuracy in a variety of conditions. Constructed from a single piece of aircraft grade aluminum, this riflescope is built with a one inch tube and a hard anodized finish that is shockproof, fogproof, and waterproof. This Core SX 4x32 scope features multi-coated lenses and resettable capped turrets for exceptional dependability, rain or shine.</span></p>'),(264027,76,0,117668,'<p>.22LR 40gr SV/29gr HV BDC reticle<br />Reticle holdover points out to 200 yards<br />Single-piece, 1\" tube<br />Aircraft grade aluminum<br />Hard anodized finish<br />Resettable, Capped turrets<br />Shockproof, fogproof, waterproof<br />Multi-coated optics</p>'),(268317,76,1,117668,'<p>.22LR 40gr SV/29gr HV BDC reticle<br />Reticle holdover points out to 200 yards<br />Single-piece, 1\" tube<br />Aircraft grade aluminum<br />Hard anodized finish<br />Resettable, Capped turrets<br />Shockproof, fogproof, waterproof<br />Multi-coated optics</p>'),(264028,85,0,117668,'riflescope, scope for hunting, hunting rifle scope, 22lr scope, rimfire scope'),(268318,85,1,117668,'riflescope, scope for hunting, hunting rifle scope, 22lr scope, rimfire scope'),(264069,75,0,117689,'It is ScentLok’s mission to make sure each step you take with our socks gives you more comfort, determination and confidence than the one before.'),(670629,75,1,117689,'It is ScentLok’s mission to make sure each step you take with our socks gives you more comfort, determination and confidence than the one before.'),(264125,75,0,117718,'<p><span>The Firefield® Agility 1x25 with Multi-Dot Reticle is the ideal optical device for hunting applications such as turkey, birds or deer, as well as sporting clays and competitive shooting. The Agility 1x25 is equipped with a variety of dot sizes, available in red and green: 1 MOA, 3 MOA, 5 MOA and 10 MOA. Featuring a weaver mount, the unit can be mounted to any Firearm equipped with a weaver or picatinny rail. Its low-profile design keeps the sight low on a scout rifle or shotgun barrel, making it less intrusive to your line of sight. The unit also sits closer to the bore, eliminating the need for additional adjustments and making it easier to sight in. The Agility 1x25 Dot Sight features unlimited eye relief for comfortable viewing and is parallax corrected, ensuring the reticle remains in the same spot regardless of target range and aiming position. Engineered with an ergonomic, aluminum housing for exceptional durability and a weatherproof rating of IPX6, this device is nitrogen-filled, fog proof and shock proof, allowing for reliable use in a wide range of environments.</span></p>'),(268138,75,1,117718,'<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.999999999999998pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Firefield Agility 1x25 Dot Sight with Multi-Dot Reticle</span></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The Firefield® Agility 1x25 with Multi-Dot Reticle is the candidate when it comes to a quality hunting, sporting or competitive shooting scope. </span></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The weaver mount design enables this multi-dot reticle sight to be mounted to nearly any firearm with a weaver or picatinny rail. </span></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The multi-colored red or green dot sight and low profile design make the Firefield Agility 1x25 among sporting enthusiasts across the globe. </span></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Specs: </span></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Flip lens and caps included</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Detailed mounting manual, batteries, and mounting rings included</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">1x Magnification allows for the ultimate situational awareness and ability</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Quick Target Acquisition</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Weatherproof And Shockproof</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Parallax Corrected</span></p>'),(264126,76,0,117718,'<p>Unlimited Eye Relief<br />Rugged Durable Design<br />Red Or Green Multi-Dot<br />1x Magnification For Both Eyes Open Shooting For Superior Environmental Awareness<br />Quick Target Acquisition<br />Weatherproof And Shockproof<br />Parallax Corrected</p>'),(268139,76,1,117718,'<p>The weaver mount design enables this multi-dot reticle sight to be mounted to nearly any firearm with a weaver or picatinny rail. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>The multi-colored red or green dot sight and low profile design make the Firefield Agility 1x25 among sporting enthusiasts across the globe. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• Flip lens and caps included</p>\r\n<p>• Detailed mounting manual, batteries, and mounting rings included</p>\r\n<p>• 1x Magnification allows for the ultimate situational awareness and ability</p>\r\n<p>• Quick Target Acquisition</p>\r\n<p>• Weatherproof And Shockproof</p>\r\n<p>• Parallax Corrected</p>'),(264127,85,0,117718,'red dot reticle, firefield '),(268140,85,1,117718,'red dot reticle, firefield '),(264128,75,0,117719,'<p><span>Perfect for home defense, night shooting and tactical situations, the Speedstrike Green Laser Sight helps you strike targets with ease and agility. This 532nm green laser features a modular mount allowing multiple configurations for one or more sights on your firearm. Hand adjustments allow easy elevation and windage changes without using tools. The Speedstrike is quickly activated through the use of a pressure pad and lasts for 25 hours on one CR123A battery. Weighing just 6.3 oz, this green laser is shockproof and IP55 water resistant.</span></p>'),(268159,75,1,117719,'<p><span>Perfect for home defense, night shooting and tactical situations, the Speedstrike Green Laser Sight helps you strike targets with ease and agility. This 532nm green laser features a modular mount allowing multiple configurations for one or more sights on your firearm. Hand adjustments allow easy elevation and windage changes without using tools. The Speedstrike is quickly activated through the use of a pressure pad and lasts for 25 hours on one CR123A battery. Weighing just 6.3 oz, this green laser is shockproof and IP55 water resistant.</span></p>'),(264129,76,0,117719,'<p>Modular modifiable mount design<br />Visible green laser<br />Powered by a single CR123A battery<br />Push button or pressure pad operation<br />Hand adjustable windage and elevation</p>'),(268160,76,1,117719,'<p>Modular modifiable mount design<br />Visible green laser<br />Powered by a single CR123A battery<br />Push button or pressure pad operation<br />Hand adjustable windage and elevation</p>'),(264130,85,0,117719,'green laser sight, home defense, night shooting'),(268161,85,1,117719,'green laser sight, home defense, night shooting'),(264131,75,0,117720,'<p><span>Ideal for target shooting and hunting of all kinds, the parallax corrected Agility 1x30 Red Dot Sight is designed specifically for use on shotguns. A perfect close-range sight for quick target acquisition, the Agility features a shotgun mount compatible on Remington 870, 1100 and 1187 models. Multiple reticle options and the choice of red or green reticle illumination allow ultimate shooter preference for different shooting scenarios. Lightweight and extremely durable, the Agility only weighs 10.8 oz. with mount and provides IPX5 weatherproof, shockproof and fog proof protection. 12-440 hours of operating life is achieved using 1 CR2032 battery. The Agility utilizes flip up lens caps to protect the glass when not in use. </span></p>'),(268182,75,1,117720,'<p><span>Ideal for target shooting and hunting of all kinds, the parallax corrected Agility 1x30 Red Dot Sight is designed specifically for use on shotguns. A perfect close-range sight for quick target acquisition, the Agility features a shotgun mount compatible on Remington 870, 1100 and 1187 models. Multiple reticle options and the choice of red or green reticle illumination allow ultimate shooter preference for different shooting scenarios. Lightweight and extremely durable, the Agility only weighs 10.8 oz. with mount and provides IPX5 weatherproof, shockproof and fog proof protection. 12-440 hours of operating life is achieved using 1 CR2032 battery. The Agility utilizes flip up lens caps to protect the glass when not in use. </span></p>'),(264132,76,0,117720,'<ul class=\"square-style ml-2\">\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Flip up caps</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Red and green reticle illumination</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Multiple reticles</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Works with semiauto and pump action Remington 870/1100/1187</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Parallax corrected optical system</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Durable, lightweight aluminum construction</li>\r\n</ul>'),(268183,76,1,117720,'<ul class=\"square-style ml-2\">\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Flip up caps</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Red and green reticle illumination</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Multiple reticles</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Works with semiauto and pump action Remington 870/1100/1187</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Parallax corrected optical system</li>\r\n<li class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Durable, lightweight aluminum construction</li>\r\n</ul>'),(264133,85,0,117720,'red dot, shotgun red dot, red dot scope'),(268184,85,1,117720,'red dot, shotgun red dot, red dot scope'),(264138,75,0,117723,'<p><span>Equipped with 1,000 lumens of powerful, white LED illumination, the Firefield T1,000 Flashlight delivers crisp, clear visibility in pitch black darkness at a distance of 300 yards. Featuring up to 7 hours of battery life, the flashlight has five modes: high at 1,000 lumens; medium at 700 lumens; low at 300 lumens; strobe at 1,000 lumens for disorientating targets; and SOS at 1,000 lumens for survival situations. With a durable, aluminum housing and long, lightweight body (less than 3 lbs.), the TXL 1,000 is built for a lifetime of use. Its weatherproof, shockproof frame and diamond pattern, non-slip grip provide superior reliability in inclement weather conditions.</span></p>'),(268149,75,1,117723,'<p><span>Equipped with 1,000 lumens of powerful, white LED illumination, the Firefield T1,000 Flashlight delivers crisp, clear visibility in pitch black darkness at a distance of 300 yards. Featuring up to 7 hours of battery life, the flashlight has five modes: high at 1,000 lumens; medium at 700 lumens; low at 300 lumens; strobe at 1,000 lumens for disorientating targets; and SOS at 1,000 lumens for survival situations. With a durable, aluminum housing and long, lightweight body (less than 3 lbs.), the TXL 1,000 is built for a lifetime of use. Its weatherproof, shockproof frame and diamond pattern, non-slip grip provide superior reliability in inclement weather conditions.</span></p>'),(264139,76,0,117723,'<p>1000 Lumen White Led<br />Variable Brightness Strobe And Sos Modes<br />Durable Aluminum Housing<br />Weatherproof And Shockproof<br />Diamond pattern texture for non-slip grip</p>'),(268150,76,1,117723,'<p>1000 Lumen White Led<br />Variable Brightness Strobe And Sos Modes<br />Durable Aluminum Housing<br />Weatherproof And Shockproof<br />Diamond pattern texture for non-slip grip</p>'),(264140,85,0,117723,'flashlight, 1000 lumens, 1,000 lumens, led flashlight'),(268151,85,1,117723,'flashlight, 1000 lumens, 1,000 lumens, led flashlight'),(264141,75,0,117724,'<p><span>Keep superior nighttime visibility without losing peripheral vision with the Firefield® Nightfall 4x50 Night Vision Monocular. Featuring a powerful, built-in PULSE IR illuminator, this high quality device produces a crisp, clear image, perfect for use in hunting, security and general observation situations. The Nightfall 4x50 Monocular is used with one eye only, allowing the other eye to maintain optimal vision. A high resolution intensifier and multi-coated optics ensure a clear, bright image and detailed resolution. Its modern, ergonomic design features a rubber-armored body and lightweight frame, making a perfect addition to any marksman™s arsenal. The unit is also water resistant, letting nothing stand in the way of your target.</span></p>'),(268191,75,1,117724,'<p><span>Keep superior nighttime visibility without losing peripheral vision with the Firefield® Nightfall 4x50 Night Vision Monocular. Featuring a powerful, built-in PULSE IR illuminator, this high quality device produces a crisp, clear image, perfect for use in hunting, security and general observation situations. The Nightfall 4x50 Monocular is used with one eye only, allowing the other eye to maintain optimal vision. A high resolution intensifier and multi-coated optics ensure a clear, bright image and detailed resolution. Its modern, ergonomic design features a rubber-armored body and lightweight frame, making a perfect addition to any marksman™s arsenal. The unit is also water resistant, letting nothing stand in the way of your target.</span></p>'),(264142,76,0,117724,'<p>High Quality Image And Resolution<br />High Power Built-In Infrared Illumination<br />Ergonomic Design<br />1/4\'\' Socket For Tripod Mounting Lightweight And Durable Design</p>'),(268192,76,1,117724,'<p>High Quality Image And Resolution<br />High Power Built-In Infrared Illumination<br />Ergonomic Design<br />1/4\'\' Socket For Tripod Mounting Lightweight And Durable Design</p>'),(264143,85,0,117724,'nightvision, monocular, night vision monocular'),(268193,85,1,117724,'nightvision, monocular, night vision monocular'),(264144,75,0,117725,'The new OZChamber 8K storage bag offers a durable and convenient storage solution now with the added power of ozone! Our innovative new ventilation system,  OZInject™, pairs directly with our OZ500 unit to evenly distribute ozone throughout the bag for a balanced attack on odors inside the OZChamber 8K. OZ will help keep your gear fresh and ready for the field while assisting in the reactivation process of carbon clothing along the way.<br><br>• Extremely durable <br>600D PVC backed polyester fabric <br>• OZInject™ internal piping <br>Perfect to pair with the OZ500 to distribute ozone<br>• Carbon Adsorber included <br>Adsorbs odors from your gear and the air inside container <br>• DWR finish<br>Helps shed moisture to keep your gear dry <br>• Five internal mesh pockets <br>Includes built in OZ500 pocket & quick access to OzInject™ piping <br>• Removable, adjustable shoulder strap<br>For comfortable, convenient carrying <br>• Airtight side pocket<br>To keep some items separated if needed<br>• Durable 2\" grab straps<br>Perfect for hauling heavy loads <br>• Dimensions<br>32\" W x 16\" H X 16\" D '),(264145,75,1,117725,'The new OZChamber 8K storage bag offers a durable and convenient storage solution now with the added power of ozone! Our innovative new ventilation system,  OZInject™, pairs directly with our OZ500 unit to evenly distribute ozone throughout the bag for a balanced attack on odors inside the OZChamber 8K. OZ will help keep your gear fresh and ready for the field while assisting in the reactivation process of carbon clothing along the way.<br><br>• Extremely durable <br>600D PVC backed polyester fabric <br>• OZInject™ internal piping <br>Perfect to pair with the OZ500 to distribute ozone<br>• Carbon Adsorber included <br>Adsorbs odors from your gear and the air inside container <br>• DWR finish<br>Helps shed moisture to keep your gear dry <br>• Five internal mesh pockets <br>Includes built in OZ500 pocket & quick access to OzInject™ piping <br>• Removable, adjustable shoulder strap<br>For comfortable, convenient carrying <br>• Airtight side pocket<br>To keep some items separated if needed<br>• Dura