oaded with fresh veggies and a hint of Thai flavor (not spicy).\r\nWild and sustainable, never farmed!\r\n\r\nIngredients: salmon, zucchini, red bell pepper, sweet chili sauce, panko, soy sauce, cilantro, green onions, ginger puree, garlic puree, carrageenan, \r\nContains: fish, soy, wheat\r\n\r\n'),(265940,76,0,118622,'<p>Made with wild-caught salmon (never farmed) of course!<br />Contain only the most premium fish - Copper River Sockeye.<br />Loaded with fresh veggies and a hint of Thai flavor (not spicy).<br />Wild and sustainable, never farmed!</p>'),(265941,85,0,118622,'salmon patties, wild alaskan salmon patties, vacuum sealed patties, wild caught salmon burgers, copper river sockeye, sena sea'),(265978,75,0,118639,'Well known for building the best crossbows, TenPoint has produced the fastest crossbow on the market – powered by a reverse-draw design that utilizes the full 17” of power stroke, the NEW Vapor RS470 generates supercharged speeds up to 470 FPS and is equipped with the NEW revolutionary ACUslide – a silent cocking and safe de-cocking system.\r\nThe Vapor RS470 is the fastest crossbow on the market offered with this unique cocking and de-cocking system. Measuring an ultra-narrow 6.5-inches wide, the industry’s best crossbow features our 3.5 pound, 2-stage S1 trigger that delivers our most crisp, consistent break ever – leading to the same hole down-range accuracy.\r\nThe best crossbow comes from generations of hard work developing the most cutting-edge technology to produce the fastest crossbow on the market.'),(670426,75,1,118639,'Well known for building the best crossbows, TenPoint has produced the fastest crossbow on the market – powered by a reverse-draw design that utilizes the full 17” of power stroke, the NEW Vapor RS470 generates supercharged speeds up to 470 FPS and is equipped with the NEW revolutionary ACUslide – a silent cocking and safe de-cocking system.\r\nThe Vapor RS470 is the fastest crossbow on the market offered with this unique cocking and de-cocking system. Measuring an ultra-narrow 6.5-inches wide, the industry’s best crossbow features our 3.5 pound, 2-stage S1 trigger that delivers our most crisp, consistent break ever – leading to the same hole down-range accuracy.\r\nThe best crossbow comes from generations of hard work developing the most cutting-edge technology to produce the fastest crossbow on the market.'),(265979,76,0,118639,'<p>Optics: EVO-X Marksman Scope mounted on a machined aluminum 7/8-inch Fixed Dovetail Mount<br />Bubble Level<br />Cocking Device: ACUslide Cocking and De-Cocking System<br />Quiver: 6-Arrow Tech Quiver<br />Lighted Crossbow Arrows: Six Lighted Evo-X CenterPunch premium carbon arrows with 100-grain practice points<br />Crossbow Arrows: Six Evo-X CenterPunch premium carbon arrows with 100-grain practice points<br />Crossbow broadheads: 3 EVO-X CenterPunch Broadheads<br />Noise Dampening: Integrated String Stop System<br />Hard Case: TenPoint STAG hard crossbow case<br />Sling: TenPoint Neoprene Sling</p>'),(670427,76,1,118639,'<p>Optics: EVO-X Marksman Scope mounted on a machined aluminum 7/8-inch Fixed Dovetail Mount<br />Bubble Level<br />Cocking Device: ACUslide Cocking and De-Cocking System<br />Quiver: 6-Arrow Tech Quiver<br />Lighted Crossbow Arrows: Six Lighted Evo-X CenterPunch premium carbon arrows with 100-grain practice points<br />Crossbow Arrows: Six Evo-X CenterPunch premium carbon arrows with 100-grain practice points<br />Crossbow broadheads: 3 EVO-X CenterPunch Broadheads<br />Noise Dampening: Integrated String Stop System<br />Hard Case: TenPoint STAG hard crossbow case<br />Sling: TenPoint Neoprene Sling</p>'),(265980,85,0,118639,'crossbow, tenpoint crossbow, hunting crossbow, rs470 accuslide, vapor crossbow'),(670428,85,1,118639,'crossbow, tenpoint crossbow, hunting crossbow, rs470 accuslide, vapor crossbow'),(265999,75,0,118649,'<p>Well known for building the best crossbows, TenPoint has produced the fastest crossbow on the market – powe