ith 100-grain practice points<br />Crossbow broadheads: 3 EVO-X CenterPunch Broadheads<br />Noise Dampening: Integrated String Stop System<br />Hard Case: TenPoint STAG hard crossbow case<br />Sling: TenPoint Neoprene Sling</p>'),(359644,76,1,118649,'<p>Optics: EVO-X Marksman Scope mounted on a machined aluminum 7/8-inch Fixed Dovetail Mount<br />Bubble Level<br />Cocking Device: ACUslide Cocking and De-Cocking System<br />Quiver: 6-Arrow Tech Quiver<br />Lighted Crossbow Arrows: Six Lighted Evo-X CenterPunch premium carbon arrows with 100-grain practice points<br />Crossbow Arrows: Six Evo-X CenterPunch premium carbon arrows with 100-grain practice points<br />Crossbow broadheads: 3 EVO-X CenterPunch Broadheads<br />Noise Dampening: Integrated String Stop System<br />Hard Case: TenPoint STAG hard crossbow case<br />Sling: TenPoint Neoprene Sling</p>'),(266001,85,0,118649,'crossbow, tenpoint vapor rs 470 crossbow, Vapor RS470, ACUslide, EVO-X Scope, STAG Hard Case, Elite Package, Graphite'),(359645,85,1,118649,'crossbow, tenpoint vapor rs 470 crossbow, Vapor RS470, ACUslide, EVO-X Scope, STAG Hard Case, Elite Package, Graphite'),(266016,75,0,118657,'<p><span>The fastest and narrowest forward-draw hunting crossbow ever produced!</span></p>\r\n<p>The lightweight Vengent S440 crossbow delivers lightning speeds up to 440 FPS and features the NEW revolutionary ACUslide silent cocking and safe de-cocking crossbow technology. This ultra-fast hunting crossbow is our narrowest ever, measuring an incredible 5.8-inches wide, and features a 3.5 pound, 2-stage S1 trigger that delivers our most crisp, consistent break ever.</p>\r\n<p>TenPoint designed the silent cocking and de-cocking system for our customers to safely de-cock their hunting crossbows without risk of injury, making our crossbows the finest and safest crossbows for sale on the market today.</p>'),(670429,75,1,118657,'<p><span>The fastest and narrowest forward-draw hunting crossbow ever produced!</span></p>\r\n<p>The lightweight Vengent S440 crossbow delivers lightning speeds up to 440 FPS and features the NEW revolutionary ACUslide silent cocking and safe de-cocking crossbow technology. This ultra-fast hunting crossbow is our narrowest ever, measuring an incredible 5.8-inches wide, and features a 3.5 pound, 2-stage S1 trigger that delivers our most crisp, consistent break ever.</p>\r\n<p>TenPoint designed the silent cocking and de-cocking system for our customers to safely de-cock their hunting crossbows without risk of injury, making our crossbows the finest and safest crossbows for sale on the market today.</p>'),(266017,76,0,118657,'<p>Optics: RangeMaster Scope mounted on a machined aluminum 7/8-inch Fixed Dovetail Mount<br />Bubble Level<br />Cocking Device: ACUslide Cocking and De-Cocking System<br />Quiver: 6-Arrow Tech Quiver<br />Crossbow Arrows: Six Evo-X CenterPunch premium carbon arrows with 100-grain practice points<br />Soft Case: TenPoint Narrow Soft Case</p>'),(670430,76,1,118657,'<p>Optics: RangeMaster Scope mounted on a machined aluminum 7/8-inch Fixed Dovetail Mount<br />Bubble Level<br />Cocking Device: ACUslide Cocking and De-Cocking System<br />Quiver: 6-Arrow Tech Quiver<br />Crossbow Arrows: Six Evo-X CenterPunch premium carbon arrows with 100-grain practice points<br />Soft Case: TenPoint Narrow Soft Case</p>'),(266018,85,0,118657,'Vengent S440, ACUslide, Rangemaster Pro Scope, Blazer Soft Case, Veil Alpine'),(670431,85,1,118657,'Vengent S440, ACUslide, Rangemaster Pro Scope, Blazer Soft Case, Veil Alpine'),(266019,75,0,118658,'<p><span>The shortest forward-draw hunting crossbow we have ever produced, the light-weight Viper S400 measures just 32-inches in length yet delivers speeds up to 400 FPS and is sold as a crossbow package. Featuring the NEW revolutionary ACUslide silent cocking and safe de-cocking system, this ultra-compact hunting crossbow measures an ultra-narrow 7.2-inches wide and features a 3.5 pound, 2-stage, zero-creep S1 trigger that delivers our most crisp, consistent break ever. If you are looking for the ultimate hunting crossbow package, look no further than the Viper S400.</span></p>'),(359646,75,1,118658,'<p><span>The shortest forward-draw hunting crossbow we have ever produced, the light-weight Viper S400 measures just 32-inches in length yet delivers speeds up to 400 FPS and is sold as a crossbow package. Featuring the NEW revolutionary ACUslide silent cocking and safe de-cocking system, this ultra-compact hunting crossbow measures an ultra-narrow 7.2-inches wide and features a 3.5 pound, 2-stage, zero-creep S1 trigger that delivers our most crisp, consistent break ever. If you are looking for the ultimate hunting crossbow package, look no further than the Viper S400.</span></p>'),(266020,76,0,118658,'<p>Optics: RangeMaster Pro Scope mounted on a machined aluminum 7/8-inch Fixed Dovetail Mount<br />Cocking Device: ACUslide Cocking and De-Cocking System<br />Quiver: 6-Arrow Tech Quiver<br />Crossbow Arrows: Three Evo-X CenterPunch premium carbon arrows with 100-grain practice points</p>'),(359647,76,1,118658,'<p>Optics: RangeMaster Pro Scope mounted on a machined aluminum 7/8-inch Fixed Dovetail Mount<br />Cocking Device: ACUslide Cocking and De-Cocking System<br />Quiver: 6-Arrow Tech Quiver<br />Crossbow Arrows: Three Evo-X CenterPunch premium carbon arrows with 100-grain practice points</p>'),(266021,85,0,118658,'Viper S400, ACUslide, RangeMaster Pro Scope, Veil Alpine'),(359648,85,1,118658,'Viper S400, ACUslide, RangeMaster Pro Scope, Veil Alpine'),(266054,75,0,118675,'The shortest forward-draw hunting crossbow we have ever produced, the light-weight Viper S400 measures just 32-inches in length yet delivers speeds up to 400 FPS and is sold as a crossbow package. Featuring the NEW revolutionary ACUslide silent cocking and safe de-cocking system, this ultra-compact hunting crossbow measures an ultra-narrow 7.2-inches wide and features a 3.5 pound, 2-stage, zero-creep S1 trigger that delivers our most crisp, consistent break ever. If you are looking for the ultimate hunting crossbow package, look no further than the Viper S400.'),(359649,75,1,118675,'The shortest forward-draw hunting crossbow we have ever produced, the light-weight Viper S400 measures just 32-inches in length yet delivers speeds up to 400 FPS and is sold as a crossbow package. Featuring the NEW revolutionary ACUslide silent cocking and safe de-cocking system, this ultra-compact hunting crossbow measures an ultra-narrow 7.2-inches wide and features a 3.5 pound, 2-stage, zero-creep S1 trigger that delivers our most crisp, consistent break ever. If you are looking for the ultimate hunting crossbow package, look no further than the Viper S400.'),(266055,76,0,118675,'<p>Optics: RangeMaster Pro Scope mounted on a machined aluminum 7/8-inch Fixed Dovetail Mount<br />Cocking Device: ACUslide Cocking and De-Cocking System<br />Quiver: 6-Arrow Tech Quiver<br />Crossbow Arrows: Three Evo-X CenterPunch premium carbon arrows with 100-grain practice points</p>'),(359650,76,1,118675,'<p>Optics: RangeMaster Pro Scope mounted on a machined aluminum 7/8-inch Fixed Dovetail Mount<br />Cocking Device: ACUslide Cocking and De-Cocking System<br />Quiver: 6-Arrow Tech Quiver<br />Crossbow Arrows: Three Evo-X CenterPunch premium carbon arrows with 100-grain practice points</p>'),(266056,85,0,118675,'Viper S400, ACUslide, RangeMaster Pro Scope, Graphite'),(359651,85,1,118675,'Viper S400, ACUslide, RangeMaster Pro Scope, Graphite'),(266125,75,0,118710,'<p><span>Expand your hunting capabilities! This expandable, two-bladedbroadhead provides you with the power of the \"Dual Trap\" blade retention system. It\'s surgically precise construction and wide slice give you the ultimate advantage in the field. With a two-inch cutting diameter, no game is off limits. LUTZ This unique kind of German sharpened metal is the sharpest blade in the industry. It\'s not whether you can afford to have it, it\'s whether you can afford not to have it. DUAL TRAP The Dual Trap retention system gives you the best of both worlds. With the durability of a stainless steel collar and the reliability of an elastomeric ring, it\'s like a memory foam pill on a steel frame bed. The perfect place to rest the Lutz blades before releasing Havoc.</span></p>'),(670432,75,1,118710,'<p><span>Expand your hunting capabilities! This expandable, two-bladedbroadhead provides you with the power of the \"Dual Trap\" blade retention system. It\'s surgically precise construction and wide slice give you the ultimate advantage in the field. With a two-inch cutting diameter, no game is off limits. LUTZ This unique kind of German sharpened metal is the sharpest blade in the industry. It\'s not whether you can afford to have it, it\'s whether you can afford not to have it. DUAL TRAP The Dual Trap retention system gives you the best of both worlds. With the durability of a stainless steel collar and the reliability of an elastomeric ring, it\'s like a memory foam pill on a steel frame bed. The perfect place to rest the Lutz blades before releasing Havoc.</span></p>'),(266126,76,0,118710,'<p><span>2\" Cutting Diameter</span><br /><span>Available in 100 Grains Only</span><br /><span>.030\" Stainless Steel Lutz Blades</span><br /><span>100% Steel Tough</span><br /><span>Dual Trap Blade Retention System</span><br /><span>Cut-On Contact Design</span></p>'),(670433,76,1,118710,'<p><span>2\" Cutting Diameter</span><br /><span>Available in 100 Grains Only</span><br /><span>.030\" Stainless Steel Lutz Blades</span><br /><span>100% Steel Tough</span><br /><span>Dual Trap Blade Retention System</span><br /><span>Cut-On Contact Design</span></p>'),(266127,85,0,118710,'g5, havoc broadheads, g5 havoc broadheads, 100 grain broadheads'),(670434,85,1,118710,'g5, havoc broadheads, g5 havoc broadheads, 100 grain broadheads'),(266662,75,0,118978,'<p><span>Hawke Sports Optics</span> specifically designed and engineered their <span>3x32 XB Crossbow Scope</span> and XB MAP reticle for crossbows using bolts traveling at 315 ft/s for optimum accuracy and ease-of-use. The objective is intentionally on the small side to maintain a low-profile, reduce snag points, and keep the weight down. To offset the smaller objective are anti-reflection fully multi-coated optics which maximize light transmission and ensure bright and clear images, and to boost its low-light performance when many game animals are most active - such as at dawn and dusk. The XB MAP reticle resembles a modified German 4 style, featuring a thin crosshair, a thin vertical bottom post, and four pairs of stacked-up horizontal posts, connected by thin lines. The post arrangement forms an inverted trapezoid target gate in the middle with aiming points from 20 to 60 yards with 10 yard intervals. It is calibrated for 315 fps speeds and offers 6\" and 12\" brackets on its 50 yard line.</p>\r\n<p>Capped, finger-operated turrets help guard against accidental adjustments while a high-torque fast-focus ring quickly adapt to rapidly changing conditions. Complementing the performance of the scope is a lightweight and durable anodized aluminum housing, with a 1\" one-piece maintube that is nitrogen-filled and O-ring sealed to be water and fogproof.</p>'),(359652,75,1,118978,'<p><span>Hawke Sports Optics</span> specifically designed and engineered their <span>3x32 XB Crossbow Scope</span> and XB MAP reticle for crossbows using bolts traveling at 315 ft/s for optimum accuracy and ease-of-use. The objective is intentionally on the small side to maintain a low-profile, reduce snag points, and keep the weight down. To offset the smaller objective are anti-reflection fully multi-coated optics which maximize light transmission and ensure bright and clear images, and to boost its low-light performance when many game animals are most active - such as at dawn and dusk. The XB MAP reticle resembles a modified German 4 style, featuring a thin crosshair, a thin vertical bottom post, and four pairs of stacked-up horizontal posts, connected by thin lines. The post arrangement forms an inverted trapezoid target gate in the middle with aiming points from 20 to 60 yards with 10 yard intervals. It is calibrated for 315 fps speeds and offers 6\" and 12\" brackets on its 50 yard line.</p>\r\n<p>Capped, finger-operated turrets help guard against accidental adjustments while a high-torque fast-focus ring quickly adapt to rapidly changing conditions. Complementing the performance of the scope is a lightweight and durable anodized aluminum housing, with a 1\" one-piece maintube that is nitrogen-filled and O-ring sealed to be water and fogproof.</p>'),(266663,76,0,118978,'<p>Hawke Sports Optics specifically designed and engineered their 3x32 XB Crossbow Scope and XB MAP reticle for crossbows using bolts traveling at 315 ft/s for optimum accuracy and ease-of-use. </p>'),(359653,76,1,118978,'<p>Hawke Sports Optics specifically designed and engineered their 3x32 XB Crossbow Scope and XB MAP reticle for crossbows using bolts traveling at 315 ft/s for optimum accuracy and ease-of-use. </p>'),(266664,85,0,118978,'hawke optics, crossbow scope, 3X32 scope'),(359654,85,1,118978,'hawke optics, crossbow scope, 3X32 scope'),(315312,75,0,148641,'<p>SW Airguns FD-8P Multi-shot Big Bore Airgun Pistol - SW airguns are engineered, manufactured, assembled, tested, and supported right here in the USA. Built right here in Texas milled in a boutique machine shop where quality come before quantity. Each gun is hand assembled and tested before it comes to us.  Then we test it again to make sure that everything is right.</p>\r\n<p>Includes:</p>\r\n<p>• FD-8P Pistol<br />• 2 shot SW Shuttle Magazine<br />• Front Fiber Optic Shotgun Sight<br />• End cap for stock threads</p>\r\n<p><em><strong>*Shown with optional AR Stock</strong></em></p>\r\n<p><b><i>(</i></b><span><b><i>IMPORTANT - ALL SALES ARE FINAL.</i></b></span><b><i>  If you have questions about availability or any other pre-sales questions, just </i></b><b><i>contact us via our contact us page</i></b><b><i> and we\'ll be happy to help you!)</i></b></p>'),(320394,75,1,148641,'<p><strong>SW Airguns FD-8P Multi-shot Big Bore Airgun Pistol - SW airguns are engineered, manufactured, assembled, tested, and supported right here in the USA.</strong></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Built right here in Texas milled in a boutique machine shop where quality come before quantity. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Each gun is hand assembled and tested before it comes to us.  Then we test it again to make sure that everything is right.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><strong>Includes:</strong></p>\r\n<p>• FD-8P Pistol</p>\r\n<p>• 2 shot SW Shuttle Magazine</p>\r\n<p>• Front Fiber Optic Shotgun Sight</p>\r\n<p>• End cap for stock threads</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><em><strong>*Shown with optional AR Stock</strong></em></p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(315313,76,0,148641,'<h2>Please Note: <span>Pre-orders are available NOW</span><span>!</span> If you have any questions, please contact us via our contact us page and we\'ll be happy to help you.</h2>\r\n<h2>Key Features of the SW Airguns FD-8P Multi-shot Big Bore Airgun Pistol:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MULTI-SHOT BIG BORE</li>\r\n<li>20 Gauge</li>\r\n<li>Massive Power in a very compact package</li>\r\n<li>450 FPS with Ballistic Products 400 Grain 20ga Slugs = 179 FPE!</li>\r\n<li>Extremely easy to service with only a hanfful of primary o-rings</li>\r\n<li>Includes standard AR15 style stock threads (use any mil-speck AR Stock!)</li>\r\n<li>Use standard AR15 Style Grips</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Includes:</p>\r\n<p>• FD-8P Pistol<br />• 2 shot SW Shuttle Magazine<br />• Front Fiber Optic Shotgun Sight<br />• End cap for stock threads</p>\r\n<p><em><strong>*Shown with optional AR Stock</strong></em></p>\r\n<p><b><i>(</i></b><span><b><i>IMPORTANT - ALL SALES ARE FINAL.</i></b></span><b><i>  If you have questions about availability or any other pre-sales questions, just </i></b><b><i>contact us via our contact us page</i></b><b><i> and we\'ll be happy to help you!)</i></b></p>'),(320395,76,1,148641,'<p>Built right here in Texas milled in a boutique machine shop where quality come before quantity. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• FD-8P Pistol</p>\r\n<p>• 2 shot SW Shuttle Magazine</p>\r\n<p>• Front Fiber Optic Shotgun Sight</p>'),(315314,85,0,148641,'FD-8P Multi-shot'),(320396,85,1,148641,'FD-8P Multi-shot'),(315329,75,0,148642,'<p>VIRTUAL ARCHERY! The AccuBow is the World’s First Ever Virtual Archery practice system. Adjustable for ALL AGES! Adjustable 10-70 lbs. in pulling resistance. Here’s how it works: 1) Get Your AccuBow Equipment! 2) Download the AccuBow App! 3) Attach Your Phone &amp; Start Shooting! The All New AccuBow 1.0 - Realtree Edge features the following new improvements: New &amp; Improved Phone Mount Included and Installed FREE Shipping within US Lifetime Warranty on Replacement Parts D-Loop Attachment Installed Integrated Laser Sight Improved String Stopper Design Adjustable 10-70 Pounds The new AccuBow 2020 App offers 21 Shooting Modes ranging from target shooting, bowhunting, bow fishing, build-your-own archery range, treestand hunting, dangerous game, and even, archery golf! Customize your shooting settings and immerse yourself into realistic graphics and animations to provide the ultimate virtual archery experience. This product is a Class II laser with a power output of less than 1mW.</p>'),(315331,75,1,148642,'<p>VIRTUAL ARCHERY! The AccuBow is the World’s First Ever Virtual Archery practice system. Adjustable for ALL AGES! Adjustable 10-70 lbs. in pulling resistance. Here’s how it works: 1) Get Your AccuBow Equipment! 2) Download the AccuBow App! 3) Attach Your Phone &amp; Start Shooting! The All New AccuBow 1.0 - Realtree Edge features the following new improvements: New &amp; Improved Phone Mount Included and Installed FREE Shipping within US Lifetime Warranty on Replacement Parts D-Loop Attachment Installed Integrated Laser Sight Improved String Stoppe