2,75,0,148727,'Humvee 2pc Bowie Knife Set, black packawood handles'),(315993,75,1,148727,'<p>Humvee 2pc Bowie Knife Set, black packawood handles</p>\r\n<p>The HUMVEE HMV-BC-02-BK Bowie Knife Combo Set comes with a large and small stainless steel blade with a black Pakawood handle. Both blades are mirror polished for a classic look, and the set includes a nylon sheath. HUMVEE has become the backbone of U.S. forces around the world. Our HUMVEE gear is modeled after equipment that is depended on in the rigors of battle. These products are designed to survive the most demanding situations while still remaining simple and easy to use.</p>\r\n<p>Features and Specifications:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Features mirror polished, stainless steel blades</li>\r\n<li>Built with black Pakawood handles</li>\r\n<li>Designed to survive the most demanding situations while still remaining simple and easy to use</li>\r\n<li>Item Weight (Oz): Large 11.7, Small 4.9</li>\r\n<li>Size (In): Large 12.5, Small 8.5</li>\r\n<li>MSRP: $49.99</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"product-meta-info\">\r\n<div>Brand: Humvee</div>\r\n<div>Catalog Number: 208324</div>\r\n</div>'),(344429,76,1,148727,'<p>Humvee 2pc Bowie Knife Set, black packawood handles</p>'),(344430,85,1,148727,'Humvee 2pc Bowie Knife Set, black packawood handles'),(315998,75,0,148729,'Outdoor Edge Wild-Pak 8-PC game processing set'),(315999,75,1,148729,'<p><strong>The Outdoor Edge Wild-Pak Game Processing Set is everything you need to help get your game from the field to your freezer. </strong></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>This light weight, 8-piece processing set has all the tools to help get the job done. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>It comes complete with full-tang caping knife, gut-hook skinner, boning knife, carbide sharpener, wood/bone saw, ribcage spreader and game cleaning gloves all in a hard-side carry case. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Non-slip rubberized blaze-orange handles never get lost and feature a horn pattern inlay for enhanced grip.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Outdoor Edge, Wild Pak Game Processing Kit, Fixed Blade Knife Set, Plain Edge, 420J2 Stainless Steel, Orange Handle, Includes (1) Caper Knife, (1) Skinner Knife, (1) Boning Knife, (1) Bone Saw, (1) Sharpener, (1) Rib Spreader, Game Cleaning Gloves, and Hard Case.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><br /><br /><strong>Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p>• Full-tang caping knife</p>\r\n<p>• Gut-hook skinner</p>\r\n<p>• Boning knife</p>\r\n<p>• Tungsten carbide sharpener</p>\r\n<p>• Wood/bone saw</p>\r\n<p>• Ribcage spreader</p>\r\n<p>• Game cleaning gloves</p>\r\n<p>• Hard-side carry case</p>\r\n<p>• 2.6 lbs</p>\r\n<p>• 8 Piece</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n<p>• Caper Blade: 2.5 in</p>\r\n<p>• Caper Overall: 8.3 in</p>\r\n<p>• Skinner Blade: 4.0 in</p>\r\n<p>• Skinner Overall: 8.5 in</p>\r\n<p>• Boning Blade: 5.0 in</p>\r\n<p>• Boning Overall: 9.5 in</p>\r\n<p>• Knife Steel: 420J2 Stainless</p>\r\n<p>• Saw Blade: 6.0 in</p>\r\n<p>• Saw Steel: 65 Mn with chrome coat</p>\r\n<p>• Saw Overall: 9.3 in</p>\r\n<p>• Handles: Rubberized orange TPR</p>'),(344431,76,1,148729,'<p>It comes complete with full-tang caping knife, gut-hook skinner, boning knife, carbide sharpener, wood/bone saw, ribcage spreader and game cleaning gloves all in a hard-side carry case. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• Game cleaning gloves</p>\r\n<p>• Hard-side carry case</p>\r\n<p>• 8 Pieces</p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(344432,85,1,148729,'Outdoor Edge Wild-Pak 8-PC game processing set'),(316004,75,0,148731,'<p>Spyderco Robin2 SS</p>\r\n<p>For those who prefer the heft and style of stainless steel handles, the new, improved Robin SS is sure to be a hit. Its satin-finished stainless steel handles feature chamfered edges for a comfortable, ergonomic grip and offer an ideal palate for engraving and personalization.</p>\r\n<p>The 8Cr13Mov stainless steel blade now features a full flat grind, offering superior edge geometry and low-friction cutting performance. A four-position pocket clip and sturdy back lock mechanism complete the package, providing completely ambidextrous operation and full range of carry options.</p>\r\n<div class=\"large-12 columns\">\r\n<div class=\"large-2 columns\"><span>Overall Length: </span>5.687 \" (144mm)</div>\r\n<div class=\"large-2 columns\"><span>Blade Length: </span>2.375 \" (60mm)</div>\r\n<div class=\"large-2 columns\"><span>Steel: </span>8Cr13MoV</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"large-12 columns\">\r\n<div class=\"large-2 columns oddrow\"><span>Closed Length: </span>3.313 \" (84mm)</div>\r\n<div class=\"large-2 columns oddrow\"><span>Edge Length: </span>1.875 \" (48mm)</div>\r\n<div class=\"large-2 columns oddrow\"><span>Weight: </span>3.2.oz (91g)</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"large-12 columns\">\r\n<div class=\"large-2 columns\"><span>Blade Thickness: </span>.093 \" (2.5mm)</div>\r\n<div class=\"large-2 columns\"><span>Handle: </span>Stainless Steel</div>\r\n<div class=\"large-2 columns\"><span>Clip Position: </span>Ambi</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"large-12 columns\">\r\n<div class=\"large-2 columns\"><span>Tip Carry Position: </span>4-position</div>\r\n<div class=\"large-2 columns\"><span>Lock Type: </span>Back Lock</div>\r\n<div class=\"large-2 columns\"><span>Grind: </span>Full-Flat</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"large-12 columns\">\r\n<div class=\"large-2 columns\"><span>Sheath: </span>N/A</div>\r\n<div class=\"large-2 columns\"><span>Origin: </span>China</div>\r\n</div>'),(316006,75,1,148731,'<p><a title=\"Spyderco Robin SS\" href=\"https://www.spyderco.com/catalog/details/BY10SS2/599\" target=\"_blank\">Spyderco Byrd Robin2 SS</a></p>\r\n<p>For those who prefer the heft and style of stainless steel handles, the new, improved Robin SS is sure to be a hit. Its satin-finished stainless steel handles feature chamfered edges for a comfortable, ergonomic grip and offer an ideal palate for engraving and personalization.</p>\r\n<p>The 8Cr13Mov stainless steel blade now features a full flat grind, offering superior edge geometry and low-friction cutting performance. A four-position pocket clip and sturdy back lock mechanism complete the package, providing completely ambidextrous operation and full range of carry options.</p>\r\n<p><span>3 1/4\" closed lockback. 2 1/2\" 8Cr13MoV stainless blade with thumb slot. Stainless handles. Four-way reversible stainless pocket clip.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"large-12 columns\">\r\n<div class=\"large-2 columns\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span>Overall Length: </span>5.687 \" (144mm)</li>\r\n<li><span>Blade Length: </span>2.375 \" (60mm)</li>\r\n<li><span>Steel: </span>8Cr13MoV</li>\r\n<li><span>Closed Length: </span>3.313 \" (84mm)</li>\r\n<li><span>Edge Length: </span>1.875 \" (48mm)</li>\r\n<li><span>Weight: </span>3.2.oz (91g)</li>\r\n<li><span>Blade Thickness: </span>.093 \" (2.5mm)</li>\r\n<li><span>Handle: </span>Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li><span>Clip Position: </span>Ambi</li>\r\n<li><span>Tip Carry Position: </span>4-position</li>\r\n<li><span>Lock Type: </span>Back Lock</li>\r\n<li><span>Grind: </span>Full-Flat</li>\r\n<li><span>Sheath: </span>N/A</li>\r\n<li><span>Origin: </span>China</li>\r\n<li>MSRP: $50.95</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(316005,76,0,148731,'<p>Spyderco Robin2 SS</p>'),(316007,76,1,148731,'<p>Spyderco Byrd Robin2 SS</p>'),(344433,85,1,148731,'Spyderco Byrd Robin2 SS'),(316008,75,0,148732,'<p>Sword Wall Display Stand - Single Katana Black - Blem: light scuffs on flat part that mounts to wall.</p>'),(316010,75,1,148732,'<p>Sword Wall Display Stand - Single Katana Black - Blem: light scuffs on flat part that mounts to wall.</p>'),(316009,76,0,148732,'<p>Sword Wall Display Stand - Single Katana Black</p>'),(316011,76,1,148732,'<p>Sword Wall Display Stand - Single Katana Black</p>'),(344434,85,1,148732,'Sword Wall Display Stand - Single Katana Black'),(316012,75,0,148733,'United Legends in Steel Crusader Dagger, 5th Edition w display'),(316013,75,1,148733,'<p>United Legends in Steel Crusader Dagger, 5th Edition w display</p>'),(344435,76,1,148733,'<p>United Legends in Steel Crusader Dagger, 5th Edition w display</p>'),(344436,85,1,148733,'United Legends in Steel Crusader Dagger, 5th Edition w display'),(316014,75,0,148734,'<p>UST Para knife FS 3.0 black</p>\r\n<p><span>7\" overall. 3\" black oxide finish stainless partially serrated blade. Full tang. ParaTinder handle wrap provides 6 feet of paracord with an added single tinder thread. Includes flint fire starter and whistle. Black nylon belt sheath. Clam packed - Note: no clam packaging, knife was removed for pictures.</span></p>\r\n<div id=\"product-caption-block-description\" class=\"product-caption-block\">\r\n<p>The <strong>UST ParaKnife FS 3.0 Fixed Blade Knife w/ Paracord Wrapped Handle</strong> is made with an incredibly robust, 3mm thick stainless steel blade that has a black oxide finish and full tang for extreme durability. The blade on the <strong>UST 3.0 ParaKnife FS Survival Knife w/ Partially Serrated Blade</strong> is rust-resistant, designed for rugged use and serrated for quick rope cutting ability. The handle is wrapped with paracord providing a secure grip in all weather conditions. The <strong>UST FS Para Knife 3.0</strong> includes a flint fire starter and nylon sheath, making it the ideal knife to have with you in the wilderness.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"product-caption-block-manufacture-specification\" class=\"product-caption-block\">\r\n<h3>Specifications for UST ParaKnife FS 3.0 Survival Knife:</h3>\r\n<table class=\"spec-table\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"spec-grey-row\">\r\n<td class=\"spec-left-column\">Size (knife only) LxWxD:</td>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">7\" x 1\" x 0.75\" (178 x 25 x 19mm)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"spec-left-column\">Weight:</td>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">2.4 oz. (68g)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"spec-grey-row\">\r\n<td class=\"spec-left-column\">Size (in sheath with fire starter) LxWxD:</td>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">7.75\" x 2\" x 1.5\" (197 x 51 x 38mm)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"spec-left-column\">Weight:</td>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">4 oz. (116g)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"product-caption-block-features\" class=\"product-caption-block\">\r\n<h3>Features of UST Para Knife FS 4.0 w/ Paracord Handle:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Tough, 3mm thick stainless-steel blade with black-oxide finish and full tang</li>\r\n<li>3\" (76mm) blade is rust-resistant, designed for rugged use, and serrated for quick rope-cutting</li>\r\n<li>Paracord handle wrap provides secure grip in all weather conditions, and unwraps to over 5\' of cordage</li>\r\n<li>Convenient wrist lanyard can be removed for additional 15\" (381mm) of cord</li>\r\n<li>Includes flint fire starter and nylon sheath</li>\r\n<li>Use knife blade to create sparks in all weather conditions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><span></span></p>'),(316016,75,1,148734,'<p>UST Para knife FS 3.0 black; package opened for pictures.</p>\r\n<p><span>7\" overall. 3\" black oxide finish stainless partially serrated blade. Full tang. ParaTinder handle wrap provides 6 feet of paracord with an added single tinder thread. Includes flint fire starter and whistle. Black nylon belt sheath. Clam packed - Note: no clam packaging, knife was removed for pictures.</span></p>\r\n<div id=\"product-caption-block-description\" class=\"product-caption-block\">\r\n<p>The <strong>UST ParaKnife FS 3.0 Fixed Blade Knife w/ Paracord Wrapped Handle</strong> is made with an incredibly robust, 3mm thick stainless steel blade that has a black oxide finish and full tang for extreme durability. The blade on the <strong>UST 3.0 ParaKnife FS Survival Knife w/ Partially Serrated Blade</strong> is rust-resistant, designed for rugged use and serrated for quick rope cutting ability. The handle is wrapped with paracord providing a secure grip in all weather conditions. The <strong>UST FS Para Knife 3.0</strong> includes a flint fire starter and nylon sheath, making it the i