p-item\">Durable Polymer Construction</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Single Stack Narrow Body Magazines</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: <strong>$38.95</strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Retail MAP: <strong>$34.95</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(344472,76,1,148766,'<p>Butler Creek Maglula Baby UpLULA Universal Pistol Loader, .22LR to .380ACP</p>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Maglula ltd., BabyUpLula Magazine Loader/Unloader, .22-.380, Universal Fit, Black</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Takes One-Third the Time of Thumb Loading</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Durable Polymer Construction</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Single Stack Narrow Body Magazines</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: <strong>$38.95</strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Retail MAP: <strong>$34.95</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>Since 2001\" Maglula has manufactured professional military-grade tools for loading and unloading magazines. These products save valuable time at the range\" field\" armory and prevent pain associated with loading and unloading magazines.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>858003000646</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>Maglula ltd.</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>UP64B</strong></td>\r\n<th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Mag Loader/Unloader</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>BabyUpLula</strong></td>\r\n<th>Caliber</th>\r\n<td><strong>.22-.380</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Capacity</th>\r\n<td><strong>N/A</strong></td>\r\n<th>Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Black</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Fit</th>\r\n<td><strong>22-380</strong></td>\r\n<th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Speed Loaders</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(344473,85,1,148766,'Butler Creek Maglula Baby UpLULA Universal Pistol Loader, .22LR to .380ACP'),(316154,75,0,148771,'<p>Crosman Varmint Target Block</p>'),(316156,75,1,148771,'<p>Crosman 4-Sided Varmint Air Gun Target Block Crow, Squirrel, Prairie Dog or Rat Paper Target on High Density Foam Block</p>\r\n<p><span>This target block is made of high density foam to trap pellets and BBs. Each side depicts one of the Crosman Varmint targets. Easy to use indoors or out. For use only with airguns shooting less than 700 fps.</span></p>'),(316155,76,0,148771,'<p>Crosman Varmint Target Block</p>'),(316157,76,1,148771,'<p>Crosman 4-Sided Varmint Air Gun Target Block Crow, Squirrel, Prairie Dog or Rat Paper Target on High Density Foam Block</p>\r\n<p>This target block is made of high density foam to trap pellets and BBs. Each side depicts one of the Crosman Varmint targets. Easy to use indoors or out. For use only with airguns shooting less than 700 fps.</p>'),(344478,85,1,148771,'Crosman 4-Sided Varmint Air Gun Target Block Crow, Squirrel, Prairie Dog or Rat Paper Target on High Density Foam Block'),(316158,75,0,148772,'<p>Daniel Defense Rail Mount QD Swivel Attachment, black</p>'),(316160,75,1,148772,'<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Daniel Defense, Rail Mount Quick Detach Swivel Attachment Point, Fits Picatinny Rail, Black Finish</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">6061-T6 Aluminum</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Military Specification Hard Coat Type III Anodized</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Durable 1.25\" Loop</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>The Daniel Defense Rail Mount QD Swivel Attachment Point is designed to allow the operator to mount the popular Heavy Duty Push Button Quick Detach Sling Swivel. This mount allows the operator to mount the swivel anywhere along their rail system. The Daniel Defense Rail Mount QD Swivel Attachment Point has been designed to limit the rotation of the swivel to prevent the operators sling from becoming tangled. The Rail Mount QD Swivel Attachment utilizes Daniel Defense\'s patented \"Rock and Lock\" one piece mounting system for a more robust and streamlined attachment point as well as simplified installation on any MIL-STD-1913 picatinny rail. This mount includes a Heavy Duty Push Button Quick Detach (QD) Sling Swivel which accepts sling straps up to 1.25\".</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(316159,76,0,148772,'<p>Daniel Defense Rail Mount QD Swivel Attachment, black</p>'),(316161,76,1,148772,'<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Daniel Defense, Rail Mount Quick Detach Swivel Attachment Point, Fits Picatinny Rail, Black Finish</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">6061-T6 Aluminum</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Military Specification Hard Coat Type III Anodized</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Durable 1.25\" Loop</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>The Daniel Defense Rail Mount QD Swivel Attachment Point is designed to allow the operator to mount the popular Heavy Duty Push Button Quick Detach Sling Swivel. This mount allows the operator to mount the swivel anywhere along their rail system. The Daniel Defense Rail Mount QD Swivel Attachment Point has been designed to limit the rotation of the swivel to prevent the operators sling from becoming tangled. The Rail Mount QD Swivel Attachment utilizes Daniel Defense\'s patented \"Rock and Lock\" one piece mounting system for a more robust and streamlined attachment point as well as simplified installation on any MIL-STD-1913 picatinny rail. This mount includes a Heavy Duty Push Button Quick Detach (QD) Sling Swivel which accepts sling straps up to 1.25\".</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>852548002141</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>Daniel Defense</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>03-021-30029</strong></td>\r\n<th>Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Black</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Fit</th>\r\n<td><strong>Picatinny</strong></td>\r\n<th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Sling Hardware</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(344479,85,1,148772,'Daniel Defense, Rail Mount Quick Detach Swivel Attachment Point, Fits Picatinny Rail, Black Finish'),(316162,75,0,148773,'<p>Deep6Comp Glockmeister Channel Insert</p>'),(316164,75,1,148773,'<p>Deep6Comp Glockmeister Channel Insert</p>\r\n<p>The Backstrap Channel Insert was developed by Glockmeister™ with input from the Israeli Security Forces. Testing and final approval was done by the Isreali Security Forces. Designed to guide the mag into the mag well and prevent the magazine from snagging on structures within the Glock, the Glockmeister Backstrap Channel Insert also stops dirt and debris from entering the backstrap channel - keeping the trigger mechanism clear of any restrictive elements.</p>\r\n<p><br />This will fit into the following Gen 1, 2 or 3 GLOCK models: 17, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 25, 31, 32, 35 and 37. Fits RTF models.</p>\r\n<p>Does not fit SF or Gen 4 / 5 frames.</p>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Grip Plug Kit, Fits Glock Mid/Full Size, Gen 1-3, Black</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Grip plug</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Helps keep gun clean</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Aids in reloading</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(316163,76,0,148773,'<p>Deep6Comp Glockmeister Channel Insert</p>'),(316165,76,1,148773,'<p>Deep6Comp Glockmeister Channel Insert</p>\r\n<p>The Backstrap Channel Insert was developed by Glockmeister™ with input from the Israeli Security Forces. Testing and final approval was done by the Isreali Security Forces. Designed to guide the mag into the mag well and prevent the magazine from snagging on structures within the Glock, the Glockmeister Backstrap Channel Insert also stops dirt and debris from entering the backstrap channel - keeping the trigger mechanism clear of any restrictive elements.</p>\r\n<p><br />This will fit into the following Gen 1, 2 or 3 GLOCK models: 17, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 25, 31, 32, 35 and 37. Fits RTF models.</p>\r\n<p>Does not fit SF or Gen 4 / 5 frames.</p>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Grip Plug Kit, Fits Glock Mid/Full Size, Gen 1-3, Black</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Grip plug</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Helps keep gun clean</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Aids in reloading</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>The Deep6Comp Plug is designed to keep dirt and debris out of the action of your Glock. It also serves as a magazine funnel to aid in reloading.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>GLMDEEPCOMP</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>Glockmeister</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><b>Glockmeister</b></td>\r\n<th>Fit</th>\r\n<td><strong>GLK Mid/Full Size</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Frame Insert</strong></td>\r\n<th>Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Black</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Description</th>\r\n<td><strong>Grip Plug Kit</strong></td>\r\n<th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Handgun Parts</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(344480,85,1,148773,'Deep6Comp Glockmeister Channel Insert'),(316166,75,0,148774,'<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>DeSantis Gunhide, Maverick Belt Holster, Fits Ruger LCP, Kel-Tec P3AT, Diamondback 380, Right Hand, Black Leather</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<di