body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(316167,76,0,148774,'<p>Desantis Maverick holster, LCP/P3AT, Black</p>'),(316169,76,1,148774,'<h4>DeSantis Gunhide, Maverick Belt Holster, Fits Ruger LCP, Kel-Tec P3AT, Diamondback 380, Right Hand, Black Leather</h4>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: $56.99</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Precise leather molding with thumb break</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Belt clip on back for each on/off of the belt: Clip can accommodate belts up to 1 3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>Back by popular demand, The Maverick features detailed molding along with a sturdy steel spring clip for easy on and off. It will accommodate belts up to 1 3/4\" wide.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>792695289951</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>DeSantis Gunhide</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>012BAR7Z0</strong></td>\r\n<th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>The Maverick</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>012</strong></td>\r\n<th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Belt Holster</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Hand</th>\r\n<td><strong>Right Hand</strong></td>\r\n<th>Finish/Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Black</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Fit</th>\r\n<td><strong>Keltec P3AT/Ruger LCP</strong></td>\r\n<th>Frame/Material</th>\r\n<td><strong>Leather</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(344481,85,1,148774,'Desantis Maverick holster, LCP/P3AT, Diamondback 380, Right Hand, Black Leather'),(344482,304,1,148774,NULL),(316170,75,0,148775,'<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>DeSantis Gunhide, <a title=\"Nemesis N38\" href=\"https://rsrgroup.com/product/DSGN38BJG3Z0\" target=\"_blank\">Nemesis Pocket Holster</a>, Fits P-3AT, Ruger LCP, Ambidextrous, Black</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\"><strong>MSRP: $26.99</strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Pocket holster that will absolutely not move out of position in your front pocket due to the \"sticky\" material</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Inside is made of a slick pack cloth for a low friction draw</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Wide base helps keep firearm in place for optimal draw each time</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>The Nemesis(R) will revolutionize pocket holsters. Never before has there been a material this viscous. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your front pocket. The inside is made of a slick pack cloth for a low friction draw, and the core is just the right amount of foam to break up the outline of the gun. Available in black</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>792695268987</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>DeSantis Gunhide</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>N38BJG3Z0</strong></td>\r\n<th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>N38</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>The Nemesis</strong></td>\r\n<th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Pocket Holster</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Hand</th>\r\n<td><strong>Ambidextrous</strong></td>\r\n<th>Finish/Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Black</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Fit</th>\r\n<td><strong>Keltec P3AT/Ruger LCP</strong></td>\r\n<th>Frame/Material</th>\r\n<td><strong>Nylon</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Holsters</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(316172,75,1,148775,'<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>DeSantis Gunhide, <a title=\"Nemesis N38\" href=\"https://rsrgroup.com/product/DSGN38BJG3Z0\" target=\"_blank\">Nemesis Pocket Holster</a>, Fits P-3AT, Ruger LCP/Ruger LCP II, Ambidextrous, Black</h4>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Pocket holster that will absolutely not move out of position in your front pocket due to the \"sticky\" material</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Inside is made of a slick pack cloth for a low friction draw</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Wide base helps keep firearm in place for optimal draw each time</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: $27.99</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>The Nemesis(R) will revolutionize pocket holsters. Never before has there been a material this viscous. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your front pocket. The inside is made of a slick pack cloth for a low friction draw, and the core is just the right amount of foam to break up the outline of the gun. Available in black</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(316171,76,0,148775,'<p>Desantis Nemesis holster, N38, LCP/P3AT, Black</p>'),(316173,76,1,148775,'<h4>DeSantis Gunhide, <a title=\"Nemesis N38\" href=\"https://rsrgroup.com/product/DSGN38BJG3Z0\" target=\"_blank\">Nemesis Pocket Holster</a>, Fits P-3AT, Ruger LCP/Ruger LCP II, Ambidextrous, Black</h4>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Pocket holster that will absolutely not move out of position in your front pocket due to the \"sticky\" material</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Inside is made of a slick pack cloth for a low friction draw</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Wide base helps keep firearm in place for optimal draw each time</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: $27.99</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>The Nemesis(R) will revolutionize pocket holsters. Never before has there been a material this viscous. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your front pocket. The inside is made of a slick pack cloth for a low friction draw, and the core is just the right amount of foam to break up the outline of the gun. Available in black</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>792695268987</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>DeSantis Gunhide</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>N38BJG3Z0</strong></td>\r\n<th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>N38</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>The Nemesis</strong></td>\r\n<th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Pocket Holster</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Hand</th>\r\n<td><strong>Ambidextrous</strong></td>\r\n<th>Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Black</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Fit</th>\r\n<td><strong>Keltec P3AT/Ruger LCP</strong></td>\r\n<th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Holsters</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Material</th>\r\n<td><strong>Nylon</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(344483,85,1,148775,'Desantis Nemesis Pocket Holster, LCP/LCPII/P3AT, Beretta 21, Black'),(344484,304,1,148775,NULL),(316178,75,0,148777,'<p><span>CAA Command Arms/EMA Tactical Quick Detach Single Point Adjustable Rifle Sling - OPS black</span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"attrLabels\">Color:</td>\r\n<td width=\"50.0%\">\r\n<h2>Black</h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"attrLabels\">MPN:</td>\r\n<td width=\"50.0%\">\r\n<h2>CAA-OPS1</h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"attrLabels\">Model:</td>\r\n<td width=\"50.0%\">\r\n<h2>CAA-OPS1</h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"attrLabels\">Type:</td>\r\n<td width=\"50.0%\"><span>Rifle Sling</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"attrLabels\">Cache:</td>\r\n<td width=\"50.0%\"><span>cache</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"attrLabels\">Features:</td>\r\n<td width=\"50.0%\"><span>Quick Release, Single Point</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><span></span></p>'),(316180,75,1,148777,'<p><span>CAA Command Arms/EMA Tactical Quick Detach Single Point Adjustable Rifle Sling - OPS black</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Model: CAA-OPS1</li>\r\n<li>Black</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>'),(316179,76,0,148777,'<p>CAA/EMA Tactical One Point Rifle Sling</p>'),(316181,76,1,148777,'<p>CAA Command Arms/EMA Tactical Quick Detach Single Point Adjustable Rifle Sling - OPS black</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Model: CAA-OPS1</li>\r\n<li>Black</li>\r\n</ul>'),(344486,85,1,148777,'CAA Command Arms/EMA Tactical Quick Detach Single Point Adjustable Rifle Sling - OPS black'),(316206,75,0,148784,'<p>Hoppes Boresnake - .22, .223, 5.56mm</p>\r\n<p>Hoppe’s BoreSnake is the fastest bore cleaner on the planet. One pass loosens large particles, scrubs out the remaining residue with a bronze brush, then swabs it all spotless with a cleaning area 160x larger than a standard patch.</p>\r\n<p>Add a few drops of <a href=\"https://www.hoppes.com/gun-oils/more/lubricating-oil\">Hoppe’s No. 9 Lubricating Oil</a> or <a href=\"https://www.hoppes.com/gun-oils/elite-gun-oil\">Hoppe’s Elite<span> </span>Gun Oil</a> and your gun’s ready for storage.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The world’s quickest, three-step bore system.</li>\r\n<li>Extremely packable.</li>\r\n<li>Available for rifles, shotguns and pistols.</li>\r\n<li>Brass weight on the pull cord is stamped with the size.</li>\r\n<li>Patented one-piece design.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>World\'s Fastest Gun Bore Cleaner</p>\r\n<p>Simply a Better Way to Clean Rifles. Brushes and swabs bore in one quick pass. Built-in bore brushes. Multiple short brushes embedded in the floss pass easily through the shortest action or port. Initial floss area (inside the barrel) removes loose grit and debris prior to the scrubbing action of the brush. Main floss, with 160 times more floss than a patch, super cleans the bore.</p>\r\n<p>Brass weighted drop-through cord slips easily down barrel grasp and pull the cleaning cord through the barrel. One pull through does it all. No assembly required. Lightweight and compact. No exposed metal to damage sensitive rifling or crown. Solvent compatible. Washable and reusable.</p>\r\n<p>- Use with: Rifles<br />- Caliber: .22 cal Centerfire &amp; Rimfire</p>'),(316208,75,1,148784,'<p>Hoppes Boresnake - .22, .223, 5.56mm</p>\r\n<p>Hoppe’s BoreSnake is the fastest bore cleaner on the planet. One pass loosens large particles, scrubs out the remaining residue with a bronze brush, then swabs it all spotless with a cleaning area 160x larger than a standard patch.</p>\r\n<p>Add a few drops of <a href=\"https://www.hoppes.com/gun-oils/more/lubricating-oil\">Hoppe’s No. 9 Lubricating Oil</a> or <a href=\"https://www.hoppes.com/gun-oils/elite-gun-oil\">Hoppe’s Elite<span> </span>Gun Oil</a> and your gun’s ready for storage.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The world’s quickest, three-step bore system.</li>\r\n<li>Extremely packable.</li>\r\n<li>Available for rifles, shotguns and pistols.</li>\r\n<li>Brass weight on the pull cord is stamped with the size.</li>\r\n<li>Patented one-piece design.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>World\'s Fastest Gun Bore Cleaner</p>\r\n<p>Simply a Better Way to Clean Rifles. Brushes and swabs bore in one quick pass. Built-in bore brushes. Multiple short brushes embedded in the floss pass easily through the shortest action or port. Initial floss area (inside the barrel) removes loose grit and debris prior to the scrubbing action of the brush. Main floss, with 160 times more floss than a patch, super cleans the bore.</p>\r\n<p>Brass weighted drop-through cord slips easily down barrel grasp and pull the cleaning cord through the barrel. One pull through does it all. No assembly required. Lightweight and compact. No exposed metal to damage sensitive rifling or crown. Solvent compatible. Washable and reusable.</p>\r\n<p>- Use with: Rifles<br />- Caliber: .22 cal Centerfire &amp; Rimfire</p>'),(316207,76,0,148784,'<p>Hoppes Boresnake - .22, .223, 5.56mm</p>'),(316209,76,1,148784,'<p>Hoppes Boresnake - .22, .223, 5.56mm</p>'),(316210,75,0,148785,'<p>Hoppes Boresnake - .270/7mm</p>'),(316212,75,1,148785,'<p>Hoppes Boresnake - .270/7mm</p>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>BoreSnake, BoreSnake, Bore Cleaner, For .270/7MM Rifles</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"hazard-warning\">Extremely Packable</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">One-Piece Design</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Integrated Bronze Brush</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: $12.45</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>The BoreSnake is the fastest bore cleaner on the planet. One pass loosens large particles, scrubs out the remaining residue with a bronze brush, then swabs it all spotless with a cleaning area 160x larger than a standard patch.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.17em;\">Specifications</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>026285001037</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>BoreSnake</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>24014D</strong></td>\r\n<th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>BoreSnake</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Bore Cleaner</strong></td>\r\n<th>Fit</th>\r\n<td><strong>270/7MM</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Description</th>\r\n<td><strong>Rifle</strong></td>\r\n<th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Cleaning Hardware &amp; Components</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(316211,76,0,148785,'<p>Hoppes Boresnake - .270/7mm</p>'),(316213,76,1,148785,'<p>Hoppes Boresnake - .270/7mm</p>'),(344492,85,1,148785,'Hoppes Boresnake - .270/7mm'),(316214,75,0,148786,'<p>Hoppes Boresnake - 20Ga</p>'),(316215,75,1,148786,'<p><span style=\"font-size: 1em;\">BoreSnake w Den, Bore Cleaner, For 12 Gauge Shotgun, Clam Pack</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<p><span>The BoreSnake is the fastest bore cleaner on the planet. One pass loosens large particles, scrubs out the remaining residue with a bronze brush, then swabs it all spotless with a cleaning area 160x larger than a standard patch.</span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Brass weight on the pull cord is stamped with size</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">50% more brush cleaning power</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Cone-shaped bore guide on the leading end</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Nylon cord attached directly to the bronze scrubbing brush</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Lubrication zone</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Extremely Packable</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">One-Piece Design</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Integrated Bronze Brush</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: $12.75</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>Everything you love about the BoreSnake plus better cleaning and superior strength.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>026285002287</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>BoreSnake</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>24035BG</strong></td>\r\n<th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>BoreSnake</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Bore Cleaner</strong></td>\r\n<th>Fit</th>\r\n<td><strong>12 Gauge</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Description</th>\r\n<td><strong>Shotgun</strong></td>\r\n<th>Packaging</th>\r\n<td><strong>Clam Pack</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Cleaning Hardware &amp; Components</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(344493,76,1,148786,'<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>BoreSnake w Den, Bore Cleaner, For 12 Gauge Shotgun, Clam Pack</h4>\r\n<p>The BoreSnake is the fastest bore cleaner on the planet. One pass loosens large particles, scrubs out the remaining residue with a bronze brush, then swabs it all spotless with a cleaning area 160x larger than a standard patch.</p>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Brass weight on the pull cord is stamped with size</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">50% more brush cleaning power</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Cone-shaped bore guide on the leading end</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Nylon cord attached directly to the bronze scrubbing brush</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Lubrication zone</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Extremely Packable</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">One-Piece Design</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Integrated Bronze Brush</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: $12.75</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>Everything you love about the BoreSnake plus better cleaning and superior strength.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>026285002287</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>BoreSnake</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>24035BG</strong></td>\r\n<th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>BoreSnake</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Bore Cleaner</strong></td>\r\n<th>Fit</th>\r\n<td><strong>12 Gauge</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Description</th>\r\n<td><strong>Shotgun</strong></td>\r\n<th>Packaging</th>\r\n<td><strong>Clam Pack</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Cleaning Hardware &amp; Components</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(344494,85,1,148786,'Hoppes Boresnake with Den - 12Ga'),(316216,75,0,148787,'<p>Hoppes Elite First Place Shotgun Cleaning Kit</p>'),(316218,75,1,148787,'<p>Hoppes Elite First Place Shotgun Cleaning Kit</p>\r\n<p><span>Hoppe\'s is highlighting it award-winning Elite line of products in this cleaning kit for shotguns. This kit comes in a plastic, low-profile, double-hinged reusable box. It\'s latches tight to help keep out dust and moisture, maintaining the integrity of all your products. This kit contains all your shotgun-cleaning essentials including a 2-ounce bottle of gun cleaner, 2-ounces gun oil, a three-piece rod, an anti-debris nylon brush, a bore brush, cotton cleaning patches, a cleaning cloth and a set of adapters and accessories. Hoppe\'s Elite Gun Cleaner was named \"Accessory of the Year\" by Shooting Industry Magazine in 2005, inspiring this collection of premium Hoppe\'s-brand cleaning products.</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MSRP: $43.95</li>\r\n</ul>'),(316217,76,0,148787,'<p>Hoppes Elite First Place Shotgun Cleaning Kit</p>'),(316219,76,1,148787,'<p>Hoppes Elite First Place Shotgun Cleaning Kit</p>\r\n<p>Hoppe\'s is highlighting it award-winning Elite line of products in this cleaning kit for shotguns. This kit comes in a plastic, low-profile, double-hinged reusable box. It\'s latches tight to help keep out dust and moisture, maintaining the integrity of all your products. This kit contains all your shotgun-cleaning essentials including a 2-ounce bottle of gun cleaner, 2-ounces gun oil, a three-piece rod, an anti-debris nylon brush, a bore brush, cotton cleaning patches, a cleaning cloth and a set of adapters and accessories. Hoppe\'s Elite Gun Cleaner was named \"Accessory of the Year\" by Shooting Industry Magazine in 2005, inspiring this collection of premium Hoppe\'s-brand cleaning products.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MSRP: $43.95</li>\r\n</ul>'),(344491,85,1,148787,'Hoppes Elite First Place Shotgun Cleaning Kit'),(316220,75,0,148788,'<p>Israeli Special Forces AR-15 Pistol Grip w battery compartment</p>\r\n<p><span>Target Sports AR15 Pistol Grip, with Battery Compartment, Black Finish AR15G</span></p>'),(316222,75,1,148788,'<p>Israeli Special Forces AR-15 Pistol Grip w battery compartment</p>\r\n<p><span>Target Sports AR15 Pistol Grip, with Battery Compartment, Black Finish AR15G.  Identical to The Mako Group AG-43.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>Purpose: A pistol grip that provides a better shooting angle, better control, less slipping and less wrist fatigue than other grips.</span><br /><br /><span>Features: Finger swelts and a backstrap shape designed to enhance grip, even when wet.</span><br /><span>Extended beavertail for better control by allowing higher firmer hold.</span><br /><span>Storage area with hinged door.</span><br /><span>MIL-SPEC reinforced polymer composite.</span><br /><br /><span>Weight      3.4 ounces  (96 gr)</span><br /><span>Width        1.3\"  (33 mm)</span><br /><span>Height      5\"  (127 mm)</span><br /><span>Length      3.27\"  (83 mm)</span><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>'),(316221,76,0,148788,'<p><span>Target Sports AR15 Pistol Grip, with Battery Compartment, Black Finish AR15G</span></p>'),(316223,76,1,148788,'<p><span>Target Sports AR15 Pistol Grip, with Battery Compartment, Black Finish AR15G</span></p>\r\n<p>Target Sports AR15 Pistol Grip, with Battery Compartment, Black Finish AR15G.  Identical to The Mako Group AG-43.</p>\r\n<p>Purpose: A pistol grip that provides a better shooting angle, better control, less slipping and less wrist fatigue than other grips.<br /><br />Features: Finger swelts and a backstrap shape designed to enhance grip, even when wet.<br />Extended beavertail for better control by allowing higher firmer hold.<br />Storage area with hinged door.<br />MIL-SPEC reinforced polymer composite.<br /><br />Weight      3.4 ounces  (96 gr)<br />Width        1.3\"  (33 mm)<br />Height      5\"  (127 mm)<br />Length      3.27\"  (83 mm)<span></span></p>'),(344495,85,1,148788,'Target Sports Israeli Special Forces AR-15 Pistol Grip w battery compartment AR15G'),(316272,75,0,148801,'Magpul AFG2 Angled Fore Grip, MAG414-BLK'),(316273,75,1,148801,'<p>Magpul AFG2 Angled Fore Grip, MAG414-BLK</p>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Magpul Industries, Angled Foregrip 2, Grip, Fits Picatinny, Black Finish</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Polymer three-piece design with interchangeable finger shelf</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">All mounting hardware included</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Mounts to 1913 picatinny rail</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: $34.95</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MAP: $34.20</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(344503,76,1,148801,'<p>Magpul AFG2 Angled Fore Grip, MAG414-BLK</p>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Magpul Industries, Angled Foregrip 2, Grip, Fits Picatinny, Black Finish</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Polymer three-piece design with interchangeable finger shelf</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">All mounting hardware included</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Mounts to 1913 picatinny rail</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: $34.95</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MAP: $34.20</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>The AFG-2 is a slim line design that is shorter in overall length and width compared to the original AFG. Smaller size allows for mounting on a wider variety of railed hand guards and better compatibility with rail covers and accessory mounts. Compatible with most any M1913 Picatinny-railed hand guard, the Magpul AFG-2 (Angled Fore Grip) takes into account natural body mechanics and provides a comfortable and stable user interface that reduces fatigue and allows for more precise weapon control. By positioning the shooter\'s hand high on the centerline of the bore, unlike conventional vertical fore grips, the AFG-2 helps mitigate recoil and control the weapon to facilitate faster, more accurate follow-up shots.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>873750003429</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>Magpul Industries</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>MAG414-BLK</strong></td>\r\n<th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>AFG-2</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Grip</strong></td>\r\n<th>Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Black</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Fit</th>\r\n<td><strong>Picatinny</strong></td>\r\n<th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Grips</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(344504,85,1,148801,'Magpul AFG2 Angled Fore Grip, MAG414-BLK'),(316274,75,0,148802,'Magpul B.A.D. Lever, black'),(316275,75,1,148802,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 1em;\">Magpul Industries, B.A.D. Lever, Bolt Catch Extension, Fits AR-15, Black</span></strong></p>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Compatible with mil-spec forged AR15/M16 receivers</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Attaches to the existing bolt catch</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Torx(R) mounting screw with Nyloc(R)</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Torx wrench included</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: <strong>$32.95</strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Retail MAP: <strong>$31.30</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(344505,76,1,148802,'<p>Made from milspec-anodized aluminum, the B.A.D. Lever attaches to the standard AR15/M16 bolt release without permanent modification to the weapon</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• Compatible with mil-spec forged AR15/M16 receivers</p>\r\n<p>• Attaches to the existing bolt catch</p>\r\n<p>• Torx(R) mounting screw with Nyloc(R)</p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(344506,85,1,148802,'Magpul Industries, B.A.D. Lever, Bolt Catch Extension, Fits AR-15, Black Finish'),(316278,75,0,148804,'Magpul MBUS Rear Flip Up Sight Gen2, BLK'),(316279,75,1,148804,'<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Magpul Industries, MOE Slim Line Pistol Grip, Fits AR-15/M4, TSP Textured, Gray</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Replacement for AR15/M4 pistol-grip</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">More vertical grip angle than standard A2 grips</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Slimmer thickness for a slightly smaller feel</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: $20.95</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MAP: $19.90</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>Similar to the MOE-K2, the MOE SL Grip (MOE Slim Line) is a drop-in upgrade for AR15/M4 pistol grips with a more vertical grip angle optimized for short LOP weapons that bring the primary hand in closer to the shooter\'s body. With an aggressive TSP texture for positive weapon control along with excellent ergonomics, the SL Grip provides a slightly smaller size and slimline feel. All mounting hardware included. Made in U.S.A.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(344507,76,1,148804,'<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Magpul Industries, MOE Slim Line Pistol Grip, Fits AR-15, TSP Textured, Gray</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Replacement for AR15/M4 pistol-grip</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">More vertical grip angle than standard A2 grips</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Slimmer thickness for a slightly smaller feel</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: $20.95</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MAP: $19.90</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>Similar to the MOE-K2, the MOE SL Grip (MOE Slim Line) is a drop-in upgrade for AR15/M4 pistol grips with a more vertical grip angle optimized for short LOP weapons that bring the primary hand in closer to the shooter\'s body. With an aggressive TSP texture for positive weapon control along with excellent ergonomics, the SL Grip provides a slightly smaller size and slimline feel. All mounting hardware included. Made in U.S.A.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>873750001975</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>Magpul Industries</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>MAG539-GRY</strong></td>\r\n<th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>MOE Slim Line Grip</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Grip</strong></td>\r\n<th>Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Gray</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Description</th>\r\n<td><strong>TSP Texture</strong></td>\r\n<th>Fit</th>\r\n<td><strong>AR-15</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Grips</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(344508,85,1,148804,'Magpul Industries, MOE Slim Line Pistol Grip, Fits AR-15/M4, Gray'),(316282,75,0,148806,'Magpul MOE SL Grip AR15/M4 BLK'),(316283,75,1,148806,'<p><strong>Magpul Industries, MOE Slim Pistol Line Grip, Fits AR-15/M4, TSP Textured, Black</strong></p>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Replacement for AR15/M4 pistol-grip</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">More vertical grip angle than standard A2 grips</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Slimmer thickness for a slightly smaller feel</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: $20.95</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MAP: $19.90</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>Similar to the MOE-K2, the MOE SL Grip (MOE Slim Line) is a drop-in upgrade for AR15/M4 pistol grips with a more vertical grip angle optimized for short LOP weapons that bring the primary hand in closer to the shooter\'s body. With an aggressive TSP texture for positive weapon control along with excellent ergonomics, the SL Grip provides a slightly smaller size and slimline feel. All mounting hardware included. Made in U.S.A.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(344511,76,1,148806,'<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Magpul Industries, MOE Slim Pistol Line Grip, Fits AR-15/M4, TSP Textured, Black</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Replacement for AR15/M4 pistol-grip</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">More vertical grip angle than standard A2 grips</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Slimmer thickness for a slightly smaller feel</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: $20.95</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MAP: $19.90</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>Similar to the MOE-K2, the MOE SL Grip (MOE Slim Line) is a drop-in upgrade for AR15/M4 pistol grips with a more vertical grip angle optimized for short LOP weapons that bring the primary hand in closer to the shooter\'s body. With an aggressive TSP texture for positive weapon control along with excellent ergonomics, the SL Grip provides a slightly smaller size and slimline feel. All mounting hardware included. Made in U.S.A.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>873750001944</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>Magpul Industries</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>MAG539-BLK</strong></td>\r\n<th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>MOE Slim Line Grip</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Grip</strong></td>\r\n<th>Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Black</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Description</th>\r\n<td><strong>TSP Texture</strong></td>\r\n<th>Fit</th>\r\n<td><strong>AR-15</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Grips</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(344512,85,1,148806,'Magpul Industries, MOE Slim Pistol Line Grip, Fits AR-15/M4, TSP Textured, Black'),(316284,75,0,148807,'MAGPUL MS4 DUAL QD SLING GEN2 BLK'),(316285,75,1,148807,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 1em;\">Magpul Industries, MS4 Dual QD Sling, Fits AR Rifles, Gen 2, Black Finish</span></strong></p>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Heavy-duty push-button QD Sling Swivels</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Compatible with push-button QD socket</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Low-profile adjustment Slider</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Strong and wear resistant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>Filling the same mission requirement as the standard MS3 Sling, the MS4 can quickly switch between one-point and two-point configuration. The MS4 maintains material construction and specifications identical to that of the standard MS3, but instead of Magpul Paraclips(TM) it features two heavy-duty push-button QD Sling Swivels along with a custom steel connection ring to allow one to two-point convertibility. This modification allows compatibility with QD sling cups commonly found on lower receivers, receiver end plates, buttstocks, and many low-profile forward QD Sling Mounts. The MS4 Dual QD GEN2 incorporates a new low profile quick-adjust Slider which minimizes bulk and allows for secure, yet effortless, sling adjustment. Webbing length has also been increased for a comfortable fit with all body types and armor configurations. Made in U.S.A. and 100% Berry Amendment compliant.</p>\r\n<h3>Features:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Heavy-duty push-button Quick Disconnect Sling Swivels for both one and two-point attachment</li>\r\n<li>Compatible with buttstocks, end plates, receivers, and hand guards that have a push-button QD socket</li>\r\n<li>Durable, precision-cast steel QD D-Ring allows for quick transition from one to two-point mode and is finished with Melonite for extreme resistance to wear and corrosion</li>\r\n<li>Custom 1.25 inch wide nylon webbing material is strong and wear resistant while remaining anti-chaff for user comfort</li>\r\n<li>Low-profile adjustment Slider for adding or removing sling tension in two-point mode with a single-hand</li>\r\n<li>Colored webbing has Near Infrared NIR treatment to reduce IR signature</li>\r\n<li>MSRP: <strong>$64.95</strong></li>\r\n<li>Retail MAP: <strong>$61.70</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(344681,76,1,148807,'<p><strong>Magpul Industries, MS4 Dual QD Sling, Fits AR Rifles, Gen 2, Black Finish</strong></p>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Heavy-duty push-button QD Sling Swivels</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Compatible with push-button QD socket</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Low-profile adjustment Slider</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Strong and wear resistant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>Filling the same mission requirement as the standard MS3 Sling, the MS4 can quickly switch between one-point and two-point configuration. The MS4 maintains material construction and specifications identical to that of the standard MS3, but instead of Magpul Paraclips(TM) it features two heavy-duty push-button QD Sling Swivels along with a custom steel connection ring to allow one to two-point convertibility. This modification allows compatibility with QD sling cups commonly found on lower receivers, receiver end plates, buttstocks, and many low-profile forward QD Sling Mounts. The MS4 Dual QD GEN2 incorporates a new low profile quick-adjust Slider which minimizes bulk and allows for secure, yet effortless, sling adjustment. Webbing length has also been increased for a comfortable fit with all body types and armor configurations. Made in U.S.A. and 100% Berry Amendment compliant.</p>\r\n<h3>Features:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Heavy-duty push-button Quick Disconnect Sling Swivels for both one and two-point attachment</li>\r\n<li>Compatible with buttstocks, end plates, receivers, and hand guards that have a push-button QD socket</li>\r\n<li>Durable, precision-cast steel QD D-Ring allows for quick transition from one to two-point mode and is finished with Melonite for extreme resistance to wear and corrosion</li>\r\n<li>Custom 1.25 inch wide nylon webbing material is strong and wear resistant while remaining anti-chaff for user comfort</li>\r\n<li>Low-profile adjustment Slider for adding or removing sling tension in two-point mode with a single-hand</li>\r\n<li>Colored webbing has Near Infrared NIR treatment to reduce IR signature</li>\r\n<li>MSRP: <strong>$64.95</strong></li>\r\n<li>Retail MAP: <strong>$61.70</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>873750010793</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>Magpul Industries</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>MAG518-BLK</strong></td>\r\n<th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>MS4 Dual QD Sling</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Sling</strong></td>\r\n<th>Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Black</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Fit</th>\r\n<td><strong>Gen 2</strong></td>\r\n<th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Slings</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(344682,85,1,148807,'Magpul Industries, MS4 Dual QD Sling, Fits AR Rifles, Gen 2, Black'),(316310,75,0,148814,'<p>Mako FAB Defense Dual Picatinny Rail Attachment for Standard AR-15 Handguards Polymer Black</p>\r\n<p><span>The FAB Defense dual picatinny rail for the AR-15 standard 2 piece handguards provides two 45 degree rails for mounting accessories. The can be mounted on the upper or lower portion of the handguards using the existing vent holes. Made from lightweight reinforced polymer, mounting hardware included. Made in Israel.</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"product-identifiers stack-s\">\r\n<li class=\"vendor-product-number \" data-ng-class=\"{\'is-hidden\':selector.multipleSaleItemsAreReturned()}\" data-ng-bind-template=\"Manufacturer #: DPR16/4-OD\">Manufacturer #: DPR16/4-OD</li>\r\n</ul>'),(316312,75,1,148814,'<p>Mako FAB Defense Dual Picatinny Rail Attachment for Standard AR-15 Handguards Polymer Black</p>\r\n<p>FAB Defense AR15 Double Offset Picatinny Rail Systems DPR 16/4</p>\r\n<p><span>The FAB Defense dual picatinny rail for the AR-15 standard 2 piece handguards provides two 45 degree rails for mounting accessories. The can be mounted on the upper or lower portion of the handguards using the existing vent holes. Made from lightweight reinforced polymer, mounting hardware included. Made in Israel.</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"product-identifiers stack-s\">\r\n<li class=\"vendor-product-number \" data-ng-class=\"{\'is-hidden\':selector.multipleSaleItemsAreReturned()}\" data-ng-bind-template=\"Manufacturer #: DPR16/4-OD\">Manufacturer #: DPR16/4-OD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The<span> FAB Defense AR15 Double Offset Picatinny Rail Systems DPR 16/4 </span>equips your rifle with high grade polymer dual accessory rails for versatile flashlights and accessory mountingy.</p>'),(316311,76,0,148814,'<p>Mako FAB Defense Dual Picatinny Rail Attachment for Standard AR-15 Handguards Polymer Black</p>'),(316313,76,1,148814,'<p>Mako FAB Defense Dual Picatinny Rail Attachment for Standard AR-15 Handguards Polymer Black</p>\r\n<p>FAB Defense AR15 Double Offset Picatinny Rail Systems DPR 16/4</p>\r\n<p>The FAB Defense dual picatinny rail for the AR-15 standard 2 piece handguards provides two 45 degree rails for mounting accessories. The can be mounted on the upper or lower portion of the handguards using the existing vent holes. Made from lightweight reinforced polymer, mounting hardware included. Made in Israel.</p>\r\n<ul class=\"product-identifiers stack-s\">\r\n<li class=\"vendor-product-number \" data-ng-class=\"{\'is-hidden\':selector.multipleSaleItemsAreReturned()}\" data-ng-bind-template=\"Manufacturer #: DPR16/4-OD\">Manufacturer #: DPR16/4-OD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The FAB Defense AR15 Double Offset Picatinny Rail Systems DPR 16/4 equips your rifle with high grade polymer dual accessory rails for versatile flashlights and accessory mountingy.</p>\r\n<h4>Advantages:</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Two 65mm / 2.5’’ accessory rails, each at 45 degrees off-center</li>\r\n<li>May be positioned on upper or lower segment of the handguard</li>\r\n<li>Provides superior positioning for operating tactical flashlights</li>\r\n<li>Short rails design allow most of the handguard to remain clear</li>\r\n<li>Available in black, olive drab green or flat dark earth</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Compatibility:</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>All carbine, mid and rifle length M16 standard handguards.</li>\r\n<li>Most one notch picatinny flashlight mounts.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Since its foundation, FAB-Defense has been leading in development and manufacture of the highest quality tactical equipment and weapon accessories for Israel’s Military and Police. Because <a href=\"https://www.fab-defense.com/en/page-about-us\">FAB-Defense</a> works in collaboration with Special Forces and SWAT teams worldwide. </p>\r\n<p>Furthermore the State-of the-Art engineering, manufacturing and quality assurance methods are joined into leading technologies ensuring the products produced exceed even the most strict industry standards. In addition FAB Defense products are thoroughly tested in the harshest environments and under extreme conditions. Conditions that include freezing snow and scorching deserts by some of the best tactical units in the world. FAB unique production standards are first and foremost led by operational field experience, leading the way in tactical accessory operation.</p>'),(344689,85,1,148814,'FAB Defense Mako AR15 Double Offset Picatinny Rail Systems DPR 16/4'),(316322,75,0,148817,'<p><a title=\"Masters Gun Care\" href=\"http://mastersguncare.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Masters Gun Care</a> CB-2 Bore Cleaner Aerosol</p>\r\n<p>Masters Bore Cleaner CB-2 is also unique. In addition to removing lead, copper, plastic and powder residues, it also aids in removal of moly build up which may occur in some shooting situations. The aerosol spray container works quite well when applying Masters Bore Cleaner straight to patches, without the concern for spilling a jar or having to dip a patch. A small bore delivery straw is also provided when you need additional help with blasting away hard-to-reach areas and again with Masters spray anyway valve system, you can even spray upside down.</p>\r\n<p>CB-2  Bore Cleaner is formulated to chmically scrub, strip and remove built up lubricants, carbon, powder, grease, waxes, lead, copper, plastic and even Moly residues that have accumulated within your bore.  Specifically formualted solvents performa a cleaning action that softens and dissolve these materials while a constant stream of fluid wash them from the bore and firearm, feely and effectively.</p>\r\n<p>We discovered Masters Gun Care products over 10 years ago at the Bianchi cup.  We were so impressed with their products and their sponsorship of some of the top shooters that we became a dealer for their products.</p>'),(316324,75,1,148817,'<p><a title=\"Masters Gun Care\" href=\"http://mastersguncare.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Masters Gun Care</a> CB-2 Bore Cleaner Aerosol</p>\r\n<p>Masters Bore Cleaner CB-2 is also unique. In addition to removing lead, copper, plastic and powder residues, it also aids in removal of moly build up which may occur in some shooting situations. The aerosol spray container works quite well when applying Masters Bore Cleaner straight to patches, without the concern for spilling a jar or having to dip a patch. A small bore delivery straw is also provided when you need additional help with blasting away hard-to-reach areas, and with Masters spray anyway valve system, you can even spray upside down.</p>\r\n<p>CB-2  Bore Cleaner is formulated to chemically scrub, strip and remove built up lubricants, carbon, powder, grease, waxes, lead, copper, plastic and even Moly residues that have accumulated within your bore.  Specifically formualted solvents performa a cleaning action that softens and dissolve these materials while a constant stream of fluid wash them from the bore and firearm, feely and effectively.</p>\r\n<p>We discovered Masters Gun Care products over 10 years ago at the Bianchi cup.  We were so impressed with their products and their sponsorship of some of the top shooters that we became a dealer for their products.  When professional shooters that shoot 40k rounds a year use the product, you know it works great!</p>'),(316323,76,0,148817,'<p>Masters Gun Care CB-2 Bore Cleaner Aerosol</p>'),(316325,76,1,148817,'<p><a title=\"Masters Gun Care\" href=\"http://mastersguncare.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Masters Gun Care</a> CB-2 Bore Cleaner Aerosol</p>\r\n<p>Masters Bore Cleaner CB-2 is also unique. In addition to removing lead, copper, plastic and powder residues, it also aids in removal of moly build up which may occur in some shooting situations. The aerosol spray container works quite well when applying Masters Bore Cleaner straight to patches, without the concern for spilling a jar or having to dip a patch. A small bore delivery straw is also provided when you need additional help with blasting away hard-to-reach areas, and with Masters spray anyway valve system, you can even spray upside down.</p>\r\n<p>CB-2  Bore Cleaner is formulated to chemically scrub, strip and remove built up lubricants, carbon, powder, grease, waxes, lead, copper, plastic and even Moly residues that have accumulated within your bore.  Specifically formualted solvents performa a cleaning action that softens and dissolve these materials while a constant stream of fluid wash them from the bore and firearm, feely and effectively.</p>\r\n<p>We discovered Masters Gun Care products over 10 years ago at the Bianchi cup.  We were so impressed with their products and their sponsorship of some of the top shooters that we became a dealer for their products.  When professional shooters that shoot 40k rounds a year use the product, you know it works great!</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><strong>The Masters Story – Quality Gun Care Products</strong><br />As an outdoorsman, avid hunter and plinker most of my life and a serious competitive shooter for the last 15 years, I have tried a lot of gun care products. I never dreamed that I would someday be involved in the production of them. During my career, I have worked with advanced synthetic lubricants. This work was directed towards applications outside the shooting industry, for situations that are even more demanding than use in firearms. In these situations a traditional petroleum based lubricant simply will not work.</p>\r\n<p><br />It only seemed logical to test some of the high performance materials I was already working with for shooting applications. In the past, I had been disappointed with many of the commercial products I had tried. They either evaporated quickly, became gummy, failed to prevent rust, or seemed to allow rapid accumulation of hard carbon in critical areas. When trying high performance synthetics, I quickly noticed the difference and started sharing the discovery with my friends.</p>\r\n<p><br />As I became more involved with testing and development, I discovered many of the products that are called synthetics, are only marginally better than petroleum based oil. In fact, some are just highly refined petroleum products. However, due to various court decisions, manufactures are allowed to call them ‘Synthetic’. This has caused a lot of confusion for consumers in various industries and has transcended into the gun care products market.</p>\r\n<p><br />Sometimes, lower cost “synthetic” additives are included in order for the manufacturer to claim their product “synthetic” but provide relatively little performance improvement. Since firearms may be used in dangerous situations where reliability is absolutely critical, performance should never be sacrificed to make a cheaper product. Masters Gun Care Products are made from materials normally passed over by many producers because of the high cost. Although we understand the need and desire to make “price points” and “profit margins” as a selling point, we also believe performance should not be sacrificed. Therefore, you will never find low grade synthetics, petroleum, Chlorine, Teflon, Moly or Graphite in Masters Gun Care Products.</p>\r\n<p><br />Because a synthetic lubricant is man-made, it can be designed or engineered to provide the exact characteristics that are desired. Choosing the right synthetic to match the job is very important. Each additive provides different benefits and liabilities. The characteristics I considered important for a firearm lubricant are listed below with a description of how they affect performance.</p>\r\n<p><br /><strong>Viscosity</strong> - the measure of a fluid\'s resistance to flow as related to its mass. For a lubricant, a higher viscosity typically creates a thicker film layer on metal. For high velocity friction, this layer prevents metal to metal contact. Viscosity decreases as temperature increases, so film layers are reduced as a firearm heats up. Choosing the right viscosity for the application is very important.</p>\r\n<p><br /><strong>Viscosity Index</strong> - the measure of how much viscosity is affected by temperature. Masters Gun Care Products proprietary formulation has a very high viscosity index. This allows a higher viscosity material to be used. It remains functional at a very low temperature while still maintaining a protective film thickness at high temperatures. The viscosity index can be influenced by additives, but they tend to quickly breakdown. Masters Gun Care Products do not use any viscosity modifiers.</p>\r\n<p><br /><strong>Pour Point</strong> - the lowest temperature that a fluid will still flow. Masters Gun Care Products proprietary formulation has a pour point of –60°F. This means the operating temperature range should cover any normal condition encountered by a personal firearm and will perform well in even the most extreme situations. The pour point can also be affected by use of additives. Masters Gun Care Products do not use any pour point depressants.</p>\r\n<p><br /><strong>Volatility</strong> - the tendency of a product to vaporize at a relatively low temperature. Volatility can vary quite a bit even within the same class of synthetics. Some lubricants evaporate very quickly. Masters Gun Care Products proprietary formulation has a very low volatility, which means increased staying power, especially in high temperature applications under extreme conditions.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Polarity</strong> - a characteristic of the products molecular structure. Masters Gun Care Products proprietary formulation is naturally Polar. This means it is attracted by or attaches to metal. Polarity also helps reduce the volatility and the attraction of charged dust particles. This is a significant advantage. Some commonly used synthetics are not at all Polar in character.</p>\r\n<p><br /><strong>Solubility</strong>- Because of the polarity and its general chemical makeup, Masters Gun Care Products proprietary formulation helps prevent carbon from becoming tightly attached to metal surfaces. It keeps this carbon material in a soft residue form, which does not inhibit the firearms operation. When Masters Gun Care Products are used, cleaning is much easier. Some lubricants have no effect on carbon residues and allow them to deposit on metal surfaces, instead of keeping them dissolved and in a soft form. The oil might look cleaner, but the powder residue is stuck to the gun.</p>\r\n<p><br /><strong>Corrosion Protection</strong> - Corrosion prevention is largely controlled by additives used in the formulation. Most lubricants have very little natural corrosion protection properties. Masters Gun Care Products has selected State-of-the-Art additives to provide the best corrosion protection possible for the firearms application.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Wear Protection</strong> - There are many types of wear which may be described as Fretting, Pitting, Micro- Pitting, Scuffing, Spalling, Fatigue, Brinnelling and others. Each one is caused by different situations.</p>\r\n<p>The right combination of lubricant and additives allow a product to be tailored to best match the wear conditions encountered by a firearm. Masters Gun Care Products proprietary formula is designed to provide that protection in small and large caliber firearms. Masters Gun Care Products development efforts initially started with our flagship product, Synthetic Gun Oil OGS-3. We then incorporated it into Masters Aerosol Synthetic Lubricant &amp; Protectant PLS-4. We also have formulated an action cleaner, a bore cleaner and a grease that are based on synthetic chemistry. As a bonus, all of Masters Gun Care Products aerosol offerings are charged with a CO2 propellant. This means Masters Gun Care Products are easier to store and are safer for the ozone. Masters Gun Care Products are unique when compared with some other products currently on the market. Below is a brief description and summary of each product offered by Masters. When used in combination or alone, the end result is increased performance, easier clean-up and less corrosion and wear to your firearm.</p>\r\n<p>None of Masters Gun Care Products contain Chlorine, Moly, Graphite or Teflon. They are intended to provide the best performance possible with today’s technology. As a new company coming into a market with lots of products to choose from, we believe there is no place for a product that is not “top of the line”. We look forward to serving the firearms market and hope you will join us to … <em><strong>“Experience the Difference”</strong></em></p>'),(344697,85,1,148817,'Masters Gun Care CB-2 Bore Cleaner Aerosol'),(316326,75,0,148818,'<p><a title=\"Masters Gun Care\" href=\"http://mastersguncare.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Masters Gun Care</a> CGA-1 Gun &amp; Action Cleaner, 6 oz Aerosol</p>\r\n<p>Masters Action &amp; Gun Cleaner CGA-1 is used to dissolve and flush away dirt and residues from firearm surfaces and actions. The unique characteristic of this product is that it does a better job of dissolving carbon residues while not leaving a white powdery residue on the firearm surfaces as many currently marketed products do. A small amount of lubricant/protectant will remain after the cleaner has evaporated. A small bore delivery straw is provided when you need a little more aggressive stream to help flush away dirt and residue. And with Masters, you get a spray anyway valve system that means you can even spray upside down.</p>\r\n<p>Masters CGA-1 Action &amp; Gun Cleaner is an advanced formula for removing built up carbon powder residues, grease and lubricant residues, dirt, waxes, and lead or plastic particles that have accumulated in the action, chamber or firing mechanism of a firearm.  Masters Action &amp; Gun Cleaner CGA-1 softens and dissolves, then flushes then flushes residue from the firearm with a minimum of physical scraping.  CGA-1 is formulated to scrub these materials from your system and prepare it for re-lubrication without causing a dried out appearance that some firearm cleaning solvents produce.</p>\r\n<p>We discovered Masters Gun Care products over 10 years ago at the Bianchi cup.  We were so impressed with their products and their sponsorship of some of the top shooters that we became a dealer for their products.</p>'),(316328,75,1,148818,'<p><a title=\"Masters Gun Care\" href=\"http://mastersguncare.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Masters Gun Care</a> CGA-1 Gun &amp; Action Cleaner, 6 oz Aerosol</p>\r\n<p>Masters Action &amp; Gun Cleaner CGA-1 is used to dissolve and flush away dirt and residues from firearm surfaces and actions. The unique characteristic of this product is that it does a better job of dissolving carbon residues while not leaving a white powdery residue on the firearm surfaces as many currently marketed products do. A small amount of lubricant/protectant will remain after the cleaner has evaporated. A small bore delivery straw is provided when you need a little more aggressive stream to help flush away dirt and residue. And with Masters, you get a spray anyway valve system that means you can even spray upside down.</p>\r\n<p>Masters CGA-1 Action &amp; Gun Cleaner is an advanced formula for removing built up carbon powder residues, grease and lubricant residues, dirt, waxes, and lead or plastic particles that have accumulated in the action, chamber or firing mechanism of a firearm.  Masters Action &amp; Gun Cleaner CGA-1 softens and dissolves, then flushes then flushes residue from the firearm with a minimum of physical scraping.  CGA-1 is formulated to scrub these materials from your system and prepare it for re-lubrication without causing a dried out appearance that some firearm cleaning solvents produce.</p>\r\n<p>We discovered Masters Gun Care products over 10 years ago at the Bianchi cup.  We were so impressed with their products and their sponsorship of some of the top shooters that we became a dealer for their products.  When professional shooters that shoot 40k rounds a year use the product, you know it works great!</p>'),(316327,76,0,148818,'<p>Masters Gun Care CGA-1 Gun &amp; Action Cleaner</p>'),(316329,76,1,148818,'<p><a title=\"Masters Gun Care\" href=\"http://mastersguncare.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Masters Gun Care</a> CGA-1 Gun &amp; Action Cleaner, 6 oz Aerosol</p>\r\n<p>Masters Action &amp; Gun Cleaner CGA-1 is used to dissolve and flush away dirt and residues from firearm surfaces and actions. The unique characteristic of this product is that it does a better job of dissolving carbon residues while not leaving a white powdery residue on the firearm surfaces as many currently marketed products do. A small amount of lubricant/protectant will remain after the cleaner has evaporated. A small bore delivery straw is provided when you need a little more aggressive stream to help flush away dirt and residue. And with Masters, you get a spray anyway valve system that means you can even spray upside down.</p>\r\n<p>Masters CGA-1 Action &amp; Gun Cleaner is an advanced formula for removing built up carbon powder residues, grease and lubricant residues, dirt, waxes, and lead or plastic particles that have accumulated in the action, chamber or firing mechanism of a firearm.  Masters Action &amp; Gun Cleaner CGA-1 softens and dissolves, then flushes then flushes residue from the firearm with a minimum of physical scraping.  CGA-1 is formulated to scrub these materials from your system and prepare it for re-lubrication without causing a dried out appearance that some firearm cleaning solvents produce.</p>\r\n<p>We discovered Masters Gun Care products over 10 years ago at the Bianchi cup.  We were so impressed with their products and their sponsorship of some of the top shooters that we became a dealer for their products.  When professional shooters that shoot 40k rounds a year use the product, you know it works great!</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><strong>The Masters Story – Quality Gun Care Products</strong><br />As an outdoorsman, avid hunter and plinker most of my life and a serious competitive shooter for the last 15 years, I have tried a lot of gun care products. I never dreamed that I wou