rease that are based on synthetic chemistry. As a bonus, all of Masters Gun Care Products aerosol offerings are charged with a CO2 propellant. This means Masters Gun Care Products are easier to store and are safer for the ozone. Masters Gun Care Products are unique when compared with some other products currently on the market. Below is a brief description and summary of each product offered by Masters. When used in combination or alone, the end result is increased performance, easier clean-up and less corrosion and wear to your firearm.</p>\r\n<p>None of Masters Gun Care Products contain Chlorine, Moly, Graphite or Teflon. They are intended to provide the best performance possible with today’s technology. As a new company coming into a market with lots of products to choose from, we believe there is no place for a product that is not “top of the line”. We look forward to serving the firearms market and hope you will join us to … <em><strong>“Experience the Difference”</strong></em></p>'),(344701,85,1,148821,'Masters Gun Care PLS-4 Spray Lubricant (red)'),(316348,75,0,148824,'<p>Hawkepaks Mini Duffle, 8x5x5, black</p>'),(316350,75,1,148824,'<p>Hawkepaks Mini Duffle, 8x5x5, black</p>'),(316349,76,0,148824,'<p>Hawkepaks Mini Duffle, 8x5x5, black</p>'),(316351,76,1,148824,'<p>Hawkepaks Mini Duffle, 8x5x5, black</p>'),(344705,85,1,148824,'Hawkepaks Mini Duffle, 8x5x5, black'),(316352,75,0,148825,'<p><span>The Mission First Tactical Battlelink Minimalist AR-15 Stock is the perfect aftermarket stock for your rifle. This stock is extremely light and is made of polymer. This stock gives you what you need in as small a package as possible, and comes in a black finish. It has an angled non slip rubberized buttpad, which allows for faster weapon presentation. The quick detach sling mounting point is positioned for optimum usage including ambidextrous shooters, and the upper section provides enhanced cheek weld.</span><br /><br /><span>Specification and Features:</span><br /><span>Quick Detach Sling mounting point is positioned for optimum usage including ambidextrous shooters</span><br /><span>Angled non slip rubberized buttpad allows faster presentation, even with body armor</span><br /><span>Upper section provides enhanced cheek weld</span><br /><span>For Mil-Spec Buffer Tube</span><br /><span>Polymer</span><br /><span>Black</span></p>'),(316354,75,1,148825,'<p><span>The Mission First Tactical Battlelink Minimalist AR-15 Stock is the perfect aftermarket stock for your rifle. This stock is extremely light and is made of polymer. This stock gives you what you need in as small a package as possible, and comes in a black finish. It has an angled non slip rubberized buttpad, which allows for faster weapon presentation. The quick detach sling mounting point is positioned for optimum usage including ambidextrous shooters, and the upper section provides enhanced cheek weld.</span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span>The MFT Battlelink Minimalist Stock ensures that all of the functional requirements of a rifle stock are met while keeping the overall weight under 6 ounces. It is the lightest stock of its kind in the market. Features include an angled, non-slip rubber buttpad, multiple sling mounting slots and a single bottom-mounted QD sling swivel socket. This collapsbile stock is compatible with Mil-Spec diameter carbine buffer tubes.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Mission First Tactical, Battlelink Utility Stock, Fits 6 Position, Commercial Minimalist Size, Mil Spec, M4 Collapsible Stock, Black Finish</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Black finish</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Slide-on replacement for collapsible butt stock</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MilSpec Buffer Tube</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Angled non-slip rubberized buttpad</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Fits AR rifles</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: <strong>$59.99</strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Retail MAP: <strong>$49.99</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><span></span></p>'),(316353,76,0,148825,'<p>Mission First Tactical Battlelink Minimialist Stock</p>'),(316355,76,1,148825,'<p>The Mission First Tactical Battlelink Minimalist AR-15 Stock is the perfect aftermarket stock for your rifle. This stock is extremely light and is made of polymer. This stock gives you what you need in as small a package as possible, and comes in a black finish. It has an angled non slip rubberized buttpad, which allows for faster weapon presentation. The quick detach sling mounting point is positioned for optimum usage including ambidextrous shooters, and the upper section provides enhanced cheek weld.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>The MFT Battlelink Minimalist Stock ensures that all of the functional requirements of a rifle stock are met while keeping the overall weight under 6 ounces. It is the lightest stock of its kind in the market. Features include an angled, non-slip rubber buttpad, multiple sling mounting slots and a single bottom-mounted QD sling swivel socket. This collapsbile stock is compatible with Mil-Spec diameter carbine buffer tubes.<br /><br /><strong>Specification and Features:</strong><br />Quick Detach Sling mounting point is positioned for optimum usage including ambidextrous shooters<br />Angled non slip rubberized buttpad allows faster presentation, even with body armor<br />Upper section provides enhanced cheek weld<br />For Mil-Spec Buffer Tube<br />Polymer<br />Black</p>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Mission First Tactical, Battlelink Utility Stock, Fits 6 Position, Commercial Minimalist Size, Mil Spec, M4 Collapsible Stock, Black Finish<