sternum strap w/ emerg whistle integrated water-resistant cov</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(316438,75,1,148846,'<p>The Bluff is a bit smaller than the Canyon at 40 liters of total storage. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>It boasts a lot of the same features as its counterpart, constructed with a blend of water-resistant nylon and polyester fabrics for a lightweight, durable pack. MOLLE webbing on the front of the pack and inside the front panel enables you to add modular storage. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>The Bluff is a top loading pack that also has zippered access to the bottom of the main compartment. The main compartment can be transformed into two compartments. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>A padded waist strap with zippered pockets is integrated with the frame. The same mesh ventilated padding is repeated on the back of the pack, allowing you to remove the frame and waist strap for more casual use. Organizing and carrying your gear is easy with the multitude of slip pockets and sleeves in this pack. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Mesh holders on each side of the pack expand to hold up to a 32 oz bottle. This pack includes an integrated rain fly.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• 40 liters of total storage</p>\r\n<p>• Contoured padded shoulder straps</p>\r\n<p>• Padded waist strap with quick-release buckle</p>\r\n<p>• Zippered pockets in waist straps</p>\r\n<p>• Ventilated back panel</p>\r\n<p>• Removable frame</p>\r\n<p>• Top-loading main compartment, bottom access zipper</p>\r\n<p>• Integrated water resistant cover</p>\r\n<p>• Sternum strap with quick-release buckle</p>\r\n<p>• 210D nylon &amp; 600D polyester outer shell with 210D nylon inner lining</p>\r\n<p>• Size: 15inW x 21inH x 8inD</p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(316437,76,0,148846,'<p>Red Rock Gear Bluff Techinical Backpack 40L, black</p>'),(316439,76,1,148846,'<p>It boasts a lot of the same features as its counterpart, constructed with a blend of water-resistant nylon and polyester fabrics for a lightweight, durable pack. MOLLE webbing on the front of the pack and inside the front panel enables you to add modular storage. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• 40 liters of total storage</p>\r\n<p>• Contoured padded shoulder straps</p>\r\n<p>• Padded waist strap with quick-release buckle</p>'),(344733,85,1,148846,'Red Rock Gear Bluff Technical Backpack 40L, black'),(316470,75,0,148855,'<p>Trijicon GL101Y, HD Tritium Night Sights, Fits Glock, Yellow Outline MSRP: $165.00 Fits Glock Model: 17, 17L, 19, 22, 23, 24, 25, 26, 27, 28, 31, 32, 33, 34, 35, 37, 38, 39, and 45. (Does not fit Glock MOS) The HD Night Sights were specifically created to address the needs of tactical shooters. The three dot green tritium night sight set’s front sight features a taller blade and an aiming point ringed in photoluminescent paint while the rear sight is outlined in black and features a wider U-shaped notch. This unique configuration increases visibility and quickens front sight acquisition—even in transitional lighting. Additionally, the front surface of the rear sight is steeply hooked to assist in emergency one-handed slide operation. The three dot green tritium night sight set’s front sight features a taller blade and an aiming point ringed in photoluminescent paint while the rear sight is outlined in black and features a wider U-shaped notch. This unique configuration increases visibility and quickens front sight acquisition—even in transitional lighting. Additionally, the front surface of the rear sight is steeply hooked to assist in emergency one-handed slide operation. Green tritium lamps are warranted for 12 years from date of manufacture NOTE: Professional installation recommended. Dimensions for reference only FEATURES: ENHANCED FRONT-SIGHT ACQUISITION IN BRIGHT, TRANSITIONAL AND NO-LIGHT SITUATIONS.  Glow-in-the-dark, photoluminescent-painted front outline combines with a “U” notch rear and black-painted rear outlines to quickly draw your eye to the front post in all lighting conditions. ONE-HANDED SLIDE MANIPULATION. Steeply hooked front surface to assist in an emergency, one-handed slide manipulation. INSTANTLY VISIBLE SIGHT PICTURE IN NO-LIGHT AND LOW-LIGHT SITUATIONS.  Tritium phosphor-filled glass lamp illuminates sights for high visibility in all lighting conditions. ENHANCED PROTECTION FROM HEAVY RECOIL AND HARSH CLEANING SOLVENTS. Tritium gas lamps are contained within protective aluminum cylinders and have additional silicone rubber cushioning. EVENLY DISTRIBUTED LIGHT FROM TRITIUM LAMPS. Each Trijicon® tritium lamp is capped with a sapphire jewel that helps evenly distribute the light and also acts as an additional layer of protection from puncture and cleaning solvents. Specifications UPC 719307209640 Manufacturer Trijicon Manufacturer Part # GL101Y-600540 Model HD Model Tritium Type Sight Fit Fits Glock Finish/Color Yellow Outline Subcategory Handgun Sights</p>'),(316472,75,1,148855,'<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Trijicon, HD Tritium Night Sights, Fits Glock, Yellow Outline</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Instantly Visible Sight Picture In No-Light Or Low-Light Situations</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Increased Daylight Dot Visibility</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Enhanced Protection From Heavy Recoil And Harsh Cleaning Solvents</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Evenly Distributed Light</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: $170.00</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>There\'s a reason so many Trijicon(R) night sights are trusted by local, state and federal law enforcement agencies, as well as the most discerning pistol sports shooters on the planet: they\'re designed for faster target acquisition in any lighting situation, as well as designed to take on abuse and still operate with precision. Upgrade your iron sights with proven, superior aiming solution technology.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Trijicon GL101Y, HD Tritium Night Sights, Fits Glock, Yellow Outline.</span></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>Fits Glock Model: 17, 17L, 19, 22, 23, 24, 25, 26, 27, 28, 31, 32, 33, 34, 35, 37, 38, 39, and 45. (Does not fit Glock MOS)</p>\r\n<p>The HD Night Sights were specifically created to address the needs of tactical shooters. The three dot green tritium night sight set’s front sight features a taller blade and an aiming point ringed in photoluminescent paint while the rear sight is outlined in black and features a wider U-shaped notch. This unique configuration increases visibility and quickens front sight acquisition—even in transitional lighting. Additionally, the front surface of the rear sight is steeply hooked to assist in emergency one-handed slide operation. The three dot green tritium night sight set’s front sight features a taller blade and an aiming point ringed in photoluminescent paint while the rear sight is outlined in black and features a wider U-shaped notch. This unique configuration increases visibility and quickens front sight acquisition—even in transitional lighting.</p>\r\n<p>Green tritium lamps are warranted for 12 years from date of manufacture</p>'),(316471,76,0,148855,'<p>Trijicon GL10, HD Tritium Night Sights, Fits Glock, Yellow Outline</p>'),(316473,76,1,148855,'<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Trijicon, HD Tritium Night Sights, Fits Glock, Yellow Outline</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Instantly Visible Sight Picture In No-Light Or Low-Light Situations</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Increased Daylight Dot Visibility</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Enhanced Protection From Heavy Recoil And Harsh Cleaning Solvents</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Evenly Distributed Light</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: $170.00</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>There\'s a reason so many Trijicon(R) night sights are trusted by local, state and federal law enforcement agencies, as well as the most discerning pistol sports shooters on the planet: they\'re designed for faster target acquisition in any lighting situation, as well as designed to take on abuse and still operate with precision. Upgrade your iron sights with proven, superior aiming solution technology.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>719307209640</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>Trijicon</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>GL101Y-600540</strong></td>\r\n<th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>Tritium</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>HD</strong></td>\r\n<th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Sight</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Fit</th>\r\n<td><strong>Fits Glock</strong></td>\r\n<th>Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Yellow Outline</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><strong>Handgun Sights</strong></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>Trijicon GL101Y, HD Tritium Night Sights, Fits Glock, Yellow Outline.</p>\r\n<p>Fits Glock Model: 17, 17L, 19, 22, 23, 24, 25, 26, 27, 28, 31, 32, 33, 34, 35, 37, 38, 39, and 45. (Does not fit Glock MOS)</p>\r\n<p>The HD Night Sights were specifically created to address the needs of tactical shooters. The three dot green tritium night sight set’s front sight features a taller blade and an aiming point ringed in photoluminescent paint while the rear sight is outlined in black and features a wider U-shaped notch. This unique configuration increases visibility and quickens front sight acquisition—even in transitional lighting. Additionally, the front surface of the rear sight is steeply hooked to assist in emergency one-handed slide operation. The three dot green tritium night sight set’s front sight features a taller blade and an aiming point ringed in photoluminescent paint while the rear sight is outlined in black and features a wider U-shaped notch. This unique configuration increases visibility and quickens front sight acquisition—even in transitional lighting.</p>\r\n<p>Green tritium lamps are warranted for 12 years from date of manufacture</p>\r\n<p>NOTE: Professional installation recommended. Dimensions for reference only</p>\r\n<p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ENHANCED FRONT-SIGHT ACQUISITION IN BRIGHT, TRANSITIONAL AND NO-LIGHT SITUATIONS.</li>\r\n<li>Glow-in-the-dark, photoluminescent-painted front outline combines with a “U” notch rear and black-painted rear outlines to quickly draw your eye to the front post in all lighting conditions.</li>\r\n<li>ONE-HANDED SLIDE MANIPULATION. Steeply hooked front surface to assist in an emergency, one-handed slide manipulation.</li>\r\n<li>INSTANTLY VISIBLE SIGHT PICTURE IN NO-LIGHT AND LOW-LIGHT SITUATIONS.  Tritium phosphor-filled glass lamp illuminates sights for high visibility in all lighting conditions.</li>\r\n<li>ENHANCED PROTECTION FROM HEAVY RECOIL AND HARSH CLEANING SOLVENTS. Tritium gas lamps are contained within protective aluminum cylinders and have additional silicone rubber cushioning.</li>\r\n<li>EVENLY DISTRIBUTED LIGHT FROM TRITIUM LAMPS. Each Trijicon® tritium lamp is capped with a sapphire jewel that helps evenly distribute the light and also acts as an additional layer of protection from puncture and cleaning solvents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Specifications</strong> </p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>UPC 719307209640</li>\r\n<li>Manufacturer Trijicon</li>\r\n<li>Manufacturer Part # GL101Y-600540</li>\r\n<li>Model HD</li>\r\n<li>Model Tritium Type Sight Fit Fits Glock</li>\r\n<li>Finish/Color Yellow Outline</li>\r\n<li>Subcategory Handgun Sights</li>\r\n</ul>'),(345235,85,1,148855,'Trijicon GL101Y, HD Tritium Night Sights, Fits Glock, Yellow Outline'),(316474,75,0,148856,'<p><a title=\"Trijicon HD XR Sig\" href=\"https://www.trijicon.com/products/details/sg601-c-600865\" target=\"_blank\">Trijicon HD XR™</a> Night Sights - Sig Sauer 9mm / .357 SIG (Exluding P938)</p>\r\n<p>Front: Yellow Outline / Green Tritium, Rear: Black Outline / Green Tritium</p>\r\n<p><span>Fits Sig Sauer models calibrated for 9mm and .357SIG, including P225, P226, P228, P239, and P320 (Excluding P938).</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>MSRP: $175.00</strong></li>\r\n<li><span><strong>SKU</strong>: SG601-C-600865</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The Trijicon HD XR™ Night Sights were specifically designed with the ever evolving challenges of law enforcement agencies in mind. Building on the features of the current HD™ Night Sights, the Trijicon HD XR™ night sights are for the next level of advanced target identification and engagement at increased distances. A thinner front sight post allows shooters to have a larger field of view which further enhances the ability to identify targets, expedite engagements and see location of hits on target at longer distances. Pistol shooters that need the advantage of a more precise engagement in any light can count on the Trijicon HD XR™ Night Sights. Green tritium lamps are warranted for 12 years from date of manufacture</p>\r\n<p><span>NOTE:</span> Professional installation recommended. Dimensions for reference only</p>\r\n<section id=\"overview\" class=\"mast mast--standard mast--thick mast--this-page mast--with-overlay subnav__waypoint\">\r\n<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\r\n<h1>Trijicon HD XR™ Night Sights</h1>\r\n</div>\r\n</section><section class=\"mast__overlay gutter-margin-bottom--2x\">\r\n<h1 class=\"h1--standard mt0\">The Next Level of Precision</h1>\r\n<p class=\"p--larger\">Building on the features of the popular HD™ Night Sights, the Trijicon HD XR™ Night Sights are for the next level of advanced target identification and engagement at increased distances, ideal for police and competitive shooters.</p>\r\n<p class=\"mb0\">A thinner front sight post allows the shooter to have a larger field of view which further enhances the ability to identify targets, expedite engagements and see hits on target at longer distances. Local and federal law enforcement and pistol shooters that need the advantage of a more precise engagement in any light can count on the Trijicon HD XR™ Night Sights.</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>EXPANDED FIELD OF VIEW AND A PRECISION SIGHT PICTURE FOR LONGER-RANGE ENGAGEMENTS. </strong>Thin front post (.122 in. width) promotes a larger field of view for fast target identification and engagement at longer.</li>\r\n<li><strong>ENHANCED FRONT-SIGHT ACQUISITION IN BRIGHT, TRANSITIONAL AND NO-LIGHT SITUATIONS. </strong>Glow-in-the-dark, photoluminescent-painted front outline combines with a “U” notch rear and black-painted rear outlines to quickly draw your eye to the front post in all lighting conditions.</li>\r\n<li><strong>ONE-HANDED SLIDE MANIPULATION. </strong>Steeply hooked front surface to assist in an emergency, one-handed slide manipulation.</li>\r\n<li><strong>INSTANTLY VISIBLE SIGHT PICTURE IN NO-LIGHT AND LOW-LIGHT SITUATIONS. </strong>Tritium phosphor-filled glass lamp illuminates sights for high visibility in all lighting conditions.</li>\r\n<li><strong>ENHANCED PROTECTION FROM HEAVY RECOIL AND HARSH CLEANING SOLVENTS. </strong>Tritium gas lamps are contained within protective aluminum cylinders and have additional silicone rubber cushioning.</li>\r\n<li><strong>EVENLY DISTRIBUTED LIGHT FROM TRITIUM LAMPS. </strong>Each Trijicon® tritium lamp is capped with a sapphire jewel that helps evenly distribute the light and also acts as an additional layer of protection from puncture and cleaning solvents.</li>\r\n</ul>'),(316476,75,1,148856,'<p><a title=\"Trijicon HD XR Sig\" href=\"https://www.trijicon.com/products/details/sg601-c-600865\" target=\"_blank\">Trijicon HD XR™</a> Night Sights - Sig Sauer 9mm / .357 SIG (Exluding P938)</p>\r\n<p>Front: Yellow Outline / Green Tritium, Rear: Black Outline / Green Tritium</p>\r\n<p><span>Fits Sig Sauer models calibrated for 9mm and .357SIG, including P225, P226, P228, P239, and P320 (Excluding P938).</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>MSRP: $180.00</strong></li>\r\n<li><span><strong>SKU</strong>: SG601-C-600865</span></li>\r\n<li><span>UPC: <span>719307214163</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The Trijicon HD XR™ Night Sights were specifically designed with the ever evolving challenges of law enforcement agencies in mind. Building on the features of the current HD™ Night Sights, the Trijicon HD XR™ night sights are for the next level of advanced target identification and engagement at increased distances. A thinner front sight post allows shooters to have a larger field of view which further enhances the ability to identify targets, expedite engagements and see location of hits on target at longer distances. Pistol shooters that need the advantage of a more precise engagement in any light can count on the Trijicon HD XR™ Night Sights. Green tritium lamps are warranted for 12 years from date of manufacture</p>'),(316475,76,0,148856,'<p>Trijicon HD XR ™ Night Sights- Sig Sauer 9mm / .357 SIG (Exluding P938)<br />Front: Yellow Outline / Green Tritium, Rear: Black Outline / Green Tritium</p>'),(316477,76,1,148856,'<p><a title=\"Trijicon HD XR Sig\" href=\"https://www.trijicon.com/products/details/sg601-c-600865\" target=\"_blank\">Trijicon HD XR™</a> Night Sights - Sig Sauer 9mm / .357 SIG (Exluding P938)</p>\r\n<p>Front: Yellow Outline / Green Tritium, Rear: Black Outline / Green Tritium</p>\r\n<p>Fits Sig Sauer models calibrated for 9mm and .357SIG, including P225, P226, P228, P239, and P320 (Excluding P938).</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>MSRP: $180.00</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>SKU</strong>: SG601-C-600865</li>\r\n<li>UPC: <span>719307214163</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The Trijicon HD XR™ Night Sights were specifically designed with the ever evolving challenges of law enforcement agencies in mind. Building on the features of the current HD™ Night Sights, the Trijicon HD XR™ night sights are for the next level of advanced target identification and engagement at increased distances. A thinner front sight post allows shooters to have a larger field of view which further enhances the ability to identify targets, expedite engagements and see location of hits on target at longer distances. Pistol shooters that need the advantage of a more precise engagement in any light can count on the Trijicon HD XR™ Night Sights. Green tritium lamps are warranted for 12 years from date of manufacture</p>\r\n<p>NOTE: Professional installation recommended. Dimensions for reference only</p>\r\n<section id=\"overview\" class=\"mast mast--standard mast--thick mast--this-page mast--with-overlay subnav__waypoint\">\r\n<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\r\n<h1>Trijicon HD XR™ Night Sights</h1>\r\n</div>\r\n</section><section class=\"mast__overlay gutter-margin-bottom--2x\">\r\n<h1 class=\"h1--standard mt0\">The Next Level of Precision</h1>\r\n<p class=\"p--larger\">Building on the features of the popular HD™ Night Sights, the Trijicon HD XR™ Night Sights are for the next level of advanced target identification and engagement at increased distances, ideal for police and competitive shooters.</p>\r\n<p class=\"mb0\">A thinner front sight post allows the shooter to have a larger field of view which further enhances the ability to identify targets, expedite engagements and see hits on target at longer distances. Local and federal law enforcement and pistol shooters that need the advantage of a more precise engagement in any light can count on the Trijicon HD XR™ Night Sights.</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>EXPANDED FIELD OF VIEW AND A PRECISION SIGHT PICTURE FOR LONGER-RANGE ENGAGEMENTS. </strong>Thin front post (.122 in. width) promotes a larger field of view for fast target identification and engagement at longer.</li>\r\n<li><strong>ENHANCED FRONT-SIGHT ACQUISITION IN BRIGHT, TRANSITIONAL AND NO-LIGHT SITUATIONS. </strong>Glow-in-the-dark, photoluminescent-painted front outline combines with a “U” notch rear and black-painted rear outlines to quickly draw your eye to the front post in all lighting conditions.</li>\r\n<li><strong>ONE-HANDED SLIDE MANIPULATION. </strong>Steeply hooked front surface to assist in an emergency, one-handed slide manipulation.</li>\r\n<li><strong>INSTANTLY VISIBLE SIGHT PICTURE IN NO-LIGHT AND LOW-LIGHT SITUATIONS. </strong>Tritium phosphor-filled glass lamp illuminates sights for high visibility in all lighting conditions.</li>\r\n<li><strong>ENHANCED PROTECTION FROM HEAVY RECOIL AND HARSH CLEANING SOLVENTS. </strong>Tritium gas lamps are contained within protective aluminum cylinders and have additional silicone rubber cushioning.</li>\r\n<li><strong>EVENLY DISTRIBUTED LIGHT FROM TRITIUM LAMPS. </strong>Each Trijicon® tritium lamp is capped with a sapphire jewel that helps evenly distribute the light and also acts as an additional layer of protection from puncture and cleaning solvents.</li>\r\n</ul>'),(345236,85,1,148856,'Trijicon HD XR ™ Night Sights- Sig Sauer 9mm / .357 SIG (Exluding P938) Front: Yellow Outline / Green Tritium, Rear: Black Outline / Green Tritium'),(316478,75,0,148857,'<p>Trijicon HD XR night sight front yellow outline Springfield XDS 600877</p>\r\n<p>Trijicon HD XR™ Front Sight - Springfield XD-S, XD-E <strong>Front Sight Only</strong>: Yellow Outline / Green Tritium</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>SKU: SP602-C-600877</li>\r\n<li><strong>MSRP: $99.00</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span>Fits the Springfield Armory® XD-S and XD-E</span></p>\r\n<p>The Trijicon HD XR™ Night Sights were specifically designed with the ever evolving challenges of law enforcement agencies in mind. Building on the features of the current HD™ Night Sights, the Trijicon HD XR™ night sights are for the next level of advanced target identification and engagement at increased distances. A thinner front sight post allows shooters to have a larger field of view which further enhances the ability to identify targets, expedite engagements and see location of hits on target at longer distances. Pistol shooters that need the advantage of a more precise engagement in any light can count on the Trijicon HD XR™ Night Sights. Green tritium lamps are warranted for 12 years from date of manufacture.</p>\r\n<p><span>NOTE:</span> Professional installation recommended. Dimensions for reference only</p>\r\n<section id=\"overview\" class=\"mast mast--standard mast--thick mast--this-page mast--with-overlay subnav__waypoint\">\r\n<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\r\n<h1>Trijicon HD XR™ Night Sights</h1>\r\n</div>\r\n</section><section class=\"mast__overlay gutter-margin-bottom--2x\">\r\n<h1 class=\"h1--standard mt0\">The Next Level of Precision</h1>\r\n<p class=\"p--larger\">Building on the features of the popular HD™ Night Sights, the Trijicon HD XR™ Night Sights are for the next level of advanced target identification and engagement at increased distances, ideal for police and competitive shooters.</p>\r\n<p class=\"mb0\">A thinner front sight post allows the shooter to have a larger field of view which further enhances the ability to identify targets, expedite engagements and see hits on target at longer distances. Local and federal law enforcement and pistol shooters that need the advantage of a more precise engagement in any light can count on the Trijicon HD XR™ Night Sights.</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>EXPANDED FIELD OF VIEW AND A PRECISION SIGHT PICTURE FOR LONGER-RANGE ENGAGEMENTS. </strong>Thin front post (.122 in. width) promotes a larger field of view for fast target identification and engagement at longer.</li>\r\n<li><strong>ENHANCED FRONT-SIGHT ACQUISITION IN BRIGHT, TRANSITIONAL AND NO-LIGHT SITUATIONS. </strong>Glow-in-the-dark, photoluminescent-painted front outline combines with a “U” notch rear and black-painted rear outlines to quickly draw your eye to the front post in all lighting conditions.</li>\r\n<li><strong>ONE-HANDED SLIDE MANIPULATION. </strong>Steeply hooked front surface to assist in an emergency, one-handed slide manipulation.</li>\r\n<li><strong>INSTANTLY VISIBLE SIGHT PICTURE IN NO-LIGHT AND LOW-LIGHT SITUATIONS. </strong>Tritium phosphor-filled glass lamp illuminates sights for high visibility in all lighting conditions.</li>\r\n<li><strong>ENHANCED PROTECTION FROM HEAVY RECOIL AND HARSH CLEANING SOLVENTS. </strong>Tritium gas lamps are contained within protective aluminum cylinders and have additional silicone rubber cushioning.</li>\r\n<li><strong>EVENLY DISTRIBUTED LIGHT FROM TRITIUM LAMPS. </strong>Each Trijicon® tritium lamp is capped with a sapphire jewel that helps evenly distribute the light and also acts as an additional layer of protection from puncture and cleaning solvents.</li>\r\n</ul>'),(316480,75,1,148857,'<p>Trijicon HD XR night sight front yellow outline Springfield XDS 600877</p>\r\n<p>Trijicon HD XR™ Front Sight - Springfield XD-S, XD-E <strong>Front Sight Only</strong>: Yellow Outline / Green Tritium</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>SKU: SP602-C-600877</li>\r\n<li><strong>MSRP: $99.00</strong></l