\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\"><span>MSRP: </span><strong>$26.00</strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Black finish</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">This is a 7-pack</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">6-hole Squid Grip</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Fits TRX Extreme\" Alpha and Delta Rails</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>This new revolutionary rail insert is made specifically for the Alpha\" Delta\" TRX Extreme rails and the T22 Sport Chassis. Its composition of proprietary advanced rubber makes it heat resistant and extremely durable. The 6-hole Squid Grip inserts directly into the cooling holes\" and may be cut to form any length or inserted end to end for longer lengths. Patent Pending. Will not fit the Troy/VTAC rail systems.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(316491,76,0,148860,'<p>Troy Squid Grip Rail Cover, 7-pack, black</p>'),(316493,76,1,148860,'<p><a title=\"Troy Squid Grip\" href=\"SKU: SSQD-7PK-00BT-00\" target=\"_blank\">Troy Squid Grip 7-pack, black</a></p>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>TROY, Squid Grip, Rail Cover, Fits TRX Extreme, Alpha and Delta Rails, Black Finish, 7 Pack</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: <strong>$26.00</strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Black finish</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">This is a 7-pack</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">6-hole Squid Grip</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Fits TRX Extreme\" Alpha and Delta Rails</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>This new revolutionary rail insert is made specifically for the Alpha\" Delta\" TRX Extreme rails and the T22 Sport Chassis. Its composition of proprietary advanced rubber makes it heat resistant and extremely durable. The 6-hole Squid Grip inserts directly into the cooling holes\" and may be cut to form any length or inserted end to end for longer lengths. Patent Pending. Will not fit the Troy/VTAC rail systems.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>812699017098</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>Troy</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>SSQD-7PK-00BT-00</strong></td>\r\n<th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>Squid Grip</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Rail Panel</strong></td>\r\n<th>Finish/Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Black</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Description</th>\r\n<td><strong>7 Pack</strong></td>\r\n<th>Fit</th>\r\n<td><strong>Certain TROY Rail Systems including TRX 308 TROY HK TRX Extreme Alpha &amp; Delta Rails</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Grips</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(345253,85,1,148860,'Troy Squid Grip Rail Cover, 7-pack, black'),(316498,75,0,148862,'<p>Vero Vellini Shotgun sling w loop ends brown/brown</p>'),(316500,75,1,148862,'<p><a href=\"https://www.vero-vellini.com/products/vero-vellini-standard-shotgun-sling-brown-neoprene-brown-leather?_pos=1&amp;_sid=c0629f826&amp;_ss=r\" target=\"_blank\">Vero Vellini</a> Shotgun sling w loop ends brown/brown</p>\r\n<p>MSRP: $44.99</p>\r\n<p><span>Have a shotgun or rifle without swivels that you’d like to carry with a sling, and the firearm is simply too “perfect” or valuable to add swivels?</span><span>   </span><span>Like the original Air Cushion Rifle slings, <span>the shotgun slings offer a tension loop that wraps around your stock and the barrel. The inner area of the webbing features a rubber coating to prevent slipping off your gun</span>. Since there is no edge piping, you get a bit more stretch, but because of the 3-layer Air Cushion laminated “sandwich” cut, there won’t be any “bounce” in your gun while you’re walking or moving quickly. The non-slip backing prevents any slippage on your shoulder, and beautiful brown leather end panels connecting the sling pad to the 1-inch wide strap webbing is perfectly detailed to fit well with your rifle. Select from Forest green, brown or black colors, the upper fabric is UV fade and stain resistant. </span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>'),(316499,76,0,148862,'<p>Vero Vellini Shotgun sling w loop ends brown/brown</p>'),(316501,76,1,148862,'<p><a href=\"https://www.vero-vellini.com/products/vero-vellini-standard-shotgun-sling-brown-neoprene-brown-leather?_pos=1&amp;_sid=c0629f826&amp;_ss=r\" target=\"_blank\">Vero Vellini</a> Shotgun sling w loop ends brown/brown</p>\r\n<p>MSRP: $44.99</p>\r\n<p><span>Have a shotgun or rifle without swivels that you’d like to carry with a sling, and the firearm is simply too “perfect” or valuable to add swivels?</span><span>   </span><span>Like the original Air Cushion Rifle slings, <span>the shotgun slings offer a tension loop that wraps around your stock and the barrel. The inner area of the webbing features a rubber coating to prevent slipping off your gun</span>. Since there is no edge piping, you get a bit more stretch, but because of the 3-layer Air Cushion laminated “sandwich” cut, there won’t be any “bounce” in your gun while you’re walking or moving quickly. The non-slip backing prevents any slippage on your shoulder, and beautiful brown leather end panels connecting the sling pad to the 1-inch wide strap webbing is perfectly detailed to fit well with your rifle. Select from Forest green, brown or black colors, the upper fabric is UV fade and stain resistant. </span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>'),(345255,85,1,148862,'Vero Vellini Shotgun sling w loop ends brown/brown'),(316508,75,0,148865,'<p>Aero .750 low profile gas block</p>\r\n<p>These gas blocks along with our gas tubes create an efficent and reliable gas system for your AR15 or AR 308 rifle build.</p>\r\n<h4><span>Features:</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits barrels with .750 Outer Diameter</li>\r\n<li>Constructed from 4140 hardened steel</li>\r\n<li>Choose No Aero Logo or Aero \"A\" Logo blocks</li>\r\n<li>Nitride or Phosphate coating</li>\r\n<li>Low profile for easy fitment</li>\r\n<li>Set Screws are Steel 10-32 x 3/16 Knurled Cup Point</li>\r\n<li>Made in the USA</li>\r\n<li>*Roll pin not included*</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><i>Please note: We do not recommend the use of red thread locker on the threads of the set screws. If you decide to use thread locker we recommend using the non permanent variety.</i></p>'),(316510,75,1,148865,'<p>Aero .750 low profile gas block, phosphate</p>\r\n<p>These gas blocks along with our gas tubes create an efficent and reliable gas system for your AR15 or AR 308 rifle build.</p>\r\n<p><span>Aero\'s Low Profile Gas Block is constructed from 4150 hardened steel with steel set screws which are 10-32 x 3/16 knurled cup point. *Note: Roll pin is not included.</span></p>\r\n<h4><span>Features:</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits barrels with .750 Outer Diameter</li>\r\n<li>Constructed from 4140 hardened steel</li>\r\n<li>Choose No Aero Logo or Aero \"A\" Logo blocks</li>\r\n<li>Nitride or Phosphate coating</li>\r\n<li>Low profile for easy fitment</li>\r\n<li>Set Screws are Steel 10-32 x 3/16 Knurled Cup Point</li>\r\n<li>Made in the USA</li>\r\n<li>*Roll pin not included*</li>\r\n<li>MSRP: $29.99</li>\r\n<li>MAP: $25.49</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><i>Please note: We do not recommend the use of red thread locker on the threads of the set screws. If you decide to use thread locker we recommend using the non permanent variety.</i></p>'),(316509,76,0,148865,'<p>Aero .750 low profile gas block</p>'),(316511,76,1,148865,'<p>Aero .750 low profile gas block, phosphate</p>\r\n<p>These gas blocks along with our gas tubes create an efficent and reliable gas system for your AR15 or AR 308 rifle build.</p>\r\n<p>Aero\'s Low Profile Gas Block is constructed from 4150 hardened steel with steel set screws which are 10-32 x 3/16 knurled cup point. *Note: Roll pin is not included.</p>\r\n<h4>Features:</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits barrels with .750 Outer Diameter</li>\r\n<li>Constructed from 4140 hardened steel</li>\r\n<li>Choose No Aero Logo or Aero \"A\" Logo blocks</li>\r\n<li>Nitride or Phosphate coating</li>\r\n<li>Low profile for easy fitment</li>\r\n<li>Set Screws are Steel 10-32 x 3/16 Knurled Cup Point</li>\r\n<li>Made in the USA</li>\r\n<li>*Roll pin not included*</li>\r\n<li>MSRP: $29.99</li>\r\n<li>MAP: $25.49</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><i>Please note: We do not recommend the use of red thread locker on the threads of the set screws. If you decide to use thread locker we recommend using the non permanent variety.</i></p>'),(345257,85,1,148865,'Aero .750 low profile gas block'),(316528,75,0,148870,'<p>Ameriglo Sig Classic Sight Tool</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>MSRP: $159.99</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"options\"><strong>Product Description</strong><br /><br />\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For sig models (no sig Pro)</li>\r\n<li>Sight Pusher tool</li>\r\n<li>Fits 220, 225, 226, 228, 229 (front and rear sights)</li>\r\n<li>Will not work on Sig Pro models or polymer frame pistols</li>\r\n<li>Made in USA</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"options\"><strong>Additional Information</strong><br /><br />\r\n<h2><span>Ameriglo sight Pusher tools for friction fitting or adjusting sights, each tool is SigTool6 family specific. Universal tool requires shoe plates, which are SigTool6 specific. Made in the USA.</span></h2>\r\n</div>'),(316530,75,1,148870,'<p><strong>Ameriglo Sig Classic Sight Tool</strong></p>\r\n<div class=\"options\"><strong>Product Description</strong><br /><br />\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For sig models (no sig Pro)</li>\r\n<li>Sight Pusher tool</li>\r\n<li>Fits 220, 225, 226, 228, 229 (front and rear sights)</li>\r\n<li>Will not work on Sig Pro models or polymer frame pistols</li>\r\n<li>Made in USA</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"options\"><strong>Additional Information</strong><br />\r\n<h2>Ameriglo sight Pusher tools for friction fitting or adjusting sights, each tool is SigTool6 family specific. Universal tool requires shoe plates, which are SigTool6 specific. Made in the USA.</h2>\r\n</div>'),(316529,76,0,148870,'<p>Ameriglo Sig Classic Sight Tool</p>'),(316531,76,1,148870,'<p>Ameriglo Sig Classic Sight Tool</p>'),(345262,85,1,148870,'Ameriglo Sig Classic Sight Tool'),(316548,75,0,148875,'<p>Bootleg 15\" PicMod Handguard</p>\r\n<p><span>Bootleg PicMod Handguard (Retail 209.95) </span>When you want that extra layer of hand protection and better accessory mounting without the weight, try a Bootleg Inc. handguard. Our specially designed handguard rail has a Picatinny rail on top and our specially designed PicMod handguard rails on the other three sides. This technology combines both Picatinny and KeyMod rail systems so you can attach nearly all KeyMod and Picatinny accessories with ease. Get the best of both worlds with Bootleg, Inc.’s specially designed handguard rail system today!</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Extruded 6061 aluminum to keep weight down</li>\r\n<li>MIL-SPEC hard anodizing for durability</li>\r\n<li>Full length MIL-SPEC Picatinny top rail</li>\r\n<li>PicMod rails allow mounting KeyMod and Picatinny accessories\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span>Specs:</span>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>9″ Handguard\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>7 oz without mounting hardware</li>\r\n<li>1.675” wide, 2.05” high, 9.2” long</li>\r\n<li>Designed to work with any barrel 10.5” or longer</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>13″ Handguard\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>8.6 oz without mounting hardware</li>\r\n<li>1.675” wide, 2.05” high, 13.4” long</li>\r\n<li>Designed to work with any barrel 14.5” or longer</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>15″ Handguard\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>9.6 oz without mounting hardware</li>\r\n<li>1.675” wide, 2.05” high, 15” long</li>\r\n<li>Designed to work with any barrel 16” or longer</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(316550,75,1,148875,'<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Bootleg, Cam-Lok Handguard, M-Lok, Fits AR Rifles, 15\", Black Finish</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Free-float</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">M-LOK Mounting Surface</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: <strong>$165.95</strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Retail MAP: <strong>$159.95</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>Bootleg Inc. makes high quality firearm components for the AR Platform.  <span>The new Bootleg CamLok Handguards are the next evolution in our lightweight, easy to install AR-15 handguards. These handguards are extruded 6061 Aluminum and feature a Mil-Spec Hard Coat Anodizing. The simple CamLok system ensures that the handguard can be installed quickly and stays put. The CamLok handguards are M-Lok compatible and are available in 7”- 9.95 oz, 9.2”- 11.2 oz, 13.4”- 13.5 oz, and 15”- 14.45 oz and all are backed by Bootleg’s lifetime warranty.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(316549,76,0,148875,'<p>Bootleg 15\" PicMod Handguard</p>'),(316551,76,1,148875,'<p>These handguards are extruded 6061 Aluminum and feature a Mil-Spec Hard Coat Anodizing. </p>\r\n<p>• Free-float</p>\r\n<p>• M-LOK Mounting Surface</p>\r\n<p>• 15\"</p>'),(345263,85,1,148875,'Bootleg, Cam-Lok Handguard, M-Lok, Fits AR Rifles, 15\", Black Finish'),(316556,75,0,148877,'<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>CMMG, AR-15 Barrel Nut</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: $11.99</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">SKU #815835012711</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Manufacturer Part # 55DA296</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Barrel Nut</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">For Builds or Repair</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Barrel Nut for AR-15. For builds or repair.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>815835012711</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>CMMG</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>55DA296</strong></td>\r\n<th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Barrel Nut</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Description</th>\r\n<td><strong>Barrel Nut</strong></td>\r\n<th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Long Gun Parts</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(316558,75,1,148877,'<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>CMMG, 