pe Rail is specifically designed for use with the Ruger® 10/22®.  This best-selling Picatinny scope base is the perfect scope rail for all 10/22® owners who plan on adding optics to their rifle. Our rail is manufactured from strong, durable, and light-weight aluminum.  It is extremely easy to install and screws needed for installation are included.   </span><br /><br /><span>• Best-selling scope rail for the Ruger® 10/22®</span><br /><span>• Lightweight:  Extremely lightweight made of aircraft grade aluminum</span><br /><span>• Easy to Install on the 10/22®.  Holes in the rail line-up with the factory 10/22® holes; rail comes with installation screws.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>Ruger® and 10/22® are Registered Trademarks of Sturm, Ruger &amp; Co. Inc.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>856365001134</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>Tactical Solutions</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>1022 SCPRL-02</strong></td>\r\n<th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Mount</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Finish/Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Black</strong></td>\r\n<th>Fit</th>\r\n<td><strong>10/22</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Bases</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(316630,75,1,148895,'<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Tactical Solutions, Mount, Picatinny Scope Rail, Fits Ruger 10/22, Black Finish</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\">\r\n<li class=\"hazard-warning\">WARNING: Cancer and Reproductive Harm - www.P65Warnings.ca.gov.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\"><strong>MSRP: $33.00</strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Screws included</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>Tactical Solutions\' 10/22(R) Picatinny Scope Base easily mounts on any factory Ruger(R) 10/22(R) Rifle.</p>\r\n<p><span>The Tactical Solutions’ Standard Scope Rail is specifically designed for use with the Ruger® 10/22®.  This best-selling Picatinny scope base is the perfect scope rail for all 10/22® owners who plan on adding optics to their rifle. Our rail is manufactured from strong, durable, and light-weight aluminum.  It is extremely easy to install and screws needed for installation are included.   </span><br /><br /><span>• Best-selling scope rail for the Ruger® 10/22®</span><br /><span>• Lightweight:  Extremely lightweight made of aircraft grade aluminum</span><br /><span>• Easy to Install on the 10/22®.  Holes in the rail line-up with the factory 10/22® holes; rail comes with installation screws.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>Ruger® and 10/22® are Registered Trademarks of Sturm, Ruger &amp; Co. Inc.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>856365001134</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>Tactical Solutions</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>1022 SCPRL-02</strong></td>\r\n<th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Mount</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Finish/Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Black</strong></td>\r\n<th>Fit</th>\r\n<td><strong>10/22</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Bases</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(316629,76,0,148895,'<p>Tactical Solutions 10/22 Picatinny Scope Rail</p>'),(316631,76,1,148895,'<p>Tactical Solutions 10/22 Picatinny Scope Rail</p>'),(345311,85,1,148895,'Tactical Solutions 10/22 Picatinny Scope Rail'),(316632,75,0,148896,'<p>Tactical Solutions 10/22 SBX Takedown Barrel</p>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Tactical Solutions, SBX Takedown Barrel, 16.5\", Matte Finish, Threaded, Fits Ruger 10/22 Takedown</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\">\r\n<li class=\"hazard-warning\"><a href=\"https://rsrgroup.com/product/TSOTDSBX-MB#hazard-warning\" data-toggle=\"collapse\"><span class=\"fa fa-exclamation-triangle\"></span>WARNING</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\"><strong>MSRP: $325.00</strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">12oz weight</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">1/2X28 thread pitch</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">1:16\" rifling</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Includes inert display suppressor and locking mechanism</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>The SB-X .22 LR barrel is compact and lightweight; the perfect premium replacement for the heavy factory barrel. The bore length of the SB-X barrel is 12.375\" and with the permanently affixed shroud, the overall length increases to a legal 16.625\" barrel, thus giving the shooter all the benefits of an SBR* with NO paperwork. This rimfire barrel is threaded and the shroud is designed so any 1\" or smaller diameter suppressor (threaded 1/2\"x 28) should fit and will maintain a compact overall length. Add the SB-X to your 10/22 Takedown(R) and make your rifle the perfect packing/prepping companion.</p>\r\n<p><span>Specifically designed for use with a silencer, the Tactical Solutions’ X-RING TAKEDOWN SBX barrel is a lightweight and highly accurate .22 LR rifle barrel for the Ruger® 10/22® Takedown, for Tactical Solutions X-Ring semi-automatic .22 rifles, and for Tactical Solutions X-Ring .22LR receivers. A silencer is easily threaded on to the ½” X 28 threaded muzzle inside of the barrel shroud. This innovation minimizes overall length while shooting with a silencer. This barrel upgrade represents what TacSol is known for in the .22LR aftermarket barrel industry; lightweight, highly accurate, and easy-to-install barrels. This barrel dramatically increases accuracy, performance, and reliability.  Hand-chambered for 22 LR, with a target crown and chromoly bore, the X-RING SBX barrel is everything you could ask for when using a silencer with a .22LR barrel. </span><br /><br /><span>• Minimize overall barrel length while shooting suppressed:  Adding a suppressor to your standard barrel increases barrel length dramatically.  By attaching your silencer within the SBX barrel shroud, overall barrel length is shorter and manageable</span><br /><span>• Shoot with Accuracy: The barrel’s innovative chromoly steel bore and target crown provide pinpoint accuracy </span><br /><span>• Quick and Easy Target Acquisition:  Lightweight, durable construction</span><br /><span>• Noticeable Craftsmanship:  Unique design &amp; quality above all others</span><br /><span>• Easy to Install:  Internet video instructions, no gunsmithing needed</span><br /><span>• Easy to carry:  Extremely lightweight and durable materials</span><br /><span>• Versatile Use:  Perfect for hunting, plinking, and target shooting</span><br /><br /><span>Chambered for .22 Long Rifle</span><br /><br /><span>Sporting Barrel Contour</span><br /><br /><span>Weight: 15 Ounces</span><br /><br /><span>Length: 16.5”</span><br /><br /><span>Profile: .920” Diameter Target </span><br /><br /><span>Threaded: 1/2” X 28</span><br /><br /><span>Rate of Twist: 1:16”</span><br /><br /><span>Includes Locking Block</span><br /><br /><span>Ruger® and 10/22® are Registered Trademarks of Sturm, Ruger &amp; Co. Inc.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>879971005877</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>Tactical Solutions</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>TDSBX-MB</strong></td>\r\n<th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>Takedown</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>SBX</strong></td>\r\n<th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Barrel</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Barrel Length</th>\r\n<td><strong>16.5\"</strong></td>\r\n<th>Finish/Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Matte</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Type of Barrel</th>\r\n<td><strong>Threaded</strong></td>\r\n<th>Fit</th>\r\n<td><strong>Ruger 10/22 Takedown</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Rifle Barrels</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(316634,75,1,148896,'<p>Tactical Solutions 10/22 SBX Takedown Barrel</p>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Tactical Solutions, SBX Takedown Barrel, 16.5\", Matte Finish, Threaded, Fits Ruger 10/22 Takedown</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\">\r\n<li class=\"hazard-warning\"><a href=\"https://rsrgroup.com/product/TSOTDSBX-MB#hazard-warning\" data-toggle=\"collapse\"><span class=\"fa fa-exclamation-triangle\"></span>WARNING</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\"><strong>MSRP: $325.00</strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">12oz weight</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">1/2X28 thread pitch</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">1:16\" rifling</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Includes inert display suppressor and locking mechanism</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>The SB-X .22 LR barrel is compact and lightweight; the perfect premium replacement for the heavy factory barrel. The bore length of the SB-X barrel is 12.375\" and with the permanently affixed shroud, the overall length increases to a legal 16.625\" barrel, thus giving the shooter all the benefits of an SBR* with NO paperwork. This rimfire barrel is threaded and the shroud is designed so any 1\" or smaller diameter suppressor (threaded 1/2\"x 28) should fit and will maintain a compact overall length. Add the SB-X to your 10/22 Takedown(R) and make your rifle the perfect packing/prepping companion.</p>\r\n<p><span>Specifically designed for use with a silencer, the Tactical Solutions’ X-RING TAKEDOWN SBX barrel is a lightweight and highly accurate .22 LR rifle barrel for the Ruger® 10/22® Takedown, for Tactical Solutions X-Ring semi-automatic .22 rifles, and for Tactical Solutions X-Ring .22LR receivers. A silencer is easily threaded on to the ½” X 28 threaded muzzle inside of the barrel shroud. This innovation minimizes overall length while shooting with a silencer. This barrel upgrade represents what TacSol is known for in the .22LR aftermarket barrel industry; lightweight, highly accurate, and easy-to-install barrels. This barrel dramatically increases accuracy, performance, and reliability.  Hand-chambered for 22 LR, with a target crown and chromoly bore, the X-RING SBX barrel is everything you could ask for when using a silencer with a .22LR barrel. </span><br /><br /><span>• Minimize overall barrel length while shooting suppressed:  Adding a suppressor to your standard barrel increases barrel length dramatically.  By attaching your silencer within the SBX barrel shroud, overall barrel length is shorter and manageable</span><br /><span>• Shoot with Accuracy: The barrel’s innovative chromoly steel bore and target crown provide pinpoint accuracy </span><br /><span>• Quick and Easy Target Acquisition:  Lightweight, durable construction</span><br /><span>• Noticeable Craftsmanship:  Unique design &amp; quality above all others</span><br /><span>• Easy to Install:  Internet video instructions, no gunsmithing needed</span><br /><span>• Easy to carry:  Extremely lightweight and durable materials</span><br /><span>• Versatile Use:  Perfect for hunting, plinking, and target shooting</span><br /><br /><span>Chambered for .22 Long Rifle</span><br /><br /><span>Sporting Barrel Contour</span><br /><br /><span>Weight: 15 Ounces</span><br /><br /><span>Length: 16.5”</span><br /><br /><span>Profile: .920” Diameter Target </span><br /><br /><span>Threaded: 1/2” X 28</span><br /><br /><span>Rate of Twist: 1:16”</span><br /><br /><span>Includes Locking Block</span><br /><br /><span>Ruger® and 10/22® are Registered Trademarks of Sturm, Ruger &amp; Co. Inc.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>879971005877</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>Tactical Solutions</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>TDSBX-MB</strong></td>\r\n<th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>Takedown</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>SBX</strong></td>\r\n<th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Barrel</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Barrel Length</th>\r\n<td><strong>16.5\"</strong></td>\r\n<th>Finish/Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Matte</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Type of Barrel</th>\r\n<td><strong>Threaded</strong></td>\r\n<th>Fit</th>\r\n<td><strong>Ruger 10/22 Takedown</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Rifle Barrels</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(316633,76,0,148896,'<p>Tactical Solutions 10/22 SBX Takedown Barrel</p>'),(316635,76,1,148896,'<p>Tactical Solutions 10/22 SBX Takedown Barrel</p>'),(345312,85,1,148896,NULL),(316636,75,0,148897,'<p>Tennessee Arms AR15 Lower Parts Kit</p>\r\n<p>TENNESSEE ARMS COMPANY, LLC<br />AR-15 LOWER PARTS KIT</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MSRP: $63.99</li>\r\n<li>THIS KIT INCLUDES FORGED STEEL COMPONENTS AND IS DESIGNED TO COMPLETE ANY MANUFACTURERS RECEIVER. THESE ARE THE SAME KITS WE USE IN OUR OWN BUILDS IN HOUSE, AND THEY ARE THE KIT WE RECOMMEND TO COMPLETE OUR AR15 RECEIVERS.</li>\r\n<li>FORGED STEEL COMPONENTS WITH FINISH CNC MACHINING (NO MIMS PARTS)</li>\r\n<li>BLACK OXIDE FINISH ON ALL COMPONENTS</li>\r\n<li>CRISP AND CLEAN TRIGGER PULL</li>\r\n<li>INCLUDES PISTOL GRIP AND TRIGGER GUARD</li>\r\n</ul>'),(316638,75,1,148897,'<p>Tennessee Arms AR15 Lower Parts Kit</p>\r\n<p>TENNESSEE ARMS COMPANY, LLC<br />AR-15 LOWER PARTS KIT</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MSRP: $65.99</li>\r\n<li>THIS KIT INCLUDES FORGED STEEL COMPONENTS AND IS DESIGNED TO COMPLETE ANY MANUFACTURERS RECEIVER. THESE ARE THE SAME KITS WE USE IN OUR OWN BUILDS IN HOUSE, AND THEY ARE THE KIT WE RECOMMEND TO COMPLETE OUR AR15 RECEIVERS.</li>\r\n<li>FORGED STEEL COMPONENTS WITH FINISH CNC MACHINING (NO MIMS PARTS)</li>\r\n<li>BLACK OXIDE FINISH ON ALL COMPONENTS</li>\r\n<li>CRISP AND CLEAN TRIGGER PULL</li>\r\n<li>INCLUDES PISTOL GRIP AND TRIGGER GUARD</li>\r\n</ul>'),(316637,76,0,148897,'<p>Tennessee Arms AR-15 Lower Parts Kit</p>'),(316639,76,1,148897,'<p>Tennessee Arms AR-15 Lower Parts Kit</p>'),(345313,85,1,148897,'Tennessee Arms AR-15 Lower Parts Kit'),(316640,75,0,148898,'<p>Tennessee Arms AR308 Lower Parts Kit</p>\r\n<p>TENNESSEE ARMS COMPANY, LLC<br />AR-308 LOWER PARTS KIT</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MSRP: $84.99</li>\r\n<li>THIS KIT INCLUDES FORGED STEEL COMPONENTS AND IS DESIGNED TO COMPLETE ANY MANUFACTURERS RECEIVER. THESE ARE THE SAME KITS WE USE IN OUR OWN BUILDS IN HOUSE, AND THEY ARE THE KIT WE RECOMMEND TO COMPLETE OUR AR15 RECEIVERS.</li>\r\n<li>FORGED STEEL COMPONENTS WITH FINISH CNC MACHINING (NO MIMS PARTS)</li>\r\n<li>BLACK OXIDE FINISH ON ALL COMPONENTS</li>\r\n<li>CRISP AND CLEAN TRIGGER PULL</li>\r\n<li>INCLUDES PISTOL GRIP AND TRIGGER GUARD</li>\r\n</ul>'),(316642,75,1,148898,'<p>Tennessee Arms AR308 Lower Parts Kit</p>\r\n<p>TENNESSEE ARMS COMPANY, LLC<br />AR-308 LOWER PARTS KIT</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MSRP: $84.99</li>\r\n<li>THIS KIT INCLUDES FORGED STEEL COMPONENTS AND IS DESIGNED TO COMPLETE ANY MANUFACTURERS RECEIVER. THESE ARE THE SAME KITS WE USE IN OUR OWN BUILDS IN HOUSE, AND THEY ARE THE KIT WE RECOMMEND TO COMPLETE OUR AR15 RECEIVERS.</li>\r\n<li>FORGED STEEL COMPONENTS WITH FINISH CNC MACHINING (NO MIMS PARTS)</li>\r\n<li>BLACK OXIDE FINISH ON ALL COMPONENTS</li>\r\n<li>CRISP AND CLEAN TRIGGER PULL</li>\r\n<li>INCLUDES PISTOL GRIP AND TRIGGER GUARD</li>\r\n</ul>'),(316641,76,0,148898,'<p>Tennessee Arms AR-308 Lower Parts Kit</p>'),(316643,76,1,148898,'<p>Tennessee Arms AR-308 Lower Parts Kit</p>'),(345324,85,1,148898,NULL),(316652,75,0,148901,'<p>10X brand Stalker suit coverall, Advantage Camo, medium regular</p>\r\n<p>Since 1934, 10x has maintained a proud American tradition of making clothes for the great outdoors.  When you purchase 10x clothing, you\'re getting comfortable, rugged, affordable garments, that stand up to years of wear with very little care.  10x supports wildlife conservation and the preservation and restoration of the American Wild Turkey.</p>'),(316654,75,1,148901,'<p>10X brand Stalker suit coverall, Advantage Camo, medium regular</p>\r\n<p>Since 1934, 10x has maintained a proud American tradition of making clothes for the great outdoors.  When you purchase 10x clothing, you\'re getting comfortable, rugged, affordable garments, that stand up to years of wear with very little care.  10x supports wildlife conservation and the preservation and restoration of the American Wild Turkey.</p>'),(316653,76,0,148901,'<p>10X brand Stalker suit coverall, Advantage Camo, medium regular</p>'),(316655,76,1,148901,'<p>10X brand Stalker suit coverall, Advantage Camo, medium regular</p>'),(345329,85,1,148901,'10X brand Stalker suit coverall, Advantage Camo, medium regular'),(316656,75,0,148902,'<p>Optronics Varmint Light Kit, 350 yd</p>'),(316658,75,1,148902,'<p>Optronics Varmint Light Kit, 350 yd w rechargeable battery pack</p>'),(316657,76,0,148902,'<p>Optronics Varmint Light Kit, 350 yd</p>'),(316659,76,1,148902,'<p>Optronics Varmint Light Kit, 350 yd</p>'),(345330,85,1,148902,'Optronics Varmint Light Kit, 350 yd'),(316660,75,0,148903,'<p>Scentcrusher car/truck air cleaner ozone go</p>\r\n<p><span>SCENTCRUSHER OZONE GO, OZONE POWER DESTROYS SMOKE, PET AND FOOD ODORS, KILLS SMELL IN 30 MINUTES, 5 YEAR LIFE OZONE GENERATOR, MAINTENANCE FREE</span></p>\r\n<p>Developed from NASA based research, Scent Crusher products feature scent-crushing Ozone Activated Technology.  Our Ozone Activated Technology effectively eliminates all odors on your gear.  Sweat, soaps, food, perfume – you name it, Scent Crusher eliminates it by killing the organisms that cause odors including bacteria and virus.  100% chemical-free, Scent Crusher leaves no scent, chemical residue or harmful byproducts.</p>\r\n<p><b><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Features</span></b></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Vehicle air cleaner</li>\r\n<li>Kills bacteria that causes odor</li>\r\n<li>Ozone technology destroys smoke, pet and food odors</li>\r\n<li>Eliminates odor in 30 minutes</li>\r\n<li>5-year life ozone generator</li>\r\n</ul>'),(316662,75,1,148903,'<p>Scentcrusher car/truck air cleaner ozone go</p>\r\n<p><span>SCENTCRUSHER OZONE GO, OZONE POWER DESTROYS SMOKE, PET AND FOOD ODORS, KILLS SMELL IN 30 MINUTES, 5 YEAR LIFE OZONE GENERATOR, MAINTENANCE FREE</span></p>\r\n<p>Developed from NASA based research, Scent Crusher products feature scent-crushing Ozone Activated Technology.  Our Ozone Activated Technology effectively eliminates all odors on your gear.  Sweat, soaps, food, perfume – you name it, Scent Crusher eliminates it by killing the organisms that cause odors including bacteria and virus.  100% chemical-free, Scent Crusher leaves no scent, chemical residue or harmful byproducts.</p>\r\n<p><b><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Features</span></b></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Vehicle air cleaner</li>\r\n<li>Kills bacteria that causes odor</li>\r\n<li>Ozone technology destroys smoke, pet and food odors</li>\r\n<li>Eliminates odor in 30 minutes</li>\r\n<li>5-year life ozone generator</li>\r\n</ul>'),(316661,76,0,148903,'<p>Scentcrusher ozone go car/truck air cleaner </p>'),(316663,76,1,148903,'<p>Scentcrusher ozone go car/truck air cleaner </p>'),(345331,85,1,148903,'Scentcrusher ozone go car/truck air cleaner '),(316664,75,0,148904,'<p>Cold Steel Koga SD1</p>\r\n<p><span>The Cold Steel Koga SD series are made of a high-impact polymer, and are designed to function as an aid in leverage when restraining an individual, and obtaining joint locks or submission holds. But they also serve as an admirable “intermediate impact tool”.</span></p>'),(316666,75,1,148904,'<p>The Cold Steel Koga SD series are made of a high-impact polymer, and are designed to function as an aid in leverage when restraining an individual, and obtaining joint locks or submission holds. But they also serve as an admirable “intermediate impact tool”.</p>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Cold Steel, Koga, SD1, Tool, Defense Tool, Black, Polypropylene</h4>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">High-Impact Polymer</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Intermediate Impact Tool</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\"><span>MSRP: </span><strong>$12.99</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>The Cold Steel Koga SD1 is made of a high-impact polymer, and is designed to function as an aid in leverage when restraining an individual, and obtaining joint locks or submission holds. It also serves as an admirable \"intermediate impact tool\".</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 1.17em;\">Specifications</span></strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>705442005124</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>Cold Steel</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>91K</strong></td>\r\n<th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>Koga</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>SD1</strong></td>\r\n<th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Tool</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Description</th>\r\n<td><strong>Defense Tool</strong></td>\r\n<th>Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Black</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Batons &amp; Impact Devices</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(316665,76,0,148904,'<p>Cold Steel Koga SD1</p>'),(316667,76,1,148904,'<h4>Cold Steel, Koga, SD1, Tool, Defense Tool, Black, Polypropylene</h4>'),(345332,85,1,148904,'Cold Steel, Koga, SD1, Tool, Defense Tool, Black, Polypropylene'),(316668,75,0,148905,'<p>Mace Pepper Gel Distance Spray, Magnum-4 Model, 79 gram</p>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Mace Security International, Pepper Spray, 10% Pepper GEL, Black</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\"><strong>MSRP: $19.99</strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Gel Stream</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Fast Acting Defense</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Causes Coughing, Respiratory Distress, and Impaired Vision</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>Mace(R) Brand is the original trusted brand of pepper spray products for self-defense against attacks by people and animals. Mace Brand has over 30 years experience developing aerosol defense spray dispensing technologies for both the consumer and tactical markets around the world. Mace Brand is the original manufacturer and the market leader in pepper sprays.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>022188802702</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>Mace Security International</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>80270</strong></td>\r\n<th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>10% Pepper GEL</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Pepper Spray</strong></td>\r\n<th>Size</th>\r\n<td><strong>79gm</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Finish/Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Black</strong></td>\r\n<th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Pepper Sprays</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Packaging</th>\r\n<td><strong>Aerosol Can</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(316670,75,1,148905,'<p>Mace Pepper Gel Distance Spray, Magnum-4 Model, 79 gram</p>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Mace Security International, Pepper Spray, 10% Pepper GEL, Black</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\"><strong>MSRP: $19.99</strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Gel Stream</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Fast Acting Defense</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Causes Coughing, Respiratory Distress, and Impaired Vision</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>Mace(R) Brand is the original trusted brand of pepper spray products for self-defense against attacks by people and animals. Mace Brand has over 30 years experience developing aerosol defense spray dispensing technologies for both the consumer and tactical markets around the world. Mace Brand is the original manufacturer and the market leader in pepper sprays.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>022188802702</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>Mace Security International</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>80270</strong></td>\r\n<th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>10% Pepper GEL</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Pepper Spray</strong></td>\r\n<th>Size</th>\r\n<td><strong>79gm</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Finish/Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Black</strong></td>\r\n<th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Pepper Sprays</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Packaging</th>\r\n<td><strong>Aerosol Can</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(316669,76,0,148905,'<p>Mace Pepper Gel Distance Spray, Magnum-4 Model, 79 gram</p>'),(316671,76,1,148905,'<p>Mace Pepper Gel Distance Spray, Magnum-4 Model, 79 gram</p>'),(316672,75,0,148906,'<p><strong>The SABRE S-1005 dual capacitor stun gun with LED flashlight is a must-have tool for personal protection and peace of mind. </strong></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Features include extreme stopping power (1.60 uC charge), 120-lumen LED flashlight for disorienting a would-be attacker at a safe distance, durable belt holster, rechargeable battery and free training video. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>The clever, stylish design makes it look like a battery - no one will know that you\'re packing serious protection!</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><strong>Most Trusted Brand</strong> - Reliable Protection You Can Count On:We don\'t market volts, because that\'s not an accurate indicator of stopping power! </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><strong>Why risk your safety on a stun gun that advertises an incorrect measurement of stun gun strength?</strong> Don\'t be fooled. Charge, measured in Microcoulombs (uC), is! </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>The National Institute for Justice (NIJ) indicates stun guns cause pain at 0.5 uC and intolerable pain at 1.0 uC; the NIJ does not mention volts as an appropriate measure of stun gun strength.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Extreme Stopping Power:This tactical and strong pain-inducing stun gun has an impressive 1.60 uC charge (intolerable pain) for reliable protection when you need it most! This SABRE stun gun is one of the strongest on the market and tested 1.60 uC as independently tested by Rassettica Testing Limited.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Versatile with Defense at a Distance: 120-lumen LED flashlight may help you disorient from a distance, possibly allowing you to escape to safety before needing to use the stun feature.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Durable &amp; Accessible: 3.7\" x 1.7\" x 0.95\" / 9.4cm x 4.3cm x 2.4cm; includes belt holster.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Safe to Carry &amp; No Batteries Needed: Safety switch prevents accidental discharge; includes rechargeable battery (cord included) and access to a free training video.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• Safety Switch to prevent accidental discharge</p>\r\n<p>• Dual Capacitors for more power</p>\r\n<p>• Built-in LED Flashlight</p>\r\n<p>• Holster included</p>\r\n<p>• Red LED Light alerts you when stun gun is armed</p>\r\n<p>• Rechargeable battery power cord included</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><strong>Why Customers Chose This Product:</strong></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><em>\"Easy to operate. It makes a very scary sound when you activate it.\" Stephanie R.</em></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><em></em></p>\r\n<p><em><em>\"I got it for my girlfriend. Very strong product. \" David W. </em></em></p>\r\n<p><em></em></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><em></em></p>\r\n<p><em><em><em>\"My wife never leaves home without it. \" Wes S. </em></em></em></p>\r\n<p><em></em></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><em></em></p>\r\n<p><em>This stun gun can\'t be shipped to anywhere in DC, HI, MA, RI, MI. It also can\'t be shipped to the following counties or cities: Newark, NYC, Wilmington and New County, DE; Annapolis, Baltimore (City and County) and Howard County, MD; Tacoma City, WA; Denison and Crawford County, IA and Chicago, IL </em></p>\r\n<p><em></em></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><em></em></p>'),(677110,75,1,148906,'<p><strong>The SABRE S-1005 dual capacitor stun gun with LED flashlight is a must-have tool for personal protection and peace of mind. </strong></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Features include extreme stopping power (1.60 uC charge), 120-lumen LED flashlight for disorienting a would-be attacker at a safe distance, durable belt holster, rechargeable battery and free training video. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>The clever, stylish design makes it look like a battery - no one will know that you\'re packing serious protection!</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><strong>Most Trusted Brand</strong> - Reliable Protection You Can Count On:We don\'t market volts, because that\'s not an accurate indicator of stopping power! </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><strong>Why risk your safety on a stun gun that advertises an incorrect measurement of stun gun strength?</strong> Don\'t be fooled. Charge, measured in Microcoulombs (uC), is! </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>The National Institute for Justice (NIJ) indicates stun guns cause pain at 0.5 uC and intolerable pain at 1.0 uC; the NIJ does not mention volts as an appropriate measure of stun gun strength.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Extreme Stopping Power:This tactical and strong pain-inducing stun gun has an impressive 1.60 uC charge (intolerable pain) for reliable protection when you need it most! This SABRE stun gun is one of the strongest on the market and tested 1.60 uC as independently tested by Rassettica Testing Limited.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Versatile with Defense at a Distance: 120-lumen LED flashlight may help you disorient from a distance, possibly allowing you to escape to safety before needing to use the stun feature.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Durable &amp; Accessible: 3.7\" x 1.7\" x 0.95\" / 9.4cm x 4.3cm x 2.4cm; includes belt holster.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Safe to Carry &amp; No Batteries Needed: Safety switch prevents accidental discharge; includes rechargeable battery (cord included) and access to a free training video.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• Safety Switch to prevent accidental discharge</p>\r\n<p>• Dual Capacitors for more power</p>\r\n<p>• Built-in LED Flashlight</p>\r\n<p>• Holster included</p>\r\n<p>• Red LED Light alerts you when stun gun is armed</p>\r\n<p>• Rechargeable battery power cord included</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><strong>Why Customers Chose This Product:</strong></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><em>\"Easy to operate. It makes a very scary sound when you activate it.\" Stephanie R.</em></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><em></em></p>\r\n<p><em><em>\"I got it for my girlfriend. Very strong product. \" David W. </em></em></p>\r\n<p><em></em></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><em></em></p>\r\n<p><em><em><em>\"My wife never leaves home without it. \" Wes S. </em></em></em></p>\r\n<p><em></em></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><em></em></p>\r\n<p><em>This stun gun can\'t be shipped to anywhere in DC, HI, MA, RI, MI. It also can\'t be shipped to the following counties or cities: Newark, NYC, Wilmington and New County, DE; Annapolis, Baltimore (City and County) and Howard County, MD; Tacoma City, WA; Denison and Crawford County, IA and Chicago, IL </em></p>\r\n<p><em></em></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><em></em></p>'),(316673,76,0,148906,'<p>Features include extreme stopping power (1.60 uC charge), 120-lumen LED flashlight for disorienting a would-be attacker at a safe distance, durable belt holster, rechargeable battery and free training video. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• Safety Switch to prevent accidental discharge</p>\r\n<p>• Dual Capacitors for more power</p>\r\n<p>• Built-in LED Flashlight</p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(677111,76,1,148906,'<p>Features include extreme stopping power (1.60 uC charge), 120-lumen LED flashlight for disorienting a would-be attacker at a safe distance, durable belt holster, rechargeable battery and free training video. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• Safety Switch to prevent accidental discharge</p>\r\n<p>• Dual Capacitors for more power</p>\r\n<p>• Built-in LED Flashlight</p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(345342,85,1,148906,'Sabre S-1005 600,000 volt mini stun gun, purple'),(316676,75,0,148907,'<p>Forster Primer Pocket Chamfering Tool</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>MSRP: $37.00</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The quickest and most accurate method to remove a military primer pocket crimp. This smooth cutting, staggered tooth cutter will chamfer many thousands of cases and will do the job consistently.</p>\r\n<p>By setting the stop collar on your Case Trimmer (sold separately), you control the depth and uniformity of the cut. Simply hold the case mouth over the Primer Pocket Center with one hand while you remove the crimp by turning the Case Trimmer crank.</p>'),(316678,75,1,148907,'<p>Forster Primer Pocket Chamfering Tool</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>MSRP: $37.00</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The quickest and most accurate method to remove a military primer pocket crimp. This smooth cutting, staggered tooth cutter will chamfer many thousands of cases and will do the job consistently.</p>\r\n<p>By setting the stop collar on your Case Trimmer (sold separately), you control the depth and uniformity of the cut. Simply hold the case mouth over the Primer Pocket Center with one hand while you remove the crimp by turning the Case Trimmer crank.</p>'),(316677,76,0,148907,'<p>Forster Primer Pocket Chamfering Tool</p>'),(316679,76,1,148907,'<p>Forster Primer Pocket Chamfering Tool</p>'),(345344,85,1,148907,'Forster Primer Pocket Chamfering Tool'),(316684,75,0,148909,'<p>RCBS FL Die Set 400 CORBON</p>\r\n<p>Manufacturer Part #17501</p>\r\n<p>Group A</p>'),(316686,75,1,148909,'<p>RCBS FL Die Set 400 CORBON</p>\r\n<p>Manufacturer Part #17501</p>\r\n<p>Group A</p>'),(316685,76,0,148909,'<p>RCBS FL Die Set 400 CORBON, #17501 Group A</p>'),(316687,76,1,148909,'<p>RCBS FL Die Set 400 CORBON, #17501 Group A</p>'),(345349,85,1,148909,'RCBS FL Die Set 400 CORBON, #17501 Group A'),(316692,75,0,148911,'<p><span>MTM S107411 Dry Box Large Survivor Dry Box Large 9.8\" x 6.8\" x 4.8\" Polypropylene Forest Green</span></p>\r\n<p><span>With its water-resistant O-Ring seal and tongue and groove design, the Survivor Dry Box from MTM is designed for extreme environments. It also features a compass built in the lid, a signaling mirror, and triple latches for the best possible seal. This rugged all-weather box is tall enough to hold any non-handled Case-Gard 50 ammo box. It has lock holes and floats. Inside dimensions are 8.2\" x 5\" x 4.4\".</span></p>'),(316694,75,1,148911,'<p><span>MTM S107411 Dry Box Large Survivor Dry Box Large 9.8\" x 6.8\" x 4.8\" Polypropylene Forest Green</span></p>\r\n<p><span>With its water-resistant O-Ring seal and tongue and groove design, the Survivor Dry Box from MTM is designed for extreme environments. It also features a compass built in the lid, a signaling mirror, and triple latches for the best possible seal. This rugged all-weather box is tall enough to hold any non-handled Case-Gard 50 ammo box. It has lock holes and floats. Inside dimensions are 8.2\" x 5\" x 4.4\".</span></p>'),(316693,76,0,148911,'<p><span>MTM S107411 Dry Box Large Survivor Dry Box Large 9.8\" x 6.8\" x 4.8\" Polypropylene Forest Green</span></p>'),(316695,76,1,148911,'<p><span>MTM S107411 Dry Box Large Survivor Dry Box Large 9.8\" x 6.8\" x 4.8\" Polypropylene Forest Green</span></p>'),(345351,85,1,148911,'MTM S107411 Dry Box Large Survivor Dry Box Large 9.8\" x 6.8\" x 4.8\" Polypropylene Forest Green'),(316696,75,0,148912,'<p><span>MTM S107211 Survivor Dry Box Small w/Mirror Triple Latch Poly Green</span></p>\r\n<p><span>With its water-resistant O-Ring seal and tongue and groove design, the Survivor Dry Box from MTM is designed for extreme environments. It also features a compass built in the lid, a signaling mirror, and triple latches for the best possible seal. This rugged all-weather box has lock holes and floats. Inside dimensions are 8.2\" x 5\" x 2.6\".</span></p>'),(316698,75,1,148912,'<p><span>MTM S107211 Survivor Dry Box Small w/Mirror Triple Latch Poly Green</span></p>\r\n<p><span>With its water-resistant O-Ring seal and tongue and groove design, the Survivor Dry Box from MTM is designed for extreme environments. It also features a compass built in the lid, a signaling mirror, and triple latches for the best possible seal. This rugged all-weather box has lock holes and floats. Inside dimensions are 8.2\" x 5\" x 2.6\".</span></p>'),(316697,76,0,148912,'<p><span>MTM S107211 Survivor Dry Box Small w/Mirror Triple Latch Poly Green</span></p>'),(316699,76,1,148912,'<p><span>MTM S107211 Survivor Dry Box Small w/Mirror Triple Latch Poly Green</span></p>'),(345352,85,1,148912,'MTM S107211 Survivor Dry Box Small w/Mirror Triple Latch Poly Green'),(316700,75,0,148913,'<p>Survival Bracelet - Paracord w whistle</p>'),(316702,75,1,148913,'<p>Survival Bracelet - Paracord w whistle</p>'),(316701,76,0,148913,'<p>Survival Bracelet - Paracord w whistle</p>'),(316703,76,1,148913,'<p>Survival Bracelet - Paracord w whistle</p>'),(345353,85,1,148913,'Survival Bracelet - Paracord w whistle'),(316704,75,0,148914,'<p>UST Base Bug Tent</p>\r\n<div id=\"productShortDescription\">Ultimate Survival Technologies Bug Tent 20-5000-01</div>\r\n<div id=\"productLongDescription\">UST B.A.S.E. Bug Tent is a protective tent that is designed for single-person occupancy.<br /><br />Features:<br /><br />- MSRP: $34.99</div>\r\n<div>- Replaces full-size tents for more efficient sleeping and protection<br />- Fine mesh protects occupant from gnats, no-see-ums, mosquitoes, and other disease-carrying insects<br />- Flame retardant<br />- Stakes, shock-corded poles, and stuff sack included</div>\r\n<div><span>For maximum protection, use in combination with the B.A.S.E. Tarp</span><br /><br /><span>Specifications:</span><br /><br /><span>- Size Erected: 21 H x 72 W x 34 D</span><br /><span>- Size Packed: 18 H x 3.5 D</span><br /><span>- Weight: 1 lb 4 oz</span><br /><span>- Color: Black</span></div>'),(316706,75,1,148914,'<p>UST Base Bug Tent</p>\r\n<div id=\"productShortDescription\">Ultimate Survival Technologies Bug Tent 20-5000-01</div>\r\n<div id=\"productLongDescription\">UST B.A.S.E. Bug Tent is a protective tent that is designed for single-person occupancy.<br /><br />Features:<br /><br />- MSRP: $34.99</div>\r\n<div>- Replaces full-size tents for more efficient sleeping and protection<br />- Fine mesh protects occupant from gnats, no-see-ums, mosquitoes, and other disease-carrying insects<br />- Flame retardant<br />- Stakes, shock-corded poles, and stuff sack included</div>\r\n<div><span>For maximum protection, use in combination with the B.A.S.E. Tarp</span><br /><br /><span>Specifications:</span><br /><br /><span>- Size Erected: 21 H x 72 W x 34 D</span><br /><span>- Size Packed: 18 H x 3.5 D</span><br /><span>- Weight: 1 lb 4 oz</span><br /><span>- Color: Black</span></div>'),(316705,76,0,148914,'<p>Ultimate Survival Technologies Bug Tent 20-5000-01</p>'),(316707,76,1,148914,'<p>Ultimate Survival Technologies Bug Tent 20-5000-01</p>'),(345354,85,1,148914,'Ultimate Survival Technologies Bug Tent 20-5000-01'),(316716,75,0,148917,'<p>GunTec 2\" removable keymod accessory rail, MSRP: $18.95</p>'),(316718,75,1,148917,'<p>GunTec 2\" removable keymod accessory rail, MSRP: $18.95</p>'),(316717,76,0,148917,'<p>GunTec 2\" removable keymod accessory rail</p>'),(316719,76,1,148917,'<p>GunTec 2\" removable keymod accessory rail</p>'),(345357,85,1,148917,'GunTec 2\" removable keymod accessory rail'),(316720,75,0,148918,'<p>GunTec slip over recoil pad Magpul CTR stock, MSRP: $12.95</p>'),(316722,75,1,148918,'<p>GunTec slip over recoil pad Magpul CTR stock, MSRP: $12.95</p>'),(316721,76,0,148918,'<p>GunTec slip over recoil pad Magpul CTR stock</p>'),(316723,76,1,148918,'<p>GunTec slip over recoil pad Magpul CTR stock</p>'),(345358,85,1,148918,'GunTec slip over recoil pad Magpul CTR stock'),(316724,75,0,148919,'<p>GunTec QD Swivel M-LOK, MSRP: $24.95</p>'),(316726,75,1,148919,'<p>GunTec QD Swivel M-LOK, MSRP: $24.95</p>'),(316725,76,0,148919,'<p>GunTec QD Swivel M-LOK</p>'),(316727,76,1,148919,'<p>GunTec QD Swivel M-LOK</p>'),(345359,85,1,148919,'GunTec QD Swivel M-LOK'),(316728,75,0,148920,'<p>GunTec 2.25\" removable keymod accessory rail, MSRP: $22.95</p>'),(316730,75,1,148920,'<p>GunTec 2.25\" removable keymod accessory rail</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MSRP: $22.95</li>\r\n<li>Part #K-RAIL-225</li>\r\n</ul>'),(316729,76,0,148920,'<p>GunTec 2.25\" removable keymod accessory rail</p>'),(316731,76,1,148920,'<p>GunTec 2.25\" removable keymod accessory rail</p>'),(345360,85,1,148920,'GunTec 2.25\" removable keymod accessory rail'),(316732,75,0,148921,'<p>GunTec 5\" removable keymod accessory rail, MSRP: $29.99</p>'),(316734,75,1,148921,'<p>GunTec 5\" removable keymod accessory rail</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MSRP: $29.99</li>\r\n<li>Part #K-5</li>\r\n</ul>'),(316733,76,0,148921,'<p>GunTec 5\" removable keymod accessory rail</p>'),(316735,76,1,148921,'<p>GunTec 5\" removable keymod accessory rail</p>'),(345361,85,1,148921,'GunTec 5\" removable keymod accessory rail'),(316736,75,0,148922,'<p>GunTec gen2 keymod rubber neoprene insert covers w protruding grooves (10 pcs kit), MSRP: $15.95</p>'),(316738,75,1,148922,'<p>GunTec gen2 keymod rubber neoprene insert covers w protruding grooves (10 pcs kit)</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MSRP: $15.95</li>\r\n<li>Part #GT-KC</li>\r\n</ul>'),(316737,76,0,148922,'<p>GunTec gen2 keymod rubber neoprene insert covers</p>'),(316739,76,1,148922,'<p>GunTec gen2 keymod rubber neoprene insert covers</p>'),(345362,85,1,148922,'GunTec gen2 keymod rubber neoprene insert covers'),(316740,75,0,148923,'<p>GunTec M-LOK neoprene grip panels (3 pcs kit), MSRP: $29.95</p>'),(316742,75,1,148923,'<p>GunTec M-LOK neoprene grip panels (3 pcs kit)</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MSRP: $29.95</li>\r\n<li>Part #GT-MLK-PANEL</li>\r\n</ul>'),(316741,76,0,148923,'<p>GunTec M-LOK neoprene grip panels (3 pcs kit)</p>'),(316743,76,1,148923,'<p>GunTec M-LOK neoprene grip panels (3 pcs kit)</p>'),(345363,85,1,148923,'GunTec M-LOK neoprene grip panels (3 pcs kit)'),(316744,75,0,148924,'<p>GunTec upper completion kit, MSRP: $24.95</p>'),(316746,75,1,148924,'<p>GunTec upper completion kit</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MSRP: $24.95</li>\r\n<li>Part #223UPPER-CKIT</li>\r\n</ul>'),(316745,76,0,148924,'<p>GunTec upper completion kit</p>'),(316747,76,1,148924,'<p>GunTec upper completion kit</p>'),(345364,85,1,148924,'GunTec upper completion kit'),(316752,75,0,148926,'<p>Adaptive Tactical, EX Performance Tactical Light and Forend, Black, Moss 500/590 &amp; 88 12 Gauge, 300-Lumen Beam, MSRP: $129.99</p>\r\n<p>300-lumen beam features a run time of up to 3 hours<br />Powered by 2 AA batteries (included)<br />3 settings: Momentary On\" Constant On\" Rapid Strobe</p>\r\n<p>The Adaptive Tactical EX Performance Tactical Light Forend for Mossberg 500 &amp; 88*\" 590 series 12g pump shotguns is a compact and powerful 300-lumen tactical flashlight that seamlessly integrates into the forend body. Three levels of illumination are designed to offer wide\" smooth beams ideal for close-range\" shotgun applications. Removable light reveals a 2 inch picatinny rail for attaching other accessories\" or rail may be concealed under the included nose cap.</p>'),(316754,75,1,148926,'<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Adaptive Tactical, EX Performance Tactical Light and Forend, Black, Moss 500 &amp; 88 12 Gauge, 300-Lumen Beam</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">300-lumen beam features a run time of up to 3 hours</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Powered by 2 AA batteries (included)</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">3 settings: Momentary On\" Constant On\" Rapid Strobe</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: $129.99</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>The Adaptive Tactical EX Performance Tactical Light Forend for Mossberg 500 &amp; 88*\" 590 series 12g pump shotguns is a compact and powerful 300-lumen tactical flashlight that seamlessly integrates into the forend body. Three levels of illumination are designed to offer wide\" smooth beams ideal for close-range\" shotgun applications. Removable light reveals a 2 inch picatinny rail for attaching other accessories\" or rail may be concealed under the included nose cap.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>682146911329</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>Adaptive Tactical</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>AT-02901</strong></td>\r\n<th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>EX Performance</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Black</strong></td>\r\n<th>Description</th>\r\n<td><strong>Forend</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Fit</th>\r\n<td><strong>Moss 500 12 Gauge</strong></td>\r\n<th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><strong>Stocks &amp; Buffer Tubes</strong></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(316753,76,0,148926,'<p>Adaptive Tactical, EX Performance Tactical Light and Forend, Black, Moss 500/590 &amp; 88 12 Gauge, 300-Lumen Beam</p>'),(316755,76,1,148926,'<p>Adaptive Tactical, EX Performance Tactical Light and Forend, Black, Moss 500/590 &amp; 88 12 Gauge, 300-Lumen Beam</p>'),(345375,85,1,148926,'Adaptive Tactical, EX Performance Tactical Light and Forend, Black, Moss 500/590 & 88 12 Gauge, 300-Lumen Beam'),(316756,75,0,148927,'<p>Adaptive Tactical, EX Performance Stock, Fits AR Rifles, Black Finish, MSRP: $49.99</p>\r\n<p>Ideal upgrade for your AR15 or AR10</p>\r\n<p>M4-style stock with adjustable length-of-pull<br />Compatible with Mil-Spec sized extension tubes<br />Sleek design</p>\r\n<p>The Adaptive Tactical EX Performance adjustable M-4 Style stock for AR15/AR10 Carbines with its advanced design and high-impact polymer construction make it the ideal upgrade for your AR15 or AR10.<br />The EX Performance M4-style Stock features an easy-to-reach rapid adjust lever for custom length-of-pull\" and includes an integrated QD swivel attachment and molded in non-rust standard sling swivel attachment. Durable polymer construction with non-slip vented rubber recoil pad\" oversized extra strength adjustment pin\" and sleek industrial design.</p>'),(316758,75,1,148927,'<p>Adaptive Tactical, EX Performance Stock, Fits AR Rifles, Black Finish, MSRP: $49.99</p>\r\n<p>Ideal upgrade for your AR15 or AR10</p>\r\n<p>M4-style stock with adjustable length-of-pull<br />Compatible with Mil-Spec sized extension tubes<br />Sleek design</p>\r\n<p>The Adaptive Tactical EX Performance adjustable M-4 Style stock for AR15/AR10 Carbines with its advanced design and high-impact polymer construction make it the ideal upgrade for your AR15 or AR10.<br />The EX Performance M4-style Stock features an easy-to-reach rapid adjust lever for custom length-of-pull\" and includes an integrated QD swivel attachment and molded in non-rust standard sling swivel attachment. Durable polymer construction with non-slip vented rubber recoil pad\" oversized extra strength adjustment pin\" and sleek industrial design.</p>'),(316757,76,0,148927,'<p>Adaptive Tactical, EX Performance Stock, Fits AR Rifles, Black Finish</p>'),(316759,76,1,148927,'<p>Adaptive Tactical, EX Performance Stock, Fits AR Rifles, Black Finish</p>'),(316760,75,0,148928,'<p>Warne Scope Mounts, XP Tactical 1 Piece Base, Fits Tikka T3, Matte Finish, MSRP: $74.99</p>\r\n<p>7075/T6 aluminum construction<br />Hardcoat anodized finish<br />Includes self centering tapered T-15 Torx screws</p>\r\n<p><span>\"Ounces are pounds; Pounds are pain\" The credo of the backcountry hunter. When tired legs are the only mode of transportation. When the air feels thin\" and feet feel heavy. When months of preparation\" training and sleepless nights thinking about the upcoming hunt culminate into a single moment\" placing the crosshair where it needs to be for the perfect shot. Warne Mountain Tech is the ultimate lightweight precision scope mounting system. Don\'t leave your dream hunt to chance. When every ounce matters\" and every shot counts\" Warne Mountain Tech are the scope mounts you can depend on.</span></p>'),(316762,75,1,148928,'<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Warne Scope Mounts, Mountain Tech Tactical 1 Piece Base, Fits Tikka T3, Matte Finish</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">7075/T6 aluminum construction</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Hardcoat anodized finish</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Includes self centering tapered T-15 Torx screws</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: $74.99</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>\"Ounces are pounds; Pounds are pain\" The credo of the backcountry hunter. When tired legs are the only mode of transportation. When the air feels thin\" and feet feel heavy. When months of preparation\" training and sleepless nights thinking about the upcoming hunt culminate into a single moment\" placing the crosshair where it needs to be for the perfect shot. Warne Mountain Tech is the ultimate lightweight precision scope mounting system. Don\'t leave your dream hunt to chance. When every ounce matters\" and every shot counts\" Warne Mountain Tech are the scope mounts you can depend on.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>656813105724</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>Warne Scope Mounts</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>76T3M</strong></td>\r\n<th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>Mountain Tech</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>Tactical</strong></td>\r\n<th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>1 Piece Base</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Black</strong></td>\r\n<th>Fit</th>\r\n<td><strong>Tikka</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Bases</strong></td>\r\n<th>Finish</th>\r\n<td><strong>Matte</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(316761,76,0,148928,'<p>Warne Scope Mounts, XP Tactical 1 Piece Base, Fits Tikka T3, Matte Finish</p>'),(316763,76,1,148928,'<p>Warne Scope Mounts, XP Tactical 1 Piece Base, Fits Tikka T3, Matte Finish</p>'),(345379,85,1,148928,'Warne Scope Mounts, XP Tactical 1 Piece Base, Fits Tikka T3, Matte Finish'),(316764,75,0,148929,'<p>Hera USA, CQR47 Stock, Fits AK Rifles, Tan, MSRP:$ 119.00</p>\r\n<p>Tan finish<br />Thumbhole stock with steep grip angle for better ergonomics<br />Bottom mounted 1913 picatinny rail<br />Fits standard AK47 stamped receivers</p>\r\n<p>Ever since the release of the CQR (close quarter rifle) buttstock for the AR15\" the firearms community has been waiting for an announcement for the AK47 version and it is finally here. Now you can add the lightweight\" durable\" compact\" polymer stock to any standard stamped AK47 receiver. This stock is extremely easy to install and is made from a high strength\" reinforced polymer that gives it a rigid\" lightweight feel. The CQR takes many design ques from the P90 sub machine gun that can turn your rifle into a futuristic looking gun fit for any scenario. The thumbhole rifle stock is designed to be as short as possible for close quarter operations; although spacers are available to customize the length of pull to fit your shooting style. Not only is the CQR stock compact\" but it is packed full of features like quick detach sling swivel points on both sides as well as regular sling attachment points. The bottom of the stock has a removable piece that covers the 1913 picatinny rail for attaching monopods which are useful for providing stability when taking long range shots. The grip angle is more steep than traditional grips to allow for a more natural point of aim that is less fatiguing to hold over a long period of time.</p>'),(316766,75,1,148929,'<p>Hera USA, CQR47 Stock, Fits AK Rifles, Tan, MSRP:$ 119.00</p>\r\n<p>Tan finish<br />Thumbhole stock with steep grip angle for better ergonomics<br />Bottom mounted 1913 picatinny rail<br />Fits standard AK47 stamped receivers</p>\r\n<p>Ever since the release of the CQR (close quarter rifle) buttstock for the AR15\" the firearms community has been waiting for an announcement for the AK47 version and it is finally here. Now you can add the lightweight\" durable\" compact\" polymer stock to any standard stamped AK47 receiver. This stock is extremely easy to install and is made from a high strength\" reinforced polymer that gives it a rigid\" lightweight feel. The CQR takes many design ques from the P90 sub machine gun that can turn your rifle into a futuristic looking gun fit for any scenario. The thumbhole rifle stock is designed to be as short as possible for close quarter operations; although spacers are available to customize the length of pull to fit your shooting style. Not only is the CQR stock compact\" but it is packed full of features like quick detach sling swivel points on both sides as well as regular sling attachment points. The bottom of the stock has a removable piece that covers the 1913 picatinny rail for attaching monopods which are useful for providing stability when taking long range shots. The grip angle is more steep than traditional grips to allow for a more natural point of aim that is less fatiguing to hold over a long period of time.</p>'),(316765,76,0,148929,'<p>Hera USA, CQR47 Stock, Fits AK Rifles, Tan</p>'),(316767,76,1,148929,'<p>Hera USA, CQR47 Stock, Fits AK Rifles, Tan</p>'),(345385,85,1,148929,'Hera USA, CQR47 Stock, Fits AK Rifles, Tan'),(316772,75,0,148931,'<p>FAB Defense M4 Buttstock for Remington 870, MSRP: $158.99</p>\r\n<p>Our AGR 870 FK collasible Buttstock for your Remington 870 provides you just what you need for a quality tactical upgrade.</p>\r\n<p>Advantages:</p>\r\n<p>Rock Solid One Piece Ergonomic Design<br />Special Non Slip Texture, Made from Reinforced Composite Materials<br />Enhanes Natural Fighting Stance Hold on Your Shotgun<br />Slightly Angled to Counter Recoil<br />Improved Performance in Reaction, on Target Time and Muzzle Control when firing<br />No Gunsmithing Required<br />Provides Storage Compartment for Batteries or Cleaning Kit<br />Allows Optional M4 Style Aluminum Buffer Tube and Our Famous GLR-16 Butt Stock Upgrades<br />Compatibility:</p>\r\n<p>Remington 870 12 gauge models Shotguns</p>'),(316774,75,1,148931,'<p>FAB Defense M4 Buttstock for Remington 870, MSRP: $158.99</p>\r\n<p>Our AGR 870 FK collasible Buttstock for your Remington 870 provides you just what you need for a quality tactical upgrade.</p>\r\n<p>Advantages:</p>\r\n<p>Rock Solid One Piece Ergonomic Design<br />Special Non Slip Texture, Made from Reinforced Composite Materials<br />Enhanes Natural Fighting Stance Hold on Your Shotgun<br />Slightly Angled to Counter Recoil<br />Improved Performance in Reaction, on Target Time and Muzzle Control when firing<br />No Gunsmithing Required<br />Provides Storage Compartment for Batteries or Cleaning Kit<br />Allows Optional M4 Style Aluminum Buffer Tube and Our Famous GLR-16 Butt Stock Upgrades<br />Compatibility:</p>\r\n<p>Remington 870 12 gauge models Shotguns</p>'),(316773,76,0,148931,'<p>FAB Defense M4 Buttstock for Remington 870</p>'),(316775,76,1,148931,'<p>FAB Defense M4 Buttstock for Remington 870</p>'),(316776,75,0,148932,'<p>Streamlight, 3V Lithium CR123 Battery, 12 Pack, MSRP: $30.13</p>\r\n<p>Lithium replacement battery</p>\r\n<p>Streamlight OEM 3V lithium battery</p>'),(316778,75,1,148932,'<p>Streamlight, 3V Lithium CR123 Battery, 12 Pack, MSRP: $30.13</p>\r\n<p>Lithium replacement battery</p>\r\n<p>Streamlight OEM 3V lithium battery</p>'),(316777,76,0,148932,'<p>Streamlight, 3V Lithium CR123 Battery, 12 Pack</p>'),(316779,76,1,148932,'<p>Streamlight, 3V Lithium CR123 Battery, 12 Pack</p>'),(316780,75,0,148933,'<p>Hera USA, HERA Front Grip Adjustable, Tan Finish, Fits PIcatinny Rails, MSRP: $39.00</p>\r\n<p>AR-15 Multi-Position Handstop Upgrade<br />M1913 Picatinny Mounted<br />Adjustable Angle<br />Fits Picatinny Rail Handguards</p>\r\n<p>Hera USA\'s HFGA AR-15 Multi-Position Front grip is a fantastic handstop upgrade for your AR-15 rifle or SBR. The HFGA mounts under your barrel on a standard picatinny rail platform. It\'s a lightweight versatile improvement over the traditional forward grip or handstop\" providing better control and improved accuracy. Featuring a low profile ambidextrous design\" with and adjustable angle to customize your forward grip\" the HFGA is the ideal companion to your AR-15. Turn your AR platform firearm into a highly effective CQB weapon\" with the HFGA.</p>\r\n<p><br />HERA MULTI-POSITION FRONT GRIP</p>\r\n<p>Manufactured from Impact Optimized Reinforced Polymer, our Multi-Position Frontgrip is both lightweight and durable. Designed to be mounted on Mil-Spec 1913 Picatinny Rails.</p>'),(316782,75,1,148933,'<p>Hera USA, HERA Front Grip Adjustable, Tan Finish, Fits PIcatinny Rails, MSRP: $39.00</p>\r\n<p>AR-15 Multi-Position Handstop Upgrade<br />M1913 Picatinny Mounted<br />Adjustable Angle<br />Fits Picatinny Rail Handguards</p>\r\n<p>Hera USA\'s HFGA AR-15 Multi-Position Front grip is a fantastic handstop upgrade for your AR-15 rifle or SBR. The HFGA mounts under your barrel on a standard picatinny rail platform. It\'s a lightweight versatile improvement over the traditional forward grip or handstop\" providing better control and improved accuracy. Featuring a low profile ambidextrous design\" with and adjustable angle to customize your forward grip\" the HFGA is the ideal companion to your AR-15. Turn your AR platform firearm into a highly effective CQB weapon\" with the HFGA.</p>\r\n<p><br />HERA MULTI-POSITION FRONT GRIP</p>\r\n<p>Manufactured from Impact Optimized Reinforced Polymer, our Multi-Position Frontgrip is both lightweight and durable. Designed to be mounted on Mil-Spec 1913 Picatinny Rails.</p>'),(316781,76,0,148933,'<p>Hera USA HFGA, HERA Front Grip Adjustable, Tan Finish, Fits PIcatinny Rails</p>'),(316783,76,1,148933,'<p>Hera USA HFGA, HERA Front Grip Adjustable, Tan Finish, Fits PIcatinny Rails</p>'),(345391,85,1,148933,'Hera USA HFGA, HERA Front Grip Adjustable, Tan Finish, Fits PIcatinny Rails'),(316784,75,0,148934,'<p>Apex Tactical Specialties, Ultimate Safety Plunger For Glock, Stainless Steel, MSRP: $17.05</p>\r\n<p>Smooths out the trigger take-up<br />Maintains proper safety function<br />Compatible with other aftermarket components<br />Easy to install</p>\r\n<p>The Apex Ultimate Safety Plunger for Glock is designed for use in the Gen 3 and Gen 4 Glock 9mm, .40 S&amp;W, .357 Sig caliber pistols and will smooth out the trigger take-up when compared to the original factory component. The Ultimate Safety Plunger maintains proper safety function</p>'),(316786,75,1,148934,'<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Apex Tactical Specialties, Ultimate Safety Plunger For Glock, Stainless Steel</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Smooths out the trigger take-up</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Maintains proper safety function</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Compatible with other aftermarket components</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Easy to install</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: <strong>$17.95</strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Retail MAP: <strong>$17.05</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>The Apex Ultimate Safety Plunger for Glock is designed for use in the Gen 3 and Gen 4 Glock 9mm, .40 S&amp;W, .357 Sig caliber pistols and will smooth out the trigger take-up when compared to the original factory component. The Ultimate Safety Plunger maintains proper safety function.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>856008005239</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>Apex Tactical Specialties</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>102-102</strong></td>\r\n<th>Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Silver</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Description</th>\r\n<td><strong>Apex Safety Plunger For Glock</strong></td>\r\n<th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Handgun Parts</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(316785,76,0,148934,'<p>Apex Tactical Specialties, Ultimate Safety Plunger For Glock, Stainless Steel</p>'),(316787,76,1,148934,'<p>Apex Tactical Specialties, Ultimate Safety Plunger For Glock, Stainless Steel</p>'),(382788,85,0,148934,'Apex Tactical Specialties, Ultimate Safety Plunger For Glock, Stainless Steel'),(345396,85,1,148934,'Apex Tactical Specialties, Ultimate Safety Plunger For Glock, Stainless Steel'),(320303,75,0,149038,'<p><span>Not sure what you want to get next? No worries! The Everest Gift Card makes the perfect gift for anyone. Shop our broad range of outdoor equipment, from hiking to fishing, camping to hunting, climbing to surfing, we\'ve got it all! </span></p>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span>Everest.com Gift Cards never expire and carry no fees.</span></li>\r\n<li>Iconic Everest Yeti design. </li>\r\n<li>Redeemable towards all of our items store-wide at Everest.com for National shipping!</li>\r\n<