an class=\"a-list-item\">Multi Tool Functions: Precision Needle nose pliers (with internal spring mechanism unlike cheaper tools). Wire &amp; cable cutter / razor sharp Knife and Saw / Philips Screwdriver / Flatnose screwdriver / File / Larger ﬂat nose screwdriver / Bottle opener / Tin opener/ Leather punch / Fish hook remover (end of saw) / Comfortable Slip Resistant Grip / Safety locking mechanism on all fold out tools / Lanyard holes x 4 / No plastic parts / A more robust alternative to a Swiss Army Knife.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Comes with a top rated CREE Tactical Flashlight as used by police and military forces. This torch is super bright and virtually indestructible, easy to carry and is waterproof – has 5 beam modes including zoom and SOS function you have the peace of mind knowing you have the right tools whether you are camping, hunting, sailing etc. a survival essential.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">The ideal gift for outdoor loving friends and lover ones. Delivered in a sleek gift box, our multi tool for men and women makes a powerful first impression when unwrapped, with a low-reflection, stealth matt grey finish that’s achieved using our a micro-sandblasting process – not some cheap coating like others use. Our camping gear multitool for men are perfect birthday gifts for men, dad gifts for dad, mens gifts, anniversary gifts for men, and gift for husband.</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(320400,75,1,149065,'<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Superb Quality Multitool and Knife that you can rely on! Made 100% from stainless steel and aluminium to make sure you have the tools for the job when you most need it. All tools come with locking safety mechanism making this multi tool set the perfect accompaniment when you are away from home. Make sure that you have reliable tools when you absolutely need them! Don’t put your safety at risk by purchasing a lower quality set!</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Multi Tool Functions: Precision Needle nose pliers (with internal spring mechanism unlike cheaper tools). Wire &amp; cable cutter / razor sharp Knife and Saw / Philips Screwdriver / Flatnose screwdriver / File / Larger ﬂat nose screwdriver / Bottle opener / Tin opener/ Leather punch / Fish hook remover (end of saw) / Comfortable Slip Resistant Grip / Safety locking mechanism on all fold out tools / Lanyard holes x 4 / No plastic parts / A more robust alternative to a Swiss Army Knife.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Comes with a top rated CREE Tactical Flashlight as used by police and military forces. This torch is super bright and virtually indestructible, easy to carry and is waterproof – has 5 beam modes including zoom and SOS function you have the peace of mind knowing you have the right tools whether you are camping, hunting, sailing etc. a survival essential.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">The ideal gift for outdoor loving friends and loved ones. Delivered in a sleek gift box, our multi tool for men and women makes a powerful first impression when unwrapped, with a low-reflection, stealth matt grey finish that’s achieved using our a micro-sandblasting process – not some cheap coating like others use. Our camping gear multitool for men are perfect birthday gifts for men, dad gifts for dad, mens gifts, anniversary gifts for men, and gift for husband.</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(320398,76,0,149065,'<p><span>The Explora Multi Tool is ergonomically designed and engineered by master craftsmen to be</span><span> </span><span>a really tough workhorse of a tool</span><span> </span><span>and is more than a match for other big brand name multitools (such as Gerber and Leatherman) on sale at many times the price. </span></p>'),(320401,76,1,149065,'<p><span>The Explora Multi Tool is ergonomically designed and engineered by master craftsmen to be</span><span> </span><span>a really tough workhorse of 