 two loops for an optional shoulder strap or TSA lock (each sold separately). The shoulder strap makes it easy to take the Luxe WinePak just about anywhere; picnics, concerts in the park, the beach, camping, boating…the list is endless. Decorating is done on one side using a dome label for an upscale look.</p>\r\n<p>Imprint Area Dimensions: 2.19″ W x 2.12″ H</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<span><span></span></span>\r\n<div class=\"wc-related-upsells-section\"><span><span></span></span>\r\n<div class=\"container\"><span><span></span></span>\r\n<div class=\"row\"><span><span><span></span></span></span>\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-12\"></div>\r\n<span><span></span></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(346108,75,1,149077,'<p>Luxe WinePak is a leak-resistant, hard plastic case with a skid-proof over mold to transport up to three bottles of wine or spirits from point A to point B. The padded universal interior has no specific cut-outs so it can accommodate most bottle shapes and sizes. The interior is customizable using laser-cut foam. Luxe WinePak has two loops for an optional shoulder strap or TSA lock (each sold separately). The shoulder strap makes it easy to take the Luxe WinePak just about anywhere; picnics, concerts in the park, the beach, camping, boating…the list is endless. Decorating is done on one side using a dome label for an upscale look. Imprint Area Dimensions: 2.19″ W x 2.12″ H</p>'),(320443,76,0,149077,'<p><span>Luxe WinePak is a leak resistant, hard plastic case with skid-proof overmold to transport up to three bottles of wine or spirits from point A to point B.</span></p>'),(346109,76,1,149077,'<p><span>Luxe WinePak is a leak-resistant, hard plastic case with a skid-proof over mold to transport up to three bottles of wine or spirits from point A to point B.</span></p>'),(320444,85,0,149077,'travel bag, bag, accessories, hard case, travel bag'),(346110,85,1,149077,'travel bag, bag, accessories, hard case, travel 