nt wc-tab\">\r\n<p>Our LuxePak Shower Puffs are perfect for gently cleansing and exfoliating your skin. Works with any liquid body wash. Pack of 3.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<span><span></span></span>\r\n<div class=\"wc-related-upsells-section\"><span><span></span></span>\r\n<div class=\"container\"><span><span></span></span>\r\n<div class=\"row\"><span><span><span></span></span></span>\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-12\"></div>\r\n<span><span></span></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(320471,85,0,149081,'shower accessories, shower puff, bathroom accessories, shower'),(346119,85,1,149081,'shower accessories, shower puff, bathroom accessories, shower'),(320472,75,0,149082,'<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Stay on your target as it moves </p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Range your target while at full draw </p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Visual red dot confirms location of range</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Works at any angle or height<span class=\"s1\"> </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Mounts directly to your <span>bow</span> or <span>crossbow</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Inexpensive back up to handheld rangefinder in critical hunting scenarios</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span>IMPORTANT</span><span>: Because AVYD uses a visual laser designator its effective use and range is limited to times when you do not have direct sunlight interfering. AVYD works as designed the first two and last two hours of shooting light and more depending upon how much tree cover you are in. And like all handheld rangefinders you must hold the unit relatively still and on-target to get a good read.</span></p>'),(359716,75,1,149082,'<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Stay on your target as it moves </p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Range your target while at full draw </p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Visual red dot confirms location of range</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Works at any angle or height<span class=\"s1\"> </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Mounts directly to your <span>bow</span> or <span>crossbow</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Inexpensive back up to handheld rangefinder in critical hunting scenarios</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span>IMPORTANT</span><span>: Because AVYD uses a visual laser designator its effective use and range is limited to times when you do not have direct sunlight interfering. AVYD works as designed the first two and last two hours of shooting light and more depending upon how much tree cover you are in. And like all handheld rangefinders you must hold the unit relatively still and on-target to get a good read.</span></p>'),(320473,76,0,149082,'<p>Bow Mounted Rangefinder - Black</p>'),(359717,76,1,149082,'<p>Bow Mounted Rangefinder - Black</p>'),(382715,85,0,149082,'Bow Mounted Rangefinder, rangefinder, archery '),(670539,85,1,149082,'Bow Mounted Rangefinder, rangefinder, archery '),(320474,75,0,149083,'<ul>\r\n<li>Stay on your target as it moves</li>\r\n<li>Range your target while at full draw</li>\r\n<li>Visual red dot confirms location of range</li>\r\n<li>Works at any angle or height</li>\r\n<li>Mounts directly to your bow or crossbow</li>\r\n<li>Inexpensive back up to hand held</li>\r\n<li>Rangefinder in critical hunting scenarios</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span>IMPORTANT</span><span>: because AVYD uses a visual laser designator its effective use and range is limited to times when you do not have direct sunlight interfering. AVYD works as designed the first two and last two hours of shooting light and more depending upon how much tree cover you are in. And like all handheld rangefinders you must hold the unit relatively still and on-target to get a good read.</span></p>'),(382762,75,1,149083,'<ul>\r\n<li>Stay on your target as it moves</li>\r\n<li>Range your target while at full draw</li>\r\n<li>Visual red dot confirms location of range</li>\r\n<li>Works at any angle or height</li>\r\n<li>Mounts directly to your bow or crossbow</li>\r\n<li>Inexpensive back up to hand held</li>\r\n<li>Rangefinder in critical hunting scenarios</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span>IMPORTANT</span><span>: because AVYD uses a visual laser designator its effective use and range is limited to times when you do not have direct sunlight interfering. AVYD works as designed the first two and last two hours of shooting light and more depending upon how much tree cover you are in. And like all handheld rangefinders you must hold the unit relatively still and on-target to get a good read.</span></p>'),(320475,76,0,149083,'<p>Bow Mounted Rangefinder - Realtree Edge</p>'),(382763,76,1,149083,'<p>Bow Mounted Rangefinder - Realtree Edge</p>'),(382792,85,0,149083,'AVYD Bow Mounted Rangefinder - Realtree Edge'),(670540,85,1,149083,'AVYD Bow Mounted Rangefinder - Realtree Edge'),(320502,75,0,149086,'<p>The Journey 150 is our most versatile, multifunctional, and rugged flashlight that features a fully waterproof enclosure.</p>\r\n<p>It has a USB port for charging your mobile devices, a Micro USB port for rapid charging the flashlight, or you can simply use any light source to keep your flashlight charged through its built-in solar panel.</p>\r\n<p>The Journey 150 super-bright LED shines for up to 21 hours on low beam and 6 hours on high from the 1200 mAh lithium-ion battery (holds a charge for 7 years). It’s 6” in length and weighs in at only 4oz.</p>\r\n<p>You can take it anywhere and store it in your glovebox, kitchen drawer, garage, or boat.</p>'),(344624,75,1,149086,'<p>The Journey 150 is our most versatile, multifunctional, and rugged flashlight that features a fully waterproof enclosure.</p>\r\n<p>It has a USB port for charging your mobile devices, a Micro USB port for rapid charging the flashlight, or you can simply use any light source to keep your flashlight charged through its built-in solar panel.</p>\r\n<p>The Journey 150 super-bright LED shines for up to 21 hours on low beam and 6 hours on high from the 1200 mAh lithium-ion battery (holds a charge for 7 years). It’s 6” in length and weighs in at only 4oz.</p>\r\n<p>You can take it anywhere and store it in your glovebox, kitchen drawer, garage, or boat.</p>'),(320503,76,0,149086,'<p>Journey 150 Flashlight Black/ Charger </p>'),(344625,76,1,149086,'<p>Hybrid Light Journey 150 Flashlight Black/ Charger </p>'),(344626,85,1,149086,NULL),(320504,75,0,149087,'<p>The Journey 150 is our most versatile, multifunctional, and rugged flashlight that features a fully waterproof enclosure.</p>\r\n<p>It has a USB port for charging your mobile devices, a Micro USB port for rapid charging the flashlight, or you can simply use any light source to keep your flashlight charged through its built-in solar panel.</p>\r\n<p>The Journey 150 super-bright LED shines for up to 21 hours on low beam and 6 hours on high from the 1200 mAh lithium-ion battery (holds a charge for 7 years). It’s 6” in length and weighs in at only 4oz.</p>\r\n<p>You can take it anywhere and store it in your glovebox, kitchen drawer, garage, or boat.</p>'),(344627,75,1,149087,'<p>The Journey 150 is our most versatile, multifunctional, and rugged flashlight that features a fully waterproof enclosure.</p>\r\n<p>It has a USB port for charging your mobile devices, a Micro USB port for rapid charging the flashlight, or you can simply use any light source to keep your flashlight charged through its built-in solar panel.</p>\r\n<p>The Journey 150 super-bright LED shines for up to 21 hours on low beam and 6 hours on high from the 1200 mAh lithium-ion battery (holds a charge for 7 years). It’s 6” in length and weighs in at only 4oz.</p>\r\n<p>You can take it anywhere and store it in your glovebox, kitchen drawer, garage, or boat.</p>'),(320505,76,0,149087,'<p>Journey 150 Flashlight Yellow/ Charger </p>'),(344628,76,1,149087,'<p>Hybrid Light Journey 150 Flashlight Yellow/ Charger </p>'),(344629,85,1,149087,NULL),(320506,75,0,149088,'<p>The 