651,'<p>Solid Gray Camo Hat </p>'),(670635,76,1,172651,'<p>Solid Gray Camo Hat </p>'),(344317,75,0,172652,'<p>An all-over digital pattern gives this textured ripstop cap a current camo look.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fabric: 100% cotton ripstop</li>\r\n<li>Structure: Unstructured</li>\r\n<li>Profile: Low</li>\r\n<li>Closure: Hook and loop</li>\r\n</ul>'),(670636,75,1,172652,'<p>An all-over digital pattern gives this textured ripstop cap a current camo look.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fabric: 100% cotton ripstop</li>\r\n<li>Structure: Unstructured</li>\r\n<li>Profile: Low</li>\r\n<li>Closure: Hook and loop</li>\r\n</ul>'),(344318,76,0,172652,'<p>Solid Front Green Camo Hat </p>'),(670637,76,1,172652,'<p>Solid Front Green Camo Hat </p>'),(344319,75,0,172653,'<p><span>Buckram lining adds shape retention while fine twill lends a classic look.</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fabric: 65/35 poly/cotton</li>\r\n<li>Structure: Structured</li>\r\n<li>Profile: High</li>\r\n<li>Closure: Self-fabric slide closure with buckle and grommet</li>\r\n</ul>'),(670638,75,1,172653,'<p><span>Buckram lining adds shape retention while fine twill lends a classic look.</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fabric: 65/35 poly/cotton</li>\r\n<li>Structure: Structured</li>\r\n<li>Profile: High</li>\r\n<li>Closure: Self-fabric slide closure with buckle and grommet</li>\r\n</ul>'),(344320,76,0,172653,'<p>Black Spirit Arms Hat</p>'),(670640,76,1,172653,'<p>Black Spirit Arms Hat</p>'),(344321,85,0,172653,'Cotton Spirit Hat Baseball '),(670639,85,1,172653,'Cotton Spirit Hat Baseball '),(344322,75,0,172654,'<p>It\'s no wonder this is one of our best-selling caps. Buckram lining not only makes for easy embroidery, but also ensures a classic shape that lasts. Plus, this great cap is available for both young and young-at-heart.</p>\r\n<p><br /><span>Port &amp; Company CP80 Features:</span><span></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fabric: 100% cotton twill</li>\r\n<li>Structure: Structured</li>\r\n<li>Profile: Mid</li>\r\n<li>Closure: Hook and loop</li>\r\n</ul>'),(670641,75,1,172654,'<p>It\'s no wonder this is one of our best-selling caps. Buckram lining not only makes for easy embroidery, but also ensures a classic shape that lasts. Plus, this great cap is available for both young and young-at-heart.</p>\r\n<p><br /><span>Port &amp; Company CP80 Features:</span><span></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fabric: 100% cotton twill</li>\r\n<li>Structure: Structured</li>\r\n<li>Profile: Mid</li>\r\n<li>Closure: Hook and loop</li>\r\n</ul>'),(344323,76,0,172654,'<p>Pink Spirit Arms Hat</p>'),(670643,76,1,172654,'<p>Pink Spirit Arms Hat</p>'),(344324,85,0,172654,'Pink Spirit Arms Hat Baseball'),(670642,85,1,172654,'Pink Spirit Arms Hat Baseball'),(344325,75,0,172655,'<p><span>Fabric: 100% cotton twill front panels; 100% polyester mesh mid and back panels Structure: Structured Profile: Mid Closure: 7-position adjustable snap</span></p>'),(670644,75,1,172655,'<p><span>Fabric: 100% cotton twill front panels; 100% polyester mesh mid and back panels Structure: Structured Profile: Mid Closure: 7-position adjustable snap</span></p>'),(344326,76,0,172655,'<p><span>Fabric: 100% cotton twill front panels; 100% polyester mesh mid and back panels Structure: Structured Profile: Mid Closure: 7-position adjustable snap</span></p>'),(670645,76,1,172655,'<p><span>Fabric: 100% cotton twill front panels; 100% polyester mesh mid and back panels Structure: Structured Profile: Mid Closure: 7-position adjustable snap</span></p>'),(344590,75,0,172679,'<p>The Journey 600 is our brightest, rugged and multifunctional workhorse. It’s a versatile and waterproof flashlight with a super-bright LED at 600 lumens.</p>\r\n<p>You’ll get 35 hours of light on one full charge from the 5000 mAh lithium-ion battery (holds a charge for 7 years). It has a USB port for charging your mobile devices, a Micro USB port for rapid charging the flashlight, or you can simply use any light source to keep your flashlight charged through its built-in solar panel.</p>\r\n<p>The Journey 600 measures 8.5” in length and weighs in only at 7oz. The electronics and hardened polycarbonate shell will outlast your greatest demands.</p>'),(344642,75,1,172679,'<p>The Journey 600 is our brightest, rugged and multifunctional workhorse. It’s a versatile and waterproof flashlight with a super-bright LED at 600 lumens.</p>\r\n<p>You’ll get 35 hours of light on one full charge from the 5000 mAh lithium-ion battery (holds a charge for 7 years). It has a USB port for charging your mobile devices, a Micro USB port for rapid charging the flashlight, or you can simply use any light source to keep your flashlight charged through its built-in solar panel.</p>\r\n<p>The Journey 600 measures 8.5” in length and weighs in only at 7oz. The electronics and hardened polycarbonate shell will outlast your greatest demands.</p>'),(344591,76,0,172679,'<p>Journey 600 Flashlight / Charger </p>'),(344643,76,1,172679,'<p>Hybrid Light Journey 600 Flashlight / Charger </p>'),(344644,85,1,172679,NULL),(344594,75,0,172681,'<p>The Puc Expandable Lantern is a portable and lightweight lantern that can also double as a flashlight when collapsed.</p>\r\n<p>It’s a versatile, water-resistant lantern that shines at 150 lumens. You’ll get 40 hours of light on one full charge from the 2000 mAh rechargeable lithium-ion battery (holds a charge for 7 years).</p>\r\n<p>The Puc has a USB port for charging your mobile devices. It also features a Micro USB port for rapid charging or you can simply use any light source to keep your Puc charged through its built-in solar panel.</p>\r\n<p>The Puc measures 5.3” when opened as a lantern and only 2” when closed as a flashlight. The lightweight design also comes in at 7oz. It also includes a fold-down metal hanger hook to hang the Puc from most anything and anywhere.</p>'),(344598,75,1,172681,'<p>The Puc Expandable Lantern is a portable and lightweight lantern that can also double as a flashlight when collapsed.</p>\r\n<p>It’s a versatile, water-resistant lantern that shines at 150 lumens. You’ll get 40 hours of light on one full charge from the 2000 mAh rechargeable lithium-ion battery (holds a charge for 7 years).</p>\r\n<p>The Puc has a USB port for charging your mobile devices. It also features a Micro USB port for rapid charging or you can simply use any light source to keep your Puc charged through its built-in solar panel.</p>\r\n<p>The Puc measures 5.3” when opened as a lantern and only 2” when closed as a flashlight. The lightweight design also comes in at 7oz. It also includes a fold-down metal hanger hook to hang the Puc from most anything and anywhere.</p>'),(344595,76,0,172681,'<p>PUC Expandable Lantern / Charger </p>'),(344599,76,1,172681,'<p>Hybrid Light PUC Expandable Lantern Yellow/ Charger </p>'),(344604,75,0,172683,'<p>The Camping Lantern is one of the brightest stars in our lineup. It’s water proof and shines incredibly bright and is adjustable from 25 to 600 lumens.</p>\r\n<p>You’ll get 100 hours of light on one full charge from the 4000 mAh rechargeable lithium-ion battery (holds a charge for 7 years). You can also charge your mobile devices with the USB port.</p>\r\n<p>It features a Micro USB port for rapid charging the Camping Lantern or you can simply use any light source to keep your Camping Lantern charged through its built-in solar panel.</p>\r\n<p>The Camping Lantern weighs in at just 13oz. This lantern is very durable, amazingly bright, water proof and floats.</p>'),(344645,75,1,172683,'<p>The Camping Lantern is one of the brightest stars in our lineup. It’s water proof and shines incredibly bright and is adjustable from 25 to 600 lumens.</p>\r\n<p>You’ll get 100 hours of light on one full charge from the 4000 mAh rechargeable lithium-ion battery (holds a charge for 7 years). You can also charge your mobile devices with the USB port.</p>\r\n<p>It features a Micro USB port for rapid charging the Camping Lantern or you can simply use any light source to keep your Camping Lantern charged through its built-in solar panel.</p>\r\n<p>The Camping Lantern weighs in at just 13oz. This lantern is very durable, amazingly bright, water proof and floats.</p>'),(344605,76,0,172683,'<p>Atlas 600 Camping Lantern / Charger</p>'),(344646,76,1,172683,'<p>Hybrid Light Atlas 600 Camping Lantern / Charger</p>'),(344647,85,1,172683,NULL),(344606,75,0,172684,'<p><span>The Headlamp is lightweight and very comfortable. It’s great for working under the hood of your car or when you’re on a hike or a bike ride. The Headlamp is water resistant, rotates 120 degrees vertically, and the LED shines bright at 75 lumens. You’ll get 30 hours of light on one full charge. It has a Micro USB port for rapid charging or you can simply use the portable solar panel for off-the-grid charging. The Headlamp measures 2.5” wide and weighs in at only 1.5 oz. It includes a comfortable headband and comes in two colors (Black or Hi-Viz Yellow).</span></p>'),(344607,76,0,172684,'<p>Hybrid Light Solar Headlamp / Yellow</p>'),(344608,75,0,172685,'<p><span>The Headlamp is lightweight and very comfortable. It’s great for working under the hood of your car or when you’re on a hike or a bike ride. The Headlamp is water resistant, rotates 120 degrees vertically, and the LED shines bright at 75 lumens. You’ll get 30 hours of light on one full charge. It has a Micro USB port for rapid charging or you can simply use the portable solar panel for off-the-grid charging. The Headlamp measures 2.5” wide and weighs in at only 1.5 oz. It includes a comfortable headband, and comes in two colors.</span></p>'),(344609,76,0,172685,'<p>Hybrid Light Solar Headlamp / Gray</p>'),(344610,75,0,172686,'<p>The NAV is our versatile Headlamp that comes with both a comfortable Headband, and a Hat Clip that slides snug on your hat.</p>\r\n<p>The head of The NAV pivots at 180° allowing you to point the headlamp where you need it. The NAV is equipped with 3 LED’s (White, Red, Green) that shines bright at 75 Lumens, and a Switch Lock Mode to prevent the light from turning on in your bag.</p>\r\n<p>You’ll get 5 hours of light on one full charge, and can be recharged via the MicroUSB port (cord included).</p>\r\n<p>The NAV Headlamp measures 3.25” in length and weighs in at only an ounce. The NAV’s super light design makes it the ideal choice for fishing, hunting, outdoor sporting and outdoors enthusiasts.</p>'),(344672,75,1,172686,'<p>The NAV is our versatile Headlamp that comes with both a comfortable Headband, and a Hat Clip that slides snug on your hat.</p>\r\n<p>The head of The NAV pivots at 180° allowing you to point the headlamp where you need it. The NAV is equipped with 3 LED’s (White, Red, Green) that shines bright at 75 Lumens, and a Switch Lock Mode to prevent the light from turning on in your bag.</p>\r\n<p>You’ll get 5 hours of light on one full charge, and can be recharged via the MicroUSB port (cord included).</p>\r\n<p>The NAV Headlamp measures 3.25” in length and weighs in at only an ounce. The NAV’s super light design makes it the ideal choice for fishing, hunting, outdoor sporting and outdoors enthusiasts.</p>'),(344611,76,0,172686,'<p>Hybrid Light NAV Headlamp</p>'),(344673,76,1,172686,'<p>Hybrid Light NAV Headlamp</p>'),(344674,85,1,172686,NULL),(344612,75,0,172687,'<p>The Puc Expandable Lantern is a portable and lightweight lantern that can also double as a flashlight when collapsed.</p>\r\n<p>It’s a versatile, water-resistant lantern that shines at 150 lumens. You’ll get 40 hours of light on one full charge from the 2000 mAh rechargeable lithium-ion battery (holds a charge for 7 years).</p>\r\n<p>The Puc has a USB port for charging your mobile devices. It also features a Micro USB port for rapid charging or you can simply use any light source to keep your Puc charged through its built-in solar panel.</p>\r\n<p>The Puc measures 5.3” when opened as a lantern and only 2” when closed as a flashlight. The lightweight design also comes in at 7oz. It also includes a fold-down metal hanger hook to hang the Puc from most anything and anywhere.</p>'),(344648,75,1,172687,'<p>The Puc Expandable Lantern is a portable and lightweight lantern that can also double as a flashlight when collapsed.</p>\r\n<p>It’s a versatile, water-resistant lantern that shines at 150 lumens. You’ll get 40 hours of light on one full charge from the 2000 mAh rechargeable lithium-ion battery (holds a charge for 7 years).</p>\r\n<p>The Puc has a USB port for charging your mobile devices. It also features a Micro USB port for rapid charging or you can simply use any light source to keep your Puc charged through its built-in solar panel.</p>\r\n<p>The Puc measures 5.3” when opened as a lantern and only 2” when closed as a flashlight. The lightweight design also comes in at 7oz. It also includes a fold-down metal hanger hook to hang the Puc from most anything and anywhere.</p>'),(344613,76,0,172687,'<p>PUC Expandable Lantern Black / Charger </p>'),(344649,76,1,172687,'<p>Hybrid Light PUC Expandable Lantern Black / Charger </p>'),(344650,85,1,172687,NULL),(344614,75,0,172688,'<p>The HEX is our first ever Bluetooth Speaker that also functions as a Lantern, a Flashlight, FM Radio, and a Micro SD Card Reader ALL-IN-ONE.</p>\r\n<p>It has a USB port for charging mobile devices and also a Micro USB port for rapid charging. You can use any light source to keep your Bluetooth Speaker charged which means you can jam your tunes outdoors or even in your dorm without worrying about missing your favorite song.</p>\r\n<p>With the 2200mAh lithium-ion battery the HEX can enjoy 20 hours of listening pleasure at mid volume. As a lantern, it can give you up to 60 hours on the 40-lumen setting or 8 hours @ 400 lumens and can turn out 10 hours on the flashlight.</p>\r\n<p>So you can take your tunes anywhere or keep it handy in your glove-box, kitchen drawer, garage, or boat.</p>'),(344615,76,0,172688,'<p>Hybrid Light HEX Bluetooth Speaker/ Light /  Charger </p>'),(344620,75,0,172691,'<p>The Hybrid Light Pro Kit contains six rugged products in one beautifully crafted box. The included products are all multi-functional lights that you have come to know and rely on for everyday life or emergencies. Also included with the kit is a Micro USB cord so that you can rapidly charge any of the products or you can always use that glorious ball of fire we call the Sun.</p>\r\n<p>The custom box is covered in velvet touch black and has a magnetic lid. To safely secure all six items, the box is fitted with a precise piece of foam for maximum impact upon opening.</p>\r\n<p>The HybridLight Pro Kit contains the following items:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Puc Expandable Lantern/Charger</li>\r\n<li>Hex Bluetooth Speaker/Light/Charger</li>\r\n<li>Nav Headlamp</li>\r\n<li>Journey 300 Flashlight/Charger</li>\r\n<li>Mammoth Multi Light/Charger</li>\r\n<li>Atlas 600 Camping Lantern/Charger</li>\r\n<li>Micro USB Cable</li>\r\n<li>Product instructions via USB flash drive</li>\r\n</ul>'),(344621,76,0,172691,'<p>Hybrid Light Pro Kit</p>'),(344622,75,0,172692,'<p>TrueTimber® has partnered with HybridLight® to produce a Premium Package stuffed with product. Seven products to be exact. All the products are rugged, multi-functional lights that you’ve come to know and rely on from HybridLight® for everyday work or emergencies. Also included with the kit is a Micro USB cord so that you can rapidly charge any of the products or you can always use that glorious ball of fire we call the Sun.</p>\r\n<p>The custom box is covered in high impact two color print (Orange and TrueTimber® Kanati Camo®) and has a magnetic lid. Holding seven different items, the box is fitted with a precise piece of foam for maximum impact on opening.</p>\r\n<p>The TrueTimber® Pro Kit contains the following items:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hex Bluetooth Speaker/Light/Charger</li>\r\n<li>Journey 300 Flashlight/Charger</li>\r\n<li>Mammoth Multi Light/Charger</li>\r\n<li>Nav Headlamp</li>\r\n<li>Journey 600 Flashlight/Charger</li>\r\n<li>Puc Expandable Lantern/Charger</li>\r\n<li>Atlas 600 Camping Lantern/Charger</li>\r\n<li>Micro USB Cable</li>\r\n<li>Product instructions via USB flash drive</li>\r\n</ul>'),(344623,76,0,172692,'<p>Hybrid Light TrueTimber Pro Kit</p>'),(344651,75,0,172693,'<p>Airia Wanderer Stainless Steel Tumbler, 20 oz</p>\r\n<p>Double wall vacuum seal insulation creates a beverage holder that is superior in keeping drinks either hot or cold. Eliminating the air between the two walls greatly diminishes the ability to transfer heat. This also keeps the exterior of the tumbler closer to room temperature so your hand does not get cold or hot. The other fantastic feature about this tumbler is the double silicone gasket in the lid. It seals so well that we recommend slightly wetting it and opening the slide on top before putting it on the cup. The hole in the top of the lid is large enough to accommodate a straw. The lid is also shatterproof and BPA free. The tumbler and lid should never be put in the dishwasher.</p>'),(344654,75,1,172693,'<p>Airia Wanderer Stainless Steel Tumbler, 20 oz</p>\r\n<p>Double wall vacuum seal insulation creates a beverage holder that is superior in keeping drinks either hot or cold. Eliminating the air between the two walls greatly diminishes the ability to transfer heat. This also keeps the exterior of the tumbler closer to room temperature so your hand does not get cold or hot. The other fantastic feature about this tumbler is the double silicone gasket in the lid. It seals so well that we recommend slightly wetting it and opening the slide on top before putting it on the cup. The hole in the top of the lid is large enough to accommodate a straw. The lid is also shatterproof and BPA free. The tumbler and lid should never be put in the dishwasher.</p>'),(344652,76,0,172693,'<p>Airia Wanderer Stainless Steel Tumbler, 20 oz</p>'),(344655,76,1,172693,'<p>Airia Wanderer Stainless Steel Tumbler, 20 oz</p>\r\n<p>Double wall vacuum seal insulation creates a beverage holder that is superior in keeping drinks either hot or cold. Eliminating the air between the two walls greatly diminishes the ability to transfer heat. This also keeps the exterior of the tumbler closer to room temperature so your hand does not get cold or hot. The other fantastic feature about this tumbler is the double silicone gasket in the lid. It seals so well that we recommend slightly wetting it and opening the slide on top before putting it on the cup. The hole in the top of the lid is large enough to accommodate a straw. The lid is also shatterproof and BPA free. The tumbler and lid should never be put in the dishwasher.</p>'),(344653,85,0,172693,'Airia Wanderer Stainless Steel Tumbler, 20 oz'),(344656,85,1,172693,'Airia Wanderer Stainless Steel Tumbler, 20 oz'),(344666,75,0,172696,'<p>ESEE Knives Izula Replacement Handle G-10 Black</p>\r\n<p><label>Brand</label>: ESEE</p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div id=\"product_sku\" class=\"col\">\r\n<div id=\"product_skuContainer\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li class=\"skuitemcode\"><label>Item Number:</label><span id=\"skucode\">ESIZULAHB</span></li>\r\n<li><label>SRP:</label><span>$26.95</span></li>\r\n<li id=\"proddescription\">\r\n<div class=\"proddescription\">3\" overall. Black G10 handle. Includes mounting hardware. Made to fit Izula. Bulk packed.</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><label>Weight:</label>0.05lbs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><span>Handles include hardware for the model specified (hardware color may vary). Please order the exact model you wish to replace since the hardware is made to fit only that model. We do not guarantee a precise perimeter fit as we do on the original handles. This is due to ESEE “marrying” a set of handles to each individual blade during production and not having that option on replacement handles.</span></p>'),(344669,75,1,172696,'<p>ESEE Knives Izula Replacement Handle G-10 Black</p>\r\n<p><label>Brand</label>: ESEE</p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div id=\"product_sku\" class=\"col\">\r\n<div id=\"product_skuContainer\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li class=\"skuitemcode\"><label>Item Number:</label><span id=\"skucode\">ESIZULAHB</span></li>\r\n<li><label>SRP:</label><span>$26.95</span></li>\r\n<li id=\"proddescription\">\r\n<div class=\"proddescription\">3\" overall. Black G10 handle. Includes mounting hardware. Made to fit Izula. Bulk packed.</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><label>Weight:</label>0.05lbs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><span>Handles include hardware for the model specified (hardware color may vary). Please order the exact model you wish to replace since the hardware is made to fit only that model. We do not guarantee a precise perimeter fit as we do on the original handles. This is due to ESEE “marrying” a set of handles to each individual blade during production and not having that option on replacement handles.</span></p>'),(344667,76,0,172696,'<p>ESEE Knives Izula Replacement Handle G-10 Black</p>'),(344670,76,1,172696,'<p>ESEE Knives Izula Replacement Handle G-10 Black</p>'),(344668,85,0,172696,'ESEE Knives Izula Replacement Handle G-10 Black'),(344671,85,1,172696,'ESEE Knives Izula Replacement Handle G-10 Black'),(344690,75,0,172697,'<p>Mako FAB Defense Dual Picatinny Rail Attachment for Standard AR-15 Handguards Polymer Black</p>\r\n<p><span>The FAB Defense dual picatinny rail for the AR-15 standard 2 piece handguards provides two 45 degree rails for mounting accessories. The can be mounted on the upper or lower portion of the handguards using the existing vent holes. Made from lightweight reinforced polymer, mounting hardware included. Made in Israel.</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"product-identifiers stack-s\">\r\n<li class=\"vendor-product-number \" data-ng-class=\"{\'is-hidden\':selector.multipleSaleItemsAreReturned()}\" data-ng-bind-template=\"Manufacturer #: DPR16/4-OD\">Manufacturer #: DPR16/4-OD</li>\r\n</ul>'),(344692,75,1,172697,'<p>Mako FAB Defense Dual Picatinny Rail Attachment for Standard AR-15 Handguards Polymer Black</p>\r\n<p>FAB Defense AR15 Double Offset Picatinny Rail Systems DPR 16/4</p>\r\n<p><span>The FAB Defense dual picatinny rail for the AR-15 standard 2 piece handguards provides two 45 degree rails for mounting accessories. The can be mounted on the upper or lower portion of the handguards using the existing vent holes. Made from lightweight reinforced polymer, mounting hardware included. Made in Israel.</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"product-identifiers stack-s\">\r\n<li class=\"vendor-product-number \" data-ng-class=\"{\'is-hidden\':selector.multipleSaleItemsAreReturned()}\" data-ng-bind-template=\"Manufacturer #: DPR16/4-OD\">Manufacturer #: DPR16/4-OD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The<span> FAB Defense AR15 Double Offset Picatinny Rail Systems DPR 16/4 </span>equips your rifle with high grade polymer dual accessory rails for versatile flashlights and accessory mountingy.</p>\r\n<h4><span>Advantages:</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Two 65mm / 2.5’’ accessory rails, each at 45 degrees off-center</li>\r\n<li>May be positioned on upper or lower segment of the handguard</li>\r\n<li>Provides superior positioning for operating tactical flashlights</li>\r\n<li>Short rails design allow most of the handguard to remain clear</li>\r\n<li>Available in black, olive drab green or flat dark earth</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><span>Compatibility:</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>All carbine, mid and rifle length M16 standard handguards.</li>\r\n<li>Most one notch picatinny flashlight mounts.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Since its foundation, <span>FAB-Defense</span> has been leading in development and manufacture of the highest quality tactical equipment and weapon accessories for Israel’s Military and Police. Because <a href=\"https://www.fab-defense.com/en/page-about-us\">FAB-Defense</a> works in collaboration with Special Forces and SWAT teams worldwide. </p>\r\n<p>Furthermore the State-of the-Art engineering, manufacturing and quality assurance methods are joined into leading technologies ensuring the products produced exceed even the most strict industry standards. In addition FAB Defense products are thoroughly tested in the harshest environments and under extreme conditions. Conditions that include freezing snow and scorching deserts by some of the best tactical units in the world. FAB unique production standards are first and foremost led by operational field experience, leading the way in tactical accessory operation.</p>'),(344691,76,0,172697,'<p>Mako FAB Defense Dual Picatinny Rail Attachment for Standard AR-15 Handguards Polymer Black</p>'),(344693,76,1,172697,'<p>Mako FAB Defense Dual Picatinny Rail Attachment for Standard AR-15 Handguards Polymer Black</p>\r\n<p>FAB Defense AR15 Double Offset Picatinny Rail Systems DPR 16/4</p>'),(344694,85,1,172697,'FAB Defense Mako AR15 Double Offset Picatinny Rail Systems DPR 16/4'),(344738,75,0,172698,'<p>Kaw Valley Precision 9MM Barrels are button rifled out of 4150 CMV Steel, QPQ Salt Bath Nitrided, with an 11-degree target crown for the best accuracy and durability possible. <br /><br />KVP 9MM barrels have an integrated feed ramp and will work with both Colt and Glock style AR-9 rifles or pistols. All barrels are manufactured under ISO:9001 &amp; AS:9100 quality certifications. </p>\r\n<p><br /><span style=\"font-size: 1.17em;\">Product Specifications:</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"tabs-content\">\r\n<li>Barrel Material: 4150 CMV Steel</li>\r\n<li>Barrel Type: Button Rifled </li>\r\n<li>Barrel Caliber: 9MM SAAMI (9x19mm Parabellum)</li>\r\n<li>Barrel Twist: 1:10</li>\r\n<li>Barrel Length: 8.5”</li>\r\n<li>Barrel Profile: Light (.675\" at the thinnest cross-section)</li>\r\n<li>Inside Finish: Black QPQ Salt Bath Nitride </li>\r\n<li>Outside Finish: Black QPQ Salt Bath Nitride </li>\r\n<li>Muzzle Thread: 1/2x36\" TPI (Threads Per Inch)</li>\r\n<li>Barrel Extension: AR15 (Will work with any Milspec AR15 Upper Receiver)</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 13.8oz</li>\r\n<li>Integrated feed ramp </li>\r\n<li>Designed to work with both Colt and Glock style AR-9 builds</li>\r\n<li>11-degree Target Crown</li>\r\n</ul>'),(344739,76,0,172698,'<p>KVP 8.5\" Barrel</p>'),(344740,85,0,172698,'Barrel, 9MM, Black, Nitride, AR15'),(344741,75,0,172699,'<p>Kaw Valley Precision 9MM Barrels are button rifled out of 4150 CMV Steel, QPQ Salt Bath Nitrided, with an 11-degree target crown for the best accuracy and durability possible. <br /><br />KVP 9MM barrels have an integrated feed ramp and will work with both Colt and Glock style AR-9 rifles or pistols. All barrels are manufactured under ISO:9001 &amp; AS:9100 quality certifications. </p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.17em;\">Product Specifications:</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"tabs-content\">\r\n<li>Barrel Material: 4150 CMV Steel</li>\r\n<li>Barrel Type: Button Rifled </li>\r\n<li>Barrel Caliber: 9MM SAAMI (9x19mm Parabellum)</li>\r\n<li>Barrel Twist: 1:10</li>\r\n<li>Barrel Length: 10.5”</li>\r\n<li>Barrel Profile: Light (.675\" at the thinnest cross-section)</li>\r\n<li>Inside Finish: Black QPQ Salt Bath Nitride </li>\r\n<li>Outside Finish: Black QPQ Salt Bath Nitride </li>\r\n<li>Muzzle Thread: 1/2x36\" TPI (Threads Per Inch)</li>\r\n<li>Barrel Extension: AR15 (Will work with any Milspec AR15 Upper Receiver)</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 16.2oz</li>\r\n<li>Integrated feed ramp </li>\r\n<li>Designed to work with both Colt and Glock style AR-9 builds</li>\r\n<li>11-degree Target Crown</li>\r\n</ul>'),(344742,76,0,172699,'<p>KVP 10.5\" Barrel</p>'),(344743,85,0,172699,'Barrel, KVP, 10.5, AR15, Black'),(344756,75,0,172705,'<div class=\"woocommerce-product-details__short-description\">\r\n<p>Sharp and Stout this general purpose outdoor knife can master all of your hunting and skinning chores. The 5” inch blade can handle the big jobs like cutting through bone or tree limbs too. With the strong blade, long blade, it works well in a survival situation.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<form class=\"cart\" action=\"https://fremontknives.com/product/popojia/\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"post\">\r\n<div class=\"quantity\"><br />\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</form>'),(344758,75,1,172705,'<div class=\"woocommerce-product-details__short-description\">\r\n<p>Sharp and Stout this general purpose outdoor knife can master all of your hunting and skinning chores. The 5” inch blade can handle the big jobs like cutting through bone or tree limbs too. With the strong blade, long blade, it works well in a survival situation.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<form class=\"cart\" action=\"https://fremontknives.com/product/popojia/\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"post\">\r\n<div class=\"quantity\"><br />\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</form>'),(344757,76,0,172705,'<p>Sharp and Stout this general purpose outdoor knife can master all of your hunting and skinning chores.</p>'),(344759,76,1,172705,'<p>Sharp and Stout this general purpose outdoor knife can master all of your hunting and skinning chores.</p>'),(344760,75,0,172706,'<div class=\"woocommerce-product-details__short-description\">\r\n<p><span>The Baldwin Creek is a stout, general purpose outdoor knife that can handle all of your hunting and skinning chores. The 3” inch blade is a perfect size for processing. With the strong blade, it works well in a survival situation.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<form class=\"cart\" action=\"https://fremontknives.com/product/popojia/\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"post\">\r\n<div class=\"quantity\">\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</form>'),(344762,75,1,172706,'<div class=\"woocommerce-product-details__short-description\">\r\n<p><span>The Baldwin Creek is a stout, general purpose outdoor knife that can handle all of your hunting and skinning chores. The 3” inch blade is a perfect size for processing. With the strong blade, it works well in a survival situation.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<form class=\"cart\" action=\"https://fremontknives.com/product/popojia/\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"post\">\r\n<div class=\"quantity\">\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</form>'),(344761,76,0,172706,'<p>The Baldwin Creek is a stout, general purpose outdoor knife that can handle all of your hunting and skinning chores.</p>'),(344763,76,1,172706,'<p>The Baldwin Creek is a stout, general purpose outdoor knife that can handle all of your hunting and skinning chores.</p>'),(344764,75,0,172707,'<div class=\"woocommerce-product-details__short-description\">\r\n<p>if you’re going to partake in a barley pop after a long day afield, you should really be carrying a 5 O’Clock Somewhere Knife. Perfect for opening your favorite craft beer and cutting up some of that deer sausage. The two most important things in a man’s life, beer and meat.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<form class=\"cart\" action=\"https://fremontknives.com/product/popojia/\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"post\">\r\n<div class=\"quantity\">\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</form>'),(344766,75,1,172707,'<div class=\"woocommerce-product-details__short-description\">\r\n<p>if you’re going to partake in a barley pop after a long day afield, you should really be carrying a 5 O’Clock Somewhere Knife. Perfect for opening your favorite craft beer and cutting up some of that deer sausage. The two most important things in a man’s life, beer and meat.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<form class=\"cart\" action=\"https://fremontknives.com/product/popojia/\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"post\">\r\n<div class=\"quantity\">\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</form>'),(344765,76,0,172707,'<p><span>if you’re going to partake in a barley pop after a long day afield, you should really be carrying a 5 O’Clock Somewhere Knife. </span></p>'),(344767,76,1,172707,'<p><span>if you’re going to partake in a barley pop after a long day afield, you should really be carrying a 5 O’Clock Somewhere Knife. </span></p>'),(344768,75,0,172708,'<div class=\"woocommerce-product-details__short-description\">\r\n<p><span>(Slim, Jim &amp; Fatty) were designed to be simplistic, lightweight and purely functional knives.  The “up-Knife”, fondly named “Jim” zips through hide and body cavity of game with ease.  The “Caping” knife, fondly named “Slim”, with its signature curve and sharp point ensures that the hunter can elegantly reach all of the intricate places necessary to keep the cape intact for the taxidermist.  The “Skinning” knife, fondly named “Fatty”, makes quick work of the process regardless if the animal has been hanging for a day or a week.  With each tool having a generous belly and finger holes for a solid grip – this tool will not let you down.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<form class=\"cart\" action=\"https://fremontknives.com/product/popojia/\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"post\">\r\n<div class=\"quantity\"><br />\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</form>'),(344770,75,1,172708,'<div class=\"woocommerce-product-details__short-description\">\r\n<p>(Slim, Jim &amp; Fatty) were designed to be simplistic, lightweight and purely functional knives.  The “up-Knife”, fondly named “Jim” zips through hide and body cavity of game with ease.  The “Caping” knife, fondly named “Slim”, with its signature curve and sharp point ensures that the hunter can elegantly reach all of the intricate places necessary to keep the cape intact for the taxidermist.  The “Skinning” knife, fondly named “Fatty”, makes quick work of the process regardless if the animal has been hanging for a day or a week.  With each tool having a generous belly and finger holes for a solid grip – this tool will not let you down.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<form class=\"cart\" action=\"https://fremontknives.com/product/popojia/\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"post\">\r\n<div class=\"quantity\"><br />\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</form>'),(344769,76,0,172708,'<p><span>The Hunters Tool Kit Trio were designed to be simplistic, lightweight and purely functional knives. </span></p>'),(344771,76,1,172708,'<p>The Hunters Tool Kit Trio were designed to be simplistic, lightweight and purely functional knives. </p>'),(697456,85,1,172708,NULL),(344776,75,0,172710,'<div class=\"woocommerce-product-details__short-description\">\r\n<p>The Hide Glider </p>\r\n<div class=\"woocommerce-product-details__short-description\">\r\n<p>This is a minimalistic tool that performs maximum work. As a nice side product of the design, it could be easier to clean? We just could not tolerate any more small gut hooks and designed this one to do the big jobs with thick hides. The serrations are designed for the index finger to rest when skinning.</p>\r\n<p>The Farson Hatchet</p>\r\n<p><span>This tool out performs anything you may have had in your hands lately. Choke up on the tool, use it like a knife or firmly grasp the handle and make short work of kindling. Whether you are building a shelter, skinning big game, or simply preparing dinner at camp this unique design gets it done.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<form class=\"cart\" action=\"https://fremontknives.com/product/hide-glider/\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"post\">\r\n<div class=\"quantity\"><br />\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</form></div>\r\n<form class=\"cart\" action=\"https://fremontknives.com/product/popojia/\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"post\">\r\n<div class=\"quantity\"><br />\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</form>'),(344778,75,1,172710,'<div class=\"woocommerce-product-details__short-description\">\r\n<p>The Hide Glider </p>\r\n<div class=\"woocommerce-product-details__short-description\">\r\n<p>This is a minimalistic tool that performs maximum work. As a nice side product of the design, it could be easier to clean? We just could not tolerate any more small gut hooks and designed this one to do the big jobs with thick hides. The serrations are designed for the index finger to rest when skinning.</p>\r\n<p>The Farson Hatchet</p>\r\n<p>This tool out performs anything you may have had in your hands lately. Choke up on the tool, use it like a knife or firmly grasp the handle and make short work of kindling. Whether you are building a shelter, skinning big game, or simply preparing dinner at camp this unique design gets it done.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<form class=\"cart\" action=\"https://fremontknives.com/product/hide-glider/\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"post\">\r\n<div class=\"quantity\"><br />\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</form></div>\r\n<form class=\"cart\" action=\"https://fremontknives.com/product/popojia/\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"post\">\r\n<div class=\"quantity\"><br />\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</form>'),(344777,76,0,172710,'<p><span>After playing with our new hatchet and Hide Glider we realized that we had a complete package of some serious tools to work up your big game. The hatchet is fantastic in breaking bone and the glider skins like a champ.</span></p>'),(344779,76,1,172710,'<p>After playing with our new hatchet and Hide Glider we realized that we had a complete package of some serious tools to work up your big game. The hatchet is fantastic in breaking bone and the glider skins like a champ.</p>'),(786768,85,1,172710,NULL),(344780,75,0,172711,'<div class=\"woocommerce-product-details__short-description\">\r\n<p><span>This is a minimalistic tool that performs maximum work. As a nice side product of the design, it could be easier to clean? We just could not tolerate any more small gut hooks and designed this one to do the big jobs with thick hides. The serrations are designed for the index finger to rest when skinning.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<form class=\"cart\" action=\"https://fremontknives.com/product/popojia/\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"post\">\r\n<div class=\"quantity\">\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</form>'),(344782,75,1,172711,'<div class=\"woocommerce-product-details__short-description\">\r\n<p><span>This is a minimalistic tool that performs maximum work. As a nice side product of the design, it could be easier to clean? We just could not tolerate any more small gut hooks and designed this one to do the big jobs with thick hides. The serrations are designed for the index finger to