r fouling and is 100% petroleum and ammonia free. It’s virtually odorless and biodegradable formula easily removes copper fouling and minimizes future copper build up without giving off any harmful or strong offensive odors found in other copper removers. Usable on all types of bore steel and won’t etch or harm the barrel.</p>\r\n<p>• Quickly breaks down copper fouling and minimizes future copper build up</p>\r\n<p>• 100% ammonia free—User safe and eco-friendly</p>\r\n<p>• Safe on bore steel—Won’t etch or harm barrels</p>\r\n<p>• Virtually odorless and is biodegradable and petroleum free</p>\r\n<p>• Made in the USA</p>'),(345174,75,1,172808,'<p>Breakthrough® Clean’s Copper Remover safely and effectively removes copper fouling and is 100% petroleum and ammonia free. It’s virtually odorless and biodegradable formula easily removes copper fouling and minimizes future copper build up without giving off any harmful or strong offensive odors found in other copper removers. Usable on all types of bore steel and won’t etch or harm the barrel.</p>\r\n<p>• Quickly breaks down copper fouling and minimizes future copper build up</p>\r\n<p>• 100% ammonia free—User safe and eco-friendly</p>\r\n<p>• Safe on bore steel—Won’t etch or harm barrels</p>\r\n<p>• Virtually odorless and is biodegradable and petroleum free</p>\r\n<p>• Made in the USA</p>'),(345173,76,0,172808,'<p><span>Breakthrough® Clean’s Copper Remover safely and effectively removes copper fouling and is 100% petroleum and ammonia free. It’s virtually odorless and biodegradable formula easily removes copper fouling and minimizes future copper build up without giving off any harmful or strong offensive odors found in other copper removers.</span></p>'),(345175,76,1,172808,'<p><span>Breakthrough® Clean’s Copper Remover safely and effectively removes copper fouling and is 100% petroleum and ammonia free. It’s virtually odorless and biodegradable formula easily removes copper fouling and minimizes future copper build up without giving off any harmful or strong offensive odors found in other copper removers.</span></p>'),(345176,75,0,172809,'<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Breakthrough Military Grade Solvent is a completely safe and odorless solvent that helps removes all carbon, lead and barrel fouling, giving you a no residue true clean. This non-flammable military grade cleaner will never stain your wood, plastic or polymer components and is also safe on Cerakote and hydro-printing. Breakthrough Military Grade cleaner cleans quickly and efficiently while using less product than other gun cleaning solutions. Breakthrough<span class=\"s2\"><span>®</span></span> Military-Grade Solvent has a flashpoint of 150° F.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Features and Benefits include:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">Non-toxic</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">Non-staining</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">Odorless</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">Non-flammable (Flashpoint of 150F)</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">Removes all fouling</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">No residue</span></li>\r\n<li>Made in the USA</li>\r\n<li>Truly pH neutral, which means its safe on your firearm’s wood, plastics, polymers, cerakote and/or hydroprinting</li>\r\n</ul>'),(345178,75,1,172809,'<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Breakthrough Military Grade Solvent is a completely safe and odorless solvent that helps removes all carbon, lead and barrel fouling, giving you a no residue true clean. This non-flammable military grade cleaner will never stain your wood, plastic or polymer components and is also safe on Cerakote and hydro-printing. Breakthrough Military Grade cleaner cleans quickly and efficiently while using less product than other gun cleaning solutions. Breakthrough<span class=\"s2\"><span>®</span></span> Military-Grade Solvent has a flashpoint of 150° F.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Features and Benefits include:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">Non-toxic</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">Non-staining</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">Odorless</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">Non-flammable (Flashpoint of 150F)</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">Removes all fouling</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">No residue</span></li>\r\n<li>Made in the USA</li>\r\n<li>Truly pH neutral, which means its safe on your firearm’s wood, plastics, polymers, cerakote and/or hydroprinting</li>\r\n</ul>'),(345177,76,0,172809,'<p><span>Breakthrough Military Grade Solvent is a completely safe and odorless solvent that helps removes all carbon, lead and barrel fouling, giving you a no residue true clean. This non-flammable military grade cleaner will never stain your wood, plastic or polymer components and is also safe on Cerakote and hydro-printing.</span></p>'),(345179,76,1,172809,'<p><span>Breakthrough Military Grade Solvent is a completely safe and odorless solvent that helps removes all carbon, lead and barrel fouling, giving you a no residue true clean. This non-flammable military grade cleaner will never stain your wood, plastic or polymer components and is also safe on Cerakote and hydro-printing.</span></p>'),(345204,75,0,172816,'<p>Our All-In-One is expertly crafted using the finest base oils, additives, and most effective solvents that modern chemistry has to offer.</p>\r\n<p>CLEANS: Removes carbon fouling, oil, grime and other contaminants.<br />LUBRICATES: Penetrates deep to prevent metal to metal contact, friction and wear.<br />PROTECTS: Coats evenly to repel moisture and shield metals from rust and corrosion.</p>'),(345207,75,1,172816,'<p>Our All-In-One is expertly crafted using the finest base oils, additives, and most effective solvents that modern chemistry has to offer.</p>\r\n<p>CLEANS: Removes carbon fouling, oil, grime and other contaminants.<br />LUBRICATES: Penetrates deep to prevent metal to metal contact, friction and wear.<br />PROTECTS: Coats evenly to repel moisture and shield metals from rust and corrosion.</p>'),(345205,76,0,172816,'<p>Cleaning at the range just got a whole lot easier!</p>\r\n<p>Our All-In-One is expertly crafted using the finest base oils, additives, and most effective solvents that modern chemistry has to offer.</p>'),(345208,76,1,172816,'<p>Cleaning at the range just got a whole lot easier!</p>\r\n<p>Our All-In-One is expertly crafted using the finest base oils, additives, and most effective solvents that modern chemistry has to offer.</p>'),(345206,85,0,172816,'all in one cleaner, what to clean your firearm with, how to clean a gun, '),(345209,85,1,172816,'all in one cleaner, what to clean your firearm with, how to clean a gun, '),(345210,75,0,172817,'<p class=\"p1\">Its plastic tray keeps all the various pieces of the kit organized neatly inside a durable case that acts like a mini toolbox.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">These cleaning kits come with cleaning rod sections, various hard bristle nylon brushes, jags, patch holders, and cotton patches. Also included is our durable and detachable aluminum handle with knurling for an easy grip and our mini bottles of Breakthrough® Military-Grade Solvent and Battle Born High-Purity Oil.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"></p>\r\n<p>Kit Includes:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>4 Stainless Steel Rods</li>\r\n<li>1 Handle</li>\r\n<li>1 Bore Brush</li>\r\n<li>1 Cotton Mop</li>\r\n<li>1 Chamber Brush</li>\r\n<li>1 Muzzle Guard</li>\r\n<li>1 Brass Patch Holder</li>\r\n<li>1 Brass Jag</li>\r\n<li>1 Double End Brush</li>\r\n<li>1 Box of Patches</li>\r\n<li>1 Box of Woolen Felts</li>\r\n<li>1 15ml Bottle of Breakthrough® Military-Grade Solvent</li>\r\n<li>1 12ml Bottle of Battle Born High-Purity Oil</li>\r\n</ul>'),(345213,75,1,172817,'<p class=\"p1\">Its plastic tray keeps all the various pieces of the kit organized neatly inside a durable case that acts like a mini toolbox.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">These cleaning kits come with cleaning rod sections, various hard bristle nylon brushes, jags, patch holders, and cotton patches. Also included is our durable and detachable aluminum handle with knurling for an easy grip and our mini bottles of Breakthrough® Military-Grade Solvent and Battle Born High-Purity Oil.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"></p>\r\n<p>Kit Includes:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>4 Stainless Steel Rods</li>\r\n<li>1 Handle</li>\r\n<li>1 Bore Brush</li>\r\n<li>1 Cotton Mop</li>\r\n<li>1 Chamber Brush</li>\r\n<li>1 Muzzle Guard</li>\r\n<li>1 Brass Patch Holder</li>\r\n<li>1 Brass Jag</li>\r\n<li>1 Double End Brush</li>\r\n<li>1 Box of Patches</li>\r\n<li>1 Box of Woolen Felts</li>\r\n<li>1 15ml Bottle of Breakthrough® Military-Grade Solvent</li>\r\n<li>1 12ml Bottle of Battle Born High-Purity Oil</li>\r\n</ul>'),(345211,76,0,172817,'<p><span>Our compact Vision Series Cleaning Kit line offers you everything you need to ensure a thorough clean.</span></p>'),(345214,76,1,172817,'<p><span>Our compact Vision Series Cleaning Kit line offers you everything you need to ensure a thorough clean.</span></p>'),(345212,85,0,172817,'Vision Series Rifle Cleaning Kit- AR-15 / .223Cal / 5.56mm'),(345215,85,1,172817,'Vision Series Rifle Cleaning Kit- AR-15 / .223Cal / 5.56mm'),(345216,75,0,172818,'<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Breakthrough Military Grade Solvent is a completely safe and odorless solvent that helps removes all carbon, lead and barrel fouling, giving you a no residue true clean. This non-flammable military grade cleaner will never stain your wood, plastic or polymer components and is also safe on Cerakote and hydro-printing. Breakthrough Military Grade cleaner cleans quickly and efficiently while using less product than other gun cleaning solutions. Breakthrough<span class=\"s2\"><span>®</span></span> Military-Grade Solvent has a flashpoint of 150° F.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Features and Benefits include:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">Non-toxic</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">Non-staining</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">Odorless</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">Non-flammable (Flashpoint of 150F)</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">Removes all fouling</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">No residue</span></li>\r\n<li>Made in the USA</li>\r\n<li>Truly pH neutral, which means its safe on your firearm’s wood, plastics, polymers, cerakote and/or hydroprinting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span>WARNING! These products contain a chemical known to the state of California to cause cancer, birth defects and other reproductive harm</span></p>'),(345219,75,1,172818,'<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Breakthrough Military Grade Solvent is a completely safe and odorless solvent that helps removes all carbon, lead and barrel fouling, giving you a no residue true clean. This non-flammable military grade cleaner will never stain your wood, plastic or polymer components and is also safe on Cerakote and hydro-printing. Breakthrough Military Grade cleaner cleans quickly and efficiently while using less product than other gun cleaning solutions. Breakthrough<span class=\"s2\"><span>®</span></span> Military-Grade Solvent has a flashpoint of 150° F.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Features and Benefits include:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">Non-toxic</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">Non-staining</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">Odorless</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">Non-flammable (Flashpoint of 150F)</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">Removes all fouling</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s1\">No residue</span></li>\r\n<li>Made in the USA</li>\r\n<li>Truly pH neutral, which means its safe on your firearm’s wood, plastics, polymers, cerakote and/or hydroprinting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span>WARNING! These products contain a chemical known to the state of California to cause cancer, birth defects and other reproductive harm</span></p>'),(345217,76,0,172818,'<p>New and improved sprayer</p>\r\n<p><span>Breakthrough Military Grade Solvent is a completely safe and odorless solvent that helps removes all carbon, lead and barrel fouling, giving you a no residue true clean. </span></p>'),(345220,76,1,172818,'<p>New and improved sprayer</p>\r\n<p><span>Breakthrough Military Grade Solvent is a completely safe and odorless solvent that helps removes all carbon, lead and barrel fouling, giving you a no residue true clean. </span></p>'),(345218,85,0,172818,'Breakthrough® Military-Grade Solvent 6 fl oz Spray Bottle'),(345221,85,1,172818,'Breakthrough® Military-Grade Solvent 6 fl oz Spray Bottle'),(345240,75,0,172820,'<p>Test product not for sell-1</p>'),(345242,75,1,172820,'<p>Test product not for sell-1</p>'),(345241,76,0,172820,'<p>Test product not for sell-1</p>'),(345243,76,1,172820,'<p>Test product not for sell-1</p>'),(345249,75,0,172822,'<p>testi product1 </p>'),(345251,75,1,172822,'<p>testi product1 </p>'),(345250,76,0,172822,'<p>testi product1 </p>'),(345252,76,1,172822,'<p>testi product1 </p>'),(345264,75,0,172823,'<p id=\"wsite-com-product-title\">5.5 ounce wildflower honey</p>'),(345273,75,1,172823,'<p id=\"wsite-com-product-title\">5.5 ounce wildflower honey</p>'),(345265,76,0,172823,'<p id=\"wsite-com-product-title\">5.5 OUNCE SPRING HARVESTED PIEDMONT WILDFLOWER HONEY</p>\r\n<p>Pure and Local</p>'),(345274,76,1,172823,'<p id=\"wsite-com-product-title\">5.5 OUNCE SPRING HARVESTED PIEDMONT WILDFLOWER HONEY</p>\r\n<p>Pure and Local</p>'),(345266,85,0,172823,'pure and local, honey, wildflower honey'),(345275,85,1,172823,'pure and local, honey, wildflower honey'),(345267,75,0,172824,'<p>West Orange Farms Fall Mountain Wildflower Honey</p>\r\n<p>5.5 ounce</p>\r\n<p>Pure and Local</p>'),(345268,76,0,172824,'<p>5.5 ounce</p>\r\n<p>Pure and Local</p>'),(345269,85,0,172824,'West Orange Farms Fall Mountain Wildflower Honey, wildflower honey, honey for sale, local honey'),(345270,75,0,172825,'<p>West Orange Farms Spring Mountain Wildflower Honey</p>\r\n<p>5.5 ounce</p>\r\n<p>Pure and Local</p>'),(345271,76,0,172825,'<p>5.5 ounce</p>\r\n<p>Pure and Local</p>'),(345272,85,0,172825,'West Orange Farms Spring Mountain Wildflower Honey, wildflower honey, local honey for sale'),(372194,75,1,172934,'<p>The AGM PVS14 OMEGA is the lightest multi-purpose night vision monocular currently available. The ultra-light PVS14 OMEGA is designed with new MIL-SPEC light weight optics and an improved battery compartment equipped with digital push button switches that reduces the total weight of the system from 350 grams to only 240 grams. The modified AGM PVS14 OMEGA retains all the characteristics of a normal AN/PVS-14, but in smaller housing dimensions. The unit features a Full Diopter Adjustment Range, Infrared LED, Gain Control, IR/Low Battery Indicator, flip up turn off and flip down turn on system and the capability to be hand-held, mounted on the helmet, headgear or weapon. The PVS14 OMEGA operates with just 4 controls, similar to the AN/PVS- 14: one button for power on/off, one button for turning on and off the IR LED, and two switches (+/-) for raising and lowering the Gain Control. Manufactured with US made optics and components and equipped with high-quality Gen 2+ or Gen 3 tubes, the AGM PVS14 OMEGA provides outstanding performance that complies with US military standards.</p>'),(372195,76,1,172934,'<p>AGM PVS14-OMEGA NL2  Light Weight Night Vision Monocular 51 degree FOV Gen 2+ \"Level 2\" Green Phosphor</p>'),(345466,75,0,173033,'<p>Cold Steel Gunsite Counter Point Lockback.  Serialized limited run. Boxed.  Highly collectible.  These limited runs always increase in value.</p>\r\n<p><br />Weight:0.32lbsCountry of Origin:Taiwan<br />Item Number:CS10ABV1</p>\r\n<p>SRP:$129.95</p>\r\n<p>5\" (12.7cm) closed. 4\" (10.16cm) satin finish partially serrated AUS-10A stainless spear point blade. OD green Griv-Ex handle. Thumb stud. Lanyard hole. Pocket clip. Serialized limited run. Boxed.<br />Weight:0.32lbsCountry of Origin:Taiwan</p>'),(345469,75,1,173033,'<p>Cold Steel Gunsite Counter Point Lockback.  Serialized limited run. Boxed.  Highly collectible.  These limited runs always increase in value.</p>\r\n<p><br />Weight:0.32lbsCountry of Origin:Taiwan<br />Item Number:CS10ABV1</p>\r\n<p>SRP:$129.95</p>\r\n<p>5\" (12.7cm) closed. 4\" (10.16cm) satin finish partially serrated AUS-10A stainless spear point blade. OD green Griv-Ex handle. Thumb stud. Lanyard hole. Pocket clip. Serialized limited run. Boxed.<br />Weight:0.32lbsCountry of Origin:Taiwan</p>'),(345467,76,0,173033,'<h1 id=\"productname\" class=\"col-xl-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 desktopview\">Gunsite Counter Point Lockback</h1>'),(345470,76,1,173033,'<h1 id=\"productname\" class=\"col-xl-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 desktopview\">Gunsite Counter Point Lockback Limited Edition - Serialized limited run</h1>'),(345468,85,0,173033,'Gunsite Counter Point Lockback'),(345471,85,1,173033,'Gunsite Counter Point Lockback Limited Edition - Serialized limited run'),(345485,75,0,173035,'<p><strong>An ultra light weight fighting/hunter profile with rubber grip scales.  The sheer balance and weight of this blade make it easy and fast to use.</strong></p>'),(359356,75,1,173035,'<p><strong>An ultra light weight fighting/hunter profile with rubber grip scales.  The sheer balance and weight of this blade make it easy and fast to use.</strong></p>'),(345486,76,0,173035,'<h6><strong>SPECIFICATIONS:</strong><br /> <strong>• Overall Length: 9.25″</strong><br /> <strong>• Blade Length: 4.25″</strong><br /> <strong>• Handle: ABS Rubber Grip</strong><br /> <strong>• Thickness: .102″</strong><br /> <strong>• Blade Material: 3cr13</strong><strong><br /> </strong></h6>'),(359357,76,1,173035,'<h6><strong>SPECIFICATIONS:</strong><br /> <strong>• Overall Length: 9.25″</strong><br /> <strong>• Blade Length: 4.25″</strong><br /> <strong>• Handle: ABS Rubber Grip</strong><br /> <strong>• Thickness: .102″</strong><br /> <strong>• Blade Material: 3cr13</strong><strong><br /> </strong></h6>'),(359358,85,1,173035,NULL),(345488,75,0,173036,'<h1>Cold Steel Ti-Lite Zytel Handle</h1>\r\n<div class=\"param sku\"><span class=\"name\"><span class=\"name\"></span></span>\r\n<p>Cold Steel Ti-Lite, 4\" Folding Knife, Spear Point, Plain Edge, AUS 8A/Polished, Black Zytel, Flipper/Pocket Clip 26SPZ</p>\r\n<span class=\"name\"><span class=\"name\"></span></span>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<span class=\"name\"><span class=\"name\"></span></span>\r\n<p>Product Weight : 5</p>\r\n<span class=\"name\"><span class=\"name\"></span></span>\r\n<p>Model : Ti-Lite</p>\r\n<span class=\"name\"><span class=\"name\"></span></span>\r\n<p>Accessories : Flipper/Pocket Clip</p>\r\n<span class=\"name\"><span class=\"name\"></span></span>\r\n<p>Description : Spear Point</p>\r\n<span class=\"name\"><span class=\"name\"></span></span>\r\n<p>Edge : Plain</p>\r\n<span class=\"name\"><span class=\"name\"></span></span>\r\n<p>Finish Color : AUS 8A/Polished</p>\r\n<span class=\"name\"><span class=\"name\"></span></span>\r\n<p>Frame Material : Black Zytel</p>\r\n<span class=\"name\"><span class=\"name\"></span></span>\r\n<p>Model 1 : Ti-Lite</p>\r\n<span class=\"name\"><span class=\"name\"></span></span>\r\n<p>Packaging : Blister</p>\r\n<span class=\"name\"><span class=\"name\"></span></span>\r\n<p>Size : 4\"</p>\r\n<span class=\"name\"><span class=\"name\"></span></span>\r\n<p>Type : Folding Knife</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<span class=\"name\">SKU:</span> <span class=\"value\">26SPZ</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"param barcode\"><span class=\"name\">Barcode:</span> <span class=\"value\">0705442005612</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"param manufacturer\"><span class=\"name\">Brand:</span> <span class=\"value\"><a href=\"https://4shooters.com/manufacturer/cold-steel\">Cold Steel</a></span></div>\r\n<div class=\"param Color\"><span class=\"name\">Color: </span><span class=\"value\">Silver</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"param Size\"><span class=\"name\">Size: </span><span class=\"value\">4\"</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"param material\"><span class=\"name\">Material: </span><span class=\"value\">Stainless Steel</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"param edge\"><span class=\"name\">Edge: </span><span class=\"value\">Plain</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"param accessories\"><span class=\"name\">Accessories: </span><span class=\"value\">Flipper/Pocket Clip</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"param packaging\"><span class=\"name\">Packaging: </span><span class=\"value\">Blister</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"param technology\"><span class=\"name\">Coating: </span><span class=\"value\">Polished</span></div>'),(345491,75,1,173036,'<div class=\"param sku\">\r\n<p><span class=\"value\">Cold Steel\'s Ti-Lite folding knives evoke the sleek speed and rebellious lines of the classic 1950\'s switchblade.<br /><br />They feature sharp and strong CPM-S35VN stainless steel blades. The Ti-Lites are equipped with Cold Steel\'s patent pending, stainless steel leaf spring locks (proven, in their tests, to hold upwards of 145 lbs). For ease of carry, the Ti-Lites come equipped with a small, but unobtrusive steel pocket clip, and can be opened rapidly by using the thumb studs or by snagging a quillon on the edge of your pocket as you draw your knife out. Cold Steel is grateful to custom knife maker, Phil Boguszewski, for his design influence and help in the creation of the Ti-Lites.<br /><br />Ti-Lite tactical folders evoke the sleek speed and rebellious lines of the classic 1950\'s-styled switchblade. Unlike most switchblades however, they are legal to carry nearly everywhere.<br /><br />Custom quality folding knives, especially those manufactured with Titanium handles and Titanium leaf spring locks are undeniably strong, lightweight, and beautiful to look at, but they\'re also quite expensive.<br /><br />We know that many of our customers love the look of our Ti-Lites but find the prices a little steep. So we have created some very affordable alternatives. The Zy-Ex Ti-Lite with a 4 inch blade mimics the look of its more expensive counterparts almost exactly, and our model that features a 6 inch blade is a completely unique Ti-Lite, virtually in a class by itself.<br /><br />Instead of 7075 Aluminum, we used 43% glass filled Zy-Ex for the handles and high quality stainless steel for the leaf spring lock and liners. The results are extraordinarily lightweight knives that are remarkably strong, sharp and good looking, at a price almost everyone can afford.</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Product Weight : 5</li>\r\n<li>Model : Ti-Lite</li>\r\n<li>Accessories : Flipper/Pocket Clip</li>\r\n<li>Description : Spear Point</li>\r\n<li>Edge : Plain</li>\r\n<li>Finish Color : AUS 8A/Polished</li>\r\n<li>Frame Material : Black Zytel</li>\r\n<li>Model 1 : Ti-Lite</li>\r\n<li>Packaging : Blister</li>\r\n<li>Size : 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Type : Folding Knife</li>\r\n<li><span class=\"name\">SKU:</span> <span class=\"value\">26SPZ</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"param technology\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"param technology\"> </div>'),(345489,76,0,173036,'<h1>Cold Steel Ti-Lite Zytel Handle</h1>'),(345492,76,1,173036,'<ul>\r\n<li>Cold Steel, Ti-Lite, 4\" Folding Knife, Spear Point, Plain Edge, AUS 8A/Polished, Black Zytel, Flipper/Pocket Clip</li>\r\n<li>Cold Steel 26SP Ti-Lite Folding Knife</li>\r\n<li>4\" Satin Plain Blade</li>\r\n<li>Zy-Ex Handles<br /><br /><br /></li>\r\n</ul>'),(345490,85,0,173036,'Cold Steel Ti-Lite Zytel Handle'),(345493,85,1,173036,'Cold Steel, Ti-Lite, 4\" Folding Knife, Spear Point, Plain Edge, AUS 8A/Polished, Black Zytel, Flipper/Pocket Clip'),(346059,75,0,173282,'<p><span>I Heard That!” – Feather-tipped ears catching the nuance of every sound, the usually wary Caracal ignored us as she began her hunt. Agile and athletic, these exquisite cats are known for their ability to leap 10 feet in the air in pursuit of birds. Having seen only 3 of these rare beauties on any of my previous safaris, rarer still was the opportunity to have her within feet of our truck while I sketched. Sherry Steele Art</span></p>'),(346067,75,1,173282,'I Heard That!” – Feather-tipped ears catching the nuance of every sound, the usually wary Caracal ignored us as she began her hunt. Agile and athletic, these exquisite cats are known for their ability to leap 10 feet in the air in pursuit of birds. Having seen only 3 of these rare beauties on any of my previous safaris, rarer still was the opportunity to have her within feet of our truck while I sketched. Sherry Steele Art'),(346060,76,0,173282,'<table class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes shop_attributes\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item woocommerce-product-attributes-item--dimensions\"><th class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__label\">Dimensions</th>\r\n<td class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__value\">12 × 19 in</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>'),(346068,76,1,173282,'<table class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes shop_attributes\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item woocommerce-product-attributes-item--dimensions\"><th class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__label\">Dimensions</th>\r\n<td class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__value\">12 × 19 in</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>'),(346061,85,0,173282,'pencil and ink, cat image, outdoor images, home decor, '),(346069,85,1,173282,'pencil and ink, cat image, outdoor images, home decor, '),(346062,75,0,173283,'<p><span>Sighted in the Serengeti while the drought lay heavy across the savannah, he was the chosen warrior to lead the herd to water. Trusted with the safety of the cows and calves, he cautiously threaded the gauntlet of lions obscured by the clumps of grasses. I hope I have honored his gallant character with my pens.</span></p>'),(346070,75,1,173283,'<p><span>Sighted in the Serengeti while the drought lay heavy across the savannah, he was the chosen warrior to lead the herd to water. Trusted with the safety of the cows and calves, he cautiously threaded the gauntlet of lions obscured by the clumps of grasses. I hope I have honored his gallant character with my pens.</span></p>'),(346071,76,1,173283,NULL),(346063,85,0,173283,'pencil & ink, outdoor image, gladiator image, Cape buffalo '),(346072,85,1,173283,'pencil & ink, outdoor image, gladiator image, Cape buffalo '),(346064,75,0,173284,'<p><span>Catching movement from the corner of my eye as I observed a group of Cape Buffalo calmly chewing their cud, I turned to see this massive Bull charging from a distant line of trees. Sketching as he advanced, I finally realized our truck was his target!  With powerful muscles surging and Doom in his eyes, all we could do was freeze. Within yards of us he suddenly turned and charged into the group of other bulls, causing chaos. That was close enough for me!</span></p>'),(346154,75,1,173284,'<p><span>Catching movement from the corner of my eye as I observed a group of Cape Buffalo calmly chewing their cud, I turned to see this massive Bull charging from a distant line of trees. Sketching as he advanced, I finally realized our truck was his target!  With powerful muscles surging and Doom in his eyes, all we could do was freeze. Within yards of us he suddenly turned and charged into the group of other bulls, causing chaos. That was close enough for me!</span></p>'),(346065,76,0,173284,'<table class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes shop_attributes\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item woocommerce-product-attributes-item--dimensions\"><th class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__label\">Dimensions</th>\r\n<td class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__value\">N/A</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item woocommerce-product-attributes-item--attribute_artwork-choices\"><th class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__label\">Artwork Choices</th>\r\n<td class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__value\">\r\n<p>50 Master Giclée Edition 17\" x 23\" = $225, 5 Artists Proofs 17\" x 23\" = $250, 50 Master Giclée Edition 14” x 19” = $195.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>'),(346155,76,1,173284,NULL),(346066,85,0,173284,'buffalo, pencil & ink, home decor, outdoor images, animals'),(346156,85,1,173284,'buffalo, pencil & ink, home decor, outdoor images, animals'),(346073,75,0,173285,'<p></p>\r\n<p>In honor of one of the last great survivors of a long-gone era, Mawingu (Cloud) still stands as a reminder of the majesty of the supreme symbol of Africa. At nearly 60 years old, he has closed the chapter of each of my safaris to Tanzania. Captured in shimmering Scratchboard, he will forever invoke the mystery and power of Africa.</p>'),(346157,75,1,173285,'<p></p>\r\n<p>In honor of one of the last great survivors of a long-gone era, Mawingu (Cloud) still stands as a reminder of the majesty of the supreme symbol of Africa. At nearly 60 years old, he has closed the chapter of each of my safaris to Tanzania. Captured in shimmering Scratchboard, he will forever invoke the mystery and power of Africa.</p>'),(346158,76,1,173285,NULL),(346074,85,0,173285,'pencil & ink image, elephant image, mawingu, wild life image, outdoor image'),(346159,85,1,173285,'pencil & ink image, elephant image, mawingu, wild life image, outdoor image'),(346075,75,0,173286,'<p><span>Sneak attack. Commemorating one of the last great Bulls of the Ngorongoro Crater, “Mawingu”, has closed the chapter on each of my safaris to Tanzania. After the bluster of a mock charge and backing off with tail raised high, he has circled around to our blind side to use the screen of acacia as his charge becomes serious.</span></p>'),(346160,75,1,173286,'<p>Sneak attack. Commemorating one of the last great Bulls of the Ngorongoro Crater, “Mawingu”, has closed the chapter on each of my safaris to Tanzania. After the bluster of a mock charge and backing off with tail raised high, he has circled around to our blind side to use the screen of acacia as his charge becomes serious.</p>'),(346076,76,0,173286,'<table class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes shop_attributes\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item woocommerce-product-attributes-item--attribute_master-giclee-edition\"><th class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__label\">Master Giclee Edition</th>\r\n<td class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__value\">\r\n<p>17\" x 23\", $175 10\" x 14\", $95</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>'),(346161,76,1,173286,NULL),(346077,85,0,173286,'African wild life, elephants, artist, pencil & ink, sherry Steele'),(346162,85,1,173286,'African wild life, elephants, artist, pencil & ink, sherry Steele'),(346078,75,0,173287,'<p><span>“Guardian and Guide” – Full of the exuberance and innocence of Youth, the tiny Elephant Calf reaches for her Mother for reassurance. Her ears and hide still tinged with pink reveal just how young she is. Exuberant with the joy of discovery and fearless in their innocence, the antics of Elephant Calves always leave us laughing as they explore the world under the watchful eyes of their families. The unbroken bond of Trust and Wisdom between Mother and Child is undeniable as the herd’s Matriarch gently guides her Babe along the path of Life.</span></p>'),(346079,85,0,173287,'African wildlife, elephants, pencil & ink, outdoor image, '),(346080,75,0,173288,'<p><span>Bat-Eared Foxes – it’s time to go out and play!  The cooling air brings out the Flirt as he entices his coy little lady from the den to join him in an evening romp. One of my favorite lesser-known species, these charming little creatures have been begging for years for their turn on my drawing table.  With oversized ears for locating insects deep underground, lovely thick coats, and expressive faces, these beguiling creatures have ended many of my afternoon game drives with a smile.</span></p>'),(346163,75,1,173288,'Bat-Eared Foxes – it’s time to go out and play!  The cooling air brings out the Flirt as he entices his coy little lady from the den to join him in an evening romp. One of my favorite lesser-known species, these charming little creatures have been begging for years for their turn on my drawing table.  With oversized ears for locating insects deep underground, lovely thick coats, and expressive faces, these beguiling creatures have ended many of my afternoon game drives with a smile.'),(346081,76,0,173288,'<table class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes shop_attributes\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item woocommerce-product-attributes-item--dimensions\"><th class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__label\">Dimensions</th>\r\n<td class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__value\">14 × 19 in</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>'),(346164,76,1,173288,'<table class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes shop_attributes\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item woocommerce-product-attributes-item--dimensions\"><th class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__label\">Dimensions</th>\r\n<td class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__value\">14 × 19 in</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>'),(346082,85,0,173288,'african wildlife, fox, wild dogs, wolves, pen & inc artwork'),(346165,85,1,173288,'african wildlife, fox, wild dogs, wolves, pen & inc artwork'),(346083,75,0,173289,'<p><span>Tail flared in the whirlwind of his pivot, the gemsbok bull dances away from the perceived threat. Sporting a horse-like plume for a tail, it perfectly balances the length of the spiraling horns. What began as a muted piece of beiges and grays quickly became one of movement and grace.</span></p>'),(346084,85,0,173289,'african wildlife, gemsbok, African animals, pencil and ink, '),(346085,75,0,173290,'<p>Looking innocent and cocky in the same instant, as only a baby can, this little fellow is bound to steal your heart. He is currently available as a paper giclée print and will soon be presented in a canvas giclée version.</p>\r\n<p>“It’s Hard to be Humble”        13″ x 23″<br />250 Master Giclée Edition S/N   $150<br />25 A/P                                         $170<br />8″ x 13″<br />250 Master Giclée Edition S/N    $95</p>'),(346086,76,0,173290,'<table class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes shop_attributes\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item woocommerce-product-attributes-item--dimensions\"><th class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__label\">Dimensions</th>\r\n<td class=\"woocommerce-product-attributes-item__value\">23 × 13 in</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>'),(346087,85,0,173290,'African wildlife, giraffes, artist, pen & ink art, sherry Steele'),(346088,75,0,173291,'<p><span>Relief.  A brief shower bursting across the Serengeti signaled the end of the dry season and the beginning of the migration.  Already muddied by heavy dust and countless thirsty mouths, a roadside puddle beckoned to yet another.  Yielding to his need, the Impala Ram cautiously stepped forward to quench his thirst.  Mirroring the beauty of the moment, the Spreading ripples broke the still surface and carried his image across the  water.</span></p>'),(346090,75,1,173291,'<p><span>Relief.  A brief shower bursting across the Serengeti signaled the end of the dry season and the beginning of the migration.  Already muddied by heavy dust and countless thirsty mouths, a roadside puddle beckoned to yet another.  Yielding to his need, the Impala Ram cautiously stepped forward to quench his thirst.  Mirroring the beauty of the moment, the Spreading ripples broke the still surface and carried his image across the  water.</span></p>'),(346091,76,1,173291,NULL),(346089,85,0,173291,'African wildlife, impala image, African artwork, ink image, Sherry Steele art'),(346092,85,1,173291,'African wildlife, impala image, African artwork, ink image, Sherry Steele art'),(346093,75,0,173292,'<p><br /><span>The Arrogance Of Elegance – Kudu</span></p>'),(346094,76,0,173292,'<p><br /><span>The Arrogance Of Elegance – Kudu</span></p>'),(346095,85,0,173292,'african wildlife, African animals, pen and ink, Sherry Steele '),(346131,75,0,173295,'<p><span>Slipping in and out of the shadows, from barely visible to invisible, he became the specter of danger. Nonchalant as he approached, without moving a whisker the menace of his presence could be felt. Though he was not yet in full hunting posture as he assessed my intent, the threat was tangible. Capturing this encounter with layer upon layer of pen strokes gave me time to relive and revel in the moment. Even the thousands of dots creating the nightfall behind the leopard became a reward of their own as his eyes began to glow with life.</span></p>'),(346132,85,0,173295,'African wildlife, big cats, African animals, leopards, pen and ink art'),(346133,75,0,173296,'<p><span>Sunrise in the Serengeti.  The only sight that could overpower the sense of wonder we had just experienced as we soared across the Endless Sea of Grass in a hot air balloon was this splendid Lion.  Heading to the champagne breakfast aboard the chase truck, we were stunned as brilliant sunrays pierced the thick screen of grasses to reveal this sight.  Like flames flickering around his face, the sun set his splendid mane afire. With eyes set only on the young Lioness at his side, he was oblivious to our prying eyes as I sketched.</span></p>'),(346134,85,0,173296,'african wildlife, big cats, lions, pen and ink art'),(346135,75,0,173297,'<p>“Dripping from her tongue was the scarcest of riches. With power and luck her Pride maintained dominance over the nearby waterhole. The cool of morning had already evaporated and until the drought broke in the Serengeti, the rapidly disappearing water would become their most prized possession. Following this lioness as she rose from the shade, belly full from the night’s feast, her intent was clear to us as she strode toward the waterhole. Dashing to the opposite side, we halted across from her just as she settled by the varnished surface for her first sip, her reflection turning the water into liquid gold”.</p>\r\n<p>Portraying that sight with my pens, without any washes or brushes, was the challenge. It quickly became clear that depicting the glassy surface of water does not take kindly to the abuse of thousands of pen strokes. Surprisingly, struggling between the strokes and the smudging of inks, the water began to take on the fractured look of ripples. That was where the mastery of the medium fell away and the magic began.</p>'),(346136,85,0,173297,'African wildlife, big cats, lions, African animals, Sherry Steele art'),(346137,75,0,173298,'<p><span>Overpowering thirst has finally broken the deadlock.  The unbroken drought lies heavy across the Serengeti as tightly bunched families of Zebra await their chance at the waterhole.  Filling the dust-laden air with barks and squeals, each stallion chooses the moment to drive his family forward into the water.  Given only a moment to satiate their thirst, each wave of mares and foals surges deeper into the pool in search of untainted water.  Reflections of their freshly washed black and white stripes flash as they return to the riverbank.  It is a time of confusion for the young and opportunity for the predators.  The pure power of Scratchbord captures the tension and the beauty of the moment.</span></p>'),(346138,85,0,173298,'African wild life, zebras, African animals, pen and ink, Sherry Steele art'),(346139,75,0,173299,'<p><span>Skittering around her mother, this little Zebra filly came to a skidding halt in front of our vehicle. Batting her eyelashes in confusion, she had to choose between fright or frolic. Under the protective gaze of her vigilant dam she was able to seize the moment as one of pure joy and continued her exuberant romp.</span></p>'),(346140,75,0,173300,'<p><span>When I saw this bull elk charge into a stream in Yellowstone National Park, I knew I had my special moment. In full rut, he is ready to take on all comers and it will take more than water to dampen his ardor. Bearing a rack that would impress the cows he is gathering and intimidate any challenger, he truly is a “Heartstopper”.</span></p>'),(346141,75,1,173300,'<p><span>When I saw this bull elk charge into a stream in Yellowstone National Park, I knew I had my special moment. In full rut, he is ready to take on all comers and it will take more than water to dampen his ardor. Bearing a rack that would impress the cows he is gathering and intimidate any challenger, he truly is a “Heartstopper”. Shop Heartstopper – Elk by Sherry Steele today at Everest.</span></p>'),(346144,75,0,173301,'<p><span>Caught by the first snow of the season, not even the flakes embellishing his antlers and crusting his back can cool the ardor of this Desert Mule Deer. The harsh conditions of his range in the high deserts of New Mexico only intensify the bitter cold of the approaching winter. Wearing his bejeweled antlers like a crown, there is little that will distract this Dandy from his quest to conquer his rivals and find the ladies.</span><br /><br /></p>'),(373372,75,1,173301,'<p><span>Caught by the first snow of the season, not even the flakes embellishing his antlers and crusting his back can cool the ardor of this Desert Mule Deer. The harsh conditions of his range in the high deserts of New Mexico only intensify the bitter cold of the approaching winter. Wearing his bejeweled antlers like a crown, there is little that will distract this Dandy from his quest to conquer his rivals and find the ladies.</span><br /><br /></p>'),(346145,85,0,173301,'deer, North American wildlife, Sherry Steele, pen and ink art'),(373373,85,1,173301,'deer, North American wildlife, Sherry Steele, pen and ink art'),(346146,75,0,173302,'<p><span>Looking for all the world like a relic from the age of dinosaurs, this beloved creature of the Southwest is struggling to make a comeback. His spunky attitude belies the gentle nature that made him part of many happy childhood memories. Somebody forgot to tell the little fellow he is only 4 inches long…. including his tail.</span></p>'),(373374,75,1,173302,'<p><span>Looking for all the world like a relic from the age of dinosaurs, this beloved creature of the Southwest is struggling to make a comeback. His spunky attitude belies the gentle nature that made him part of many happy childhood memories. Somebody forgot to tell the little fellow he is only 4 inches long…. including his tail.</span></p>'),(346147,85,0,173302,'horned toad, North American wildlife, artist, pen and ink art, Sherry Steele'),(373375,85,1,173302,'horned toad, North American wildlife, artist, pen and ink art, Sherry Steele'),(346148,75,0,173303,'<p><span>Triggered by the invitation to speak at the dedication of the final two pieces in the University of Texas Longhorn Art Series, it was a powerful reminder of how much I love this species. Referring back to my sketches made over the years at the Durnal Ranch in Western Nebraska, I was reminded of the beautiful sight of Longhorns spread across the hills and bluffs around Chimney Rock. Oftentimes this magnificent steer named “Charlie” would amble toward us as we checked the water and rode through the canyons in search of new calves. This is finally his time to be immortalized in ink.</span></p>'),(373376,75,1,173303,'<p><span>Triggered by the invitation to speak at the dedication of the final two pieces in the University of Texas Longhorn Art Series, it was a powerful reminder of how much I love this species. Referring back to my sketches made over the years at the Durnal Ranch in Western Nebraska, I was reminded of the beautiful sight of Longhorns spread across the hills and bluffs around Chimney Rock. Oftentimes this magnificent steer named “Charlie” would amble toward us as we checked the water and rode through the canyons in search of new calves. This is finally his time to be immortalized in ink.</span></p>'),(346149,85,0,173303,'longhorns, pen and ink art, Sherry Steele, animals'),(373377,85,1,173303,'longhorns, pen and ink art, Sherry Steele, animals'),(346150,75,0,173304,'<p><span>These jewels of the fields flash with the fury of their encounter. Even the palest feathers shimmer with unexpected iridescence when turned in the sunlight. As the autumn fields fade in hue, the bleached cornstalks are illuminated by the vivid flurry of feathers. The emptiness of the negative space and the swirl of dust accentuate the frenzy of the moment. A lone wild morning glory twists among the stems and pales in the presence of such brilliance.</span></p>'),(373378,75,1,173304,'<p><span>These jewels of the fields flash with the fury of their encounter. Even the palest feathers shimmer with unexpected iridescence when turned in the sunlight. As the autumn fields fade in hue, the bleached cornstalks are illuminated by the vivid flurry of feathers. The emptiness of the negative space and the swirl of dust accentuate the frenzy of the moment. A lone wild morning glory twists among the stems and pales in the presence of such brilliance.</span></p>'),(346151,85,0,173304,'birds, north African wildlife, artwork, pheasants, Sherry Steele'),(373379,85,1,173304,'birds, north African wildlife, artwork, pheasants, Sherry Steele'),(346152,75,0,173305,'<p><span>Caught in a half-strut, everything about this Eastern Wild Turkey says this is going to be “his day”! The result of many years collecting details and making field sketches during their Spring courtship rites, I finally had the moment I sought. Just a little bit quirky, as befits their personality, it gave me the impetus to tackle this challenge. These remarkable birds are simply brilliant, both in elusive behavior and in coloration. The complexity and iridescence of their feathers has turned this into my most punishing undertaking. Testing every skill I have developed with my Pen &amp; Ink, I don’t believe any other medium could capture the intricate detail that sets this bird apart.</span></p>'),(373380,75,1,173305,'<p><span>Caught in a half-strut, everything about this Eastern Wild Turkey says this is going to be “his day”! The result of many years collecting details and making field sketches during their Spring courtship rites, I finally had the moment I sought. Just a little bit quirky, as befits their personality, it gave me the impetus to tackle this challenge. These remarkable birds are simply brilliant, both in elusive behavior and in coloration. The complexity and iridescence of their feathers has turned this into my most punishing undertaking. Testing every skill I have developed with my Pen &amp; Ink, I don’t believe any other medium could capture the intricate detail that sets this bird apart.</span></p>'),(346153,85,0,173305,'birds, North American wildlife, pen and ink art, Sherry Steele, turkey'),(373381,85,1,173305,'birds, North American wildlife, pen and ink art, Sherry Steele, turkey'),(359013,75,0,173392,'<p><span>The Pro Ears Stealth 28</span><span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>weighs in at only 20 grams allowing for extended all-weather use, and the battery lasts 18 hours with a one-hour charging time. The great features of the stealth are the 5 times hearing amplification, sound compression technology, noise reducing wind cover over the microphone, and the Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) 28dB rated hearing protection. Pro Ears includes 3 incredibly soft ear bud sizes to fit any ear canal. What does this all mean for consumers? Pro Ears has created ultra-light hearing protection that is technologically advanced for all users, environments, and affordable. Pro Ears Stealth 28 comes with proprietary temple hugging design for a secure, comfortable fit with amplification up to 5X and sound compression. Perfect for shooters, yard work, concerts and everyday wear when ear protection is needed.</span></p>'),(359228,75,1,173392,'<p><span>The Pro Ears Stealth 28</span><span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>weighs in at only 20 grams allowing for extended all-weather use, and the battery lasts 18 hours with a one-hour charging time. The great features of the stealth are the 5 times hearing amplification, sound compression technology, noise reducing wind cover over the microphone, and the Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) 28dB rated hearing protection. Pro Ears includes 3 incredibly soft ear bud sizes to fit any ear canal. What does this all mean for consumers? Pro Ears has created ultra-light hearing protection that is technologically advanced for all users, environments, and affordable. Pro Ears Stealth 28 comes with proprietary temple hugging design for a secure, comfortable fit with amplification up to 5X and sound compression. Perfect for shooters, yard work, concerts and everyday wear when ear protection is needed.</span></p>'),(359014,76,0,173392,'<ul>\r\n<li>Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) 28dB</li>\r\n<li>Attack (Response) Time 2.0ms</li>\r\n<li>DLSC Technology</li>\r\n<li>Rapid USB Rechargeable Port</li>\r\n<li>5X Hearing Amplification</li>\r\n<li>Noise Reducing Wind Cover</li>\r\n<li>Incredibly Soft Ear Buds</li>\r\n<li>Ultra-Lightweight for All Day Comfort</li>\r\n<li>1 Year Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>'),(359229,76,1,173392,'<ul>\r\n<li>Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) 28dB</li>\r\n<li>Attack (Response) Time 2.0ms</li>\r\n<li>DLSC Technology</li>\r\n<li>Rapid USB Rechargeable Port</li>\r\n<li>5X Hearing Amplification</li>\r\n<li>Noise Reducing Wind Cover</li>\r\n<li>Incredibly Soft Ear Buds</li>\r\n<li>Ultra-Lightweight for All Day Comfort</li>\r\n<li>1 Year Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>'),(359015,85,0,173392,'ear phones, noise reduction, portable ear phones, '),(359230,85,1,173392,'ear phones, noise reduction, portable ear phones, '),(359096,75,0,173393,'<p><span>The Pro Ears Silver 22</span><span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>have a slimmer design with a padded base; if you are a rifle or shotgun shooter their padded design will rest on your rifle stock and not the shell of the ear cup where scratching can occur. The Silver 22 has the same technologies as the top-of-the-line Pro Ears models with<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span><span class=\"st\">DLSC™</span><span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>military-grade  circuit boards, 8-bit Micro-Processor and a Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) of 22dB. The most significant change is built around comfort and quality. The Pro Ears Silver 22 amplifies sound 5x and protects your hearing to a safe 22dB, super sensitive stereo microphones are strategically located for incredible 360-degree situation awareness.  Requires 2 AAA Batteries, not included.</span></p>'),(360420,75,1,173393,'<p><span>The Pro Ears Silver 22</span><span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>have a slimmer design with a padded base; if you are a rifle or shotgun shooter their padded design will rest on your rifle stock and not the shell of the ear cup where scratching can occur. The Silver 22 has the same technologies as the top-of-the-line Pro Ears models with<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span><span class=\"st\">DLSC™</span><span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>military-grade  circuit boards, 8-bit Micro-Processor and a Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) of 22dB. The most significant change is built around comfort and quality. The Pro Ears Silver 22 amplifies sound 5x and protects your hearing to a safe 22dB, super sensitive stereo microphones are strategically located for incredible 360-degree situation awareness.  Requires 2 AAA Batteries, not included.</span></p>'),(359097,76,0,173393,'<ul>\r\n<li>Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) 22dB</li>\r\n<li>Attack (Response) Time 1.5ms</li>\r\n<li>Weighs only 12oz</li>\r\n<li>3 Year Warra