bsorbing frame combined with a no-slip grip offer superior protection for your phone. Built-in screen protector prevents scratches without compromising touch sensitivity. Kickstand offers convenient hands-free viewing from either landscape or two different angles of portrait mode. Precise cutouts ensure full access to iPhone ports, functions, and features. Experience user-friendly convenience with (included) detachable rotating holster. Trust SUPCASE Unicorn Beetle Pro to protect your phone while working, traveling, or participating in outdoor activities. Fortify your Apple iPhone 12 or 12 PRO 6.1 Inch with the legendary Unicorn Beetle Pro by SUPCASE! Slim, sturdy, and built to take a beating, you’ll enjoy 360° protection from dirt, dust, drops, and even the kids! Packed with TPU/poly-carbonate, precise cutouts and a bonus kickstand for hands-free video content, it truly lives up to its reputation.</p>\r\n<p>What\'s in the package?</p>\r\n<p>1x SUPCASE Unicorn Beetle Pro Protective Case with Screen Protector for the Apple iPhone 12 and 12 PRO 6.1 Inch (2020 edition).</p>\r\n<p>1x Supcase Unicorn Beetle Pro Rotating Belt Clip Holster for the Apple iPhone 12 and 12 PRO 6.1 Inch (2020 edition).</p>\r\n<p>Quality Guarantee:</p>\r\n<p>We are committed to providing our customers with quality products and superior service and offer a one-year hassle-free warranty and 100% satisfaction guarantee. If you have any problem with our product, contact us, our support team is happy to help. \"</p>'),(359359,75,1,173401,'<ul>\r\n<li>Winner of CNET’s Annual Drop Test with highest total feet.</li>\r\n<li>Made of Ultra Durable poly-carbonate and shock-absorbing TPU.</li>\r\n<li>Built-in screen protector resists scratches and cracks.</li>\r\n<li>360° casing provides total protection from drops, bumps, and impact.</li>\r\n<li>Raised bezels guard screen and lenses from damaging surfaces.</li>\r\n<li>Built-in kickstand offers 3 viewing angles and doubles as ring holder.</li>\r\n<li>Free r