elp organize your pistols without taking excess room.</li>\r\n<li>Interior Dimensions of each slot: 7″ x 4.25″ x 1.5″</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Dimensions: 6.63″ x 9.5″ x 12.44″</li>\r\n<li>Handmade in the USA with All-American caliber materials.</li>\r\n</ul>'),(359426,85,0,173452,'pistol storage, safe storage, gun safe accessories'),(359427,75,0,173453,'<p>The Benchmaster 8 Gun Pistol Rack provides easy, organized storage for up to 8 pistols. The semi-rigid Kydex dividers protect your gun’s finish and are water and oil resistant. The antimicrobial foam cushioning is both water- and shock-resistant. Give your guns the protection they deserve, and organize your safe for when you need quick and easy access.  The sturdy materials and quality construction eliminates the need to remove your pistols to transport them for cleaning.</p>\r\n<p>The spaces for both the grip end and the barrel slide of the gun are 1.5” wide. This is ample space for any single stack or double stack magazine pistol.</p>\r\n<p>Whether you need a rack for pistols only, mags only or one that holds pistols and mags, check out our other great Weapon Rack products.</p>'),(359428,76,0,173453,'<ul>\r\n<li>Made from Kydex and anti-microbial foam, giving your pistols soft but rigid protection.</li>\r\n<li>No metal parts to scratch or mar your gun’s finish.</li>\r\n<li>Lightweight and sturdy, carry a full rack with no flex like some all-foam racks.</li>\r\n<li>High strength shock absorption.  Drop resistant and will provide some cushion for your guns.</li>\r\n<li>No wasted space in your safe.  The thin walls help organize your pistols without taking excess room.</li>\r\n<li>Interior Dimensions of each slot: 4.25″ x 7″ x 1.5″</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Dimensions: 6.63″ x 8.44″ x 12.44″</li>\r\n<li>Handmade in the USA with All-American caliber materials.</li>\r\n</ul>'),(359429,85,0,173453,'pistol storage, safe storage, gun safe accessories'),(359430,75,0,173454,'<p><span>The four (4) gun barrel gun rest is an easy access, lightweight cushioned gun rest with a magnetic strip for a no slip base. Keep your rifles and shotguns upright in your safe. They have excellent chemical resistance, impervious to rot, mold and mildew. Be ready with weapon rack.</span></p>'),(359431,76,0,173454,'<ul>\r\n<li>This rack is lightweight, high resiliency, and has great shock absorption.</li>\r\n<li>Keep your barrels in order and you know where they are when you need them.</li>\r\n<li>Contains no latex.</li>\r\n<li>Strong Magnetic strip to attach to your safe, fridge, or car.</li>\r\n<li>No water absorption, impervious to rot and mildew.</li>\r\n<li>Excellent chemical resistance</li>\r\n<li>Interior: 1.5″ x 1.44″ x 1.5″</li>\r\n<li>Exterior: 1.5″ x 2.88″ x 11.88″</li>\r\n<li>Made in the USA</li>\r\n</ul>'),(359432,85,0,173454,'gun safes, rifle rests, barrel rests'),(359457,75,0,173462,'<p><span>The six (6) gun barrel gun rest is an easy access, lightweight cushioned gun rest with a magnetic strip for a no slip base. Keep your rifles and shotguns upright in your safe. They have excellent chemical resistance, impervious to rot, mold and mildew. Be ready with weapon rack</span></p>'),(370614,75,1,173462,'<p><span>The six (6) gun barrel gun rest is an easy access, lightweight cushioned gun rest with a magnetic strip for a no slip base. Keep your rifles and shotguns upright in your safe. They have excellent chemical resistance, impervious to rot, mold and mildew. Be ready with weapon rack</span></p>'),(359458,76,0,173462,'<ul>\r\n<li>This rack is lightweight, high resiliency, and has great shock absorption.</li>\r\n<li>Keep your barrels in order and you know where they are when you need them.</li>\r\n<li>Contains no latex.</li>\r\n<li>Strong Magnetic strip to attach to your safe, fridge, or car.</li>\r\n<li>No water absorption, impervious to rot and mildew.</li>\r\n<li>Excellent chemical resistance</li>\r\n<li>Interior: 1.5″ x 1.44″ x 1.5″</li>\r\n<li>Exterior: 17.88″ x 2.88″ x 1.5″</li>\r\n<li>Made in the USA</li>\r\n</ul>'),(370615,76,1,173462,'<ul>\r\n<li>This rack is lightweight, high resiliency, and has great shock absorption.</li>\r\n<li>Keep your barrels in order and you know where they are when you need them.</li>\r\n<li>Contains no latex.</li>\r\n<li>Strong Magnetic strip to attach to your safe, fridge, or car.</li>\r\n<li>No water absorption, impervious to rot and mildew.</li>\r\n<li>Excellent chemical resistance</li>\r\n<li>Interior: 1.5″ x 1.44″ x 1.5″</li>\r\n<li>Exterior: 17.88″ x 2.88″ x 1.5″</li>\r\n<li>Made in the USA</li>\r\n</ul>'),(359459,85,0,173462,'gun safes, rifle rests, barrel rests'),(370616,85,1,173462,'gun safes, rifle rests, barrel rests'),(359460,75,0,173463,'<p><span>The Bench Master adjustable 3-piece bench block comes with three (3) interlocking bench blocks that can be used separately or in any combination of the three (3) blocks. It is ideal for the barrel or buttstock rest or can be used for both. The rubber bottom prevents slipping and it has two carry loops for easy transportation.</span></p>'),(373388,75,1,173463,'<p><span>The Bench Master adjustable 3-piece bench block comes with three (3) interlocking bench blocks that can be used separately or in any combination of the three (3) blocks. It is ideal for the barrel or buttstock rest or can be used for both. The rubber bottom prevents slipping and it has two carry loops for easy transportation.</span></p>'),(359461,76,0,173463,'<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable 3-piece bench block Comes with three (3) interlocking bench Blocks that can be used separately or in any combination of the three (3) blocks</li>\r\n<li>The rubber bottom prevents slipping and it has two carry loops for easy transportation</li>\r\n<li>Improve accuracy, reduce recoil and easy transport</li>\r\n<li>Protects from unwanted nicks and scratches</li>\r\n<li>Multiple heights for all your shooting needs.</li>\r\n<li>Weighs 10.4 ounces</li>\r\n<li>Made in the USA</li>\r\n</ul>'),(373389,76,1,173463,'<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable 3-piece bench block Comes with three (3) interlocking bench Blocks that can be used separately or in any combination of the three (3) blocks</li>\r\n<li>The rubber bottom prevents slipping and it has two carry loops for easy transportation</li>\r\n<li>Improve accuracy, reduce recoil and easy transport</li>\r\n<li>Protects from unwanted nicks and scratches</li>\r\n<li>Multiple heights for all your shooting needs.</li>\r\n<li>Weighs 10.4 ounces</li>\r\n<li>Made in the USA</li>\r\n</ul>'),(359462,85,0,173463,'bench rests, shooting rests, bench bags shooting bags'),(373390,85,1,173463,'bench rests, shooting rests, bench bags shooting bags'),(359475,75,0,173468,'<p><span>The Benchmaster X Block is multi-dimensional shooting rest that provided multiple options for the shooter. This bench rest provides the height and cradle options for just about all your bench shooting needs.</span></p>'),(373391,75,1,173468,'<p><span>The Benchmaster X Block is multi-dimensional shooting rest that provided multiple options for the shooter. This bench rest provides the height and cradle options for just about all your bench shooting needs.</span></p>'),(359476,76,0,173468,'<ul>\r\n<li>Multi-dimensional lightweight shooting rest options – height and cradle options</li>\r\n<li>The high-density foam construction will stand up to bad weather and has extremely low water absorption, excellent chemical resistance (gun oil), and is impervious to rot, mold, and mildew</li>\r\n<li>Improve accuracy, reduce recoil and easy transport</li>\r\n<li>Protects from unwanted nicks and scratches</li>\r\n<li>8″x 6″x 4″</li>\r\n<li>Weighs 7.1 ounces</li>\r\n<li>Made in the USA</li>\r\n</ul>'),(373392,76,1,173468,'<ul>\r\n<li>Multi-dimensional lightweight shooting rest options – height and cradle options</li>\r\n<li>The high-density foam construction will stand up to bad weather and has extremely low water absorption, excellent chemical resistance (gun oil), and is impervious to rot, mold, and mildew</li>\r\n<li>Improve accuracy, reduce recoil and easy transport</li>\r\n<li>Protects from unwanted nicks and scratches</li>\r\n<li>8″x 6″x 4″</li>\r\n<li>Weighs 7.1 ounces</li>\r\n<li>Made in the USA</li>\r\n</ul>'),(359477,85,0,173468,'bench rests, shooting rests, bench bags shooting bags'),(373393,85,1,173468,'bench rests, shooting rests, bench bags shooting bags'),(359478,75,0,173469,'<p><span>When you have a larger barrel, you need a larger gun rest. Made from the same high-density foam as our original X-Block, the X-Block XL as even more oomph. Anti-microbial, sturdy and lightweight, the X-Block XL is perfect shooting rest for your BFG.</span></p>'),(359479,76,0,173469,'<ul>\r\n<li>160 cubic inches larger than our regular X-BLOCK shooting rest.</li>\r\n<li>Multi-dimensional lightweight shooting rest options with bigger cradles.</li>\r\n<li>The high-density foam construction will stand up to bad weather and has extremely low water absorption, excellent chemical resistance, and is impervious to rot, mold, and mildew.</li>\r\n<li>Improve accuracy, reduce recoil and easy transport.</li>\r\n<li>Protects from unwanted nicks and scratches</li>\r\n<li>11″x 8″x 4″</li>\r\n<li>Weighs 7.1 ounces</li>\r\n<li>Made in the USA</li>\r\n</ul>'),(359480,85,0,173469,'bench rests, shooting rests, bench bags shooting bags'),(359599,75,0,173529,'<p>AR-15/M16 - BCG MPI -NITRIDE - .223/5.56/300AAC Complete Bolt Carrier Group</p>\r\n<p>This bolt carrier group offer smooth, reliable cycling as well as excellent quality and unsurpassed value.  These carriers are fully assembled, ready to go.  Drop-in, check headspace, and you are ready to shoot.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>New AR15 Bolt Carrier Group</li>\r\n<li>Fully Assembled Bolt &amp; Carrier Assembly</li>\r\n<li>Caliber:  .223/5.56 &amp; 300AAC</li>\r\n<li>Carrier Material:  8620 Nitride Treated</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Material:  9310 Nitride Treated</li>\r\n<li>MPI (Magnetic Particle Inspected) Bolt</li>\r\n<li>Phosphate Extractor</li>\r\n<li>Properly Staked Carrier Key</li>\r\n<li>M16 (Full) Carrier has Forward Assist Serrations</li>\r\n<li>Firing pin</li>\r\n<li>Retaining pin </li>\r\n<li>Cam pin</li>\r\n<li>All Parts Made in the USA</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>*Will also work for 300 AAC/Blackout Builds!</strong><br /> <br /> </p>'),(359602,75,1,173529,'<p>AR-15/M16 - BCG MPI -NITRIDE - .223/5.56/300AAC Complete Bolt Carrier Group</p>\r\n<p>This bolt carrier group offer smooth, reliable cycling as well as excellent quality and unsurpassed value.  These carriers are fully assembled, ready to go.  Drop-in, check headspace, and you are ready to shoot.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>New AR15 Bolt Carrier Group</li>\r\n<li>Fully Assembled Bolt &amp; Carrier Assembly</li>\r\n<li>Caliber:  .223/5.56 &amp; 300AAC</li>\r\n<li>Carrier Material:  8620 Nitride Treated</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Material:  9310 Nitride Treated</li>\r\n<li>MPI (Magnetic Particle Inspected) Bolt</li>\r\n<li>Phosphate Extractor</li>\r\n<li>Properly Staked Carrier Key</li>\r\n<li>M16 (Full) Carrier has Forward Assist Serrations</li>\r\n<li>Firing pin</li>\r\n<li>Retaining pin </li>\r\n<li>Cam pin</li>\r\n<li>All Parts Made in the USA</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>*Will also work for 300 AAC/Blackout Builds!</strong><br /> </p>'),(359600,76,0,173529,'<p>AR-15/M16 - BCG MPI -NITRIDE - .223/5.56/300AAC Complete Bolt Carrier Group</p>'),(359603,76,1,173529,'<p>AR-15/M16 - BCG MPI -NITRIDE - .223/5.56/300AAC Complete Bolt Carrier Group</p>'),(359601,85,0,173529,'AR-15/M16 - BCG MPI -NITRIDE - .223/5.56/300AAC Complete Bolt Carrier Group'),(359604,85,1,173529,'AR-15/M16 - BCG MPI -NITRIDE - .223/5.56/300AAC Complete Bolt Carrier Group'),(360963,75,0,173534,'<p>The Perfect Shot Shooting Rest is an adjustable ambidextrous shooting rest made from powder coated steel for premium quality without you having to pay a premium price.</p>\r\n<p>Weighing at a mere 5 pounds, this is the ultimate gun rest that is light weight, easy to assemble, and easy to use. While a rifle bipod or a shooting bag may be useful for portability, the Perfect Shot Shooting Rest gives you the stability you need to line up for that perfect shot.</p>\r\n<p>Adjust the gun rest easily from 17″ to 29″ to accommodate most gun lengths. The height adjustments will accommodate a black gun with a 30 round clip as well as an air rifle with no magazine. After making your macro adjustments lock the rifle rest in place with the seal tight EZ-Lock mechanism. Perfect your shot group using the front to back and side to side micro adjustments.</p>\r\n<p>When you’re looking for the perfect shooting accessories for hunting or for shooting range accessories, look no further than BenchmasterUSA.</p>'),(370617,75,1,173534,'<p>The Perfect Shot Shooting Rest is an adjustable ambidextrous shooting rest made from powder coated steel for premium quality without you having to pay a premium price.</p>\r\n<p>Weighing at a mere 5 pounds, this is the ultimate gun rest that is light weight, easy to assemble, and easy to use. While a rifle bipod or a shooting bag may be useful for portability, the Perfect Shot Shooting Rest gives you the stability you need to line up for that perfect shot.</p>\r\n<p>Adjust the gun rest easily from 17″ to 29″ to accommodate most gun lengths. The height adjustments will accommodate a black gun with a 30 round clip as well as an air rifle with no magazine. After making your macro adjustments lock the rifle rest in place with the seal tight EZ-Lock mechanism. Perfect your shot group using the front to back and side to side micro adjustments.</p>\r\n<p>When you’re looking for the perfect shooting accessories for hunting or for shooting range accessories, look no further than BenchmasterUSA.</p>'),(360964,76,0,173534,'<ul>\r\n<li>Front rest is a Wide U shape rubberized grip that is gentle on your front stock yet firm enough to provide a stable shooting surface.</li>\r\n<li>Ballistic Nylon stock sling to reduce recoil.</li>\r\n<li>Quick micro adjust for sighting scopes.</li>\r\n<li>Unique offset circular feet to adjust your shot left and right.</li>\r\n<li>Rubberized feet to protect your shooting table.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>'),(370618,76,1,173534,'<ul>\r\n<li>Front rest is a Wide U shape rubberized grip that is gentle on your front stock yet firm enough to provide a stable shooting surface.</li>\r\n<li>Ballistic Nylon stock sling to reduce recoil.</li>\r\n<li>Quick micro adjust for sighting scopes.</li>\r\n<li>Unique offset circular feet to adjust your shot left and right.</li>\r\n<li>Rubberized feet to protect your shooting table.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>'),(360965,85,0,173534,'bench rests, shooting rests, bench bags shooting bags'),(370619,85,1,173534,'bench rests, shooting rests, bench bags shooting bags'),(361003,75,0,173535,'<p>The Benchmaster Ground Hunting &amp; Shooting Chair is designed specifically for the outdoors person who prefers to hunt from the ground. The chairs superior design, comfort,  weight, and durability allows for quick pack-up and move out for repositioning in the field.</p>\r\n<p>With the fully adjustable gun rest this chair is made for target practice and scouting trips and with features such as 4 multi-position legs that level the seat on uneven terrain and full 360-degree silent rotation capability the seat can be used in the field for target shooting, sighting in, and hunting. It is compact and portable,  weighing only 13.5 lbs. with convenient carry straps.</p>\r\n<p>The chair is engineered for all-weather use. The seat and backrest are made of high-quality Nylon webbing and the powder-coated steel frame prevents rust. Backed by a Benchmaster 3-year warranty you know you are getting a quality chair. Strong enough to support the larger person but light enough for a small person to carry.</p>\r\n<p>If you are a hunter always on the move than this lightweight chair was made for you. Made with top quality materials, fully adjustable with a 360 degree view your shot accuracy will be unsurpassed. “A hunting chair without a gun rest is just a chair…”</p>'),(370620,75,1,173535,'<p>The Benchmaster Ground Hunting &amp; Shooting Chair is designed specifically for the outdoors person who prefers to hunt from the ground. The chairs superior design, comfort,  weight, and durability allows for quick pack-up and move out for repositioning in the field.</p>\r\n<p>With the fully adjustable gun rest this chair is made for target practice and scouting trips and with features such as 4 multi-position legs that level the seat on uneven terrain and full 360-degree silent rotation capability the seat can be used in the field for target shooting, sighting in, and hunting. It is compact and portable,  weighing only 13.5 lbs. with convenient carry straps.</p>\r\n<p>The chair is engineered for all-weather use. The seat and backrest are made of high-quality Nylon webbing and the powder-coated steel frame prevents rust. Backed by a Benchmaster 3-year warranty you know you are getting a quality chair. Strong enough to support the larger person but light enough for a small person to carry.</p>\r\n<p>If you are a hunter always on the move than this lightweight chair was made for you. Made with top quality materials, fully adjustable with a 360 degree view your shot accuracy will be unsurpassed. “A hunting chair without a gun rest is just a chair…”</p>'),(361004,76,0,173535,'<ul>\r\n<li>Silent turning system for 360 degrees of movement</li>\r\n<li>Lightweight and easy to carry – only 13.5 pounds</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable 4 legs for help with uneven terrain and different blind heights</li>\r\n<li>Padded seat and backrest for extra comfort</li>\r\n<li>Folds for easy transport</li>\r\n<li>Rubberized gun grip to be gentle but firm on the front stock</li>\r\n<li>Made from powder-coated steel for unsurpassed quality</li>\r\n<li>Three (3) Year Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>'),(370621,76,1,173535,'<ul>\r\n<li>Silent turning system for 360 degrees of movement</li>\r\n<li>Lightweight and easy to carry – only 13.5 pounds</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable 4 legs for help with uneven terrain and different blind heights</li>\r\n<li>Padded seat and backrest for extra comfort</li>\r\n<li>Folds for easy transport</li>\r\n<li>Rubberized gun grip to be gentle but firm on the front stock</li>\r\n<li>Made from powder-coated steel for unsurpassed quality</li>\r\n<li>Three (3) Year Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>'),(361005,85,0,173535,'shooting chair, ground blind chair'),(370622,85,1,173535,'shooting chair, ground blind chair'),(361049,75,0,173536,'<p>BenchMaster, an industry leader in shooting tables and accessories, introduces the new Sniper Seat 360: the ultimate shooting solution. Not only can the seat be used for target practice and scouting, but with features such as multi-position legs that level the seat on uneven terrain and full 360-degree rotation capability, this seat can be used in the field for extreme target shooting and hunting.</p>\r\n<p>The Sniper Seat 360 looks like a typical four-legged chair. But it’s so much more than that. It has a durable foam back, 16- by 11-inch seat and arm rests for extreme comfort in long-term sitting. The back of the seat adjusts up to a 50-degree recline, for even more comfort and position variety. It has four multi-position legs, with large, solid foot plates, that can be adjusted separately for sitting on unlevel ground, or removed all together. And to top off all the comfort features, the seat rotates a full 360 degrees, quietly, with or without the legs, for full range of shooting. So wherever the location you plan on shooting, the Sniper Seat 360 will ensure comfort and stability, and a full 360-degree shooting range.</p>\r\n<p>When shooting from a seated position, a gun rest is a must. The Sniper Seat 360 offers an arm extension for a gun rest or optional camera or spotting scope mount. Whether you’re target shooting, scouting or hunting, this seat will accommodate each activity with minimal add-ons. And for situations where the arms might get in the way, such as when bowhunting, the Sniper Seat 360 has you covered – the arms are removable.</p>\r\n<p>The seating is made of high-quality cordura webbing for all-weather use, and the powder-coated steel frame prevents rust. So even in harsh weather conditions, the Sniper Seat can be utilized. Experience the ultimate shooting solution, and use a Sniper Seat 360 on your next outdoor shooting adventure.</p>'),(361050,76,0,173536,'<ul>\r\n<li>Durable foam back, seat, and arm rests for comfort</li>\r\n<li>Full 360 degree rotation: both with and without the legs attached</li>\r\n<li>Power-coated, lightweight steel that avoids rust</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable back and seat for 50 degree recline</li>\r\n<li>Removable arms for bow hunting</li>\r\n<li>Multi-position legs to level the chair on uneven terrain</li>\r\n<li>High-quality, cordura webbing for all weather use</li>\r\n<li>Arm extension for gun rest and optional camera mount</li>\r\n<li>Super quiet rotation</li>\r\n<li>Large, solid foot plates for stability</li>\r\n<li>Five year warranty</li>\r\n</ul>'),(361051,85,0,173536,'shooting chair, ground blind chair'),(361111,75,0,173537,'<p>Every professional shooter knows you’re unprepared if you don’t have your proper eyes and ears. At Pro Ears we pride ourselves in helping you prepare for the range with only the best quality protectors. The all-new 3-in-1 interchangeable shooting glasses are perfect for when you need to stay prepared in any environment.</p>\r\n<p>Light-weight, comfortable and, better yet, slip resistant, the Pro Ears shooting glasses conform to every nose shape and can be adjusted to fit every head size.</p>\r\n<p>The Pro Ears safety glasses come with 3 easy to change lenses, ideal for sunny days to dim lit rooms. The wide wraparound UV lenses ensure that your peripheral vision is safe from harm while still being able to see all of your surroundings.</p>\r\n<p>Each set of Pro Ears Shooting Glasses comes with a zipper hard case and a microfiber cleaning cloth, making maintenance and storage a breeze.</p>\r\n<p>Whether you are shooting on the range or working with power tools, the Pro Ears safety glasses are what you need to protect your eyes.</p>'),(361475,75,1,173537,'<p>Every professional shooter knows you’re unprepared if you don’t have your proper eyes and ears. At Pro Ears we pride ourselves in helping you prepare for the range with only the best quality protectors. The all-new 3-in-1 interchangeable shooting glasses are perfect for when you need to stay prepared in any environment.</p>\r\n<p>Light-weight, comfortable and, better yet, slip resistant, the Pro Ears shooting glasses conform to every nose shape and can be adjusted to fit every head size.</p>\r\n<p>The Pro Ears safety glasses come with 3 easy to change lenses, ideal for sunny days to dim lit rooms. The wide wraparound UV lenses ensure that your peripheral vision is safe from harm while still being able to see all of your surroundings.</p>\r\n<p>Each set of Pro Ears Shooting Glasses comes with a zipper hard case and a microfiber cleaning cloth, making maintenance and storage a breeze.</p>\r\n<p>Whether you are shooting on the range or working with power tools, the Pro Ears safety glasses are what you need to protect your eyes.</p>'),(361112,76,0,173537,'<ul>\r\n<li>3-in-1 shooting glasses with easy to change lenses – perfect for all environments.</li>\r\n<li>Scratch and impact resistant polycarbonate lens with anti-fog technology.</li>\r\n<li>Wraparound lens style offers maximum protection and clear peripheral vision.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable temple-length to fit all head sizes.</li>\r\n<li>Soft adjustable nose piece suitable for all nose shapes.</li>\r\n<li>Maximum UV protection available on all 3 lenses.</li>\r\n<li>Comes with Zipper hard case to protect your lenses.</li>\r\n</ul>'),(361476,76,1,173537,'<ul>\r\n<li>3-in-1 shooting glasses with easy to change lenses – perfect for all environments.</li>\r\n<li>Scratch and impact resistant polycarbonate lens with anti-fog technology.</li>\r\n<li>Wraparound lens style offers maximum protection and clear peripheral vision.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable temple-length to fit all head sizes.</li>\r\n<li>Soft adjustable nose piece suitable for all nose shapes.</li>\r\n<li>Maximum UV protection available on all 3 lenses.</li>\r\n<li>Comes with Zipper hard case to protect your lenses.</li>\r\n</ul>'),(361113,85,0,173537,'eye protection, shooting glasses, shooting protection, eye safety'),(361477,85,1,173537,'eye protection, shooting glasses, shooting protection, eye safety'),(361180,75,0,173538,'<p><span>The Pro Ears Silver 22</span><span> have a slimmer design with a padded base; if you are a rifle or shotgun shooter their padded design will rest on your rifle stock and not the shell of the ear cup where scratching can occur. The Silver 22 has the same technologies as the top-of-the-line Pro Ears models with </span><span class=\"st\">DLSC™</span><span> military-grade  circuit boards, 8-bit Micro-Processor and a Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) of 22dB. The most significant change is built around comfort and quality. The Pro Ears Silver 22 amplifies sound 5x and protects your hearing to a safe 22dB, super sensitive stereo microphones are strategically located for incredible 360-degree situation awareness.  Requires 2 AAA Batteries, not included.</span></p>'),(361447,75,1,173538,'<p><span>The Pro Ears Silver 22</span><span> have a slimmer design with a padded base; if you are a rifle or shotgun shooter their padded design will rest on your rifle stock and not the shell of the ear cup where scratching can occur. The Silver 22 has the same technologies as the top-of-the-line Pro Ears models with </span><span class=\"st\">DLSC™</span><span> military-grade  circuit boards, 8-bit Micro-Processor and a Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) of 22dB. The most significant change is built around comfort and quality. The Pro Ears Silver 22 amplifies sound 5x and protects your hearing to a safe 22dB, super sensitive stereo microphones are strategically located for incredible 360-degree situation awareness.  Requires 2 AAA Batteries, not included.</span></p>'),(361181,76,0,173538,'<ul>\r\n<li>Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) 22dB</li>\r\n<li>Attack (Response) Time 1.5ms</li>\r\n<li>Weighs only 12oz</li>\r\n<li>3 Year Warranty</li>\r\n<li><span class=\"st\">Dynamic Level Sound Compression (DLSC™) Technology</span></li>\r\n<li>Automatic and Programmable Gain Control</li>\r\n<li>Premium Quality Gold Connectors</li>\r\n<li>Dynamic Sound Range</li>\r\n<li>Proprietary Gel Ear Seals</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable, Padded Headband</li>\r\n<li>Convenient Folding Design for Easy Storage</li>\r\n</ul>'),(361448,76,1,173538,'<ul>\r\n<li>Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) 22dB</li>\r\n<li>Attack (Response) Time 1.5ms</li>\r\n<li>Weighs only 12oz</li>\r\n<li>3 Year Warranty</li>\r\n<li><span class=\"st\">Dynamic Level Sound Compression (DLSC™) Technology</span></li>\r\n<li>Automatic and Programmable Gain Control</li>\r\n<li>Premium Quality Gold Connectors</li>\r\n<li>Dynamic Sound Range</li>\r\n<li>Proprietary Gel Ear Seals</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable, Padded Headband</li>\r\n<li>Convenient Folding Design for Easy Storage</li>\r\n</ul>'),(361182,85,0,173538,'hearing protection, ear muffs, pro ears, gel ear seals, ear protection'),(361449,85,1,173538,'hearing protection, ear muffs, pro ears, gel ear seals, ear protection'),(361359,75,0,173539,'<p><span>The Pro Ears Ultra Gel series are our answer to uncomfortable hearing protection. Designed with our customized polyurethane Aviator Gel Ear seals, the Ultra Gel series provides the ultimate comfort, letting you wear your safety ear muffs all day. The Ultra Gel 25 is our mid range of the ultra gel series and is perfect for protecting your ears against moderate to loud noise environments. Designed for a higher noise reduction rating while still remaining slim and compact, the Ultra Gel 25 is constructed from the finest materials, the the contoured ear cups allows for easy movement and can fit smaller heads.</span></p>'),(361433,75,1,173539,'<p><span>The Pro Ears Ultra Gel series are our answer to uncomfortable hearing protection. Designed with our customized polyurethane Aviator Gel Ear seals, the Ultra Gel series provides the ultimate comfort, letting you wear your safety ear muffs all day. The Ultra Gel 25 is our mid range of the ultra gel series and is perfect for protecting your ears against moderate to loud noise environments. Designed for a higher noise reduction rating while still remaining slim and compact, the Ultra Gel 25 is constructed from the finest materials, the the contoured ear cups allows for easy movement and can fit smaller heads.</span></p>'),(361360,76,0,173539,'<ul>\r\n<li>Weighs 8.8 oz</li>\r\n<li>The Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) is 25</li>\r\n<li>Comes with Aviator Gel Ear Seals for ultra-comfort.</li>\r\n<li><span>1</span> Year Warranty</li>\r\n<li><span>Made in the USA</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(361434,76,1,173539,'<ul>\r\n<li>Weighs 8.8 oz</li>\r\n<li>The Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) is 25</li>\r\n<li>Comes with Aviator Gel Ear Seals for ultra-comfort.</li>\r\n<li><span>1</span> Year Warranty</li>\r\n<li><span>Made in the USA</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(361361,85,0,173539,'hearing protection, ear muffs, pro ears, gel ear seals, ear protection'),(361435,85,1,173539,'hearing protection, ear muffs, pro ears, gel ear seals, ear protection'),(361413,75,0,173540,'<p><span>The Pro Ears Ultra Gel series are our answer to uncomfortable hearing protection. Designed with our customized polyurethane Aviator Gel Ear seals, the Ultra Gel series provides the ultimate comfort, letting you wear your safety ear muffs all day. The Ultra Gel 29 is our largest of the ultra gel series and is perfect for protecting your ears against loud to extremely loud noise environments. Designed for a higher noise reduction rating while still being light in weight, the Ultra Gel 29 is constructed from the finest materials, the full size ear cups give you all the protection your hearing deserves.</span></p>'),(361819,75,1,173540,'<p><span>The Pro Ears Ultra Gel series are our answer to uncomfortable hearing protection. Designed with our customized polyurethane Aviator Gel Ear seals, the Ultra Gel series provides the ultimate comfort, letting you wear your safety ear muffs all day. The Ultra Gel 29 is our largest of the ultra gel series and is perfect for protecting your ears against loud to extremely loud noise environments. Designed for a higher noise reduction rating while still being light in weight, the Ultra Gel 29 is constructed from the finest materials, the full size ear cups give you all the protection your hearing deserves.</span></p>'),(361414,76,0,173540,'<ul>\r\n<li>Weighs 11.2 oz</li>\r\n<li>The Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) is 29</li>\r\n<li>Comes with Aviator Gel Ear Seals for ultra-comfort.</li>\r\n<li><span>1</span> Year Warranty</li>\r\n<li><span>Made in the USA</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(361820,76,1,173540,'<ul>\r\n<li>Weighs 11.2 oz</li>\r\n<li>The Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) is 29</li>\r\n<li>Comes with Aviator Gel Ear Seals for ultra-comfort.</li>\r\n<li><span>1</span> Year Warranty</li>\r\n<li><span>Made in the USA</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(361415,85,0,173540,'hearing protection, ear muffs, pro ears, gel ear seals, ear protection'),(361821,85,1,173540,'hearing protection, ear muffs, pro ears, gel ear seals, ear protection'),(361540,75,0,173541,'<p><span>The Stealth Elite is a unique pair of electronic hearing protection earbuds with attachable Bluetooth lanyard.</span><span> Each set of Stealth Elites come with two earbuds independently powered by your standard #10 battery, a rechargeable lanyard with </span><span>Bluetooth capabilities</span><span> that can connect to your earbuds to play music or talk on the phone, several sizes of foam ear tips to fit with a </span><span>Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) of 28</span><span>, and several sizes of silicone tips designed for staying in your ear during physical activities. </span></p>'),(361796,75,1,173541,'<p><span>The Stealth Elite is a unique pair of electronic hearing protection earbuds with attachable Bluetooth lanyard.</span><span> Each set of Stealth Elites come with two earbuds independently powered by your standard #10 battery, a rechargeable lanyard with </span><span>Bluetooth capabilities</span><span> that can connect to your earbuds to play music or talk on the phone, several sizes of foam ear tips to fit with a </span><span>Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) of 28</span><span>, and several sizes of silicone tips designed for staying in your ear during physical activities. </span></p>'),(361541,76,0,173541,'<div class=\"col-sm-6 spec-height\"><span>TYPE:</span> Compact size ear buds<br /><span>UNIT BATTERY:</span> #10<br /><span>WORKING TIME:</span> 80+ Hours<br /><span>COMPRESSION:</span> Hi/Low DLSC Compression<br /><span>NOISE REDUCTION RATING (NRR):</span> 28<br /><span>BLUETOOTH CABLE:</span> USB rechargeable<br /><span>WORKING TIME:</span> 5 hours per charge<br /><span>CHARGING TIME:</span> 2 hours<br /><span>BLUETOOTH:</span> CSR Bluetooth 4.1 – Range 10 m</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 spec-height\"><span>COAXIAL:</span> MMCX Connector<br /><span>CIRCUITS:</span> Hybrid analog/digital circuits<br /><span>WEIGHT:</span> 28 grams<br /><span>LANYARD:</span> Durable, No-tangle Cloth lanyard<br /><span>WARRANTY:</span> 1-Year Warranty<br /><span>AMPLIFICATION:</span> 5X amplification level<br /><span>ISOLATION:</span> Noise isolation microphones<br /><span>WATERPROOF:</span> IPX6 Rating</div>'),(361797,76,1,173541,'<div class=\"col-sm-6 spec-height\"><span>TYPE:</span> Compact size ear buds<br /><span>UNIT BATTERY:</span> #10<br /><span>WORKING TIME:</span> 80+ Hours<br /><span>COMPRESSION:</span> Hi/Low DLSC Compression<br /><span>NOISE REDUCTION RATING (NRR):</span> 28<br /><span>BLUETOOTH CABLE:</span> USB rechargeable<br /><span>WORKING TIME:</span> 5 hours per charge<br /><span>CHARGING TIME:</span> 2 hours<br /><span>BLUETOOTH:</span> CSR Bluetooth 4.1 – Range 10 m</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 spec-height\"><span>COAXIAL:</span> MMCX Connector<br /><span>CIRCUITS:</span> Hybrid analog/digital circuits<br /><span>WEIGHT:</span> 28 grams<br /><span>LANYARD:</span> Durable, No-tangle Cloth lanyard<br /><span>WARRANTY:</span> 1-Year Warranty<br /><span>AMPLIFICATION:</span> 5X amplification level<br /><span>ISOLATION:</span> Noise isolation microphones<br /><span>WATERPROOF:</span> IPX6 Rating</div>'),(361542,85,0,173541,'Pro Ears Stealth Bluetooth Elite'),(361798,85,1,173541,'Pro Ears Stealth Bluetooth Elite'),(361702,75,0,173542,'<p><span>The Pro Ears Stealth 28</span><span> weighs in at only 20 grams allowing for extended all-weather use, and the battery lasts 18 hours with a one-hour charging time. The great features of the stealth are the 5 times hearing amplification, sound compression technology, noise reducing wind cover over the microphone, and the Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) 28dB rated hearing protection. Pro Ears includes 3 incredibly soft ear bud sizes to fit any ear canal. What does this all mean for consumers? Pro Ears has created ultra-light hearing protection that is technologically advanced for all users, environments, and affordable. Pro Ears Stealth 28 comes with proprietary temple hugging design for a secure, comfortable fit with amplification up to 5X and sound compression. Perfect for shooters, yard work, concerts and everyday wear when ear protection is needed.</span></p>'),(361709,75,1,173542,'<p><span>The Pro Ears Stealth 28</span><span> weighs in at only 20 grams allowing for extended all-weather use, and the battery lasts 18 hours with a one-hour charging time. The great features of the stealth are the 5 times hearing amplification, sound compression technology, noise reducing wind cover over the microphone, and the Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) 28dB rated hearing protection. Pro Ears includes 3 incredibly soft ear bud sizes to fit any ear canal. What does this all mean for consumers? Pro Ears has created ultra-light hearing protection that is technologically advanced for all users, environments, and affordable. Pro Ears Stealth 28 comes with proprietary temple hugging design for a secure, comfortable fit with amplification up to 5X and sound compression. Perfect for shooters, yard work, concerts and everyday wear when ear protection is needed.</span></p>'),(361703,76,0,173542,'<ul>\r\n<li>Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) 28dB</li>\r\n<li>Attack (Response) Time 2.0ms</li>\r\n<li>DLSC Technology</li>\r\n<li>Rapid USB Rechargeable Port</li>\r\n<li>5X Hearing Amplification</li>\r\n<li>Noise Reducing Wind Cover</li>\r\n<li>Incredibly Soft Ear Buds</li>\r\n<li>Ultra-Lightweight for All Day Comfort</li>\r\n<li>1 Year Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>'),(361710,76,1,173542,'<ul>\r\n<li>Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) 28dB</li>\r\n<li>Attack (Response) Time 2.0ms</li>\r\n<li>DLSC Technology</li>\r\n<li>Rapid USB Rechargeable Port</li>\r\n<li>5X Hearing Amplification</li>\r\n<li>Noise Reducing Wind Cover</li>\r\n<li>Incredibly Soft Ear Buds</li>\r\n<li>Ultra-Lightweight for All Day Comfort</li>\r\n<li>1 Year Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>'),(361704,85,0,173542,'Hearing Protection and amplification, bluetooth device. hearing piece'),(361711,85,1,173542,'Hearing Protection and amplification, bluetooth device. hearing piece'),(370963,75,0,173735,'<p>The Alligator Sniper Coat is designed for use in wooded environments when concealment is critical to success. This design comes with 3D disguise elements installed and extra length for added camouflage. <br /><br />The coat is breathable and well ventilated with mesh and extended size. This is the modern version of the ghillie suit minus the weight and bulk.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Increase the number of integrated 3D camo leaves.</li>\r\n<li>Extended fit, fully covers back and large chest area.</li>\r\n<li>Mesh hood — excellent ventilation.</li>\r\n<li>Hood volume and deep are adjustable. You can wear Alligator with any headwear or helmet.</li>\r\n<li>Wide side overview.</li>\r\n<li>Advanced adjustment system. The sniper platform can be used for 44-46 to 56-58 sizes.</li>\r\n<li>Designed for hot climate conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Short sleeves, convenient to work with gear.</li>\r\n<li>Can be used with a backpack.</li>\r\n<li>Ultra-light thin material (polyester/cotton).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Shipping<br /></strong>All orders placed INSIDE the United States ship next business day with UPS, tracking number included<strong><br /><br /></strong><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-sanitized-data-mce-fragment=\"1\">All orders placed OUTSIDE the United States ship next business day with DHL, tracking number included, 3-7 day delivery.</span></p>'),(370966,75,1,173735,'<p>The Alligator Sniper Coat is designed for use in wooded environments when concealment is critical to success. This design comes with 3D disguise elements installed and extra length for added camouflage. <br /><br />The coat is breathable and well ventilated with mesh and extended size. This is the modern version of the ghillie suit minus the weight and bulk.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Increase the number of integrated 3D camo leaves.</li>\r\n<li>Extended fit, fully covers back and large chest area.</li>\r\n<li>Mesh hood — excellent ventilation.</li>\r\n<li>Hood volume and deep are adjustable. You can wear Alligator with any headwear or helmet.</li>\r\n<li>Wide side overview.</li>\r\n<li>Advanced adjustment system. The sniper platform can be used for 44-46 to 56-58 sizes.</li>\r\n<li>Designed for hot climate conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Short sleeves, convenient to work with gear.</li>\r\n<li>Can be used with a backpack.</li>\r\n<li>Ultra-light thin material (polyester/cotton).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Shipping<br /></strong>All orders placed INSIDE the United States ship next available business day with UPS, tracking number included<strong><br /><br /></strong><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-sanitized-data-mce-fragment=\"1\">All orders placed OUTSIDE the United States ship next available business day with DHL, tracking number included 7-10 day delivery.<br /><br /><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-sanitized-data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><em data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-sanitized-data-mce-fragment=\"1\">*Currently all orders are shipping from our factory location in Europe with a lead time of two weeks due to high demand. The typical time from point of purchase to delivery is about 21 days.</em></strong></span></p>'),(370964,76,0,173735,'<p>The Alligator Sniper Coat is designed for use in wooded environments when concealment is critical to success. This design comes with 3D disguise elements installed and extra length for added camouflage. </p>'),(373422,76,1,173735,'<p>The Alligator Sniper Coat is designed for use in wooded environments when concealment is critical to success. This design comes with 3D disguise elements installed and extra length for added camouflage. </p>'),(370965,85,0,173735,'Alligator Sniper Coat (Ghillie Suit) - 3D MULTICAM'),(373423,85,1,173735,'Alligator Sniper Coat (Ghillie Suit) - 3D MULTICAM'),(370969,75,0,173736,'<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>In Greek Mythology, Styx is the deity and the river that forms the boundary between Earth and Underworld. Its meaning was so dark that late the word “Stygian” referred to anything dark, dismal, and murky.</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>This blade is the ultimate mix between survival and tactical, a knife designed to endure hell and survive.  We chose stainless steel combined with a black powder coating to handle any situation. The two different grind zones allow you to endure the hardest tasks or the most precise task with no effort at all.</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Stygian performance is optimal in any kind of situation either if you are on the fields or you are looking for a big scary tactical knife, Stygian is a safe bet.</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>==FEATURES===</span><span><br /></span><span><br /></span><span>Best Use:</span><span> Survival</span><span><br /></span><span>Product Type:</span><span> Fixed Blade</span><span><br /></span><span>Blade Material:</span><span> Böhler N690co Cryogenic Stainless Steel</span><span><br /></span><span>Blade Hardness:</span><span> 59-61 HRc</span><span><br /></span><span>Blade Length:</span><span> 6.97” (177 mm)</span><span><br /></span><span>Blade Thickness:</span><span> 0.19” (5 mm)</span><span><br /></span><span>Blade Width:</span><span> 1.65” (42 mm)</span><span><br /></span><span>Blade Grind:</span><span> Double grind (Hollow + Taper)</span><span><br /></span><span>Blade Shape:</span><span> Drop point</span><span><br /></span><span>Blade Finish:</span><span> Black powder coating</span><span><br /></span><span>Cutting Edge:</span><span> 6.69” (170 mm)</span><span><br /></span><span>Edge Type:</span><span> Straight</span><span><br /></span><span>Tang Type:</span><span> Full tang</span><span><br /></span><span>Handle Material:</span><span> Customized CNC G10 scales</span><span><br /></span><span>Handle Color:</span><span> Black</span><span><br /></span><span>Handle Length:</span><span> 5.24” (133 mm)</span><span><br /></span><span>Screws Material:</span><span> Security Torx Stainless Steel with Dracomet coating</span><span><br /></span><span>Lanyard Hole:</span><span> Yes</span><span><br /></span><span>Overall Length:</span><span> 12.21” (310 mm)</span><span><br /></span><span>Sheath Included:</span><span> Yes</span><span><br /></span><span>Sheath Material:</span><span> Kydex® with fasten screw</span><span><br /></span><span>Sheath Color:</span><span> Black</span><span><br /></span><span>Sheath Attachment Type:</span><span> Nylon belt loop</span><span><br /></span><span>Weight:</span><span> 23.11 Oz (655 gr)</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Shipping</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>DHL Air Express 3-5 days delivery time.</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<div><span><br /></span></div>'),(370972,75,1,173736,'<p>In Greek Mythology, Styx is the deity and the river that forms the boundary between Earth and Underworld. Its meaning was so dark that late the word “Stygian” referred to anything dark, dismal, and murky.</p>\r\n<p>This blade is the ultimate mix between survival and tactical, a knife designed to endure hell and survive.  We chose stainless steel combined with a black powder coating to handle any situation. The two different grind zones allow you to endure the hardest tasks or the most precise task with no effort at all.</p>\r\n<p>Stygian performance is optimal in any kind of situation either if you are on the fields or you are looking for a big scary tactical knife, Stygian is a safe bet.</p>\r\n<p><b>==FEATURES===</b><br /><br /><strong>Best Use:</strong> Survival<br /><strong>Product Type:</strong> Fixed Blade<br /><strong>Blade Material:</strong> Böhler N690co Cryogenic Stainless Steel<br /><strong>Blade Hardness:</strong> 59-61 HRc<br /><strong>Blade Length:</strong> 6.97” (177 mm)<br /><strong>Blade Thickness:</strong> 0.19” (5 mm)<br /><strong>Blade Width:</strong> 1.65” (42 mm)<br /><strong>Blade Grind:</strong> Double grind (Hollow + Taper)<br /><strong>Blade Shape:</strong> Drop point<br /><strong>Blade Finish:</strong> Black powder coating<br /><strong>Cutting Edge:</strong> 6.69” (170 mm)<br /><strong>Edge Type:</strong> Straight<br /><strong>Tang Type:</strong> Full tang<br /><strong>Handle Material:</strong> Customized CNC G10 scales<br /><strong>Handle Color:</strong> Black<br /><strong>Handle Length:</strong> 5.24” (133 mm)<br /><strong>Screws Material:</strong> Security Torx Stainless Steel with Dracomet coating<br /><strong>Lanyard Hole:</strong> Yes<br /><strong>Overall Length:</strong> 12.21” (310 mm)<br /><strong>Sheath Included:</strong> Yes<br /><strong>Sheath Material:</strong> Kydex® with fasten screw<br /><strong>Sheath Color:</strong> Black<br /><strong>Sheath Attachment Type:</strong> Nylon belt loop<br /><strong>Weight:</strong> 23.11 Oz (655 gr)</p>\r\n<p><strong>Shipping</strong></p>\r\n<p>International shipping with tracking number and notifications. DHL Air Express 3-5 days delivery time.</p>'),(370970,76,0,173736,'<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-2b856647-7fff-c5f7-8e95-13697b1ce0b1\"><span>In Greek Mythology, Styx is the deity and the river that forms the boundary between Earth and Underworld. Its meaning was so dark that late the word “Stygian” referred to anything dark, dismal, and murky.</span></span> </p>'),(669901,76,1,173736,'<p>In Greek Mythology, Styx is the deity and the river that forms the boundary between Earth and Underworld. Its meaning was so dark that late the word “Stygian” referred to anything dark, dismal, and murky.</p>'),(370971,85,0,173736,'Alligator Sniper Coat (Ghillie Suit) - 3D MULTICAM'),(669902,85,1,173736,'Alligator Sniper Coat (Ghillie Suit) - 3D MULTICAM'),(370999,75,0,173741,'<p>Thompson Center Encore &amp; Encore Pro Hunter Rifle Barrel 24\" .308 Win - Blued</p>\r\n<p><span>This Encore rifle barrel has a blued finish and adjustable sights. The barrel can be changed in seconds by removing the forend and tapping out the barrel/frame hinge pin. Encore and Encore Pro Hunter interchangeable barrels will fit any Encore frame.</span></p>\r\n<p>Fits: Encore, Encore Pro Hunter, Encore Endeavor</p>\r\n<div class=\"column m-colwidth-4 data-heading\">MFG PRODUCT #: 7241750</div>\r\n<div class=\"column m-colwidth-8 gutter-top-0\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"column m-colwidth-8 gutter-top-0\">\r\n<div class=\"column m-colwidth-4 data-heading\">UPC: 090161015500</div>\r\n<div class=\"column m-colwidth-4 data-heading\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"column m-colwidth-4 data-heading\">MSRP: $352.99</di