Win - Blued'),(371009,75,0,173742,'<h4>Walker\'s, Passive, Combo Kit, Folding Earmuff, Black, 1 Pair of Foam Ear Plugs, 1 Pair of Sport Glasses Included</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Padded Headband</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Compact Folding Design</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Soft PVC Ear Pads</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Protective Sport Glasses</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span>The Walker\'s line of products is widely considered the industry standard for shooting protection and safety. Walker\'s continues to raise the bar with enhanced safety products that offer unparalleled comfort and performance.</span></p>\r\n</div>'),(373411,75,1,173742,'<h4>Walker\'s, Passive, Combo Kit, Folding Earmuff, Black, 1 Pair of Foam Ear Plugs, 1 Pair of Sport Glasses Included</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Padded Headband</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Compact Folding Design</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Soft PVC Ear Pads</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Protective Sport Glasses</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span>The Walker\'s line of products is widely considered the industry standard for shooting protection and safety. Walker\'s continues to raise the bar with enhanced safety products that offer unparalleled comfort and performance.</span></p>\r\n</div>'),(371010,85,0,173742,'Walker\'s '),(373412,85,1,173742,'Walker\'s '),(371011,75,0,173743,'<h4>Walker\'s, Passive Combo Kit, Purple</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\">\r\n<li class=\"hazard-warning\"><a href=\"https://rsrgroup.com/product/WALGWP-YWFM2GFP-PUR#hazard-warning\" data-toggle=\"collapse\"><span class=\"fa fa-exclamation-triangle\"></span>WARNING</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Low profile contoured cup</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Padded headband</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Soft PVC ear pads</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span>The Walker\'s line of products is widely considered the industry standard for shooting protection and safety. Walker\'s continues to raise the bar with enhanced safety products that offer unparalleled comfort and performance.</span></p>\r\n</div>'),(373409,75,1,173743,'<h4>Walker\'s, Passive Combo Kit, Purple</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\">\r\n<li class=\"hazard-warning\"><a href=\"https://rsrgroup.com/product/WALGWP-YWFM2GFP-PUR#hazard-warning\" data-toggle=\"collapse\"><span class=\"fa fa-exclamation-triangle\"></span>WARNING</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Low profile contoured cup</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Padded headband</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Soft PVC ear pads</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span>The Walker\'s line of products is widely considered the industry standard for shooting protection and safety. Walker\'s continues to raise the bar with enhanced safety products that offer unparalleled comfort and performance.</span></p>\r\n</div>'),(371012,85,0,173743,'Female Walker\'s'),(373410,85,1,173743,'Female Walker\'s'),(371031,75,0,173747,'<p>The R10 is one of the classic Ravin models and is great for both beginners and experienced hunters and shooters. Measuring 33 inches in length and tipping the scales at 6.8 pounds, the R10 produces speeds of over 400 FPS. Made for running-and-gunning or hanging out in a tree stand or ground blind, the R10 is a slim 6 inches axle-axle when cocked. Available in Predator Camo, exclusive to Ravin Crossbows. Included: HeliCoil Technology, Fully Assembled/Pre-Tuned, 6-Ravin .003 Arrows &amp; Field Tips (400 Grain Total), 1-Removable Draw Handle, 1-Quiver/Mounting Bracket, 100 Yard Illuminated Scope, Anti-Dry Fire/Auto Safety, Built-in Sling Mounts</p>'),(371051,75,1,173747,'<p>The R10 is one of the classic Ravin models and is great for both beginners and experienced hunters and shooters. Measuring 33 inches in length and tipping the scales at 6.8 pounds, the R10 produces speeds of over 400 FPS. Made for running-and-gunning or hanging out in a tree stand or ground blind, the R10 is a slim 6 inches axle-axle when cocked. Available in Predator Camo, exclusive to Ravin Crossbows. Included: HeliCoil Technology, Fully Assembled/Pre-Tuned, 6-Ravin .003 Arrows &amp; Field Tips (400 Grain Total), 1-Removable Draw Handle, 1-Quiver/Mounting Bracket, 100 Yard Illuminated Scope, Anti-Dry Fire/Auto Safety, Built-in Sling Mounts</p>'),(371032,76,0,173747,'<p>Ravin R10 Predator Camo Crossbow</p>\r\n<p><span>his custom R10 Package features contents that are handpicked by the team at Archery Revolution to provide you with the ultimate shooting experience. This is truly an ultimate package! Package Includes - Ravin R10 Crossbow in Predator Camo - Ravin 100 yard, Red/Green Variable Illumination Crossbow Scope - (12) .003 Ravin Arrows - (3) .003 Illuminated Ravin Arrows (Orange Lumenoks come pre-installed from the factory). - Lumenok Extinguisher / Arrow Puller (Very useful tool) - (3) Ravin Aluminum 2\" 2 Blade 100gr. Mechanical Crossbow Broad-heads - Ravin Limb Vibration Dampeners - Ravin Serving Fluid - Padded Ravin Shoulder Sling - Ravin Padded Soft Case - Cocking / Draw Handle - Ambidextrous Quiver Mount - 3 Arrow Ravin Quiver - (6) 100gr. Field Points - Owners Manual / Warranty Registration Information - Ravin Crossbows Decal Ravin R10 Crossbow Specs - Speed (400gr. Arrow): 400 feet per second - Power Stroke: 11\" - Kinetic Energy: 142 ft/lbs. - Draw Force: 12lbs. - Axle to Axle Width (cocked): 6\" - Axle to Axle Width (uncocked): 10.5\" - Total Length: 33\" - Physical Weight: 6.8lbs.</span></p>'),(371052,76,1,173747,'<p>Ravin R10 Predator Camo Crossbow</p>'),(371033,85,0,173747,'Ravin,R10,Predator,Camo,Crossbow,R014'),(371053,85,1,173747,'Ravin,R10,Predator,Camo,Crossbow,R014'),(371043,75,0,173750,'<p>The R26 is Ravin’s most compact and lightweight crossbow to date. Weighing only 6.5 pounds, the R26 has an amazing axle-to-axle width of 5.75 inches when fully drawn- making it the most compact crossbow on the market. Don’t let the size fool you- the R26 shoots an incredible 400 FPS with 142-foot pounds of kinetic energy. The Ravin R26 features an ergonomic grip, making it a more tactical option for shooters and hunters. Available in Predator Dusk Camo, exclusive to Ravin Crossbows.  Included: HeliCoil Technology, Fully Assembled/Pre-Tuned, 6-Ravin .003 Arrows &amp; Field Tips (400 Grain Total), 1-Removable Draw Handle, 1-Quiver/Mounting Bracket, 100 Yard Illuminated Scope, Anti-Dry Fire/Auto Safety, Built-in Sling Mounts</p>'),(371045,75,1,173750,'<p>The R26 is Ravin’s most compact and lightweight crossbow to date. Weighing only 6.5 pounds, the R26 has an amazing axle-to-axle width of 5.75 inches when fully drawn- making it the most compact crossbow on the market. Don’t let the size fool you- the R26 shoots an incredible 400 FPS with 142-foot pounds of kinetic energy. The Ravin R26 features an ergonomic grip, making it a more tactical option for shooters and hunters. Available in Predator Dusk Camo, exclusive to Ravin Crossbows.  Included: HeliCoil Technology, Fully Assembled/Pre-Tuned, 6-Ravin .003 Arrows &amp; Field Tips (400 Grain Total), 1-Removable Draw Handle, 1-Quiver/Mounting Bracket, 100 Yard Illuminated Scope, Anti-Dry Fire/Auto Safety, Built-in Sling Mounts</p>'),(371044,76,0,173750,'<p>Ravin R26 Predator Dusk Camo</p>'),(371046,76,1,173750,'<p>Ravin R26 Predator Dusk Camo</p>'),(371047,85,1,173750,'Ravin,R26,Predator,Dusk,Camo,Crossbow,R026'),(371048,75,0,173751,'<p>Ravin’s R29 is an unbelievable 5.5 inches shorter than the R20 and still delivers arrows at 430 FPS with impeccable downrange accuracy. The R29 features a sleek design of 6 inches axle-to-axle when cocked and weighs only 6.75 pounds. With an ergonomic front grip, the R29 is easy to maneuver when in the field or at the shooting range. Available in Predator Dusk Camo, exclusive to Ravin Crossbows.  Included: HeliCoil Technology, Fully Assembled/Pre-Tuned, 6-Ravin .003 Arrows &amp; Field Tips (400 Grain Total), 1-Removable Draw Handle, 1-Quiver/Mounting Bracket, 100 Yard Illuminated Scope, Anti-Dry Fire/Auto Safety, Built-in Sling Mounts</p>'),(669909,75,1,173751,'<p><strong>Introducing the Ravin R29 Predator Dusk Camo Crossbow: Precision and Power in One Package</strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Elevate your hunting game with the Ravin R29 Predator Dusk Camo Crossbow - a masterpiece of engineering that seamlessly blends cutting-edge technology with unparalleled performance. Designed to redefine your hunting experience, this crossbow stands as a testament to innovation and precision.</span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Unmatched Precision: </strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Ravin R29 Predator boasts an astonishingly compact and lightweight design, ensuring remarkable maneuverability without compromising accuracy. Its advanced Helicoil technology minimizes string friction, resulting in exceptional arrow speeds and pinpoint accuracy.</span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Dusk Camo Aesthetics:</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Designed with the avid hunter in mind, the Dusk Camo finish not only enhances the crossbow\'s aesthetics but also aids in stealthy camouflage, seamlessly blending with various hunting environments.</span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Impressive Power:</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Equipped with a mind-blowing 12.5-inch power stroke, the R29 Predator delivers an awe-inspiring arrow speed of up to 430 feet per second. This exceptional power ensures your shots hit the mark with remarkable force, granting you the confidence to tackle even the most challenging targets.</span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Compact Design:</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Measuring a mere 29 inches in length and a mere 6 inches axle-axle when fully drawn, this crossbow sets new standards for portability. Its compact build allows you to navigate tight spaces and confined hunting spots with ease, granting you a tactical advantage in the field.</span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Enhanced Safety: </strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Safety is paramount, and the Ravin R29 Predator prioritizes this aspect. The Versa-Draw Cocking System reduces cocking effort, minimizing the risk of accidents during setup, while the built-in anti-dry fire mechanism safeguards both the crossbow and the user.</span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Exceptional Accessories:</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Each purchase of the Ravin R29 Predator includes essential accessories such as the illuminated scope, quiver, and mounting bracket, ensuring you have everything needed for a successful hunting expedition right out of the box.</span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><strong>Why Choose the Ravin R29 Predator Dusk Camo Crossbow?</strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The R29 Predator is the epitome of modern crossbow technology, encapsulating power, accuracy, and convenience within its sleek frame. Whether you\'re an experienced hunter seeking to elevate your game or a newcomer looking for a reliable, performance-driven tool, this crossbow promises to deliver beyond your expectations.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Order Now and Unleash Your Hunting Potential!</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dominate the wild with the Ravin R29 Predator Dusk Camo Crossbow - a fusion of innovation and performance that guarantees an edge in your hunting pursuits. Don\'t miss out on the opportunity to own a crossbow that sets the standard for excellence. Place your order now and experience the future of hunting technology firsthand.</span></p>'),(371049,76,0,173751,'<p>Ravin R29 Predator Dusk Camo Crossbow</p>'),(669910,76,1,173751,'<ul>\r\n<li>Cutting Edge Precision</li>\r\n<li>Impressive Speed and Power</li>\r\n<li>Enhanced Safety Features</li>\r\n<li>Compact Design</li>\r\n<li>Dusk Camo</li>\r\n</ul>'),(371050,85,0,173751,'Ravin,R29,Predator,Dusk,Camo,Crossbow,R029'),(670435,85,1,173751,'Ravin,R29,Predator,Dusk,Camo,Crossbow,R029'),(371054,75,0,173752,'<p>The new R29X, complete with our new fully-integrated Silent Cocking System, hits a new pinnacle of speed at an incredible 450 FPS. The length remains 29 inches, and when fully drawn, the R29X is 6 inches axle-axle and weighs a light 6.75 pounds. Including an ergonomic grip, this crossbow is easy to maneuver in tight spaces and gives hunters and shooters great control without sacrificing comfort. Available in Predator Dusk Camo, exclusive to Ravin Crossbows.   Included: HeliCoil Technology, Silent Cocking System, Fully Assembled/Pre-Tuned, 6-Ravin .003 Arrows &amp; Field Tips (400 Grain Total), 1-Removable Draw Handle, 1-Quiver/Mounting Bracket, 100 Yard Illuminated Scope, Anti-Dry Fire/Auto Safety, Built-in Sling Mounts</p>'),(670436,75,1,173752,'<p>The new R29X, complete with our new fully-integrated Silent Cocking System, hits a new pinnacle of speed at an incredible 450 FPS. The length remains 29 inches, and when fully drawn, the R29X is 6 inches axle-axle and weighs a light 6.75 pounds. Including an ergonomic grip, this crossbow is easy to maneuver in tight spaces and gives hunters and shooters great control without sacrificing comfort. Available in Predator Dusk Camo, exclusive to Ravin Crossbows.   Included: HeliCoil Technology, Silent Cocking System, Fully Assembled/Pre-Tuned, 6-Ravin .003 Arrows &amp; Field Tips (400 Grain Total), 1-Removable Draw Handle, 1-Quiver/Mounting Bracket, 100 Yard Illuminated Scope, Anti-Dry Fire/Auto Safety, Built-in Sling Mounts</p>'),(371055,76,0,173752,'<p>Ravin R29X Predator Dusk Camo</p>'),(670437,76,1,173752,'<p>Ravin R29X Predator Dusk Camo</p>'),(371056,85,0,173752,'Ravin,R29X,Sniper,Package,Predator,Dusk,Camo,Crossbow,R040'),(670438,85,1,173752,'Ravin,R29X,Sniper,Package,Predator,Dusk,Camo,Crossbow,R040'),(371057,75,0,173753,'<p>The new Aluminum Broadhead, designed exclusively for Ravin Crossbows, gives hunters surgical precision with its rear-deploying blades, which open on impact and have been tested and approved for crossbows shooting up to 450 FPS. This mechanical broadhead has a massive 2-inch cut and internal spring clip, eliminating the need for lock rings and O-rings. 3 pack, Aluminum 7075-T6/Steel 12L 14 Tip, Extreme Accuracy and Penetration, Internal Spring Clip, No Locking Ring or O-ring, 450 FPS Approved, Rear-Deployed Blades, Deploys Upon Impact, 100 Grain, 2\" Cut</p>'),(670439,75,1,173753,'<p>The new Aluminum Broadhead, designed exclusively for Ravin Crossbows, gives hunters surgical precision with its rear-deploying blades, which open on impact and have been tested and approved for crossbows shooting up to 450 FPS. This mechanical broadhead has a massive 2-inch cut and internal spring clip, eliminating the need for lock rings and O-rings. 3 pack, Aluminum 7075-T6/Steel 12L 14 Tip, Extreme Accuracy and Penetration, Internal Spring Clip, No Locking Ring or O-ring, 450 FPS Approved, Rear-Deployed Blades, Deploys Upon Impact, 100 Grain, 2\" Cut</p>'),(371058,76,0,173753,'<p>The new Aluminum Broadhead, designed exclusively for Ravin Crossbows, gives hunters surgical precision with its rear-deploying blades, which open on impact and have been tested and approved for crossbows shooting up to 450 FPS</p>'),(670440,76,1,173753,'<p>The new Aluminum Broadhead, designed exclusively for Ravin Crossbows, gives hunters surgical precision with its rear-deploying blades, which open on impact and have been tested and approved for crossbows shooting up to 450 FPS</p>'),(371059,85,0,173753,'Ravin,Aluminum,Broadheads,3PK,R102'),(670441,85,1,173753,'Ravin,Aluminum,Broadheads,3PK,R102'),(371060,75,0,173754,'<p>The new Steel Broadheads, designed exclusively for Ravin Crossbows, are constructed with 416 steel for extreme accuracy, giving hunters the confidence they need in the field. The blades on this mechanical broadhead deploy upon impact with a 2-inch cutting diameter and have been tested and approved for crossbows shooting up to 450 FPS. The Steel Broadheads from Ravin have a single piece of ferrule and internal spring clip, eliminating the need for lock rings and O-rings.  3 Pack, 416 Steel, Extreme Accuracy and Penetration, Internal Spring Clip, No Locking Ring or O-ring, 450 FPS Approved, Rear-Deployed Blades, Deploys Upon Impact, 100 Grain, 2\" Cut</p>'),(670442,75,1,173754,'<p>The new Steel Broadheads, designed exclusively for Ravin Crossbows, are constructed with 416 steel for extreme accuracy, giving hunters the confidence they need in the field. The blades on this mechanical broadhead deploy upon impact with a 2-inch cutting diameter and have been tested and approved for crossbows shooting up to 450 FPS. The Steel Broadheads from Ravin have a single piece of ferrule and internal spring clip, eliminating the need for lock rings and O-rings.  3 Pack, 416 Steel, Extreme Accuracy and Penetration, Internal Spring Clip, No Locking Ring or O-ring, 450 FPS Approved, Rear-Deployed Blades, Deploys Upon Impact, 100 Grain, 2\" Cut</p>'),(371061,76,0,173754,'<p>Ravin Steel Broadheads - 3PK</p>'),(670443,76,1,173754,'<p>Ravin Steel Broadheads - 3PK</p>'),(371062,85,0,173754,'Ravin,Steel,Broadheads,3PK,R101'),(670444,85,1,173754,'Ravin,Steel,Broadheads,3PK,R101'),(371063,75,0,173755,'<p>The new Titanium Broadhead, designed exclusively for Ravin Crossbows, utilizes Ti6AL4V Grade 5 titanium and is packed with features for ultimate penetration and performance. This 100-grain mechanical broadhead features a single piece of a ferrule and internal spring clip. There are no lock rings or O-rings necessary, providing hunters ease of use. The blades deploy upon impact, inflicting a 2-inch cutting diameter.  3 Pack, Ti6AL4V Grade 5 Titanium, Extreme Accuracy and Penetration, Internal Spring Clip, No Locking Ring or O-ring, 450 FPS Approved, Rear-Deployed Blades, Deploys Upon Impact, 100 Grain, 2\" Cut</p>'),(670445,75,1,173755,'<p>The new Titanium Broadhead, designed exclusively for Ravin Crossbows, utilizes Ti6AL4V Grade 5 titanium and is packed with features for ultimate penetration and performance. This 100-grain mechanical broadhead features a single piece of a ferrule and internal spring clip. There are no lock rings or O-rings necessary, providing hunters ease of use. The blades deploy upon impact, inflicting a 2-inch cutting diameter.  3 Pack, Ti6AL4V Grade 5 Titanium, Extreme Accuracy and Penetration, Internal Spring Clip, No Locking Ring or O-ring, 450 FPS Approved, Rear-Deployed Blades, Deploys Upon Impact, 100 Grain, 2\" Cut</p>'),(371064,76,0,173755,'<p>Ravin Titanium Broadheads - 3PK</p>'),(670446,76,1,173755,'<p>Ravin Titanium Broadheads - 3PK</p>'),(371065,85,0,173755,'Ravin,Titanium,Broadheads,3PK,R100'),(670447,85,1,173755,'Ravin,Titanium,Broadheads,3PK,R100'),(371066,75,0,173756,'<p>Adjustable 2.5” wide padded neoprene design, Fits all Ravin Crossbow models, Soft durable no-slip backing, Quick-detach swivels for easy sling removal, Built-in thumb loop designed for carrying comfort, Water-resistant for inclement weather</p>'),(373579,75,1,173756,'<p>Adjustable 2.5” wide padded neoprene design, Fits all Ravin Crossbow models, Soft durable no-slip backing, Quick-detach swivels for easy sling removal, Built-in thumb loop designed for carrying comfort, Water-resistant for inclement weather</p>'),(371067,76,0,173756,'<p>Ravin Shoulder Sling</p>'),(373580,76,1,173756,'<p>Ravin Shoulder Sling</p>'),(371068,85,0,173756,'Ravin,Shoulder, Crossbow,Sling,R260'),(373581,85,1,173756,'Ravin,Shoulder, Crossbow,Sling,R260'),(371069,75,0,173757,'<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Holosun Technologies, Open Reflex, 2MOA Dot or 2MOA Dot with 65MOA Circle, Solar with Internal Battery, Quick Release Mount, AR Riser, Protective Hood, Black Finish</h4>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Parallax free</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">2 MOA dot and 65 MOA ring</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Dot only, Ring only, or Dot and Ring reticle combinations</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Titanium-alloyed, shock resistant hood</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: $364.69</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MAP: $309.99</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>The HS510C Open Reflex Circle Dot Sight has an open frame for a wide sight picture. It is powered by solar cell under normal usage, and a back-up battery to supplement power requirements in low light conditions. The reticle can be switched between a 65 MOA circle with 2 MOA dot, a 2 MOA dot only, or a 65 MOA ring only at the push of a button. Better yet, the same LED projects both reticles, so no re-zeroing is necessary.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>605930624571</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>Holosun Technologies</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>HS510C</strong></td>\r\n<th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>510C</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Red Dot</strong></td>\r\n<th>Power</th>\r\n<td><strong>N/A</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Objective</th>\r\n<td><strong>N/A</strong></td>\r\n<th>Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Black</strong></td>\r\n</tr