i>Features an odorless formula</li>\r\n<li>Does not stain fabric</li>\r\n<li>Used by the United States and Canadian Militaries for almost 30 years</li>\r\n</ul>'),(371633,75,1,174008,'<p>Whether you’re camping or tracking deer, Sawyer® Permethrin Insect Repellant will protect you and your gear from irritating pests. Spray this odorless, 0.5% Permethrin repellant on your clothing, tent, and other equipment to keep bugs away. Comparable to the effectiveness of DEET, Permethrin binds to fabric and does not stain. This powerful spray offers 42 days of relief from ticks, mosquitoes, chiggers, mites and more than 55 other insects.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MSRP: $10.99</li>\r\n<li>SSC: $7.99</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lasts 6 weeks or through 6 washes</li>\r\n<li>Non staining</li>\r\n<li>Odorless</li>\r\n<li>Perfect for camping and hunting</li>\r\n<li>Spray evenly onto your tents, gear, and clothing to protect again pests</li>\r\n<li>Made with 0.5% Permethrin</li>\r\n<li>Effectiveness is comparable to 100% DEET</li>\r\n<li>Protects against ticks, mosquitoes, chiggers, mites and more than 55 other kinds of insects</li>\r\n<li>Provides protection for 42 days in the sun or 6 washes</li>\r\n<li>Safe for skin but not intended for skin</li>\r\n<li>Features an odorless formula</li>\r\n<li>Does not stain fabric</li>\r\n<li>Used by the United States and Canadian Militaries for almost 30 years</li>\r\n</ul>'),(371631,76,0,174008,'<p>Whether you’re camping or tracking deer, Sawyer® Permethrin Insect Repellant will protect you and your gear from irritating pests. Spray this odorless, 0.5% Permethrin repellant on your clothing, tent, and other equipment to keep bugs away. Comparable to the effectiveness of DEET, Permethrin binds to fabric and does not stain. This powerful spray offers 42 days of relief from ticks, mosquitoes, chiggers, mites and more than 55 other insects.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MSRP: $10.99</li>\r\n<li>SSC: $7.99</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lasts 6 weeks or through 6 washes</li>\r\n<li>Non staining</li>\r\n<li>Odorless</li>\r\n<li>Perfect for camping and hunting</li>\r\n<li>Spray evenly onto your tents, gear, and clothing to protect again pests</li>\r\n<li>Made with 0.5% Permethrin</li>\r\n<li>Effectiveness is comparable to 100% DEET</li>\r\n<li>Protects against ticks, mosquitoes, chiggers, mites and more than 55 other kinds of insects</li>\r\n<li>Provides protection for 42 days in the sun or 6 washes</li>\r\n<li>Safe for skin but not intended for skin</li>\r\n<li>Features an odorless formula</li>\r\n<li>Does not stain fabric</li>\r\n<li>Used by the United States and Canadian Militaries for almost 30 years</li>\r\n</ul>'),(371634,76,1,174008,'<p>Whether you’re camping or tracking deer, Sawyer® Permethrin Insect Repellant will protect you and your gear from irritating pests. Spray this odorless, 0.5% Permethrin repellant on your clothing, tent, and other equipment to keep bugs away. Comparable to the effectiveness of DEET, Permethrin binds to fabric and does not stain. This powerful spray offers 42 days of relief from ticks, mosquitoes, chiggers, mites and more than 55 other insects.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MSRP: $10.99</li>\r\n<li>SSC: $7.99</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lasts 6 weeks or through 6 washes</li>\r\n<li>Non staining</li>\r\n<li>Odorless</li>\r\n<li>Perfect for camping and hunting</li>\r\n<li>Spray evenly onto your tents, gear, and clothing to protect again pests</li>\r\n<li>Made with 0.5% Permethrin</li>\r\n<li>Effectiveness is comparable to 100% DEET</li>\r\n<li>Protects against ticks, mosquitoes, chiggers, mites and more than 55 other kinds of insects</li>\r\n<li>Provides protection for 42 days in the sun or 6 washes</li>\r\n<li>Safe for skin but not intended for skin</li>\r\n<li>Features an odorless formula</li>\r\n<li>Does not stain fabric</li>\r\n<li>Used by the United States and Canadian Militaries for almost 30 years</li>\r\n</ul>'),(371632,85,0,174008,'Coulston\'s Permethrin Insect Repellent- 9 oz spray, by Sawyer'),(371635,85,1,174008,'Coulston\'s Permethrin Insect Repellent- 9 oz spray, by Sawyer'),(371636,75,0,174009,'<p><span>Compact and light weight, this Cascade Mountain Tech camp chair is perfect for camping trips, beach days, sporting events, outdoor concerts and more. Weighing only 3 lbs 4 oz, this high back chair is light weight and easy to carry anywhere and everywhere. The Ultralight Packable High-Back Camp Chair can also collapse to fit perfectly into its own carry case. Additionally, this compact outdoor chair is built with strong and durable aluminum, allowing it to hold up to 250lbs.</span></p>\r\n<p>Purchase with confidence: All Cascade Mountain Tech Camp Chairs come with a 1-year manufacturer’s warranty. <a href=\"https://cascademountaintech.com/pages/returns-and-exchanges\">Warranty and Return Policy Details</a></p>\r\n<h3>Features</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>DURABLE - Strong, fully-collapsible aluminum frame holds up to 250lbs</li>\r\n<li>PORTABLE - Convenient carry bag included <span>for easy packing in your backpack or luggage</span></li>\r\n<li><span>SAND FEET- Help to reduce sinking into the sand, mud, and other soft ground</span></li>\r\n<li>MAXIMUM COMFORT - Removable, adjustable headrest and cool breathable mesh back for enhanced airflow</li>\r\n<li>QUICK AND EASY SETUP - Aluminum shock-cord pole structure makes for a quick hassle-free setup and tear-down</li>\r\n<li>ULTRALIGHT<span> </span>CONSTRUCTION – weighs under 4 pounds (3 lbs and 4 oz to be exact)!</li>\r\n<li>COMPACT - Packs down to 19” x 5” x 5”</li>\r\n<li>Measures 39.5\" high with a 16\" wide seat. </li>\r\n<li>Sits 16\" off the ground</li>\r\n</ul>'),(371637,75,1,174009,'<p><span>Compact and light weight, this Cascade Mountain Tech camp chair is perfect for camping trips, beach days, sporting events, outdoor concerts and more. Weighing only 3 lbs 4 oz, this high back chair is light weight and easy to carry anywhere and everywhere. The Ultralight Packable High-Back Camp Chair can also collapse to fit perfectly into its own carry case. Additionally, this compact outdoor chair is built with strong and durable aluminum, allowing it to hold up to 250lbs.</span></p>\r\n<p>Purchase with confidence: All Cascade Mountain Tech Camp Chairs come with a 1-year manufacturer’s warranty. <a href=\"https://cascademountaintech.com/pages/returns-and-exchanges\">Warranty and Return Policy Details</a></p>\r\n<h3>Features</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>DURABLE - Strong, fully-collapsible aluminum frame holds up to 250lbs</li>\r\n<li>PORTABLE - Convenient carry bag included <span>for easy packing in your backpack or luggage</span></li>\r\n<li><span>SAND FEET- Help to reduce sinking into the sand, mud, and other soft ground</span></li>\r\n<li>MAXIMUM COMFORT - Removable, adjustable headrest and cool breathable mesh back for enhanced airflow</li>\r\n<li>QUICK AND EASY SETUP - Aluminum shock-cord pole structure makes for a quick hassle-free setup and tear-down</li>\r\n<li>ULTRALIGHT<span> </span>CONSTRUCTION – weighs under 4 pounds (3 lbs and 4 oz to be exact)!</li>\r\n<li>COMPACT - Packs down to 19” x 5” x 5”</li>\r\n<li>Measures 39.5\" high with a 16\" wide seat. </li>\r\n<li>Sits 16\" off the ground</li>\r\n</ul>'),(371644,75,0,174011,'<div class=\"u25wc0c mgz-element mgz-child mgz-element-product_description\">\r\n<div class=\"mgz-element-inner u25wc0c-s\">\r\n<div class=\"ppbd-product-description\">North America\'s Most Popular Portable Propane Heater! This patented radiant 4,000-9,000 BTU Liquid Propane heater connects directly to a 1 lb. cylinder and is the perfect solution for heating enclosed spaces like large tents up to 225 sq. ft. The expertly engineered size to BTU ratio is augmented with a fold down handle to give this heater maximum output while retaining a minimalistic footprint. A swivel regulator gives you the ability to adapt usage from a disposable cylinder to a remote gas supply with the purchase of a hose and filter. To light the unit, simply rotate the knob to pilot and push. Then the integrated Piezo sparking mechanism will take care of the rest. With the Oxygen Depletion Sensor (ODS) and accidental tip-over safety shut-off you can be sure that you will enjoy years of comfortable indoor safe heat.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ri8xxln mgz-element mgz-child mgz-element-product_attribute\">\r\n<div class=\"mgz-element-inner ri8xxln-s\">\r\n<div class=\"ppbd-product-attribute\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>4,000 or 9,000 BTU per hour</li>\r\n<li>For use with propane gas</li>\r\n<li>Heats up to 225 sq. ft.</li>\r\n<li>Single control start knob</li>\r\n<li>Hi-Low heat settings</li>\r\n<li>Swivel regulator</li>\r\n<li>Fold down handle</li>\r\n<li>Accidental tip-over safety shut-off</li>\r\n<li>Includes Piezo igniter</li>\r\n<li>Runs off a 1 lb. cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Connects directly to a 20 lb. cylinder with optional hose and filter</li>\r\n<li>The distinctive <span><span style=\"color: red;\">RED</span></span> Mr. Heater Buddy that has delivered comfort and safety for decades.</li>\r\n<li>THE USE OF UN-AUTHORIZED ACCESSORIES/ATTACHMENTS WITH THIS HEATER ARE EXPRESSLY PROHIBITED, MAY CAUSE SERIOUS INJURY, AND WILL VOID THE WARRANTY.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Heating Area (Sq Ft)225</p>\r\n<p>Tank Capacity (Min)1 lb Propane Cylinder</p>\r\n<p>Run Time (Hrs at Max BTU)3 Hours</p>\r\n<p>Run Time (Hrs at Min BTU)6 Hours</p>\r\n<p>Fuel Consumption/Burn Rate (Gal/Hr)at 4,000 BTU = 0.044 Gal/Hr, at 9,000 BTU = 0.099 Gal/Hr</p>\r\n<p>Maximum Elevation (Ft)7000 Ft</p>\r\n<p>Weight 10.6</p>\r\n<p>Model MH9BX</p>\r\n<p>Length 14.25</p>\r\n<p>Width 9.00</p>\r\n<p>Height 15</p>\r\n<p>Disclaimer Not for sale in Massachusetts or Canada.</p>\r\n<p>Use Emergency Heat, Tents, Campers, Workshops, Job Sites, Porches, Patios, Decks, Garages, Storage Buildings, Picnics, Tailgate Parties, Construction Trailers, Sporting Events, Barns, Sheds, Hunting Blinds, Shelters, Ice Fishing Shanties</p>\r\n<p>Warranty 1 Year Limited</p>\r\n<p>Thermostat No</p>\r\n<p>Safety Tip-Over Switch Yes</p>\r\n<p>Fuel Type Propane Heat</p>\r\n<p>Type Radiant</p>\r\n<p>Oxygen Depletion Sensor (ODS) Yes</p>\r\n<p>Indoor Safe Yes</p>\r\n<p>Ignition Piezo</p>\r\n<p>Hose &amp; Regulator Sold separately</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(670555,75,1,174011,'<div class=\"u25wc0c mgz-element mgz-child mgz-element-product_description\">\r\n<div class=\"mgz-element-inner u25wc0c-s\">\r\n<div class=\"ppbd-product-description\">North America\'s Most Popular Portable Propane Heater! This patented radiant 4,000-9,000 BTU Liquid Propane heater connects directly to a 1 lb. cylinder and is the perfect solution for heating enclosed spaces like large tents up to 225 sq. ft. The expertly engineered size to BTU ratio is augmented with a fold down handle to give this heater maximum output while retaining a minimalistic footprint. A swivel regulator gives you the ability to adapt usage from a disposable cylinder to a remote gas supply with the purchase of a hose and filter. To light the unit, simply rotate the knob to pilot and push. Then the integrated Piezo sparking mechanism will take care of the rest. With the Oxygen Depletion Sensor (ODS) and accidental tip-over safety shut-off you can be sure that you will enjoy years of comfortable indoor safe heat.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ri8xxln mgz-element mgz-child mgz-element-product_attribute\">\r\n<div class=\"mgz-element-inner ri8xxln-s\">\r\n<div class=\"ppbd-product-attribute\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>4,000 or 9,000 BTU per hour</li>\r\n<li>For use with propane gas</li>\r\n<li>Heats up to 225 sq. ft.</li>\r\n<li>Single control start knob</li>\r\n<li>Hi-Low heat settings</li>\r\n<li>Swivel regulator</li>\r\n<li>Fold down handle</li>\r\n<li>Accidental tip-over safety shut-off</li>\r\n<li>Includes Piezo igniter</li>\r\n<li>Runs off a 1 lb. cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Connects directly to a 20 lb. cylinder with optional hose and filter</li>\r\n<li>The distinctive <span><span style=\"color: red;\">RED</span></span> Mr. Heater Buddy that has delivered comfort and safety for decades.</li>\r\n<li>THE USE OF UN-AUTHORIZED ACCESSORIES/ATTACHMENTS WITH THIS HEATER ARE EXPRESSLY PROHIBITED, MAY CAUSE SERIOUS INJURY, AND WILL VOID THE WARRANTY.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Heating Area (Sq Ft)225</p>\r\n<p>Tank Capacity (Min)1 lb Propane Cylinder</p>\r\n<p>Run Time (Hrs at Max BTU)3 Hours</p>\r\n<p>Run Time (Hrs at Min BTU)6 Hours</p>\r\n<p>Fuel Consumption/Burn Rate (Gal/Hr)at 4,000 BTU = 0.044 Gal/Hr, at 9,000 BTU = 0.099 Gal/Hr</p>\r\n<p>Maximum Elevation (Ft)7000 Ft</p>\r\n<p>Weight 10.6</p>\r\n<p>Model MH9BX</p>\r\n<p>Length 14.25</p>\r\n<p>Width 9.00</p>\r\n<p>Height 15</p>\r\n<p>Disclaimer Not for sale in Massachusetts or Canada.</p>\r\n<p>Use Emergency Heat, Tents, Campers, Workshops, Job Sites, Porches, Patios, Decks, Garages, Storage Buildings, Picnics, Tailgate Parties, Construction Trailers, Sporting Events, Barns, Sheds, Hunting Blinds, Shelters, Ice Fishing Shanties</p>\r\n<p>Warranty 1 Year Limited</p>\r\n<p>Thermostat No</p>\r\n<p>Safety Tip-Over Switch Yes</p>\r\n<p>Fuel Type Propane Heat</p>\r\n<p>Type Radiant</p>\r\n<p>Oxygen Depletion Sensor (ODS) Yes</p>\r\n<p>Indoor Safe Yes</p>\r\n<p>Ignition Piezo</p>\r\n<p>Hose &amp; Regulator Sold separately</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(371645,75,0,174012,'<p>Folding Knife Deployment System. Black finish stainless pocket clip. Allows the operator to place a folding knife in a variety of carry positions ready to draw. The Merlin system is symmetrical, allowing left or right carry. Fits knives with 2.5\" to 5\" blade. Special locator disk allows eight customizable carry angles. Black nylon sheath.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Dimensions: 3.13\" x 2.5\" x 1.25\". </li>\r\n<li>MSRP: $7.99</li>\r\n</ul>'),(371648,75,1,174012,'<p>Folding Knife Deployment System. Black finish stainless pocket clip. Allows the operator to place a folding knife i