 has tool less elevation and windage adjustments. Sights have a positive detent lock in the deployed position. Front sight not made to be mounted on a gas block.<br /><br /><strong>Specifications and Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>FAB Defense Folding Sight Set FX-FRBSKIT</li>\r\n<li>Can be used as primary or back-up sight</li>\r\n<li>Ergonomic angel-wing-shaped shroud helps center the image with front sight</li>\r\n<li>Dual apertures are 3mm for longer eye relief mounting, low light and faster target acquisition</li>\r\n<li>1.5mm for shorter eye relief mounting and greater accuracy</li>\r\n<li>Instantly selectable to match conditions</li>\r\n<li>Low folded profile is smooth and inconspicuous, and will not snag on gear, webbing, or brush</li>\r\n<li>Instant spring locked deployment mechanism will not slip, break or deform</li>\r\n<li>Tool less rapid windage and elevation adjustments</li>\r\n<li>Made of extremely durable high-grade polymer and metal</li>\r\n<li>Black</li>\r\n<li>MSRP: $107.00</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><br />Fits:<br />AR-15/M-16 Same plane Handguard Rails</p>'),(371966,75,1,174137,'<p>FAB Defense manufacturers and distributes unique weapon accessories designed for combat in the most extreme environments. With a workforce consisting of real world operators with real world combat experience you know FAB Defense has the experience necessary to offer you the finest gear available on the planet. You\'re your life depends is on the line gear up with FAB Defense products. FAB Defense has a flip up sight set that is designed to help you quickly center your target in the sight picture by creating an optical tunnel. The smooth design helps prevent snags and can work as primary sights or back up. Easily installs on Picatinny rails and has tool less elevation and windage adjustments. Sights have a positive detent lock in the deployed position. Front sight not made to be mounted on a gas block.<br /><br /><strong>Specifications and Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>FAB Defense Folding Sight Set FX-FRBSKIT</li>\r\n<li>Can be used as primary or back-up sight</li>\r\n<li>Ergonomic angel-wing-shaped shroud helps center the image with front sight</li>\r\n<li>Dual apertures are 3mm for longer eye relief mounting, low light and faster target acquisition</li>\r\n<li>1.5mm for shorter eye relief mounting and greater accuracy</li>\r\n<li>Instantly selectable to match conditions</li>\r\n<li>Low folded profile is smooth and inconspicuous, and will not snag on gear, webbing, or brush</li>\r\n<li>Instant spring locked deployment mechanism will not slip, break or deform</li>\r\n<li>Tool less rapid windage and elevation adjustments</li>\r\n<li>Made of extremely durable high-grade polymer and metal</li>\r\n<li>Black</li>\r\n<li>MSRP: $107.00</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><br />Fits:<br />AR-15/M-16 Same plane Handguard Rails</p>'),(371964,76,0,174137,'<p><span>FAB Defense manufacturers and distributes unique weapon accessories designed for combat in the most extreme environments. With a workforce consisting of real world operators with real world combat experience you know FAB Defense has the experience necessary to offer you the finest gear available on the planet. You\'re your life depends is on the line gear up with FAB Defense products. FAB Defense has a flip up sight set that is designed to help you quickly center your target in the sight picture by creating an optical tunnel. The smooth design helps prevent snags and can work as primary sights or back up. Easily installs on Picatinny rails and has tool less elevation and windage adjustments. Sights have a positive detent lock in the deployed position. Front sight not made to be mounted on a gas block.</span><br /><br /><strong>Specifications and Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span>FAB Defense Folding Sight Set FX-FRBSKIT</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Can be used as primary or back-up sight</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Ergonomic angel-wing-shaped shroud helps center the image with front sight</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Dual apertures are 3mm for longer eye relief mounting, low light and faster target acquisition</span></li>\r\n<li><span>1.5mm for shorter eye relief mounting and greater accuracy</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Instantly selectable to match conditions</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Low folded profile is smooth and inconspicuous, and will not snag on gear, webbing, or brush</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Instant spring locked deployment mechanism will not slip, break or deform</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Tool less rapid windage and elevation adjustments</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Made of extremely durable high-grade polymer and metal</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Black</span></li>\r\n<li><span>MSRP: $107.00</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><br /><span>Fits:</span><br /><span>AR-15/M-16 Same plane Handguard Rails</span></p>'),(371967,76,1,174137,'<p><span>FAB Defense manufacturers and distributes unique weapon accessories designed for combat in the most extreme environments. With a workforce consisting of real world operators with real world combat experience you know FAB Defense has the experience necessary to offer you the finest gear available on the planet. You\'re your life depends is on the line gear up with FAB Defense products. FAB Defense has a flip up sight set that is designed to help you quickly center your target in the sight picture by creating an optical tunnel. The smooth design helps prevent snags and can work as primary sights or back up. Easily installs on Picatinny rails and has tool less elevation and windage adjustments. Sights have a positive detent lock in the deployed position. Front sight not made to be mounted on a gas block.</span><br /><br /><strong>Specifications and Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span>FAB Defense Folding Sight Set FX-FRBSKIT</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Can be used as primary or back-up sight</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Ergonomic angel-wing-shaped shroud helps center the image with front sight</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Dual apertures are 3mm for longer eye relief mounting, low light and faster target acquisition</span></li>\r\n<li><span>1.5mm for shorter eye relief mounting and greater accuracy</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Instantly selectable to match conditions</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Low folded profile is smooth and inconspicuous, and will not snag on gear, webbing, or brush</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Instant spring locked deployment mechanism will not slip, break or deform</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Tool less rapid windage and elevation adjustments</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Made of extremely durable high-grade polymer and metal</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Black</span></li>\r\n<li><span>MSRP: $107.00</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><br /><span>Fits:</span><br /><span>AR-15/M-16 Same plane Handguard Rails</span></p>'),(371965,85,0,174137,'F.A.B. DEFENSE FRONT & REAR BACK UP SIGHTS BLACK'),(371968,85,1,174137,'F.A.B. DEFENSE FRONT & REAR BACK UP SIGHTS BLACK'),(371969,75,0,174138,'<ul>\r\n<li><span>Allows the mounting of Aimpoint T1, T2, H1, H2 or clones that use the same mounting design</span></li>\r\n<li>This will not fit the Bushnell red dot</li>\r\n<li>Patent pending pivot design allows the gun to be folded as designed for compact storage</li>\r\n<li>Constructed from 6061 aluminum hard coat anodized for a lifetime of service.</li>\r\n<li>Includes all mounting hardware</li>\r\n<li>Weight - 2.7 ounces</li>\r\n<li>100% made in the U.S.A. with MI Lifetime Warranty</li>\r\n<li><a title=\"MI Sub2000 Mount\" href=\"https://youtu.be/R_YOxV1Wo2s\" target=\"_blank\">Installation video</a></li>\r\n<li>MSRP: $109.95</li>\r\n<li>MAP: $99.95</li>\r\n</ul>'),(371972,75,1,174138,'<p>MIDWEST INDUSTRIES KEL-TEC OPTIC MOUNT GEN.2 SUB-2000 PICATINNY</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p> Allows the mounting of Aimpoint T1, T2, H1, H2 or clones that use the same mounting design.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>This will not fit the Bushnell red dot.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Patent pending pivot design allows the gun to be folded as designed for compact storage.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Constructed from 6061 aluminum hard coat anodized for a lifetime of service.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Includes all mounting hardware.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• 100% made in the U.S.A. with MI Lifetime Warranty</p>\r\n<p>• Manufacturer Part Number MI-G2SUB-R</p>\r\n<p>• UPC 816537012689</p>\r\n<p>• FINISH: BLACK MATTE</p>\r\n<p>• HEIGHT: 2.2000</p>\r\n<p>• LENGTH: 7.1500</p>\r\n<p>• MATERIAL: ALUMINUM</p>\r\n<p>• OTHER FEATURES: DESIGNED FOR SMALL RED DOTS WITH A PICATINNY BASE</p>\r\n<p>• RINGS INCLUDED: N</p>\r\n<p>• STYLE: PICATINNY</p>\r\n<p>• TYPE OF RINGS NEEDED: NONE</p>\r\n<p>• OTHER FEATURES: PIVOT DESIGN ALLOWS THE GUN TO BE FOLDED FOR COMPACT STORAGE. INCLUDES MOUNTING HARDWARE, MADE IN USA. FITS GEN2 SUB2K ONLY NOT GEN1</p>\r\n<p>• WIDTH 5.1000</p>'),(371970,76,0,174138,'<ul>\r\n<li>Allows the mounting of Aimpoint T1, T2, H1, H2 or clones that use the same mounting design</li>\r\n<li>This will not fit the Bushnell red dot</li>\r\n<li>Patent pending pivot design allows the gun to be folded as designed for compact storage</li>\r\n<li>Constructed from 6061 aluminum hard coat anodized for a lifetime of service.</li>\r\n<li>Includes all mounting hardware</li>\r\n<li>Weight - 2.7 ounces</li>\r\n<li>100% made in the U.S.A. with MI Lifetime Warranty</li>\r\n<li><a title=\"MI Sub2000 Mount\" href=\"https://youtu.be/R_YOxV1Wo2s\" target=\"_blank\">Installation video</a></li>\r\n<li>MSRP: $109.95</li>\r\n<li>MAP: $99.95</li>\r\n</ul>'),(371973,76,1,174138,'<p>Allows the mounting of Aimpoint T1, T2, H1, H2 or clones that use the same mounting design.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• This will not fit the Bushnell red dot.</p>\r\n<p>• Patent pending pivot design allows the gun to be folded as designed for compact storage.</p>\r\n<p>• Constructed from 6061 aluminum hard coat anodized for a lifetime of service.</p>'),(371971,85,0,174138,'MIDWEST INDUSTRIES KEL-TEC OPTIC MOUNT GEN.2 SUB-2000 PICATINNY'),(371974,85,1,174138,'MIDWEST INDUSTRIES KEL-TEC OPTIC MOUNT GEN.2 SUB-2000 PICATINNY'),(371981,75,0,174139,'<p>Kel-Tec PLR-16 Muzzle Brake Kit, part #582.  <span>Muzzle brake specifically designed for the 9.2\" barrel of the PLR-16.</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mfg Item Num: PLR16582</li>\r\n<li>Supplier SKU: 49645</li>\r\n<li>Category: FIREARM PARTS</li>\r\n<li>Type: Muzzle Brake</li>\r\n<li>Model: PLR16582</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Black</li>\r\n<li>Size: Fits 9.2\" Barrel Of PLR-16</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Muzzle: 1/2\"-28 TPI</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Kit Contains:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>#580 Muzzle brake</li>\r\n<li>#581 Muzzle brake lock nut</li>\r\n</ul>'),(371988,75,1,174139,'<p>Kel-Tec PLR-16 Muzzle Brake Kit, part #582.  <span>Muzzle brake specifically designed for the 9.2\" barrel of the PLR-16.</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mfg Item Num: PLR16582</li>\r\n<li>Supplier SKU: 49645</li>\r\n<li>Category: FIREARM PARTS</li>\r\n<li>Type: Muzzle Brake</li>\r\n<li>Model: PLR16582</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Black</li>\r\n<li>Size: Fits 9.2\" Barrel Of PLR-16</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Muzzle: 1/2\"-28 TPI</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Kit Contains:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>#580 Muzzle brake</li>\r\n<li>#581 Muzzle brake lock nut</li>\r\n</ul>'),(371982,76,0,174139,'<p>Kel-Tec PLR-16 Muzzle Brake Kit, part #582.  Muzzle brake specifically designed for the 9.2\" barrel of the PLR-16.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mfg Item Num: PLR16582</li>\r\n<li>Supplier SKU: 49645</li>\r\n<li>Category: FIREARM PARTS</li>\r\n<li>Type: Muzzle Brake</li>\r\n<li>Model: PLR16582</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Black</li>\r\n<li>Size: Fits 9.2\" Barrel Of PLR-16</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Muzzle: 1/2\"-28 TPI</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Kit Contains:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>#580 Muzzle brake</li>\r\n<li>#581 Muzzle brake lock nut</li>\r\n</ul>'),(371989,76,1,174139,'<p>Kel-Tec PLR-16 Muzzle Brake Kit, part #582.  Muzzle brake specifically designed for the 9.2\" barrel of the PLR-16.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mfg Item Num: PLR16582</li>\r\n<li>Supplier SKU: 49645</li>\r\n<li>Category: FIREARM PARTS</li>\r\n<li>Type: Muzzle Brake</li>\r\n<li>Model: PLR16582</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Black</li>\r\n<li>Size: Fits 9.2\" Barrel Of PLR-16</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Muzzle: 1/2\"-28 TPI</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Kit Contains:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>#580 Muzzle brake</li>\r\n<li>#581 Muzzle brake lock nut</li>\r\n</ul>'),(371983,85,0,174139,'Kel-Tec PLR-16 Muzzle Brake Kit'),(371990,85,1,174139,'Kel-Tec PLR-16 Muzzle Brake Kit'),(371991,75,0,174140,'<p>Kel-Tec RFB Riser Kit</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The RFB Riser is made out of hard coat anodized 6061-T6 aluminum, similar to the RFB Quad Rail.</li>\r\n<li>This Riser can be used with the RFB Quad Rail kit to match the height of the Top Picatinny Rail for increased sight radius, when using iron sights, or can be used to add height on a purchased scope.</li>\r\n<li>This kit includes one (1) RFB-750-Riser, one (1) 10-32 screw and one (1) hex key.</li>\r\n</ul>'),(371994,75,1,174140,'<p>Kel-Tec RFB Riser Kit</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The RFB Riser is made out of hard coat anodized 6061-T6 aluminum, similar to the RFB Quad Rail.</li>\r\n<li>This Riser can be used with the RFB Quad Rail kit to match the height of the Top Picatinny Rail for increased sight radius, when using iron sights, or can be used to add height on a purchased scope.</li>\r\n<li>This kit includes one (1) RFB-750-Riser, one (1) 10-32 screw and one (1) hex key.</li>\r\n</ul>'),(371992,76,0,174140,'<p>Kel-Tec RFB Riser Kit</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The RFB Riser is made out of hard coat anodized 6061-T6 aluminum, similar to the RFB Quad Rail.</li>\r\n<li>This Riser can be used with the RFB Quad Rail kit to match the height of the Top Picatinny Rail for increased sight radius, when using iron sights, or can be used to add height on a purchased scope.</li>\r\n<li>This kit includes one (1) RFB-750-Riser, one (1) 10-32 screw and one (1) hex key.</li>\r\n</ul>'),(371995,76,1,174140,'<p>Kel-Tec RFB Riser Kit</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The RFB Riser is made out of hard coat anodized 6061-T6 aluminum, similar to the RFB Quad Rail.</li>\r\n<li>This Riser can be used with the RFB Quad Rail kit to match the height of the Top Picatinny Rail for increased sight radius, when using iron sights, or can be used to add height on a purchased scope.</li>\r\n<li>This kit includes one (1) RFB-750-Riser, one (1) 10-32 screw and one (1) hex key.</li>\r\n</ul>'),(371993,85,0,174140,'Kel-Tec RFB Riser Kit'),(371996,85,1,174140,'Kel-Tec RFB Riser Kit'),(371999,75,0,174141,'<p>Kel-Tec SU16 PLR-16 Scope Mount Kit.  Packaged opened for pictures.</p>\r\n<p><span>Kel-Tec Scope Mount For SU-16 - Specifically designed for a positive clamp to the polymer receiver of the SU16 rifles with a long 1.3\" clamping surface.  <span>Fits Kel-Tec SU-16 rifles and PLR-16 pistols For Picatinny rails. Separate clamping screws for rail &amp; scope. Black anodized 6061 aluminum. Includes 2 scope rings &amp; hardware.</span></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span class=\"_2FP4UbSD\">MPN:</span>SU16960</li>\r\n<li><span class=\"_2FP4UbSD\">UPC:</span>640832002157</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372002,75,1,174141,'<p>Kel-Tec SU16 PLR-16 Scope Mount Kit.  Packaged opened for pictures.</p>\r\n<p><span>Kel-Tec Scope Mount For SU-16 - Specifically designed for a positive clamp to the polymer receiver of the SU16 rifles with a long 1.3\" clamping surface.  <span>Fits Kel-Tec SU-16 rifles and PLR-16 pistols For Picatinny rails. Separate clamping screws for rail &amp; scope. Black anodized 6061 aluminum. Includes 2 scope rings &amp; hardware.</span></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span class=\"_2FP4UbSD\">MPN:</span>SU16960</li>\r\n<li><span class=\"_2FP4UbSD\">UPC:</span>640832002157</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372000,76,0,174141,'<p>Kel-Tec SU16 PLR-16 Scope Mount Kit.  Packaged opened for pictures.</p>\r\n<p>Kel-Tec Scope Mount For SU-16 - Specifically designed for a positive clamp to the polymer receiver of the SU16 rifles with a long 1.3\" clamping surface.  Fits Kel-Tec SU-16 rifles and PLR-16 pistols For Picatinny rails. Separate clamping screws for rail &amp; scope. Black anodized 6061 aluminum. Includes 2 scope rings &amp; hardware.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span class=\"_2FP4UbSD\">MPN:</span>SU16960</li>\r\n<li><span class=\"_2FP4UbSD\">UPC:</span>640832002157</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372003,76,1,174141,'<p>Kel-Tec SU16 PLR-16 Scope Mount Kit.  Packaged opened for pictures.</p>\r\n<p>Kel-Tec Scope Mount For SU-16 - Specifically designed for a positive clamp to the polymer receiver of the SU16 rifles with a long 1.3\" clamping surface.  Fits Kel-Tec SU-16 rifles and PLR-16 pistols For Picatinny rails. Separate clamping screws for rail &amp; scope. Black anodized 6061 aluminum. Includes 2 scope rings &amp; hardware.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span class=\"_2FP4UbSD\">MPN:</span>SU16960</li>\r\n<li><span class=\"_2FP4UbSD\">UPC:</span>640832002157</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372001,85,0,174141,'Kel-Tec SU16 PLR-16 Scope Mount Kit'),(372004,85,1,174141,'Kel-Tec SU16 PLR-16 Scope Mount Kit'),(372012,75,0,174143,'<p><span>PRECISION AIMING &amp; TARGET ACQUISITION</span> – 2 MOA center dot allows users to quickly acquire their target while simultaneously providing precise accuracy at an extended range. The 65 MOA surround provides universality to any platform.</p>\r\n<p><span>ADVANCED TECHNOLOGY</span> – The HRD1 features 6 brightness settings for use in all environments. Its etched internal base helps filter out unwanted light. The different lens dimensions allows for a greater field of view which helps acquire targets easier. Parallax free and unlimited eye-relief.</p>\r\n<p><span>ENERGY-SAVING DISPLAY</span> – Equipped with a motion sensor that turns the red dot off when idle to conserve battery power. Its low power consuming OLED display also allows for extended battery life. The HRD1 boasts a 22,000-hour battery life and operates on 2 AAA batteries (included).</p>\r\n<p><span>DURABLE AND COMPACT</span> – Features a reinforced lens canopy for extreme durability made with 6061-T6 aluminum. Water resistant to an International Protection Rating of IPX8. Weighs 0.45lbs (7.2oz) with batteries included.</p>\r\n<p><span>INCLUDED ACCESSORIES</span> – Comes with the HRD1 sight, protective lens cover, two adjustment wrenches, cleaning cloth, and 2 AAA batteries.</p>'),(372295,75,1,174143,'<p><span>PRECISION AIMING &amp; TARGET ACQUISITION</span> – 2 MOA center dot allows users to quickly acquire their target while simultaneously providing precise accuracy at an extended range. The 65 MOA surround provides universality to any platform.</p>\r\n<p><span>ADVANCED TECHNOLOGY</span> – The HRD1 features 6 brightness settings for use in all environments. Its etched internal base helps filter out unwanted light. The different lens dimensions allows for a greater field of view which helps acquire targets easier. Parallax free and unlimited eye-relief.</p>\r\n<p><span>ENERGY-SAVING DISPLAY</span> – Equipped with a motion sensor that turns the red dot off when idle to conserve battery power. Its low power consuming OLED display also allows for extended battery life. The HRD1 boasts a 22,000-hour battery life and operates on 2 AAA batteries (included).</p>\r\n<p><span>DURABLE AND COMPACT</span> – Features a reinforced lens canopy for extreme durability made with 6061-T6 aluminum. Water resistant to an International Protection Rating of IPX8. Weighs 0.45lbs (7.2oz) with batteries included.</p>\r\n<p><span>INCLUDED ACCESSORIES</span> – Comes with the HRD1 sight, protective lens cover, two adjustment wrenches, cleaning cloth, and 2 AAA batteries.</p>'),(372013,76,0,174143,'<p><span>2 MOA center dot allows users to quickly acquire their target while simultaneously providing precise accuracy at an extended range.</span></p>'),(372296,76,1,174143,'<p><span>2 MOA center dot allows users to quickly acquire their target while simultaneously providing precise accuracy at an extended range.</span></p>'),(372014,85,0,174143,'optics, x-vision, auto brightness, lenses, red dot sights'),(372297,85,1,174143,'optics, x-vision, auto brightness, lenses, red dot sights'),(372015,75,0,174144,'<p><span>PRECISION AIMING &amp; TARGET ACQUISITION</span> – 2 MOA center dot allows users to quickly acquire their target while simultaneously providing precise accuracy at an extended range. It has a tapered tube effect for faster target acquisition. Its 1.45in. cowitness mount provides universality to any platform.</p>\r\n<p><span>ADVANCED TECHNOLOGY</span> – The ZRD1 features 11 brightness settings for use in all environments. Parallax free and unlimited eye-relief.</p>\r\n<p><span>ENERGY-SAVING DISPLAY</span> – The ZRD1 has a low power OLED display that allows for extended battery life. The HRD1 boasts a 22,500 battery life and operates on one CR2032 battery (included).</p>\r\n<p><span>DURABLE AND COMPACT</span> – Equipped with a high performance, high impact 6061-T6 housing for extreme durability. Water resistant to an International Protection Rating of IPX7. Weighs 0.3lbs (0.5oz).</p>\r\n<p><span> </span><span>INCLUDED ACCESSORIES</span> – Comes with the ZRD1 Sight, protective lens cover, adjustment wrench, cleaning cloth, and CR2032 battery.</p>\r\n<p>Specs:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Dot size: 2 MOA</li>\r\n<li>Cowitness mount: 1.45 in. (37 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Magnification: 1x</li>\r\n<li>Objective Lens Dimensions: 1 in. (25 mm) diameter</li>\r\n<li>11 brightness settings</li>\r\n<li>Waterproof rating: IPX7</li>\r\n<li>Mount type: Picatinny</li>\r\n<li>Battery life: 22,500 hours</li>\r\n<li>Operates on one CR2032 battery</li>\r\n<li>Length: 2.75 in. (7.0 cm)</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 0.3 lbs. (0.14 kg)</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372397,75,1,174144,'<p><span>PRECISION AIMING &amp; TARGET ACQUISITION</span> – 2 MOA center dot allows users to quickly acquire their target while simultaneously providing precise accuracy at an extended range. It has a tapered tube effect for faster target acquisition. Its 1.45in. cowitness mount provides universality to any platform.</p>\r\n<p><span>ADVANCED TECHNOLOGY</span> – The ZRD1 features 11 brightness settings for use in all environments. Parallax free and unlimited eye-relief.</p>\r\n<p><span>ENERGY-SAVING DISPLAY</span> – The ZRD1 has a low power OLED display that allows for extended battery life. The HRD1 boasts a 22,500 battery life and operates on one CR2032 battery (included).</p>\r\n<p><span>DURABLE AND COMPACT</span> – Equipped with a high performance, high impact 6061-T6 housing for extreme durability. Water resistant to an International Protection Rating of IPX7. Weighs 0.3lbs (0.5oz).</p>\r\n<p><span> </span><span>INCLUDED ACCESSORIES</span> – Comes with the ZRD1 Sight, protective lens cover, adjustment wrench, cleaning cloth, and CR2032 battery.</p>\r\n<p>Specs:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Dot size: 2 MOA</li>\r\n<li>Cowitness mount: 1.45 in. (37 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Magnification: 1x</li>\r\n<li>Objective Lens Dimensions: 1 in. (25 mm) diameter</li>\r\n<li>11 brightness settings</li>\r\n<li>Waterproof rating: IPX7</li>\r\n<li>Mount type: Picatinny</li>\r\n<li>Battery life: 22,500 hours</li>\r\n<li>Operates on one CR2032 battery</li>\r\n<li>Length: 2.75 in. (7.0 cm)</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 0.3 lbs. (0.14 kg)</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372016,76,0,174144,'<p><span>2 MOA center dot allows users to quickly acquire their target while simultaneously providing precise accuracy at an extended range. It has a tapered tube effect for faster target acquisition. </span></p>'),(372398,76,1,174144,'<p><span>2 MOA center dot allows users to quickly acquire their target while simultaneously providing precise accuracy at an extended range. It has a tapered tube effect for faster target acquisition. </span></p>'),(372017,85,0,174144,'optics, x-vision, auto brightness, lenses, red dot sights'),(372399,85,1,174144,'optics, x-vision, auto brightness, lenses, red dot sights'),(372018,75,0,174145,'<p><span>ADDED MAGNIFICATION</span> – View objects closer and clearer with the MAAG’s 3x magnification capabilities. See an extended field of view with additional eye relief of 2.5 inches.</p>\r\n<p><span>ADVANCED FLIP-TO-SIDE MOUNT AND QUICK RELEASE</span> – The included flip-to-side mount design is perfect for both absolute cowitness and lower 1/3 cowitness mount heights. This magnifier also features an integrated quick release for fast attachment.</p>\r\n<p><span> </span><span>COMPATIBLE WITH ALL RED DOT SIGHTS</span> – Use with any type of red dots for zoomed sighting. It has the capability to fit on both Weaver or Picatinny rails.</p>\r\n<p><span>DURABLE AND COMPACT</span> – Nitrogen purged and O-ring sealed for protection in tough terrain. Its high performance, high impact 6061-T6 aluminum housing adds extra durability. Water resistant to an International Protection Rating of IPX7.</p>\r\n<p><span> </span><span>INCLUDED ACCESSORIES</span> – Comes with the MAAG Magnifier, height riser, adjustment caps, and cleaning cloth.</p>\r\n<p>Specs:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mount height: absolute cowitness or lower 1/3 cowitness</li>\r\n<li>Objective lens size: 0.86 in. (22 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Magnification: 3x</li>\r\n<li>Eye relief: 2.5 in. (63.5 mm)z</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372400,75,1,174145,'<p><span>ADDED MAGNIFICATION</span> – View objects closer and clearer with the MAAG’s 3x magnification capabilities. See an extended field of view with additional eye relief of 2.5 inches.</p>\r\n<p><span>ADVANCED FLIP-TO-SIDE MOUNT AND QUICK RELEASE</span> – The included flip-to-side mount design is perfect for both absolute cowitness and lower 1/3 cowitness mount heights. This magnifier also features an integrated quick release for fast attachment.</p>\r\n<p><span> </span><span>COMPATIBLE WITH ALL RED DOT SIGHTS</span> – Use with any type of red dots for zoomed sighting. It has the capability to fit on both Weaver or Picatinny rails.</p>\r\n<p><span>DURABLE AND COMPACT</span> – Nitrogen purged and O-ring sealed for protection in tough terrain. Its high performance, high impact 6061-T6 aluminum housing adds extra durability. Water resistant to an International Protection Rating of IPX7.</p>\r\n<p><span> </span><span>INCLUDED ACCESSORIES</span> – Comes with the MAAG Magnifier, height riser, adjustment caps, and cleaning cloth.</p>\r\n<p>Specs:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mount height: absolute cowitness or lower 1/3 cowitness</li>\r\n<li>Objective lens size: 0.86 in. (22 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Magnification: 3x</li>\r\n<li>Eye relief: 2.5 in. (63.5 mm)z</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372401,76,1,174145,NULL),(372019,85,0,174145,'optics, x-vision, auto brightness, lenses, red dot sights'),(372402,85,1,174145,'optics, x-vision, auto brightness, lenses, red dot sights'),(372024,75,0,174146,'<p><span>NOTE:</span>  Some photos show the optional <a href=\"https://xvisionoptics.com/product/night-vision-ir-flashlight/\"><span>XANF100 IR Flashlight</span></a> attached.  This product is sold separately and can be purchased <a href=\"https://xvisionoptics.com/product/night-vision-ir-flashlight/\"><span>HERE</span></a>.</p>\r\n<p>With a range of 350 yards in total darkness and 700 yards in the daytime, X-Vision Optic’s XANS500 Xtreme Night Vision Scope re-defines the meaning of hunting. Featuring WiFi capabilities and a free app that allows you to not only see through the sights on your phone but capture real time photos and footage of you on the hunt. Package comes with a wrench, cloth, and USB cord.</p>\r\n<h5><span>HIGH PERFORMANCE DISTANCE RANGE.</span></h5>\r\n<p>See as far as 350 yards (320 m) in complete darkness, or up to 700 yards (640 m) during the day. Field of view at 100 yards (91 m) is 10 yards (9 m) to ensure nothing ever goes unnoticed. View animals clearly without extra external light, so you can Discover The Unseen. Built for the toughest adventures.</p>\r\n<h5><span>HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS AND ERGONOMIC DESIGN</span>.</h5>\r\n<p>Dust and water resistant to an International Protection Rating of IP52. Weighs 2.3 pounds (1.04 kg) for optimal comfort. This X-Vision Optics Xtreme Night Vision Scope is perfect for any harsh environment with its heavy-duty exterior that is durable and built to last. Package comes with a wrench, cloth, and USB cord.</p>\r\n<h5><span>LONG BATTERY LIFE FOR BOTH DAY AND NIGHT USE.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Battery life consists of long continuous use with 6 hours of performance. This X-Vision scope operates on 1 built-in rechargeable lithium battery.</p>\r\n<h5><span>REMEMBER THE ADVENTURE WITH FREE PHONE APP FOR PHOTO AND VIDEO CAPABILITY.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Take your scope into the dark of night and clearly view animals in total darkness on the free complimentary phone app. View your adventures on your phone and capture real time photos and footage of you on the hunt.</p>\r\n<h5><span>EASY TO USE FOR BOTH BEGINNERS AND PROFESSIONALS.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Owner’s manual explains straightforward operation with step by step analysis. Easy to assemble and mount the scope to a picatinny rail base. The keyboard on the scope consists of 9 buttons for optimal user control.</p>\r\n<p>Specs:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Night Time Full Dark Distance: 350 yards</li>\r\n<li>Day Time Max Distance: 700 yards</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Zoom: 4x</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Zoom: 8x</li>\r\n<li>Field of View @ 100 yards: 10 yards (H), 5 yards (V)</li>\r\n<li>Battery Type: 18650 Lithium Battery</li>\r\n<li>Battery Quantity: 1 (built-in)</li>\r\n<li>Rechargeable: Yes</li>\r\n<li>Battery Life: More than 6 hours</li>\r\n<li>Screen Size: 0.32 in</li>\r\n<li>WiFi Capable: Yes</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372409,75,1,174146,'<p><span>NOTE:</span>  Some photos show the optional <a href=\"https://xvisionoptics.com/product/night-vision-ir-flashlight/\"><span>XANF100 IR Flashlight</span></a> attached.  This product is sold separately and can be purchased <a href=\"https://xvisionoptics.com/product/night-vision-ir-flashlight/\"><span>HERE</span></a>.</p>\r\n<p>With a range of 350 yards in total darkness and 700 yards in the daytime, X-Vision Optic’s XANS500 Xtreme Night Vision Scope re-defines the meaning of hunting. Featuring WiFi capabilities and a free app that allows you to not only see through the sights on your phone but capture real time photos and footage of you on the hunt. Package comes with a wrench, cloth, and USB cord.</p>\r\n<h5><span>HIGH PERFORMANCE DISTANCE RANGE.</span></h5>\r\n<p>See as far as 350 yards (320 m) in complete darkness, or up to 700 yards (640 m) during the day. Field of view at 100 yards (91 m) is 10 yards (9 m) to ensure nothing ever goes unnoticed. View animals clearly without extra external light, so you can Discover The Unseen. Built for the toughest adventures.</p>\r\n<h5><span>HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS AND ERGONOMIC DESIGN</span>.</h5>\r\n<p>Dust and water resistant to an International Protection Rating of IP52. Weighs 2.3 pounds (1.04 kg) for optimal comfort. This X-Vision Optics Xtreme Night Vision Scope is perfect for any harsh environment with its heavy-duty exterior that is durable and built to last. Package comes with a wrench, cloth, and USB cord.</p>\r\n<h5><span>LONG BATTERY LIFE FOR BOTH DAY AND NIGHT USE.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Battery life consists of long continuous use with 6 hours of performance. This X-Vision scope operates on 1 built-in rechargeable lithium battery.</p>\r\n<h5><span>REMEMBER THE ADVENTURE WITH FREE PHONE APP FOR PHOTO AND VIDEO CAPABILITY.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Take your scope into the dark of night and clearly view animals in total darkness on the free complimentary phone app. View your adventures on your phone and capture real time photos and footage of you on the hunt.</p>\r\n<h5><span>EASY TO USE FOR BOTH BEGINNERS AND PROFESSIONALS.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Owner’s manual explains straightforward operation with step by step analysis. Easy to assemble and mount the scope to a picatinny rail base. The keyboard on the scope consists of 9 buttons for optimal user control.</p>\r\n<p>Specs:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Night Time Full Dark Distance: 350 yards</li>\r\n<li>Day Time Max Distance: 700 yards</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Zoom: 4x</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Zoom: 8x</li>\r\n<li>Field of View @ 100 yards: 10 yards (H), 5 yards (V)</li>\r\n<li>Battery Type: 18650 Lithium Battery</li>\r\n<li>Battery Quantity: 1 (built-in)</li>\r\n<li>Rechargeable: Yes</li>\r\n<li>Battery Life: More than 6 hours</li>\r\n<li>Screen Size: 0.32 in</li>\r\n<li>WiFi Capable: Yes</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372025,76,0,174146,'<p><span>With a range of 350 yards in total darkness and 700 yards in the daytime, X-Vision Optic’s XANS500 Xtreme Night Vision Scope re-defines the meaning of hunting. Featuring WiFi capabilities and a free app that allows you to not only see through the sights on your phone but capture real time photos and footage of you on the hunt. Package comes with a wrench, cloth, and USB cord.</span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span> Some photos show the optional </span><a href=\"https://xvisionoptics.com/product/night-vision-ir-flashlight/\"><span>XANF100 IR Flashlight</span></a><span> attached.  This product is sold separately and can be purchased </span><a href=\"https://xvisionoptics.com/product/night-vision-ir-flashlight/\"><span>HERE</span></a><span>.</span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>'),(372410,76,1,174146,'<p><span> Some photos show the optional </span><a href=\"https://xvisionoptics.com/product/night-vision-ir-flashlight/\"><span>XANF100 IR Flashlight</span></a><span> attached.  This product is sold separately and can be purchased </span><a href=\"https://xvisionoptics.com/product/night-vision-ir-flashlight/\"><span>HERE</span></a><span>.</span></p>'),(372026,85,0,174146,'optics, x-vision, auto brightness, lenses, red dot sights'),(372411,85,1,174146,'optics, x-vision, auto brightness, lenses, red dot sights'),(372027,75,0,174147,'<p>X-Vision Optics’ Night Vision IR Flashlight is the only tool capable of complementing our <a href=\"https://xvisionoptics.com/product/xtreme-night-vision-scope/\">Xtreme Night Vision Scope</a>. With a total darkness range of 500 yards, the XANF100 is certainly a no-brainer when it comes to boosting any IR system with an easily attachable picatinny rail that securely mounts it.</p>\r\n<h5><span>LONG DISTANCE ILLUMINATION.</span></h5>\r\n<p>See as far as 500 yards in complete darkness to make sure nothing ever goes unnoticed so you can Discover The Unseen.</p>\r\n<h5><span>HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS AND ERGONOMIC DESIGN.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Dust and water resistant to an International Protection Rating of IP52. Weighs 0.75 pounds 0.34 kg for optimal comfort. The X-Vision Optics Night Vision IR Flashlight has a picatinny rail mounting style to securely fasten to our XANS500 Scope.</p>\r\n<h5><span>LONG BATTERY LIFE.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Battery life consists of long continuous use with 4 hours of performance. This X-Vision IR Flashlight operates on a rechargeable lithium battery.</p>\r\n<h5><span>USE FOR MULTIPLE PURPOSES.</span></h5>\r\n<p>You can certainly use this flashlight for multiple purposes! Perfect for hunting, camping, wildlife observation, sightseeing, etc.</p>\r\n<p>Specs:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Night Time Full Dark Distance: 500 yards</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Style: Picatinny Rail</li>\r\n<li>Battery Type: Lithium</li>\r\n<li>Battery Quantity: 1</li>\r\n<li>Rechargeable: Yes</li>\r\n<li>Battery Life: 4 hours</li>\r\n<li>For Use With: XANS500 Scope</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372415,75,1,174147,'<p>X-Vision Optics’ Night Vision IR Flashlight is the only tool capable of complementing our <a href=\"https://xvisionoptics.com/product/xtreme-night-vision-scope/\">Xtreme Night Vision Scope</a>. With a total darkness range of 500 yards, the XANF100 is certainly a no-brainer when it comes to boosting any IR system with an easily attachable picatinny rail that securely mounts it.</p>\r\n<h5><span>LONG DISTANCE ILLUMINATION.</span></h5>\r\n<p>See as far as 500 yards in complete darkness to make sure nothing ever goes unnoticed so you can Discover The Unseen.</p>\r\n<h5><span>HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS AND ERGONOMIC DESIGN.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Dust and water resistant to an International Protection Rating of IP52. Weighs 0.75 pounds 0.34 kg for optimal comfort. The X-Vision Optics Night Vision IR Flashlight has a picatinny rail mounting style to securely fasten to our XANS500 Scope.</p>\r\n<h5><span>LONG BATTERY LIFE.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Battery life consists of long continuous use with 4 hours of performance. This X-Vision IR Flashlight operates on a rechargeable lithium battery.</p>\r\n<h5><span>USE FOR MULTIPLE PURPOSES.</span></h5>\r\n<p>You can certainly use this flashlight for multiple purposes! Perfect for hunting, camping, wildlife observation, sightseeing, etc.</p>\r\n<p>Specs:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Night Time Full Dark Distance: 500 yards</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Style: Picatinny Rail</li>\r\n<li>Battery Type: Lithium</li>\r\n<li>Battery Quantity: 1</li>\r\n<li>Rechargeable: Yes</li>\r\n<li>Battery Life: 4 hours</li>\r\n<li>For Use With: XANS500 Scope</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372028,76,0,174147,'<p><span>X-Vision Optics’ Night Vision IR Flashlight is the only tool capable of complementing our </span><a href=\"https://xvisionoptics.com/product/xtreme-night-vision-scope/\">Xtreme Night Vision Scope</a><span>.</span></p>'),(372416,76,1,174147,'<p><span>X-Vision Optics’ Night Vision IR Flashlight is the only tool capable of complementing our </span><a href=\"https://xvisionoptics.com/product/xtreme-night-vision-scope/\">Xtreme Night Vision Scope</a><span>.</span></p>'),(372029,85,0,174147,'optics, x-vision, auto brightness, lenses, red dot sights'),(372417,85,1,174147,'optics, x-vision, auto brightness, lenses, red dot sights'),(372030,75,0,174148,'<p>The XANB60 Night Vision Monocular is the pocket-sized answer for every hunter. With a 150-yard distance in total darkness and 400-yard distance in the daytime, the XANB60 outperforms others twice its size! With its rubber exterior that is durable and built to last, this monocular is perfect for any harsh environment. Package comes with a wrist strap for support and a protection case to put in when not in use.</p>\r\n<h5><span>HIGH PERFORMANCE DISTANCE RANGE.</span></h5>\r\n<p>See as far as 150 yards (137 m) in total darkness, or up to 400 yards (366 m) during the day. With maximum zoom up to 6x, you will not miss anything on your adventures. Equipped with an invisible IR LED light so you can clearly view animals or objects without extra external light. Built for the toughest adventures so you can Discover The Unseen.</p>\r\n<h5><span>HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS AND ERGONOMIC DESIGN.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Dust and water resistant to an International Protection Rating of IP52. Weighs 0.65 pounds (0.30 kg) for optimal comfort. Its ergonomic design allows you to easily focus and view a target with only one hand. The X-Vision Optics Night Vision Monocular is perfect for any harsh environment with its rubber exterior that is durable and built to last. Package comes with a wrist strap for support and a protection case to put it in when not in use.</p>\r\n<h5><span>PORTABLE AND EASY TO CARRY.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Our portable monocular easily fits in pockets! Its efficient technology allows you to comfortably hold it with one hand as you navigate rough terrain. Hunt, camp, or use for surveillance without the fear of anything holding you back.</p>\r\n<h5><span>LONG BATTERY LIFE FOR BOTH DAY AND NIGHT USE.</span></h5>\r\n<p>This night vision monocular may be low-profile, but it has a long-lasting battery life! Battery life consists of long continuous use with 9 hours of performance during the daytime or 4 hours of performance during the nighttime. This <span><a href=\"https://xvisionoptics.com/product-category/binoculars/\">X-Vision monocular</a> </span>operates on 6 AA alkaline batteries (sold separately).</p>\r\n<h5><span>EASY TO USE FOR BOTH BEGINNERS AND PROFESSIONALS.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Its ability to automatically transition from day vision to night vision means no hassle with a lens cap. 5 simple buttons for easy use. You can comfortably use this monocular with or without eyeglasses.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Specs:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Night Time Full Dark Distance: 150 yards</li>\r\n<li>Day Time Max Distance: 400 yards</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Zoom: 3x</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Zoom: 6x</li>\r\n<li>Field of View @ 100 yards: 20 yards</li>\r\n<li>Battery Type: AA</li>\r\n<li>Battery Quantity: 6</li>\r\n<li>Rechargeable: No</li>\r\n<li>Day Time Battery Life: 9 hours</li>\r\n<li>Night Time Battery Life: 4 hours</li>\r\n<li>Screen Size: 1.5 in</li>\r\n<li>Unit Size: 5.00in x 1.75in x 3.00in / 12.70cm x 4.45cm x 7.62cm (approx.)</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 0.65 pounds / 0.30 kg (approx.)</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372421,75,1,174148,'<p>The XANB60 Night Vision Monocular is the pocket-sized answer for every hunter. With a 150-yard distance in total darkness and 400-yard distance in the daytime, the XANB60 outperforms others twice its size! With its rubber exterior that is durable and built to last, this monocular is perfect for any harsh environment. Package comes with a wrist strap for support and a protection case to put in when not in use.</p>\r\n<h5><span>HIGH PERFORMANCE DISTANCE RANGE.</span></h5>\r\n<p>See as far as 150 yards (137 m) in total darkness, or up to 400 yards (366 m) during the day. With maximum zoom up to 6x, you will not miss anything on your adventures. Equipped with an invisible IR LED light so you can clearly view animals or objects without extra external light. Built for the toughest adventures so you can Discover The Unseen.</p>\r\n<h5><span>HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS AND ERGONOMIC DESIGN.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Dust and water resistant to an International Protection Rating of IP52. Weighs 0.65 pounds (0.30 kg) for optimal comfort. Its ergonomic design allows you to easily focus and view a target with only one hand. The X-Vision Optics Night Vision Monocular is perfect for any harsh environment with its rubber exterior that is durable and built to last. Package comes with a wrist strap for support and a protection case to put it in when not in use.</p>\r\n<h5><span>PORTABLE AND EASY TO CARRY.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Our portable monocular easily fits in pockets! Its efficient technology allows you to comfortably hold it with one hand as you navigate rough terrain. Hunt, camp, or use for surveillance without the fear of anything holding you back.</p>\r\n<h5><span>LONG BATTERY LIFE FOR BOTH DAY AND NIGHT USE.</span></h5>\r\n<p>This night vision monocular may be low-profile, but it has a long-lasting battery life! Battery life consists of long continuous use with 9 hours of performance during the daytime or 4 hours of performance during the nighttime. This <span><a href=\"https://xvisionoptics.com/product-category/binoculars/\">X-Vision monocular</a> </span>operates on 6 AA alkaline batteries (sold separately).</p>\r\n<h5><span>EASY TO USE FOR BOTH BEGINNERS AND PROFESSIONALS.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Its ability to automatically transition from day vision to night vision means no hassle with a lens cap. 5 simple buttons for easy use. You can comfortably use this monocular with or without eyeglasses.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Specs:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Night Time Full Dark Distance: 150 yards</li>\r\n<li>Day Time Max Distance: 400 yards</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Zoom: 3x</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Zoom: 6x</li>\r\n<li>Field of View @ 100 yards: 20 yards</li>\r\n<li>Battery Type: AA</li>\r\n<li>Battery Quantity: 6</li>\r\n<li>Rechargeable: No</li>\r\n<li>Day Time Battery Life: 9 hours</li>\r\n<li>Night Time Battery Life: 4 hours</li>\r\n<li>Screen Size: 1.5 in</li>\r\n<li>Unit Size: 5.00in x 1.75in x 3.00in / 12.70cm x 4.45cm x 7.62cm (approx.)</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 0.65 pounds / 0.30 kg (approx.)</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372031,76,0,174148,'<p><span>he XANB60 Night Vision Monocular is the pocket-sized answer for every hunter. With a 150-yard distance in total darkness and 400-yard distance in the daytime, the XANB60 outperforms others twice its size!</span></p>'),(372422,76,1,174148,'<p><span>he XANB60 Night Vision Monocular is the pocket-sized answer for every hunter. With a 150-yard distance in total darkness and 400-yard distance in the daytime, the XANB60 outperforms others twice its size!</span></p>'),(372032,85,0,174148,'optics, x-vision, auto brightness, lenses, red dot sights'),(372423,85,1,174148,'optics, x-vision, auto brightness, lenses, red dot sights'),(372033,75,0,174149,'<p>There’s no need to slow down at sundown with our XANB50 Hands-Free Deluxe Digital Night Vision Deluxe Binoculars. The electronic view finder uses 2x digital zoom to offer 400 yards of daytime observation and 200 yards in total darkness. The F1.4 aperture and IR LED enable you to capture photos and videos of the action for sharing later. The performance, dependability, and versatility of the XANB50’s will outrank others like it. Package comes with a padded neck strap, micro USB cable, and head piece accessories.</p>\r\n<h5><span>HIGH PERFORMANCE DISTANCE RANGE.</span></h5>\r\n<p>See as far as 200 yards (183 m) in complete darkness or up to 400 yards (366 m) during the day. Equipped with 3 levels of screen brightness and 4 levels of IR brightness.</p>\r\n<h5><span>HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS AND ERGONOMIC DESIGN.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Dust and water resistant to an International Protection Rating of IP52. Weighs 0.74 pounds (0.34 kg) for optimal comfort. The X-Vision Optics Deluxe Digital Night Vision Binoculars are perfect for any harsh environment with its rubber exterior that is durable and built to last. Package comes with a padded neck strap, micro USB cable, and head piece accessories.</p>\r\n<h5><span>LONG BATTERY LIFE FOR BOTH DAY AND NIGHT USE.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Battery life consists of long continuous use with 8 hours of performance during the daytime or 5 hours of performance during the nighttime. This X-Vision binocular operates with a built-in rechargeable lithium battery.</p>\r\n<h5><span>REMEMBER THE ADVENTURE WITH PHOTO AND VIDEO CAPABILITY.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Take your goggles into the dark of night and clearly capture objects in total darkness on a large viewing screen. Zoom in at multiple levels: from 3X, 4.5X, and 6X. This night vision goggle can record video and take pictures so you can show off any adventure to your friends and family.</p>\r\n<h5><span>EASY TO USE FOR BOTH BEGINNERS AND PROFESSIONALS.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Its ability to automatically transition from day vision to night vision means no hassle with a lens cap. 4 easy operating buttons for straightforward operation. The focus wheel on the bottom of the <a href=\"https://xvisionoptics.com/product-category/binoculars/\">night vision binoculars</a> adjusts the view so you can manually focus on any animal or object around you. Can comfortably view with both eyes, including the use of glasses.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Specs:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Viewfinder: EVF mode</li>\r\n<li> Aspect ratio: 4:3</li>\r\n<li>Aperture: F1.4 with adjustable aperture day and night dual mode Operation: Preview</li>\r\n<li>Night Time Full Dark Distance: 200 yards</li>\r\n<li>Day Time Max Distance: 400 yards</li>\r\n<li>Optical Lens: 3x</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Zoom: 3x</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Zoom: 6x</li>\r\n<li>Field of View @ 100 yards: 20 yards</li>\r\n<li>Photo Capability: Yes</li>\r\n<li>Video Capability: Yes</li>\r\n<li>Object lens focus: Manually adjust</li>\r\n<li>Visual angle: 10 degrees</li>\r\n<li>Luminance: IR LED / total 2W</li>\r\n<li>Photo and Video: VGA</li>\r\n<li>TFT resolution: 320 x 240</li>\r\n<li>Battery Type: Lithium</li>\r\n<li>Battery Quantity: 1 (built-in)</li>\r\n<li>Rechargeable: Yes</li>\r\n<li>Day Time Battery Life: 8 hours</li>\r\n<li>Night Time Battery Life: 5 hours</li>\r\n<li>Power Consumption: 2.5W with IR LED fully on</li>\r\n<li>Unit Size: 5.51in x 6.30in x 2.60in / 14.00cm x 16.00cm x 6.60cm (approx.)</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 0.74 pounds / 0.34 kg (approx.)</li>\r\n<li>Accessories: Head strap (detachable)</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372036,75,1,174149,'<p>There’s no need to slow down at sundown with our XANB50 Hands-Free Deluxe Digital Night Vision Deluxe Binoculars. The electronic view finder uses 2x digital zoom to offer 400 yards of daytime observation and 200 yards in total darkness. The F1.4 aperture and IR LED enable you to capture photos and videos of the action for sharing later. The performance, dependability, and versatility of the XANB50’s will outrank others like it. Package comes with a padded neck strap, micro USB cable, and head piece accessories.</p>\r\n<h5><span>HIGH PERFORMANCE DISTANCE RANGE.</span></h5>\r\n<p>See as far as 200 yards (183 m) in complete darkness or up to 400 yards (366 m) during the day. Equipped with 3 levels of screen brightness and 4 levels of IR brightness.</p>\r\n<h5><span>HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS AND ERGONOMIC DESIGN.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Dust and water resistant to an International Protection Rating of IP52. Weighs 0.74 pounds (0.34 kg) for optimal comfort. The X-Vision Optics Deluxe Digital Night Vision Binoculars are perfect for any harsh environment with its rubber exterior that is durable and built to last. Package comes with a padded neck strap, micro USB cable, and head piece accessories.</p>\r\n<h5><span>LONG BATTERY LIFE FOR BOTH DAY AND NIGHT USE.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Battery life consists of long continuous use with 8 hours of performance during the daytime or 5 hours of performance during the nighttime. This X-Vision binocular operates with a built-in rechargeable lithium battery.</p>\r\n<h5><span>REMEMBER THE ADVENTURE WITH PHOTO AND VIDEO CAPABILITY.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Take your goggles into the dark of night and clearly capture objects in total darkness on a large viewing screen. Zoom in at multiple levels: from 3X, 4.5X, and 6X. This night vision goggle can record video and take pictures so you can show off any adventure to your friends and family.</p>\r\n<h5><span>EASY TO USE FOR BOTH BEGINNERS AND PROFESSIONALS.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Its ability to automatically transition from day vision to night vision means no hassle with a lens cap. 4 easy operating buttons for straightforward operation. The focus wheel on the bottom of the <a href=\"https://xvisionoptics.com/product-category/binoculars/\">night vision binoculars</a> adjusts the view so you can manually focus on any animal or object around you. Can comfortably view with both eyes, including the use of glasses.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Specs:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Viewfinder: EVF mode</li>\r\n<li> Aspect ratio: 4:3</li>\r\n<li>Aperture: F1.4 with adjustable aperture day and night dual mode Operation: Preview</li>\r\n<li>Night Time Full Dark Distance: 200 yards</li>\r\n<li>Day Time Max Distance: 400 yards</li>\r\n<li>Optical Lens: 3x</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Zoom: 3x</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Zoom: 6x</li>\r\n<li>Field of View @ 100 yards: 20 yards</li>\r\n<li>Photo Capability: Yes</li>\r\n<li>Video Capability: Yes</li>\r\n<li>Object lens focus: Manually adjust</li>\r\n<li>Visual angle: 10 degrees</li>\r\n<li>Luminance: IR LED / total 2W</li>\r\n<li>Photo and Video: VGA</li>\r\n<li>TFT resolution: 320 x 240</li>\r\n<li>Battery Type: Lithium</li>\r\n<li>Battery Quantity: 1 (built-in)</li>\r\n<li>Rechargeable: Yes</li>\r\n<li>Day Time Battery Life: 8 hours</li>\r\n<li>Night Time Battery Life: 5 hours</li>\r\n<li>Power Consumption: 2.5W with IR LED fully on</li>\r\n<li>Unit Size: 5.51in x 6.30in x 2.60in / 14.00cm x 16.00cm x 6.60cm (approx.)</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 0.74 pounds / 0.34 kg (approx.)</li>\r\n<li>Accessories: Head strap (detachable)</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372034,76,0,174149,'<p><span>There’s no need to slow down at sundown with our XANB50 Hands-Free Deluxe Digital Night Vision Deluxe Binoculars.</span></p>'),(372037,76,1,174149,'<p><span>There’s no need to slow down at sundown with our XANB50 Hands-Free Deluxe Digital Night Vision Deluxe Binoculars.</span></p>'),(372035,85,0,174149,'optics, x-vision, auto brightness, lenses, red dot sights'),(372038,85,1,174149,'optics, x-vision, auto brightness, lenses, red dot sights'),(372039,75,0,174150,'<p>With a range of 500 yards during the day and 300 yards in total darkness, X-Vision Optics’ Xtrem