ight vision goggle has the ability to record video and take pictures with a Micro SD card (4GB to 32GB sold separately) to transfer onto your computer for later viewing.</p>\r\n<h5><span>EASY TO USE FOR BOTH BEGINNERS AND PROFESSIONALS.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Its ability to automatically transition from day vision to night vision means no hassle with a lens cap. 6 simple buttons for easy use. The focus wheel on the bottom of the <a href=\"https://xvisionoptics.com/product-category/binoculars/\">night vision binocular</a> adjusts the view so you can clearly focus on any animal or object around you. Can comfortably view with both eyes, including the use of glasses</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Specs:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Night Time Full Dark Distance: 300 yards</li>\r\n<li>Day Time Max Distance: 500 yards</li>\r\n<li>Optical Lens: 3x</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Zoom: 3x</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Zoom: 6x</li>\r\n<li>Field of View @ 100 yards: 20 yards</li>\r\n<li>Photo Capability: Yes</li>\r\n<li>Video Capability: Yes</li>\r\n<li>Battery Type: AA</li>\r\n<li>Battery Quantity: 8</li>\r\n<li>Rechargeable: No</li>\r\n<li>Day Time Battery Life: 10 hours</li>\r\n<li>Night Time Battery Life: 6 hours</li>\r\n<li>Screen Size: 2 inch</li>\r\n<li>Unit Size: 6.30in x 5.90in x 2.70in / 16.00cm x 15.00cm x 6.80cm (approx.)</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 1 pound / 0.45 kg (approx.)</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372596,75,1,174150,'<p>With a range of 500 yards during the day and 300 yards in total darkness, X-Vision Optics’ Xtreme Night Vision Binoculars are changing the way we see the world one binocular at a time. With the capabilities to take pictures and record videos, the XANB35 is perfect for hunting, recreation, spectator sports and everything in between. Package comes with a padded neck strap for support and a protection case to put in when not in use.</p>\r\n<h5><span>HIGH PERFORMANCE DISTANCE RANGE.</span></h5>\r\n<p>IR LED allows you to view up to 300 yards (274 m) in complete darkness. View up to 500 yards (457 m) during th