ke your goggles into the dark of night and clearly capture objects in total darkness on a large widescreen display. Zoom in at multiple levels: 3x all the way up to 6x.</p>\r\n<h5><span>EASY TO USE FOR BOTH BEGINNERS AND PROFESSIONALS.</span></h5>\r\n<p>3 simple buttons for straightforward operation. The focus wheel on the bottom of the <a href=\"https://xvisionoptics.com/product-category/binoculars/\">night vision binoculars</a> adjusts the view so you can manually focus on any animal or object around you. Has a clear widescreen display so you can easily view with both eyes, including the use of glasses.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Specs:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Viewfinder: EVF mode</li>\r\n<li>Aspect ratio: 4:3</li>\r\n<li>Aperture: F1.4 with adjustable aperture day and night dual mode Operation: Preview</li>\r\n<li>Night Time Full Dark Distance: 150 yards</li>\r\n<li>Day Time Max Distance: 400 yards</li>\r\n<li>Optical Lens: 3x</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Zoom: 3x</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Zoom: 6x</li>\r\n<li>Field of View @ 100 yards: 20 yards</li>\r\n<li>Object lens focus: Manually adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Visual Angle: 10 degrees</li>\r\n<li>Luminance: IR LED / total 1W</li>\r\n<li>Battery Type: Alkaline AA</li>\r\n<li>Battery Quantity: 8</li>\r\n<li>Rechargeable: No</li>\r\n<li>Power Consumption: 1.5W with IR LED fully on</li>\r\n<li>Day Time Battery Life: 10 hours</li>\r\n<li>Night Time Battery Life: 6 hours</li>\r\n<li>Unit Size: 7.25in x 5.50in x 2.00in / 18.42cm x 13.97cm x 5.08cm (approx.)</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 1.33 pounds / 0.60 kg (approx.)</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372046,76,0,174152,'<p><span>The X-Vision Optics XANB20 night vision binoculars are the affordable yet effective way to see in the dark. </span></p>'),(372603,76,1,174152,'<p><span>The X-Vision Optics XANB20 night vision binoculars are the affordable yet effective way to see in the dark. </span></p>'),(372047,85,0,174152,'optics, x-vision, auto brightness, lenses, red dot sights'),(372604,85,1,174152,'optics, x-vision, auto brightness, lenses, red dot sights'),(372048,75,0,174153,'<p>The XANR100 Night Vision Rangefinder is every hunter’s new best friend. With a 6x zoom, total darkness distance of 150 yards, rangefinding capability up to 200 yards, and daytime distance of 400 yards, the XANR100 opens the door for every kind of adventure at any time of the day with its unique trio of technology. Package comes with a wrist strap for support and a protection case to put in when not in use.</p>\r\n<h5><span>A UNIQUE TRIO OF TECHNOLOGY.</span></h5>\r\n<p>This X-Vision Optics monocular combines the premium technology of range finding, night vision, and magnification all into one powerful device.</p>\r\n<h5><span>HIGH PERFORMANCE DISTANCE RANGE.</span></h5>\r\n<p>See as far as 150 yards (137 m) in total darkness, or up to 400 yards (366 m) during the day. Range finding distance is up to 200 yards (183 m) to ensure nothing goes unnoticed. 6x maximum zoom capability provides vivid images throughout your toughest adventures. The slope angle auto adjusts up to 80 degrees up and down. Discover The Unseen by viewing animals or objects clearly without extra external light.</p>\r\n<h5><span>HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS AND ERGONOMIC DESIGN.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Dust and water resistant to an International Protection Rating of IP52. Weighs 0.5 pounds (0.23 kg) for optimal comfort. This X-Vision Optics Rangefinder is perfect for any harsh environment with its tough exterior that is durable and built to last. Package comes with a wrist strap for support and a protection case to put it in when not in use.</p>\r\n<h5><span>LONG BATTERY LIFE FOR BOTH DAY AND NIGHT USE.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Battery life consists of continuous use with 9 hours of performance during the daytime or 4 hours of performance during the nighttime. If the rangefinder is not in use for more than 5 minutes, it will automatically shut off to conserve battery power. This X-Vision <a href=\"https://xvisionoptics.com/product-category/rangefinders/\">night vision rangefinder</a> operators on 6 AA batteries (sold separately).</p>\r\n<h5><span>EASY TO USE FOR BOTH BEGINNERS AND PROFESSIONALS.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Its ability to automatically transition from day vision to night vision means no hassle with a lens cap. 4 simple buttons for straightforward operation. You can comfortably use this monocular with or without eyeglasses. Its efficient technology allows you to comfortably hold it with one hand as you navigate rough terrain. Use for a variety of activities, from hiking, archery, bow hunting, and more!</p>\r\n<p>Specs:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Night Time Full Dark Distance: 150 yards</li>\r\n<li>Day Time Max Distance: 400 yards</li>\r\n<li>Range Finding Distance: 200 yards</li>\r\n<li>Optical Lens: 3x</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Zoom: 3x</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Zoom: 6x</li>\r\n<li>Field of View @ 100 yards: 20 yards</li>\r\n<li>Battery Type: AA</li>\r\n<li>Battery Quantity: 6</li>\r\n<li>Rechargeable: No</li>\r\n<li>Day Time Battery Life: 9 hours</li>\r\n<li>Night Time Battery Life: 4 hours</li>\r\n<li>Screen Size: 1.5in</li>\r\n<li>Unit Size: 5.20in x 2.20in x 3.50in / 13.20cm x 5.60cm x 9.00cm (approx.)</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 0.5 pounds / 0.23 kg (approx.)</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372614,75,1,174153,'<p>The XANR100 Night Vision Rangefinder is every hunter’s new best friend. With a 6x zoom, total darkness distance of 150 yards, rangefinding capability up to 200 yards, and daytime distance of 400 yards, the XANR100 opens the door for every kind of adventure at any time of the day with its unique trio of technology. Package comes with a wrist strap for support and a protection case to put in when not in use.</p>\r\n<h5><span>A UNIQUE TRIO OF TECHNOLOGY.</span></h5>\r\n<p>This X-Vision Optics monocular combines the premium technology of range finding, night vision, and magnification all into one powerful device.</p>\r\n<h5><span>HIGH PERFORMANCE DISTANCE RANGE.</span></h5>\r\n<p>See as far as 150 yards (137 m) in total darkness, or up to 400 yards (366 m) during the day. Range finding distance is up to 200 yards (183 m) to ensure nothing goes unnoticed. 6x maximum zoom capability provides vivid images throughout your toughest adventures. The slope angle auto adjusts up to 80 degrees up and down. Discover The Unseen by viewing animals or objects clearly without extra external light.</p>\r\n<h5><span>HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS AND ERGONOMIC DESIGN.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Dust and water resistant to an International Protection Rating of IP52. Weighs 0.5 pounds (0.23 kg) for optimal comfort. This X-Vision Optics Rangefinder is perfect for any harsh environment with its tough exterior that is durable and built to last. Package comes with a wrist strap for support and a protection case to put it in when not in use.</p>\r\n<h5><span>LONG BATTERY LIFE FOR BOTH DAY AND NIGHT USE.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Battery life consists of continuous use with 9 hours of performance during the daytime or 4 hours of performance during the nighttime. If the rangefinder is not in use for more than 5 minutes, it will automatically shut off to conserve battery power. This X-Vision <a href=\"https://xvisionoptics.com/product-category/rangefinders/\">night vision rangefinder</a> operators on 6 AA batteries (sold separately).</p>\r\n<h5><span>EASY TO USE FOR BOTH BEGINNERS AND PROFESSIONALS.</span></h5>\r\n<p>Its ability to automatically transition from day vision to night vision means no hassle with a lens cap. 4 simple buttons for straightforward operation. You can comfortably use this monocular with or without eyeglasses. Its efficient technology allows you to comfortably hold it with one hand as you navigate rough terrain. Use for a variety of activities, from hiking, archery, bow hunting, and more!</p>\r\n<p>Specs:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Night Time Full Dark Distance: 150 yards</li>\r\n<li>Day Time Max Distance: 400 yards</li>\r\n<li>Range Finding Distance: 200 yards</li>\r\n<li>Optical Lens: 3x</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Zoom: 3x</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Zoom: 6x</li>\r\n<li>Field of View @ 100 yards: 20 yards</li>\r\n<li>Battery Type: AA</li>\r\n<li>Battery Quantity: 6</li>\r\n<li>Rechargeable: No</li>\r\n<li>Day Time Battery Life: 9 hours</li>\r\n<li>Night Time Battery Life: 4 hours</li>\r\n<li>Screen Size: 1.5in</li>\r\n<li>Unit Size: 5.20in x 2.20in x 3.50in / 13.20cm x 5.60cm x 9.00cm (approx.)</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 0.5 pounds / 0.23 kg (approx.)</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372049,76,0,174153,'<p><span>The XANR100 Night Vision Rangefinder is every hunter’s new best friend. With a 6x zoom, total darkness distance of 150 yards, rangefinding capability up to 200 yards, and daytime distance of 400 yards, the XANR100 opens the door for every kind of adventure at any time of the day with its unique trio of technology.</span></p>'),(372615,76,1,174153,'<p><span>The XANR100 Night Vision Rangefinder is every hunter’s new best friend. With a 6x zoom, total darkness distance of 150 yards, rangefinding capability up to 200 yards, and daytime distance of 400 yards, the XANR100 opens the door for every kind of adventure at any time of the day with its unique trio of technology.</span></p>'),(372050,85,0,174153,'optics, x-vision, auto brightness, lenses, red dot sights'),(372616,85,1,174153,'optics, x-vision, auto brightness, lenses, red dot sights'),(372051,75,0,174154,'<p><span>QUICK TARGET ACQUISITION</span> – A 1.26in (32mm) objective lens provides for quick target acquisition. The PSRD1 provides perceive accuracy at an extended range with its 4x magnification capability. Its mount height of 1.48in (37.5mm) absolute cowitness makes this scope perfect for any type of platform.</p>\r\n<p><span>TRI-COLOR RETICLE</span> – Equipped with a tri-color (red, green, and blue) mil-dot reticle with adjustable brightness control.</p>\r\n<p><span>MULTI-COATED LENS</span> – Features a multi-coated lens for pristine optical clarity.</p>\r\n<p><span>DURABLE AND COMPACT</span> – Sealed design for 100% fog-proof and waterproof protection.</p>\r\n<p><span>INCLUDED ACCESSORIES</span> – Comes with the PSRD1 scope, CR2032 battery, protective lens covers, cleaning cloth, and hex wrench.</p>'),(372617,75,1,174154,'<p><span>QUICK TARGET ACQUISITION</span> – A 1.26in (32mm) objective lens provides for quick target acquisition. The PSRD1 provides perceive accuracy at an extended range with its 4x magnification capability. Its mount height of 1.48in (37.5mm) absolute cowitness makes this scope perfect for any type of platform.</p>\r\n<p><span>TRI-COLOR RETICLE</span> – Equipped with a tri-color (red, green, and blue) mil-dot reticle with adjustable brightness control.</p>\r\n<p><span>MULTI-COATED LENS</span> – Features a multi-coated lens for pristine optical clarity.</p>\r\n<p><span>DURABLE AND COMPACT</span> – Sealed design for 100% fog-proof and waterproof protection.</p>\r\n<p><span>INCLUDED ACCESSORIES</span> – Comes with the PSRD1 scope, CR2032 battery, protective lens covers, cleaning cloth, and hex wrench.</p>'),(372052,76,0,174154,'<p><span>A 1.26in (32mm) objective lens provides for quick target acquisition.</span></p>'),(372618,76,1,174154,'<p><span>A 1.26in (32mm) objective lens provides for quick target acquisition.</span></p>'),(372053,85,0,174154,'optics, x-vision, auto brightness, lenses, red dot sights'),(372619,85,1,174154,'optics, x-vision, auto brightness, lenses, red dot sights'),(372054,75,0,174155,'<p><span>The Original PEET Dryer provides safe, silent and energy-efficient operation so that you can leave it plugged in all the time, 24 hours a day, 7 days a week. It uses convection technology to push slightly warmed air through our specially designed AirChambers and DryPorts to quickly and quietly dry your footwear or gear. The Original PEET Dryer is ideal for drying shoes, boots and athletic and hunting footwear, as well as your outdoor gear. The sturdy base easily plugs into any standard 110-120 volt US household current and is available in 220-volt electrical configurations (New Zealand, United Kingdom and Europe). This product is proudly made in the USA. Dry Responsibly with Peet.</span></p>'),(372055,75,0,174156,'<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Geissele Automatics, 556/223 Caliber Reaction Rod, Black Finish</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Allows Torque from Barrel Nut Wrenches to go Directly into the Barrel Extension</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Prevents Marring of Finish</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">4140 Chrome Moly steel</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: $99.00</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MAP: $99.00</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>The 556/223 Caliber Reaction Rod makes the removal and installation of barrels, flash hiders, gas blocks and hand guards much easier and simpler. The Reaction Rod is designed to be gripped in a bench vise so that the rod is either horizontal or vertical. The upper receiver is then slid onto the rod and the rod\'s integral splines enter the barrel extension and secure the barrel extension from turning. This allows all the torque from barrel nut wrenches to go directly into the barrel extension. In contrast, receiver vise blocks transmit the turning force into the aluminum receiver, a good part of which passes through the small, easily distorted receiver index pin. With the Geissele Reaction Rod, marring of an upper receiver\'s finish by gripping and twisting inside vise blocks is eliminated and so is the need to remove sights and mounts from the receiver\'s M1913 rail.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(372058,75,1,174156,'<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Geissele Automatics, 556/223 Caliber Reaction Rod, Black Finish</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Allows Torque from Barrel Nut Wrenches to go Directly into the Barrel Extension</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Prevents Marring of Finish</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">4140 Chrome Moly steel</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: $99.00</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MAP: $99.00</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>The 556/223 Caliber Reaction Rod makes the removal and installation of barrels, flash hiders, gas blocks and hand guards much easier and simpler. The Reaction Rod is designed to be gripped in a bench vise so that the rod is either horizontal or vertical. The upper receiver is then slid onto the rod and the rod\'s integral splines enter the barrel extension and secure the barrel extension from turning. This allows all the torque from barrel nut wrenches to go directly into the barrel extension. In contrast, receiver vise blocks transmit the turning force into the aluminum receiver, a good part of which passes through the small, easily distorted receiver index pin. With the Geissele Reaction Rod, marring of an upper receiver\'s finish by gripping and twisting inside vise blocks is eliminated and so is the need to remove sights and mounts from the receiver\'s M1913 rail.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(372056,76,0,174156,'<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Geissele Automatics, 556/223 Caliber Reaction Rod, Black Finish</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Allows Torque from Barrel Nut Wrenches to go Directly into the Barrel Extension</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Prevents Marring of Finish</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">4140 Chrome Moly steel</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: $99.00</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MAP: $99.00</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>The 556/223 Caliber Reaction Rod makes the removal and installation of barrels, flash hiders, gas blocks and hand guards much easier and simpler. The Reaction Rod is designed to be gripped in a bench vise so that the rod is either horizontal or vertical. The upper receiver is then slid onto the rod and the rod\'s integral splines enter the barrel extension and secure the barrel extension from turning. This allows all the torque from barrel nut wrenches to go directly into the barrel extension. In contrast, receiver vise blocks transmit the turning force into the aluminum receiver, a good part of which passes through the small, easily distorted receiver index pin. With the Geissele Reaction Rod, marring of an upper receiver\'s finish by gripping and twisting inside vise blocks is eliminated and so is the need to remove sights and mounts from the receiver\'s M1913 rail.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(372059,76,1,174156,'<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Geissele Automatics, 556/223 Caliber Reaction Rod, Black Finish</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Allows Torque from Barrel Nut Wrenches to go Directly into the Barrel Extension</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Prevents Marring of Finish</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">4140 Chrome Moly steel</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MSRP: $99.00</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MAP: $99.00</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>The 556/223 Caliber Reaction Rod makes the removal and installation of barrels, flash hiders, gas blocks and hand guards much easier and simpler. The Reaction Rod is designed to be gripped in a bench vise so that the rod is either horizontal or vertical. The upper receiver is then slid onto the rod and the rod\'s integral splines enter the barrel extension and secure the barrel extension from turning. This allows all the torque from barrel nut wrenches to go directly into the barrel extension. In contrast, receiver vise blocks transmit the turning force into the aluminum receiver, a good part of which passes through the small, easily distorted receiver index pin. With the Geissele Reaction Rod, marring of an upper receiver\'s finish by gripping and twisting inside vise blocks is eliminated and so is the need to remove sights and mounts from the receiver\'s M1913 rail.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(372057,85,0,174156,'Geissele AR-15 Reaction Rod, PN 10-169'),(372060,85,1,174156,'Geissele AR-15 Reaction Rod, PN 10-169'),(372084,75,0,174159,'<p>1603iS-2C/4782 Two Barrel Over and Under Shotgun case (1 Gun/2 Barrel). The 1603iS-2C/4782 case is made of durable injection-molded polypropylene. The double-wall construction of the 1603i-2C consists of an outer case welded to a thermoformed inner case, finished with plush velvet padded cushioning. The Negrini 1603iS-2C’s double-wall construction absorbs maximum shock without breaking while protecting the contents of the case. The interior is designed with separate compartments for the barrel and forearm, stock and receiver, chokes and tools. The 1603i-2C shotgun case fits an Over/Under shotgun with two barrels up to 36″. Finished with a Limited Lifetime Warranty.</p>\r\n<p>For any type of shotgun Browning, Winchester, Guerini, Beretta, Benelli &amp; Remington Two Barrel Flat Rib shotguns.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span>Flat Rib Barrels Only</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Color:</span> Black/Bordeaux Interior</li>\r\n<li>Recommended for Car/Club &amp; Home</li>\r\n<li>NOT recommended for Air Travel</li>\r\n<li>Combination locks for security</li>\r\n</ul>'),(373425,75,1,174159,'<p>1603iS-2C/4782 Two Barrel Over and Under Shotgun case (1 Gun/2 Barrel). The 1603iS-2C/4782 case is made of durable injection-molded polypropylene. The double-wall construction of the 1603i-2C consists of an outer case welded to a thermoformed inner case, finished with plush velvet padded cushioning. The Negrini 1603iS-2C’s double-wall construction absorbs maximum shock without breaking while protecting the contents of the case. The interior is designed with separate compartments for the barrel and forearm, stock and receiver, chokes and tools. The 1603i-2C shotgun case fits an Over/Under shotgun with two barrels up to 36″. Finished with a Limited Lifetime Warranty.</p>\r\n<p>For any type of shotgun Browning, Winchester, Guerini, Beretta, Benelli &amp; Remington Two Barrel Flat Rib shotguns.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span>Flat Rib Barrels Only</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Color:</span> Black/Bordeaux Interior</li>\r\n<li>Recommended for Car/Club &amp; Home</li>\r\n<li>NOT recommended for Air Travel</li>\r\n<li>Combination locks for security</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372085,76,0,174159,'<p><span>Fits: </span><span>Over and Under</span><br /><span>Rib:</span><span> Flat Rib Only</span><br /><span>Color: </span><span>Black/Bordeaux Int.</span></p>'),(373426,76,1,174159,'<p><span>Fits: </span><span>Over and Under</span><br /><span>Rib:</span><span> Flat Rib Only</span><br /><span>Color: </span><span>Black/Bordeaux Int.</span></p>'),(372086,85,0,174159,'Negrini Cases Two Barrel Over and Under Shotgun case 1603iS-2C/4782, negrini cases, shotgun cases, negrini, o/u storage, everest, everest.com'),(373427,85,1,174159,'Negrini Cases Two Barrel Over and Under Shotgun case 1603iS-2C/4782, negrini cases, shotgun cases, negrini, o/u storage, everest, everest.com'),(372087,75,0,174160,'<p>SIG SAUER® Luxury Custom Shop Case – 2018LXX/5996</p>\r\n<p>Officially licensed SIG SAUER® cases from the Negrini Custom Shop. All are handmade by Negrini of Italy. Each case is manufactured from state-of-the-art two-layer composite and hand upholstered in the best materials. 100% made in Italy with TSA compliant steel security locks.</p>\r\n<p>2018LXX Luxury Case Features</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Fits all SIG Sauer P320, P226, P229, P220, and M17 pistols</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Padded velvet interior</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>ROMEO1 Reflex Sight Compatible</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>LXX Italian leather trim</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Double-wall ABS composite technology</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>TSA Compliant steel combination locks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Removable foam spacers to enhance fit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Limited Lifetime Warranty</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Fits:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>P320 – X-Series, M17, M18, full size, carry size, and compact size.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>P226</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>MK25</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>P229</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>P228</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>P220 (not intended for 220 Compact)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>M17 PROFORCE / P225 / P225-A1 / P227 / P250 / MK25</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372090,75,1,174160,'<p>SIG SAUER® Luxury Custom Shop Case – 2018LXX/5996</p>\r\n<p>Officially licensed SIG SAUER® cases from the Negrini Custom Shop. All are handmade by Negrini of Italy. Each case is manufactured from state-of-the-art two-layer composite and hand upholstered in the best materials. 100% made in Italy with TSA compliant steel security locks.</p>\r\n<p>2018LXX Luxury Case Features</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Fits all SIG Sauer P320, P226, P229, P220, and M17 pistols</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Padded velvet interior</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>ROMEO1 Reflex Sight Compatible</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>LXX Italian leather trim</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Double-wall ABS composite technology</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>TSA Compliant steel combination locks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Removable foam spacers to enhance fit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Limited Lifetime Warranty</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Fits:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>P320 – X-Series, M17, M18, full size, carry size, and compact size.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>P226</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>MK25</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>P229</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>P228</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>P220 (not intended for 220 Compact)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>M17 PROFORCE / P225 / P225-A1 / P227 / P250 / MK25</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372088,76,0,174160,'<p><span>Officially licensed SIG SAUER® cases from the Negrini Custom Shop. All are handmade by Negrini of Italy. Each case is manufactured from state-of-the-art two-layer composite and hand upholstered in the best materials.</span></p>'),(372091,76,1,174160,'<p><span>Officially licensed SIG SAUER® cases from the Negrini Custom Shop. All are handmade by Negrini of Italy. Each case is manufactured from state-of-the-art two-layer composite and hand upholstered in the best materials.</span></p>'),(372089,85,0,174160,'SIG SAUER® Luxury Custom Shop Case – 2018LXX/5996, negrini cases, sig sauer pistol cases, pistol cases, handgun case, handgun storage, negrini, everest, everest.com'),(372092,85,1,174160,'SIG SAUER® Luxury Custom Shop Case – 2018LXX/5996, negrini cases, sig sauer pistol cases, pistol cases, handgun case, handgun storage, negrini, everest, everest.com'),(372093,75,0,174161,'<p>SIG SAUER Super Deluxe Custom Shop Case – 2018LXCS/5995</p>\r\n<p>Officially licensed SIG SAUER® cases from the Negrini Custom Shop. <span>Negrini teamed-up with the engineers at SIG SAUER to create the ultimate case for their pistols. The high-grade cases are the result of intense study by Negrini and SIG SAUER. Designed and manufactured by Negrini specifically to secure SIG SAUER P320, 226, 229, 220, and M17 handguns in world-class professional cases.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>The SIG SAUER Custom Shop Professional Series Cases are hand-formed of patented double-wall composite construction and secured with steel hinges and special German combination locks. Each case is then hand finished and upholstered with the finest fabric, cushioning and leather available. As a result, the SIG SAUER Professional Series Cases are ultra-strong, light in weight, and handsome in appearance, unlike typical pistol cases. The internal compartments of each case can be adjusted for the barrel length and will accommodate the Sig Romeo reflex sight and extra magazines. Each case is <em>100% MADE IN ITALY</em>.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>The SIG SAUER Custom Shop Professional Series Cases can be used to confidently secure SIG SAUER handguns at home, carry to the range, or for air travel. Each case is backed by the well-known INTELCASE customer service and Limited Lifetime warranty.</span></p>\r\n<p>2018LXCS Super Deluxe FEATURES</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Fits all SIG Sauer P320, P226, P229, P220, and M17 pistols</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Hand-stitched luxury velvet interior</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Best Italian leather trim and handle</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>ROMEO1 Reflex Sight Compatible</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Double-wall ABS composite technology</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>TSA Compliant steel combination locks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Inside document pocket</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Removable foam spacers to enhance fit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Limited Lifetime Warranty</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Fits:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>P320 – X-Series, M17, M18, full size, carry size, and compact size.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>P226</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>MK25</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>P229</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>P228</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>P220 (not intended for 220 Compact)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>M17 PROFORCE / P225 / P225-A1 / P227 / P250 / MK25</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p id=\"gap-1306409758\" class=\"gap-element clearfix\"></p>\r\n<p class=\"is-divider divider clearfix\"></p>\r\n<p><span>Registered trademarks of SIG SAUER Inc. are used under license by INTELCASE Company.</span></p>'),(372099,75,1,174161,'<p>SIG SAUER Super Deluxe Custom Shop Case – 2018LXCS/5995</p>\r\n<p>Officially licensed SIG SAUER® cases from the Negrini Custom Shop. <span>Negrini teamed-up with the engineers at SIG SAUER to create the ultimate case for their pistols. The high-grade cases are the result of intense study by Negrini and SIG SAUER. Designed and manufactured by Negrini specifically to secure SIG SAUER P320, 226, 229, 220, and M17 handguns in world-class professional cases.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>The SIG SAUER Custom Shop Professional Series Cases are hand-formed of patented double-wall composite construction and secured with steel hinges and special German combination locks. Each case is then hand finished and upholstered with the finest fabric, cushioning and leather available. As a result, the SIG SAUER Professional Series Cases are ultra-strong, light in weight, and handsome in appearance, unlike typical pistol cases. The internal compartments of each case can be adjusted for the barrel length and will accommodate the Sig Romeo reflex sight and extra magazines. Each case is <em>100% MADE IN ITALY</em>.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>The SIG SAUER Custom Shop Professional Series Cases can be used to confidently secure SIG SAUER handguns at home, carry to the range, or for air travel. Each case is backed by the well-known INTELCASE customer service and Limited Lifetime warranty.</span></p>\r\n<p>2018LXCS Super Deluxe FEATURES</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Fits all SIG Sauer P320, P226, P229, P220, and M17 pistols</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Hand-stitched luxury velvet interior</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Best Italian leather trim and handle</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>ROMEO1 Reflex Sight Compatible</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Double-wall ABS composite technology</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>TSA Compliant steel combination locks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Inside document pocket</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Removable foam spacers to enhance fit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Limited Lifetime Warranty</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Fits:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>P320 – X-Series, M17, M18, full size, carry size, and compact size.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>P226</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>MK25</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>P229</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>P228</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>P220 (not intended for 220 Compact)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>M17 PROFORCE / P225 / P225-A1 / P227 / P250 / MK25</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p id=\"gap-1306409758\" class=\"gap-element clearfix\"></p>\r\n<p class=\"is-divider divider clearfix\"></p>\r\n<p><span>Registered trademarks of SIG SAUER Inc. are used under license by INTELCASE Company.</span></p>'),(372094,76,0,174161,'<p><span>Fits:</span><span> SIG SAUER P320, P226, P229, P220, and M17 pistols</span><br /><span>Color:</span><span> Black/Black Leather Trim</span></p>'),(372100,76,1,174161,'<p><span>Fits:</span><span> SIG SAUER P320, P226, P229, P220, and M17 pistols</span><br /><span>Color:</span><span> Black/Black Leather Trim</span></p>'),(372095,85,0,174161,'SIG SAUER Super Deluxe Custom Shop Negrini Case – 2018LXCS/5995, sig sauer cases, negrini, everest, everest.com, '),(372101,85,1,174161,'SIG SAUER Super Deluxe Custom Shop Negrini Case – 2018LXCS/5995, sig sauer cases, negrini, everest, everest.com, '),(372096,75,0,174162,'<p>Negrini Model 1911 Wood Handgun Case – 2018SLX-WOOD/5369</p>\r\n<p>Like the popular 2018SR/5126 Dedicated Model 1911 handgun case, the deluxe wood finish brings this case to the next level of luxury. Features an internal compartment holding a 1911 style handgun and 2 single stack magazines. The handgun case also adapts to different barrel lengths. The 2018SLX-WOOD/5369 handgun case is designed to protect the pistol in transit, whether it is from home and to the range or on a plane coast to coast.</p>\r\n<p>Since most 1911 shooters have multiple magazines and accessories, the case is designed with that in mind. Fitted compartments for the pistol magazines and other accessories. As with all Negrini cases, the new Dedicated 1911 gun cases hold more than it appears from the outside. This storage space engineering is one of the things that sets Negrini apart from other cases.</p>\r\n<p>Produced using Negrini’s patented double-wall ABS construction for high strength coupled with sleek Italian design. Each case has two travel secure steel combination locks for security and a limited lifetime warranty.</p>\r\n<p><img class=\"size-full wp-image-19075 alignright lazyloaded\" src=\"https://360p9pogrstqp3pq16kp6r5e-wpengine.netdna-ssl.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/10/icon-lifetime-security-iata.png\" sizes=\"(max-width: 284px) 100vw, 284px\" srcset=\"https://360p9pogrstqp3pq16kp6r5e-wpengine.netdna-ssl.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/10/icon-lifetime-security-iata.png 284w, https://360p9pogrstqp3pq16kp6r5e-wpengine.netdna-ssl.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/10/icon-lifetime-security-iata-31x9.png 31w, https://360p9pogrstqp3pq16kp6r5e-wpengine.netdna-ssl.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/10/icon-lifetime-security-iata-32x10.png 32w\" alt=\"Gun Cases - Limited Lifetime Warranty - Safety System - IATA Approved\" width=\"284\" height=\"86\" data-ll-status=\"loaded\" /></p>\r\n<p>As with most Negrini cases, customers can choose many finish options from standard to full leather. Contact us if you have a special request.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>SLX-WOOD – Italian leather trim &amp; handle with faux wood ABS interior</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Italian leather trim on interior compartments</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Velvet padded top and velvet padded inserts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Two hardened steel combination locks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span>Fits 1911 size:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>All Government Sizes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Commander Size (with full-size frame)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Will fit smaller Compact (with modifications)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372685,75,1,174162,'<p>Negrini Model 1911 Wood Handgun Case – 2018SLX-WOOD/5369</p>\r\n<p>Like the popular 2018SR/5126 Dedicated Model 1911 handgun case, the deluxe wood finish brings this case to the next level of luxury. Features an internal compartment holding a 1911 style handgun and 2 single stack magazines. The handgun case also adapts to different barrel lengths. The 2018SLX-WOOD/5369 handgun case is designed to protect the pistol in transit, whether it is from home and to the range or on a plane coast to coast.</p>\r\n<p>Since most 1911 shooters have multiple magazines and accessories, the case is designed with that in mind. Fitted compartments for the pistol magazines and other accessories. As with all Negrini cases, the new Dedicated 1911 gun cases hold more than it appears from the outside. This storage space engineering is one of the things that sets Negrini apart from other cases.</p>\r\n<p>Produced using Negrini’s patented double-wall ABS construction for high strength coupled with sleek Italian design. Each case has two travel secure steel combination locks for security and a limited lifetime warranty.</p>\r\n<p><img class=\"size-full wp-image-19075 alignright lazyloaded\" src=\"https://360p9pogrstqp3pq16kp6r5e-wpengine.netdna-ssl.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/10/icon-lifetime-security-iata.png\" sizes=\"(max-width: 284px) 100vw, 284px\" srcset=\"https://360p9pogrstqp3pq16kp6r5e-wpengine.netdna-ssl.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/10/icon-lifetime-security-iata.png 284w, https://360p9pogrstqp3pq16kp6r5e-wpengine.netdna-ssl.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/10/icon-lifetime-security-iata-31x9.png 31w, https://360p9pogrstqp3pq16kp6r5e-wpengine.netdna-ssl.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/10/icon-lifetime-security-iata-32x10.png 32w\" alt=\"Gun Cases - Limited Lifetime Warranty - Safety System - IATA Approved\" width=\"284\" height=\"86\" data-ll-status=\"loaded\" /></p>\r\n<p>As with most Negrini cases, customers can choose many finish options from standard to full leather. Contact us if you have a special request.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>SLX-WOOD – Italian leather trim &amp; handle with faux wood ABS interior</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Italian leather trim on interior compartments</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Velvet padded top and velvet padded inserts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Two hardened steel combination locks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span>Fits 1911 size:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>All Government Sizes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Commander Size (with full-size frame)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Will fit smaller Compact (with modifications)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372097,76,0,174162,'<p class=\"thin-font\">Fits Govt. &amp; Commander 1911s</p>\r\n<p><span>Color: </span>Black/Rich Tobacco Leather/Wood</p>'),(372686,76,1,174162,'<p class=\"thin-font\">Fits Govt. &amp; Commander 1911s</p>\r\n<p><span>Color: </span>Black/Rich Tobacco Leather/Wood</p>'),(372098,85,0,174162,'Negrini Model 1911 Wood Handgun Case – 2018SLX-WOOD/5369, everest, everest.com, negrini, made in italy, 1911 case'),(372687,85,1,174162,'Negrini Model 1911 Wood Handgun Case – 2018SLX-WOOD/5369, everest, everest.com, negrini, made in italy, 1911 case'),(372102,75,0,174163,'<p>Compact Scoped Bolt Action Rifle Case for Travel</p>\r\n<p>The Negrini 1619LUNGA/5517 compact scoped rifle case is internationally certified and tested for air travel. Like the popular 1619LX/5287, we made this case more affordable. The rifle case is constructed with a double-wall ABS with cushioning on the top and bottom. The compact bolt action rifle case holds a single scoped rifle with an overall length of 44″. The compact scoped rifle case has separate compartments for gear and accessories. It’s the best case for all Ruger American rifles, T/C bolt action rifles, Winchester, Browning X-Bolt and other bolt action style rifles. Limited lifetime warranty.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>LXX – Leather Trim</li>\r\n<li>Hard walled interior with padded and upholstered top and bottom</li>\r\n<li>Accessory or bolt storage</li>\r\n<li>Integrated handle</li>\r\n<li>Fitted compartment for single scoped rifles or other long guns</li>\r\n<li>1x steel composite TSA accepted combination lock</li>\r\n<li>2x Recessed Nylon reinforced polymer/steel locks</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372688,75,1,174163,'<p>Compact Scoped Bolt Action Rifle Case for Travel</p>\r\n<p>The Negrini 1619LUNGA/5517 compact scoped rifle case is internationally certified and tested for air travel. Like the popular 1619LX/5287, we made this case more affordable. The rifle case is constructed with a double-wall ABS with cushioning on the top and bottom. The compact bolt action rifle case holds a single scoped rifle with an overall length of 44″. The compact scoped rifle case has separate compartments for gear and accessories. It’s the best case for all Ruger American rifles, T/C bolt action rifles, Winchester, Browning X-Bolt and other bolt action style rifles. Limited lifetime warranty.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>LXX – Leather Trim</li>\r\n<li>Hard walled interior with padded and upholstered top and bottom</li>\r\n<li>Accessory or bolt storage</li>\r\n<li>Integrated handle</li>\r\n<li>Fitted compartment for single scoped rifles or other long guns</li>\r\n<li>1x steel composite TSA accepted combination lock</li>\r\n<li>2x Recessed Nylon reinforced polymer/steel locks</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372103,76,0,174163,'<p><span>Fits: </span><span>Bolt Action Rifle, Lever Action</span><span><br /></span><span>Color: </span><span>Black/Cognac Leather/Brown</span></p>'),(372689,76,1,174163,'<p><span>Fits: </span><span>Bolt Action Rifle, Lever Action</span><span><br /></span><span>Color: </span><span>Black/Cognac Leather/Brown</span></p>'),(372104,85,0,174163,'Negrini Compact Scoped Bolt Action Rifle Case, 1619LUNGA/5517, negrini case, case for rifle with scope, scoped rifled case, rifle storage case, everest.com, everest, whats your everest'),(372690,85,1,174163,'Negrini Compact Scoped Bolt Action Rifle Case, 1619LUNGA/5517, negrini case, case for rifle with scope, scoped rifled case, rifle storage case, everest.com, everest, whats your everest'),(372105,75,0,174164,'<p>America’s favorite handgun… the Model 1911 finally has a proper handgun case. The 2018S/5126 Model 1911 gun case features internal compartments holding a 1911 style handgun and two single stack magazines. The gun case also adapts to different barrel lengths. The Dedicated Model 1911 Handgun Series gun case is designed to protect the pistol in transit, whether it is from home and to the range or on a plane coast to coast.</p>\r\n<p>Since most 1911 shooters have multiple magazines and accessories, the case is designed with that in mind. Fitted compartments for the pistol magazines and other accessories. As with all Negrini cases, the new Dedicated 1911 gun cases hold more than it appears from the outside. This storage space engineering is one of the things that sets Negrini apart from other cases.</p>\r\n<p>Produced using Negrini’s patented double-wall ABS construction for high strength coupled with sleek Italian design. Each case has two travel secure steel combination locks for security and a limited lifetime warranty.</p>\r\n<p><span>Fits 1911 size:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>All Government Sizes</li>\r\n<li>Commander Size (with full-size frame)</li>\r\n<li>Will fit smaller Compact (with modifications)</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372106,76,0,174164,'<p class=\"thin-font\">Fits Govt. &amp; Commander 1911s</p>\r\n<p><span>Color: </span>Black/Black</p>'),(372107,85,0,174164,'Negrini Model 1911 Handgun Case – 2018SR/5126, negrini cases, 1911 gun case, 1911 gun storage, everest, everest.com'),(372108,75,0,174165,'<p>Negrini’s Dedicated Custom Shop Pistol Case. With a dedicated compartment that will fit full size to compact GLOCK’s, Smith &amp; Wesson M&amp;P Shield, Walther, Springfield XD Series, and similar style pistols. This compact handgun case comes fitted with two integrated hardened steel combination locks in many trim levels. The dedicated handgun compartment is fitted with removable foam to fit your handgun. Plus a separate compartment for magazine storage and another for tools or accessories. The top and bottom cavities are padded and upholstered with velvet fabric for extra cushioning. Negrini uses its patented ultra-light, ultra-strong double wall ABS for protection and security. Like all Negrini ABS cases, the Dedicated GLOCK Case is airline approved for travel with TSA accepted locks.</p>\r\n<p><span>Features</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>R – Rubber trim and padded upholstered top and bottom</li>\r\n<li>Fits GLOCK, S&amp;W M&amp;P Shield, Springfield XD, SIG Sauer, Walther, and similar style pistols</li>\r\n<li>2x German steel combination locks (TSA Compliant)</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372109,76,0,174165,'<p><span>Fits:</span><span> GLOCK, Smith &amp; Wesson M&amp;P Shield, Springfield XD, Walther, and similar style pistols</span></p>'),(372110,85,0,174165,'Negrini Modern Handgun Case – 2028SR/5511, negrini case, handgun case, pistol case, tsa approved gun case, everest, everest.com'),(372132,75,0,174168,'<p>PCS misting hydration backpack comes with the personal cooling system unit fully<br />installed! 2-n-1 drinking and misting from the same hydration pack system. Right out of the box<br />the PCS unit comes with a rechargeable battery, 8-speed wireless remote control for mist<br />density, and an extra 0.20mm mist nozzle (0.15mm mist nozzle comes standard with each<br />backpack). The PCS unit can also be used with our waist Pack attachment that zips to the<br />backpack itself. This eliminates the need to carry a separate water bottle. The cooling pack<br />system is designed for easy removal and reinstallation, so it can also be used out of the pack for<br />a variety of cooling applications and can be further enhanced by adding our quad hose, nozzle<br />kit.</p>'),(372133,75,1,174168,'<p>Scorching days on the trail, pedaling through the dry summer heat, or trail running in the blazing sun can quickly turn a fun outdoor adventure into a miserable, even dangerous situation. </p>\r\n<p>Staying hydrated is critical, but you have to stay cool, too. The ExtremeMist Misting and Drinking Hydration Backpack is the only pack on the market that does both. </p>\r\n<p>With a drinking tube and misting system, you can hydrate on the go while enjoying a cool, energizing mist. An insulated reservoir cover keeps your drinking water refreshingly cold, and mesh pockets on the pack store your outdoor essentials. With easy-to-use drinking, misting, and storage systems, this pack can transform a sweltering day on the trail into a pleasant outdoor adventure.</p>\r\n<p>The new and improved Personal Cooling System (PCS) with higher PSI and a water-cooled pump comes with a rechargeable battery and an 8-speed wireless remote for adjusting misting settings. </p>\r\n<p>The PCS cooling pump comes easily out of the backpack. It’s also compatible with our Quad Hose/Nozzle Kit for large-scale cooling. </p>\r\n<p>The Misting and Drinking Hydration Backpack comes with the Personal Cooling System (PCS) fully installed.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Portable Misting Features</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>On the Shoulders:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Stay cool and let your skin breathe with wide, ergonomically-shaped mesh shoulder straps.</li>\r\n<li>>Enjoy easy access to your drink tube and mist nozzle with dual hose stays.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Side of the Pack:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjust the size of your pack - from size Small to Large or Large to 4XL - with adjustable Z straps. </li>\r\n<li>Stash essentials with zippered side mesh pockets. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Back of the Pack:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keep your 2-liter reservoir secure with its separate compartment and stabilization clip.</li>\r\n<li>Store your PCS in place with its own large interior compartment. </li>\r\n<li>Organize your outdoor gear in the four additional stretch pockets. </li>\r\n<li>Stash your helmet or air out sweated-out clothes in the large outer stretch-mesh compartment.</li>\r\n<li>Keep your sunglasses safe and scratch-free in a convenient top pocket. </li>\r\n<li>Easily attach your pack to the Detachable Dual Holster Hydration Waist Pack (sold separately) for additional space and weight distribution.</li>\r\n<li>Stay visible and safe in the dark with nighttime reflective strips.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Front of Pack:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Create the perfect fit with dual adjustable chest straps and vertical slide fittings.</li>\r\n<li>Keep your snacks and phone close at hand with 5 easy-to-reach pockets. </li>\r\n<li>Safely store your essentials in a roomy interior zippered pocket with key clip.</li>\r\n<li>Keep your misting remote accessible in either of the secure front remote pockets.</li>\r\n<li>Hold your drink tube in place while you’re on the move with a magnetic sternum clasp.*</li>\r\n<li>Stay visible and safe in the dark with nighttime reflective strips.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2 Liter TSI Water Reservoir:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Reservoir made with food-grade TPU materials that are BPA-free and FDA-approved.</li>\r\n<li>Easily fill and use your reservoir with a 37” cut-to-fit PVC drink tube. </li>\r\n<li>Prevent unwanted leaks through your bite valve with an easy on/off button.</li>\r\n<li>Keep your drinking water cold on the hottest of days with an insulated reservoir and hose cover. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>*Magnetic drink tube holder has a strong magnetic field. If you have a pacemaker, be sure to remove the magnetic clip before using this pack.</p>'),(372134,76,1,174168,'<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Stay cool and let your skin breathe with wide, ergonomically-shaped mesh shoulder straps.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Reservoir made with food-grade TPU materials that are BPA-free and FDA-approved.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Easily fill and use your reservoir with a 37” cut-to-fit PVC drink tube. </span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Adjust the size of your pack - from size Small to Large or Large to 4XL - with adjustable Z straps. </span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enjoy easy access to your drink tube and mist nozzle with dual hose stays. </span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(372135,85,1,174168,'hydration backpack, backpack, misting system, cooling, hydration pack'),(372146,75,0,174171,'<p>The PCS Retrofit kit can be installed in your favorite hydration pack –<br />leaving the drinking hose intact for dual-use. The kit includes everything you’ll need to head out<br />into the heat. Simply Install the ExtremeMist PCS (Personal Cooling System) in your day-[ack,<br />backpack or existing hydration pack in minutes. Upgrade your ordinary backpack to a 2-n-1<br />hydration pack. Wirelessly Drinking and misting from a Compact, lightweight,professional-grade,<br />Retrofit kit. Your extraordinary system now provides a continuous atomized mist in front of you,<br />creating a cooling mist cloud that can reduce the air temperature up to 30°F. The high-pressure<br />pump has 8 speeds, all controlled via its wireless remote. At low speeds, water consumption is<br />only about 1.5 to 2.5 cups per hour of continuous use, and the battery lasts at least 12 hours.<br />The battery can be fast-charged with an included wall charger or charged via USB cord. The<br />PCS Battery doubles as a Power Bank to charge your mobile devices or outdoor gadgets for the<br />day. Modify your hydration pack now!</p>'),(372147,75,1,174171,'<p>Don\'t let the sweltering heat of summer hinder your outdoor adventures. Even when the blazing sun threatens to confine you indoors, there\'s a simple solution to keep cool and hydrated during your outdoor excursions.</p>\r\n<p>Integrate the Backpack Misting and Drinking Retrofit Kit into any hydration backpack, introducing the dual benefits of a refreshing portable mist and seamless hydration. By enveloping yourself in a cooling mist as you hike, bike, or run, those scorching summer days become a breeze.</p>\r\n<p>The upgraded Personal Cooling System (PCS), boasting enhanced PSI and a water-cooled pump, features a rechargeable battery and an 8-speed wireless remote for convenient misting adjustments.</p>\r\n<p>The compact and lightweight PCS unit effortlessly fits into your daypack, enveloping your surroundings in a continuous mist wherever your journey takes you. Installing the PCS unit in your hydration pack ensures that your drinking hose remains intact, allowing for easy, hands-free hydration.</p>\r\n<p>Key Features of the Portable Misting System:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Universal Compatibility:</strong> The Retrofit Kit seamlessly installs into any hydration pack you already own.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Dramatic Cooling:</strong> Experience a significant drop in temperature with added misting capabilities. The PCS allows you to cool the air around you by up to 30°F.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Customizable Cooling:</strong> Take charge of your comfort with the wireless 8-speed remote control, conveniently attached to the front of your pack for on-the-go mist adjustments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Long-lasting Power:</strong> Forget about battery replacements; the PCS unit comes with a rechargeable battery pack that can last over 12 hours between charges.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Emergency Charging:</strong> The PCS battery doubles as a power bank, ensuring your devices stay charged in case of an emergency.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>Personal Cooling System Specifications:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Weight:</strong> 16 oz</li>\r\n<li><strong>Measurements:</strong> 7.5” H x 3.5” W x 1.5’ D</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Includes:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ExtremeMist PCS unit (with rechargeable lithium-ion battery pack)</li>\r\n<li>2 hoses**</li>\r\n<li>Quick-disconnect Y-connector</li>\r\n<li>Plug for use without drink hose or PCS</li>\r\n<li>.015 mm mist nozzle</li>\r\n<li>.020mm mist nozzle for higher mist density</li>\r\n<li>Omni-directional mist nozzle purge valve</li>\r\n<li>Mist nozzle clip</li>\r\n<li>Wireless 8-speed remote control</li>\r\n<li>A/C fast charger and micro USB cable</li>\r\n<li>Hose reducer for Y-connector</li>\r\n<li>2 barbed drink hose adapters</li>\r\n<li>2 barbed adapters for packs with larger diameter drink hoses</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>*Reservoir Not Included **Color of hose may vary from photos ***Blue mist line expanders are no longer included</p>'),(372148,76,1,174171,'<ul>\r\n<li>Transform any Hydration Backpack into a Misting and Drinking pack in minutes: </li>\r\n<li>Wireless Remote Control: Powered by ExtremeMist’s Blue Pump Technology. Comes with an 8-speed wireless remote control for variable mist density. </li>\r\n<li>Rechargeable battery and power bank: PCS pump/battery can be fully charged from any outlet in approximately 3hrs and can also be used as a power bank to power other devices, (android, tablet, etc..).</li>\r\n<li>Multi-Directional Misting Nozzle:  Adjust the angle of the mist spray in any direction based on the wind and the pace of your movements. </li>\r\n</ul>'),(372154,75,0,174173,'<p>Waist-Pack provides easy access to your gear and<br />hydration.Designed with convenience in mind, it comes with a zipper to attach to our Personal Cooling Backpack. When zipped to the pack, it redistributes much of the weight from your shoulders to<br />your hips. It has a Large back compartment with key clip, bungee attachment secures spare<br />clothing items, 2 roomy side zippered pockets, dual bottle holders, and a mesh back panel for a<br />comfortable fit.</p>'),(372155,75,1,174173,'<p><span>ExtremeMist hydration waist pack provides easy access to your gear and hydration. Designed with convenience in mind, it comes with a zipper to attach to any ExtremeMist Misting Hydration Pack (sold separately). When zipped to the pack, it redistributes much of the weight from your shoulders to your hips. It has a large back compartment with a key clip, bungee attachment that secures spare clothing items, 2 roomy side zippered pockets, dual bottle holders (Bottles not included), and a mesh back panel for a comfortable fit.</span>.</p>'),(372156,76,1,174173,'<ul>\r\n<li>Large expands to fit 27\" to 62\" waist</li>\r\n<li>Dual bottle holsters</li>\r\n<li>Zippered pockets for added storage</li>\r\n<li>Stand-alone Waist Pack or detachable to any ExtremeMist Misting Hydration pack for more support and storage</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372160,75,0,174174,'<p>Waist-Pack provides easy access to your gear and<br />hydration.Designed with convenience in mind, it comes with a zipper to attach to our Portable Cooling Backpack.When zipped to the pack, it redistributes much of the weight from your shoulders to<br />your hips. It has a Large back compartment with key clip, bungee attachment secures spare<br />clothing items, 2 roomy side zippered pockets, dual bottle holders, and a mesh back panel for a<br />comfortable fit.</p>'),(372161,75,1,174174,'<p><span>ExtremeMist hydration waist pack provides easy access to your gear and hydration. Designed with convenience in mind, it comes with a zipper to attach to any ExtremeMist Misting Hydration Pack (sold separately). When zipped to the pack, it redistributes much of the weight from your shoulders to your hips. It has a large back compartment with a key clip, bungee attachment that secures spare clothing items, 2 roomy side zippered pockets, dual bottle holders (Bottles not included), and a mesh back panel for a comfortable fit.</span></p>'),(372162,76,1,174174,'<ul>\r\n<li>Large expands to fit 27\" to 62\" waist</li>\r\n<li>Dual bottle holsters</li>\r\n<li>Zippered pockets for added storage</li>\r\n<li>Stand-alone Waist Pack or detachable to any ExtremeMist Misting Hydration pack for more support and storage</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372164,75,0,174175,'<p>Waist-Pack provides easy access to your gear and<br />hydration.Designed with convenience in mind, it comes with a zipper to attach to our Personal Cooling Backpack.When zipped to the pack, it redistributes much of the weight from your shoulders to<br />your hips. It has a Large back compartment with key clip, bungee attachment secures spare<br />clothing items, 2 roomy side zippered pockets, dual bottle holders, and a mesh back panel for a<br />comfortable fit.</p>'),(372466,75,1,174175,'<p><span>ExtremeMist hydration waist pack provides easy access to your gear and hydration. Designed with convenience in mind, it comes with a zipper to attach to any ExtremeMist Misting Hydration Pack (sold separately). When zipped to the pack, it redistributes much of the weight from your shoulders to your hips. It has a large back compartment with a key clip, bungee attachment that secures spare clothing items, 2 roomy side zippered pockets, dual bottle holders (Bottles not included), and a mesh back panel for a comfortable fit.</span></p>'),(372467,76,1,174175,'<ul>\r\n<li>Large expands to fit 27\" to 62\" waist</li>\r\n<li>Dual bottle holsters</li>\r\n<li>Zippered pockets for added storage</li>\r\n<li>Stand-alone Waist Pack or detachable to any ExtremeMist Misting Hydration pack for more support and storage</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372468,85,1,174175,NULL),(372165,75,0,174176,'<p>Waist-Pack provides easy access to your gear and<br />hydration.Designed with convenience in mind, it comes with a zipper to attach to our Portable Cooling Backpack.When zipped to the pack, it redistributes much of the weight from your shoulders to<br />your hips. It has a Large back compartment with key clip, bungee attachment secures spare<br />clothing items, 2 roomy side zippered pockets, dual bottle holders, and a mesh back panel for a<br />comfortable fit.</p>'),(372469,75,1,174176,'<p><span>ExtremeMist hydration waist pack provides easy access to your gear and hydration. Designed with convenience in mind, it comes with a zipper to attach to any ExtremeMist Misting Hydration Pack (sold separately). When zipped to the pack, it redistributes much of the weight from your shoulders to your hips. It has a large back compartment with a key clip, bungee attachment that secures spare clothing items, 2 roomy side zippered pockets, dual bottle holders (Bottles not included), and a mesh back panel for a comfortable fit</span></p>'),(372470,76,1,174176,'<ul>\r\n<li>Large expands to fit 27\" to 62\" waist</li>\r\n<li>Dual bottle holsters</li>\r\n<li>Zippered pockets for added storage</li>\r\n<li>Stand-alone Waist Pack or detachable to any ExtremeMist Misting Hydration pack for more support and storage</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372168,75,0,174177,'<p>Vortex\'s most affordable red dot proves that you can still get big performance without the big price tag. When your AR-15, shotgun or rimfire just needs a simple point of aim and none of the frills, the Crossfire should be at the top of your list. The 2 MOA dot is quick to acquire in close-quarters scenarios, while remaining fine enough to promote pin-point accuracy at extended range. In addition to looking awesome, the included skeletonized lower 1/3 co-witness mount provides a rock-solid and extremely lightweight platform for your red dot. The Crossfire is a no-nonsense sight at a no-nonsense price for darn near any application.</p>\r\n<p><b>Features</b>:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fully Multi-Coated Lenses</li>\r\n<li>11 Illumination Settings</li>\r\n<li>Up to 50,000 hours on brightness setting 6.</li>\r\n<li>Parallax Free</li>\r\n<li>Unlimited Eye Relief</li>\r\n<li>Shockproof</li>\r\n<li>Waterproof</li>\r\n<li>Nitrogen purged</li>\r\n<li>Low-glare matte black anodized</li>\r\n<li></li>\r\n</ul>'),(372171,75,1,174177,'<p>Vortex\'s most affordable red dot proves that you can still get big performance without the big price tag. When your AR-15, shotgun or rimfire just needs a simple point of aim and none of the frills, the Crossfire should be at the top of your list. The 2 MOA dot is quick to acquire in close-quarters scenarios, while remaining fine enough to promote pin-point accuracy at extended range. In addition to looking awesome, the included skeletonized lower 1/3 co-witness mount provides a rock-solid and extremely lightweight platform for your red dot. The Crossfire is a no-nonsense sight at a no-nonsense price for darn near any application.</p>\r\n<p><b>Features</b>:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fully Multi-Coated Lenses</li>\r\n<li>11 Illumination Settings</li>\r\n<li>Up to 50,000 hours on brightness setting 6.</li>\r\n<li>Parallax Free</li>\r\n<li>Unlimited Eye Relief</li>\r\n<li>Shockproof</li>\r\n<li>Waterproof</li>\r\n<li>Nitrogen purged</li>\r\n<li>Low-glare matte black anodized</li>\r\n<li></li>\r\n</ul>'),(372169,76,0,174177,'<p><span>When your AR-15, shotgun or rimfire just needs a simple point of aim and none of the frills, the Crossfire should be at the top of your list.</span></p>'),(372172,76,1,174177,'<p><span>When your AR-15, shotgun or rimfire just needs a simple point of aim and none of the frills, the Crossfire should be at the top of your list.</span></p>'),(372170,85,0,174177,'optics, crossfire, red dot sight, accessories'),(372173,85,1,174177,'optics, crossfire, red dot sight, accessories'),(372174,75,0,174178,'<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">PSE CROSSBOW SPECIFICATIONS - Speed: 380 fps. Power Stroke: 14.5. Axle-to-Axle 21.5\" Draw Weight: 185 lbs. Overall Length: 35-36.5\" Mass Weight: 7.5 lbs. Kinetic Energy: 127 FT. lbs. Cable: 23.4” String: 37.2”</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">SCOPE &amp; STOPS INSTALLED - 4X32 Illuminated crossbow scope and string stops to dampen sound &amp; vibration.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">ANTI-DRY FIRE &amp; AUTO SAFETY TRIGGER - Provides ultimate safety. A hunting crossbow with complete power &amp; control!</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">THE ULTIMATE HUNTING BOW - The Coalition is a fast, compact, and ergonomic crossbow featuring the comfort of an adjustable stock and a pass-through foregrip.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">PSE BOW PACKAGE INCLUDES - Illuminated Scope, Dual String Stops, 4-Bolt Quiver, Anti-Dry Fire &amp; Auto Safety Trigger, 3-20 Carbon Bolts with Field Points, Foot Stirrup, Limb Dampeners, Cocking Rope, Cocking &amp; Rail Lube.</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(372179,75,1,174178,'<table id=\"specifications_table\" cellspacing=\"0px\" cellpadding=\"0px\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr id=\"_specs_product_manufacturer_row\">\r\n<td class=\"specification-name\">Manufacturer</td>\r\n<td id=\"specs_product_manufacturer\" class=\"specification-value\">PSE Archery</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr id=\"_product_data_upc_code_row\">\r\n<td class=\"specification-name\">UPC</td>\r\n<td id=\"product_data_upc_code\" class=\"specification-value\">042958601502</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr id=\"_product_data_width_row\">\r\n<td class=\"specification-name\">Width</td>\r\n<td id=\"product_data_width\" class=\"specification-value\">12.1000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr id=\"_product_data_length_row\">\r\n<td class=\"specification-name\">Length</td>\r\n<td id=\"product_data_length\" class=\"specification-value\">-3536.5000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr id=\"_product_data_height_row\">\r\n<td class=\"specification-name\">Height</td>\r\n<td id=\"product_data_height\" class=\"specification-value\">5.6500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr id=\"_product_data_weight_row\">\r\n<td class=\"specification-name\">Weight</td>\r\n<td id=\"product_data_weight\" class=\"specification-value\">12.0500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr id=\"_product_facets_dimension_row\">\r\n<td class=\"specification-name\">Dimension</td>\r\n<td id=\"product_facets_dimension\" class=\"specification-value\">5.65 X 12.10 X 31.00</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr id=\"_product_facets_weight_row\">\r\n<td class=\"specification-name\">Weight</td>\r\n<td id=\"product_facets_weight\" class=\"specification-value\">7.5</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>'),(382706,76,0,174178,'<p><span>Join the crossbow revolution with COALITION® FRONTIER. Delivering 380 fps, the COALITION® FRONTIER is a fast and compact affordable crossbow with an illuminated reticle scope, quiver, bolts and, cocking rope.</span></p>'),(670448,76,1,174178,'<p><span>Join the crossbow revolution with COALITION® FRONTIER. Delivering 380 fps, the COALITION® FRONTIER is a fast and compact affordable crossbow with an illuminated reticle scope, quiver, bolts and, cocking rope.</span></p>'),(372175,85,0,174178,'FOOT STIRRUP,RAIL LUBE,LIMB '),(372181,85,1,174178,'FOOT STIRRUP,RAIL LUBE,LIMB '),(372176,75,0,174179,'<div class=\"product-section-overview\" data-ng-non-bindable=\"\">\r\n<p>The latest iteration of our SPARC series of red dots now harnesses the power of the sun for up to 150,000 hours of battery life, powering a reliable tactical machine ready to help you protect what matters most. Vortex\'s smartest red dot to date, the SPARC SOLAR’s Auto D-TEC technology automatically switches from solar to battery power when the sun can’t power the dot to your choice of 10 daytime illumination settings and two night-vision compatible settings. Motion activation capable, the SPARC is always ready, and its daylight bright, 2 MOA dot provides a clear, precise point of aim. Near and far, night and day, the SPARC SOLAR means you’re always ready.</p>\r\n<p><b>Features</b>:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solar powered, with auto D-tec technology</li>\r\n<li>Up to 150,000 hour battery life</li>\r\n<li>Motion activation capable</li>\r\n<li>Daylight bright 2 moa red dot</li>\r\n<li>Motion activation capable</li>\r\n<li>Side push button control</li>\r\n<li>Daylight bright illumination</li>\r\n<li>Low-glare matte black anodized</li>\r\n<li>2 night visi