i-Dry Fire/Auto Safety</li>\r\n<li>Built-in Sling Mounts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span>Features:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span>Model:</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>R024</li>\r\n<li><span>Pattern:</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>Predator Camo</li>\r\n<li><span>Speed:</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>430 FPS</li>\r\n<li><span>Power Stroke:</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>12.5\"</li>\r\n<li><span>Kinetic Energy:</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>164</li>\r\n<li><span>Draw Weight:</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>12 lbs</li>\r\n<li><span>Length:</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>34.5\"</li>\r\n<li><span>Axle to Axle Width (Uncocked):</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>10.5\"</li>\r\n<li><span>Axle to Axle Width (Cocked):</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>6\"</li>\r\n<li><span>Weight:</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>7.1 lbs</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372203,75,1,174181,'<p><span>The<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span><span>Ravin R20 Crossbow</span><span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>delivers superior speed and rifle-like accuracy. With a 12.5\" power stroke, the R20 inflicts speeds over 430 FPS and 164-foot pounds of kinetic energy. Shooting 3-inch groups at 100 yards, this crossbow is sure to impress bow hunters and gun enthusiasts alike!</span><br /><br /><span>The Ravin R20 Crossbow Package comes with:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Ravin R20 Crossbow in Predator Camo</li>\r\n<li>HeliCoil Technology</li>\r\n<li>Fully-Assembled/Pre-Tuned</li>\r\n<li>3 Ravin .003 Arrows &amp; Field Tips (400 Grain Total)</li>\r\n<li>1 Removable Draw Handle</li>\r\n<li>1 Quiver/Mounting Bracket</li>\r\n<li>100 Yard Illuminated Scope</li>\r\n<li>Built-In Cocking Mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Anti-Dry Fire/Auto Safety</li>\r\n<li>Built-in Sling Mounts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span>Features:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span>Model:</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>R024</li>\r\n<li><span>Pattern:</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>Predator Camo</li>\r\n<li><span>Speed:</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>430 FPS</li>\r\n<li><span>Power Stroke:</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>12.5\"</li>\r\n<li><span>Kinetic Energy:</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>164</li>\r\n<li><span>Draw Weight:</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>12 lbs</li>\r\n<li><span>Length:</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>34.5\"</li>\r\n<li><span>Axle to Axle Width (Uncocked):</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>10.5\"</li>\r\n<li><span>Axle to Axle Width (Cocked):</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>6\"</li>\r\n<li><span>Weight:</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>7.1 lbs</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372186,76,0,174181,'<p><span>The<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span><span>Ravin R20 Crossbow</span><span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>delivers superior speed and rifle-like accuracy. With a 12.5\" power stroke, the R20 inflicts speeds over 430 FPS and 164-foot pounds of kinetic energy. Shooting 3-inch groups at 100 yards, this crossbow is sure to impress bow hunters and gun enthusiasts alike!</span></p>'),(372204,76,1,174181,'<p><span>The<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span><span>Ravin R20 Crossbow</span><span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>delivers superior speed and rifle-like accuracy. With a 12.5\" power stroke, the R20 inflicts speeds over 430 FPS and 164-foot pounds of kinetic energy. Shooting 3-inch groups at 100 yards, this crossbow is sure to impress bow hunters and gun enthusiasts alike!</span></p>'),(372187,85,0,174181,'Ravin R20 Crossbow, HeliCoil Technology, Built-In Cocking Mechanism, Built-in Sling Mounts'),(372205,85,1,174181,'Ravin R20 Crossbow, HeliCoil Technology, Built-In Cocking Mechanism, Built-in Sling Mounts'),(372209,75,0,174183,'<p><span>370 FPS velocity</span><br /><span>116 ft.-lbs. kinetic energy</span><br /><span>14\" power stroke</span><br /><span>draw weight</span><br /><span>9\" axle-to-axle when cocked, 14.25\" uncocked</span><br /><span>32.5\"l., 6.25 lbs.</span></p>'),(373289,75,1,174183,'<p><span>370 FPS velocity</span><br /><span>116 ft.-lbs. kinetic energy</span><br /><span>14\" power stroke</span><br /><span>draw weight</span><br /><span>9\" axle-to-axle when cocked, 14.25\" uncocked</span><br /><span>32.5\"l., 6.25 lbs.</span></p>'),(372210,85,0,174183,'crossbow, ten point, m1, power stroke'),(373290,85,1,174183,'crossbow, ten point, m1, power stroke'),(372211,75,0,174184,'<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable Butt Stock</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Cheek Comb</li>\r\n<li>Shoot Through Riser</li>\r\n<li>Balanced Center of Mass (Centered of the Trigger / Hand Grip)</li>\r\n<li>Integrated Crank with Cock / De-Cock Feature (Adjustable handle position)</li>\r\n<li>Trigger (3.7 lbs. and zero creep)</li>\r\n<li>Safest Trigger on the Market (Automatically resets to safe every shot)</li>\r\n<li>Full Capture, Tunable Roller Rest</li>\r\n<li>85% Cam Efficiency (Best in Market)</li>\r\n<li>Ergonomic Chassis Design</li>\r\n<li>Integrally Mounted 3 Arrow Quiver</li>\r\n<li>Multi Range Illuminated Reticle Scope</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Foot Peg</li>\r\n<li>(3) AXE micro diameter bolts with 100 grain practice tips</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Compact by design, but colossal with its features, the new AX405 crossbow is best characterized as; Performance. Optimized. At a compact and maneuverable 27.75-inches long and 10-inches axle-to-axle (cocked) the weight of the crossbow is centered over the shooter\'s hand by way of a balanced shoot-through stock and riser design and reverse limb system. This configuration empowers the most efficient part of the AX405 210-pound split limbs to deliver bolt speeds in excess of 400 feet-per-second, from just 13-inches of power stroke. A proprietary cam system is linked by cables that run parallel to each other, rather than from the top of one cam to the bottom of the other. This unique configuration eliminates cam-lean, limb torque and is further enhanced by an exclusive cable brace that engages the riser to aid in the limitation of flex away from the center of the crossbow. When combined, these features allow the string to move along the same plane throughout the entire power stroke. Unlike the one-piece aluminum rail concepts of conventional crossbow designs that rob speed, efficiency and bolt life, the stock of the AX405 eliminates the rail and utilizes dual carbon guide rods along the entire length of the stock. When combined with the shoot through riser and a roller rest on the bow\'s front end these features create a free-floating arrow system that mitigates contact, friction and torque along the arrow\'s entire path further enhancing efficiency, accuracy and speed output. Comes with a multi-range reticle scope with markings for 20-100 yards in 10 yard increments. Red/green illumination for different lighting conditions helps you see the reticle clearly. The scope features a wide field of view and is both shock and fog proof.</p>\r\n<p><strong>AX405 Crossbow Specs:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Cocked Axle to Axle: 9.95\"</li>\r\n<li>Un-cocked Axle to Axle: 14.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Power Stroke: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Limb Weight: 210 lbs.</li>\r\n<li>Trigger Pull: 3.7 lbs. (AXE 2 Stage Sliding Trigger Assembly)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 10.4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 27.75\" (Foot Peg Collapsed)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 32\" (Foot Peg Extended)</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 9.7 lbs. (Without Scope)</li>\r\n<li>Speed: 405 fps</li>\r\n</ul>'),(670449,75,1,174184,'<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable Butt Stock</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Cheek Comb</li>\r\n<li>Shoot Through Riser</li>\r\n<li>Balanced Center of Mass (Centered of the Trigger / Hand Grip)</li>\r\n<li>Integrated Crank with Cock / De-Cock Feature (Adjustable handle position)</li>\r\n<li>Trigger (3.7 lbs. and zero creep)</li>\r\n<li>Safest Trigger on the Market (Automatically resets to safe every shot)</li>\r\n<li>Full Capture, Tunable Roller Rest</li>\r\n<li>85% Cam Efficiency (Best in Market)</li>\r\n<li>Ergonomic Chassis Design</li>\r\n<li>Integrally Mounted 3 Arrow Quiver</li>\r\n<li>Multi Range Illuminated Reticle Scope</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Foot Peg</li>\r\n<li>(3) AXE micro diameter bolts with 100 grain practice tips</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Compact by design, but colossal with its features, the new AX405 crossbow is best characterized as; Performance. Optimized. At a compact and maneuverable 27.75-inches long and 10-inches axle-to-axle (cocked) the weight of the crossbow is centered over the shooter\'s hand by way of a balanced shoot-through stock and riser design and reverse limb system. This configuration empowers the most efficient part of the AX405 210-pound split limbs to deliver bolt speeds in excess of 400 feet-per-second, from just 13-inches of power stroke. A proprietary cam system is linked by cables that run parallel to each other, rather than from the top of one cam to the bottom of the other. This unique configuration eliminates cam-lean, limb torque and is further enhanced by an exclusive cable brace that engages the riser to aid in the limitation of flex away from the center of the crossbow. When combined, these features allow the string to move along the same plane throughout the entire power stroke. Unlike the one-piece aluminum rail concepts of conventional crossbow designs that rob speed, efficiency and bolt life, the stock of the AX405 eliminates the rail and utilizes dual carbon guide rods along the entire length of the stock. When combined with the shoot through riser and a roller rest on the bow\'s front end these features create a free-floating arrow system that mitigates contact, friction and torque along the arrow\'s entire path further enhancing efficiency, accuracy and speed output. Comes with a multi-range reticle scope with markings for 20-100 yards in 10 yard increments. Red/green illumination for different lighting conditions helps you see the reticle clearly. The scope features a wide field of view and is both shock and fog proof.</p>\r\n<p><strong>AX405 Crossbow Specs:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Cocked Axle to Axle: 9.95\"</li>\r\n<li>Un-cocked Axle to Axle: 14.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Power Stroke: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Limb Weight: 210 lbs.</li>\r\n<li>Trigger Pull: 3.7 lbs. (AXE 2 Stage Sliding Trigger Assembly)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 10.4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 27.75\" (Foot Peg Collapsed)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 32\" (Foot Peg Extended)</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 9.7 lbs. (Without Scope)</li>\r\n<li>Speed: 405 fps</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372212,76,0,174184,'<p><span>Compact by design, but colossal with its features, the new AX405 crossbow is best characterized as; Performance.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></p>'),(670451,76,1,174184,'<p><span>Compact by design, but colossal with its features, the new AX405 crossbow is best characterized as; Performance.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></p>'),(372213,85,0,174184,'Adjustable Butt Stock, Adjustable Cheek Comb, Shoot Through Riser, Full Capture, Tunable Roller Rest'),(670450,85,1,174184,'Adjustable Butt Stock, Adjustable Cheek Comb, Shoot Through Riser, Full Capture, Tunable Roller Rest'),(372214,75,0,174185,'<p><span>Our shortest forward-draw hunting crossbow ever produced, the light-weight Viper S400 measures just 32-inches in length yet delivers speeds up to 400 FPS and is sold as a crossbow package. Featuring the NEW revolutionary ACUslide silent cocking and safe de-cocking system, this ultra-compact hunting crossbow measures an ultra-narrow 7.2-inches wide and features a 3.5 pound, 2-stage, zero-creep S1 trigger that delivers our most crisp, consistent break ever. If you are looking for the ultimate hunting crossbow package, look no further than the Viper S400.</span></p>'),(373291,75,1,174185,'<p><span>Our shortest forward-draw hunting crossbow ever produced, the light-weight Viper S400 measures just 32-inches in length yet delivers speeds up to 400 FPS and is sold as a crossbow package. Featuring the NEW revolutionary ACUslide silent cocking and safe de-cocking system, this ultra-compact hunting crossbow measures an ultra-narrow 7.2-inches wide and features a 3.5 pound, 2-stage, zero-creep S1 trigger that delivers our most crisp, consistent break ever. If you are looking for the ultimate hunting crossbow package, look no further than the Viper S400.</span></p>'),(372215,76,0,174185,'<p></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Optics: RangeMaster Pro Scope mounted on a machined aluminum 7/8-inch Fixed Dovetail Mount</li>\r\n<li>Cocking Device: ACUslide Cocking and De-Cocking System</li>\r\n<li>Quiver: 6-Arrow Tech Quiver</li>\r\n<li>Arrows: Three Evo-X CenterPunch premium carbon arrows with 100-grain practice points</li>\r\n</ul>'),(373292,76,1,174185,'<p></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Optics: RangeMaster Pro Scope mounted on a machined aluminum 7/8-inch Fixed Dovetail Mount</li>\r\n<li>Cocking Device: ACUslide Cocking and De-Cocking System</li>\r\n<li>Quiver: 6-Arrow Tech Quiver</li>\r\n<li>Arrows: Three Evo-X CenterPunch premium carbon arrows with 100-grain practice points</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372216,85,0,174185,'optics, pro scope, arrow tech'),(373293,85,1,174185,'optics, pro scope, arrow tech'),(372223,75,0,174186,'<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p>The fastest and narrowest forward-draw hunting crossbow ever produced!</p>\r\n<p>The lightweight Vengent S440 delivers lightning speeds up to 440 FPS and features the NEW revolutionary ACUslide silent cocking and safe de-cocking crossbow technology. This ultra-fast hunting crossbow for sale is our narrowest ever, measuring an incredible 5.8-inches wide, and features a 3.5 pound, 2-stage S1 trigger that delivers our most crisp, consistent break ever.</p>\r\n<p>TenPoint designed the silent cocking and de-cocking system for our customers to safely de-cock their hunting crossbows without risk of injury, making our crossbows the finest and safest crossbows for sale on the market today.</p>\r\n<p>Package Includes:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Optics: RangeMaster Scope mounted on a machined aluminum 7/8-inch Fixed Dovetail Mount</li>\r\n<li>Bubble Level</li>\r\n<li>Cocking Device: ACUslide Cocking and De-Cocking System</li>\r\n<li>Quiver: 6-Arrow Tech Quiver</li>\r\n<li>Arrows: Six Evo-X CenterPunch premium carbon arrows with 100-grain practice points</li>\r\n<li>Soft Case: TenPoint Blazer Soft Crossbow Case</li>\r\n<li>Length (w/o foot stirrup) 35\"</li>\r\n<li>Width Axle-to-Axle (uncocked/cocked) 11\" / 5.8\"</li>\r\n<li>Power Stroke 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Weight (w/out accessories) 7.7 lbs.</li>\r\n<li>Speed/KE: Pro Light Carbon Arrow (370-grains) 440 FPS / 159 FP KE</li>\r\n<li>Speed/KE: Pro Elite 400 Carbon Arrow (400-grains) 430 FPS / 164 FP KE</li>\r\n<li>Speed/KE: EVO-X CenterPunch Carbon Arrow (445-grains) 410 FPS / 166 FP KE</li>\r\n<li>Draw style Forward Draw</li>\r\n<li>Safe De-Cocking ACUslide</li>\r\n<li></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(373294,75,1,174186,'<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p>The fastest and narrowest forward-draw hunting crossbow ever produced!</p>\r\n<p>The lightweight Vengent S440 delivers lightning speeds up to 440 FPS and features the NEW revolutionary ACUslide silent cocking and safe de-cocking crossbow technology. This ultra-fast hunting crossbow for sale is our narrowest ever, measuring an incredible 5.8-inches wide, and features a 3.5 pound, 2-stage S1 trigger that delivers our most crisp, consistent break ever.</p>\r\n<p>TenPoint designed the silent cocking and de-cocking system for our customers to safely de-cock their hunting crossbows without risk of injury, making our crossbows the finest and safest crossbows for sale on the market today.</p>\r\n<p>Package Includes:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Optics: RangeMaster Scope mounted on a machined aluminum 7/8-inch Fixed Dovetail Mount</li>\r\n<li>Bubble Level</li>\r\n<li>Cocking Device: ACUslide Cocking and De-Cocking System</li>\r\n<li>Quiver: 6-Arrow Tech Quiver</li>\r\n<li>Arrows: Six Evo-X CenterPunch premium carbon arrows with 100-grain practice points</li>\r\n<li>Soft Case: TenPoint Blazer Soft Crossbow Case</li>\r\n<li>Length (w/o foot stirrup) 35\"</li>\r\n<li>Width Axle-to-Axle (uncocked/cocked) 11\" / 5.8\"</li>\r\n<li>Power Stroke 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Weight (w/out accessories) 7.7 lbs.</li>\r\n<li>Speed/KE: Pro Light Carbon Arrow (370-grains) 440 FPS / 159 FP KE</li>\r\n<li>Speed/KE: Pro Elite 400 Carbon Arrow (400-grains) 430 FPS / 164 FP KE</li>\r\n<li>Speed/KE: EVO-X CenterPunch Carbon Arrow (445-grains) 410 FPS / 166 FP KE</li>\r\n<li>Draw style Forward Draw</li>\r\n<li>Safe De-Cocking ACUslide</li>\r\n<li></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(372224,76,0,174186,'<p><span>The fastest and narrowest forward-draw hunting crossbow ever produced!</span></p>'),(373295,76,1,174186,'<p><span>The fastest and narrowest forward-draw hunting crossbow ever produced!</span></p>'),(372225,85,0,174186,'Bubble Level, Optics, Power Stroke, Pro Light Carbon Arrow'),(373296,85,1,174186,'Bubble Level, Optics, Power Stroke, Pro Light Carbon Arrow'),(372226,75,0,174187,'<p><strong>TenPoint Turbo M1 380FPS ACUdraw Pro Range Master Scope Crossbow Package CB19020-5713</strong></p>\r\n<p>The lightest, narrowest, and fastest version in our long line of successful Turbo models, the Turbo M1 features a radically narrow, 9-inch wide bow assembly powered by VX-5™ inverted cams that elongate the power-stroke and increase rotation. Available with the optional ACUdraw PRO silent cocking device that makes cocking this crossbow effortless, the Turbo M1 sends arrows down-range with pin-point accuracy at lightning speeds up to 380 feet-per-second.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (w/o foot stirrup):32.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Width Axle-to-Axle (uncocked/cocked):14\" / 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Power Stroke:14\"</li>\r\n<li>Weight (w/out accessories):6.4 lbs.</li>\r\n<li>Speed/KE: Pro Light Carbon Arrow (370-grains):380 FPS / 119 FP KE</li>\r\n<li>Speed/KE: Pro Elite 400 Carbon Arrow (400-grains):370 FPS / 122 FP KE</li>\r\n<li>Speed/KE: EVO-X CenterPunch Carbon Arrow (445-grains):350 FPS / 121 FP KE</li>\r\n<li>Draw style:Forward Draw</li>\r\n<li>Camo: Mossy Oak Break Up</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Package Includes:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Optics: TenPoint Range Master Scope mounted on a machined aluminum 7/8-inch Fixed Dovetail Mount</li>\r\n<li>Cocking Device: ACUdraw PRO</li>\r\n<li>Quiver: 3-Arrow Instant Detach Quiver</li>\r\n<li>Arrows: Three TenPoint Lighted Carbon Arrows with 100-grain practice points</li>\r\n</ul>'),(373297,75,1,174187,'<p><strong>TenPoint Turbo M1 380FPS ACUdraw Pro Range Master Scope Crossbow Package CB19020-5713</strong></p>\r\n<p>The lightest, narrowest, and fastest version in our long line of successful Turbo models, the Turbo M1 features a radically narrow, 9-inch wide bow assembly powered by VX-5™ inverted cams that elongate the power-stroke and increase rotation. Available with the optional ACUdraw PRO silent cocking device that makes cocking this crossbow effortless, the Turbo M1 sends arrows down-range with pin-point accuracy at lightning speeds up to 380 feet-per-second.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (w/o foot stirrup):32.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Width Axle-to-Axle (uncocked/cocked):14\" / 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Power Stroke:14\"</li>\r\n<li>Weight (w/out accessories):6.4 lbs.</li>\r\n<li>Speed/KE: Pro Light Carbon Arrow (370-grains):380 FPS / 119 FP KE</li>\r\n<li>Speed/KE: Pro Elite 400 Carbon Arrow (400-grains):370 FPS / 122 FP KE</li>\r\n<li>Speed/KE: EVO-X CenterPunch Carbon Arrow (445-grains):350 FPS / 121 FP KE</li>\r\n<li>Draw style:Forward Draw</li>\r\n<li>Camo: Mossy Oak Break Up</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Package Includes:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Optics: TenPoint Range Master Scope mounted on a machined aluminum 7/8-inch Fixed Dovetail Mount</li>\r\n<li>Cocking Device: ACUdraw PRO</li>\r\n<li>Quiver: 3-Arrow Instant Detach Quiver</li>\r\n<li>Arrows: Three TenPoint Lighted Carbon Arrows with 100-grain practice points</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372227,76,0,174187,'<p><span>The lightest, narrowest, and fastest version in our long line of successful Turbo models, the Turbo M1 features a radically narrow, 9-inch wide bow assembly powered by VX-5™ inverted cams that elongate the power-stroke and increase rotation.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></p>'),(373298,76,1,174187,'<p><span>The lightest, narrowest, and fastest version in our long line of successful Turbo models, the Turbo M1 features a radically narrow, 9-inch wide bow assembly powered by VX-5™ inverted cams that elongate the power-stroke and increase rotation.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></p>'),(372228,85,0,174187,'Optics, Power Stroke, Mossy Oak Break Up, TenPoint Range Master Scope'),(373299,85,1,174187,'Optics, Power Stroke, Mossy Oak Break Up, TenPoint Range Master Scope'),(372241,75,0,174188,'<p>The Best of the Best Powered by a reverse-draw design that utilizes the full 17 of power stroke the NEW Vapor RS470 generates supercharged speeds up to 470 FPS and is equipped with the NEW revolutionary ACUslide silent cocking and safe de-cocking system. Measuring an ultra-narrow 6.5-inches wide the industrys premier crossbow features our 3.5 pound 2-stage S1 trigger that delivers our most crisp consistent break ever leading to same hole down-range accuracy.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Shoots arrows up to 470 FPS</li>\r\n<li>ACUslide cocking and de-cocking system allows you to de-cock your crossbow without shooting an arrow</li>\r\n<li>RX-7 CamsTM and Vector QuadTM Cable System deliver nock-splitting, down-range accuracy</li>\r\n<li>2-stage S1 trigger mechanism with 3.5-lb. trigger break</li>\r\n<li>Lightweight TEC-X stock with pass-through fore-grip</li>\r\n<li>CNC-machined 6061-T6 aluminum TRI-LOCKTM limb pocket system and riser</li>\r\n<li>DUAL FLEXTM limbs</li>\r\n<li>20\" MICRO-TRACTM fluted aluminum flight rail</li>\r\n<li>Auto-engaging safety mechanism</li>\r\n<li>DFI (Dry-Fire-Inhibitor)TM prevents crossbow from dry-firing</li>\r\n<li>Includes Ready-to-Hunt Accessory Package</li>\r\n<li>Made in the USA</li>\r\n<li>Ready-to-Hunt Accessory Package</li>\r\n<li>EVO-X Marksman Precision scope</li>\r\n<li>TenPoint® STAG hard crossbow case</li>\r\n<li>(6) EVO-X CenterPunch Premium arrows (.001\" straightness)</li>\r\n<li>(6) EVO-X Lighted CenterPunch Premium arrows (.001\" straightness)</li>\r\n<li>(3) EVO-X CenterPunch rear-deploying broadheads</li>\r\n<li>TenPoint® sling</li>\r\n<li>Integrated string stop system</li>\r\n<li>TenPoint® 6-arrow tech quiver</li>\r\n</ul>'),(373300,75,1,174188,'<p>The Best of the Best Powered by a reverse-draw design that utilizes the full 17 of power stroke the NEW Vapor RS470 generates supercharged speeds up to 470 FPS and is equipped with the NEW revolutionary ACUslide silent cocking and safe de-cocking system. Measuring an ultra-narrow 6.5-inches wide the industrys premier crossbow features our 3.5 pound 2-stage S1 trigger that delivers our most crisp consistent break ever leading to same hole down-range accuracy.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Shoots arrows up to 470 FPS</li>\r\n<li>ACUslide cocking and de-cocking system allows you to de-cock your crossbow without shooting an arrow</li>\r\n<li>RX-7 CamsTM and Vector QuadTM Cable System deliver nock-splitting, down-range accuracy</li>\r\n<li>2-stage S1 trigger mechanism with 3.5-lb. trigger break</li>\r\n<li>Lightweight TEC-X stock with pass-through fore-grip</li>\r\n<li>CNC-machined 6061-T6 aluminum TRI-LOCKTM limb pocket system and riser</li>\r\n<li>DUAL FLEXTM limbs</li>\r\n<li>20\" MICRO-TRACTM fluted aluminum flight rail</li>\r\n<li>Auto-engaging safety mechanism</li>\r\n<li>DFI (Dry-Fire-Inhibitor)TM prevents crossbow from dry-firing</li>\r\n<li>Includes Ready-to-Hunt Accessory Package</li>\r\n<li>Made in the USA</li>\r\n<li>Ready-to-Hunt Accessory Package</li>\r\n<li>EVO-X Marksman Precision scope</li>\r\n<li>TenPoint® STAG hard crossbow case</li>\r\n<li>(6) EVO-X CenterPunch Premium arrows (.001\" straightness)</li>\r\n<li>(6) EVO-X Lighted CenterPunch Premium arrows (.001\" straightness)</li>\r\n<li>(3) EVO-X CenterPunch rear-deploying broadheads</li>\r\n<li>TenPoint® sling</li>\r\n<li>Integrated string stop system</li>\r\n<li>TenPoint® 6-arrow tech quiver</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372242,76,0,174188,'<p><span>The Best of the Best Powered by a reverse-draw design that utilizes the full 17 of power stroke the NEW Vapor RS470 generates supercharged speeds up to 470 FPS and is equipped with the NEW revolutionary ACUslide silent cocking and safe de-cocking system.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></p>'),(373301,76,1,174188,'<p><span>The Best of the Best Powered by a reverse-draw design that utilizes the full 17 of power stroke the NEW Vapor RS470 generates supercharged speeds up to 470 FPS and is equipped with the NEW revolutionary ACUslide silent cocking and safe de-cocking system.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></p>'),(372243,85,0,174188,'arrows, crossbow, power stroke'),(373302,85,1,174188,'arrows, crossbow, power stroke'),(372253,75,0,174189,'<p>High performance meets economical. Clear, tough, and bright, our popular Crossfire II line is built to exceed the performance standards of similarly priced riflescopes. Long eye relief, a fast-focus eyepiece, fully multi-coated lenses, and resettable MOA turrets are hallmarks of the series.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Magnification: 3-9x</li>\r\n<li>Objective Lens Diameter: 50 mm</li>\r\n<li>Eye Relief: 3.8 inches</li>\r\n<li>Field of View: 32-12.9 ft/100 yds</li>\r\n<li>Tube Size: 1 inch</li>\r\n<li>Turret Style: Capped</li>\r\n<li>Adjustment Graduation: 1/4 MOA</li>\r\n<li>Travel Per Rotation: 15 MOA</li>\r\n<li>Max Elevation Adjustment: 60 MOA</li>\r\n<li>Max Windage Adjustment: 60 MOA</li>\r\n<li>Parallax Setting: 100 yards</li>\r\n<li>Length: 12.80 inches</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 18.4 oz</li>\r\n</ul>'),(373303,75,1,174189,'<p>High performance meets economical. Clear, tough, and bright, our popular Crossfire II line is built to exceed the performance standards of similarly priced riflescopes. Long eye relief, a fast-focus eyepiece, fully multi-coated lenses, and resettable MOA turrets are hallmarks of the series.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Magnification: 3-9x</li>\r\n<li>Objective Lens Diameter: 50 mm</li>\r\n<li>Eye Relief: 3.8 inches</li>\r\n<li>Field of View: 32-12.9 ft/100 yds</li>\r\n<li>Tube Size: 1 inch</li>\r\n<li>Turret Style: Capped</li>\r\n<li>Adjustment Graduation: 1/4 MOA</li>\r\n<li>Travel Per Rotation: 15 MOA</li>\r\n<li>Max Elevation Adjustment: 60 MOA</li>\r\n<li>Max Windage Adjustment: 60 MOA</li>\r\n<li>Parallax Setting: 100 yards</li>\r\n<li>Length: 12.80 inches</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 18.4 oz</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372254,76,0,174189,'<p><span>High performance meets economical. Clear, tough, and bright, our popular Crossfire II line is built to exceed the performance standards of similarly priced riflescopes. Long eye relief, a fast-focus eyepiece, fully multi-coated lenses, and resettable MOA turrets are hallmarks of the series.</span></p>'),(373304,76,1,174189,'<p><span>High performance meets economical. Clear, tough, and bright, our popular Crossfire II line is built to exceed the performance standards of similarly priced riflescopes. Long eye relief, a fast-focus eyepiece, fully multi-coated lenses, and resettable MOA turrets are hallmarks of the series.</span></p>'),(372255,85,0,174189,'vortex, optics, high performance'),(373305,85,1,174189,'vortex, optics, high performance'),(372281,75,0,174190,'<p><span>Vortex has redesigned their bestselling rifle scope in the Crossfire. With the sleek new style and added features, the Crossfire will no doubt continue to outperform every scope in its class. The new line features longer eye relief, fast focus eye piece and redesigned, finger adjustable, zero resettable 1/2 MOA capped turrets. Fully multi-coated lenses with anti-reflective coating deliver amazing light transmission with edge to edge clarity. The rugged 1-piece tube is nitrogen purged and O-ring sealed for 100% waterproofing and fog proofing at any elevation in any conditions. You shouldn\'t have to struggle to find your target and with the generous eye box and ample field of view allow for the easiest target acquisition. The new Crossfire delivers exactly what you need, and then some. Covered by Vortex\'s VIP lifetime warranty.</span></p>'),(373306,75,1,174190,'<p><span>Vortex has redesigned their bestselling rifle scope in the Crossfire. With the sleek new style and added features, the Crossfire will no doubt continue to outperform every scope in its class. The new line features longer eye relief, fast focus eye piece and redesigned, finger adjustable, zero resettable 1/2 MOA capped turrets. Fully multi-coated lenses with anti-reflective coating deliver amazing light transmission with edge to edge clarity. The rugged 1-piece tube is nitrogen purged and O-ring sealed for 100% waterproofing and fog proofing at any elevation in any conditions. You shouldn\'t have to struggle to find your target and with the generous eye box and ample field of view allow for the easiest target acquisition. The new Crossfire delivers exactly what you need, and then some. Covered by Vortex\'s VIP lifetime warranty.</span></p>'),(372282,76,0,174190,'<p><span>Vortex has redesigned their bestselling rifle scope in the Crossfire. With the sleek new style and added features, the Crossfire will no doubt continue to outperform every scope in its class.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></p>'),(373307,76,1,174190,'<p><span>Vortex has redesigned their bestselling rifle scope in the Crossfire. With the sleek new style and added features, the Crossfire will no doubt continue to outperform every scope in its class.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></p>'),(372283,85,0,174190,'optics, accessories, vortex, waterproof, fog proof'),(373308,85,1,174190,'optics, accessories, vortex, waterproof, fog proof'),(372290,75,0,174191,'<p>The Vortex StrikeFire 2 is the perfect solution for a shooter looking for a red dot sight that allows for lightning fast target acquisition. This StrikeFire 2 features an unlimited field of view, unlimited eye relief and 1x magnification, allowing the shooter to keep both eyes open.  The bright red or green dot has 10 brightness settings including 2-night vision levels. Typical battery life is 300-600 hours and the scope has a built in 12-hour auto-shutdown feature to maximize performance.  The StrikeFire 2 includes flip caps, CR2 Battery, and the Vortex VIP Lifetime Warranty. The lower 1/3 co-witness cantilever picatinny mount model is ideal for AR platforms, positioning the optic bore center 40mm above the base surface. </p>\r\n<p><b><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Features</span></b></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Parallax Free</li>\r\n<li>10 Brightness Levels</li>\r\n<li>Single Piece Chassis</li>\r\n<li>Waterproof/Fogproof/Shockproof</li>\r\n<li>Hard Anodized Finish</li>\r\n<li>Unlimited Eye Relief</li>\r\n<li>12 Hour Auto Shut-Off Feature</li>\r\n</ul>'),(373309,75,1,174191,'<p>The Vortex StrikeFire 2 is the perfect solution for a shooter looking for a red dot sight that allows for lightning fast target acquisition. This StrikeFire 2 features an unlimited field of view, unlimited eye relief and 1x magnification, allowing the shooter to keep both eyes open.  The bright red or green dot has 10 brightness settings including 2-night vision levels. Typical battery life is 300-600 hours and the scope has a built in 12-hour auto-shutdown feature to maximize performance.  The StrikeFire 2 includes flip caps, CR2 Battery, and the Vortex VIP Lifetime Warranty. The lower 1/3 co-witness cantilever picatinny mount model is ideal for AR platforms, positioning the optic bore center 40mm above the base surface. </p>\r\n<p><b><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Features</span></b></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Parallax Free</li>\r\n<li>10 Brightness Levels</li>\r\n<li>Single Piece Chassis</li>\r\n<li>Waterproof/Fogproof/Shockproof</li>\r\n<li>Hard Anodized Finish</li>\r\n<li>Unlimited Eye Relief</li>\r\n<li>12 Hour Auto Shut-Off Feature</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372291,76,0,174191,'<p><span>The Vortex StrikeFire 2 is the perfect solution for a shooter looking for a red dot sight that allows for lightning fast target acquisition.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></p>'),(373310,76,1,174191,'<p><span>The Vortex StrikeFire 2 is the perfect solution for a shooter looking for a red dot sight that allows for lightning fast target acquisition.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></p>'),(372292,85,0,174191,'red dot, sight, single piece chassis, 12 hour auto-off feature'),(373311,85,1,174191,'red dot, sight, single piece chassis, 12 hour auto-off feature'),(372301,75,0,174192,'<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span>The HE508T-RD-X2 is an open reflex optical sight designed for pistol applications. Features include Titanium housing, Holosun\'s Super LED with up to 50k hours battery life; 12 brightness setting- 10 Daylight &amp; 2 night vision; parallax free and unlimited eye relief; solar failsafe and shake awake. Includes Picatinny mount, lens cloth, CR1632 battery, T10 L Key and user manual.</span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>'),(373315,75,1,174192,'<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span>The HE508T-RD-X2 is an open reflex optical sight designed for pistol applications. Features include Titanium housing, Holosun\'s Super LED with up to 50k hours battery life; 12 brightness setting- 10 Daylight &amp; 2 night vision; parallax free and unlimited eye relief; solar failsafe and shake awake. Includes Picatinny mount, lens cloth, CR1632 battery, T10 L Key and user manual.</span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>'),(372302,76,0,174192,'<p>The HE508T-RD-X2 is an open reflex optical sight designed for pistol applications.</p>'),(373316,76,1,174192,'<p>The HE508T-RD-X2 is an open reflex optical sight designed for pistol applications.</p>'),(372303,85,0,174192,'pistol accessories, titanium housing, super LED\r\n'),(373317,85,1,174192,'pistol accessories, titanium housing, super LED\r\n'),(372307,75,0,174193,'<div class=\"product-section-overview\" data-ng-non-bindable=\"\">\r\n<p><span>The HE509T-RD is an enclosed reflex optical sight designed for pistol applications. Features include a Titanium housing, Holosun’s Super LED with up to 50k hours battery life, Multi-Reticle System, Solar Failsafe, and Shake Awake.</span></p>\r\n<p><b>Features</b></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MRS: Circle Dot: Dot Only</li>\r\n<li>Up to 50,000 Hours Battery Life (setting 6)</li>\r\n<li>12 Brightness Setting: 10 DL &amp; 2 NV Compatible</li>\r\n<li>Enclosed Design &amp; Titanium Housing</li>\r\n<li>Convenient Tray Battery Compartment</li>\r\n<li>Parallax-free &amp; Unlimited Eye Relief</li>\r\n<li></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>'),(373312,75,1,174193,'<div class=\"product-section-overview\" data-ng-non-bindable=\"\">\r\n<p><span>The HE509T-RD is an enclosed reflex optical sight designed for pistol applications. Features include a Titanium housing, Holosun’s Super LED with up to 50k hours battery life, Multi-Reticle System, Solar Failsafe, and Shake Awake.</span></p>\r\n<p><b>Features</b></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MRS: Circle Dot: Dot Only</li>\r\n<li>Up to 50,000 Hours Battery Life (setting 6)</li>\r\n<li>12 Brightness Setting: 10 DL &amp; 2 NV Compatible</li>\r\n<li>Enclosed Design &amp; Titanium Housing</li>\r\n<li>Convenient Tray Battery Compartment</li>\r\n<li>Parallax-free &amp; Unlimited Eye Relief</li>\r\n<li></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>'),(372308,76,0,174193,'<p><span>The HE509T-RD is an enclosed reflex optical sight designed for pistol applications.</span></p>'),(373313,76,1,174193,'<p><span>The HE509T-RD is an enclosed reflex optical sight designed for pistol applications.</span></p>'),(372309,85,0,174193,'optics for pistol, pistol accessories, battery powered'),(373314,85,1,174193,'optics for pistol, pistol accessories, battery powered'),(372358,75,0,174194,'<p>The HS507K is an open reflex optical sight designed for concealed carry pistol applications. Features include Holosun’s Super LED with up to 50k hours battery life, Multi-Reticle System, Shake Awake, and Lock Mode.</p>\r\n<p><b>Features</b>:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MRS: Circle Dot; 2 MOA Dot; 32 MOA Circle</li>\r\n<li>Up to 50,000 Hours Battery Life (Setting 6)</li>\r\n<li>12 Brightness Setting; 10 DL &amp; 2 NV compatible</li>\r\n<li>Convenient Tray Battery Compartment</li>\r\n<li>Parallax-free &amp; Unlimited Eye Relief</li>\r\n<li>Designed for CCW</li>\r\n<li>IP67 Waterproof</li>\r\n<li>Shake Awake<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></li>\r\n<li>Multiple Reticle System</li>\r\n<li>Multilayer Reflective Glass</li>\r\n</ul>'),(373318,75,1,174194,'<p>The HS507K is an open reflex optical sight designed for concealed carry pistol applications. Features include Holosun’s Super LED with up to 50k hours battery life, Multi-Reticle System, Shake Awake, and Lock Mode.</p>\r\n<p><b>Features</b>:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MRS: Circle Dot; 2 MOA Dot; 32 MOA Circle</li>\r\n<li>Up to 50,000 Hours Battery Life (Setting 6)</li>\r\n<li>12 Brightness Setting; 10 DL &amp; 2 NV compatible</li>\r\n<li>Convenient Tray Battery Compartment</li>\r\n<li>Parallax-free &amp; Unlimited Eye Relief</li>\r\n<li>Designed for CCW</li>\r\n<li>IP67 Waterproof</li>\r\n<li>Shake Awake<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></li>\r\n<li>Multiple Reticle System</li>\r\n<li>Multilayer Reflective Glass</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372359,76,0,174194,'<p><span>The HS507K is an open reflex optical sight designed for concealed carry pistol applications.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></p>'),(373319,76,1,174194,'<p><span>The HS507K is an open reflex optical sight designed for concealed carry pistol applications.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></p>'),(372360,85,0,174194,'optical, waterproof, power operated, circle dot\r\n'),(373320,85,1,174194,'optical, waterproof, power operated, circle dot\r\n'),(372361,75,0,174195,'<p><span>The HS507C X2 is an open reflex optical sight designed for pistol applications. The X2 Series pistol optics feature two improvements. First is the addition of Lock Mode from our 2018-2019 LE pistol optic models. Lock Mode, when activated, locks the buttons preventing inadvertent setting changes. Second, the buttons have been redesigned to compliment the Lock Mode by placing them lower and out of the way. Additional features include Holosun’s Super LED with up to 50k hours battery life, Solar Failsafe, Multi-Reticle System, and Shake Awake.</span></p>\r\n<p><b>Features</b>:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2 MOA Dot; 32 MOA Circle</li>\r\n<li>Up to 50,000 Hours Battery Life (Setting 6)</li>\r\n<li>12 Brightness Settings; 10 DL &amp; 2 NV Compatible</li>\r\n<li>Convenient Tray Battery Compartment</li>\r\n<li>Parallax-free &amp; Unlimited Eye Relief</li>\r\n</ul>'),(373321,75,1,174195,'<p><span>The HS507C X2 is an open reflex optical sight designed for pistol applications. The X2 Series pistol optics feature two improvements. First is the addition of Lock Mode from our 2018-2019 LE pistol optic models. Lock Mode, when activated, locks the buttons preventing inadvertent setting changes. Second, the buttons have been redesigned to compliment the Lock Mode by placing them lower and out of the way. Additional features include Holosun’s Super LED with up to 50k hours battery life, Solar Failsafe, Multi-Reticle System, and Shake Awake.</span></p>\r\n<p><b>Features</b>:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2 MOA Dot; 32 MOA Circle</li>\r\n<li>Up to 50,000 Hours Battery Life (Setting 6)</li>\r\n<li>12 Brightness Settings; 10 DL &amp; 2 NV Compatible</li>\r\n<li>Convenient Tray Battery Compartment</li>\r\n<li>Parallax-free &amp; Unlimited Eye Relief</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372362,76,0,174195,'<p><span>The HS507C X2 is an open reflex optical sight designed for pistol applications. </span></p>'),(373322,76,1,174195,'<p><span>The HS507C X2 is an open reflex optical sight designed for pistol applications. </span></p>'),(372363,85,0,174195,'optics, pistol optics, battery powered, matte, red reticle solar'),(373323,85,1,174195,'optics, pistol optics, battery powered, matte, red reticle solar'),(372364,75,0,174196,'<p>The PARALOW HS503CU is a small compact red dot sight with the option of a 2MOA dot only or a 2 MOA dot with a 65MOA circle reticle pattern. Employing LED technology, the life time for one CR2032 battery can reach 2 years if left on constantly. However, the solar technology and automatic brightness features work together to extend the battery life dramatically beyond that for the average shooter. The U signifies a housing design that shrouds the windage and elevation turrets on two sides. The sight may be installed on various firearms such as shotguns, pistols, rifles, air rifles and crossbows.</p>\r\n<p><b><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Features</span></b></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2 MOA dot &amp; 65 MOA Circle</li>\r\n<li>Unlimited field of view</li>\r\n<li>Parallax-free with unlimited eye relief</li>\r\n<li>Durable and reliable construction</li>\r\n<li>Low mount and 1/3 Co-witness mount included</li>\r\n</ul>'),(373324,75,1,174196,'<p>The PARALOW HS503CU is a small compact red dot sight with the option of a 2MOA dot only or a 2 MOA dot with a 65MOA circle reticle pattern. Employing LED technology, the life time for one CR2032 battery can reach 2 years if left on constantly. However, the solar technology and automatic brightness features work together to extend the battery life dramatically beyond that for the average shooter. The U signifies a housing design that shrouds the windage and elevation turrets on two sides. The sight may be installed on various firearms such as shotguns, pistols, rifles, air rifles and crossbows.</p>\r\n<p><b><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Features</span></b></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2 MOA dot &amp; 65 MOA Circle</li>\r\n<li>Unlimited field of view</li>\r\n<li>Parallax-free with unlimited eye relief</li>\r\n<li>Durable and reliable construction</li>\r\n<li>Low mount and 1/3 Co-witness mount included</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372365,76,0,174196,'<p><span>The PARALOW HS503CU is a small compact red dot sight with the option of a 2MOA dot only or a 2 MOA dot with a 65MOA circle reticle pattern. </span></p>'),(373325,76,1,174196,'<p><span>The PARALOW HS503CU is a small compact red dot sight with the option of a 2MOA dot only or a 2 MOA dot with a 65MOA circle reticle pattern. </span></p>'),(372366,85,0,174196,'small compact red dot, LED technology, automatic brightness'),(373326,85,1,174196,'small compact red dot, LED technology, automatic brightness'),(372367,75,0,174197,'<p>The HS403R is a small compact micro red dot optic that features Holosun’s rheostat dial to adjust brightness settings. This intensity control brings you everything you love about a Holosun, only faster! Employing Holosun’s ultra-efficient LED technology, The HS403R can achieve a “constant on” battery life of up to 5 years.</p>\r\n<p><b>Features</b></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rotary control for faster operation and visual brightness indicator</li>\r\n<li>Advanced technology LED allows up to 100,000 hours of operation on one CR2032 battery</li>\r\n<li>2 MOA on dot size</li>\r\n<li>Unlimited field of view</li>\r\n<li>Parallax-free with unlimited eye relief</li>\r\n<li>Durable and reliable construction</li>\r\n<li>Low mount and 1/3 Co-witness mount included</li>\r\n</ul>'),(373327,75,1,174197,'<p>The HS403R is a small compact micro red dot optic that features Holosun’s rheostat dial to adjust brightness settings. This intensity control brings you everything you love about a Holosun, only faster! Employing Holosun’s ultra-efficient LED technology, The HS403R can achieve a “constant on” battery life of up to 5 years.</p>\r\n<p><b>Features</b></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rotary control for faster operation and visual brightness indicator</li>\r\n<li>Advanced technology LED allows up to 100,000 hours of operation on one CR2032 battery</li>\r\n<li>2 MOA on dot size</li>\r\n<li>Unlimited field of view</li>\r\n<li>Parallax-free with unlimited eye relief</li>\r\n<li>Durable and reliable construction</li>\r\n<li>Low mount and 1/3 Co-witness mount included</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372368,76,0,174197,'<p><span>The HS403R is a small compact micro red dot optic that features Holosun’s rheostat dial to adjust brightness settings.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></p>'),(373328,76,1,174197,'<p><span>The HS403R is a small compact micro red dot optic that features Holosun’s rheostat dial to adjust brightness settings.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></p>'),(372369,85,0,174197,'optics, micro red dot optics, holosun'),(373329,85,1,174197,'optics, micro red dot optics, holosun'),(372370,75,0,174198,'<p>The HE403C-GR Elite is the green reticle, solar version of the extremely popular HS403C red-dot. It features a crisp green 2MOA dot. The highly efficient light emitting diodes and solar cells allow Holosun solar optics to run without a battery in many lighting conditions. Additionally, the CR2032 battery lasts up to 5-years. The HE403C-GR Elite is compatible with industry standard mounting solutions.</p>\r\n<p><b><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Features</span></b></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Night vision compatible</li>\r\n<li>50,000 hours of operation on one battery</li>\r\n<li>Green - 2 MOA dot size</li>\r\n<li>Parallax-free with unlimited eye relief</li>\r\n<li>Solar and battery power supplies</li>\r\n<li>Unaffected by extreme weather conditions</li>\r\n<li>Low mount and 1/3 Co-witness mount included</li>\r\n</ul>'),(373330,75,1,174198,'<p>The HE403C-GR Elite is the green reticle, solar version of the extremely popular HS403C red-dot. It features a crisp green 2MOA dot. The highly efficient light emitting diodes and solar cells allow Holosun solar optics to run without a battery in many lighting conditions. Additionally, the CR2032 battery lasts up to 5-years. The HE403C-GR Elite is compatible with industry standard mounting solutions.</p>\r\n<p><b><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Features</span></b></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Night vision compatible</li>\r\n<li>50,000 hours of operation on one battery</li>\r\n<li>Green - 2 MOA dot size</li>\r\n<li>Parallax-free with unlimited eye relief</li>\r\n<li>Solar and battery power supplies</li>\r\n<li>Unaffected by extreme weather conditions</li>\r\n<li>Low mount and 1/3 Co-witness mount included</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372371,76,0,174198,'<p><span>The HE403C-GR Elite is the green reticle, solar version of the extremely popular HS403C red-dot.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></p>'),(373331,76,1,174198,'<p><span>The HE403C-GR Elite is the green reticle, solar version of the extremely popular HS403C red-dot.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></p>'),(372372,85,0,174198,'green dot, solar and battery power supply, night vision compatible\r\n\r\n'),(373332,85,1,174198,'green dot, solar and battery power supply, night vision compatible\r\n\r\n'),(372382,75,0,174199,'<p>The narrow version CUGA VEST are durable-adjustable-protection for the active dog in your life.<br /><br />Made in the USA with 1000 Denier Cordura brand fabric.<br /><br />Machine Washable and Hang Dry.<br /><br />One year warranty on materials and craftsmanship.<br /><br />Extra Small CUGA Vest fit most dogs 18-30 pounds.<br