healthy well-being</p>\r\n<p class=\"a-spacing-base\"><strong>BETTER THAN THE REST</strong>: The only Non-GMO verified, Vegan Certified, 100% Plant-Based capsule available. </p>'),(373459,76,1,174243,'<p>Vitamin D plays an essential role in your body ability to strengthen your immune system and build strong bones. Most vitamin D sources are from animal sources like sheep’s wool or duck feathers while TruWild’s is from vegan natural sources of mushrooms and lichen. Paired with over 300mg of calcium from ocean rich minerals to aid in strong bones and increased healthy well-being</p>\r\n<p class=\"a-spacing-base\"><strong>BETTER THAN THE REST</strong>: The only Non-GMO verified, Vegan Certified, 100% Plant-Based capsule available. </p>'),(372607,85,0,174243,'vitamin d, coral calcium, vegan vitamin d from lichen & mushrooms'),(373460,85,1,174243,'vitamin d, coral calcium, vegan vitamin d from lichen & mushrooms'),(372651,75,0,174253,'<div>Hybrid Kydex/saddle leather construction<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div>Premium center cut steerhide lining<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div>Tuckable design with metal belt clips and optional C-Hooks<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div>Raised sweat guard to protect pistol and wearer<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div>Kydex pocket for easy holstering<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div>UniClip fits belt up to 1 1/2\"<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div>Ultimate Stealth clip fits belts of unlimited width<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div>Patent pending</div>'),(372654,75,1,174253,'<div>Hybrid Kydex/saddle leather construction<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div>Premium center cut steerhide lining<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div>Tuckable design with metal belt clips and optional C-Hooks<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div>Raised sweat guard to protect pistol and wearer<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div>Kydex pocket for easy holstering<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div>UniClip fits belt up to 1 1/2\"<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div>Ultimate Stealth clip fits belts of unlimited width<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div>Patent pending</div>'),(372652,76,0,174253,'<ul>\r\n<li class=\"prod_tab_1 prod_tab prod_tab_cur\">\r\n<div class=\"prod_desc\">\r\n<div>Galco’s highly popular KingTuk Deluxe™ tuckable IWB reigns supreme in comfort, speed, and versatility!<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div>The patented KingTuk Deluxe provides the best of both worlds: a comfortable backing plate made of saddle leather and lined with Premium Center Cut Steerhide, with a rigid Kydex® holster pocket for a fast draw and easy holstering.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div><span><br /></span></div>\r\n<div>Worn inside the waistband, the KingTuk Deluxe includes Galco’s patent-pending polymer UniClip™ and Ultimate Stealth™ clip designs for excellent concealment, stability and easy on-off capability. The clips can be moved up or down in the corresponding holes in the leather, enabling the user to set the carry height and angle to suit their unique preferences.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div><br />Available in black.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372655,76,1,174253,'<ul>\r\n<li class=\"prod_tab_1 prod_tab prod_tab_cur\">\r\n<div class=\"prod_desc\">\r\n<div>Galco’s highly popular KingTuk Deluxe™ tuckable IWB reigns supreme in comfort, speed, and versatility!<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div>The patented KingTuk Deluxe provides the best of both worlds: a comfortable backing plate made of saddle leather and lined with Premium Center Cut Steerhide, with a rigid Kydex® holster pocket for a fast draw and easy holstering.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div><span><br /></span></div>\r\n<div>Worn inside the waistband, the KingTuk Deluxe includes Galco’s patent-pending polymer UniClip™ and Ultimate Stealth™ clip designs for excellent concealment, stability and easy on-off capability. The clips can be moved up or down in the corresponding holes in the leather, enabling the user to set the carry height and angle to suit their unique preferences.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div><br />Available in black.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372653,85,0,174253,'kingtuk deluxe IWB holster, holster, accessories'),(372656,85,1,174253,'kingtuk deluxe IWB holster, holster, accessories'),(372658,75,0,174254,'<ul>\r\n<li>Premium Steerhide<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></li>\r\n<li>Open top<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></li>\r\n<li>Butt-forward cant<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></li>\r\n<li>Metal-reinforced mouth<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 1 3/4\" belt loops<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></li>\r\n<li>Optional/replacement 1 1/4\", 1 1/2\" and 1 3/4\" belt loops available</li>\r\n</ul>'),(373360,75,1,174254,'<ul>\r\n<li>Premium Steerhide<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></li>\r\n<li>Open top<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></li>\r\n<li>Butt-forward cant<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></li>\r\n<li>Metal-reinforced mouth<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 1 3/4\" belt loops<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></li>\r\n<li>Optional/replacement 1 1/4\", 1 1/2\" and 1 3/4\" belt loops available</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372659,76,0,174254,'<div>\r\n<div>The Summer Comfort™ is the perfect concealed carry holster for all seasons!<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div>Comfortable and convenient, the Summer Comfort features a snap-on design that allows the holster to attach and detach from the belt without removing the belt. Reinforced premium steerhide construction retains its shape when the handgun is removed, allowing smooth and easy return to the holster. The smooth-out leather construction rides comfortably against the body, and features full firing grip clearance for a quick and sure draw<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div>The Summer Comfort fits belts up to 1 3/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, it\'s available in right or left hand designs in black finish.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"><br /></span></div>\r\n</div>'),(373361,76,1,174254,'<div>\r\n<div>The Summer Comfort™ is the perfect concealed carry holster for all seasons!<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div>Comfortable and convenient, the Summer Comfort features a snap-on design that allows the holster to attach and detach from the belt without removing the belt. Reinforced premium steerhide construction retains its shape when the handgun is removed, allowing smooth and easy return to the holster. The smooth-out leather construction rides comfortably against the body, and features full firing grip clearance for a quick and sure draw<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div>The Summer Comfort fits belts up to 1 3/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, it\'s available in right or left hand designs in black finish.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></div>\r\n<div><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"><br /></span></div>\r\n</div>'),(372660,85,0,174254,'galco, summer comfort, leather holster'),(373362,85,1,174254,'galco, summer comfort, leather holster'),(372661,75,0,174255,'<ul>\r\n<li>Premium Center Cut Steerhide<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></li>\r\n<li>Retention strap with reinforced thumb break<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></li>\r\n<li>Neutral cant<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></li>\r\n<li><span>Modern injection-molded nylon J-clip</span></li>\r\n<li>Fits belts up to 1 3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>'),(373363,75,1,174255,'<ul>\r\n<li>Premium Center Cut Steerhide<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></li>\r\n<li>Retention strap with reinforced thumb break<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></li>\r\n<li>Neutral cant<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></li>\r\n<li><span>Modern injection-molded nylon J-clip</span></li>\r\n<li>Fits belts up to 1 3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372662,76,0,174255,'<ul>\r\n<li class=\"prod_tab_1 prod_tab prod_tab_cur\">\r\n<div class=\"prod_desc\">The Galco Waistband™ IWB offers functionality and economy.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><br /><br />Featuring a reinforced thumb break retention strap, a m<span>odern injection-molded nylon J-clip</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>locks the holster onto the belt. The Waistband holster carries the handgun in a vertical orientation, with no cant or angle, so it can be used strong side, crossdraw, or in front of the hip (appendix carry). Constructed of premium center cut steerhide, the Waistband fits belts up to 13/4\".<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><br /><br />Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Waistband is available in right or left hand designs in black or natural finish.</div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(373364,76,1,174255,'<ul>\r\n<li class=\"prod_tab_1 prod_tab prod_tab_cur\">\r\n<div class=\"prod_desc\">The Galco Waistband™ IWB offers functionality and economy.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><br /><br />Featuring a reinforced thumb break retention strap, a m<span>odern injection-molded nylon J-clip</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>locks the holster onto the belt. The Waistband holster carries the handgun in a vertical orientation, with no cant or angle, so it can be used strong side, crossdraw, or in front of the hip (appendix carry). Constructed of premium center cut steerhide, the Waistband fits belts up to 13/4\".<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><br /><br />Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Waistband is available in right or left hand designs in black or natural finish.</div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(372663,85,0,174255,'galco, holster, right hand, gun accessories'),(373365,85,1,174255,'galco, holster, right hand, gun accessories'),(372664,75,0,174256,'<p><span>Constructed of durable, virtually maintenance-free Kydex, the Triton 2.0 is fast on the draw, slender in profile, and easy to conceal. The firm holster body allows a smooth and easy return to the holster after the draw, while the raised sweat guard protec</span></p>'),(373366,75,1,174256,'<p><span>Constructed of durable, virtually maintenance-free Kydex, the Triton 2.0 is fast on the draw, slender in profile, and easy to conceal. The firm holster body allows a smooth and easy return to the holster after the draw, while the raised sweat guard protec</span></p>'),(372665,76,0,174256,'<p><span>Kydex construction Adjustable tension units Includes two different belt clips Adjustable for cant Raised sweat guard to protect pistol and wearer UniClip fits belt up to 1 1/2 Ultimate Stealth clip fits belts of unlimited width</span></p>'),(373367,76,1,174256,'<p><span>Kydex construction Adjustable tension units Includes two different belt clips Adjustable for cant Raised sweat guard to protect pistol and wearer UniClip fits belt up to 1 1/2 Ultimate Stealth clip fits belts of unlimited width</span></p>'),(372666,85,0,174256,'Galco accessories, holsters, left handed'),(373368,85,1,174256,'Galco accessories, holsters, left handed'),(372667,75,0,174257,'<p><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span><span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Kydex construction<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span><span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Adjustable tension units<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span><span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Includes two different belt clips<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span><span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Adjustable for cant<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span><span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Raised sweat guard to protect pistol and wearer<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span><span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">UniClip fits belt up to 1 1/2\"<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span><span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Ultimate Stealth clip fits belts of unlimited width<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Available in black</span></span></span></p>'),(373369,75,1,174257,'<p><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span><span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Kydex construction<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span><span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Adjustable tension units<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span><span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Includes two different belt clips<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span><span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Adjustable for cant<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span><span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Raised sweat guard to protect pistol and wearer<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span><span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">UniClip fits belt up to 1 1/2\"<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span><span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Ultimate Stealth clip fits belts of unlimited width<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Available in black</span></span></span></p>'),(372668,76,0,174257,'<p><span><span>Constructed of durable, virtually maintenance-free Kydex®, the Triton™ 2.0 is fast on the draw, slender in profile, and easy to conceal. The firm holster body allows a smooth and easy return to the holster after the draw, while the raised sweat guard protects the pistol from corrosive perspiration – and also protects the wearer’s skin from hard steel!</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></p>\r\n<p><span><span>The improved Triton 2.0’s belt clips are adjustable for cant, making it suitable for the strongside, crossdraw, or appendix carry positions.</span><span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span><span>The Triton 2.0 is supplied with two types of interchangeable tuckable clips. The first is the UniClip™, designed to go over the belt, but which also works well without a belt. The second is the Ultimate Stealth™ clip with hook, which fits on the trouser waistband, under or behind a belt with just the clip showing, for the ultimate in stealthy concealment!<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span><span>The Triton 2.0 is available in black.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></p>'),(373370,76,1,174257,'<p><span><span>Constructed of durable, virtually maintenance-free Kydex®, the Triton™ 2.0 is fast on the draw, slender in profile, and easy to conceal. The firm holster body allows a smooth and easy return to the holster after the draw, while the raised sweat guard protects the pistol from corrosive perspiration – and also protects the wearer’s skin from hard steel!</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></p>\r\n<p><span><span>The improved Triton 2.0’s belt clips are adjustable for cant, making it suitable for the strongside, crossdraw, or appendix carry positions.</span><span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span><span>The Triton 2.0 is supplied with two types of interchangeable tuckable clips. The first is the UniClip™, designed to go over the belt, but which also works well without a belt. The second is the Ultimate Stealth™ clip with hook, which fits on the trouser waistband, under or behind a belt with just the clip showing, for the ultimate in stealthy concealment!<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span><span>The Triton 2.0 is available in black.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></p>'),(372669,85,0,174257,'Galco accessories, holsters, right hand, compact'),(373371,85,1,174257,'Galco accessories, holsters, right hand, compact'),(372700,75,0,174269,'WSI\'s best selling HexaCamo Leggings provide you with comfortable compression, durable, squat proof, breathable American-made quality. These leggings feature a wide waistband with built in elastic for added comfort. 100% Made in USA'),(372701,75,1,174269,'WSI\'s best selling HexaCamo Leggings provide you with comfortable compression, durable, squat proof, breathable American-made quality. These leggings feature a wide waistband with built in elastic for added comfort. 100% Made in USA'),(372702,75,0,174270,'WSI\'s best selling HexaCamo Leggings provide you with comfortable compression, durable, squat proof, breathable American-made quality. These leggings feature a wide waistband with built in elastic for added comfort. 100% Made in USA'),(372703,75,1,174270,'WSI\'s best selling HexaCamo Leggings provide you with comfortable compression, durable, squat proof, breathable American-made quality. These leggings feature a wide waistband with built in elastic for added comfort. 100% Made in USA'),(372704,75,0,174271,'WSI\'s best selling HexaCamo Leggings provide you with comfortable compression, durable, squat proof, breathable American-made quality. These leggings feature a wide waistband with built in elastic for added comfort. 100% Made in USA'),(372705,75,1,174271,'WSI\'s best selling HexaCamo Leggings provide you with comfortable compression, durable, squat proof, breathable American-made quality. These leggings feature a wide waistband with built in elastic for added comfort. 100% Made in USA'),(372706,75,0,174272,'WSI\'s best selling HexaCamo Leggings provide you with comfortable compression, durable, squat proof, breathable American-made quality. These leggings feature a wide waistband with built in elastic fo