ng> (Minnesota Innovation) for the Nation!</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"yj6qo ajU\">\r\n<div id=\":m2\" class=\"ajR\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tooltip=\"Show trimmed content\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><strong><em>Product Features: </em></strong></p>\r\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\r\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Comfortable, lightweight and feels great against the skin </li>\r\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Feels drier than cotton</li>\r\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Looking good never felt so good</li>\r\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Keeps you safe in extreme solar conditions</li>\r\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Scoop neck, short sleeve &amp; contour fit</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul></ul>\r\n<ul></ul>\r\n<p><strong><em>Material Tech:</em></strong></p>\r\n<p><em><span> ✔ </span>SoftTECH™: 92% Polyester, 8% Spandex</em></p>\r\n<p><span> ✔</span>Advanced Wicking Properties</p>\r\n<p><span> ✔</span>Anti-Microbial Properties</p>\r\n<p><span> ✔</span>Anti-Snag technology </p>\r\n<p><span> ✔</span>UPF 50 + Sun Protection</p>\r\n<p><strong>SHOW YOUR PRIDE &amp; BUY IT NOW!</strong> </p>'),(373780,76,1,174347,'<p>Comfortable, lightweight and feels great against the skin <br />Feels drier than cotton<br />Looking good never felt so good<br />Keeps you safe in extreme solar conditions<br />Scoop neck, short sleeve &amp; contour fit</p>'),(373781,85,1,174347,'WSI Sports Patriot SoftTech Short Sleeve Heather Grey'),(372839,75,0,174349,'This Patriotic, American-Made, shirt is super comfortable and lightweight. A must have summer shirt. Our SoftTech™ fabric feels great against the skin, wicks moisture away, and protects against the sun. 100% Made in USA'),(372840,75,1,174349,'This Patriotic, American-Made, shirt is super comfortable and lightweight. A must have summer shirt. Our SoftTech™ fabric feels great against the skin, wicks moisture away, and protects against the sun. 100% Made in USA'),(372841,75,0,174350,'This Patriotic, American-Made, shirt is super comfortable and lightweight. A mu