variety of light conditions. Stay focused, on-target and get your kit today!</span><span class=\"s1\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<div><span class=\"s1\"><br /></span></div>'),(373219,85,0,174520,'SSP Eyewear Chelan AST Kit'),(373229,75,0,174524,'<p>Survivor Filter\'s Made in USA Water Bottle replaces 426 Single-Use Bottles</p>\r\n<p>Simply fill, squeeze and drink<span> 900ml (30oz) of clean water in 30 seconds! </span>Filtering microplastics, chlorine, bacteria, parasites, toxic chemicals and heavy metals, The ACTIVE Filtration Bottle improves water taste and meets ANSI/NSF 42 &amp; 53 Standards that match or exceed in-home filtration systems - all while on the go!</p>\r\n<p><span>Our tests are publicly available as we don’t make claims that are not independently verified from accredited labs within the USA. </span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Tested independently in the USA to show 99.99% filtration removal of: </strong>Toxic Chemicals, Bacteria, Parasites , Heavy Metals</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Chlorine</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Detergents</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Pesticides</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Mircoplastics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>VOC\'s</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>PCB\'s</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>SOC\'s</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>DDT</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>E.Coli</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Cryptosporidium</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Giardia</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Aluminum</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Cadmium</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Chromium</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Lead</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Mercury</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Radiologicals</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul></ul>\r\n<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p class=\"info-wrap\">Water passes through an ionic adsorption filter to provide you with fresh tasting water instantaneously. Designed to prevent mold or mildew from growing so you will never have to worry about colonization of microbes within the filter.</p>\r\n<p class=\"info-container-body\">Contaminated water passes through The ACTIVE Filter that blocks contaminants to remove chlorine, VOCs, toxins, bacteria, parasites, unpleasant tastes and odor. The ACTIVE Filter can be reused up to 100 gallons or 426 refills with city water. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Specifications:</p>\r\n<p><strong>Product SKU#: </strong>W100</p>\r\n<p><strong>Replacement Filter SKU#: </strong>W100-F</p>\r\n<p><strong>Capacity:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Municipal Tap Water: <span>100 gal / 575 refills when filtering tap water</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Raw, Untreated Water: 25 gal / 145 refills when filtering lakes, rivers, streams and natural bodies of water</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Flow Rate:  </strong>1.8 liter per minute (60 ounces/minute)</p>\r\n<p><strong>Materials:</strong> BPA Free Low-density polyethylene </p>\r\n<p><strong>Size:</strong> 3 x 10 x 3\"</p>\r\n<p><strong>Weight:</strong> 4.9 ounces</p>'),(373232,75,1,174524,'<p>Survivor Filter\'s Made in USA Water Bottle replaces 426 Single-Use Bottles</p>\r\n<p>Simply fill, squeeze and drink<span> 900ml (30oz) of clean water in 30 seconds! </span>Filtering microplastics, chlorine, bacteria, parasites, toxic chemicals and heavy metals, The ACTIVE Filtration Bottle improves water taste and meets ANSI/NSF 42 &amp; 53 Standards that match or exceed in-home filtration systems - all while on the go!</p>\r\n<p><span>Our tests are publicly available as we don’t make claims that are not independently verified from accredited labs within the USA. </span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Tested independently in the USA to show 99.99% filtration removal of: </strong>Toxic Chemicals, Bacteria, Parasites , Heavy Metals</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Chlorine</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Detergents</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Pesticides</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Mircoplastics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>VOC\'s</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>PCB\'s</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>SOC\'s</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>DDT</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>E.Coli</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Cryptosporidium</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Giardia</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Aluminum</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Cadmium</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Chromium</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Lead</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Mercury</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Radiologicals</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul></ul>\r\n<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p class=\"info-wrap\">Water passes through an ionic adsorption filter to provide you with fresh tasting water instantaneously. Designed to prevent mold or mildew from growing so you will never have to worry about colonization of microbes within the filter.</p>\r\n<p class=\"info-container-body\">Contaminated water passes through The ACTIVE Filter that blocks contaminants to remove chlorine, VOCs, toxins, bacteria, parasites, unpleasant tastes and odor. The ACTIVE Filter can be reused up to 100 gallons or 426 refills with city water. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Specifications:</p>\r\n<p><strong>Product SKU#: </strong>W100</p>\r\n<p><strong>Replacement Filter SKU#: </strong>W100-F</p>\r\n<p><strong>Capacity:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Municipal Tap Water: <span>100 gal / 575 refills when filtering tap water</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Raw, Untreated Water: 25 gal / 145 refills when filtering lakes, rivers, streams and natural bodies of water</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Flow Rate:  </strong>1.8 liter per minute (60 ounces/minute)</p>\r\n<p><strong>Materials:</strong> BPA Free Low-density polyethylene </p>\r\n<p><strong>Size:</strong> 3 x 10 x 3\"</p>\r\n<p><strong>Weight:</strong> 4.9 ounces</p>'),(373230,76,0,174524,'<p>(2) SURVIVOR FILTER™ ACTIVE Filtration Bottle\'s (900mL)</p>'),(373233,76,1,174524,'<p>(2) SURVIVOR FILTER™ ACTIVE Filtration Bottle\'s (900mL)</p>'),(373231,85,0,174524,'SURVIVOR FILTER™ ACTIVE Filtration Bottle (900mL), filtration bottle, water filtration, everest.com'),(373234,85,1,174524,'SURVIVOR FILTER™ ACTIVE Filtration Bottle (900mL), filtration bottle, water filtration, everest.com'),(373235,75,0,174525,'<p class=\"wistia_swatch\">Introducing the World\'s First Portable Electric Water Filter that can be used with any plug, mobile charger or 2-AA batteries. The Electric Survivor Filter PRO X uses the same filtering technology that you know and love from<span> </span>Survivor Filter PRO.</p>\r\n<div class=\"wistia_swatch\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"wistia_swatch\">The PRO X produces 500 ml of water per minute (17 oz/minute) at the push of a button. The two (2)-AA HIGH ENERGY™ Alkaline Batteries | Rayovac® included are good for up to 360 liters (95 gallons) of filtered water.</div>\r\n<div class=\"wistia_swatch\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"wistia_swatch\">Tested at Multiple USA labs to show:<br />\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Log 5 Removal 99.999% of Protozoa (Cryptosporidium, Giardia and Parasites)</li>\r\n<li>Log 5 Removal 99.999% of tested Virus (Phi X-174), Staph and Bacteria</li>\r\n<li>99.5% Mercury and 93% Lead Removal which matches or exceeds most home systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\r\n<div><strong>Stage 1: </strong>Ultra Filter Pre-Filter</div>\r\n<p class=\"info-container-body\"><span>First, contaminated water passes through the 0.1 Micron Pre-Filter that acts like a barrier to help remove algae, giardia, e.coli, protozoa and cryptosporidium. The Pre-Filter can be back washed and reused up to 100,000 liters.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"info-container-body\"><span><strong>Stage 2:</strong> Carbon Filter</span><br /><span>Then the water moves through the Carbon Filter - located inside the device, the Carbon Filter is designed to help reduce heavy metals, chemicals and pollutants by absorbing the contaminants. The Carbon Filter can be cleaned and reused up to 2,000 liters.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"info-container-body\"><span><strong>Stage 3:</strong> Internal Ultra Filter</span><br /><span>Finally, water passes the final Internal Ultra Filter. Independent tests have shown that the 0.01 Micron Ultra Filter can filter out 99.999% of testes virus and staph. The Ultra Filter can be easily back washed and reused up to 100,000 liters.</span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n<p><span><strong>Product SKU#: </strong>L800</span></p>\r\n<p><span><strong>Replacement Filter SKU#:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span>Pre-Filter: L610-PF</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Carbon Filter: L610-CF</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Ultra Filter: L610-UF</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Hoses and Pre-Filter Kit: L610-UPK</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span><strong>Capacity:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span>Pre-Filter: up to 100,000 liters (26, 417 gallons)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Carbon Filter: up to 2,000 liters (528 gallons)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Ultra Filter: up to 100,000 liters (26, 417 gallons)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span><strong>Flow Rate:  </strong>500 ml per minute (17 ounces/minute)</span></p>\r\n<p><span><strong>Battery Life:</strong> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>AA Batteries: Lasts up to 6 hours on 2 AA-batteries supplied, equivalent to 360 liters (95 gallons) in very dirty water and 442 liters (117 gallons) of water in clearer water conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Wall Outlet: Compatible with standard wall plug with a Input AC of 100-240V and output of 5V 1000mA. Lasts indefinitely (until filters need to be replaced) when plugged directly to a power source</li>\r\n<li>Power Bank: Compatible with any 120-240v external power bank</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span><strong>Size:</strong> 3.2 x 2 x 6.5\"</span></p>\r\n<p><span><strong>Weight:</strong> 13.75 oz</span></p>\r\n<ul></ul>\r\n<p><span><strong>Environmental Requirements: </strong><br /></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Operating ambient temperature: 5° to 25° C (41° to 77° F)*</li>\r\n<li>Non operating temperature: 0° to 27° C (32° to 80° F)*</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span><strong>Components:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span>Electric Survivor Filter PRO X<br /></span></li>\r\n<li><span>2x AA 2-HIGH ENERGY™ Alkaline Batteries | Rayovac®</span></li>\r\n<li>1x 6ft Micro USB Cable</li>\r\n<li>1x USB Wall Charger,<span> </span><span>Ultra Compact Single Port 5.0V-100mA Output (Input: AC100-240V 50/60Hz)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>1x Ultra Filter Pre-Filter<br /></span></li>\r\n<li><span>1x Carbon Filter</span></li>\r\n<li><span>1x Internal Ultra Filter</span></li>\r\n<li><span>1x Inlet Hose (3.25ft)<br /></span></li>\r\n<li><span><span>1x </span>Outlet Hose (1 ft)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>1x Hose Clip<br /></span></li>\r\n<li><span>1x Carrying Case<br /></span></li>\r\n<li><span>1x Back-washing Syringe</span>1x User Manual</li>\r\n</ul>'),(373354,75,1,174525,'<p class=\"wistia_swatch\">Introducing the World\'s First Portable Electric Water Filter that can be used with any plug, mobile charger or 2-AA batteries. The Electric Survivor Filter PRO X uses the same filtering technology that you know and love from<span> </span>Survivor Filter PRO.</p>\r\n<div class=\"wistia_swatch\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"wistia_swatch\">The PRO X produces 500 ml of water per minute (17 oz/minute) at the push of a button. The two (2)-AA HIGH ENERGY™ Alkaline Batteries | Rayovac® included are good for up to 360 liters (95 gallons) of filtered water.</div>\r\n<div class=\"wistia_swatch\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"wistia_swatch\">Tested at Multiple USA labs to show:<br />\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Log 5 Removal 99.999% of Protozoa (Cryptosporidium, Giardia and Parasites)</li>\r\n<li>Log 5 Removal 99.999% of tested Virus (Phi X-174), Staph and Bacteria</li>\r\n<li>99.5% Mercury and 93% Lead Removal which matches or exceeds most home systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\r\n<div><strong>Stage 1: </strong>Ultra Filter Pre-Filter</div>\r\n<p class=\"info-container-body\"><span>First, contaminated water passes through the 0.1 Micron Pre-Filter that acts like a barrier to help remove algae, giardia, e.coli, protozoa and cryptosporidium. The Pre-Filter can be back washed and reused up to 100,000 liters.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"info-container-body\"><span><strong>Stage 2:</strong> Carbon Filter</span><br /><span>Then the water moves through the Carbon Filter - located inside the device, the Carbon Filter is designed to help reduce heavy metals, chemicals and pollutants by absorbing the contaminants. The Carbon Filter can be cleaned and reused up to 2,000 liters.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"info-container-body\"><span><strong>Stage 3:</strong> Internal Ultra Filter</span><br /><span>Finally, water passes the final Internal Ultra Filter. Independent tests have shown that the 0.01 Micron Ultra Filter can filter out 99.999% of testes virus and staph. The Ultra Filter can be easily back washed and reused up to 100,000 liters.</span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n<p><span><strong>Product SKU#: </strong>L800</span></p>\r\n<p><span><strong>Replacement Filter SKU#:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span>Pre-Filter: L610-PF</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Carbon Filter: L610-CF</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Ultra Filter: L610-UF</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Hoses and Pre-Filter Kit: L610-UPK</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span><strong>Capacity:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span>Pre-Filter: up to 100,000 liters (26, 417 gallons)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Carbon Filter: up to 2,000 liters (528 gallons)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>Ultra Filter: up to 100,000 liters (26, 417 gallons)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span><strong>Flow Rate:  </strong>500 ml per minute (17 ounces/minute)</span></p>\r\n<p><span><strong>Battery Life:</strong> </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>AA Batteries: Lasts up to 6 hours on 2 AA-batteries supplied, equivalent to 360 liters (95 gallons) in very dirty water and 442 liters (117 gallons) of water in clearer water conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Wall Outlet: Compatible with standard wall plug with a Input AC of 100-240V and output of 5V 1000mA. Lasts indefinitely (until filters need to be replaced) when plugged directly to a power source</li>\r\n<li>Power Bank: Compatible with any 120-240v external power bank</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span><strong>Size:</strong> 3.2 x 2 x 6.5\"</span></p>\r\n<p><span><strong>Weight:</strong> 13.75 oz</span></p>\r\n<ul></ul>\r\n<p><span><strong>Environmental Requirements: </strong><br /></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Operating ambient temperature: 5° to 25° C (41° to 77° F)*</li>\r\n<li>Non operating temperature: 0° to 27° C (32° to 80° F)*</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span><strong>Components:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span>Electric Survivor Filter PRO X<br /></span></li>\r\n<li><span>2x AA 2-HIGH ENERGY™ Alkaline Batteries | Rayovac®</span></li>\r\n<li>1x 6ft Micro USB Cable</li>\r\n<li>1x USB Wall Charger,<span> </span><span>Ultra Compact Single Port 5.0V-100mA Output (Input: AC100-240V 50/60Hz)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>1x Ultra Filter Pre-Filter<br /></span></li>\r\n<li><span>1x Carbon Filter</span></li>\r\n<li><span>1x Internal Ultra Filter</span></li>\r\n<li><span>1x Inlet Hose (3.25ft)<br /></span></li>\r\n<li><span><span>1x </span>Outlet Hose (1 ft)</span></li>\r\n<li><span>1x Hose Clip<br /></span></li>\r\n<li><span>1x Carrying Case<br /></span></li>\r\n<li><span>1x Back-washing Syringe</span>1x User Manual</li>\r\n</ul>'),(373236,76,0,174525,'<p>The PRO X produces 500 ml of water per minute (17 oz/minute) at the push of a button. The two (2)-AA HIGH ENERGY™ Alkaline Batteries | Rayovac® included are good for up to 360 liters (95 gallons) of filtered water.</p>'),(373355,76,1,174525,'<p>The PRO X produces 500 ml of water per minute (17 oz/minute) at the push of a button. The two (2)-AA HIGH ENERGY™ Alkaline Batteries | Rayovac® included are good for up to 360 liters (95 gallons) of filtered water.</p>'),(373237,85,0,174525,'SURVIVOR FILTER™ PRO X Electric Water Filter'),(373356,85,1,174525,'SURVIVOR FILTER™ PRO X Electric Water Filter'),(373238,75,0,174526,'<ul>\r\n<li>1000D anti-abrasion polyesters MOLLE pouch for emergency or tactical situations.</li>\r\n<li>Tri-fold design, rip away Velcro panel and wide handle for removal or carrying quick access to first aid supplies.</li>\r\n<li>Double zipper closer, multiple pockets, elastic loops, instrument holders and zippered mesh compartment for small supplies.</li>\r\n<li>2 inches Velcro panel across front of pouch for First Aid or Morale Patch and D-rings on the back for additional attachment points</li>\r\n</ul>'),(676128,75,1,174526,'<ul>\r\n<li>1000D anti-abrasion polyesters MOLLE pouch for emergency or tactical situations.</li>\r\n<li>Tri-fold design, rip away Velcro panel and wide handle for removal or carrying quick access to first aid supplies.</li>\r\n<li>Double zipper closer, multiple pockets, elastic loops, instrument holders and zippered mesh compartment for small supplies.</li>\r\n<li>2 inches Velcro panel across front of pouch for First Aid or Morale Patch and D-rings on the back for additional attachment points</li>\r\n</ul>'),(373239,76,0,174526,'<p class=\"h2\">Secure Your First Aid Supplies</p>\r\n<div class=\"rte\">\r\n<p>Made of 1000D nylon, designed for this compact durable kit contains all you need for providing first aid and is ideal for taking with you in your sports bag.</p>\r\n</div>'),(676130,76,1,174526,'<p class=\"h2\">Secure Your First Aid Supplies</p>\r\n<div class=\"rte\">\r\n<p>Made of 1000D nylon, designed for this compact durable kit contains all you need for providing first aid and is ideal for taking with you in your sports bag.</p>\r\n</div>'),(373240,85,0,174526,'Tactical Molle Rip-Away EMT Medical First Aid Utility Pouch'),(676129,85,1,174526,'Tactical Molle Rip-Away EMT Medical First Aid Utility Pouch'),(373244,75,0,174528,'<p>Made of upgraded lightweight and splash resistance nylon to protect your belongs stay dry in light rain.<br />Double built-in waist straps improve its wear and tear resistance to ensure the pack’s life last longer.<br />Include a 2 Liter/ 70z BPA free bladder (in total 1.1 lbs) ,which keeps you hydrated.<br />The chest and waist straps make sure the pack does not bounce when you move.<br />Adjustable shoulder/chest/waist straps, will fit chest size teenagers/kids with 27\" up to adults with 50”.<br />Equipped with small front pocket designed for racing.</p>'),(373899,75,1,174528,'<p>Made of upgraded lightweight and splash resistance nylon to protect your belongs stay dry in light rain.<br />Double built-in waist straps improve its wear and tear resistance to ensure the pack’s life last longer.<br />Include a 2 Liter/ 70z BPA free bladder (in total 1.1 lbs) ,which keeps you hydrated.<br />The chest and waist straps make sure the pack does not bounce when you move.<br />Adjustable shoulder/chest/waist straps, will fit chest size teenagers/kids with 27\" up to adults with 50”.<br />Equipped with small front pocket designed for racing.</p>'),(373245,76,0,174528,'<p><span>Designed with the adventurer in mind, fulfilling the need for both secure essentials storage and physical comfort during diverse outdoor sports and travel. Enough capacity for essential gear and hydration for hours when hiking.</span></p>'),(373900,76,1,174528,'<p><span>Designed with the adventurer in mind, fulfilling the need for both secure essentials storage and physical comfort during diverse outdoor sports and travel. Enough capacity for essential gear and hydration for hours when hiking.</span></p>'),(373246,85,0,174528,'Unigear Red Hydration Pack with 70 oz 2L Water Bladder'),(373901,85,1,174528,'Unigear Red Hydration Pack with 70 oz 2L Water Bladder'),(373247,75,0,174529,'<p>Made of upgraded lightweight and splash resistance nylon to protect your belongs stay dry in light rain.<br />Double built-in waist straps improve its wear and tear resistance to ensure the pack’s life last longer.<br />Include a 2 Liter/ 70z BPA free bladder (in total 1.1 lbs) ,which keeps you hydrated.<br />The chest and waist straps make sure the pack does not bounce when you move.<br />Adjustable shoulder/chest/waist straps, will fit chest size teenagers/kids with 27\" up to adults with 50”.<br />Equipped with small front pocket designed for racing.</p>'),(373902,75,1,174529,'<p>Made of upgraded lightweight and splash resistance nylon to protect your belongs stay dry in light rain.<br />Double built-in waist straps improve its wear and tear resistance to ensure the pack’s life last longer.<br />Include a 2 Liter/ 70z BPA free bladder (in total 1.1 lbs) ,which keeps you hydrated.<br />The chest and waist straps make sure the pack does not bounce when you move.<br />Adjustable shoulder/chest/waist straps, will fit chest size teenagers/kids with 27\" up to adults with 50”.<br />Equipped with small front pocket designed for racing.</p>'),(373248,76,0,174529,'<p><span>Hit The Road With Your Hydration</span></p>'),(373903,76,1,174529,'<p><span>Hit The Road With Your Hydration</span></p>'),(373249,85,0,174529,'Unigear Blue Hydration Pack with 70 oz 2L Water Bladder'),(373904,85,1,174529,'Unigear Blue Hydration Pack with 70 oz 2L Water Bladder'),(373250,75,0,174530,'<p>Small Size and Large Capacity: Compact design but can carry lots of first aid supplies. Multiple tight and elastic straps and a spacious pocket is enough to store your vital supplies. Easy to carry around in any environment.<br />Premium Military grade 1000D nylon material and sturdy double stitching strengthen the function of waterproof and anticorrosion.<br />Durable MOLLE straps with strong snaps allow you to attach any place you want.<br />Double zipper closer, multiple pockets, elastic loops, instrument holders and zippered mesh compartment for small supplies.<br />2 inches Velcro panel across front of pouch for First Aid or Morale Patch and D-rings on the back for additional attachment points.</p>'),(373268,75,1,174530,'<p>Small Size and Large Capacity: Compact design but can carry lots of first aid supplies. Multiple tight and elastic straps and a spacious pocket is enough to store your vital supplies. Easy to carry around in any environment.<br />Premium Military grade 1000D nylon material and sturdy double stitching strengthen the function of waterproof and anticorrosion.<br />Durable MOLLE straps with strong snaps allow you to attach any place you want.<br />Double zipper closer, multiple pockets, elastic loops, instrument holders and zippered mesh compartment for small supplies.<br />2 inches Velcro panel across front of pouch for First Aid or Morale Patch and D-rings on the back for additional attachment points.</p>'),(373251,76,0,174530,'<p>Compact design but can carry lots of first aid supplies. Multiple tight and elastic straps and a spacious pocket is enough to store your vital supplies. Easy to carry around in any environment.</p>'),(373269,76,1,174530,'<p>Compact design but can carry lots of first aid supplies. Multiple tight and elastic straps and a spacious pocket is enough to store your vital supplies. Easy to carry around in any environment.</p>\r\n<p><span>1 x Pouch, 1 x EMT shears</span></p>'),(373252,85,0,174530,'Unigear Desert Tan Tactical First Aid Utility Molle Medical Pouch'),(373270,85,1,174530,'Unigear Desert Tan Tactical First Aid Utility Molle Medical Pouch'),(373253,75,0,174531,'<p>Small Size and Large Capacity: Compact design but can carry lots of first aid supplies. Multiple tight and elastic straps and a spacious pocket is enough to store your vital supplies. Easy to carry around in any environment.<br />Premium Military grade 1000D nylon material and sturdy double stitching strengthen the function of waterproof and anticorrosion.<br />Durable MOLLE straps with strong snaps allow you to attach any place you want.<br />Double zipper closer, multiple pockets, elastic loops, instrument holders and zippered mesh compartment for small supplies.<br />2 inches Velcro panel across front of pouch for First Aid or Morale Patch and D-rings on the back for additional attachment points.</p>');
INSERT INTO `catalog_product_entity_text` VALUES (373265,75,1,174531,'<p>Small Size and Large Capacity: Compact design but can carry lots of first aid supplies. Multiple tight and elastic straps and a spacious pocket is enough to store your vital supplies. Easy to carry around in any environment.<br />Premium Military grade 1000D nylon material and sturdy double stitching strengthen the function of waterproof and anticorrosion.<br />Durable MOLLE straps with strong snaps allow you to attach any place you want.<br />Double zipper closer, multiple pockets, elastic loops, instrument holders and zippered mesh compartment for small supplies.<br />2 inches Velcro panel across front of pouch for First Aid or Morale Patch and D-rings on the back for additional attachment points.</p>'),(373254,76,0,174531,'<p><span>Made of 1000D nylon, designed for this compact durable kit contains all you need for providing first aid and is ideal for taking with you in your sports bag. Small size but large capacity.</span></p>'),(373266,76,1,174531,'<p><span>Made of 1000D nylon, designed for this compact durable kit contains all you need for providing first aid and is ideal for taking with you in your sports bag. Small size but large capacity.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>1 x Pouch, 1 x EMT shears</span><span></span></p>'),(373255,85,0,174531,'Unigear Black Tactical First Aid Utility Molle Medical Pouch'),(373267,85,1,174531,'Unigear Black Tactical First Aid Utility Molle Medical Pouch'),(373256,75,0,174532,'<p>Lightweight with large capacity.<br />Heavy-duty construction, resistant to tears and abrasion.<br />Adjustable shoulder/chest/waist straps and ventilated shoulder straps.<br />Replaceable 2.5L bladder, Hands-free hose with bite valve.<br />Air mesh back and shoulder pad allow for airflow, comfort and thermal performance</p>'),(676125,75,1,174532,'<p>Lightweight with large capacity.<br />Heavy-duty construction, resistant to tears and abrasion.<br />Adjustable shoulder/chest/waist straps and ventilated shoulder straps.<br />Replaceable 2.5L bladder, Hands-free hose with bite valve.<br />Air mesh back and shoulder pad allow for airflow, comfort and thermal performance</p>'),(373257,76,0,174532,'<p><span>The convenience of external fill in a sleek hydration pack. The pack has a 2.5L reservoir that can be refilled on the fly via the quick-release flap on the front of the pack.</span></p>'),(676127,76,1,174532,'<p><span>The convenience of external fill in a sleek hydration pack. The pack has a 2.5L reservoir that can be refilled on the fly via the quick-release flap on the front of the pack.</span></p>'),(373258,85,0,174532,'Unigear ACU Camo Tactical Hydration Pack Backpack 900D with 2.5L Bladder'),(676126,85,1,174532,'Unigear ACU Camo Tactical Hydration Pack Backpack 900D with 2.5L Bladder'),(373262,75,0,174534,'<p>1000D anti-abrasion polyesters MOLLE pouch for emergency or tactical situations.<br />Tri-fold design, rip away Velcro panel and wide handle for removal or carrying quick access to first aid supplies.<br />Double zipper closer, multiple pockets, elastic loops, instrument holders and zippered mesh compartment for small supplies.<br />2 inches Velcro panel across front of pouch for First Aid or Morale Patch and D-rings on the back for additional attachment points</p>\r\n<p><span>8.07 x 7.3 x 3.7 inches / 20.5 x 18.5 x 9.4 cm</span></p>'),(676131,75,1,174534,'<p>1000D anti-abrasion polyesters MOLLE pouch for emergency or tactical situations.<br />Tri-fold design, rip away Velcro panel and wide handle for removal or carrying quick access to first aid supplies.<br />Double zipper closer, multiple pockets, elastic loops, instrument holders and zippered mesh compartment for small supplies.<br />2 inches Velcro panel across front of pouch for First Aid or Morale Patch and D-rings on the back for additional attachment points</p>\r\n<p><span>8.07 x 7.3 x 3.7 inches / 20.5 x 18.5 x 9.4 cm</span></p>'),(373263,76,0,174534,'<p><span>Made of 1000D nylon, designed for this compact durable kit contains all you need for providing first aid and is ideal for taking with you in your sports bag.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>1 x Pouch, 1 x Velcro, 1 x EMT shears</span><span></span></p>'),(676133,76,1,174534,'<p><span>Made of 1000D nylon, designed for this compact durable kit contains all you need for providing first aid and is ideal for taking with you in your sports bag.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>1 x Pouch, 1 x Velcro, 1 x EMT shears</span><span></span></p>'),(373264,85,0,174534,'Unigear Red Tactical Molle Rip-Away EMT Medical First Aid Utility Pouch'),(676132,85,1,174534,'Unigear Red Tactical Molle Rip-Away EMT Medical First Aid Utility Pouch'),(373506,75,0,174545,'<p style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"center\">O<span style=\"font-size: small;\">ur EDC belt has got to be one of the best you can buy! The material used is unlike any other</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">on the market. The special webbing rolls and flexes incredibly but holds weight extremely well. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">That is due to the belt  NOT compressing vertically. Pair that with a compact, easy to use G-hook buckle. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">It will not disappoint. Easily adjust belt tightness on the fly with the adjustment tail. Get the best belt on the market! </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Belts are made custom to waist/pant size with an additional 3-4 inches of adjustment. And as always Satisfaction is guaranteed!</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Compact aluminum buckle</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Thin and highly flexible</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Holds weight VERY well</span></l