sight height when deployed, and so low when they are stowed that you\'ll never notice them until they\'re needed. Narrow width Front is compatible with most IR aiming laser and light installations for the professional user.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>873750008370</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>Magpul Industries</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>MAG275</strong></td>\r\n<th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>MBUS</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>PRO</strong></td>\r\n<th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Sight</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Fit</th>\r\n<td><strong>Picatinny</strong></td>\r\n<th>Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Black</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Description</th>\r\n<td><strong>Front</strong></td>\r\n<th>Accessories</th>\r\n<td><strong>Steel</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Long Gun Sights</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p></p>'),(373573,76,1,174562,'<p><span>Magpul MAG275-BLK MBUS Pro Front Sight Folding Black for AR-Platform</span></p>\r\n<p><span>The MBUS Pro (Magpul Back-Up Sight) is a corrosion resistant all-steel back-up sighting solution. The no-tool, elevation adjustable front excels in all 1913 Picatinny rail mounting applications, including rail-height gas blocks. Positive detents keep the MBUS Pro Front at standard AR sight height when deployed, and low when it is stowed. Narrow width Front is compatible with most IR aiming laser and light installations for the professional user. The steel rectangular site post are selectable between match and standards widths, and the sight is case hardened and finished with Melonite QPQ for extreme resistance to wear and corrosion. Made in the USA. *NOTE: All MBUS Pro Front Sights now come factory-equipped with the Enhanced Front Sight Post.</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MSRP: <strong>$84.95</strong></li>\r\n<li>Retail MAP: <strong><strong>$80.70</strong></strong>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<h4>Magpul Industries, MBUS PRO Front Sight, Fits Picatinny, Flip Up, Steel, Black</h4>\r\n<ul class=\"product-flags\"></ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul class=\"list-group css-columns-2 with-bullets\">\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">All steel construction</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Case hardened and finished with Melonite QOQ</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Elevation adjustment knob no tools required</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-body row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Product Description</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<p>The MBUS Pro (Magpul(R) Back-Up Sight) is a corrosion resistant all-steel back-up sighting solution that delivers maximum functionality and strength with minimum bulk at a price that\'s even smaller than its size. The dual aperture, windage adjustable Rear and no-tool, elevation adjustable Front excel in all 1913 Picatinny rail mounting applications, including rail-height gas blocks. Positive detents keep the MBUS Pro Front and Rear at standard AR sight height when deployed, and so low when they are stowed that you\'ll never notice them until they\'re needed. Narrow width Front is compatible with most IR aiming laser and light installations for the professional user.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel product-section product-specifications\">\r\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n<tbody class=\"hidden-xs\">\r\n<tr><th>UPC</th>\r\n<td><strong>873750008370</strong></td>\r\n<th>Manufacturer</th>\r\n<td><strong>Magpul Industries</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Manufacturer Part #</th>\r\n<td><strong>MAG275</strong></td>\r\n<th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>MBUS</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Model</th>\r\n<td><strong>PRO</strong></td>\r\n<th>Type</th>\r\n<td><strong>Sight</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Fit</th>\r\n<td><strong>Picatinny</strong></td>\r\n<th>Color</th>\r\n<td><strong>Black</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Description</th>\r\n<td><strong>Front</strong></td>\r\n<th>Accessories</th>\r\n<td><strong>Steel</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><th>Subcategory</th>\r\n<td><strong>Long Gun Sights</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(373571,85,0,174562,'Magpul MAG275-BLK MBUS Pro Front Sight Folding Black for AR-Platform'),(373574,85,1,174562,'Magpul MAG275-BLK MBUS Pro Front Sight Folding Black for AR-Platform'),(373582,75,0,174563,'<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>In response to the market\'s overwhelming trend towards tactical and matte finishes on blades and firearms, Flitz is proud to introduce for 2021 it\'s Tactical Gun &amp; Knife Care Kit. The kit contains everything you need to keep firearms and blades clean and protected in one convenient ready-to-use kit! Best of all for the hunter and hobbyist, this all-in-one solution is easy on the wallet.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The kit includes:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">1.7oz (50gr) tube of Flitz Polish</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">1.7 oz (50ml) Tactical Matte Finish Cleaner spray bottle</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">1.7 oz (50ml) Ceramic Gun Sealant spray bottle</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">1 Flitz Microfiber cloth</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>Legendary Flitz Polish.</b> This is the flagship product that started the legend over 40 years ago. German engineering and American know-how combined to provide a product that restores, cleans, polishes and protects. It is literally, \"The Swiss Army Knife\" of polishes. Non-toxic and eco-friendly, it\'s so effective it has earned a US Dept. of Defense MilSpec number that certifies it for use on the leading edges of combat aircraft. And it\'s so gentle, it\'s been spec\'ed by architects for use on antique brass hardware in the restoration of historic government buildings. Flitz Polish has been the favorite for two generations of American sportsmen.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>Flitz Tactical Matte Finish Cleaner</b> thoroughly and safely cleans dirt, oils and residue from all matte finishes! It is unsurpassed in removing everything a sportsman\'s blade or firearm runs into in the course of a hunting season. On the job, in the woods or in the display case, Flitz Tactical Matte Finish Cleaner carefully and thoroughly preps scales, barrels, blades and decorative metal components.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>Flitz Ceramic Gun Sealant</b> provides a nano-ceramic, hydrophobic hard shell coating that lasts up to one full year, fully protecting without impairing performance! Moisture is the enemy and Flitz Ceramic Gun Sealant leaves rock-hard protection that literally scares water away!</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">A thick &amp; thirsty Flitz Microfiber rounds out the kit to give firearms and blades the TLC they deserve. Featuring patented Starfiber® Microfiber technology, this cloth works better than any other cloth on the market today - with or without chemicals! Absorbs 4X its weight in liquid. Cleans faster, easier and more economically because it\'s washable up to 500 times!</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"> </span></p>'),(373589,75,1,174563,'<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>In response to the market\'s overwhelming trend towards tactical and matte finishes on blades and firearms, Flitz is proud to introduce for 2021 it\'s Tactical Gun &amp; Knife Care Kit. The kit contains everything you need to keep firearms and blades clean and protected in one convenient ready-to-use kit! Best of all for the hunter and hobbyist, this all-in-one solution is easy on the wallet.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The kit includes:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">1.7oz (50gr) tube of Flitz Polish</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">1.7 oz (50ml) Tactical Matte Finish Cleaner spray bottle</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">1.7 oz (50ml) Ceramic Gun Sealant spray bottle</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">1 Flitz Microfiber cloth</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>Legendary Flitz Polish.</b> This is the flagship product that started the legend over 40 years ago. German engineering and American know-how combined to provide a product that restores, cleans, polishes and protects. It is literally, \"The Swiss Army Knife\" of polishes. Non-toxic and eco-friendly, it\'s so effective it has earned a US Dept. of Defense MilSpec number that certifies it for use on the leading edges of combat aircraft. And it\'s so gentle, it\'s been spec\'ed by architects for use on antique brass hardware in the restoration of historic government buildings. Flitz Polish has been the favorite for two generations of American sportsmen.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>Flitz Tactical Matte Finish Cleaner</b> thoroughly and safely cleans dirt, oils and residue from all matte finishes! It is unsurpassed in removing everything a sportsman\'s blade or firearm runs into in the course of a hunting season. On the job, in the woods or in the display case, Flitz Tactical Matte Finish Cleaner carefully and thoroughly preps scales, barrels, blades and decorative metal components.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>Flitz Ceramic Gun Sealant</b> provides a nano-ceramic, hydrophobic hard shell coating that lasts up to one full year, fully protecting without impairing performance! Moisture is the enemy and Flitz Ceramic Gun Sealant leaves rock-hard protection that literally scares water away!</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">A thick &amp; thirsty Flitz Microfiber rounds out the kit to give firearms and blades the TLC they deserve. Featuring patented Starfiber® Microfiber technology, this cloth works better than any other cloth on the market today - with or without chemicals! Absorbs 4X its weight in liquid. Cleans faster, easier and more economically because it\'s washable up to 500 times!</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"> </span></p>'),(373583,76,0,174563,'<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">In response to the market\'s overwhelming trend towards tactical and matte finishes on blades and firearms, Flitz is proud to introduce for 2021 it\'s Tactical Gun &amp; Knife Care Kit. The kit contains everything you need to keep firearms and blades clean and protected in one convenient ready-to-use kit! Best of all for the hunter and hobbyist, this all-in-one solution is easy on the wallet.</span></p>'),(373590,76,1,174563,'<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">In response to the market\'s overwhelming trend towards tactical and matte finishes on blades and firearms, Flitz is proud to introduce for 2021 it\'s Tactical Gun &amp; Knife Care Kit. The kit contains everything you need to keep firearms and blades clean and protected in one convenient ready-to-use kit! Best of all for the hunter and hobbyist, this all-in-one solution is easy on the wallet.</span></p>'),(373591,85,1,174563,'FLITZ Tactical Gun & Knife Care Kit'),(373587,75,0,174565,'<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>Casual user, sportsman or world-class collector, this kit is exactly what you need to clean, polish &amp; protect all your guns and blades. Recommended by hunters and collectors worldwide!</b></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>TACTICAL MATTE FINISH CLEANER:</b></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\"> Degreasing formula.  Anti-Smear.  Use on stainless steel &amp; nickel firearms &amp; knives.  Safe on interior &amp; exterior of the bore.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>GUN &amp; KNIFE WAX:<br /> </b>A premium, white carnauba and beeswax formula that provides exceptional results on gun bluing, polished or hand-rubbed stocks, stainless and nickel firearms.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>FLITZ POLISH:</b></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\"> This product will clean your stainless, nickel or HOT BLUED gun. Removes powder residue, fingerprints, and rust without harming the surface. </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>Removes and Protects Against: </b>Rust, Fingerprints, Water Stains, Powder Residue, Tree Sap, Blood, Salt Deposits, Lime Deposits and More! Safe on the Interior and Exterior of the Bore, Will not attract dust or Wash Off in Rain, Water-based, Contains no Solvents, UV and Acid Rain Protection, Easy to Apply and Buff Off, Protects up to 6 Months.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">A thick &amp; thirsty Flitz Microfiber rounds out the kit to give firearms and blades the TLC they deserve. Featuring patented Starfiber® Microfiber technology, this cloth works better than any other cloth on the market today - with or without chemicals! Absorbs 4X its weight in liquid. Cleans faster, easier and more economically because it\'s washable up to 500 times!</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>Kit Contains:</b></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">(1) Flitz Tactical Matte Cleaner 1.7oz</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\"> (1) Flitz Polish-Paste 1.7oz</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\"> (1) Flitz Rifle Gun &amp; Knife Wax Protectant 1.7oz</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\"> (1) 16\" x 16\" Premium Microfiber Clot</span></p>'),(373592,75,1,174565,'<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>Casual user, sportsman or world-class collector, this kit is exactly what you need to clean, polish &amp; protect all your guns and blades. Recommended by hunters and collectors worldwide!</b></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>TACTICAL MATTE FINISH CLEANER:</b></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\"> Degreasing formula.  Anti-Smear.  Use on stainless steel &amp; nickel firearms &amp; knives.  Safe on interior &amp; exterior of the bore.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>GUN &amp; KNIFE WAX:<br /> </b>A premium, white carnauba and beeswax formula that provides exceptional results on gun bluing, polished or hand-rubbed stocks, stainless and nickel firearms.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>FLITZ POLISH:</b></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\"> This product will clean your stainless, nickel or HOT BLUED gun. Removes powder residue, fingerprints, and rust without harming the surface. </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>Removes and Protects Against: </b>Rust, Fingerprints, Water Stains, Powder Residue, Tree Sap, Blood, Salt Deposits, Lime Deposits and More! Safe on the Interior and Exterior of the Bore, Will not attract dust or Wash Off in Rain, Water-based, Contains no Solvents, UV and Acid Rain Protection, Easy to Apply and Buff Off, Protects up to 6 Months.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">A thick &amp; thirsty Flitz Microfiber rounds out the kit to give firearms and blades the TLC they deserve. Featuring patented Starfiber® Microfiber technology, this cloth works better than any other cloth on the market today - with or without chemicals! Absorbs 4X its weight in liquid. Cleans faster, easier and more economically because it\'s washable up to 500 times!</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>Kit Contains:</b></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">(1) Flitz Tactical Matte Cleaner 1.7oz</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\"> (1) Flitz Polish-Paste 1.7oz</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\"> (1) Flitz Rifle Gun &amp; Knife Wax Protectant 1.7oz</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\"> (1) 16\" x 16\" Premium Microfiber Clot</span></p>'),(373588,76,0,174565,'<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>Casual user, sportsman or world-class collector, this kit is exactly what you need to clean, polish &amp; protect all your guns and blades. Recommended by hunters and collectors worldwide!</b></span></p>'),(373593,76,1,174565,'<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>Casual user, sportsman or world-class collector, this kit is exactly what you need to clean, polish &amp; protect all your guns and blades. Recommended by hunters and collectors worldwide!</b></span></p>'),(373594,85,1,174565,'FLITZ Gun & Knife Care Kit'),(373595,75,0,174566,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Clean your gun\'s bore safely and quickly with Flitz Bore Cleaner to maintain accuracy and prolong barrel life! </span></strong><br /><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Safely cleans &amp; protects eliminating the need for other cleaners. </span></strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">No foam.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">No mess.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">No ammonia.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Eco friendly.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Non-abrasive.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Non-flammable.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Protects for up to 100 Shot Guns.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Leaves Protective coating for increased accuracy.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Elimanates need for multiple cleaners.  </span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(373597,75,1,174566,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Clean your gun\'s bore safely and quickly with Flitz Bore Cleaner to maintain accuracy and prolong barrel life! </span></strong><br /><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Safely cleans &amp; protects eliminating the need for other cleaners. </span></strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">No foam.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">No mess.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">No ammonia.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Eco friendly.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Non-abrasive.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Non-flammable.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Protects for up to 100 Shot Guns.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Leaves Protective coating for increased accuracy.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Elimanates need for multiple cleaners.  </span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(373596,76,0,174566,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Clean your gun\'s bore safely and quickly with Flitz Bore Cleaner to maintain accuracy and prolong barrel life! </span></strong><br /><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Safely cleans &amp; protects eliminating the need for other cleaners.</span></strong></p>'),(373598,76,1,174566,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Clean your gun\'s bore safely and quickly with Flitz Bore Cleaner to maintain accuracy and prolong barrel life! </span></strong><br /><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Safely cleans &amp; protects eliminating the need for other cleaners.</span></strong></p>'),(373599,85,1,174566,'FLITZ Bore Cleaner 7.6oz/225ml, bore cleaner, flitz'),(373600,75,0,174567,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Restore &amp; protect all your knives with one simple kit. Clean, sharpen, oil and polish to keep your knives looking brand new. Work, kitchen, hunting or fishing knives all need Flitz!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">There\'s nothing more dangerous than a dull knife. It\'s even worse if it\'s rusty or poorly maintained. Flitz\' Knife Restoration Kit to the rescue! Clean, sharpen, polish and protect with one kit at a great price. For high-end knives like Buck or CRKT, an old jackknife or a treasured heirloom you can bring every part of the knife back to life and with a diamond-like shine and a razor-sharp edge! Easy, affordable and safe!</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Included in your kit:</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">One 1.7oz Bottle of FLITZ Liquid Polish</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">One product—Many uses.  Stainless Steel, Brass, Copper, Titanium, Plastic, Fiberglass, Clear Coated finishes &amp; more. Flitz Polish provides toughness and durable protection up to 6 months.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">One DMT Diamond Sharpener (Dia-Sharp)</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The Dia-Sharp® 4\" continuous diamond sharpening stone delivers full-size sharpening while maximizing work and storage space. Perfectly suited for small contact area and pointed tools. Sharpening with diamonds is fast and easy. Sharpen dry or with water.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">One 7.5ml needle bottle of Super Lube Lubricating Oil (CLP)</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Super Lube has a special cleaning action that breaks loose dirt and corrosion that can damage metal. The special penetrating formula displaces trapped grit and frees sticky, rusted, or corroded mechanisms. Multiple ingredients including specially treated PTFE for improved boundary film strength that reduces friction, retards wear, and stops build-up of foreign matter, providing a long-lasting protective coating that shields all metals from rust and corrosion. </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">One 16” x 16” FLITZ Thick &amp; Thirsty Microfiber Polishing Cloth</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Super-Premium 16\" x 16\" Grey Microfiber Polishing Cloth. Clean faster, easier, and cheaper! Use it everywhere, ON ANY SURFACE! Made from Starfiber® Microfiber technology, this cloth works better than any other cloth on the market today -- with or without chemicals.</span></p>'),(373624,75,1,174567,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Restore &amp; protect all your knives with one simple kit. Clean, sharpen, oil and polish to keep your knives looking brand new. Work, kitchen, hunting or fishing knives all need Flitz!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">There\'s nothing more dangerous than a dull knife. It\'s even worse if it\'s rusty or poorly maintained. Flitz\' Knife Restoration Kit to the rescue! Clean, sharpen, polish and protect with one kit at a great price. For high-end knives like Buck or CRKT, an old jackknife or a treasured heirloom you can bring every part of the knife back to life and with a diamond-like shine and a razor-sharp edge! Easy, affordable and safe!</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Included in your kit:</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">One 1.7oz Bottle of FLITZ Liquid Polish</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">One product—Many uses.  Stainless Steel, Brass, Copper, Titanium, Plastic, Fiberglass, Clear Coated finishes &amp; more. Flitz Polish provides toughness and durable protection up to 6 months.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">One DMT Diamond Sharpener (Dia-Sharp)</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The Dia-Sharp® 4\" continuous diamond sharpening stone delivers full-size sharpening while maximizing work and storage space. Perfectly suited for small contact area and pointed tools. Sharpening with diamonds is fast and easy. Sharpen dry or with water.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">One 7.5ml needle bottle of Super Lube Lubricating Oil (CLP)</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Super Lube has a special cleaning action that breaks loose dirt and corrosion that can damage metal. The special penetrating formula displaces trapped grit and frees sticky, rusted, or corroded mechanisms. Multiple ingredients including specially treated PTFE for improved boundary film strength that reduces friction, retards wear, and stops build-up of foreign matter, providing a long-lasting protective coating that shields all metals from rust and corrosion. </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">One 16” x 16” FLITZ Thick &amp; Thirsty Microfiber Polishing Cloth</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Super-Premium 16\" x 16\" Grey Microfiber Polishing Cloth. Clean faster, easier, and cheaper! Use it everywhere, ON ANY SURFACE! Made from Starfiber® Microfiber technology, this cloth works better than any other cloth on the market today -- with or without chemicals.</span></p>'),(373601,76,0,174567,'<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">There\'s nothing more dangerous than a dull knife. It\'s even worse if it\'s rusty or poorly maintained. Flitz\' Knife Restoration Kit to the rescue! Clean, sharpen, polish and protect with one kit at a great price. For high-end knives like Buck or CRKT, an old jackknife or a treasured heirloom you can bring every part of the knife back to life and with a diamond-like shine and a razor-sharp edge! Easy, affordable and safe!</span></p>'),(373625,76,1,174567,'<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">There\'s nothing more dangerous than a dull knife. It\'s even worse if it\'s rusty or poorly maintained. Flitz\' Knife Restoration Kit to the rescue! Clean, sharpen, polish and protect with one kit at a great price. For high-end knives like Buck or CRKT, an old jackknife or a treasured heirloom you can bring every part of the knife back to life and with a diamond-like shine and a razor-sharp edge! Easy, affordable and safe!</span></p>'),(373626,85,1,174567,'FLITZ Knife Restoration Kit, knife restoration kit, '),(373602,75,0,174568,'<h4><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">The polish that launched an entire company over 40 years ago. German engineering and American know-how bring you the Swiss Army Knife of polishes. A concentrated cream, Flitz Paste Polish is unsurpassed in its ability to clean, polish, de-oxidize and protect. Provides a durable finish with tough protection. It\'s non-abrasive, non-toxic, non-flammable.</span></h4>\r\n<h4></h4>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Completely Safe For Use On:</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Brass, Copper**, Silverplate, Sterling Silver, Chrome, Stainless Steel, Nickel, Bronze, Solid Gold, Aluminum, Anodized Aluminum, Beryllium, Magnesium, Platinum, Pewter,</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Factory Hot Gun Bluing*, Painted Surfaces, Formica®, Cultured Marble, Fire clay sinks, Corian™, Glass, Plexiglas™, Plastics***, Fiberglass &amp; Eisenglass. </span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Leaves behind a protective wax finish to keep things shiny longer.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Easily Removes:</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Tarnish, Rust, Water Stains, Chalking, Lime Deposits</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Heat Discoloration, Lead &amp; Powder Residue, Oxidation</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Bugs, Tar, Oil, Fingerprints, Tree Sap, Bird Droppings</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Graffiti, Dyes, Black Streaks, Scuff Marks.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Protects up to 6 months in fresh water; up to 3 months in salt water!</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Use sparingly. You don\'t need a lot. That\'s why it\'s such a great value!</span></h4>'),(373611,75,1,174568,'<h4><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">The polish that launched an entire company over 40 years ago. German engineering and American know-how bring you the Swiss Army Knife of polishes. A concentrated cream, Flitz Paste Polish is unsurpassed in its ability to clean, polish, de-oxidize and protect. Provides a durable finish with tough protection. It\'s non-abrasive, non-toxic, non-flammable.</span></h4>\r\n<h4></h4>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Completely Safe For Use On:</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Brass, Copper**, Silverplate, Sterling Silver, Chrome, Stainless Steel, Nickel, Bronze, Solid Gold, Aluminum, Anodized Aluminum, Beryllium, Magnesium, Platinum, Pewter,</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Factory Hot Gun Bluing*, Painted Surfaces, Formica®, Cultured Marble, Fire clay sinks, Corian™, Glass, Plexiglas™, Plastics***, Fiberglass &amp; Eisenglass. </span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Leaves behind a protective wax finish to keep things shiny longer.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Easily Removes:</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Tarnish, Rust, Water Stains, Chalking, Lime Deposits</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Heat Discoloration, Lead &amp; Powder Residue, Oxidation</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Bugs, Tar, Oil, Fingerprints, Tree Sap, Bird Droppings</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Graffiti, Dyes, Black Streaks, Scuff Marks.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Protects up to 6 months in fresh water; up to 3 months in salt water!</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Use sparingly. You don\'t need a lot. That\'s why it\'s such a great value!</span></h4>'),(373603,76,0,174568,'<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><strong>Enjoy the legendary shine &amp; protection that made Flitz a household name! Flitz Paste Polish concentrated cream is unsurpassed in its ability to clean, polish, de-oxidize and protect.  </strong></span></p>'),(373612,76,1,174568,'<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><strong>Enjoy the legendary shine &amp; protection that made Flitz a household name! Flitz Paste Polish concentrated cream is unsurpassed in its ability to clean, polish, de-oxidize and protect.  </strong></span></p>'),(373613,85,1,174568,'FLITZ Metal, Plastic & Fiberglass Polish 1.76oz/50g'),(373607,75,0,174570,'<p align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">FINALLY, there is a product specifically made to clean and maintain tactical flat and matte finishes. Cleans without leaving a glossy shine. This oxidation remover and residue-killing organic formula is a simple one spray then dry away!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Instantly &amp; Easily Removes: </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">fingerprints</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">oil</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">grease</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">water spots</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">soil</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">wax residue</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">carbon &amp; other impurities.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Safe on: Flat/Matte finishes, Parkerized finishes, Tactical finishes, Gun wraps, AR Firearms, brushed or polished stainless steel,</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">• Will NOT leave a shine - restores unwanted shiny surfaces back to matte</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">• Will NOT remove bluing</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">• Will NOT remove parkerized finish</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">• Environment friendly</span></p>'),(373627,75,1,174570,'<p align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">FINALLY, there is a product specifically made to clean and maintain tactical flat and matte finishes. Cleans without leaving a glossy shine. This oxidation remover and residue-killing organic formula is a simple one spray then dry away!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Instantly &amp; Easily Removes: </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">fingerprints</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">oil</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">grease</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">water spots</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">soil</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">wax residue</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">carbon &amp; other impurities.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Safe on: Flat/Matte finishes, Parkerized finishes, Tactical finishes, Gun wraps, AR Firearms, brushed or polished stainless steel,</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">• Will NOT leave a shine - restores unwanted shiny surfaces back to matte</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">• Will NOT remove bluing</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">• Will NOT remove parkerized finish</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">• Environment friendly</span></p>'),(373608,76,0,174570,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">A stunning clean doesn’t always have to shine– do Flat/Matte the right way on your arsenal, with this residue killing organic formula. One spray then dry away with Tactical Matte Finish Cleaner!</span></strong></p>'),(373628,76,1,174570,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">A stunning clean doesn’t always have to shine– do Flat/Matte the right way on your arsenal, with this residue killing organic formula. One spray then dry away with Tactical Matte Finish Cleaner!</span></strong></p>'),(373629,85,1,174570,'FLITZ Tactical Matte Finish Cleaner 7.6oz/225ml'),(373609,75,0,174571,'<div