</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Lime Deposits and More!</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"shg-product-title-component\">\r\n<div class=\"shogun-tab-content\">\r\n<div class=\"shg-c  \">\r\n<div class=\"shg-row\" data-col-grid-mode-on=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"shg-c-lg-7 shg-c-md-7 shg-c-sm-7 shg-c-xs-12\">\r\n<div class=\"shg-c  \">\r\n<div class=\"shg-rich-text shg-theme-text-content\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">So Safe &amp; Easy!</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Safe on the interior and exterior of the bore *ALL Finishes</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Will not attract dust or wash off in the rain</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Water-based, contains no solvents</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">UV and acid rain protection</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Easy to apply and buff off</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Protects up to 6 months!</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">ECO Green</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(373610,76,0,174571,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Give your blades &amp; firearms the best possible protection with Flitz Riffle Gun &amp; Knife Wax!</span></strong></p>'),(373631,76,1,174571,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Give your blades &amp; firearms the best possible protection with Flitz Riffle Gun &amp; Knife Wax!</span></strong></p>'),(373632,85,1,174571,'FLITZ Rifle Gun & Knife Wax 7.6oz/225ml'),(373614,75,0,174572,'<h4><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Seal &amp; protect your firearms in one easy application. Works on all firearm finishes. Won’t leave a shine on your matte finish. Hydrophobic nano-ceramic technology protects up to one full year! </span></h4>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Keep your guns &amp; knives protected every hunting season and for months to come. The same technology that protects a $200,000 Lamborghini is now available for your sporting gear! This spray-on application creates a ceramic shell coating that lasts up to a year! Works with all finishes. Will not gloss up your matte finish guns or blades.</span></p>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: small;\">This NANO-CERMAMIC hydrophobic spray is safe on:</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">All Metals</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Fiberglass</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Clear Coats</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">All Paints</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Plastics</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(373633,75,1,174572,'<h4><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Seal &amp; protect your firearms in one easy application. Works on all firearm finishes. Won’t leave a shine on your matte finish. Hydrophobic nano-ceramic technology protects up to one full year! </span></h4>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Keep your guns &amp; knives protected every hunting season and for months to come. The same technology that protects a $200,000 Lamborghini is now available for your sporting gear! This spray-on application creates a ceramic shell coating that lasts up to a year! Works with all finishes. Will not gloss up your matte finish guns or blades.</span></p>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: small;\">This NANO-CERMAMIC hydrophobic spray is safe on:</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">All Metals</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Fiberglass</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Clear Coats</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">All Paints</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Plastics</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(373615,76,0,174572,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">A ceramic coating that keeps your guns &amp; knives protected for up to a year! Easy application. State of the art protection.</span></strong></p>'),(373634,76,1,174572,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">A ceramic coating that keeps your guns &amp; knives protected for up to a year! Easy application. State of the art protection.</span></strong></p>'),(373635,85,1,174572,'FLITZ Gun & Knife Ceramic Sealant 1.7oz/50ml'),(373639,75,0,174575,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Cut your tumbling time in half! Remove oxidation, powder residue, fingerprints and other contaminants leaving brass, nickel and other cases bright and shiny.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>T<span style=\"font-size: small;\">ough metal requires tough cleaning. Supercharge your media’s scrubbing power with Flitz Tumbler Media Additive! </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Safe on ANY Metal. Will not deaden primer or stress and embrittle brass. (NO AMONIA)</span></p>\r\n<p><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Eco-safe product. Perfect for use with walnut shell or corn cob tumbling media to reduce cleaning time by up to half compared to using plain media alone! </span></p>'),(373645,75,1,174575,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Cut your tumbling time in half! Remove oxidation, powder residue, fingerprints and other contaminants leaving brass, nickel and other cases bright and shiny.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>T<span style=\"font-size: small;\">ough metal requires tough cleaning. Supercharge your media’s scrubbing power with Flitz Tumbler Media Additive! </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Safe on ANY Metal. Will not deaden primer or stress and embrittle brass. (NO AMONIA)</span></p>\r\n<p><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Eco-safe product. Perfect for use with walnut shell or corn cob tumbling media to reduce cleaning time by up to half compared to using plain media alone! </span></p>'),(373640,76,0,174575,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tough metal requires tough cleaning. Supercharge your media’s scrubbing power with the FLITZ Tumbler Media Additive!</span></strong></p>'),(373646,76,1,174575,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tough metal requires tough cleaning. Supercharge your media’s scrubbing power with the FLITZ Tumbler Media Additive!</span></strong></p>'),(373647,85,1,174575,'FLITZ Tumbler Media Additive 1 Gallon/128oz/3785ml'),(373643,75,0,174577,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Cut your tumbling time in half! Remove oxidation, powder residue, fingerprints and other contaminants leaving brass, nickel and other cases bright and shiny.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>T<span style=\"font-size: small;\">ough metal requires tough cleaning. Supercharge your media’s scrubbing power with Flitz Tumbler Media Additive! </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Safe on ANY Metal. Will not deaden primer or stress and embrittle brass. (NO AMONIA)</span></p>\r\n<p><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Eco-safe product. Perfect for use with walnut shell or corn cob tumbling media to reduce cleaning time by up to half compared to using plain media alone! </span></p>'),(373771,75,1,174577,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Cut your tumbling time in half! Remove oxidation, powder residue, fingerprints and other contaminants leaving brass, nickel and other cases bright and shiny.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>T<span style=\"font-size: small;\">ough metal requires tough cleaning. Supercharge your media’s scrubbing power with Flitz Tumbler Media Additive! </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Safe on ANY Metal. Will not deaden primer or stress and embrittle brass. (NO AMONIA)</span></p>\r\n<p><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Eco-safe product. Perfect for use with walnut shell or corn cob tumbling media to reduce cleaning time by up to half compared to using plain media alone! </span></p>'),(373644,76,0,174577,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tough metal requires tough cleaning. Supercharge your media’s scrubbing power with the FLITZ Tumbler Media Additive!</span></strong></p>'),(373772,76,1,174577,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tough metal requires tough cleaning. Supercharge your media’s scrubbing power with the FLITZ Tumbler Media Additive!</span></strong></p>'),(373773,85,1,174577,'FLITZ Tumbler Media Additive 16oz/473ml'),(373648,75,0,174578,'<h4><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">The polish that launched an entire company over 45 years ago. German engineering and American know-how bring you the Swiss Army Knife of polishes. A concentrated cream, Flitz Paste Polish is unsurpassed in its ability to clean, polish, de-oxidize and protect. Provides a durable finish with tough protection. It\'s non-abrasive, non-toxic, non-flammable.</span></h4>\r\n<h4></h4>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Completely Safe For Use On:</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Brass, Copper**, Silverplate, Sterling Silver, Chrome, Stainless Steel, Nickel, Bronze, Solid Gold, Aluminum, Anodized Aluminum, Beryllium, Magnesium, Platinum, Pewter,</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Factory Hot Gun Bluing*, Painted Surfaces, Formica®, Cultured Marble, Fire clay sinks, Corian™, Glass, Plexiglas™, Plastics***, Fiberglass &amp; Eisenglass. </span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Leaves behind a protective wax finish to keep things shiny longer!</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Easily Removes:</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Tarnish, Rust, Water Stains, Chalking, Lime Deposits</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Heat Discoloration, Lead &amp; Powder Residue, Oxidation</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Bugs, Tar, Oil, Fingerprints, Tree Sap, Bird Droppings</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Graffiti, Dyes, Black Streaks, Scuff Marks.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Protects up