 style=\"font-size: small;\">Protects up to 6 months in fresh water; up to 3 months in salt water!</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(373653,75,1,174579,'<h4><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">The polish that launched an entire company over 45 years ago. German engineering and American know-how bring you the Swiss Army Knife of polishes. A concentrated cream, Flitz Paste Polish is unsurpassed in its ability to clean, polish, de-oxidize and protect. Provides a durable finish with tough protection. It\'s non-abrasive, non-toxic, non-flammable.</span></h4>\r\n<h4></h4>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Completely Safe For Use On:</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Brass, Copper**, Silverplate, Sterling Silver, Chrome, Stainless Steel, Nickel, Bronze, Solid Gold, Aluminum, Anodized Aluminum, Beryllium, Magnesium, Platinum, Pewter,</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Factory Hot Gun Bluing*, Painted Surfaces, Formica®, Cultured Marble, Fire clay sinks, Corian™, Glass, Plexiglas™, Plastics***, Fiberglass &amp; Eisenglass. </span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Leaves behind a protective wax finish to keep things shiny longer!</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Easily Removes:</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Tarnish, Rust, Water Stains, Chalking, Lime Deposits</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Heat Discoloration, Lead &amp; Powder Residue, Oxidation</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Bugs, Tar, Oil, Fingerprints, Tree Sap, Bird Droppings</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Graffiti, Dyes, Black Streaks, Scuff Marks.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Protects up to 6 months in fresh water; up to 3 months in salt water!</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(373651,76,0,174579,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Enjoy the legendary shine that made Flitz a household name! Flitz Paste Polish concentrated cream is unsurpassed in its ability to clean, polish, de-oxidize and protect.</span></strong></p>'),(373654,76,1,174579,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Enjoy the legendary shine that made Flitz a household name! Flitz Paste Polish concentrated cream is unsurpassed in its ability to clean, polish, de-oxidize and protect.</span></strong></p>'),(373655,85,1,174579,'FLITZ Metal, Plastic & Fiberglass Polish 1lb/453g'),(373656,75,0,174580,'<h5 class=\"powr-popup powrLoaded\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">The Original Flitz Büff Ball (*Bonus includes 1 free 1.76oz Tube of FLITZ Metal, Paint &amp; Fiberglass Polish).    </span> </strong>      </h5>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The revolutionary way to Buff and Polish! The self-cooling viscose felt material won’t tear and shred like foam buffers. And self-cooling means it won\'t scorch or burn your finish. Power-rated for speeds up to 2500 rpm, it fits any 3/8-inch drill or air tool.(not included). The Buff Ball is washable and reusable... guaranteed!* </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Scuff Marks, Light Scratches</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Oxidation, Chalking, Tarnish,</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Pitting and Corrosion</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Perfect for:</span></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">ALL Metals, Fiberglass®, Painted Surfaces</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Plastics, Eisenglass®, Plexiglas®</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Mag Wheels, Railings, Aluminum Running Boards </span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Motorcycles, Antiques, Furniture, Awnings</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Shower Enclosures and Patio Furniture </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Exceptional for Industrial Polishing and Buffing on Stainless Steel, Aluminum, Brass and More! Fits all Drills, Air Tools, Drill Presses and Bench Grinders.</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Buffs Hard-to-Reach Areas in Seconds. </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Original Design made with Soft Italian Viscose Fiber. Great for Textured and Smooth Surfaces. Can be Machine Washed and Reused up to 10 Times. Use Indoors or Outdoors. Will not shred or shed lint. </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">How To Use: (Always use protective eyewear when using any power tool)</span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Properly secure Flitz Büff Ball into drill or air tool. (Use only forward or right rotation).</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Apply a thin coat of Flitz Polish to surface. </span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Buff lightly to begin. Increase speed and buff (up to 2500rpm) for highest luster.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Repeat if necessary. </span></li>\r\n</ol>'),(373774,75,1,174580,'<h5 class=\"powr-popup powrLoaded\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">The Original Flitz Büff Ball (*Bonus includes 1 free 1.76oz Tube of FLITZ Metal, Paint &amp; Fiberglass Polish).    </span> </strong>      </h5>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The revolutionary way to Buff and Polish! The self-cooling viscose felt material won’t tear and shred like foam buffers. And self-cooling means it won\'t scorch or burn your finish. Power-rated for speeds up to 2500 rpm, it fits any 3/8-inch drill or air tool.(not included). The Buff Ball is washable and reusable... guaranteed!* </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Scuff Marks, Light Scratches</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Oxidation, Chalking, Tarnish,</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Pitting and Corrosion</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Perfect for:</span></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">ALL Metals, Fiberglass®, Painted Surfaces</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Plastics, Eisenglass®, Plexiglas®</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Mag Wheels, Railings, Aluminum Running Boards </span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Motorcycles, Antiques, Furniture, Awnings</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Shower Enclosures and Patio Furniture </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Exceptional for Industrial Polishing and Buffing on Stainless Steel, Aluminum, Brass and More! Fits all Drills, Air Tools, Drill Presses and Bench Grinders.</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Buffs Hard-to-Reach Areas in Seconds. </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Original Design made with Soft Italian Viscose Fiber. Great for Textured and Smooth Surfaces. Can be Machine Washed and Reused up to 10 Times. Use Indoors or Outdoors. Will not shred or shed lint. </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">How To Use: (Always use protective eyewear when using any power tool)</span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Properly secure Flitz Büff Ball into drill or air tool. (Use only forward or right rotation).</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Apply a thin coat of Flitz Polish to surface. </span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Buff lightly to begin. Increase speed and buff (up to 2500rpm) for highest luster.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Repeat if necessary. </span></li>\r\n</ol>'),(373657,76,0,174580,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Experience a revolutionary new way to buff and polish surfaces! Designed for reuse, it is heat resistant, tear resistant, and washable, guaranteed! Plus best of all fits on any corded or cordless drill (no more wasting your time with a orbital). </span></strong></p>'),(373775,76,1,174580,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Experience a revolutionary new way to buff and polish surfaces! Designed for reuse, it is heat resistant, tear resistant, and washable, guaranteed! Plus best of all fits on any corded or cordless drill (no more wasting your time with a orbital). </span></strong></p>'),(373776,85,1,174580,'FLITZ 5'),(373658,75,0,174581,'<h5 class=\"powr-popup powrLoaded\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">The Original Flitz Büff Ball (*Bonus includes 1 free 1.76oz Tube of FLITZ Metal, Paint &amp; Fiberglass Polish).    </span> </strong>      </h5>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The revolutionary way to Buff and Polish! The self-cooling viscose felt material won’t tear and shred like foam buffers. And self-cooling means it won\'t scorch or burn your finish. Power-rated for speeds up to 2500 rpm, it fits any 3/8-inch drill or air tool.(not included). The Buff Ball is washable and reusable... guaranteed!* </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Scuff Marks, Light Scratches</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Oxidation, Chalking, Tarnish,</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Pitting and Corrosion</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Perfect for:</span></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">ALL Metals, Fiberglass®, Painted Surfaces</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Plastics, Eisenglass®, Plexiglas®</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Mag Wheels, Railings, Aluminum Running Boards </span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Motorcycles, Antiques, Furniture, Awnings</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Shower Enclosures and Patio Furniture </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Exceptional for Industrial Polishing and Buffing on Stainless Steel, Aluminum, Brass and More! Fits all Drills, Air Tools, Drill Presses and Bench Grinders.</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Buffs Hard-to-Reach Areas in Seconds. </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Original Design made with Soft Italian Viscose Fiber. Great for Textured and Smooth Surfaces. Can be Machine Washed and Reused up to 10 Times. Use Indoors or Outdoors. Will not shred or shed lint. </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">How To Use: (Always use protective eyewear when using any power tool)</span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Properly secure Flitz Büff Ball into drill or air tool. (Use only forward or right rotation).</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Apply a thin coat of Flitz Polish to surface. </span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Buff lightly to begin. Increase speed and buff (up to 2500rpm) for highest luster.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Repeat if necessary. </span></li>\r\n</ol>'),(373664,75,1,174581,'<h5 class=\"powr-popup powrLoaded\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">The Original Flitz Xtra Large Büff Ball (*Bonus includes 1 free 1.76oz Tube of FLITZ Metal, Paint &amp; Fiberglass Polish).    </span> </strong>      </h5>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The revolutionary way to Buff and Polish! The self-cooling viscose felt material won’t tear and shred like foam buffers. And self-cooling means it won\'t scorch or burn your finish. Power-rated for speeds up to 2500 rpm, it fits any 3/8-inch drill or air tool.(not included). The Buff Ball is washable and reusable... guaranteed!* </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Scuff Marks, Light Scratches</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Oxidation, Chalking, Tarnish,</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Pitting and Corrosion</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Perfect for:</span></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">ALL Metals, Fiberglass®, Painted Surfaces</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Plastics, Eisenglass®, Plexiglas®</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Mag Wheels, Railings, Aluminum Running Boards </span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Motorcycles, Antiques, Furniture, Awnings</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Shower Enclosures and Patio Furniture </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Exceptional for Industrial Polishing and Buffing on Stainless Steel, Aluminum, Brass and More! Fits all Drills, Air Tools, Drill Presses and Bench Grinders.</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Buffs Hard-to-Reach Areas in Seconds. </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Original Design made with Soft Italian Viscose Fiber. Great for Textured and Smooth Surfaces. Can be Machine Washed and Reused up to 10 Times. Use Indoors or Outdoors. Will not shred or shed lint. </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">How To Use: (Always use protective eyewear when using any power tool)</span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Properly secure Flitz Büff Ball into drill or air tool. (Use only forward or right rotation).</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Apply a thin coat of Flitz Polish to surface. </span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Buff lightly to begin. Increase speed and buff (up to 2500rpm) for highest luster.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Repeat if necessary. </span></li>\r\n</ol>'),(373659,76,0,174581,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Experience a revolutionary new way to buff and polish surfaces! Designed for reuse, it is heat resistant, tear resistant, and washable, guaranteed! Plus best of all fits on any corded or cordless drill (no more wasting your time with a orbital). </span></strong></p>'),(373665,76,1,174581,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Experience a revolutionary new way to buff and polish surfaces! Designed for reuse, it is heat resistant, tear resistant, and washable, guaranteed! Plus best of all fits on any corded or cordless drill (no more wasting your time with a orbital). </span></strong></p>'),(373666,85,1,174581,'FLITZ 7'),(373667,75,0,174582,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Remove Calcium, Rust and Lime buildup this deposit killing organic formula. Works instantly! Not an acid! Spray and rinse with water and the crud is gone!</span></strong></p>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Perfect For Use On:</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Glass Plastic &amp; Acrylics</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Aluminum</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Fiberglass &amp; Tile</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Stainless Steel</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Brass &amp; Copper</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Painted Surfaces</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Enamel finishes</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Instantly Removes:</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Hard Water Spots</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Calcium/Lime Deposits</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Heavy Green Tarnish</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Heavy Oxidation Rust &amp; Corrosion</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Grease, Oil &amp; Hard Water Stains</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Soap Scum Build-up</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: small;\">How to Use:</span></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Spray full strength onto surface</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Wait up to 1 minute (DO NOT LET DRY)</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Rinse well with water</span></li>\r\n</ol>'),(373777,75,1,174582,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Remove Calcium, Rust and Lime buildup this deposit killing organic formula. Works instantly! Not an acid! Spray and rinse with water and the crud is gone!</span></strong></p>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Perfect For Use On:</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Glass Plastic &amp; Acrylics</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Aluminum</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Fiberglass &amp; Tile</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Stainless Steel</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Brass &amp; Copper</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Painted Surfaces</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Enamel finishes</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Instantly Removes:</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Hard Water Spots</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Calcium/Lime Deposits</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Heavy Green Tarnish</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Heavy Oxidation Rust &amp; Corrosion</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Grease, Oil &amp; Hard Water Stains</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Soap Scum Build-up</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: small;\">How to Use:</span></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Spray full strength onto surface</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Wait up to 1 minute (DO NOT LET DRY)</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Rinse well with water</span></li>\r\n</ol>'),(373668,76,0,174582,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Quickly and easily removes even the toughest stains, deposits and build-up. Flitz\'s organic salt formula is safer and easier to use than traditional cleaners. Recommended for removal of hard water spots, fuel stains, scum lines and rust stains too!</span></strong></p>'),(373778,76,1,174582,'<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Quickly and easily removes even the toughest stains, deposits and build-up. Flitz\'s organic salt formula is safer and easier to use than traditional cleaners. Recommended for removal of hard water spots, fuel stains, scum lines and rust stains too!</span></strong></p>'),(373779,85,1,174582,'FLITZ Instant Calcium Lime & Rust Remover 16oz/473ml'),(373669,75,0,174583,'<div class=\"woocommerce-tabs wc-tabs-wrapper\">\r\n<div id=\"tab-description\" class=\"woocommerce-Tabs-panel woocommerce-Tabs-panel--description panel entry-content wc-tab\">\r\n<p>AR-15 Cornerstone series hand guard (standard or competition) in black hard coat anodize.</p>\r\n<p>Standards come with a full length picatinny rail the whole length of rail.</p>\r\n<p>Competitions come with a cut a way picatinny rail and clamping lugs only at the front and rear of rails.</p>\r\n<div>Our AR-chitect AR15 CORNERSTONE SERIES hand guards are designed to be slim and light.</div>\r\n<div>A low cost alternative to foreign sourced hand guards. American made quality at an import price.</div>\r\n<div>An overall width of 1.5 inches and a weight of only 9.5 ozs. for the 15 inch model provide ultimate comfort.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p>A 1.3 inch I.D. will accommodate most low profile gas blocks. We have seen some interference with some clamp-on style low profile gas blocks)</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>MLOK slots at the 3,6 and 9 positions are manufactured to MAGPUL standards to ensure proper fitment with any MAGPUL certified accessories.</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div>Every handguard comes with a 4140 pre-heat treated steel barrel nut that has been black nitride coated not phosphates coated. All mounting hardware is included with full mounting instructions.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p>A two inch long barrel nut ensures rigid mounting for rock solid accessory mounting. This system will not work with piston driven rifles.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p>American made from American sourced 6061 T-6 extruded aluminum.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Hard-coat anodized in accordance with MIL-A-8625 Type III class II.</div>\r\n<div>100% warranty against any and all manufacturers defects. If we missed something we will replace it at no cost to you.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(648780,75,1,174583,'<div class=\"woocommerce-tabs wc-tabs-wrapper\">\r\n<div id=\"tab-description\" class=\"woocommerce-Tabs-panel woocommerce-Tabs-panel--description panel entry-content wc-tab\">\r\n<p>AR-15 Cornerstone series hand guard (standard or competition) in black hard coat anodize.</p>\r\n<p>Standards come with a full length picatinny rail the whole length of rail.</p>\r\n<p>Competitions come with a cut a way picatinny rail and clamping lugs only at the front and rear of rails.</p>\r\n<div>Our AR-chitect AR15 CORNERSTONE SERIES hand guards are designed to be slim and light.</div>\r\n<div>A low cost alternative to foreign sourced hand guards. American made quality at an import price.</div>\r\n<div>An overall width of 1.5 inches and a weight of only 9.5 ozs. for the 15 inch model provide ultimate comfort.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p>A 1.3 inch I.D. will accommodate most low profile gas blocks. We have seen some interference with some clamp-on style low profile gas blocks)</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>MLOK slots at the 3,6 and 9 positions are manufactured to MAGPUL standards to ensure proper fitment with any MAGPUL certified accessories.</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div>Every handguard comes with a 4140 pre-heat treated steel barrel nut that has been black nitride coated not phosphates coated. All mounting hardware is included with full mounting instructions.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p>A two inch long barrel nut ensures rigid mounting for rock solid accessory mounting. This system will not work with piston driven rifles.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p>American made from American sourced 6061 T-6 extruded aluminum.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Hard-coat anodized in accordance with MIL-A-8625 Type III class II.</div>\r\n<div>100% warranty against any and all m