dguard comes with a pre-heat treated, 2 inch length 4140 steel barrel nut. This ensures rigid, rock-solid accessory mounting. The barrel nut has been nitrided, not phosphated.</p>\r\n<p>Mounting instructions and hardware are included with every AR10 &amp; AR15 handguard.</p>\r\n<p>Available in Hard Coat Black anodized finish.</p>\r\n<p>Hard Coat Black anodizing is in accordance with MILA-A-8625 Type III Class II specifications.</p>\r\n<p>100% warranty against all manufacturing defects.</p>'),(373709,76,0,174596,'<p><span>Our AR-chitect AR15 FOUNDATION SERIES hand-guards are designed to be slim and light.</span><br /><span>An overall width of 1.5 inches and a weight of only 10 ozs. for the 15 inch model provide</span><br /><span>ultimate comfort.</span></p>'),(374071,76,1,174596,'<p><span>Our AR-chitect AR15 FOUNDATION SERIES hand-guards are designed to be slim and light.</span></p>\r\n<p>• Competition Rail or Full Flat Top</p>\r\n<p>• Length in different sizes</p>\r\n<p>• American sourced 6061 T-6 extruded aluminum</p>'),(373710,85,0,174596,'Bowden Tactical AR-15 Foundation Series  Handguard. handguard, magpul specs, m-lok'),(374072,85,1,174596,'Bowden Tactical AR-15 Foundation Series  Handguard. handguard, magpul specs, m-lok'),(373711,75,0,174597,'<p>Our AR-chitect AR rifle FOUNDATION SERIES muzzle brakes are designed to be slim and<br />light weight.</p>\r\n<p>Designed to redirect blast and gasses out and up as to mitigate recoil and muzzle rise. While also<br />suppressing the flash at the end of the barrel.</p>\r\n<p>American made from American sourced 4140 pre-heat treated steel or 304 Stainless Steel.</p>\r\n<p>Thread patterns available are 1/2×28 with a bore of .280 is designed for the .223/5.56 platform<br />as well as 5/8×24 with a bore of .375 is designed for the .300 / 6.5 / .308 / 7.62 platforms.</p>\r\n<p>Please be aware of what caliber you are shooting versus the bore size. shooting anything other than<br />the recommended platforms can result in seri