tical Low-Profile .750 Diameter Gas Blocks'),(373756,75,0,174611,'<p>Low-profile Adjustable .750 diameter gas block, set screw style, black nitride coated.</p>\r\n<p>Our AR-chitect AR rifle FOUNDATION SERIES gas blocks are designed to be slim and<br />light weight.<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"></span></p>\r\n<p>American made from American sourced 4140 pre-heat treated steel.<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"></span></p>\r\n<p>8-32 adjustment screw from muzzle end. 4-40 locking set screw.</p>\r\n<p>.750 diameter set screw style. If your barrel is not pre-dimpled, we recommend the use of a gas block alignment tool.<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"></span></p>\r\n<p>We recommend the use of lok-tite thread locker on both set screws during installation.<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"></span></p>\r\n<p>4140 gas blocks are black nitride coated not phosphate coated for the best look and finish.<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"></span></p>\r\n<p>100% warranty against any and all manufacturers defects. If we missed something we will replace it at<br />no cost to you.</p>'),(374055,75,1,174611,'<p>Low-profile Adjustable .750 diameter gas block, set screw style, black nitride coated.</p>\r\n<p>If your barrel is not pre-dimpled, we recommend the use of a gas block alignment tool.</p>\r\n<p>Our AR-chitect AR rifle FOUNDATION SERIES gas blocks are designed to be slim and<br />light weight.<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"></span></p>\r\n<p>American made from American sourced 4140 pre-heat treated steel.<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"></span></p>\r\n<p>8-32 adjustment screw from muzzle end. 4-40 locking set screw.</p>\r\n<p>We recommend the use of Loctite thread locker on both set screws during installation.<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"></span></p>\r\n<p>4140 gas blocks are black nitride coated not phosphate coated for the best look and finish.<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"></span></p>\r\n<p>100% warranty against any and all manufacturers defects. If we missed something we will replace it at<br />no cost to you.</p>'),(373757,76,0,174611,'<p><span>Super low-profile .750 diameter gas block, set screw style, black nitride, adjustable</span></p>'),(374056,76,1,174611,'<p><span>Super low-profile .750 diameter gas block, set screw style, black nitride, adjustable</span></p>'),(373758,85,0,174611,'Bowden Tactical Low-Profile Adjustable .750 Diameter Gas Blocks'),(374057,85,1,174611,'Bowden Tactical Low-Profile Adjustable .750 Diameter Gas Blocks'),(373759,75,0,174612,'<p>AR-chitect Direct Mount MLOK Angled Fore-grip.</p>\r\n<p>Great application for AR pistols where a vertical grip cannot be used.</p>\r\n<p>No additional Picatinny section needed to mount to.</p>\r\n<p>6061 Aluminum.<br />Hard coat Black Anodized.<br />Reversible to be Used as a Hand-stop.</p>\r\n<p>3/4″ wide   2″ tall   4 7/8″ long.</p>\r\n<p>Made In America.</p>'),(374058,75,1,174612,'<p>AR-chitect Direct Mount MLOK Angled Fore-grip.</p>\r\n<p>Great application for AR rifles or pistols where a vertical grip cannot be used.</p>\r\n<p>No additional Picatinny section needed for mounting.</p>\r\n<p>6061 Aluminum.<br />Hard coat Black Anodized.<br />Reversible to be Used as a Hand-stop.</p>\r\n<p>3/4″ wide x 2″ tall x 4 7/8″ long.</p>\r\n<p>Made In America.</p>'),(373760,76,0,174612,'<p><span>Reversible </span></p>\r\n<p><span>Can be used as a hand stop </span></p>\r\n<p><span>Direct M-Lok mounting </span></p>\r\n<p><span>No additional picatinny section required</span></p>'),(374059,76,1,174612,'<p>The Bowden Tactical AR-chitect Direct Mount MLOK Angled Foregrip</p>\r\n<p>• Can be used as a hand stop</p>\r\n<p>• Direct M-Lok mounting</p>\r\n<p>• No additional picatinny section required</p>'),(373761,85,0,174612,'Bowden Tactical AR-chitect Direct Mount MLOK Angled Foregrip'),(374060,85,1,174612,'Bowden Tactical AR-chitect Direct Mount MLOK Angled Foregrip'),(373762,75,0,174613,'<p><span>AR-chitect Direct Mount MLOK micro-handstop.</span><br /><span>Great application for AR pistols.</span><br /><span>Keep your hand from entering the blast zone on short barrels.</span><br /><span>No additional Picatinny section needed to mount.</span><br /><span>6061 aluminum.</span><br /><span>Hard coat black anodized.</span><br /><span>Reversible to be used in either direction.</span><br /><span>5/8” wide x 1” high x 1 ¾” long.</span><br /><span>Made In America.</span></p>'),(374049,75,1,174613,'<p><span>AR-chitect Direct Mount MLOK micro-handstop.</span><br /><span>Great application for AR rifles or pistols.</span><br /><span>Protects your hand from entering the blast zone on short barrels.</span><br /><span>No additional Picatinny section needed to mount.</span><br /><span>6061 aluminum.</span><br /><span>Hard coat black anodized.</span><br /><span>Reversible to be used in either direction.</span><br /><span>5/8” wide x 1” high x 1 ¾” long.</span><br /><span>Made In America.</span></p>'),(373763,76,0,174613,'<p><span>AR-chitect Direct Mount MLOK micro-handstop.</span></p>\r\n<p>• Great application for AR pistols.</p>\r\n<p>• No additional Picatinny section needed to mount.</p>\r\n<p>• 6061 aluminum</p>'),(374050,76,1,174613,'<p><span>AR-chitect Direct Mount MLOK micro-handstop.</span></p>\r\n<p>• Great application for AR pistols.</p>\r\n<p>• No additional Picatinny section needed to mount.</p>\r\n<p>• 6061 aluminum</p>'),(373764,85,0,174613,'Bowden Tactical AR-chitect Direct Mount MLOK Micro-Handstop'),(374051,85,1,174613,'Bowden Tactical AR-chitect Direct Mount MLOK Micro-Handstop'),(373765,75,0,174614,'<p>Engineered to give you increased accuracy at a price you can afford. Our Parametric Trigger is our answer to the gritty mil-spec triggers that destroy your accuracy.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>All steel components are hardened 4140 steel, black nitride coated and cut 100% with wire EDM machines for exacting tolerances of .0002 in critical places.</li>\r\n<li>The hammer spring is made from heavy-duty spring steel giving you the hard-hit needed for even the hardest primers.</li>\r\n<li>Designed to reduce the amount of pressure it takes to fire the rifle. Factory set and locked between 3.5-4.0 lbs.</li>\r\n</ul>'),(374073,75,1,174614,'<p>Engineered to give you increased accuracy at a price you can afford. Our Parametric Trigger is your answer to the gritty mil-spec triggers that destroy your accuracy.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>All steel components are hardened 4140 steel, black nitride coated and cut 100% with wire EDM machines for exacting tolerances of .0002 in critical places.</li>\r\n<li>The hammer spring is made from heavy-duty spring steel giving you the hard-hit needed for even the hardest primers.</li>\r\n<li>Designed to reduce the amount of pressure it takes to fire the rifle. Factory set and locked between 3.5-4.0 lbs.</li>\r\n</ul>'),(373766,76,0,174614,'<p><span>Engineered to give you increased accuracy at a price you can afford. Our Parametric Trigger is our answer to the gritty mil-spec triggers that destroy your accuracy.</span></p>'),(374074,76,1,174614,'<p><span>Engineered to give you increased accuracy at a price you can afford. Our Parametric Trigger is our answer to the gritty mil-spec triggers that destroy your accuracy.</span></p>\r\n<p>• Curved or Straight</p>\r\n<p>• Single Stage, Drop-in, adjustable</p>\r\n<p>• Black Nitride Coating</p>'),(373767,85,0,174614,'Bowden Tactical Parametric Trigger, ar15 trigger, rifle trigger'),(374075,85,1,174614,'Bowden Tactical Parametric Trigger, ar15 trigger, rifle trigger'),(373768,75,0,174615,'<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">The Bowden Tactical Billet Upper is designed to be stylish and functional. Made to be ergonomic, easy to install, and a perfect match to our handguards so you can have a complete monolithic look for your AR.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Stripped uppers only ( No UPK added )</li>\r\n<li>7075 billet aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Hard coat black anodized</li>\r\n<li>Set screw style forward assist ( not roll pin )</li>\r\n<li>9.4 ounces</li>\r\n<li>Picatinny machined to MIL-STD 1913</li>\r\n<li>Will fit MIL-SPEC and billet lowers</li>\r\n</ul>'),(374067,75,1,174615,'<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">The Bowden Tactical Billet Upper is designed to be stylish and functional. Made to be ergonomic, easy to install, and a perfect match to our handguards so you can have a complete monolithic look for your AR.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Stripped uppers only ( No UPK added )</li>\r\n<li>7075 billet aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Hard coat black anodized</li>\r\n<li>Set screw style forward assist ( not roll pin )</li>\r\n<li>9.4 ounces</li>\r\n<li>Picatinny machined to MIL-STD 1913</li>\r\n<li>Will fit MIL-SPEC and billet lowers</li>\r\n</ul>'),(373769,76,0,174615,'<p><span>The Bowden Tactical Billet Upper is designed to be stylish and functional. Made to be ergonomic, easy to install, and a perfect match to our handguards so you can have a complete monolithic look for your AR.</span></p>'),(374068,76,1,174615,'<p><span>The Bowden Tactical Billet Upper is designed to be stylish and functional. Made to be ergonomic, easy to install, and a perfect match to our handguards so you can have a complete monolithic look for your AR.</span></p>'),(373770,85,0,174615,'Bowden Tactical Billet Upper'),(374069,85,1,174615,'Bowden Tactical Billet Upper'),(373788,75,0,174618,'Be Your Best\r\n\r\nWSI provides you with soft, comfortable, stylish, American-made clothing that helps 