cts to our clients across the world while maintaining age-old Japanese traditions.<br />We believe in maintaining complete control over the manufacturing process, and our master craftsmen infuse all our products with the pride and traditions inherited from centuries of Japanese blade makers.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li id=\"proddescription\">\r\n<div class=\"proddescription\">Closed: 4.63\".</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li id=\"proddescription\">\r\n<div class=\"proddescription\">Blade: 3.5\".</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li id=\"proddescription\">\r\n<div class=\"proddescription\">l Damascus Steel l Standard Edge.</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li id=\"proddescription\">\r\n<div class=\"proddescription\">Handle: Brown. Stamina wood handles etched Bushido - Hideyoshi - with decorative artwork. </div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li id=\"proddescription\">\r\n<div class=\"proddescription\">Other Info: Thumb Stud(s). Molded black nylon belt sheath with brown leather trim. Boxed.</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><label>Weight:</label>0.4lbs.</li>\r\n<li><label>Country of Origin: </label>Japan.</li>\r\n<li>MSRP: $244.95</li>\r\n</ul>'),(374123,85,0,174692,'Mcusta MCU182D Linerlock'),(374126,85,1,174692,'Mcusta MCU182D Linerlock'),(374152,75,0,174695,'<p>A deadly combination of high ocatane fire power and agility, the Boss hits the target hard at 405 feet per second. Micro-Lite aluminum barrel that eliminates excess weight while still producing dead on accuracy.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Brand Name: Killer Instinct</li>\r\n<li>Trigger: 3.5 LBS</li>\r\n<li>Vendor\'s Item Number: 1104</li>\r\n<li>Speed: 405 FPS</li>\r\n<li>Draw Weight Max: 220</li>\r\n<li>Length 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Power Stroke: 13.25</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 6.7 LBS</li>\r\n</ul>'),(374173,75,1,174695,'<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>A deadly combination of high ocatane fire power and agility, the Boss hits the target hard at 405 feet per second. Micro-Lite aluminum barrel that eliminates excess weight while still producing dead on accuracy.</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Brand Name: Killer Instinct</li>\r\n<li>Trigger: 3.5 LBS</li>\r\n<li>Vendor\'s Item Number: 1104</li>\r\n<li>Speed: 405 FPS</li>\r\n<li>Draw Weight Max: 220</li>\r\n<li>Length 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Power Stroke: 13.25</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 6.7 LBS</li>\r\n</ul>'),(374153,85,0,174695,'Crossbow, Crossbow Package, Killer Instinct, Boss, Hunting, Archery, Bow hunting, Deer Hunting, Crossbow Hunting, Bow Package, Bow, Arrows, Bolts'),(374175,85,1,174695,'Crossbow, Crossbow Package, Killer Instinct, Boss, Hunting, Archery, Bow hunting, Deer Hunting, Crossbow Hunting, Bow Package, Bow, Arrows, Bolts'),(374156,75,0,174697,'<p>Gold Tip’s most popular bolt choice offers unmatched straightness tolerances and superb accuracy. Straightness tolerance of +-.005” and weight tolerance of +-2 grains. Shafts are 7.3 GPI. Includes brass inserts, moon nocks, and flat nocks. Factory fletched with 4 in. vanes. Finished weight of 398 gr. (20\") with 100 gr. point.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Brand Name: Gold Tip</li>\r\n<li>Pack Size: 6 Bolts</li>\r\n<li>Primary Color: Black</li>\r\n<li>Grains Per Inch: 7.3</li>\r\n<li>Fletching Length: 4 in.</li>\r\n<li>Fletching Type Mfg. Stock Vane</li>\r\n<li>Inserts: Included</li>\r\n<li>Length: 20 IN</li>\r\n<li>Nock Type: Moon and Flat included</li>\r\n</ul>'),(374159,75,1,174697,'<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Designed for the hunter who wants ultimate penetration, this is the heaviest carbon bolt in the Carbon express lineup. Factory fletched with 4\" vanes. 20\" bolts weigh 442 grains (with 100 gr. point). Moon nocks and inserts installed, flat nocks included.</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Brand Name: <span>Carbon Express</span></li>\r\n<li>Pack Size: 6 Bolts</li>\r\n<li>Primary Color: Black</li>\r\n<li>Fletching Length: 4 in.</li>\r\n<li>Fletching Type Mfg. Stock Vane</li>\r\n<li>Inserts: Included</li>\r\n<li>Length: 20 IN</li>\r\n<li>Nock Type: Moon and Flat included</li>\r\n</ul>'),(374157,85,0,174697,'Crossbow bolt, bolt, arrow, fletched bolt, hunting, bow, crossbow, crossbow accessories, archery, archery hunting  '),(374161,85,1,174697,'Crossbow bolt, bolt, arrow, fletched bolt, hunting, bow, crossbow, crossbow accessories, archery, archery hunting, Carbon Express, Piledriver'),(374185,75,0,174700,'<p><span>Guaranteed to save your fingernails!!! And, make disassembly of your Glock much easier!</span><br /><br /><span>The GlockStore Extended Precision Slide Lock is machined to be thicker and more robust than the factory part and is guaranteed to deliver better accuracy by letting your barrel and slide settle into battery more consistently, allowing you to be more accurate shot to shot. We machine this precision part here in the USA from 416 stainless steel that is hardened to 42 Rockwell.</span><br /><br /><span>It is slightly longer than the factory which makes it easier to grasp when removing the slide for dis-assembly and cleaning.</span></p>'),(374187,75,1,174700,'<p><span>Guaranteed to save your fingernails!!! And, make disassembly of your Glock much easier!</span><br /><br /><span>The GlockStore Extended Precision Slide Lock is machined to be thicker and more robust than the factory part and is guaranteed to deliver better accuracy by letting your barrel and slide settle into battery more consistently, allowing you to be more accurate shot to shot. We machine this precision part here in the USA from 416 stainless steel that is hardened to 42 Rockwell.</span><br /><br /><span>It is slightly longer than the factory which makes it easier to grasp when removing the slide for dis-assembly and cleaning.</span></p>'),(374186,76,0,174700,'<p><span>Makes take down of your Glock much easier! Improves accuracy!</span><br /><br /><span>Precision machined (not stamped, like many of the slide locks on the market)</span></p>'),(374188,76,1,174700,'<p><span>Makes take down of your Glock much easier! Improves accuracy!</span><br /><br /><span>Precision machined (not stamped, like many of the slide locks on the market)</span></p>'),(374269,75,0,174701,'<p><span>A good cup of coffee doesn\'t have to be complicated. Do you need to kick ass in the morning or not? Our strong but smooth dark roast is designed to taste great straight out of the pot. Made with 100% Arabica beans and roasted in the U.S.A., this coffee has a full-bodied flavor and more than a little fight in it. A little goes a long way, just like the underdogs that inspired it. So drink up and let’s make some hay.</span></p>'),(374425,75,1,174701,'<ul>\r\n<li>TOP QUALITY COFFEE TO FUEL YOUR GRIND: A good cup of coffee doesn\'t have to be complicated. Our strong but smooth dark roast is designed to taste great straight out of the pot.</li>\r\n<li>100% PREMIUM ARABICA BEANS: Quality coffee sourced from Central and South America.</li>\r\n<li>BOLD, SMOOTH TASTE: Perfectly balanced flavor that keeps you swinging. Has a full-bodied flavor and more than a little fight in it. A little goes a long way, just like the underdogs that inspired it. So drink up and let’s make some hay.</li>\r\n<li>FLAVOR BREAKDOWN: Class: Heavyweight. Roast: Dark. Body: Full. Bean: Arabica. Effort: 110%</li>\r\n<li>INSTRUCTIONS: Brewing a cup of coffee isn\'t bean surgery. Depending on your intestinal fortitude, start with 1 Tbsp (5g) for 1 cup (8 fl oz or 240mL) of filtered water. The benchmark is 2 Tbsp (10g) of coffee for 6 fl oz (180mL) of filtered water, but that may knock your socks off.</li>\r\n<li>Proudly roasted in the USA.</li>\r\n</ul>'),(374270,76,0,174701,'<p>Dark Roast</p>\r\n<p>100% Arabica Beans</p>\r\n<p>Ground Bean</p>'),(374426,76,1,174701,'<p><span>FROM THE MANUFACTURER: For us, Haymaker is more than just coffee. It\'s a belief that there\'s opportunity everywhere you look. That underdogs and opportunity-seekers need to make hay all day, every day. And to keep them up for the challenge, they need coffee that packs a punch. That\'s why we make good, quality blends to fuel your dream - because we know that dream won\'t chase itself.</span></p>'),(374271,85,0,174701,'Haymaker Coffee Heavyweight Dark Roast '),(374427,85,1,174701,'Haymaker Coffee Heavyweight Dark Roast '),(374272,75,0,174702,'<div id=\"prod-desc\" class=\"over-575\">\r\n<p>A good cup of coffee doesn\'t have to be complicated. Do you need to kick ass in the morning or not? Our strong but smooth dark roast is designed to taste great straight out of the pot. Made with 100% Arabica beans and roasted in the U.S.A., this coffee has a full-bodied flavor and more than a little fight in it. A little goes a long way, just like the underdogs that inspired it. So drink up and let’s make some hay.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"prod-price-area\">\r\n<div id=\"prod-price-bottom\">\r\n<div id=\"prod-price\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div id=\"dvProductPricing\" class=\"ProductDetailsPricing\">\r\n<div class=\"prod-price-reatil\"></div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(374428,75,1,174702,'<div id=\"prod-desc\" class=\"over-575\">\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">TOP QUALITY COFFEE TO FUEL YOUR GRIND: A good cup of coffee doesn\'t have to be complicated. Our strong but smooth dark roast is designed to taste great straight out of the pot.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">100% PREMIUM ARABICA BEANS: Quality coffee sourced from Central and South America.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">BOLD, SMOOTH TASTE: Perfectly balanced flavor that keeps you swinging. Has a full-bodied flavor and more than a little fight in it. A little goes a long way, just like the underdogs that inspired it. So drink up and let’s make some hay.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">FLAVOR BREAKDOWN: Class: Heavyweight. Roast: Dark. Body: Full. Bean: Arabica. Effort: 110%</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">INSTRUCTIONS: Brewing a cup of coffee isn\'t bean surgery. Depending on your intestinal fortitude, start with 1 Tbsp (5g) for 1 cup (8 fl oz or 240mL) of filtered water. The benchmark is 2 Tbsp (10g) of coffee for 6 fl oz (180mL) of filtered water, but that may knock your socks off.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Proudly roasted in the USA.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"prod-price-area\">\r\n<div id=\"prod-price-bottom\">\r\n<div id=\"prod-price\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div id=\"dvProductPricing\" class=\"ProductDetailsPricing\">\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(374273,76,0,174702,'<p>Dark Roast. 100% Arabica Beans</p>\r\n<p>Whole Bean</p>'),(374429,76,1,174702,'<p><span>FROM THE MANUFACTURER: For us, Haymaker is more than just coffee. It\'s a belief that there\'s opportunity everywhere you look. That underdogs and opportunity-seekers need to make hay all day, every day. And to keep them up for the challenge, they need coffee that packs a punch. That\'s why we make good, quality blends to fuel your dream - because we know that dream won\'t chase itself.</span></p>'),(374274,85,0,174702,'Haymaker Coffee Heavyweight Dark Roast Whole Bean'),(374430,85,1,174702,'Haymaker Coffee Heavyweight Dark Roast Whole Bean'),(374275,75,0,174703,'<p><span>A middleweight punching above its weight class, our medium roast isn’t playing around. Made from the leanest, meanest beans and roasted the hard way in the U.S.A., this coffee has a buff flavor that’s balanced and bright. The Middleweight is specially crafted to provide a smooth but bold taste that doesn’t need any fancy stuff (unless you want it to). It’s damn good and will fuel your day plain and simple.</span></p>'),(374278,75,1,174703,'<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">TOP QUALITY COFFEE TO FUEL YOUR GRIND: A middleweight punching above its weight class, our medium roast isn’t playing around. Made from the leanest, meanest beans, this coffee has a buff flavor that’s balanced and bright. The Middleweight is specially crafted to provide a smooth but bold taste that doesn’t need any fancy stuff (unless you want it to). It will fuel your day plain and simple.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">100% PREMIUM ARABICA BEANS: Quality coffee sourced from Central and South America.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">BOLD, SMOOTH TASTE: Perfectly balanced flavor that keeps you swinging. Has a well-rounded flavor.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">FLAVOR BREAKDOWN: Class: Middleweight. Roast: Medium. Body: Buff. Bean: Arabica</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">INSTRUCTIONS: Brewing a cup of coffee isn’t bean surgery. Just use 2 Tbsp (10g) of coffee for 6 fl oz (180mL) of filtered water. After opening, keep the grounds in a sealed container and enjoy within a week for peak freshness. Mmmmm, smells like productivity.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Proudly roasted in the USA.</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(374276,76,0,174703,'<p>Medium Roast. 100% Arabica Beans</p>\r\n<p>Ground Bean</p>'),(374279,76,1,174703,'<p>A middleweight punching above its weight class, our medium roast isn’t playing around. Made from the leanest, meanest beans and roasted the hard way in the U.S.A., this coffee has a buff flavor that’s balanced and bright. The Middleweight is specially crafted to provide a smooth but bold taste that doesn’t need any fancy stuff (unless you want it to). It’s damn good and will fuel your day plain and simple</p>'),(374277,85,0,174703,'Haymaker Coffee Middleweight Medium Roast'),(374280,85,1,174703,'Haymaker Coffee Middleweight Medium Roast'),(374281,75,0,174704,'<p><span>A middleweight punching above its weight class, our medium roast isn’t playing around. Made from the leanest, meanest beans and roasted the hard way in the U.S.A., this coffee has a buff flavor that’s balanced and bright. The Middleweight is specially crafted to provide a smooth but bold taste that doesn’t need any fancy stuff (unless you want it to). It’s damn good and will fuel your day plain and simple.</span></p>'),(388412,75,1,174704,'<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">TOP QUALITY COFFEE TO FUEL YOUR GRIND: A middleweight punching above its weight class, our medium roast isn’t playing around. Made from the leanest, meanest beans, this coffee has a buff flavor that’s balanced and bright. The Middleweight is specially crafted to provide a smooth but bold taste that doesn’t need any fancy stuff (unless you want it to). It will fuel your day plain and simple.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">100% PREMIUM ARABICA BEANS: Quality coffee sourced from Central and South America.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">BOLD, SMOOTH TASTE: Perfectly balanced flavor that keeps you swinging. Has a well-rounded flavor.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">FLAVOR BREAKDOWN: Class: Middleweight. Roast: Medium. Body: Buff. Bean: Arabica</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">INSTRUCTIONS: Brewing a cup of coffee isn’t bean surgery. Just use 2 Tbsp (10g) of coffee for 6 fl oz (180mL) of filtered water. After opening, keep the grounds in a sealed container and enjoy within a week for peak freshness. Mmmmm, smells like productivity.</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Proudly roasted in the USA.</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(374282,76,0,174704,'<p>Medium Roast Coffee. 100% Arabica Beans</p>\r\n<p>Whole Bean</p>'),(388413,76,1,174704,'<p>A middleweight punching above its weight class, our medium roast isn’t playing around. Made from the leanest, meanest beans and roasted the hard way in the U.S.A., this coffee has a buff flavor that’s balanced and bright. The Middleweight is specially crafted to provide a smooth but bold taste that doesn’t need any fancy stuff (unless you want it to). It’s damn good and will fuel your day plain and simple.</p>'),(374283,85,0,174704,'Haymaker Coffee Middleweight Medium Roast Whole Bean'),(388414,85,1,174704,'Haymaker Coffee Middleweight Medium Roast Whole Bean'),(374284,75,0,174705,'<div id=\"prod-desc\" class=\"over-575\">\r\n<p>You don’t get crowned champ by accident. The Prizefighter is aged for 10 days in maple syrup bourbon barrels from Manifest Distillery*. All Manifest Distillery’s distillation equipment is American-made and the grains that go into each of their spirits are sourced from a co-op of North American farms. Unlike synthetically flavored coffee, our Prizefighter blend delivers a sweet, natural flavor and aroma that can’t be beat. And just like all Haymaker roasts, it’s made with 100% Arabica beans and roasted in the U.S.A. This winner doesn’t take sh*t from anyone, but you can add milk and sugar if you want. Either way, it will rule the day – so you can dominate yours.</p>\r\n<p>*Not a significant source of alcohol. Sorry, bud.</p>\r\n<p>Note: actual coffee packaging may differ from the photos.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"prod-price-area\">\r\n<div id=\"prod-price-bottom\">\r\n<div id=\"prod-price\">\r\n<div id=\"dvProductPricing\" class=\"ProductDetailsPricing\">\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div class=\"prod-price-reatil\"></div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(388415,75,1,174705,'<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">100% SPECIALTY-GRADE ARABICA COFFEE BEANS: Quality coffee sourced from Central and South America.</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(374285,76,0,174705,'<p>Bourbon Roast. 100% Arabica Beans</p>\r\n<p>Whole Bean</p>'),(388416,76,1,174705,'<div id=\"prod-desc\" class=\"over-575\">\r\n<p>You don’t get crowned champ by accident. The Prizefighter is aged for 10 days in maple syrup bourbon barrels from Manifest Distillery*. All Manifest Distillery’s distillation equipment is American-made and the grains that go into each of their spirits are sourced from a co-op of North American farms. Unlike synthetically flavored coffee, our Prizefighter blend delivers a sweet, natural flavor and aroma that can’t be beat. And just like all Haymaker roasts, it’s made with 100% Arabica beans and roasted in the U.S.A. This winner doesn’t take sh*t from anyone, but you can add milk and sugar if you want. Either way, it will rule the day – so you can dominate yours.</p>\r\n<p>*Not a significant source of alcohol. Sorry, bud.</p>\r\n<p>Note: actual coffee packaging may differ from the photos.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"prod-price-area\">\r\n<div id=\"prod-price-bottom\">\r\n<div id=\"prod-price\">\r\n<div id=\"dvProductPricing\" class=\"ProductDetailsPricing\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(374286,85,0,174705,'Haymaker Coffee Prizefighter Bourbon Roast'),(388417,85,1,174705,'Haymaker Coffee Prizefighter Bourbon Roast'),(388387,75,0,175154,'<p><span>Stinger DS® LED HL™ Rechargeable Flashlight</span><br /><br /><span>Material/ Lens: 6000 series machined aircraft aluminum with non-slip rubberized comfort grip and anti-roll rubber ring. Unbreakable polycarbonate lens with scratch-resistant coating</span><br /><br /><span>Length: 8.85\"</span><br /><span>Major Diameter: 1.62\"</span><br /><span>Body Diameter: 1.17\"</span><br /><span>Weight: 12.8 oz</span><br /><br /><span>Switch: Dual switch technology - Access high, medium, low and strobe via the indepently working head mounted push-button switch or tail switch</span><br /><br /><span>Battery: 3-cell,3.6 Volt NiMH sub-C battery, rechargeable up to 1000 times</span><br /><br /><span>Charging: Ten hours to fully recharge on 100V, 120V, 230V or 240V AC, or 12V DC, 2.5-hour fast charger or PiggyBack® charger model available</span><br /><br /><span>Features</span><br /><span>• Anti-roll ring included</span><br /><span>• LED charge-continuity indicator, compact</span><br /><span>• IPX4 Rated for water resistant operation</span><br /><span>• 1 meter impact resistance tested</span><br /><span>• Snap-in charger holder that mounts in any position</span><br /><span>• Serialized for positive identification</span></p>'),(658217,75,1,175154,'<p><span>Stinger DS® LED HL™ Rechargeable Flashlight</span><br /><br /><span>Material/ Lens: 6000 series machined aircraft aluminum with non-slip rubberized comfort grip and anti-roll rubber ring. Unbreakable polycarbonate lens with scratch-resistant coating</span><br /><br /><span>Length: 8.85\"</span><br /><span>Major Diameter: 1.62\"</span><br /><span>Body Diameter: 1.17\"</span><br /><span>Weight: 12.8 oz</span><br /><br /><span>Switch: Dual switch technology - Access high, medium, low and strobe via the indepently working head mounted push-button switch or tail switch</span><br /><br /><span>Battery: 3-cell,3.6 Volt NiMH sub-C battery, rechargeable up to 1000 times</span><br /><br /><span>Charging: Ten hours to fully recharge on 100V, 120V, 230V or 240V AC, or 12V DC, 2.5-hour fast charger or PiggyBack® charger model available</span><br /><br /><span>Features</span><br /><span>• Anti-roll ring included</span><br /><span>• LED charge-continuity indicator, compact</span><br /><span>• IPX4 Rated for water resistant operation</span><br /><span>• 1 meter impact resistance tested</span><br /><span>• Snap-in charger holder that mounts in any position</span><br /><span>• Serialized for positive identification</span></p>'),(388388,76,0,175154,'<p><span>Switch: Dual switch technology - Access high, medium, low and strobe via the indepently working head mounted push-button switch or tail switch</span><br /><br /><span>Battery: 3-cell,3.6 Volt NiMH sub-C battery, rechargeable up to 1000 times</span></p>'),(658218,76,1,175154,'<p><span>Switch: Dual switch technology - Access high, medium, low and strobe via the indepently working head mounted push-button switch or tail switch</span><br /><br /><span>Battery: 3-cell,3.6 Volt NiMH sub-C battery, rechargeable up to 1000 times</span></p>'),(672837,75,0,176402,'<p>The FORCE-PRO from SPYPOINT is an absolute powerhouse of a camera.</p>\r\n<p>Capturing images at an incredible 30 megapixels, and taking 4K video, every piece of hunting information this camera delivers is truly impressive, instead of just being adequate.</p>\r\n<p>When you simply have to know that the image and video quality you bring back from the woods is crystal clear, and will help you make the best plan for the next hunt, you have the FORCE-PRO from SPYPOINT.</p>\r\n<p><strong>4K Video:</strong> See the action unfold just like you were there to see it yourself in incredible 4K<br /><strong>54 LED Flash:</strong> Learn as much from your nighttime images thanks to the powerful 54 LED flash<br /><strong>30MP Photo Resolution: </strong>Stunning 30 megapixel images mean you can study every detail of that big buck<br /><strong>0.2-Second Trigger Speed: </strong>Exceptional trigger speed means fewer photos of empty frames with game already passed by<br /><strong>110\' Detection Range: </strong>Capture images of even distant animals with a massive detection range</p>'),(657609,75,1,176402,'<p><strong>The FORCE-PRO from SPYPOINT is an absolute powerhouse of a camera.</strong></p>\r\n<p>Capturing images at an incredible 30 megapixels, and taking 4K video, every piece of hunting information this camera delivers is truly impressive, instead of just being adequate.</p>\r\n<p>When you simply have to know that the image and video quality you bring back from the woods is crystal clear, and will help you make the best plan for the next hunt, you have the FORCE-PRO from SPYPOINT.</p>\r\n<p>• 4K Video - See the action unfold just like you were there to see it yourself in incredible 4K</p>\r\n<p>• 54 LED Flash - Learn as much from your nighttime images thanks to the powerful 54 LED flash</p>\r\n<p>• 30MP Photo Resolution - Stunning 30 megapixel images mean you can study every detail of that big buck</p>\r\n<p>• 0.2-Second Trigger Speed - Exceptional trigger speed means fewer photos of empty frames with game already passed by</p>\r\n<p>• 110\' Detection Range - Capture images of even distant animals with a massive detection range</p>'),(672838,76,0,176402,'<ul>\r\n<li>4K Video</li>\r\n<li>54 LED Flash</li>\r\n<li>30MP Photo Resolution</li>\r\n<li>0.2 - Second Trigger Speed</li>\r\n<li>110ft Detection Range</li>\r\n</ul>'),(657610,76,1,176402,'<p>Capturing images at an incredible 30 megapixels, and taking 4K video, every piece of hunting information this camera delivers is truly impressive, instead of just being adequate.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• 4K Video - See the action unfold just like you were there to see it yourself in incredible 4K</p>\r\n<p>• 54 LED Flash - Learn as much from your nighttime images thanks to the powerful 54 LED flash</p>\r\n<p>• 30MP Photo Resolution - Stunning 30 megapixel images mean you can study every detail of that big buck</p>\r\n<p></p>'),(678557,75,0,176420,'<p>Case Material/ Lens: Impact resistant Engineering polymer. Glass lens with shock resistant gasket seal<br />Dims/Weight: 2.30 (5.84 cm)<br />2.97 (7.54 cm) depending on model<br />1.12 oz. (32 grams)<br />1.27 oz. (36 grams) with batteries; depending on model<br />Light Source: C4 LED technology, impervious to shock with a 50,000 hour lifetime; 640-660nm red laser<br />Light Output: 100 lumens; 2,000 candela peak beam intensity; parabolic reflector produces a balance of beam and peripheral illumination. Optimized electronics provide regulated intensity; Laser provides long-range targeting<br />On/Off: Ambidextrous momentary/steady On-Off push-button switch, Three modes: Laser only; both Laser/LED; LED only<br />Run Time: Runs 1 hour (LED only or LED/Laser combo); Laser only function runs 11 hours<br />Battery: Two CR-1/3N lithium batteries (included)</p>\r\n<p><strong>Features:</strong><br />Ultra lightweight and compact<br />Batteries can be replaced while light remains mounted on gun<br />No need to resight laser after battery change<br />Windage and Elevation adjustment screws mounted in brass bushings for long life and dependable zero retention of laser<br />Operating temperature: -20°F to +120°F.<br />IPX4; water resistant; 1m impact resistance tested<br />Serialized for positive identification</p>'),(678558,76,0,176420,'<p>Ultra lightweight and compact<br />Batteries can be replaced while light remains mounted on gun<br />No need to resight laser after battery change</p>'),(382749,85,0,176535,'Self Defense Tactical Penlight,'),(658216,85,1,176535,'Self Defense Tactical Penlight,'),(382556,75,0,176834,'<h1 class=\"page-title\"><span>The Engage Hybrid gives you a more precise setup. And a windage unit with micro adjustments that click to dial you in closer than ever before.</span></h1>'),(658219,75,1,176834,'<h1 class=\"page-title\"><span>The Engage Hybrid gives you a more precise setup. And a windage unit with micro adjustments that click to dial you in closer than ever before.</span></h1>'),(382775,85,0,177202,'Coleman Rainwear Danum Jacket Grey/Green Large, rainwear, rain jacket, '),(658220,85,1,177202,'Coleman Rainwear Danum Jacket Grey/Green Large, rainwear, rain jacket, '),(382744,85,0,177596,'Ravin R20 Crossbow Package-Predator Camo, ravin, crossbow, archery, '),(658212,85,1,177596,'Ravin R20 Crossbow Package-Predator Camo, ravin, crossbow, archery, '),(382716,85,0,177597,'Ravin R26 Predator Dusk Grey Crossbow Package, Ravin R26 Predator, Crossbow, Archery, Ravin'),(658213,85,1,177597,'Ravin R26 Predator Dusk Grey Crossbow Package, Ravin R26 Predator, Crossbow, Archery, Ravin'),(648455,75,1,177598,'<p><strong>The Ravin r26 Predator Dusk Crossbow package is an all inclusive crossbow system with advanced designs, performance, and user friendliness.  </strong></p>\r\n<p>Made from a lightweight aluminium frame, the Ravi r26 features balanced cams with adjustable 360-degree rotation ability.</p>\r\n<p>With up to 400 feet per second of shooting speed using a 404-grain arrow, Ravin r26 crossbow has the capability to take down large game animals.</p>\r\n<p>While it packs a big punch, the compact crossbow measures only 26 inches, and is featherlight at only 6.5 pounds.</p>\r\n<p>Knowing this, you can feel comfortable and confident of this shooting system\'s capability.</p>'),(648456,76,1,177598,'<p><strong>Comes fully assembled and tuned so it’s ready to shoot right out of the box  </strong></p>\r\n<p>•6 Ravin .003 arrows with field tips arrowheads included</p>\r\n<p>• High shooting capability projecting arrows up to 400 feet per second</p>\r\n<p>• Extremely lightweight (6.5 lbs) and compact (26 inches) making it a comfortable and capable</p>'),(382561,75,0,177599,'<div class=\"mb3\"><span class=\"b f6 mid-gray lh-copy lh-title overflow-visible db w_AH\"><span class=\"b f6 mid-gray lh-copy lh-title overflow-visible db w_AH\"></span></span>\r\n<div class=\"dangerous-html mb3\">\r\n<p>The Ravin Steel Broadheads, designed exclusively for Ravin Crossbows, are constructed with 416 steel for extreme accuracy, giving hunters the confidence they need in the field. The blades on this mechanical broadhead deploy upon impact with a 2-inch cutting diameter and have been tested and approved for crossbows shooting up to 450 FPS. The Steel Broadheads from Ravin have a single piece of ferrule and internal spring clip, eliminating the need for lock rings and O-rings.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"mb3\"><span class=\"f6 mid-gray lh-title overflow-visible db w_AH\"><span class=\"f6 mid-gray lh-title overflow-visible db w_AH\"></span></span>\r\n<div class=\"dangerous-html mb3\">\r\n<p><span>Ravin 100 Grain Steel Broadhead 3 Pack:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Constructed with 416 Steel</li>\r\n<li>Blades deploy on impact</li>\r\n<li>2 inch cutting diameter</li>\r\n<li>Tested and approved for crossbows up to 450 FPS</li>\r\n<li>Single piece of ferrule and internal spring clip</li>\r\n<li>No need for lock rings and O-rings</li>\r\n<li>100 grain broadhead</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(638740,75,1,177599,'<p>he new Steel Broadheads, designed exclusively for Ravin Crossbows, are constructed with 416 steel for extreme accuracy, giving hunters the confidence they need in the field. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>The blades on this mechanical broadhead deploy upon impact with a 2-inch cutting diameter and have been tested and approved for crossbows shooting up to 450 FPS. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>The Steel Broadheads from Ravin have a single piece of ferrule and internal spring clip, eliminating the need for lock rings and O-rings.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Features:</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>3 Pack</p>\r\n<p>416 Steel</p>\r\n<p>Extreme Accuracy and Penetration</p>\r\n<p>Internal Spring Clip, No Lock Ring or O-ring</p>\r\n<p>450 FPS Approved</p>\r\n<p>Rear-Deploying Blades</p>\r\n<p>Deploys Upon Impact</p>\r\n<p>100 Grain</p>\r\n<p>2” Cut</p>'),(638741,76,1,177599,'<p>The blades on this mechanical broadhead deploy upon impact with a 2-inch cutting diameter and have been tested and approved for crossbows shooting up to 450 FPS. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• 3 Pack</p>\r\n<p>• 416 Steel</p>\r\n<p>• Extreme Accuracy and Penetration</p>'),(382741,85,0,177599,'Ravin 100 Grain Steel Broadhead 3pk, Ravin, Steel Broadhead, 3 pack, crossbow, '),(638742,85,1,177599,'Ravin 100 Grain Steel Broadhead 3pk, Ravin, Steel Broadhead, 3 pack, crossbow, '),(648453,75,1,177600,'<p><strong>The Ravin Crossbow Hard Case is extra insurance that keeps things safe, secure, and ready for the time.  </strong></p>\r\n<p>This molded hard case is constructed of industrial-strength plastic that maintains its form and function even after repeated abuse.</p>\r\n<p>Designed for Ravin Crossbows, this hard case will also fit most modern crossbows within similar size parameters.</p>\r\n<p>Custom made storage system enables crossbow, arrows, and other vital components orgnaized and secure</p>'),(648454,76,1,177600,'<p><strong>Molded plastic hard case specifically designed to fit most modern crossbows  </strong></p>\r\n<p>• Latching system makes opening and closing your crossbow case simple and safe</p>\r\n<p>• Softened interior features keep crossbows performing at the highest level</p>\r\n<p>• Softened interior features keep crossbows performing at the highest level</p>'),(648451,75,1,177601,'<p><strong>The Ravin Crossbow Hard Case is extra insurance that keeps things safe, secure, and ready for the time.  </strong></p>\r\n<p>This molded hard case is constructed of industrial-strength plastic that maintains its form and function even after repeated abuse.</p>\r\n<p>Designed for Ravin Crossbows, this hard case will also fit most modern crossbows within similar size parameters.</p>\r\n<p>Custom made storage system enables crossbow, arrows, and other vital components orgnaized and secure</p>'),(648452,76,1,177601,'<p><strong>Molded plastic hard case specifically designed to fit most modern crossbows  </strong></p>\r\n<p>• Latching system makes opening and closing your crossbow case simple and safe</p>\r\n<p>• Softened interior features keep crossbows performing at the highest level</p>\r\n<p>• Softened interior features keep crossbows performing at the highest level</p>'),(382563,75,0,177778,'<p><span>The Deer Splitter Game Splitter Assistant from Viking Solutions is a new tool that makes splitting the chest cavity and pelvic bone a breeze! This stainless steel device delivers a 19X force that will split these two areas and keep your hands and knives outside the animal. The Deer Splitter provides several advantages over traditional methods: You can keep your knife sharp because you don’t have to dull it cutting the chest open or splitting the pelvic bone; You keep your hands outside the animal and this eliminates puncturing anything inside; And it eliminates the risk of cutting yourself or someone else with a knife while cutting through these difficult areas. The Deer Splitter is small enough to keep in a backpack or fanny-pack but packs the power to tackle these two tough areas on your animal as well as jawbone extraction. The stainless steel construction and quality engineering means you’ll get many years of trouble free service. Simple to clean under running water this is one tool you won’t want to go to the woods without!</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Updated in 2016 for even easier cutting &amp; more leverage</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Splits chest/sternum with ease</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Splits pelvic bone (on deer up to 200 lbs. )</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Keeps knives from dulling</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Keeps hands outside the animal.</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(658214,75,1,177778,'<p><span>The Deer Splitter Game Splitter Assistant from Viking Solutions is a new tool that makes splitting the chest cavity and pelvic bone a breeze! This stainless steel device delivers a 19X force that will split these two areas and keep your hands and knives outside the animal. The Deer Splitter provides several advantages over traditional methods: You can keep your knife sharp because you don’t have to dull it cutting the chest open or splitting the pelvic bone; You keep your hands outside the animal and this eliminates puncturing anything inside; And it eliminates the risk of cutting yourself or someone else with a knife while cutting through these difficult areas. The Deer Splitter is small enough to keep in a backpack or fanny-pack but packs the power to tackle these two tough areas on your animal as well as jawbone extraction. The stainless steel construction and quality engineering means you’ll get many years of trouble free service. Simple to clean under running water this is one tool you won’t want to go to the woods without!</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Updated in 2016 for even easier cutting &amp; more leverage</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Splits chest/sternum with ease</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Splits pelvic bone (on deer up to 200 lbs. )</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Keeps knives from dulling</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Keeps hands outside the animal.</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(672820,75,1,178617,'<p>Sensor 320x240 px/12 ?m 60 Hz<br />Magnification 4-8x<br />Field of view, degrees 6.3x4.7<br />Core ATN Obsidian Core LT<br />Micro display 1280x960 HD Display<br />Eye relief 25 mm<br />IP rating Weather resistant<br />Charging USB, type C<br />Color modes White Hot / Black Hot<br />Battery life (Li-ion) 9+ hrs<br />Operating Temperature -20°F to +120°F / -28°C to 48°C<br />Dimensions 195x75x66 mm<br />Weight 1.2 lb/560 g<br />Human Detection Range 1510<br />Human Recognition Range 680<br />Human Identification Range 340<br />Warranty 3 years</p>'),(672821,76,1,178617,'<p>Sensor 320x240 px/12 ?m 60 Hz<br />Magnification 4-8x<br />Field of view, degrees 6.3x4.7<br />Core ATN Obsidian Core LT<br />Micro display 1280x960 HD Display</p>'),(641856,75,1,178805,'<p><strong><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-8a52d8cd-7fff-203b-cedd-f3fad561698f\">The Juliet 3-Micro Magnifier Push Button Mount is a professional-grade optic mount with a 3x22mm magnification.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-cd5016ee-7fff-86c7-48e0-7d9661a6aa01\"><span>This dynamic sight system allows for precise mid-range shooting with optics that enable quick, accurate, and confident shooting.</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-d167f48b-7fff-9dc5-8622-379d631bb48b\"><span>The easy-to-mount Micro Magnifier will upgrade your shooting experience, taking your abilities to the next level, all while coming in at an affordable and competitive price point.</span></span></p>'),(641857,76,1,178805,'<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The Juliet 3-Micro Magnifier Push-Button Mount With Spacers.</span></p>\r\n<p>• <span id=\"docs-internal-guid-c60ea923-7fff-7030-6cf1-43daf0217b4c\"><span>Push-Button mount allows for easy assembly and rigging</span></span></p>\r\n<p>• <span id=\"docs-internal-guid-adf1b022-7fff-926a-fb1a-9319ac940282\"><span>A 3x magnification strength is ideal for mid-range shooting applications</span></span></p>\r\n<p>• Quick adjustment technology that allows for agile shooting and easy target recognition </p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<div><span><br /></span></div>'),(642588,75,1,178865,'<p><strong>The CenterPoint Wrath 430X Crossbow is a compact but deadly crossbow combination package, including everything needed to enter the sport. </strong></p>\r\n<p>With the ability to shoot up to 430 feet per second, this crossbow is ready to unleash its Wrath on downfield targets or big game quarry.</p>\r\n<p>While it packs a big punch, with over 160 pounds of kinetic energy, the bow measures only 9 inches from axle-to-axle when fully cocked and ready to shoot. In addition, shooters will notice the ultra-comfortable tactical handle, which fits like a glove while providing added stability.</p>'),(642589,76,1,178865,'<p><strong>Advanced engineering allows for a compact crossbow to shoot up to 430 feet per second . </strong></p>\r\n<p>• Compact and comfortable, measuring just 29\" inches with a balanced fit and design</p>\r\n<p>• Maintain a sleek profile with a bow that measures only 9 inches from side to side when fully cocked</p>\r\n<p>• Package includes crossbow, scope, and arrows</p>'),(638743,75,1,178879,'<p>The Rage Crossbow X 2-Blade Broadhead features Ferrule Alignment Technology. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>This 3-pack set also includes a FREE practice. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Features:</p>\r\n<p>2 Blade Broadhead</p>\r\n<p>125 Grain</p>\r\n<p>Cut-on-contact Tip</p>\r\n<p>Aluminum Construction F.A.T. (Ferrule Alignment Technology)</p>\r\n<p>Tough Razor-Sharp .035\" Stainless Steel Blades</p>\r\n<p>2\"+ Cutting Diameter (Increased cut for 2013)</p>\r\n<p>SHOCK Collar for proper blade retention</p>\r\n<p>3 per pack</p>\r\n<p>Includes free practice head</p>'),(638744,76,1,178879,'<p>The Rage Crossbow X 2-Blade Broadhead features Ferrule Alignment Technology. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• Aluminum Construction F.A.T. (Ferrule Alignment Technology)</p>\r\n<p>• Tough Razor-Sharp .035\" Stainless Steel Blades</p>\r\n<p>• Includes free practice head</p>'),(642516,75,1,178939,'<p><strong>The Titanium X broadheads are field-proven and lab-tested to ensure the ultimate hunting performance. </strong></p>\r\n<p>The titanium ferrule is virtually bulletproof and constructed from an advanced CNC machining process with precise quality control.</p>\r\n<p>On the business end, the Tru-Cut titanium tip finish is capable of taking down the big game as its penetrating design, and razor-sharp finish are capable of cutting through flesh like a hot knife to butter.</p>'),(642517,76,1,178939,'<p><strong>3 Razor Sharp CNC machined broadheads are included in every package. </strong></p>\r\n<p>• 100-grain weight for optimal flight trajectory and devastating impact</p>\r\n<p>• Quality guaranteed - Each broadhead is spin tested and examined</p>\r\n<p>• Includes installation tools, including a specialized wrench and replacement blade</p>'),(641869,75,0,178958,'<p>Designed to protect any Ravin Bullpup crossbow, the Ravin Soft Cast features a polished look and sleek profile , in addition, the interior bag padding will help secure your crossbow during transport or while in storage. </p>\r\n<p>Built to fit a fully assembled crossbow, there is no need to worry about your mounter scope, quiver, or arrows fitting in this bag, with the Ravin Bullpup Case there’s room for the whole team.</p>'),(641871,75,1,178958,'<p>Designed to protect any Ravin Bullpup crossbow, the Ravin Soft Cast features a polished look and sleek profile , in addition, the interior bag padding will help secure your crossbow during transport or while in storage. </p>\r\n<p>Built to fit a fully assembled crossbow, there is no need to worry about your mounter scope, quiver, or arrows fitting in this bag, with the Ravin Bullpup Case there’s room for the whole team.</p>'),(641870,76,0,178958,'<p><strong>Easily protect and organzie your Ravin Bullpup case with this sleek soft case . </strong></p>\r\n<p>• Fits all equipment comfortably and supports your bow with interior padding</p>\r\n<p>• Makes transport, storage, and overall up keep much more manageable</p>\r\n<p>• Industrial strength zippering system built to last for years to come</p>'),(641872,76,1,178958,'<p><strong>Easily protect and organzie your Ravin Bullpup case with this sleek soft case . </strong></p>\r\n<p>• Fits all equipment comfortably and supports your bow with interior padding</p>\r\n<p>• Makes transport, storage, and overall up keep much more manageable</p>\r\n<p>• Industrial strength zippering system built to last for years to come</p>'),(641867,75,1,179003,'<p><strong>The Ravin Crossbow Arrows will keep hunters confident and in line throughout the hunt knowing they’re shooting with the absolute best. </strong></p>\r\n<p>Combined with illuminated nocks that securely lock into your bowstring providing increased accuracy.</p>\r\n<p>The Ravin Crossbow Arrows .0003 premium six pack of arrows works with all Ravin Crossbows aside from the R500 crossbow.</p>'),(641868,76,1,179003,'<p><strong>Illuminating arrows that allow shooters to trace their shot. </strong></p>\r\n<p>• Designed to fit all Ravin Crossbows aside from the R500</p>\r\n<p>• Six crossbow arrows included in every order</p>'),(672847,75,0,179089,'<p>Ideal for tactical training, competition shooting and hunting, this reliable device is the perfect accessory for any shooter.</p>\r\n<p>The Firefield Bipod features a padded stock mount and adjustable legs that extend to multiple lengths ranging from 9 to 14 inches in length, ensuring a customized experience.</p>\r\n<p>Its compatible body style fits all rifle and shotgun barrels. The unit\'s rubber feet create maximum stability and its lightweight body is perfect for storage and carry.</p>\r\n<p>Featuring a durable aluminum construction, the bipod is easy to install, attaching to the firearm\'s swivel stud.</p>\r\n<p>The device is equipped with a pivot mount with tension adjustment and requires no firearm modification for use. Included is a picatinny mount adapter.</p>\r\n<p>Durable<br />Lightweight<br />Attaches to firearm\'s swivel stud<br />Rubber feet for maximum stability<br />Padded stock mount<br />Extends to multiple lengths<br />Pivot mount with tension adjustment<br />Sling attachment<br />Picatinny Mount Adapter Included</p>'),(676002,75,1,179089,'<p>Ideal for tactical training, competition shooting and hunting, this reliable device is the perfect accessory for any shooter.</p>\r\n<p>The Firefield Bipod features a padded stock mount and adjustable legs that extend to multiple lengths ranging from 9 to 14 inches in length, ensuring a customized experience.</p>\r\n<p>Its compatible body style fits all rifle and shotgun barrels. The unit\'s rubber feet create maximum stability and its lightweight body is perfect for storage and carry.</p>\r\n<p>Featuring a durable aluminum construction, the bipod is easy to install, attaching to the firearm\'s swivel stud.</p>\r\n<p>The device is equipped with a pivot mount with tension adjustment and requires no firearm modification for use. Included is a picatinny mount adapter.</p>\r\n<p>Durable<br />Lightweight<br />Attaches to firearm\'s swivel stud<br />Rubber feet for maximum stability<br />Padded stock mount<br />Extends to multiple lengths<br />Pivot mount with tension adjustment<br />Sling attachment<br />Picatinny Mount Adapter Included</p>'),(672848,76,0,179089,'<p>Extends to multiple lengths<br />Pivot mount with tension adjustment<br />Sling attachment<br />Picatinny Mount Adapter Included</p>'),(676003,76,1,179089,'<p>Extends to multiple lengths<br />Pivot mount with tension adjustment<br />Sling attachment<br />Picatinny Mount Adapter Included</p>'),(648449,75,1,179139,'<p><strong>The Tenpoint Alpha Nocks display the extra features and functions that an archer looks for in their accessory equipment. </strong>Built with extra long ears, that ensure the string stays snug, on top of that the deep bowstring grooves allow your string and nock to feel connected. Available in a six pack, the Tenpoint Alpha Nock system comes with enough nocks to fill your quiver. Designed to work with Alpha-Nock receivers, the Tenpoint Alpha Nocks are ready to take your shooting game to the next level.</p>'),(648450,76,1,179139,'<p><strong>Pairs perfectly with the Alpha-Nock Receiver  </strong></p>\r\n<p>• Elongated nocking ears maintain a secure and balanced fit with arrow string</p>\r\n<p>• Required for the most recent TenPoint and Wicked Range Crossbows</p>'),(678549,75,0,179181,'<p>2.5mm dia (3/32\" OD) x 32mm long (1.25\") hardened steel pin. CNC machined aluminum body/handle</p>\r\n<p>Compatible with all Glock® models, and many other firearms</p>\r\n<p>Useful for the removal of action/trigger pins during disassembly</p>'),(678550,76,0,179181,'<p>Compatible with all Glock® models, and many other firearms</p>'),(675659,75,0,179723,'<p>Bushnell AR Optics are built to deliver maximum accuracy and reliability in every tactical shooting scenario.</p>\r\n<p>Fully Multi Coated</p>\r\n<p>Multiple layers of anti-reflective coating on all air-to-glass surfaces deliver bright, high-contrast images.</p>\r\n<p>Color: Black<br />Configuration: 1-4x24mm<br />Tube Diameter: 30mm<br />Reticle: BTR-2<br />Reticle Type: MIL<br />Focal Plane: First<br />Parallax Adjustment: Fixed<br />Parallax Adjustment Range: 0<br />Eye Relief: 4mm / 0.2in<br />Length: 236mm / 9.3in<br />Weight: 516g / 18.2oz<br />Field of View (ft @100y): 112f @min, 26f @max<br />Elevation Adjustment: 110 MOA<br />Windage Adjustment: 110 MOA<br />Travel per Rotation: 6 MIL<br />Elevation Turret: Exposed<br />Windage Turret: Exposed<br />Elevation Locking: No<br />Wind Locking: No<br />Zero Stop: No<br />Coatings: Fully Multi-coated<br />Illuminated: Yes<br />Rainguard: Yes<br />EXOBarrier: No<br />Waterproof: Yes<br />Waterproof IPX7: No<br />Ultrawide Band Coatings: No<br />ED Prime Glass: No</p>'),(675708,75,1,179723,'<p>Bushnell AR Optics are built to deliver maximum accuracy and reliability in every tactical shooting scenario.</p>\r\n<p>Fully Multi Coated</p>\r\n<p>Multiple layers of anti-reflective coating on all air-to-glass surfaces deliver bright, high-contrast images.</p>\r\n<p>Color: Black<br />Configuration: 1-4x24mm<br />Tube Diameter: 30mm<br />Reticle: BTR-2<br />Reticle Type: MIL<br />Focal Plane: First<br />Parallax Adjustment: Fixed<br />Parallax Adjustment Range: 0<br />Eye Relief: 4mm / 0.2in<br />Length: 236mm / 9.3in<br />Weight: 516g / 18.2oz<br />Field of View (ft @100y): 112f @min, 26f @max<br />Elevation Adjustment: 110 MOA<br />Windage Adjustment: 110 MOA<br />Travel per Rotation: 6 MIL<br />Elevation Turret: Exposed<br />Windage Turret: Exposed<br />Elevation Locking: No<br />Wind Locking: No<br />Zero Stop: No<br />Coatings: Fully Multi-coated<br />Illuminated: Yes<br />Rainguard: Yes<br />EXOBarrier: No<br />Waterproof: Yes<br />Waterproof IPX7: No<br />Ultrawide Band Coatings: No<br />ED Prime Glass: No</p>'),(675660,76,0,179723,'<p>Field of View (ft @100y): 112f @min, 26f @max<br />Elevation Adjustment: 110 MOA<br />Windage Adjustment: 110 MOA<br />Travel per Rotation: 6 MIL<br />Elevation Turret: Exposed</p>'),(675709,76,1,179723,'<p>Field of View (ft @100y): 112f @min, 26f @max<br />Elevation Adjustment: 110 MOA<br />Windage Adjustment: 110 MOA<br />Travel per Rotation: 6 MIL<br />Elevation Turret: Exposed</p>'),(648424,75,1,179732,'<p><strong>The small 8.25\" inch shooting scope from TenPoint technologies enables crossbow shooters to dial in their archery experience with an illuminating and highly functional crossbow shooting scope. </strong></p>\r\n<p>Built with fully coated lenses that reduce the amount of light loss.</p>\r\n<p>Each scope has crosshairs set at 20, 30, and 40 yards straight out of the box, allowing you to take down targets or big games more effectively.</p>'),(648425,76,1,179732,'<p><strong>8.25\" - compact aluminum framed shooting scope explicitly designed for crossbow archery shooters  </strong></p>\r\n<p>• A 7/8 scope mounting ring kit is included in every order</p>\r\n<p>• Illuminating optics with 5 different light levels in both green and red options</p>\r\n<p>• Crosshairs are dialed in at 20, 30, and 40 yards, a standard shooting distance for archery hunters</p>\r\n<p>• Fully coated lenses reduce light loss and increase shooting accuracy</p>'),(638738,75,1,179787,'<p>The revolutionary Hypodermic NC utilizes cutting-edge finger-like tabs on the blades’ Slip Cam™ pivot point to “anchor” them in place while in the closed position, completely eliminating the need for a Shock Collar, dental band or O-ring, while still providing reliable blade retention. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Upon impact, the blades instantly deploy to a 2-inch cutting diameter, administering the gaping wounds that bowhunters have come to expect from the field-proven Rage Hypodermic series. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>The new 100-grain Hypodermic NC features the lethal Hypodermic hybrid tip with an even narrower profile and needle-like ferrule.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>In flight, that streamlined design makes for superior field-tip accuracy. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>The two .035” thick blades deploy on impact, sliding into a swept-back blade angle while the monstrous 2” cutting diameter delivers a wide entry hole for gruesome blood trails and brief tracking jobs.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Features:</p>\r\n<p>2-Blade Broadhead</p>\r\n<p>100 Grain</p>\r\n<p>Hybrid Hypodermic Tip</p>\r\n<p>Machined Stainless Steel Ferrule</p>\r\n<p>.035\" Blades</p>\r\n<p>2\" Cutting Diameter</p>\r\n<p>No Collar Blade Lock</p>\r\n<p>3 per Package</p>'),(638739,76,1,179787,'<p>Upon impact, the blades instantly deploy to a 2-inch cutting diameter, administering the gaping wounds that bowhunters have come to expect from the field-proven Rage Hypodermic series. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• 2-Blade Broadhead</p>\r\n<p>• 100 Grain</p>\r\n<p>• Hybrid Hypodermic Tip</p>'),(641850,75,1,179848,'<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>&lt;p&gt;Handmade leather and synthetic holsters made for shooters.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>&lt;p&gt;&amp;#8226; Easy-to-access holsters that allow quick and fluid exit and entry of the weapon &lt;/p&gt;</span></p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>&lt;p&gt;&amp;#8226; Compact and comfortable, providing all day comfort and safety &lt;/p&gt;</span></p>\r\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7ff6e526-7fff-c7c2-3fdd-d5f1db7264ad\"><span>&lt;p&gt;&amp;#8226; Sleek design style help conceal your carry and keep things undercover &lt;/p&gt;</span><span><br /></span><span>&lt;p&gt;&amp;#8226; Long-lasting design will keep this holster by your side for years to come &lt;/p&gt;</span></span></p>'),(641851,76,1,179848,'<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Galco Holsters are handmade leather gun holsters that are sleek, discrete, and, most importantly, functional and easy to access. Compact but comfortable gun holsters provide an uncovered look and quick access when needed. Stay safe, stealth, and secure with the Galco Stinger Belt.</span></p>'),(641839,75,0,179877,'<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The Trijicon RMR Type 2 is an advanced shooting sight designed with a patent pending housing that prevents damage common in rugged field activities. Day or night, this night vision-equipped shooting sight will be a reliable companion whether practicing tactical drills at the range or when you need it to protect the home. </span>The RMR Type 2 will last up to 16.5 hours in manual mode, providing long-lasting performance with every charge.</p>'),(658222,75,1,179877,'<p>Developed to improve precision and accuracy with any style or caliber of weapon, the Trijicon RMR (Ruggedized Miniature Reflex) Type 2 is designed to be as durable as the legendary ACOG.</p>\r\n<p>The RM06 is an LED sight powered by a standard CR2032 battery. Housed in rugged forged aluminum, the RMR is extremely tough yet lightweight. New easy-to-use adjusters with audible clicks allow for quick windage and elevation adjustments.</p>\r\n<p>With eight available brightness settings, the reticle can be manually adjusted by pressing the plus or minus buttons on either side of the unit. To switch to auto adjust mode simply press both buttons simultaneously and release. To save battery life turn the optic off by pressing both buttons simultaneously and holding for 3 seconds.</p>\r\n<p>The Trijicon RMR Type 2 is tougher than any alternative and suitable for military, law enforcement and hunting applications.</p>\r\n<p>Magnification: 1x<br />Bullet Drop Compensator: No<br />Length (in): 45mm<br />Weight (oz): 1.2 oz w/Battery<br />Illumination Source: LED<br />Reticle Pattern: 3.25 MOA Dot<br />Day Reticle Color: Red<br />Night Reticle Color: Red<br />Bindon Aiming Concept: No<br />Adjustment @ 100 yards (clicks/in): 1<br />Housing Material: Forged Aluminum<br />Batteries: 1 CR2032 Lithium Battery<br />Battery Life: Over 4 years of continuous use (when used at 70ºF (21ºC)) at setting 4 of 8. Extreme temperatures (high or low) will affect lithium battery performance.</p>'),(641840,76,0,179877,'<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Eight different LED brightness levels for maximum visibility </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Night vision compatible capable of nocturnal hunting expeditions</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>User-friendly controls for simple on-the-fly adjustments</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Automatic and manual functions are available, giving shooters the best of both worlds</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(658223,76,1,179877,'<p>Illumination Source: LED<br />Reticle Pattern: 3.25 MOA Dot<br />Day Reticle Color: Red<br />Night Reticle Color: Red<br />Bindon Aiming Concept: No</p>'),(657607,75,1,179917,'<p>The Tall Timber Gabriel is our Premium Box Call which features double thumbholes on the box to allow easy and perfect clucks and cuts. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>The name is derived from a book written by Will’s good friend Charles Whittington. Mr. Whittington wrote about his Turkey Hunting exploits in 1971 in a book entitled, Tall Timber Gabriels. He affectionately called a gobbler “Old Gabriel” after an angel. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Hence Tall Timber Gabriels because gobblers sing each spring from their tall timber perch sending out their love song for all to hear.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>We have put all that we know and cherish about the box call as an instrument into this call: the choice of woods, the curves of the striking surfaces, the shape and cutouts of the sideboards as well as the finish to give you the finest instrument in reproducing the sounds that “Old Gabriel” so badly wants to hear.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• Dual thumbhole positions for clucks &amp; cuts</p>\r\n<p>• Premium Sapele &amp; Purple Heart wood</p>\r\n<p>• Laser Engraved</p>\r\n<p>• Hand Tuned</p>'),(657608,76,1,179917,'<p>The Tall Timber Gabriel is our Premium Box Call which features double thumbholes on the box to allow easy and perfect clucks and cuts. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• Dual thumbhole positions for clucks &amp; cuts</p>\r\n<p>• Premium Sapele &amp; Purple Heart wood</p>\r\n<p>• Hand Tuned</p>'),(382771,85,0,180035,'TruGlo Brite-Site Tritium Handgun Sight - Glock Low Set - TG231G1'),(658224,85,1,180035,'TruGlo Brite-Site Tritium Handgun Sight - Glock Low Set - TG231G1'),(382559,75,0,180104,'<p><span>CenterPoint Archery has raised the bar in design and performance with the introduction of the innovative CP400 Crossbow. Utilizing licensed HeliCoil technology together with a custom-designed riser, CNC-machined cam system and adjustable stock, CenterPoint Archery combines cutting-edge technology together with affordability in one package. The CP400\'s extremely narrow axle-to-axle width is an incredible 6-inches when fully-drawn, produces speeds of up to 400 fps and generates a knock-out punch of up to 142 fpe. This evolutionary design delivers amazing power and downrange accuracy and is lightweight and compact enough to handle with ease or carry into your favorite hunting  spot. Featuring anti-dry fire and auto safety, a unique dual purpose folding stirrup/bipod, a 3x32mm illuminated scope and CenterPoint Archery\'s 5-year limited warranty. This hybrid crossbow will surpass your expectations on the 3D range and in the field.</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">CNC-MACHINED CAM SYSTEM - With licensed HeliCoil  technology for perfectly balanced cams</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">CUSTOM DESIGNED RISER - With aluminum rail, innovative folding stirrup and adjustable stock</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">COMPACT - Incredible 6-inch axle-to-axle width when fully-drawn</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">FAST - Delivers speeds up to 400 fps with 142 fpe for downrange accuracy</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">SAFE - Anti-dry fire and auto safety</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">FEATURES INCLUDE - A 5-year limited warranty, three 20-inch carbon arrows, quick-detach quiver, 3x32 mm illuminated scope and rope cocker</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(658225,75,1,180104,'<p><span>CenterPoint Archery has raised the bar in design and performance with the introduction of the innovative CP400 Crossbow. Utilizing licensed HeliCoil technology together with a custom-designed riser, CNC-machined cam system and adjustable stock, CenterPoint Archery combines cutting-edge technology together with affordability in one package. The CP400\'s extremely narrow axle-to-axle width is an incredible 6-inches when fully-drawn, produces speeds of up to 400 fps and generates a knock-out punch of up to 142 fpe. This evolutionary design delivers amazing power and downrange accuracy and is lightweight and compact enough to handle with ease or carry into your favorite hunting  spot. Featuring anti-dry fire and auto safety, a unique dual purpose folding stirrup/bipod, a 3x32mm illuminated scope and CenterPoint Archery\'s 5-year limited warranty. This hybrid crossbow will surpass your expectations on the 3D range and in the field.</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">CNC-MACHINED CAM SYSTEM - With licensed HeliCoil  technology for perfectly balanced cams</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">CUSTOM DESIGNED RISER - With aluminum rail, innovative folding stirrup and adjustable stock</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">COMPACT - Incredible 6-inch axle-to-axle width when fully-drawn</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">FAST - Delivers speeds up to 400 fps with 142 fpe for downrange accuracy</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">SAFE - Anti-dry fire and auto safety</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">FEATURES INCLUDE - A 5-year limited warranty, three 20-inch carbon arrows, quick-detach quiver, 3x32 mm illuminated scope and rope cocker</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(382723,85,0,180104,'Centerpoint Crossbow Cp400, centerpoint, crossbow, archery, '),(658226,85,1,180104,'Centerpoint Crossbow Cp400, centerpoint, crossbow, archery, '),(648446,75,1,180111,'<p><strong>The Barnett HyperTac Pro 430 is a complete crossbow package with superb shooting and the capability of taking down big game. </strong></p>\r\n<p>Loaded with features that include a freshly patented string hook system to maximise shooters comfort and effectiveness.</p>\r\n<p>With an easy draw back, shooters won’t need to worry about straining themselves as they cock back for a shot. And once in the shooting position, feel comforted by the tactical grip form that will fits most hands like a glove.</p>\r\n<p>With a high powered shooting capacity, the HyperTac Pro 430 will shoot arrows up to 430 feet per second providing a higher mortality rate compared to similar products on the market.</p>'),(648447,76,1,180111,'<p><strong>The Barnett HyperTac Pro 430 is a complete crossbow package with superb shooting and the capability of taking down big game. </strong></p>\r\n<p>Loaded with features that include a freshly patented string hook system to maximise shooters comfort and effectiveness.</p>\r\n<p>With an easy draw back, shooters won’t need to worry about straining themselves as they cock back for a shot. And once in the shooting position, feel comforted by the tactical grip form that will fits most hands like a glove.</p>\r\n<p>With a high powered shooting capacity, the HyperTac Pro 430 will shoot arrows up to 430 feet per second providing a higher mortality rate compared to similar products on the market.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Patented string hook system makes for a practical and easy to use weapon  </strong></p>\r\n<p>•Verti-Grip handle enables shooters to feel more secure and comfortable with each shot</p>\r\n<p>• Adjustable butt stock and cheek piece to customize to the shooters needs</p>\r\n<p>• Shoots up to 430 feet per second and is capable of taking down big game</p>'),(382732,85,0,180111,'Barnett Hypertac Pro 430, '),(648448,85,1,180111,'Barnett Hypertac Pro 430, '),(638735,75,1,180198,'<p>The new Aluminum Broadhead, designed exclusively for Ravin Crossbows, gives hunters surgical precision with its rear-deploying blades, which open on impact and have been tested and approved for crossbows shooting up to 450 FPS. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>This mechanical broadhead has a massive 2-inch cut and internal spring clip, eliminating the need for lock rings and O-rings.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Features:</p>\r\n<p>3 Pack</p>\r\n<p>Aluminum 7075-T6/Steel 12L 14 Tip</p>\r\n<p>Extreme Accuracy and Penetration</p>\r\n<p>Internal Spring Clip, No Lock Ring or O-ring</p>\r\n<p>450 FPS Approved</p>\r\n<p>Rear-Deploying Blades</p>\r\n<p>Deploys Upon Impact</p>\r\n<p>100 Grain</p>\r\n<p>2” Cut</p>'),(638736,76,1,180198,'<p>This mechanical broadhead has a massive 2-inch cut and internal spring clip, eliminating the need for lock rings and O-rings.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• 450 FPS Approved</p>\r\n<p>• Rear-Deploying Blades</p>\r\n<p>• Deploys Upon Impact</p>'),(638737,85,1,180198,'Ravin 100 Grain Aluminum Broadhead 3pk'),(674818,75,0,180208,'<p>Developed to improve precision and accuracy with any style or caliber of weapon, the Trijicon RMR (Ruggedized Miniature Reflex) Type 2 is designed to be as durable as the legendary ACOG.</p>\r\n<p>The RM06 is an LED sight powered by a standard CR2032 battery. Housed in rugged forged aluminum, the RMR Type 2 is extremely tough yet lightweight. New easy-to-use adjusters with audible clicks allow for quick windage and elevation adjustments.</p>\r\n<p>With eight available brightness settings, the reticle can be manually adjusted by pressing the plus or minus buttons on either side of the unit. To switch to auto adjust mode simply press both buttons simultaneously and release. To save battery life turn the optic off by pressing both buttons simultaneously and holding for 3 seconds.</p>\r\n<p>The Trijicon RMR Type 2 is tougher than any alternative and suitable for military, law enforcement and hunting applications.</p>\r\n<p>Magnification: 1x<br />Bullet Drop Compensator: No<br />Length (in): 45mm<br />Weight (oz): 1.2 oz w/Battery<br />Illumination Source: LED<br />Reticle Pattern: 6.5 MOA Dot<br />Day Reticle Color: Red<br />Night Reticle Color: Red<br />Bindon Aiming Concept: No<br />Adjustment @ 100 yards (clicks/in): 1.0<br />Mount: RM33 Picatinny Rail<br />Housing Material: Forged Aluminum<br />Batteries: 3V Lithium Battery<br />Battery Life: Over 4 years of continuous use (when used at 70ºF (21ºC)) at setting 4 of 8. Extreme temperatures (high or low) will affect lithium battery performance.</p>'),(675710,75,1,180208,'<p>Developed to improve precision and accuracy with any style or caliber of weapon, the Trijicon RMR (Ruggedized Miniature Reflex) Type 2 is designed to be as durable as the legendary ACOG.</p>\r\n<p>The RM06 is an LED sight powered by a standard CR2032 battery. Housed in rugged forged aluminum, the RMR Type 2 is extremely tough yet lightweight. New easy-to-use adjusters with audible clicks allow for quick windage and elevation adjustments.</p>\r\n<p>With eight available brightness settings, the reticle can be manually adjusted by pressing the plus or minus buttons on either side of the unit. To switch to auto adjust mode simply press both buttons simultaneously and release. To save battery life turn the optic off by pressing both buttons simultaneously and holding for 3 seconds.</p>\r\n<p>The Trijicon RMR Type 2 is tougher than any alternative and suitable for military, law enforcement and hunting applications.</p>\r\n<p>Magnification: 1x<br />Bullet Drop Compensator: No<br />Length (in): 45mm<br />Weight (oz): 1.2 oz w/Battery<br />Illumination Source: LED<br />Reticle Pattern: 6.5 MOA Dot<br />Day Reticle Color: Red<br />Night Reticle Color: Red<br />Bindon Aiming Concept: No<br />Adjustment @ 100 yards (clicks/in): 1.0<br />Mount: RM33 Picatinny Rail<br />Housing Material: Forged Aluminum<br />Batteries: 3V Lithium Battery<br />Battery Life: Over 4 years of continuous use (when used at 70ºF (21ºC)) at setting 4 of 8. Extreme temperatures (high or low) will affect lithium battery performance.</p>'),(674819,76,0,180208,'<p>Magnification: 1x<br />Bullet Drop Compensator: No<br />Length (in): 45mm<br />Weight (oz): 1.2 oz w/Battery<br />Illumination Source: LED<br />Reticle Pattern: 6.5 MOA Dot</p>'),(675711,76,1,180208,'<p>Magnification: 1x<br />Bullet Drop Compensator: No<br />Length (in): 45mm<br />Weight (oz): 1.2 oz w/Battery<br />Illumination Source: LED<br />Reticle Pattern: 6.5 MOA Dot</p>'),(382565,75,0,180343,'<div id=\"featurebullets_feature_div\" class=\"celwidget\" data-feature-name=\"featurebullets\" data-csa-c-id=\"cmlogp-zi70wq-dmfbns-aiz9w6\" data-cel-widget=\"featurebullets_feature_div\">\r\n<div id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-medium a-spacing-top-small\">\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">This compact, battery operated trickle-compatible scale offers a maximum reference measurement of 1500 grains</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Precision load cell with 1/10th grain accuracy</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Constant readout up to 500 grains</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Flexibility to trickle powder into the pan or weigh charges, bullets or cases directly</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Trust this scale to make quick work of your most precise handloading tasks</span></li>\r\n<li></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(658227,75,1,180343,'<div id=\"featurebullets_feature_div\" class=\"celwidget\" data-feature-name=\"featurebullets\" data-csa-c-id=\"cmlogp-zi70wq-dmfbns-aiz9w6\" data-cel-widget=\"featurebullets_feature_div\">\r\n<div id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-medium a-spacing-top-small\">\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">This compact, battery operated trickle-compatible scale offers a maximum reference measurement of 1500 grains</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Precision load cell with 1/10th grain accuracy</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Constant readout up to 500 grains</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Flexibility to trickle powder into the pan or weigh charges, bullets or cases directly</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Trust this scale to make quick work of your most precise handloading tasks</span></li>\r\n<li></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(634094,75,1,180399,'<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.999999999999998pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #0f1111; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Xpedition Crossbow Viking X380 Blk</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"> </p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #0f1111; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The Viking Series crossbows provide you with an advanced and well equipped shooting platform available at a workingman\'s price. </span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"> </p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #0f1111; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The all black 380 package has an advanced illuminated 4 x 32 shooting scope, a built in three arrow quiver, and all of the other features needed to shoot right out of the box. </span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"> </p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #0f1111; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Three 20” carbon bolts for a durable and feather weight fee.l</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #0f1111; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Detachable sling that allows for maneuverability and comfort in the field.</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #0f1111; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Weighing only  6.7 lbs it provides an easy to hold, aim, and handle package.</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #0f1111; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Shoots speeds up to 380 fps with a 380gr bolt capable of taking down large game.</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #0f1111; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Anti-dry fire trigger increases the safe shooting experience.</span></p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(634095,76,1,180399,'<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The all black 380 package has an advanced illuminated 4 x 32 shooting scope, a built in three arrow quiver, and all of the other features needed to shoot right out of the box. </span></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• Weighing only  6.7 lbs it provides an easy to hold, aim, and handle package.</p>\r\n<p>• Shoots speeds up to 380 fps with a 380gr bolt capable of taking down large game.</p>\r\n<p>• Anti-dry fire trigger increases the safe shooting experience.</p>'),(684311,75,1,180443,'<p>The Smith &amp; Wesson Ultimate Survival provides a versatile and durable fixed knife. It features a black plain 5 inch blade and a rubberized handle.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Blade Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 9.84\"</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 0.54lb</li>\r\n<li>Blade Material: 8Cr13MoV Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Handle Material: Rubberized polymer</li>\r\n<li>Full tang</li>\r\n<li>Rigid synthetic tactical sheath</li>\r\n<li>Sawback edge</li>\r\n</ul>'),(684312,76,1,180443,'<ul>\r\n<li>Blade Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 9.84\"</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 0.54lb</li>\r\n<li>Blade Material: 8Cr13MoV Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Handle Material: Rubberized polymer</li>\r\n</ul>'),(672829,75,0,180585,'<p>Developed to improve precision and accuracy with any style or caliber of weapon, the Trijicon RMR (Ruggedized Miniature Reflex) Type 2 is designed to be as durable as the legendary ACOG.</p>\r\n<p>The RM06 is an LED sight powered by a standard CR2032 battery. Housed in rugged forged aluminum, the RMR Type 2 is extremely tough yet lightweight. New easy-to-use adjusters with audible clicks allow for quick windage and elevation adjustments.</p>\r\n<p>With eight available brightness settings, the reticle can be manually adjusted by pressing the plus or minus buttons on either side of the unit. To switch to auto adjust mode simply press both buttons simultaneously and release. To save battery life turn the optic off by pressing both buttons simultaneously and holding for 3 seconds.</p>\r\n<p>The Trijicon RMR Type 2 is tougher than any alternative and suitable for military, law enforcement and hunting applications.</p>\r\n<p>Magnification: 1x<br />Bullet Drop Compensator: No<br />Length (in): 45mm<br />Weight (oz): 1.2 oz w/Battery<br />Illumination Source: LED<br />Reticle Pattern: 6.5 MOA Dot<br />Day Reticle Color: Red<br />Night Reticle Color: Red<br />Bindon Aiming Concept: No<br />Adjustment @ 100 yards (clicks/in): 1.0<br />Mount: RM34 Picatinny Rail<br />Housing Material: Forged Aluminum<br />Batteries: 3V Lithium Battery<br />Battery Life: Over 4 years of continuous use (when used at 70ºF (21ºC)) at setting 4 of 8. Extreme temperatures (high or low) will affect lithium battery performance.</p>'),(675712,75,1,180585,'<p>Developed to improve precision and accuracy with any style or caliber of weapon, the Trijicon RMR (Ruggedized Miniature Reflex) Type 2 is designed to be as durable as the legendary ACOG.</p>\r\n<p>The RM06 is an LED sight powered by a standard CR2032 battery. Housed in rugged forged aluminum, the RMR Type 2 is extremely tough yet lightweight. New easy-to-use adjusters with audible clicks allow for quick windage and elevation adjustments.</p>\r\n<p>With eight available brightness settings, the reticle can be manually adjusted by pressing the plus or minus buttons on either side of the unit. To switch to auto adjust mode simply press both buttons simultaneously and release. To save battery life turn the optic off by pressing both buttons simultaneously and holding for 3 seconds.</p>\r\n<p>The Trijicon RMR Type 2 is tougher than any alternative and suitable for military, law enforcement and hunting applications.</p>\r\n<p>Magnification: 1x<br />Bullet Drop Compensator: No<br />Length (in): 45mm<br />Weight (oz): 1.2 oz w/Battery<br />Illumination Source: LED<br />Reticle Pattern: 6.5 MOA Dot<br />Day Reticle Color: Red<br />Night Reticle Color: Red<br />Bindon Aiming Concept: No<br />Adjustment @ 100 yards (clicks/in): 1.0<br />Mount: RM34 Picatinny Rail<br />Housing Material: Forged Aluminum<br />Batteries: 3V Lithium Battery<br />Battery Life: Over 4 years of continuous use (when used at 70ºF (21ºC)) at setting 4 of 8. Extreme temperatures (high or low) will affect lithium battery performance.</p>'),(672830,76,0,180585,'<p>Reticle Pattern: 6.5 MOA Dot<br />Day Reticle Color: Red<br />Night Reticle Color: Red<br />Bindon Aiming Concept: No<br />Adjustment @ 100 yards (clicks/in): 1.0</p>'),(675713,76,1,180585,'<p>Reticle Pattern: 6.5 MOA Dot<br />Day Reticle Color: Red<br />Night Reticle Color: Red<br />Bindon Aiming Concept: No<br />Adjustment @ 100 yards (clicks/in): 1.0</p>'),(648442,75,1,180657,'<p><strong>The CenterPoint Deadpoint Broadheads are a hunter approved and field proven mechanical crossbow broadhead capable of taking down big game.  </strong></p>\r\n<p>Deadpoint Broadheads by CenterPoint are a classic, mechanical crossbow broadhead that hunters can rely on as their new go-to.</p>\r\n<p>Designed to deploy for maximum lethal impact, the DEADPOINT Broadheads are 2 blades, 100-grain broadheads that have a slim profile during flight, and deploy to a 2-inch cutting diameter.</p>\r\n<p>Take your best shot with CenterPoint Archery.</p>'),(648443,76,1,180657,'<p><strong>Three 100-grain crossbow broadheads  </strong></p>\r\n<p>• Arrows constructed from lightweight and ultra tough aluminium arrow</p>\r\n<p>• Razor-sharp blades automatically deploy on impact for exceptional penetration</p>\r\n<p>• Field point accuracy makes the most of each shot and helps you fill your freezer</p>\r\n<p>• 6061 T6 aluminium Ferrule</p>\r\n<p>• 420 stainless steel .035 blades</p>'),(648440,75,1,180727,'<p><strong>The lightweight and ultrabright aluminium arrow is ultra bright while maintaining a straight shooting arrow trajectory. </strong></p>\r\n<p>The 13-grain aluminium insert size fitting matches the Alpha-Brit Alum arrows with the most common broadheads in the hunting community which allows archers to pair this arrow with multiple broadheads.</p>\r\n<p>The bright nock features deep and secure ears that enable the bow string to rest comfortably and evenly in the string.</p>'),(648441,76,1,180727,'<p><strong>13-grain aluminium insert size matches with the most common broadheads  </strong></p>\r\n<p>• Arrows constructed from lightweight and ultra tough aluminium arrow</p>\r\n<p>• The bundle comes in yellow, red, silver and green.</p>\r\n<p>• Slightly offset fletching combined with a ultra bright Alpha-Nock system</p>'),(674816,75,0,180788,'<p>The Vudu 3.5-18x provides a robust 34 mm tube, XC High-Density glass, and is loaded with other performance features required to take that precise long-range shot.</p>\r\n<p>The oversized and precision-machined turrets, with EZ Chek zero stop feature, let you quickly dial adjustments and return to zero, even in low-light conditions.</p>\r\n<p>The side-mounted parallax adjustment allows you to dial the reticle focus in for the most difficult long-range shots.</p>\r\n<p>Magnification: 3.5-18x<br />Objective Lens: 50mm<br />Focal Plane: First Focal Plane<br />Eye Relief: 3.5x: 91-101mm; 18x: 90-101mm<br />Exit Pupil: 3.5x: 11.2mm; 18x: 2.8mm<br />Field-Of-View (Degrees): 3.5x: 5.6 degrees; 18x: 1.1 degrees<br />Field-Of-View (@100 Yards): 3.5x: 29.5 ft; 18x: 5.7 ft<br />Exterior Finish: Flat Black; Type III anodized<br />Illumination Controls: Push Buttons<br />Exposed Optical Surface Treatment Lens Coating: Broadband anti-reflection coating<br />Windage and Elevation Increment Per Click: MD2 Model: Approx. 0.25 MOA<br />Total Elevation Adjustment Range About Factory-Defined Zero Reference: ± 14.5 min MRAD or ± 50 MOA<br />Total Windage Adjustment Range About Factory-Defined Zero Reference: ± 11.5 min MRAD or ± 40 MOA<br />Battery Type: CR2032<br />Auto Power Shut-Off, Typical Time Interval at Which Power Will Shut Down to Preserve Battery Life: Approx. 2 hrs<br />Battery Life, Typical Time of Use at Middle Brightness Setting at Room Temperature: Approx. 500 hrs<br />Overall Length: 377 mm (14.84 in)<br />Weight: 33.6 oz (952 gr)<br />Tube Diameter: 34mm</p>'),(675714,75,1,180788,'<p>The Vudu 3.5-18x provides a robust 34 mm tube, XC High-Density glass, and is loaded with other performance features required to take that precise long-range shot.</p>\r\n<p>The oversized and precision-machined turrets, with EZ Chek zero stop feature, let you quickly dial adjustments and return to zero, even in low-light conditions.</p>\r\n<p>The side-mounted parallax adjustment allows you to dial the reticle focus in for the most difficult long-range shots.</p>\r\n<p>Magnification: 3.5-18x<br />Objective Lens: 50mm<br />Focal Plane: First Focal Plane<br />Eye Relief: 3.5x: 91-101mm; 18x: 90-101mm<br />Exit Pupil: 3.5x: 11.2mm; 18x: 2.8mm<br />Field-Of-View (Degrees): 3.5x: 5.6 degrees; 18x: 1.1 degrees<br />Field-Of-View (@100 Yards): 3.5x: 29.5 ft; 18x: 5.7 ft<br />Exterior Finish: Flat Black; Type III anodized<br />Illumination Controls: Push Buttons<br />Exposed Optical Surface Treatment Lens Coating: Broadband anti-reflection coating<br />Windage and Elevation Increment Per Click: MD2 Model: Approx. 0.25 MOA<br />Total Elevation Adjustment Range About Factory-Defined Zero Reference: ± 14.5 min MRAD or ± 50 MOA<br />Total Windage Adjustment Range About Factory-Defined Zero Reference: ± 11.5 min MRAD or ± 40 MOA<br />Battery Type: CR2032<br />Auto Power Shut-Off, Typical Time Interval at Which Power Will Shut Down to Preserve Battery Life: Approx. 2 hrs<br />Battery Life, Typical Time of Use at Middle Brightness Setting at Room Temperature: Approx. 500 hrs<br />Overall Length: 377 mm (14.84 in)<br />Weight: 33.6 oz (952 gr)<br />Tube Diameter: 34mm</p>'),(674817,76,0,180788,'<p>Magnification: 3.5-18x<br />Objective Lens: 50mm<br />Focal Plane: First Focal Plane<br />Eye Relief: 3.5x: 91-101mm; 18x: 90-101mm<br />Exit Pupil: 3.5x: 11.2mm; 18x: 2.8mm</p>'),(675715,76,1,180788,'<p>Magnification: 3.5-18x<br />Objective Lens: 50mm<br />Focal Plane: First Focal Plane<br />Eye Relief: 3.5x: 91-101mm; 18x: 90-101mm<br />Exit Pupil: 3.5x: 11.2mm; 18x: 2.8mm</p>'),(382542,75,0,180924,'<p><span>The brightest and most accurate variable speed crossbow scope on the market, this scope features a variable speed and arrow drop-compensation setting for crossbows that shoot between 300 and 500 FPS. Its innovative configuration, consisting of three illuminated (red or green) duplex crosshairs calibrated at 20-, 40-, and 60-yards, two illuminated (red or green) dots at 30- and 50-yards, and four non-illuminated chevrons at 70-, 80-, 90-, and 100-yards, presents the shooter with a simplified aiming system. The scope’s 30mm aluminum tube is equipped with an etched glass reticle and fully multi-coated 2-8x optics that increase fi eld-of-view and brightness in low light settings. External, micro-adjustable target turrets provide easy adjustment to windage and elevation for unmatched long-range accuracy. High-quality flip-up scope caps provide optimal protection for your optics and can be opened at the touch of your thumb.</span></p>\r\n<div id=\"featurebullets_feature_div\" class=\"celwidget\" data-feature-name=\"featurebullets\" data-csa-c-id=\"wuheba-jiqn44-gqaoew-r5h4xj\">\r\n<div id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-medium a-spacing-top-small\">\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Variable speed and arrow drop-compensation setting for crossbows that shoot beween 300 and 500 fps</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">30mm aluminum tube is equipped with an etched glass reticle and fully multi-coated 2-8x optics that increase field-of-view and brightness in low light settings</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">External, micro-adjustable target turrets provide easy adjustment to windage and elevation for unmatched long-range accuracy</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Innovative configurations consisting of multiple illuminations (red or green) for various yards</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Maxium distance marks at 100-yards</span></li>\r\n<li></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(658228,75,1,180924,'<p><span>The brightest and most accurate variable speed crossbow scope on the market, this scope features a variable speed and arrow drop-compensation setting for crossbows that shoot between 300 and 500 FPS. Its innovative configuration, consisting of three illuminated (red or green) duplex crosshairs calibrated at 20-, 40-, and 60-yards, two illuminated (red or green) dots at 30- and 50-yards, and four non-illuminated chevrons at 70-, 80-, 90-, and 100-yards, presents the shooter with a simplified aiming system. The scope’s 30mm aluminum tube is equipped with an etched glass reticle and fully multi-coated 2-8x optics that increase fi eld-of-view and brightness in low light settings. External, micro-adjustable target turrets provide easy adjustment to windage and elevation for unmatched long-range accuracy. High-quality flip-up scope caps provide optimal protection for your optics and can be opened at the touch of your thumb.</span></p>\r\n<div id=\"featurebullets_feature_div\" class=\"celwidget\" data-feature-name=\"featurebullets\" data-csa-c-id=\"wuheba-jiqn44-gqaoew-r5h4xj\">\r\n<div id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-medium a-spacing-top-small\">\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Variable speed and arrow drop-compensation setting for crossbows that shoot beween 300 and 500 fps</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">30mm aluminum tube is equipped with an etched glass reticle and fully multi-coated 2-8x optics that increase field-of-view and brightness in low light settings</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">External, micro-adjustable target turrets provide easy adjustment to windage and elevation for unmatched long-range accuracy</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Innovative configurations consisting of multiple illuminations (red or green) for various yards</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Maxium distance marks at 100-yards</span></li>\r\n<li></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),(382726,85,0,180924,'Evo-X Marksman Scope, tenpoint, crossbow scope, marksman scope, archery '),(658229,85,1,180924,'Evo-X Marksman Scope, tenpoint, crossbow scope, marksman scope, archery '),(641843,75,0,180990,'<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The Sightmark Ultra Shot A-Spec Reflex Sight is a quick-hitting, target-acquiring shooting tool designed for a tactical approach to handguns. The increased visibility in a high-quality shooting sight will ensure accuracy and confident shots in various environments.</span></p>\r\n<p>Ideal for recreational or competition shooters looking for a dependable, functional, and long lasting shooting sight by their side. Take down the competition with this practical shooting accessory.</p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<div><span><br /></span></div>'),(658230,75,1,180990,'<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The Sightmark Ultra Shot A-Spec Reflex Sight is a quick-hitting, target-acquiring shooting tool designed for a tactical approach to handguns. The increased visibility in a high-quality shooting sight will ensure accuracy and confident shots in various environments.</span></p>\r\n<p>Ideal for recreational or competition shooters looking for a dependable, functional, and long lasting shooting sight by their side. Take down the competition with this practical shooting accessory.</p>\r\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<div><span><br /></span></div>'),(641844,76,0,180990,'<p>Designed for optimal optical function with repeatable accuracy<br />Functional reflex sight allows for quick target recognition and acquisition <br />Wide angle lens system features a scratch-resistant covering to prevent scrapes and scratches<br />Multiple red reticle sight options give a functional shooting approach <br />Ten brightness settings that maintain a visible indicator in a variety of scenarios</p>'),(658231,76,1,180990,'<p>Designed for optimal optical function with repeatable accuracy<br />Functional reflex sight allows for quick target recognition and acquisition <br />Wide angle lens system features a scratch-resistant covering to prevent scrapes and scratches<br />Multiple red reticle sight options give a functional shooting approach <br />Ten brightness settings that maintain a visible indicator in a variety of scenarios</p>'),(672851,75,0,181009,'<p>9 loops<br />Ammo is immediately available<br />Sewn on elastic loops keeps ammo secure<br />Slips easily over stock</p>'),(676004,75,1,181009,'<p>9 loops<br />Ammo is immediately available<br />Sewn on elastic loops keeps ammo secure<br />Slips easily over stock</p>'),(672852,76,0,181009,'<p>9 loops<br />Ammo is immediately available<br />Sewn on elastic loops keeps ammo secure<br />Slips easily over stock</p>'),(676005,76,1,181009,'<p>9 loops<br />Ammo is immediately available<br />Sewn on elastic loops keeps ammo secure<br />Slips easily over stock</p>'),(648438,75,1,181036,'<p><strong>A user-friendly archery tool that enables shooters to easily turn their lighted arrow nocks on and off.  </strong></p>\r\n<p>The brightness of an illuminating arrow allows archers to trace their arrow after pulling the release.</p>\r\n<p>Typically an archery nock will last between 18-24 hours so it’s important for users to switch on and off their products.</p>'),(648439,76,1,181036,'<p><strong>A user-friendly archery tool that enables shooters to easily turn their lighted arrow nocks on and off  </strong></p>\r\n<p>• Constructed from tough molded plastic that’s tough enough to last a lifetime\\</p>\r\n<p>• Keeps things lasting longer which means more time in the field for each nock</p>\r\n<p>• Stores easily and is ultra lightweight</p>'),(657637,75,1,181078,'<p>The LINK-MICRO-LTE from SPYPOINT pairs the most popular cellular trail camera in years with the ultra-reliable LTE cellular network. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>The LINK-MICRO-LTE continues to challenge traditional expectations of performance and value the hunter can expect from a camera.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>The LINK-MICRO-LTE from SPYPOINT continues the legacy of the MICRO family, offering an incredible performance and opening the door to the definitive mobile scouting solution, at a price that any hunter can afford.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>The LINK-MICRO-LTE is a photo-mode only camera, with multi-shot capabilities. All camera settings are managed in the app, where the full compliment of advanced scouting tools like enhanced AI species filters, and mapping and weather integration can be found.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• 10 megapixels</p>\r\n<p>• .05-second trigger speed</p>\r\n<p>• 80-foot detection and flash range</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>The LINK-MICRO-LTE takes advantage of the LTE cellular network for improved camera reliability and longevity</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><strong>HIGHLIGHTS</strong></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>BUCK TRACKER Detection Technology (patent pending): Yes</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><strong>CELLULAR/WIRELESS</strong></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• Network: LTE</p>\r\n<p>• SIM card: Preactivated included</p>\r\n<p>• Photos transmission: Yes</p>\r\n<p>• Camera fully configurable: via the SPYPOINT App</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><strong>PHOTO</strong></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• Continuous mode: Yes</p>\r\n<p>• Multi-shot mode: Up to 2 pictures per detection</p>\r\n<p>• Stamp on pictures: Date, time, moon phase and temperature (°C/°F)</p>\r\n<p>• Photo type: Color by day, infrared by night</p>\r\n<p>• Trigger speed: 0.5 s</p>\r\n<p>• Flash range: &lt; 80\' (24m)</p>\r\n<p>• Number of LEDs: 4 Power LEDs</p>\r\n<p>• Definition (MP): 10MP</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><strong>MEMORY/POWER</strong></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• Memory card: Requires an Micro-SD card (not included) up to 32 GB</p>\r\n<p>• Power: 8 alkaline AA batteries (not included)</p>\r\n<p>• Power: LIT-10 battery pack (not included)</p>\r\n<p>• External power: DC 12V input</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><strong>MORE</strong></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• Distance detection sensor: Up to 80 ft (24m)</p>\r\n<p>• Motion Sensor: 1 sensor covering 5 zones detection</p>\r\n<p>• Schedule setup: 7 days</p>\r\n<p>• Mount: Standard 1/4\"-20 tripod</p>\r\n<p>• Dimensions: 3.1\" W X 4.4\" H X 2.2\" D (7,9 cm W X 11,2 cm H X 5,6 cm D)</p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(657638,76,1,181078,'<p>The LINK-MICRO-LTE from SPYPOINT pairs the most popular cellular trail camera in years with the ultra-reliable LTE cellular network. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• 10 megapixels</p>\r\n<p>• .05-second trigger speed</p>\r\n<p>• 80-foot detection and flash range</p>'),(674820,75,0,181094,'<p>Designed with tactical shooters in mind, the XPS2-300 offers a 2-dot ballistic drop reticle that allows the shooter to zero either subsonic or supersonic rounds in the same reticle pattern.</p>\r\n<p>Offered in the XPS2 platform, it is the shortest and lightest HWS sight available. Its size and weight make it convenient for hunters, military and law enforcement officers to carry.</p>\r\n<p>The single compact lithium 123 battery configuration opens up more space on the rail for rear iron sights or magnifiers.</p>\r\n<p>This sight has the same body style as the XPS3 model, but the XPS2 does not have night vision-compatibility.</p>\r\n<p>Length/Width/Height: 3.5\" x 2\" x 2.4\"<br />Weight: 8 oz<br />Water Resistant: Submersible to 10 ft. (3 m)<br />Mount: 1\" Weaver or MIL-STD-1913 rail<br />Power Source: One 123 lithium battery<br />Battery Life: 600 continuous hours at nominal setting 12</p>'),(675716,75,1,181094,'<p>Designed with tactical shooters in mind, the XPS2-300 offers a 2-dot ballistic drop reticle that allows the shooter to zero either subsonic or supersonic rounds in the same reticle pattern.</p>\r\n<p>Offered in the XPS2 platform, it is the shortest and lightest HWS sight available. Its size and weight make it convenient for hunters, military and law enforcement officers to carry.</p>\r\n<p>The single compact lithium 123 battery configuration opens up more space on the rail for rear iron sights or magnifiers.</p>\r\n<p>This sight has the same body style as the XPS3 model, but the XPS2 does not have night vision-compatibility.</p>\r\n<p>Length/Width/Height: 3.5\" x 2\" x 2.4\"<br />Weight: 8 oz<br />Water Resistant: Submersible to 10 ft. (3 m)<br />Mount: 1\" Weaver or MIL-STD-1913 rail<br />Power Source: One 123 lithium battery<br />Battery Life: 600 continuous hours at nominal setting 12</p>'),(674821,76,0,181094,'<p>Water Resistant: Submersible to 10 ft. (3 m)<br />Mount: 1\" Weaver or MIL-STD-1913 rail<br />Power Source: One 123 lithium battery<br />Battery Life: 600 continuous hours at nominal setting 12</p>'),(675717,76,1,181094,'<p>Water Resistant: Submersible to 10 ft. (3 m)<br />Mount: 1\" Weaver or MIL-STD-1913 rail<br />Power Source: One 123 lithium battery<br />Battery Life: 600 continuous hours at nominal setting 12</p>'),(672839,75,0,181128,'<p>\"THE GREAT BIG CAN\" has been tuned to be louder and longer for long-range calling. It\'s perfect for windy days and hunting wide-open fields. You can?t beat the \"quivering\" Estrus\" Bleat that has made \"THE CAN\" family of calls so accurate and effective.</p>\r\n<p>We guarantee it!</p>\r\n<p>Larger size for louder and long-range Estrus Bleats<br />Perfect for pre-rut, rut and post-rut hunting<br />Perfect for windy days and hunting wide-open fields</p>'),(675861,75,1,181128,'<p>\"THE GREAT BIG CAN\" has been tuned to be louder and longer for long-range calling. It\'s perfect for windy days and hunting wide-open fields. You can?t beat the \"quivering\" Estrus\" Bleat that has made \"THE CAN\" family of calls so accurate and effective.</p>\r\n<p>We guarantee it!</p>\r\n<p>Larger size for louder and long-range Estrus Bleats<br />Perfect for pre-rut, rut and post-rut hunting<br />Perfect for windy days and hunting wide-open fields</p>'),(672840,76,0,181128,'<p>Larger size for louder and long-range Estrus Bleats<br />Perfect for pre-rut, rut and post-rut hunting<br />Perfect for windy days and hunting wide-open fields</p>'),(675862,76,1,181128,'<p>Larger size for louder and long-range Estrus Bleats<br />Perfect for pre-rut, rut and post-rut hunting<br />Perfect for windy days and hunting wide-open fields</p>'),(648436,75,1,181130,'<p><strong><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-b1323391-7fff-66af-8db9-4279392268fa\">TenPoint Flight Rail and Trigger Lube is a gelbased lubricant that doesn’t gum up in the cold and maintains resistance to dirt, grime, and dust.</span></strong><br /><br />Keep things operating smoothly with the Tenpoint Flight Rail And Trigger Lube.</p>\r\n<p>It’s one of those things you don’t think about but maintaining preventative maintenance is essential in equipment longevity.</p>'),(648437,76,1,181130,'<p><strong>Resistant to dust, dirt, grime and the nastiness found in the field</strong></p>\r\n<p>• Keeps your gear running and operating smoothly throughout the season</p>\r\n<p>• Preventive maintenance tool that maintains optimal equipment performance</p>\r\n<p>• Cold weather resistant which prevents the lube from gumming up</p>'),(638733,75,1,181285,'<p>Outfit your new Ravin crossbow with these high strength 100% pure carbon crossbow bolts. These bolts feature high impact Ravin engineered polymer nocks, brass threaded inserts and aluminum nock bushings are included. (Set of 6).</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Built with high-strength 100% pure premium carbon construction</p>\r\n<p>Includes high-impact Ravin polymer nocks, brass threaded inserts and aluminum nock bushings</p>\r\n<p>These standard, 20” .003 arrows are included with the bow from the factory</p>'),(638734,76,1,181285,'<p>Built with high-strength 100% pure premium carbon construction.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• High-impact Ravin polymer nock</p>\r\n<p>• Brass threaded inserts</p>\r\n<p>• Aluminum nock bushings</p>'),(658574,75,1,181294,'<p>Upgrade your shooting precision with the Steyr 3X Optic AUG A3 M1, now available at Everest.com. </p>\r\n<p>This is the FACTORY 3X optic that integrates onto the A3 M1 receiver ONLY. Can be easily switched out with the offered rail versions of the A3 M1 via three 4MM hex head bolts. Blue thread locker is used but bolts can be removed with minimal force.</p>\r\n<p>Engineered for accuracy and reliability, this cutting-edge optic is designed to enhance your shooting prowess and elevate your performance on the range or in the field.</p>\r\n<p>Crystal-Clear Optics: Experience unparalleled clarity through the high-quality lenses of the Steyr 3X Optic. Whether you\'re aiming at distant targets or engaging in close-quarters combat, the optics ensure you maintain a clear view of your surroundings.</p>\r\n<p>Optimized Reticle: The Steyr AUG A3 M1 optic comes equipped with a meticulously crafted reticle designed to assist with quick target acquisition and precise shot placement. Its intuitive design aids in rapid adjustments and target tracking, making it an indispensable tool for both novice and experienced shooters.</p>\r\n<p>Rugged Durability: Built to withstand the toughest conditions, this optic is crafted with durability in mind. Its robust construction is shockproof and waterproof, ensuring consistent performance even in challenging environments.</p>\r\n<p>Versatile Compatibility: Whether you\'re an avid hunter, competitive shooter, or a tactical enthusiast, this optic is compatible with a wide range of firearms. Its versatility makes it a valuable addition to any shooting setup.</p>\r\n<p>Elevate your shooting game with the Steyr 3X Optic AUG A3 M1, available exclusively at Everest.com. Don\'t settle for less when it comes to accuracy and performance. Order now and experience the difference firsthand.</p>\r\n<p>Upgrade your shooting experience with the Steyr 3X Optic AUG A3 M1. Order now and take aim with confidence.</p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(658575,76,1,181294,'<ul>\r\n<li>Factory 3X optic</li>\r\n<li>Integrates onto the A3 M1 receiver ONLY.</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Can be easily switched out with the offered rail versions </span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Blue thread locker is used but bolts can be removed with minimal force.</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(678103,75,0,181364,'<p>This nut fits our extension tubes and is designed to fit your shotgun. Matte black.</p>'),(648434,75,1,181370,'<p><strong>The TenPoint Pro View 2 3X Crossbow Scope is a shooter friendly optic that fits perfectly with most crossbows. Measuring only 8.5” inches long, the scope fits comfortably and stays locked in with two ⅞ mounting rings. </strong></p>\r\n<p>The scopes crosshairs come set at 20, 30, and 40 yards enabling archers to shoot within ranges common in hunting.</p>'),(648435,76,1,181370,'<p><strong>8.5 inch shooting scope ideal for crossbow archery</strong></p>\r\n<p>• 3x32 optics that provide a crystal clear magnified view</p>\r\n<p>• ⅞” size shooting mounting rings are included</p>\r\n<p>• Crosshairs set for 20,30, and 40 yards straight out of the box</p>'),(657632,75,1,181407,'<p>Apply the ease, speed, and accuracy of a red dot sighting system to your favorite shotgun with this unique mounting system. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>The SpeedBead mounts a FastFire optic between the stock and receiver of many popular shotguns. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Your line of sight will fall naturally just above the vented rib, allowing for accurate and instinctive aiming. At 1x magnification, it’s designed for both-eyes-open shooting. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>That’s ideal for shooting clays and hunting waterfowl, upland birds, and turkeys.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• Magnification: 1x</p>\r\n<p>• Reticles: FastFire 8-MOA Dot</p>\r\n<p>• Reticle Color(s): Red</p>\r\n<p>• Clear Objective Lens Diameter: 21x15 mm</p>\r\n<p>• Finish: Matte</p>\r\n<p>• Mount: Beretta Xtrema/2, 391, 391 Light, Urika/2 12 ga.</p>\r\n<p>• Eye Relief: Unlimited</p>\r\n<p>• Click Value: 1 MOA</p>\r\n<p>• Elevation Adjustment, Total Capability: 115 MOA</p>\r\n<p>• Windage Adjustment: 86 MOA</p>\r\n<p>• Parallax/Focus: Parallax-Free</p>\r\n<p>• Length: 1.9 in.</p>\r\n<p>• Weight: 1.9 oz.</p>\r\n<p>• Battery: CR1632</p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(657633,76,1,181407,'<p>Apply the ease, speed, and accuracy of a red dot sighting system to your favorite shotgun with this unique mounting system. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>That’s ideal for shooting clays and hunting waterfowl, upland birds, and turkeys.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• Magnification: 1x</p>\r\n<p>• Reticles: FastFire 8-MOA Dot</p>\r\n<p>• Reticle Color(s): Red</p>'),(641863,75,1,181418,'<p><strong>SilencerCo`s 3-prong flash hider is compatible with the ASR mounting system . </strong></p>\r\n<p>It features one hand-on, one hand-off attachment/detachment, and patent-pending resonance suppression, effectively eliminating the tuning-fork effect common with competing for 3-prong flash hiders.</p>\r\n<p>The 3-port muzzle brake design effectively reduces felt recoil and muzzle climb.</p>'),(641864,76,1,181418,'<p><strong>The 3-Pin flash hider is compatible with most ASR mounting systems. </strong></p>\r\n<p>• Hand-on and hand-off attaching allow for the functional and user-friendly ability to customize their shooting tool</p>\r\n<p>• Recoil is repressed from a built-in 3-port muzzle-breaking system</p>\r\n<p>• Feel confident and comfortable with this dynamic shooting tool</p>'),(648432,75,1,181490,'<p><strong>The fully coated lenses on the Xbow Rng Blk Scope enables optimal shooting performance for any crossbow archer.</strong></p>\r\n<p>Dial in targets or big game between 20-70 yards with a shooting scope that features a speed calibrated magnification system.</p>\r\n<p>Featuring two spring calibrated magnification system that allows shooters to easily adjust their position and range in a short window.</p>'),(648433,76,1,181490,'<p><strong>• Fully-coated lenses provide maximum brightness, clarity, and contrast; adjustable rheostat brightness control</strong></p>\r\n<p>• Enhanced crossbow BDC reticle compensates for bolt drop and provides accurate hold-over points from 20-70 yards; glass-etched reticle can be used with or without Illumination</p>\r\n<p>• Speed calibrated magnification System scales the reticle and target image to match bolt Velocity (250-450 FPS)</p>\r\n<p>• Durable leaf-spring click adjustments for windage and elevation; 1/2-moa windage/elevation adjustments</p>\r\n<p>• Waterproof, fog-proof, and Nitrogen gas-filled; Weaver-style 30mm rings included; Battery included</p>'),(648430,75,1,181501,'<p><strong>Muzzy Trocar Crossbow Broadheads are built for the highest power and faster shooting crossbows available today.</strong></p>\r\n<p>With a 1- 3/16” inch cutting diameter and .035 thick cutting blades the Muzzy Trocar will cut through big game like butter.</p>\r\n<p>The advanced engineering enables a straight shooting arrow even when flying speeds upwards of 400 feet per second.</p>\r\n<p>The broadheads trocar tip will meet contact points with force and fury ready to take down whatever\'s in its path.</p>'),(648431,76,1,181501,'<p><strong>High performing broadheads designed specifically for crossbow archery</strong></p>\r\n<p>• 3-blade broadhead featuring an ultra sharp trocar tip</p>\r\n<p>• 1-3/16” cutting diameter</p>\r\n<p>• .035” thick blades</p>\r\n<p>• Capable of taking down big game</p>'),(641858,75,0,181553,'<p><strong><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-8f875d43-7fff-c53d-1bad-09b51d1e080c\">Side saddle shell holster that keeps access ammo stashed away safely</span>.</strong></p>\r\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-c1728143-7fff-df93-300d-36b1ece72166\">Fits the most common 930/935 size shell and keeps each casing locked in tightly.</span></p>\r\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-14030561-7fff-13be-deed-abd0ad6b6156\">Upgrade your shotgun shooting experience by having your extra ammo sit comfortably and securely in the Side Saddle Paddle shell carrying system.</span></p>\r\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-14030561-7fff-13be-deed-abd0ad6b6156\">Easily slide your access shells into the polymer harness system to keep things locked away. Stay organized, confident, and ready with the Side Saddle Polymer Mossberg system.</span></p>'),(641847,75,1,181553,'<p><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Side saddle shell holster that keeps access ammo stashed away safely</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Fits the most common 930/935 size shell and keeps each casing locked in tightly</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span><span></span></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Upgrade your shotgun shooting experience by having your extra ammo sit comfortably and securely in the Side Saddle Paddle shell carrying system. Easily slide your access shells into the polymer harness system to keep things locked away. Stay organized, confident, and ready with the Side Saddle Polymer Mossberg system.</span></p>'),(641849,76,0,181553,'<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-12c352c3-7fff-5d09-af9c-c229ed0c6779\">Side saddle shell holster that keeps access ammo stashed away safely</span></p>\r\n<p>• Fits the most common 930/935 size shell and keeps each casing locked in tightly</p>\r\n<p>• Compact and comfortable, providing all day comfort and safety</p>\r\n<p>• Sleek design style help conceal your carry and keep things undercover</p>\r\n<p>• Long-lasting design will keep this holster by your side for years to come</p>\r\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-14030561-7fff-13be-deed-abd0ad6b6156\"><span></span></span></p>'),(641848,76,1,181553,'<p>GutCheck® Highly reflective Arrow Wrap allows you to quickly and easily find your arrow or bolt in dark or dim lighting. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• Just shine a flashlight in the direction of the arrow.</p>\r\n<p>• The bundle comes in yellow, red, silver and green.</p>\r\n<p>• Great way to find your arrow or bolt in low light conditions.</p>'),(674804,75,0,181561,'<p>The most innovative, direct view thermal sight in the world. The ECHO3 uses SIG SAUER BDX technology and can record both video and images in 8 different color palettes.</p>\r\n<p><strong>FEATURES:</strong><br />Compact Thermal Reflex Style Sight (Don\'t get Stuck Behind a Scope)</p>\r\n<p>BDX Enabled WiFi/Bluetooth, Allowing Active Reticles that Change with KILO Rangefinder Input.</p>\r\n<p>Customizable Fixed Reticles that are Configured from the BDX Mobile Application</p>\r\n<p>Uncooled 320x240 12µ VOx LWIR Core Operating at 30Hz (ITAR Controlled)</p>\r\n<p>LevelPlex Anti-Cant System with Scope Cant Sensitivity down to 0.5°</p>\r\n<p>MOTAC (Motion Activated Display) Powers up when it Senses Motion</p>\r\n<p>Video and Image Recording (including recoil activation) with 8 Color Palettes</p>\r\n<p>Greater than 6 Hours of Run Time with Heavy Use</p>\r\n<p>Easy to Adjust Lens with Optional Throw Lever Attachment</p>\r\n<p>Optional Quick Disconnect Mount</p>\r\n<p>Designed and Assembled in the U.S.A. to Withstand IPX-6 Conditions</p>\r\n<p>Aspheric Lens (10° FOV) with up to 6X Digital Magnification</p>\r\n<p>Designed for Predator and Hog hunters</p>\r\n<p>Improved Situational Awareness</p>\r\n<p>COLOR: Black<br />CATEGORY: Thermal Reflex Sights<br />ADJUSTMENT INCREMENTS: 0.5 MOA<br />MAGNIFICATION: 1-6x<br />OBJECTIVE LENS DIAMETER (MM): 23 mm<br />BATTERY: (2) CR123<br />RETICLE: Multiple<br />OVERALL LENGTH: 4.3<br />OVERALL WIDTH: 2.6<br />HEIGHT: 3.3<br />WEIGHT: 14.3<br />WATERPROOFING: IPX4<br />ILLUMINATION SETTINGS: 8 Color Palettes and 6 Brightness Settings<br />TOTAL ELEVATION TRAVEL: 150 MOA x 150 MOA<br />RUN TIME: 6 hrs</p>'),(675718,75,1,181561,'<p>The most innovative, direct view thermal sight in the world. The ECHO3 uses SIG SAUER BDX technology and can record both video and images in 8 different color palettes.</p>\r\n<p><strong>FEATURES:</strong><br />Compact Thermal Reflex Style Sight (Don\'t get Stuck Behind a Scope)</p>\r\n<p>BDX Enabled WiFi/Bluetooth, Allowing Active Reticles that Change with KILO Rangefinder Input.</p>\r\n<p>Customizable Fixed Reticles that are Configured from the BDX Mobile Application</p>\r\n<p>Uncooled 320x240 12µ VOx LWIR Core Operating at 30Hz (ITAR Controlled)</p>\r\n<p>LevelPlex Anti-Cant System with Scope Cant Sensitivity down to 0.5°</p>\r\n<p>MOTAC (Motion Activated Display) Powers up when it Senses Motion</p>\r\n<p>Video and Image Recording (including recoil activation) with 8 Color Palettes</p>\r\n<p>Greater than 6 Hours of Run Time with Heavy Use</p>\r\n<p>Easy to Adjust Lens with Optional Throw Lever Attachment</p>\r\n<p>Optional Quick Disconnect Mount</p>\r\n<p>Designed and Assembled in the U.S.A. to Withstand IPX-6 Conditions</p>\r\n<p>Aspheric Lens (10° FOV) with up to 6X Digital Magnification</p>\r\n<p>Designed for Predator and Hog hunters</p>\r\n<p>Improved Situational Awareness</p>\r\n<p>COLOR: Black<br />CATEGORY: Thermal Reflex Sights<br />ADJUSTMENT INCREMENTS: 0.5 MOA<br />MAGNIFICATION: 1-6x<br />OBJECTIVE LENS DIAMETER (MM): 23 mm<br />BATTERY: (2) CR123<br />RETICLE: Multiple<br />OVERALL LENGTH: 4.3<br />OVERALL WIDTH: 2.6<br />HEIGHT: 3.3<br />WEIGHT: 14.3<br />WATERPROOFING: IPX4<br />ILLUMINATION SETTINGS: 8 Color Palettes and 6 Brightness Settings<br />TOTAL ELEVATION TRAVEL: 150 MOA x 150 MOA<br />RUN TIME: 6 hrs</p>'),(674805,76,0,181561,'<p>OBJECTIVE LENS DIAMETER (MM): 23 mm<br />BATTERY: (2) CR123<br />RETICLE: Multiple<br />OVERALL LENGTH: 4.3<br />OVERALL WIDTH: 2.6<br />HEIGHT: 3.3</p>'),(675719,76,1,181561,'<p>OBJECTIVE LENS DIAMETER (MM): 23 mm<br />BATTERY: (2) CR123<br />RETICLE: Multiple<br />OVERALL LENGTH: 4.3<br />OVERALL WIDTH: 2.6<br />HEIGHT: 3.3</p>'),(638731,75,1,181565,'<p>The new R29X, complete with our new fully-integrated Silent Cocking System, hits a new pinnacle of speed at an incredible 450 FPS. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>The length remains 29 inches, and when fully drawn, the R29X is 6 inches axle-axle and weighs a light 6.75 pounds. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Including an ergonomic grip, this crossbow is easy to maneuver in tight spaces and gives hunters and shooters great control without sacrificing comfort. Now in all Black</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Features:</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>450 FPS</p>\r\n<p>Weight: 6.75 lbs.</p>\r\n<p>Length: 29”</p>\r\n<p>Width Axle to Axle 6” Cocked</p>\r\n<p>Width Axle to Axle 10.5” Un-cocked</p>\r\n<p>Power-Stroke: 12.5”</p>\r\n<p>Kinetic Energy: 180</p>\r\n<p>Draw Weight: 12 lbs.</p>\r\n<p>HeliCoil Technology</p>\r\n<p>Silent Cocking System</p>\r\n<p>Fully-Assembled/Pre-Tuned</p>\r\n<p>3 – Ravin .003 Arrows &amp; Field Tips (400 Grain Total)</p>\r\n<p>1 – Removable Draw Handle</p>\r\n<p>1 – Quiver/Mounting Bracket</p>\r\n<p>100 Yard Illuminated Scope</p>\r\n<p>Built-In Cocking Mechanism</p>\r\n<p>Anti-Dry Fire/Auto Safety</p>\r\n<p>Built-in Sling Mounts</p>'),(638732,76,1,181565,'<p>The new R29X, complete with our new fully-integrated Silent Cocking System, hits a new pinnacle of speed at an incredible 450 FPS. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• HeliCoil Technology</p>\r\n<p>• Silent Cocking System</p>\r\n<p>• Fully-Assembled/Pre-Tuned</p>'),(382740,85,0,181565,'Ravin R29X Crossbow Package-Predator Dusk Camo, crossbow, archery, '),(638730,85,1,181565,'Ravin R29X Crossbow Package-Predator Dusk Camo, crossbow, archery, '),(648426,75,1,181573,'<p><strong>The Tenpoint Vapor RS470 Crossbow combination package with ACUslide included in the ultimate archery crossbow package providing sportsmen and women with an archery weapon that is simply above the rest.  </strong></p>\r\n<p>Capable of shooting long distances at extremely high speeds the TenPoint Vapor is a weapon respected by big game archers who turn to crossbows for their adventures.</p>'),(648427,76,1,181573,'<p><strong>Top-of-the-line crossbow built for max speed and accuracy  </strong></p>\r\n<p>• Advanced design equipped with an autoranging Garmin Xero X1i Rangefinding Scope</p>\r\n<p>• Launches arrows up to 470 fps</p>\r\n<p>• Lightweight and compact design - 31\" long and just 6-1/2\" wide (cocked)</p>\r\n<p>• Huge 17\" power stroke for big power and speed</p>\r\n<p>• Reverse-draw design through the riser - more power, greater accuracy, balanced feel</p>\r\n<p>• 2-stage S1 trigger- zero-creep design with a consistent, crisp, 3-1/2 lb</p>\r\n<p>• Dry-Fire-Inhibitor protection</p>'),(645327,75,1,181685,'<p><strong>Dual-bladed broadhead capable of big-game takedowns </strong></p>\r\n<p>Available in 100 or 125-grain model options</p>\r\n<p>1.75 broadhead cutting diameter</p>\r\n<p>.035\" blades capable of cutting flesh through butter</p>\r\n<p>Three broadheads per package</p>\r\n<p>Razor-sharp tip point that shoots straight in a high-speed capacity</p>\r\n<p>Blades instantly deploy on contact and</p>'),(645328,76,1,181685,'<p><strong>Dual-bladed broadhead capable of big-game takedowns </strong></p>\r\n<p>Available in 100 or 125-grain model options</p>\r\n<p>1.75 broadhead cutting diameter</p>\r\n<p>.035\" blades capable of cutting flesh through butter</p>\r\n<p>Three broadheads per package</p>\r\n<p>Razor-sharp tip point that shoots straight in a high-speed capacity</p>\r\n<p>Blades instantly deploy on contact and</p>'),(645250,75,1,181709,'<p>Often called the quietest compound crossbow ever created, the Siege RS410 from TenPoint Crossbow Technologies can shoot up to 410 feet per second.  </p>\r\n<p>The compact crossbow measures only 7.5” inches from axle to axle making it suitable for a wide range of archers.</p>\r\n<p>Completed with a professionally mounted Rangemaster Proscope that will accurately take down targets at ranges between 20, 30, and 40 yards.</p>'),(645251,76,1,181709,'<p><strong>Ten Point Siege Rs410 Acuslide Rangemaster Pro Scope  </strong></p>\r\n<p>• High-performing crossbow with every bell and whistle imaginable</p>\r\n<p>• Shoot up to 410 feet per second</p>\r\n<p>• Measuring 7.5\" axle-to-axle, maintaining a compact size</p>\r\n<p>• Ultra accurate straight out of the box out to 20, 30, and 40 yards</p>\r\n<p>• Micro-Trac Barrell, which reduces string-to-rail contact and increases the shooting experience</p>'),(675648,75,0,181725,'<p>Demand truly long-range precision and a premium feature set from the Trijicon AccuPoint® 4-24x50.</p>\r\n<p>The impressive magnification range offers versatility, with the Duplex reticle designed for accurate shot placement.</p>\r\n<p>Fully multi-coated broadband anti-reflective glass, outstanding low-light performance, and precise, repeatable adjusters make this scope the optimal choice for long-range hunting and shooting.</p>\r\n<p>Length x Width x Height:14.4 in x 2.9 in x 2.4 in (365.76mm x 73.66mm x 60.96mm)<br />Weight: 26.8 oz. (759.77g)<br />Magnification: 4-24x<br />Objective Size: 50mm<br />Tube Size: 30mm<br />Reticle Pattern: Triangle Post<br />Day Reticle Color: Green<br />Focal Plane: Second<br />Illumination Source: Tritium / Fiber Optic<br />Power Source: Tritium / Fiber Optic<br />Adjustment: 1/4 MOA per click<br />Adjustment Range: 100 MOA Elevation, 70 MOA Windage<br />Eye Relief: 3.1 in.-3.8 in. (78.74mm-96.52mm)<br />Exit Pupil: 0.33 in.-0.08 in. (8.38mm-2.03mm)<br />Field of View (degrees): 5.43°-0.91°<br />Field of View (feet): 28.5 ft.-4.7 ft. @ 100 yds. (9.5-1.57m @ 100m)<br />Housing Material: 6061 Aircraft Grade Aluminum<br />Finish: Satin Black</p>'),(675720,75,1,181725,'<p>Demand truly long-range precision and a premium feature set from the Trijicon AccuPoint® 4-24x50.</p>\r\n<p>The impressive magnification range offers versatility, with the Duplex reticle designed for accurate shot placement.</p>\r\n<p>Fully multi-coated broadband anti-reflective glass, outstanding low-light performance, and precise, repeatable adjusters make this scope the optimal choice for long-range hunting and shooting.</p>\r\n<p>Length x Width x Height:14.4 in x 2.9 in x 2.4 in (365.76mm x 73.66mm x 60.96mm)<br />Weight: 26.8 oz. (759.77g)<br />Magnification: 4-24x<br />Objective Size: 50mm<br />Tube Size: 30mm<br />Reticle Pattern: Triangle Post<br />Day Reticle Color: Green<br />Focal Plane: Second<br />Illumination Source: Tritium / Fiber Optic<br />Power Source: Tritium / Fiber Optic<br />Adjustment: 1/4 MOA per click<br />Adjustment Range: 100 MOA Elevation, 70 MOA Windage<br />Eye Relief: 3.1 in.-3.8 in. (78.74mm-96.52mm)<br />Exit Pupil: 0.33 in.-0.08 in. (8.38mm-2.03mm)<br />Field of View (degrees): 5.43°-0.91°<br />Field of View (feet): 28.5 ft.-4.7 ft. @ 100 yds. (9.5-1.57m @ 100m)<br />Housing Material: 6061 Aircraft Grade Aluminum<br />Finish: Satin Black</p>'),(675649,76,0,181725,'<p>Objective Size: 50mm<br />Tube Size: 30mm<br />Reticle Pattern: Triangle Post<br />Day Reticle Color: Green<br />Focal Plane: Second</p>'),(675721,76,1,181725,'<p>Objective Size: 50mm<br />Tube Size: 30mm<br />Reticle Pattern: Triangle Post<br />Day Reticle Color: Green<br />Focal Plane: Second</p>'),(638725,75,1,181747,'<p>The Trocar HBX features 0.35-inch-thick surgically sharp stainless steel mechanical blades that stay tucked in tight to the solid-steel ferrule in flight, but they deploy reliably with a 1 5/8” expandable cutting diameter. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>The fixed blades are also 0.35-inch thick and have a cutting diameter of 1”. They have an offset for increased accuracy and stability. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>The total cutting diameter of the HBX is 2 5/8”. The Trocar HBX features a bone-crushing chisel tip.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Features:</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>4-Blade (2 fixed and 2 mechanical)</p>\r\n<p>100 Grain</p>\r\n<p>Chisel Tip</p>\r\n<p>Stainless Steel Ferrule</p>\r\n<p>.035\" thickness blades</p>\r\n<p>1 \" Fixed Blade Cutting Diameter</p>\r\n<p>1 5/8\" Expandable Cutting Diameter</p>\r\n<p>2 5/8\" Total Cutting Diameter</p>\r\n<p>Offset Fixed Blades to Induce Spin</p>\r\n<p>3 per pack</p>'),(638726,76,1,181747,'<p>The Trocar HBX features 0.35-inch-thick surgically sharp stainless steel mechanical blades that stay tucked in tight to the solid-steel ferrule in flight, but they deploy reliably with a 1 5/8” expandable cutting diameter. </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• 4-Blade (2 fixed and 2 mechanical)</p>\r\n<p>• 100 Grain</p>\r\n<p>• Chisel Tip</p>'),(638727,85,1,181747,'Muzzy Trocar HBX Hybrid 4 Blade Crossbow Broadhead 100gr'),(672818,75,1,181906,'<p>Designed to the exact specifications of the US Special Operations Command for use by elite US forces, the Trijicon ACOG TA01NSN is Trijicon\'s most popular ACOG.</p>\r\n<p>The ranging reticle allows for bullet drop compensation out to 600 meters without any manual adjustments. The reticle will appear black during the daytime and will glow amber in the dark, thanks to Trijicon\'s patented tritium illumination.</p>\r\n<p>Includes backup Iron Sights. No batteries needed! The TA01NSN also includes: 1 ACOG Thumbscrew Flattop Adapter (TA51), 1 Rubber Scope Cap Cover (TA52), 1 Set of backup Iron Sights, 1 LENSPEN® (TA56), 1 Lanyard Assembly for Adjuster Caps (TA71E), 1 Trijicon Logo Sticker (PR15), 1 ACOG Manual, 1 Warranty Card</p>\r\n<p>Magnification: 4x<br />Objective Size: 32mm<br />Bullet Drop Compensator: Yes<br />Length: 5.8\"<br />Weight: 14.96 oz<br />Illumination Source: Tritium<br />Reticle Pattern: Crosshair<br />Day Reticle Color: Black<br />Night Reticle Color: Center Amber<br />Calibration: 0.223<br />Eye Relief: 1.5\"<br />Exit Pupil: 8mm<br />Field of View: 7 Degrees Field of View @ 100 yards: 36.8\'<br />Adjustment @ 100 yards (clicks/in): 2<br />Mount: TA51<br />Mount Comes With: Flattop<br />Housing Material: Forged Aluminum</p>'),(672819,76,1,181906,'<p>Magnification: 4x<br />Objective Size: 32mm<br />Bullet Drop Compensator: Yes<br />Length: 5.8\"<br />Weight: 14.96 oz</p>'),(382745,85,0,182012,'Axe Crossbow With Three Bolts And Optic, axe crossbow, archery, crossbow with optic'),(658233,85,1,182012,'Axe Crossbow With Three Bolts And Optic, axe crossbow, archery, crossbow with optic'),(672845,75,0,182125,'<p>Made of heavy-duty polyester, this convenient shotgun shell holder has adjustable Velcro® straps to secure it to the buttstock of your shotgun.</p>\r\n<p>Its suede cheek piece adds comfort and protects the stock of the gun.</p>\r\n<p>This hunting accessory provides easy access to 3 shotshells, and includes a zippered pouch for additional ammo and other accessories.</p>'),(676006,75,1,182125,'<p>Made of heavy-duty polyester, this convenient shotgun shell holder has adjustable Velcro® straps to secure it to the buttstock of your shotgun.</p>\r\n<p>Its suede cheek piece adds comfort and protects the stock of the gun.</p>\r\n<p>This hunting accessory provides easy access to 3 shotshells, and includes a zippered pouch for additional ammo and other accessories.</p>'),(672846,76,0,182125,'<ul>\r\n<li>Easy Access to 3 Shotshells</li>\r\n<li>Includes a Zippered Pouch</li>\r\n<li>Heavy Duty Polyester</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Velcro Straps</li>\r\n</ul>'),(676007,76,1,182125,'<ul>\r\n<li>Easy Access to 3 Shotshells</li>\r\n<li>Includes a Zippered Pouch</li>\r\n<li>Heavy Duty Polyester</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Velcro Straps</li>\r\n</ul>'),(4533621,75,0,182150,'<h3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"105\"><strong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"103\">Carlson’s 12 Gauge Cremator Ported Beretta Optima HP Choke Tube Set – Mid &amp; Long Range (2-Pack)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"156\"><strong data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"154\">Precision Performance for Waterfowl Hunting</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"158\" data-end=\"469\">The Carlson’s 12 Gauge Cremator Ported Choke Tube Set is designed for Beretta Optima HP shotguns, offering superior accuracy and consistency for waterfowl hunters. This two-pack set includes both a Mid-Range (MR) and Long-Range (LR) choke tube, allowing seamless adaptability for different shooting distances.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"505\"><strong data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"503\">Key Features &amp; Benefits</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"803\"><strong data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"560\">Triple Shot Technology (TST) for Tighter Patterns</strong><br data-start=\"560\" data-end=\"563\" />Carlson’s patented Triple Shot Technology (TST) reduces pellet deformation, producing tighter and more consistent shot patterns with fewer fliers. The gradual constriction design optimizes downrange effectiveness without excessive recoil.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"1045\"><strong data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"855\">Ported Design for Reduced Muzzle Jump &amp; Recoil</strong><br data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"858\" />Strategically placed ports help minimize muzzle rise and felt recoil, ensuring greater stability for faster follow-up shots. The improved control enhances accuracy and shooting comfort.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1105\"><strong data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1103\">Mid-Range &amp; Long-Range Chokes for Versatile Shooting</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1339\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1212\"><strong data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1132\">Mid-Range (MR) Choke</strong> – Ideal for shooting ducks, geese, and other waterfowl at moderate distances.</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1339\"><strong data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1240\">Long-Range (LR) Choke</strong> – Provides tighter, more consistent patterns for long-distance shots when birds are further out.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1606\"><strong data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1386\">Durable 17-4 Stainless Steel Construction</strong><br data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1389\" />Made from heat-treated 17-4 stainless steel, these choke tubes are highly durable and resistant to corrosion, even in harsh hunting environments. The matte black finish adds a professional look and extra protection.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1829\"><strong data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1656\">No Size or Speed Restrictions for Steel Shot</strong><br data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1659\" />Unlike many competitor chokes, Carlson’s Cremator Chokes have no restrictions on steel shot size or velocity, making them perfect for modern high-speed waterfowl loads.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1953\"><strong data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1862\">Easy Installation &amp; Removal</strong><br data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1865\" />Knurled ends allow for quick choke tube changes in the field without needing a wrench.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"2007\"><strong data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"2005\">Why Choose Carlson’s Cremator Choke Tubes?</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2289\">Carlson’s Choke Tubes are known for their innovative design, exceptional performance, and USA-made quality. Whether you\'re hunting over decoys or taking long-range shots, this Beretta Optima HP 12-gauge choke set provides the precision and consistency needed to maximize success.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2291\" data-end=\"2315\"><strong data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2313\">Specifications</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2316\" data-end=\"2619\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2316\" data-end=\"2339\"><strong data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2328\">Gauge:</strong> 12 Gauge</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2340\" data-end=\"2395\"><strong data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2360\">Compatibility:</strong> Beretta Optima HP (OHP) Shotguns</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2396\" data-end=\"2465\"><strong data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2421\">Choke Set Includes:</strong> Mid-Range (MR) and Long-Range (LR) Chokes</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2504\"><strong data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2481\">Material:</strong> 17-4 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2532\"><strong data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2518\">Finish:</strong> Matte Black</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2552\"><strong data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2546\">Ported:</strong> Yes</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2619\"><strong data-start=\"2555\" data-end=\"2581\">Steel Shot Compatible:</strong> Yes (No size or speed restrictions)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2642\"><strong data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2640\">Perfect For</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2643\" data-end=\"2758\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2643\" data-end=\"2689\">Waterfowl Hunting (Ducks, Geese, and more)</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2726\">Sporting Clays &amp; Target Shooting</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2758\">High-Velocity Shotgun Loads</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2760\" data-end=\"2825\"><strong data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"2823\">Order Your Carlson’s 12GA Cremator Choke Tube Set Today</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2826\" data-end=\"3055\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Upgrade your Beretta Optima HP shotgun with Carlson’s Cremator Ported Choke Tubes for superior pattern consistency, reduced recoil, and excellent long-range performance. Shop now to take your hunting experience to the next level.</p>'),(674806,75,0,182152,'<p>Generous 4\" eye relief<br />Includes rubber eye-guard<br />Fully-coated lenses provide maximum brightness, clarity and contrast<br />Durable, scratch-resistant, non-reflective matte finish<br />Includes Weaver-style rings</p>'),(675722,75,1,182152,'<p>Generous 4\" eye relief<br />Includes rubber eye-guard<br />Fully-coated lenses provide maximum brightness, clarity and contrast<br />Durable, scratch-resistant, non-reflective matte finish<br />Includes Weaver-style rings</p>'),(674807,76,0,182152,'<ul>\r\n<li>TRUGLO CROSSBOW 4X32 W/RINGS</li>\r\n<li>Generous 4\" eye relief</li>\r\n<li>Durable</li>\r\n<li>Scratch Resistant </li>\r\n<li>Non-Reflective</li>\r\n</ul>'),(675723,76,1,182152,'<ul>\r\n<li>TRUGLO CROSSBOW 4X32 W/RINGS</li>\r\n<li>Generous 4\" eye relief</li>\r\n<li>Durable</li>\r\n<li>Scratch Resistant </li>\r\n<li>Non-Reflective</li>\r\n</ul>'),(652265,75,1,182327,'<p>The KILO1000 is one of the most advanced, yet simple to use rangefinders on the market and features the fastest, digital signal processing engine while streamlining the user interface for a no hassle, out of the box experience.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p>\r\n<p>• 5x20 mm monocular with SpectraCoatTM anti-reflection coatings for superior light transmission and optical clarity.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• Revolutionary Lightwave TMDSP Technology for the fastest and longest distance rangefinder engine.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• HyperScan provides 4x range updates per second in scan mode while RangeLock reports the last range result when ranging distant targets.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• Features line of sight or angle modified range.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• Units in yards or meters to tenth Y/M resolution.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• High Transmittance LCD display for superior low-light performance.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• Compact, lightweight polymer housing with eyecup and diopter adjustment.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• Simplified user interface with RANGE and MODE buttons only.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><strong>Specs:</strong></p>\r\n<p>RANGE: Reflective 1200 / Trees 800 / Deer 600</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>BATTERY: (1) CR-1/3N</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>COLOR: Black</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>OVERALL LENGTH: 4.3 in (109 mm)</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>OVERALL WIDTH: 1.4 in (36 mm)</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>HEIGHT: 3 in (76 mm)</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>WEIGHT: 5 oz (140 g)</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>DISPLAY TYPE: LCD</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>FIELD OF VIEW: 7.5º</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>EYE RELIEF: 18 mm</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>OBJECTIVE LENS DIAMETER: 20 mm</p>'),(652266,76,1,182327,'<p>The KILO1000 is one of the most advanced, yet simple to use rangefinders on the market and features the fastest, digital signal processing engine while streamlining the user interface for a no hassle, out of the box experience.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• 5x20 mm monocular with SpectraCoatTM anti-reflection coatings for superior light transmission and optical clarity.</p>\r\n<p>• Revolutionary Lightwave TMDSP Technology for the fastest and longest distance rangefinder engine.</p>\r\n<p>• HyperScan provides 4x range updates per second in scan mode while RangeLock reports the last range result when ranging distant targets.</p>'),(657452,75,1,182335,'<p>The 3-person Hub Ground Blind is a quick-set hub style blind that is perfect for archery or firearm hunting. With 3 large full width windows with silent slide covers your shot opportunities will be ample. The completely black interior will keep you concealed and the water resistant fabric will keep you dry in inclement weather.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• 75” SHOOTING WIDTH</p>\r\n<p>• 67” CENTER HEIGHT</p>\r\n<p>• 300D Shell</p>\r\n<p>• Water Resistant</p>\r\n<p>• Two Full width windows</p>\r\n<p>• Brushed fabric</p>\r\n<p>• Blackout interior</p>\r\n<p>• Brush holders</p>\r\n<p>• Silent window sliders</p>\r\n<p>• Ozone loft pockets</p>\r\n<p>• Veil Camo Finish</p>'),(657453,76,1,182335,'<p>The completely black interior will keep you concealed and the water resistant fabric will keep you dry in inclement weather.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• 75” SHOOTING WIDTH</p>\r\n<p>• 67” CENTER HEIGHT</p>\r\n<p>• 300D Shell</p>'),(648428,75,1,182392,'<p><strong>The Muzzy Trocar broadhead is an advanced broadhead with a monstrous 1-3/16\" cutting diameter that is capable of taking down big game animals from a great distance.  </strong></p>\r\n<p>Each blade is 035\" inches and comes factory tested to ensure a razor-sharp finish.</p>\r\n<p>The Muzzy Trocars are known to be as tough as nails and a preferred broadhead by serious hunters who look to know if there is capable of taking down big game.</p>'),(648429,76,1,182392,'<p><strong>1-3/16\" cutting diameter that is capable of taking down big game</strong></p>\r\n<p>• .035\" thick razor-sharp blades that come factory tested</p>'),(645230,75,1,182414,'<p><strong>The Ten Point Havoc Rs440 featuring the Garmin Xero X1i Scope is a high powered crossbow featuring premium components and professional grade engineering.</strong>  </p>\r\n<p>With the ability to arrows over 400 feet per second, the Ten Point Havoc also features a state of the art Garmin Xero scope that enables experienced shooters to take down big game confidently up to 75 yards.</p>\r\n<p>This all in one package also includes an integrated range touchpad that lets you dial in on the distance with a simple click of a button.</p>'),(645231,76,1,182414,'<p><strong>Shoots up to 440 feet per second with extreme accuracy  </strong></p>\r\n<p>• Features Garmin Xero Rangefinder Scope providing extreme visibility in both the target and distance between you and it</p>\r\n<p>•Tactical grip and handle for maximum comfort and steadiness</p>\r\n<p>•Acuslide cocking and de-cokcing system provides a more silent system</p>'),(645096,75,1,182511,'<p><strong>The Wicked Ridge Invader 400 ACUdraw Crossbow is a tactically built shooting system that is ultra-light while maintaining a rugged and sporting feel. </strong></p>\r\n<p>Combined with the Acudraw Scope, the Wicked Range Invader keeps shooters dialed in and on the target.</p>\r\n<p>With the ability to shoot up to 400 feet per second, the Wicked Range Invader is high powered weapon capable of taking down big game animals up to 70 yards.</p>\r\n<p>The Wicked Ridge also includes the ACUdraw cocking device that decreases the crossbows overall pulling power to only 5lbs.</p>'),(645097,76,1,182511,'<p><strong>High powered crossbow that can shoot up to 400 FPS </strong></p>\r\n<p>•TenPoint Lighted Pro-View scope comes pre-mounted on the crossbow</p>\r\n<p>• ACUdraw cocking device needs only 5 lbs of pulling power</p>\r\n<p>• Custom camouflage color pattern</p>'),(645001,75,1,182558,'<p><strong>The Ten Point Vengent S440 Acuslide Rangemaster Pro crossbow is an all inclusive crossbow combination package with state of the art features, incredible shooting power, and advanced accuracy which combine for the ultimate shooting experience.  </strong></p>\r\n<p>Featuring multi-coated glass for optimal light gathering, the RangeMaster Pro variable speed scope includes lighted aiming points for precision down-range accuracy in low-light conditions.</p>\r\n<p>Combined with the S440 Rangemaster is the Acuslide cocking system that requires only 5lbs of total pulling power, which means nearly any outdoors person is capable of pulling back on the bow and engaging in an outdoor shooting activity.</p>'),(645002,76,1,182558,'<p><strong>The Ten Point Vengent S440 Acuslide Rangemaster Pro crossbow is an all inclusive crossbow combination package with state of the art features  </strong></p>\r\n<p>• The crossbow package includes a RangeMaster Scope with a bubble level, the ACUslide Cocking and De-Cocking System</p>\r\n<p>• 6 carbon arrows with 100-grain practice points, a 6 arrow quiver, and a crossbow soft case</p>'),(678551,75,0,182591,'<p>Introducing the Wheeler Armorers Handgun Sight Tool – Your Trusted Companion for Precision Sight Adjustments!</p>\r\n<p>When it comes to accuracy and precision in your handgun shooting, the Wheeler Armorers Handgun Sight Tool is your indispensable ally. This tool is designed to make sight adjustments on your handguns effortless, ensuring that every shot hits its mark with unwavering precision.</p>\r\n<p>Key Features:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Versatile Compatibility:</strong> The Wheeler Armorers Handgun Sight Tool is engineered to accommodate a wide range of handguns, making it a valuable addition to any firearm enthusiast\'s toolkit. Whether you own a Glock, Sig Sauer, Smith &amp; Wesson, or other popular handgun brands, this tool has you covered.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>User-Friendly Design:</strong> Say goodbye to the frustration of trying to adjust your handgun sights with basic tools. This sight tool is specifically designed for ease of use, with adjustable knobs, durable components, and clear instructions to help you achieve precise adjustments with confidence.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Durable Construction:</strong> Crafted from high-quality materials, this sight tool is built to last. Its rugged construction ensures that it can withstand repeated use and perform flawlessly, even in demanding shooting conditions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Enhanced Accuracy:</strong> Achieve unparalleled accuracy and consistency in your shooting with the Wheeler Armorers Handgun Sight Tool. Whether you need to adjust windage, elevation, or both, this tool allows for micro-adjustments that make a significant difference in your shooting performance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Portable and Compact:</strong> This tool is compact and portable, making it easy to carry to the range or keep in your gunsmithing kit. It\'s a must-have accessory for competitive shooters, gunsmiths, and anyone who demands the best from their handgun\'s sights.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Reliable Brand:</strong> Wheeler Engineering is a trusted name in the firearm industry, known for producing high-quality tools and accessories that stand the test of time. You can trust in the Wheeler Armorers Handgun Sight Tool for long-lasting performance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>Elevate your shooting game to new heights and gain confidence in every shot you take with the Wheeler Armorers Handgun Sight Tool. Don\'t settle for less when it comes to precision – equip yourself with the tool that\'s built to deliver results. Upgrade your shooting experience today with the Wheeler Armorers Handgun Sight Tool!</p>'),(678552,76,0,182591,'<p>When it comes to accuracy and precision in your handgun shooting, the Wheeler Armorers Handgun Sight Tool is your indispensable ally.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Precision machined unit</li>\r\n<li>Designed in install, un-install or adjust front and rear dovetail sights</li>\r\n<li>Fully captures and supports slide so it wont deform</li>\r\n<li>Works on all semi auto pistols</li>\r\n</ul>'),(678553,75,0,182614,'<p>TekMat is the creator of original printed cleaning and maintenance mat. Our 17\" TekMats are large enough to handle a fully disassembled handgun with room to spare for tools and accessories.</p>\r\n<p>The 1/8\" padding on these mats not only provides a premium feel and high level of quality but it offers extra protection from any rough handling or drops while working on your firearm.</p>\r\n<p>The ultra soft, oil and water-resistant surface helps protect your firearm from scratches while the diagrams and illustrations help with cleaning, disassembly and are just plain fun to look at.</p>\r\n<p>PROTECT YOUR GUN AND YOUR WORK AREA<br />The soft thermoplastic fiber surface ensures your gun doesn\'t get scratched while the extra thick, 1/8\" vulcanized rubber will protect your work surface and prevent the mat from sliding. This mat will also keep harmful chemicals, oil and dirt from penetrating down to your desk, bench or work area where you normally clean and work on your Glock 42-43.</p>\r\n<p>OVERSIZED DESIGN<br />This Glock 42-43 gun cleaning mat measures 11\" x 17\" and is 1/8\" thick. The oversized design gives you plenty of room to disassemble your handgun and to clean it without having to move parts all over. The thick 1/8\" vulcanized rubber backing ensures the cleaning mat will protect your firearm and work surface.</p>\r\n<p>QUALITY GUN CLEANING MAT<br />This Glock 42-43 gun cleaning mat by TekMat is made to exacting standards. This begins with the water-resistant, scratch proof, fade and oil resistant dye-sublimation printing. This heat transferred printing impregnates the ink into the fibers for a lifetime of durability. TekMat does not silkscreen their designs like a lot of other inferior gun cleaning mat manufacturers.</p>\r\n<p>EASY TO USE<br />This Glock 42-43 gun cleaning mat comes with an overview of the history of the Glock 42-43 as well as a simple to follow parts diagram of the parts that make up your Glock 42-43. The Glock 42-43 cleaning mat rolls up for easy storage along with your other cleaning supplies and accessories.</p>'),(678554,76,0,182614,'<p>The ultra soft, oil and water-resistant surface helps protect your firearm from scratches while the diagrams and illustrations help with cleaning, disassembly and are just plain fun to look at.</p>'),(674812,75,0,182637,'<p>Fully Multi-Coated Optics With Ultra Wide Band Coatings Provide Bright, True to Life Colors.</p>\r\n<p><br />Angle Range Compensation (ARC) Accounts for Terrain Angle, Giving You True Distance to Target on Uphill and Downhill Shots.</p>\r\n<p><br />50% Larger Objective Lens Paired With and All Glass Optical System Bring More Light to your Eye for a Brighter Image, Adding Critical Time to Your Hunt at Dusk and Dawn.</p>\r\n<p><br />Updates Range 4X per Second for Fast, Reliable Ranging</p>\r\n<p><br />Coating Bonds to Exterior Lens Surfaces, and Repels Water, Oil, Fog, Dust and Debris, Protecting you from all Elements Mother Nature Can Throw at you.</p>\r\n<p>Maximum Range: 1300 yds<br />Magnification: 6 x<br />Objective Lens Diameter: 23.5 mm<br />Color: Black<br />Battery Type: CR2 Lithium<br />Magnification Type: Fixed</p>'),(675724,75,1,182637,'<p>Fully Multi-Coated Optics With Ultra Wide Band Coatings Provide Bright, True to Life Colors.</p>\r\n<p><br />Angle Range Compensation (ARC) Accounts for Terrain Angle, Giving You True Distance to Target on Uphill and Downhill Shots.</p>\r\n<p><br />50% Larger Objective Lens Paired With and All Glass Optical System Bring More Light to your Eye for a Brighter Image, Adding Critical Time to Your Hunt at Dusk and Dawn.</p>\r\n<p><br />Updates Range 4X per Second for Fast, Reliable Ranging</p>\r\n<p><br />Coating Bonds to Exterior Lens Surfaces, and Repels Water, Oil, Fog, Dust and Debris, Protecting you from all Elements Mother Nature Can Throw at you.</p>\r\n<p>Maximum Range: 1300 yds<br />Magnification: 6 x<br />Objective Lens Diameter: 23.5 mm<br />Color: Black<br />Battery Type: CR2 Lithium<br />Magnification Type: Fixed</p>'),(674813,76,0,182637,'<p>Maximum Range: 1300 yds<br />Magnification: 6 x<br />Objective Lens Diameter: 23.5 mm<br />Color: Black<br />Battery Type: CR2 Lithium</p>'),(675725,76,1,182637,'<p>Maximum Range: 1300 yds<br />Magnification: 6 x<br />Objective Lens Diameter: 23.5 mm<br />Color: Black<br />Battery Type: CR2 Lithium</p>'),(641854,75,0,182648,'<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-dc91df4a-7fff-a766-67f7-3c0d39f37133\">The twin-illuminated RMR MOA Amb Tri Dual sight features state-of-the-art optic capabilities at a price point that most shooters can afford.</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Whether it’s at dusk, dawn, or even in the middle of the night, the illuminating ability from the Trijicon Rmr will enable more accurate and confident shooting capabilities.</p>\r\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-018955a2-7fff-f53b-e0a2-dad72419451e\"><span></span></span></p>'),(658234,75,1,182648,'<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-dc91df4a-7fff-a766-67f7-3c0d39f37133\">The twin-illuminated RMR MOA Amb Tri Dual sight features state-of-the-art optic capabilities at a price point that most shooters can afford.</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Whether it’s at dusk, dawn, or even in the middle of the night, the illuminating ability from the Trijicon Rmr will enable more accurate and confident shooting capabilities.</p>\r\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-018955a2-7fff-f53b-e0a2-dad72419451e\"><span></span></span></p>'),(641855,76,0,182648,'<p>Dual illuminating shooting sight featuring functional and user-friendly shooting capabilities</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• <span id=\"docs-internal-guid-178c4636-7fff-c62b-a866-f8c1d309c2c5\">Triangle-designed sight enables precision accuracy along with rapid-fire capability, with both methods leaving the shooter confident and accurate</span></p>\r\n<p>• <span id=\"docs-internal-guid-018955a2-7fff-f53b-e0a2-dad72419451e\">Easy to read and dictate bright color scheme that works day or nigh</span></p>'),(658235,76,1,182648,'<p>Dual illuminating shooting sight featuring functional and user-friendly shooting capabilities</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>• <span id=\"docs-internal-guid-178c4636-7fff-c62b-a866-f8c1d309c2c5\">Triangle-designed sight enables precision accuracy along with rapid-fire capability, with both methods leaving the shooter confident and accurate</span></p>\r\n<p>• <span id=\"docs-internal-guid-018955a2-7fff-f53b-e0a2-dad72419451e\">Easy to read and dictate bright color scheme that works day or nigh</span></p>'),(674832,75,0,182671,'<p>Featuring a 34mm tube and a 5x magnification ratio, Riton\'s X5 Conquer 5-25×50 has the perfect combination of clarity and durability to ensure every shot is a success.</p>\r\n<p>With a First Focal Plane (FFP) reticle, integrated throw lever, advanced Riton R5 Zero Stop turrets, this optic will allow for fast on target shots at any distance.</p>\r\n<p>Equipped with Riton\'s R5 Zero Stop Turrets for Instant and Reliable Return to Zero</p>\r\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Integrated Removable Throw Lever<br />1/4 MOA Windage and Elevation Adjustment<br />6 levels of red illumination featuring on/off between each level<br />Fast-Focus Eyepiece<br />Assembled in EP-Level Clean Room<br />100% Waterproof, Fog proof and Shockproof (tested up to 1200 G\'s)<br />Aircraft Grade Aluminum with Rugged Design Ready for the Toughest Environments</p>\r\n<p><strong>Technical Specifications:</strong><br />Magnification: 5-25<br />Parallax Adjustment: 10-infinity<br />Tube Diameter: 34mm<br />Objective Lens Diameter: 50mm<br />Focal Lens Position: First Focal Plane<br />Lens Coating: Fully Multi-Coated, Full Wide Band, Waterproof Coated, Low Light Enhancement<br />Reticle: BAF, Illuminated<br />Field of View at 100 yds: 22.5ft-4.5ft<br />Material: 6061-T6<br />Eye Relief: 3.7in/95mm<br />Exit Pupil: Low 10.2mm-High 2.2mm<br />Click Value at 100 yds/mm: 1/4<br />Adjustment Range: 70 MOA<br />Mounting Length: 7.75in/196mm<br />Length: 15.37in/390mm<br />Weight: 34oz/963g<br />Included Items: Flip Up Lens Covers, Lens Cloth, Allen Wrench</p>'),(675726,75,1,182671,'<p>Featuring a 34mm tube and a 5x magnification ratio, Riton\'s X5 Conquer 5-25×50 has the perfect combination of clarity and durability to ensure every shot is a success.</p>\r\n<p>With a First Focal Plane (FFP) reticle, integrated throw lever, advanced Riton R5 Zero Stop turrets, this optic will allow for fast on target shots at any distance.</p>\r\n<p>Equipped with Riton\'s R5 Zero Stop Turrets for Instant and Reliable Return to Zero</p>\r\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Integrated Removable Throw Lever<br />1/4 MOA Windage and Elevation Adjustment<br />6 levels of red illumination featuring on/off between each level<br />Fast-Focus Eyepiece<br />Assembled in EP-Level Clean Room<br />100% Waterproof, Fog proof and Shockproof (tested up to 1200 G\'s)<br />Aircraft Grade Aluminum with Rugged Design Ready for the Toughest Environments</p>\r\n<p><strong>Technical Specifications:</strong><br />Magnification: 5-25<br />Parallax Adjustment: 10-infinity<br />Tube Diameter: 34mm<br />Objective Lens Diameter: 50mm<br />Focal Lens Position: First Focal Plane<br />Lens Coating: Fully Multi-Coated, Full Wide Band, Waterproof Coated, Low Light Enhancement<br />Reticle: BAF, Illuminated<br />Field of View at 100 yds: 22.5ft-4.5ft<br />Material: 6061-T6<br />Eye Relief: 3.7in/95mm<br />Exit Pupil: Low 10.2mm-High 2.2mm<br />Click Value at 100 yds/mm: 1/4<br />Adjustment Range: 70 MOA<br />Mounting Length: 7.75in/196mm<br />Length: 15.37in/390mm<br />Weight: 34oz/963g<br />Included Items: Flip Up Lens Covers, Lens Cloth, Allen Wrench</p>'),(674833,76,0,182671,'<p>Magnification: 5-25<br />Parallax Adjustment: 10-infinity<br />Tube Diameter: 34mm<br />Objective Lens Diameter: 50mm<br />Focal Lens Position: First Focal Plane</p>'),(675727,76,1,182671,'<p>Magnification: 5-25<br />Parallax Adjustment: 10-infinity<br />Tube Diameter: 34mm<br />Objective Lens Diameter: 50mm<br />Focal Lens Position: First Focal Plane</p>'),(382761,85,0,182900,'Crosman SBR Full Automatic CO2 Target BB Rifle,  '),(658236,85,1,182900,'Crosman SBR Full Automatic CO2 Target BB Rifle,  '),(678543,75,0,182980,'<p>Cover most of your AR-15 service needs with a single tool. An innovative layered and laminated stamped steel construction makes the Delta Series Combo Tool the most durable AR tool available.</p>\r\n<p>This construction method allows the use of hardened steel barrel nut pins designed to hold up to heavy torque requirements. A cut out for a 1/2 drive allows the tool to be used with a torque wrench or ratchet driver.</p>\r\n<p>Profiles for buffer tube lock nut and flash hider are included. The addition of a bit driver and bit holder with six common bits adds to the versatility.</p>'),(644788,75,1,182987,'<p><strong>The Ravin Serving and String Fluid will keep you in the field and in pursuit all season long without having to worry about the string performance. </strong></p>\r\n<p>Made from a polymeric lubricant material can be applied to the middle of your archery string, to increase performance and longevity.</p>\r\n<p>This odor free lubricant is also waterproof and will withstand brutal weather including cooler temperatures. Apply 1-2 times per year for optimal performance.</p>'),(644789,76,1,182987,'<p><strong>Made from a polymeric lubricant material can be applied to the middle of your archery string, to increase performance and longevity. </strong></p>\r\n<p>• Apply 1-2 times per year for optimal performance</p>\r\n<p>• Non-wax material that stands up to cold winter temperatures</p>'),(382774,85,0,183007,'Bulldog Economy Black Range Bag w Strap, Range bag, holsters and belts '),(658239,85,1,183007,'Bulldog Economy Black Range Bag w Strap, Range bag, holsters and belts '),(644729,75,1,183021,'<p><strong>The most compact and devastating crossbow in its class has emerged \" the HyperTac™ 420. </strong></p>\r\n<p>A newly designed and ultra-compact riser assembly paired with the tactical-style adjustable butt stock renders this bow unbelievably maneuverable in tight quarters</p>\r\n<p>The bow amplifies Barnett\'s Hyper™ series crossbow lineup and shoots the small-diameter, extreme penetrating HyperFlite™ .204 diameter arrows.</p>'),(644730,76,1,183021,'<p><strong>The most compact and devastating crossbow in its class has emerged \" the HyperTac™ 420</strong></p>\r\n<p>• A newly designed and ultra-compact riser assembly paired with the tactical-style adjustable butt stock renders this bow unbelievably maneuverable in tight quarters</p>\r\n<p>• The bundle comes in yellow, red, silver and green</p>\r\n<p>• Great way to find your arrow or bolt in low light conditions</p>'),(382728,85,0,183021,'Barnett Hypertac 420, archery, '),(644731,85,1,183021,'Barnett Hypertac 420, archery, '),(382546,75,0,183022,'<p><span>XRAY Paper Deer Target 25 x 25 (6pk) These large, 4-color targets feature x-ray anatomy to help shooters understand and visualize an animals vitals zone. By learning the anatomy of an animal, hunters can practice making clean, ethical shots in the field. Ideal for educating new hunters on shot placement. Features &amp; Benefits: - High contrast targets for increased visibility - Identified vital zone improves shot placement - Realistic targets boost shooting confidence</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">High contrast targets for increased visibility</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Identified vital zone improves shot placement</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Realistic targets boost shooting confidence</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">High contrast targets for increased visibility</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Identified vital zone improves shot placement</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Realistic targets boost shooting confidence</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">4-color target</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">The perfect way to dial in the accuracy of your firearm</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(658240,75,1,183022,'<p><span>XRAY Paper Deer Target 25 x 25 (6pk) These large, 4-color targets feature x-ray anatomy to help shooters understand and visualize an animals vitals zone. By learning the anatomy of an animal, hunters can practice making clean, ethical shots in the field. Ideal for educating new hunters on shot placement. Features &amp; Benefits: - High contrast targets for increased visibility - Identified vital zone improves shot placement - Realistic targets boost shooting confidence</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">High contrast targets for increased visibility</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Identified vital zone improves shot placement</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Realistic targets boost shooting confidence</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">High contrast targets for increased visibility</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Identified vital zone improves shot placement</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Realistic targets boost shooting confidence</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">4-color target</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">The perfect way to dial in the accuracy of your firearm</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(382713,85,0,183022,'Champion Deer Target, paper deer targets, shooting targets, 6 pack of shooting targets'),(658241,85,1,183022,'Champion Deer Target, paper deer targets, shooting targets, 6 pack of shooting targets'),(382743,85,0,183142,'Tenpoint Pro Elite 400 Carbon Arrows 20 White, Arrows, white, carbon arrows, Tenpoint, '),(658242,85,1,183142,'Tenpoint Pro Elite 400 Carbon Arrows 20 White, Arrows, white, carbon arrows, Tenpoint, '),(382551,75,0,183188,'<h1 class=\"page-title\"><span>Cocking your crossbow has never been easier with Barnett’s Crank Cocking Device. This easy-to-install crossbow accessory attaches to the stock of your crossbow to reduce cocking resistance by as much as 93 percent. It won’t impact your shooting experience, but it will get you ready to shoot faster and with less physical strain. This CCD is sized to fit Hyperghost 425 and Hyperghost 405 Barnett crossbow models.</span></h1>\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Barnett Crossbows | The most trusted name in crossbows since 1952</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Barnett’s HyperGhost Crank Cocking Device will get you ready to shoot your crossbow faster and with less physical strain without impacting your shooting experience - Simply turn cranking handle to pull back string</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">CCD is sized to fit Hyperghost 425 and Hyperghost 405 crossbow models | Includes crank and all installation hardware</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Easy-to-install crossbow accessory attaches to the stock of your crossbow to reduce cocking resistance by as much as 93 percent | 13 lbs. maximum force required to turn crank</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Handle adjusts for right- or left-handed use</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Sport type: Hunting</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(658244,75,1,183188,'<h1 class=\"page-title\"><span>Cocking your crossbow has never been easier with Barnett’s Crank Cocking Device. This easy-to-install crossbow accessory attaches to the stock of your crossbow to reduce cocking resistance by as much as 93 percent. It won’t impact your shooting experience, but it will get you ready to shoot faster and with less physical strain. This CCD is sized to fit Hyperghost 425 and Hyperghost 405 Barnett crossbow models.</span></h1>\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Barnett Crossbows | The most trusted name in crossbows since 1952</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Barnett’s HyperGhost Crank Cocking Device will get you ready to shoot your crossbow faster and with less physical strain without impacting your shooting experience - Simply turn cranking handle to pull back string</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">CCD is sized to fit Hyperghost 425 and Hyperghost 405 crossbow models | Includes crank and all installation hardware</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Easy-to-install crossbow accessory attaches to the stock of your crossbow to reduce cocking resistance by as much as 93 percent | 13 lbs. maximum force required to turn crank</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Handle adjusts for right- or left-handed use</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\">Sport type: Hunting</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(382718,85,0,183188,'Barnett Hyperghost Ccd, Barnett, crank cocking device, hyperghost 425, hyperghost 405'),(658245,85,1,183188,'Barnett Hyperghost Ccd, Barnett, crank cocking device, hyperghost 425, hyperghost 405'),(382717,85,0,183209,'Reddot 30mm Xbow 3dot Black, Red-dot, crossbow red-dot, red dot scope'),(658246,85,1,183209,'Reddot 30mm Xbow 3dot Black, Red-dot, crossbow red-dot, red dot scope'),(382734,85,0,183351,'Sig Holster P365xl Owb Rh, Holster, '),(658247,85,1,183351,'Sig Holster P365xl Owb Rh, Holster, '),(674810,75,0,183357,'<p>Demand truly long-range precision and a premium feature set from the Trijicon AccuPoint® 4-24x50.</p>\r\n<p>The impressive magnification range offers versatility, with the Duplex reticle designed for accurate shot placement.</p>\r\n<p>Fully multi-coated broadband anti-reflective glass, outstanding low-light performance, and precise, repeatable adjusters make this scope the optimal choice for long-range hunting and shooting.</p>\r\n<p><br />Length x Width x Height:14.4 in x 2.9 in x 2.4 in (365.76mm x 73.66mm x 60.96mm)<br />Weight: 26.8 oz. (759.77g)<br />Magnification: 4-24x<br />Objective Size: 50mm<br />Tube Size: 30mm<br />Reticle Pattern: Triangle Post<br />Day Reticle Color: Amber<br />Focal Plane: Second<br />Illumination Source: Tritium / Fiber Optic<br />Power Source: Tritium / Fiber Optic<br />Adjustment: 1/4 MOA per click<br />Adjustment Range: 100 MOA Elevation, 70 MOA Windage<br />Eye Relief: 3.1 in.-3.8 in. (78.74mm-96.52mm)<br />Exit Pupil: 0.33 in.-0.08 in. (8.38mm-2.03mm)<br />Field of View (degrees): 5.43°-0.91°<br />Field of View (feet): 28.5 ft.-4.7 ft. @ 100 yds. (9.5-1.57m @ 100m)<br />Housing Material: 6061 Aircraft Grade Aluminum<br />Finish: Satin Black</p>'),(675730,75,1,183357,'<p>Demand truly long-range precision and a premium feature set from the Trijicon AccuPoint® 4-24x50.</p>\r\n<p>The impressive magnification range offers versatility, with the Duplex reticle designed for accurate shot placement.</p>\r\n<p>Fully multi-coated broadband anti-reflective glass, outstanding low-light performance, and precise, repeatable adjusters make this scope the optimal choice for long-range hunting and shooting.</p>\r\n<p><br />Length x Width x Height:14.4 in x 2.9 in x 2.4 in (365.76mm x 73.66mm x 60.96mm)<br />Weight: 26.8 oz. (759.77g)<br />Magnification: 4-24x<br />Objective Size: 50mm<br />Tube Size: 30mm<br />Reticle Pattern: Triangle Post<br />Day Reticle Color: Amber<br />Focal Plane: Second<br />Illumination Source: Tritium / Fiber Optic<br />Power Source: Tritium / Fiber Optic<br />Adjustment: 1/4 MOA per click<br />Adjustment Range: 100 MOA Elevation, 70 MOA Windage<br />Eye Relief: 3.1 in.-3.8 in. (78.74mm-96.52mm)<br />Exit Pupil: 0.33 in.-0.08 in. (8.38mm-2.03mm)<br />Field of View (degrees): 5.43°-0.91°<br />Field of View (feet): 28.5 ft.-4.7 ft. @ 100 yds. (9.5-1.57m @ 100m)<br />Housing Material: 6061 Aircraft Grade Aluminum<br />Finish: Satin Black</p>'),(674811,76,0,183357,'<p>Exit Pupil: 0.33 in.-0.08 in. (8.38mm-2.03mm)<br />Field of View (degrees): 5.43°-0.91°<br />Field of View (feet): 28.5 ft.-4.7 ft. @ 100 yds. (9.5-1.57m @ 100m)<br />Housing Material: 6061 Aircraft Grade Aluminum<br />Finish: Satin Black</p>'),(675731,76,1,183357,'<p>Exit Pupil: 0.33 in.-0.08 in. (8.38mm-2.03mm)<br />Field of View (degrees): 5.43°-0.91°<br />Field of View (feet): 28.5 ft.-4.7 ft. @ 100 yds. (9.5-1.57m @ 100m)<br />Housing Material: 6061 Aircraft Grade Aluminum<br />Finish: Satin Black</p>'),(382735,85,0,183596,'Pulsar Helion 2 Xp50 2.5-20 Thermal Monocular, thermal monocular, optics, hunting gear, '),(658248,85,1,183596,'Pulsar Helion 2 Xp50 2.5-20 Thermal Monocular, thermal monocular, optics, hunting gear, '),(551982,75,0,183644,'<p><strong>The Bear and Son Cutlery Survivor Series black folder was designed for the backpacker in mind. </strong></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Handle Material: Stainless Steel Frame Lock</p>\r\n<p>Blade Options: 440 Stainless Steel, Black Coated</p>\r\n<p>Open Length: 5 5/8\"</p>\r\n<p>Closed Lenth: 3 3/8\"</p>\r\n<p>Blade Length: 2 3/8\"</p>\r\n<p>Weight: 1.8 oz.</p>'),(551984,75,1,183644,'<p><strong>The Bear and Son Cutlery Survivor Series black folder was designed for the backpacker in mind. </strong></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><strong>Handle Material:</strong> Stainless Steel Frame Lock</p>\r\n<p><strong>Blade Options:</strong> 440 Stainless Steel, Black Coated</p>\r\n<p><strong>Open Length:</strong> 5 5/8\"</p>\r\n<p><strong>Closed Lenth:</strong> 3 3/8\"</p>\r\n<p><strong>Blade Length:</strong> 2 3/8\"</p>\r\n<p><strong>Weight:</strong> 1.8 oz.</p>'),(551983,76,0,183644,'<p>Handle Material: Stainless Steel Frame Lock</p>\r\n<p>Blade Options: 440 Stainless Steel, Black Coated</p>\r\n<p>Open Length: 5 5/8\"</p>\r\n<p>Closed Lenth: 3 3/8\"</p>\r\n<p>Blade Length: 2 3/8\"</p>\r\n<p>Weight: 1.8 oz.</p>'),(551985,76,1,183644,'<p>Handle Material: Stainless Steel Frame Lock</p>\r\n<p>Blade Options: 440 Stainless Steel, Black Coated</p>\r\n<p>Open Length: 5 5/8\"</p>\r\n<p>Closed Lenth: 3 3/8\"</p>\r\n<p>Blade Length: 2 3/8\"</p>\r\n<p>Weight: 1.8 oz.</p>'),(551959,75,0,183660,'<p><span>Handle Material: G10 with Stainless Steel Hidden Liners</span><br /><span>Blade Options: 440 Stainless Steel</span><br /><span>Open Length: 7 5/8”</span><br /><span>Closed Length: 4 1/2”</span><br /><span>Blade Length: 3 3/8”</span><br /><span>Weight: 3.1 oz.</span><br /><span>Features: Smooth Action Ball Bearing Washers, Reversible Clip for Left or Right Hand</span></p>'),(658249,75,1,183660,'<p><span>Handle Material: G10 with Stainless Steel Hidden Liners</span><br /><span>Blade Options: 440 Stainless Steel</span><br /><span>Open Length: 7 5/8”</span><br /><span>Closed Length: 4 1/2”</span><br /><span>Blade Length: 3 3/8”</span><br /><span>Weight: 3.1 oz.</span><br /><span>Features: Smooth Action Ball Bearing Washers, Reversible Clip for Left or Right Hand</span></p>'),(551960,76,0,183660,'<p>G10 with Stainless Steel Hidden Liners</p>\r\n<p>Open Length: 7 5/8”</p>\r\n<p>Closed Length: 4 1/2”</p>'),(658250,76,1,183660,'<p>G10 with Stainless Steel Hidden Liners</p>\r\n<p>Open Length: 7 5/8”</p>\r\n<p>Closed Length: 4 1/2”</p>'),(675646,75,0,183684,'<p>Introducing the ultimate optical solution for modern semi-automatic pistols, MSR platforms, and shotguns.</p>\r\n<p>Our product is specifically designed for short and medium-range engagements and recreational shooting, catering to a wide range of calibers and light conditions.</p>\r\n<p>Equipped with a 1x magnification and 20mm objective clear aperture, our product boasts the perfect combination of speed and accuracy.</p>\r\n<p>Our product is fully ruggedized and impact-resistant, capable of withstanding the toughest environments. It features an ultra-durable and lightweight 7075 aluminum main housing and components, with a 1.41\" riser mount and additional lower 1/3 co-witness spacer for optimum stability.</p>\r\n<p>Users have the option of selecting from four different integrated reticle options (Dot, Circle-Dot, Dot with Holds, Circle-Dot with Holds). Our product features the 1 MOA Red Dot Ballistic Circle Plex reticle, which enables precise targeting for short and medium-range engagements.</p>\r\n<p>Our product comes standard with solid and see-through lens covers, and hex bolt mounts. It has undergone complete Mil-Spec 810G testing and is submersible up to 20 meters, making it the perfect companion for those who love the great outdoors.</p>\r\n<p>With a runtime in excess of 100,000 hours, our product ensures a long-lasting and reliable performance with solar and battery usage. The Ballistic Circle-Dot and Ballistic CirclePlex reticle options ensure optimum precision and accuracy, catering to the needs of both amateur and professional shooters alike.</p>\r\n<p>Experience unparalleled accuracy and speed with our product. Join the league of champions and take your shooting game to the next level!</p>'),(675732,75,1,183684,'<p>Introducing the ultimate optical solution for modern semi-automatic pistols, MSR platforms, and shotguns.</p>\r\n<p>Our product is specifically designed for short and medium-range engagements and recreational shooting, catering to a wide range of calibers and light conditions.</p>\r\n<p>Equipped with a 1x magnification and 20mm objective clear aperture, our product boasts the perfect combination of speed and accuracy.</p>\r\n<p>Our product is fully ruggedized and impact-resistant, capable of withstanding the toughest environments. It features an ultra-durable and lightweight 7075 aluminum main housing and components, with a 1.41\" riser mount and additional lower 1/3 co-witness spacer for optimum stability.</p>\r\n<p>Users have the option of selecting from four different integrated reticle options (Dot, Circle-Dot, Dot with Holds, Circle-Dot with Holds). Our product features the 1 MOA Red Dot Ballistic Circle Plex reticle, which enables precise targeting for short and medium-range engagements.</p>\r\n<p>Our product comes standard with solid and see-through lens covers, and hex bolt mounts. It has undergone complete Mil-Spec 810G testing and is submersible up to 20 meters, making it the perfect companion for those who love the great outdoors.</p>\r\n<p>With a runtime in excess of 100,000 hours, our product ensures a long-lasting and reliable performance with solar and battery usage. The Ballistic Circle-Dot and Ballistic CirclePlex reticle options ensure optimum precision and accuracy, catering to the needs of both amateur and professional shooters alike.</p>\r\n<p>Experience unparalleled accuracy and speed with our product. Join the league of champions and take your shooting game to the next level!</p>'),(675647,76,0,183684,'<p>MAGNIFICATION: 1x<br />OBJECTIVE CLEAR APERTURE: 20 mm<br />RETICLE: 1 MOA Red Dot Ballistic Circle Plex<br />ADJUSTMENT INCREMENTS: 0.5 MOA</p>'),(675733,76,1,183684,'<p>MAGNIFICATION: 1x<br />OBJECTIVE CLEAR APERTURE: 20 mm<br />RETICLE: 1 MOA Red Dot Ballistic Circle Plex<br />ADJUSTMENT INCREMENTS: 0.5 MOA</p>'),(672835,75,0,183771,'<p>Made for style and extra comfort, these Walker\'s Game Ear earmuffs fit both women and youth with smaller head sizes. </p>\r\n<p>The folding design ensures it\'s easy to take these earmuffs with you as you travel, so you have them on hand to protect your ears from loud noises.</p>\r\n<p>Low profile, ultra slim ear cups<br />Ideal for smaller heads<br />women &amp; youth<br />Padded headband for comfortable fit<br />Soft PVC ear pads<br />Ultra-light weight<br />Compact folding design<br />Noise reducing rating, NRR 27dB<br />ANSI S3.19 rated<br /><br /></p>'),(676008,75,1,183771,'<p>Made for style and extra comfort, these Walker\'s Game Ear earmuffs fit both women and youth with smaller head sizes. </p>\r\n<p>The folding design ensures it\'s easy to take these earmuffs with you as you travel, so you have them on hand to protect your ears from loud noises.</p>\r\n<p>Low profile, ultra slim ear cups<br />Ideal for smaller heads<br />women &amp; youth<br />Padded headband for comfortable fit<br />Soft PVC ear pads<br />Ultra-light weight<br />Compact folding design<br />Noise reducing rating, NRR 27dB<br />ANSI S3.19 rated<br /><br /></p>'),(672836,76,0,183771,'<p>Low profile, ultra slim ear cups<br />Ideal for smaller heads<br />women &amp; youth<br />Padded headband for comfortable fit</p>'),(676009,76,1,183771,'<p>Low profile, ultra slim ear cups<br />Ideal for smaller heads<br />women &amp; youth<br />Padded headband for comfortable fit</p>'),(669912,75,1,183851,'<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Enhance Your Shooting Accuracy with the Trijicon ACOG 4x32 Green LED .223 Chevron Reticle: Unmatched Precision in Every Shot</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Elevate your shooting game with the Trijicon ACOG 4x32 Green LED .223 Chevron Reticle with TA51 Mount from Everest. </span><strong>Engineered to deliver exceptional accuracy and reliability, this cutting-edge scope is your perfect companion for hitting targets with pinpoint precision.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Advanced Green LED Illumination:</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> The Trijicon ACOG 4x32 features a highly visible green LED illuminated Chevron reticle, ensuring rapid target acquisition and precise shot placement in various lighting conditions. Enjoy unmatched clarity and enhanced shooting performance.</span></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>.223 Chevron Reticle: </strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Equipped with a specialized .223 Chevron reticle, this scope offers bullet drop compensation for improved accuracy at different distances. Say goodbye to guesswork and hello to consistent and reliable shots.</span></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Crystal-Clear Optics:</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> The 4x32 magnification delivers crisp and clear images, allowing you to identify and engage targets with confidence. Whether you\'re in close-quarters or reaching out to distant targets, this scope ensures you never miss a shot.</span></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Rugged Durability: </strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Crafted from robust materials, this Trijicon ACOG scope is built to withstand tough conditions and recoil. Its rugged construction ensures your optics stay on target, maintaining reliability in the most demanding shooting scenarios.</span></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>TA51 Mount for Stability: </strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The included TA51 mount guarantees a secure attachment to your firearm. Designed for stability and quick target acquisition, this mount complements the scope\'s performance, making it an essential component of your shooting setup.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">Why Choose the Trijicon ACOG 4x32 Green LED .223 Chevron Reticle?</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">When accuracy matters, the Trijicon ACOG 4x32 Green LED .223 Chevron Reticle stands out as a game-changing optics solution. Whether you\'re a professional shooter, a hunter, or a tactical enthusiast, this scope empowers you to achieve consistent and precise shots like never before.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">Upgrade Your Shooting Experience – Order Now!</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">Don\'t compromise on accuracy and performance. Elevate your shooting capabilities with the Trijicon ACOG 4x32 Green LED .223 Chevron Reticle with TA51 Mount, available at Everest. Experience the difference that advanced optics can make in your shooting endeavors. Place your order today and revolutionize your shooting accuracy.</span></p>'),(669911,76,1,183851,'<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Magnification: 4x</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Objective Size: 32mm</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bullet Drop Compensator: Yes</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Day Reticle Color: Green</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Night Reticle Color: Green</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(678547,75,0,183952,'<p>Cover most of your AR-15 service needs with a single tool.</p>\r\n<p>An innovative layered and laminated stamped steel construction makes the Delta Series Combo Tool the most durable AR tool available.</p>\r\n<p>This construction method allows the use of hardened steel barrel nut pins designed to hold up to heavy torque requirements.</p>\r\n<p>A cut out for a 1/2 drive allows the tool to be used with a torque wrench or ratchet driver. Profiles for buffer tube lock nut and flash hider are included.</p>\r\n<p>The addition of a bit driver and bit holder with six common bits adds to the versatility. Includes a torque wrench to ensure proper barrel nut torque for maximum accuracy.</p>'),(678548,76,0,183952,'<p>Cover most of your AR-15 service needs with a single tool.</p>'),(657624,75,1,184097,'<p><strong>Introducing the Trijicon ACOG 3x30 Horseshoe Amber Chevron Riflescope - Your Ultimate Precision Companion for .308 Rifles!</strong></p>\r\n<p>Elevate your shooting experience like the pros with the <strong>Trijicon ACOG 3x30 Horseshoe Amber Chevron</strong>, specifically designed for .308 caliber rifles.</p>\r\n<p>This particular cutting-edge riflescope combines unmatched optical clarity, battle-proven durability, and intuitive design to give you the upper hand in any shooting scenario.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features of the Trijicon ACOG 3x30 Horseshoe Amber Chevron:</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Crystal Clear Optics: The ACOG 3x30 boasts premium quality glass that delivers exceptional clarity, ensuring you never miss a target, whether you\'re hunting, competing, or in a tactical situation.</li>\r\n<li>Horseshoe Amber Chevron Reticle: The illuminated Horseshoe Amber Chevron reticle enhances target acquisition in various lighting conditions, providing rapid aiming and precise shot placement.</li>\r\n<li>Built Like a Tank: Crafted from rugged materials and rigorously tested to military standards, this ACOG is designed to withstand the harshest environments, making it the perfect choice for outdoor enthusiasts and professionals alike.</li>\r\n<li>Fixed 3x Magnification: The 3x magnification strikes an ideal balance between close-quarters engagement and mid-range precision, making it versatile for a wide range of shooting applications.</li>\r\n<li>Both-Eyes-Open Design: The Bindon Aiming Concept (BAC) allows you to keep both eyes open while aiming, providing you with enhanced situational awareness and rapid target transitions.</li>\r\n<li>Aircraft-Grade Aluminum Housing: The robust, forged aluminum housing is nitrogen-filled and O-ring sealed to ensure fog-proof, waterproof, and shockproof performance.</li>\r\n<li>Easy-to-Adjust Controls: The finger-adjustable turrets provide precise and tool-free windage and elevation adjustments, allowing you to fine-tune your shots effortlessly.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Why Choose the Trijicon ACOG 3x30 for Your .308 Rifle?</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Unmatched Accuracy: The Amber Chevron reticle facilitates lightning-fast target acquisition and shot placement, making it perfect for both beginners and experienced shooters.</li>\r\n<li>Uncompromising Durability: Built to military specifications, this riflescope can endure the toughest conditions and keep delivering exceptional performance.</li>\r\n<li>Low-Light Dominance: Whether you\'re hunting at dawn or dusk or navigating low-light environments, the illuminated reticle ensures you never lose sight of your target.</li>\r\n<li>Quick Installation: The Trijicon ACOG comes complete with a TA60 mount, simplifying the installation process, and allowing you to hit the range or field sooner.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Specs:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Magnification: 3x</li>\r\n<li>Objective Size: 30mm</li>\r\n<li>Bullet Drop Compensator: Yes</li>\r\n<li>Length: 6.1 in.</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 7.7 oz.</li>\r\n<li>Illumination Source: Fiber Optics &amp; Tritium</li>\r\n<li>Reticle Pattern: Chevron</li>\r\n<li>Day Reticle Color: Amber</li>\r\n<li>Night Reticle Color: Amber</li>\r\n<li>Calibration: .308</li>\r\n<li>Bindon Aiming Concept: Yes</li>\r\n<li>Eye Relief: 1.9 in.</li>\r\n<li>Exit Pupil: 0.33 in.</li>\r\n<li>Field of View (Degrees): 3.7°</li>\r\n<li>Field of View @ 100 yards (ft): 19.3 ft. / 6.5m</li>\r\n<li>Adjustment @ 100 yards (clicks/in): 4 clicks / in.</li>\r\n<li>Mount Comes With: TA60</li>\r\n<li>Housing Material: Forged Aluminum</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Unlock your 308\'s true potential and gain the edge you need with the Trijicon ACOG 3x30 Horseshoe Amber Chevron Riflescope. Elevate your shooting game to the next level and experience precision like never before.</p>\r\n<p>Order now while in stock to experience the Trijicon advantage and revolutionize your shooting experience. Dominate the field, trust in Trijicon!</p>'),(657625,76,1,184097,'<p>The new 3x30mm model is designed for law enforcement and military applications- where the combination of ample magnification, low light capability and long eye relief make the TA33 the Trijicon ACOG of choice. This ACOG scope features Dual Illumination Amber Chevron .308 Ballistic Reticle.</p>\r\n<p>• Magnification: 3x</p>\r\n<p>• Objective Size: 30mm</p>\r\n<p>• Mount Comes With: TA60</p>'),(657630,75,1,184125,'<p><strong>The HME Folding Saw has a 7 carbon steel blade with coating to resist rust. </strong></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>The blade locks in open and closed positions and has a pistol grip handle to help prevent accidental slippage. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Aggressively cuts on each pull stroke. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Perfect for cutting shooting lanes, clearing trails, turkey hunting, camping, or hiking. </p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(657631,76,1,184125,'<p>The HME Folding Saw has a 7 carbon steel blade with coating to resist rust.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• Cutting shooting lanes</p>\r\n<p>• Clearing trails for turkey hunting</p>\r\n<p>• Great for campsites</p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(644670,75,1,184136,'<p><strong>The Allen Moa100 Crossbow Bolt 20 premium arrows come in a four-pack of hunting fury.  </strong></p>\r\n<p>Designed for high impact and unparalleled shooting accuracy, the Crossbow Bolt 20 premium arrows can take down big game animals.</p>\r\n<p>Whether you\'re a target shooter taking aim at a target behind the house or a serious hunter looking to take down their next quarry, the Allen Moa100 Crossbow Bolt 20 are the premium arrows capable of getting the job done.</p>'),(644671,76,1,184136,'<p><strong>4 premium crossbow arrows included in every order</strong></p>\r\n<p>Preferred by hunters and sporting shooters looking for a professional grade arrow</p>\r\n<p>9.95 grains per inch provide ultimate shooting balance</p>'),(382739,85,0,184175,'DeSantis Slim Tuck Kydex Holster RH MP Shield, Holster, '),(658251,85,1,184175,'DeSantis Slim Tuck Kydex Holster RH MP Shield, Holster, '),(644597,75,1,184184,'<p><strong>The Wicked Ridge Crossbow Rope Cocker is a high-capacity polyester cord with two in-plastic handles and two super-tough plastic hooks. </strong></p>\r\n<p>They are used to help users pull back on their crossbow, the Wicked Ridge Crossbow.</p>'),(644598,76,1,184184,'<p><strong>Ultra-durable construction  </strong></p>\r\n<p>• Abrasion resistant</p>\r\n<p>• Available in Hi Vis orange</p>\r\n<p>• Ultra tough construction</p>'),(657634,75,1,184334,'<p>The Primos® Hook Hunter™ Series mouth calls produce incredibly real and unique pitches that even the wisest ole’ tom can’t resist. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Custom designed by combining 100+ years of experience by passionate, determined turkey hunters with premium gauge reeds and precision hand made cuts. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>You’ll be hooked by how effortless these calls are to use; he’ll be hooked when you “Speak His Language!</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• Two latex reeds</p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(657635,76,1,184334,'<p>The Primos® Hook Hunter™ Series mouth calls produce incredibly real and unique pitches that even the wisest ole’ tom can’t resist. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>• real and unique pitches that even the wisest ole’ tom can’t resist</p>\r\n<p>• Custom designed by combining 100+ years of experience</p>\r\n<p>• Two latex reeds</p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(672841,75,0,184504,'<p>18 oz Size<br />Cleans clothing and attacks odors<br />No UV brighteners<br />Special unscented formula<br />H-E formula for use in standard top loading and in high efficiency front loading washing machines</p>'),(675863,75,1,184504,'<p>18 oz Size<br />Cleans clothing and attacks odors<br />No UV brighteners<br />Special unscented formula<br />H-E formula for use in standard top loading and in high efficiency front loading washing machines</p>'),(672842,76,0,184504,'<p>18 oz Size<br />Cleans clothing and attacks odors<br />No UV brighteners</p>'),(675864,76,1,184504,'<p>18 oz Size<br />Cleans clothing and attacks odors<br />No UV brighteners</p>'),(678589,75,0,184601,'<p><strong>Introducing the Most Compact Sight in its Class!</strong></p>\r\n<p>Experience the ultimate in compactness and convenience with our latest innovation. The XPS series red dot sight takes the concept of streamlined design to a whole new level.</p>\r\n<p>This remarkable sight is not only smaller and lighter than any other holographic weapon sight in the HWS range but also operates efficiently on a single 123 battery. With the new single battery configuration, the XPS offers an unprecedented advantage, allowing for more rail space than ever before.</p>\r\n<p>This extra room gives you the flexibility to mount rear iron sights, magnifiers, or night vision mounts alongside your XPS.</p>\r\n<p>Compact, Lightweight, and Lightning-Fast The XPS series delivers a combination of features that make it the ideal choice for your firearm platform. Its operation is centered on optics that provide transmission holography with parallax-free performance at 1x magnification, ensuring rapid target acquisition. You\'ll enjoy unlimited eye relief for an enhanced shooting experience.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Impressive Specs:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Dimensions: Measuring at just 3.5\" in length, 2\" in width, and 2.4\" in height, the XPS is impressively compact.</li>\r\n<li>Featherweight: At only 8 ounces (227 grams), it won\'t weigh you down, making it perfect for those who demand agility and precision.</li>\r\n<li>Extreme Temperature Tolerance: Designed to withstand temperatures ranging from -40 to 150 degrees Fahrenheit.</li>\r\n<li>Waterproof: Fully submersible to a depth of 10 feet, it\'s built to handle even the harshest conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Fogproof: Internal optics are sealed to prevent fogging, ensuring clear vision in various environments.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Precision Adjustments:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjust with Confidence: Each click equals 0.5 MOA (1/2 inch at 100 yards), offering precise control.</li>\r\n<li>Wide Adjustment Range: +/- 40 MOA travel for both windage and elevation adjustments.</li>\r\n<li>Secure Mounting: Compatible with 1\" Weaver or Picatinny (MIL-STD-1913) rails, ensuring a rock-solid attachment.</li>\r\n<li>Consistent Accuracy: Enjoy a return to zero, repeatable to 2 MOA after re-mounting.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Impressive Heads-Up Display Window:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Anti-Glare Coating: Optical surfaces are treated to reduce glare, providing clear sight picture even in bright conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Generous Field of View: A field of view of 30 yards at 100 yards with a 4\" eye relief ensures you maintain situational awareness.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Electrical Excellence:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Brightness Control: Adjust your reticle with a wide range from the brightest to the lowest settings, with 20 options available.</li>\r\n<li>Long Battery Life: Powered by a single 123 lithium battery, the XPS boasts 600 continuous hours at nominal setting 12.</li>\r\n<li>Smart Features: Auto Battery Check Indicator flashes the reticle upon start-up, and the sight offers programmable auto shut-down after 8 hours (configurable to 4 hours).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Elevate your shooting experience with the XPS series. Its remarkable compactness, lightweight build, and unmatched performance make it the ideal choice for professionals and enthusiasts alike. With the XPS, you\'ll always be prepared for whatever the situation demands.</p>'),(678591,75,1,184601,'<p><strong>Introducing the Most Compact Sight in its Class!</strong></p>\r\n<p>Experience the ultimate in compactness and convenience with our latest innovation. The XPS series red dot sight takes the concept of streamlined design to a whole new level.</p>\r\n<p>This remarkable sight is not only smaller and lighter than any other holographic weapon sight in the HWS range but also operates efficiently on a single 123 battery. With the new single battery configuration, the XPS offers an unprecedented advantage, allowing for more rail space than ever before.</p>\r\n<p>This extra room gives you the flexibility to mount rear iron sights, magnifiers, or night vision mounts alongside your XPS.</p>\r\n<p>Compact, Lightweight, and Lightning-Fast The XPS series delivers a combination of features that make it the ideal choice for your firearm platform. Its operation is centered on optics that provide transmission holography with parallax-free performance at 1x magnification, ensuring rapid target acquisition. You\'ll enjoy unlimited eye relief for an enhanced shooting experience.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Impressive Specs:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Dimensions: Measuring at just 3.5\" in length, 2\" in width, and 2.4\" in height, the XPS is impressively compact.</li>\r\n<li>Featherweight: At only 8 ounces (227 grams), it won\'t weigh you down, making it perfect for those who demand agility and precision.</li>\r\n<li>Extreme Temperature Tolerance: Designed to withstand temperatures ranging from -40 to 150 degrees Fahrenheit.</li>\r\n<li>Waterproof: Fully submersible to a depth of 10 feet, it\'s built to handle even the harshest conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Fogproof: Internal optics are sealed to prevent fogging, ensuring clear vision in various environments.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Precision Adjustments:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjust with Confidence: Each click equals 0.5 MOA (1/2 inch at 100 yards), offering precise control.</li>\r\n<li>Wide Adjustment Range: +/- 40 MOA travel for both windage and elevation adjustments.</li>\r\n<li>Secure Mounting: Compatible with 1\" Weaver or Picatinny (MIL-STD-1913) rails, ensuring a rock-solid attachment.</li>\r\n<li>Consistent Accuracy: Enjoy a return to zero, repeatable to 2 MOA after re-mounting.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Impressive Heads-Up Display Window:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Anti-Glare Coating: Optical surfaces are treated to reduce glare, providing clear sight picture even in bright conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Generous Field of View: A field of view of 30 yards at 100 yards with a 4\" eye relief ensures you maintain situational awareness.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Electrical Excellence:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Brightness Control: Adjust your reticle with a wide range from the brightest to the lowest settings, with 20 options available.</li>\r\n<li>Long Battery Life: Powered by a single 123 lithium battery, the XPS boasts 600 continuous hours at nominal setting 12.</li>\r\n<li>Smart Features: Auto Battery Check Indicator flashes the reticle upon start-up, and the sight offers programmable auto shut-down after 8 hours (configurable to 4 hours).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Elevate your shooting experience with the XPS series. Its remarkable compactness, lightweight build, and unmatched performance make it the ideal choice for professionals and enthusiasts alike. With the XPS, you\'ll always be prepared for whatever the situation demands.</p>'),(678590,76,0,184601,'<ul>\r\n<li>Brightness Control: Adjust your reticle with a wide range from the brightest to the lowest settings, with 20 options available.</li>\r\n<li>Long Battery Life: Powered by a single 123 lithium battery, the XPS boasts 600 continuous hours at nominal setting 12.</li>\r\n<li>Smart Features: Auto Battery Check Indicator flashes the reticle upon start-up, and the sight offers programmable auto shut-down after 8 hours (configurable to 4 hours).</li>\r\n</ul>'),(678592,76,1,184601,'<ul>\r\n<li>Brightness Control: Adjust your reticle with a wide range from the brightest to the lowest settings, with 20 options available.</li>\r\n<li>Long Battery Life: Powered by a single 123 lithium battery, the XPS boasts 600 continuous hours at nominal setting 12.</li>\r\n<li>Smart Features: Auto Battery Check Indicator flashes the reticle upon start-up, and the sight offers programmable auto shut-down after 8 hours (configurable to 4 hours).</li>\r\n</ul>'),(672833,75,0,184671,'<p>Designed for youth and smaller shooters, Walker\'s® Razor Compact Electronic Muffs feature a low-profile design that provides a secure and comfortable fit.</p>\r\n<p>Plus, they\'re equipped with Sound Activated Compression Technology that protects your ears from loud gunfire, while still allowing you to hear range commands and other shooters.</p>\r\n<p>Low-profile ear cups<br />Hi-gain Omni Directional microphone<br />Sound Activated Compression ? 0.02 second reaction time<br />Low noise / frequency tuned for natural sound clarity<br />Perforated headband for excellent comfort<br />Compact folding design<br />Recessed volume control knob<br />External battery door<br />Runs on 2 AAA batteries (included)</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(676010,75,1,184671,'<p>Designed for youth and smaller shooters, Walker\'s® Razor Compact Electronic Muffs feature a low-profile design that provides a secure and comfortable fit.</p>\r\n<p>Plus, they\'re equipped with Sound Activated Compression Technology that protects your ears from loud gunfire, while still allowing you to hear range commands and other shooters.</p>\r\n<p>Low-profile ear cups<br />Hi-gain Omni Directional microphone<br />Sound Activated Compression ? 0.02 second reaction time<br />Low noise / frequency tuned for natural sound clarity<br />Perforated headband for excellent comfort<br />Compact folding design<br />Recessed volume control knob<br />External battery door<br />Runs on 2 AAA batteries (included)</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(672834,76,0,184671,'<p>Low-profile ear cups<br />Hi-gain Omni Directional microphone<br />Sound Activated Compression ? 0.02 second reaction time<br />Low noise / frequency tuned for natural sound clarity</p>'),(676011,76,1,184671,'<p>Low-profile ear cups<br />Hi-gain Omni Directional microphone<br />Sound Activated Compression ? 0.02 second reaction time<br />Low noise / frequency tuned for natural sound clarity</p>'),(658202,75,1,184677,'<p><strong>For all those who camp, hunt or spend time afield. </strong></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>The Campanion works just as happily splitting out kindling as it does prying apart joints and skinning game, not to mention chopping onions for the campfire chili! </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Sold with a MOLLE compatible hard plastic sheath and Ultramid® handles. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Becker Knives \"Work for a living\". Made in the USA.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><br />• Weight: 1 lbs</p>\r\n<p><br />• Blade Type: Fixed Blade</p>\r\n<p><br />• Blade Length: 5.25 inches</p>\r\n<p><br />• Overall length: 10.5 inches</p>\r\n<p><br />• Edge Angles: 20 Degrees</p>\r\n<p><br />• Shape: Drop Point</p>\r\n<p><br />• Tang Stamp: KA-BAR/BK&amp;T</p>\r\n<p><br />• Knife Material: 1095 Cro-Van</p>\r\n<p><br />• Grind: Flat</p>\r\n<p><br />• Handle Material: Ultramid®</p>\r\n<p><br />• Rockwell Hardness: 56-58</p>\r\n<p><br />• Knife Country of Origin: United States</p>\r\n<p><br />• Sheath Country of Origin: Taiwan</p>\r\n<p><br />• Blade Thickness: 0.25 inches</p>\r\n<p><br />• Blade Width: 1.625 inches</p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(658203,76,1,184677,'<p>The Campanion works just as happily splitting out kindling as it does prying apart joints and skinning game, not to mention chopping onions for the campfire chili! </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><br />• Blade Type: Fixed Blade</p>\r\n<p><br />• Blade Length: 5.25 inches</p>\r\n<p><br />• Overall length: 10.5 inches</p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(672827,75,1,184735,'<p>Demand truly long-range precision and a premium feature set from the Trijicon AccuPoint® 4-24x50.</p>\r\n<p>The impressive magnification range offers versatility, with the Duplex reticle designed for accurate shot placement.</p>\r\n<p>Fully multi-coated broadband anti-reflective glass, outstanding low-light performance, and precise, repeatable adjusters make this scope the optimal choice for long-range hunting and shooting.</p>\r\n<p>Length x Width x Height:14.4 in x 2.9 in x 2.4 in (365.76mm x 73.66mm x 60.96mm)<br />Weight: 26.8 oz. (759.77g)<br />Magnification: 4-24x<br />Objective Size: 50mm<br />Tube Size: 30mm<br />Reticle Pattern: Duplex w/ Green Dot<br />Day Reticle Color: Green<br />Focal Plane: Second<br />Illumination Source: Tritium / Fiber Optic<br />Power Source: Tritium / Fiber Optic<br />Adjustment: 1/4 MOA per click<br />Adjustment Range: 100 MOA Elevation, 70 MOA Windage<br />Eye Relief: 3.1 in.-3.8 in. (78.74mm-96.52mm)<br />Exit Pupil: 0.33 in.-0.08 in. (8.38mm-2.03mm)<br />Field of View (degrees): 5.43°-0.91°<br />Field of View (feet): 28.5 ft.-4.7 ft. @ 100 yds. (9.5-1.57m @ 100m)<br />Housing Material: 6061 Aircraft Grade Aluminum<br />Finish: Satin Black</p>'),(672828,76,1,184735,'<p>Magnification: 4-24x<br />Objective Size: 50mm<br />Tube Size: 30mm<br />Reticle Pattern: Duplex w/ Green Dot<br />Day Reticle Color: Green</p>'),(644558,75,1,184736,'<p><strong>Made from natural materials, the TenPoint String Wax and Conditioner prevents bowstring damage. </strong></p>\r\n<p>Available in a chapstick-style tube, the TenPoint String Wax can be easily applied to your string by wiping it up and down</p>'),(644559,76,1,184736,'<p><strong>Made from natural materials, the TenPoint String Wax and Conditioner is a preventative patience tool that can be applied to your crossbow string. </strong></p>\r\n<p>• Available in a chapstick-style tube, the TenPoint String Wax can be easily applied to your string by wiping it up and down.</p>\r\n<p>•Maintain optimal shooting performance and equipment safety with the TenPoint String Wax.</p>'),(388383,75,0,184755,'<p><span>Schrade® Liner Lock Folding Knife, Stone Washed 9Cr18MoV High Carbon Stainless Steel Partially Serrated Drop Point Blade with Ambidextrous Thumb Knobs and Index Flipper, Black G-10 Handle with Stone Washed Aluminum Overlay, Spine &amp; Grip Jimping, Lanyard Slot, Glass Break, and Pocket Clip</span><br /><br /><span>• Overall Length: 7.80\"</span><br /><span>• Handle Length: 4.60\"</span><br /><span>• Blade Length: 3.20\"</span><br /><span>• Overall Weight: 5.10 oz</span><br /><span>• Steel: 9Cr18MoV High Carbon Stainless Steel</span><br /><span>• Handle Material: G-10 Handle with Aluminum Overlay</span></p>'),(388381,75,1,184755,'<p><span>Schrade® Liner Lock Folding Knife, Stone Washed 9Cr18MoV High Carbon Stainless Steel Partially Serrated Drop Point Blade with Ambidextrous Thumb Knobs and Index Flipper, Black G-10 Handle with Stone Washed Aluminum Overlay, Spine &amp; Grip Jimping, Lanyard Slot, Glass Break, and Pocket Clip</span><br /><br /><span>• Overall Length: 7.80\"</span><br /><span>• Handle Length: 4.60\"</span><br /><span>• Blade Length: 3.20\"</span><br /><span>• Overall Weight: 5.10 oz</span><br /><span>• Steel: 9Cr18MoV High Carbon Stainless Steel</span><br /><span>• Handle Material: G-10 Handle with Aluminum Overlay</span></p>'),(388384,76,0,184755,'<p>Overall Length: 7.80\"<br />Handle Length: 4.60\"<br />Blade Length: 3.20\"</p>'),(388382,76,1,184755,'<p>Overall Length: 7.80\"<br />Handle Length: 4.60\"<br />Blade Length: 3.20\"</p>'),(678544,75,0,184825,'<p>This kit is designed to address the most common firearm maintenance tasks. It includes a magnetic-tipped hex bit driver and a variety of tool bits to service different fasteners. Lengthening attachments make many hard-to-reach adjustments possible. All these crucial components are contained in a rugged, latched case for easy storage and transport.</p>'),(678545,76,0,184825,'<li>Use this 36-piece gunsmith kit to address the most common firearm maintenance tasks.</li>\r\n<li>Store all 36 pieces</li>\r\n<li>Blow-molded hard shell case that makes organization</li>\r\n<li>Transportation of this kit quick and easy.</li>\r\n'),(672831,75,1,184838,'<p><strong>Elevate Your Shooting Precision with the Trijicon RMR Type 2 LED Sight</strong></p>\r\n<p>Experience a new level of precision and accuracy with the Trijicon RMR (Ruggedized Miniature Reflex) Type 2, a sight engineered to withstand the harshest conditions, designed to be as rugged as the legendary ACOG. The RM02 is your ultimate companion for enhancing shooting performance.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Unmatched Durability:</strong> Crafted from rugged forged aluminum, the Trijicon RMR Type 2 is built to last. Its robust construction ensures it can handle the rigors of any mission or hunting expedition while remaining surprisingly lightweight.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Crystal-Clear Optics:</strong> With 1x magnification, this LED sight delivers exceptional clarity and a 6.5 MOA red dot reticle, making target acquisition quick and precise.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Easy Windage and Elevation Adjustments: </strong>The RMR Type 2 features user-friendly adjusters with audible clicks, allowing you to make rapid windage and elevation adjustments with confidence.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Long Battery Life:</strong> Powered by a single standard CR2032 lithium battery, this sight offers up to 2 years of typical use, extending to 5 years in dark storage conditions when used at 70ºF (21ºC). Please note that extreme temperatures may affect battery performance.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Versatile Application:</strong> Whether you\'re in the military, law enforcement, or engaged in hunting pursuits, the Trijicon RMR Type 2 is the go-to choice for improving your shooting capabilities. It excels in various scenarios, helping you achieve your mission objectives.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Compact and Lightweight: </strong>Measuring just 45mm in length and weighing a mere 1.2 ounces (with battery), the RMR Type 2 won\'t add unnecessary bulk to your firearm.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Specs:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Magnification: 1x</li>\r\n<li>Bullet Drop Compensator: No</li>\r\n<li>Length (in): 45mm</li>\r\n<li>Weight (oz): 1.2 oz w/ Battery</li>\r\n<li>Illumination Source: LED</li>\r\n<li>Reticle Pattern: 6.5 MOA Dot</li>\r\n<li>Day Reticle Color: Red</li>\r\n<li>Night Reticle Color: Red</li>\r\n<li>Bindon Aiming Concept: No</li>\r\n<li>Adjustment @ 100 yards (clicks/in): 1</li>\r\n<li>Housing Material: Forged Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Batteries: 1 CR2032 Lithium Battery</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Take your shooting game to the next level with the Trijicon RMR Type 2. It\'s not just a sight; it\'s a tool that empowers you to perform at your best, no matter the conditions. Invest in precision, invest in Trijicon.</p>\r\n<p> </p>'),(672832,76,1,184838,'<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Magnification: 1x</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bullet Drop Compensator: No</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Length (in): 45mm</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Weight (oz): 1.2 oz w/ Battery</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Illumination Source: LED</span></li>\r\n</ul>'),(382727,85,0,184873,'Barnett Explorer Xp380, Barnett crossbows, archery, '),(658253,85,1,184873,'Barnett Explorer Xp380, Barnett crossbows, archery, '),(644485,75,1,184875,'<p><strong>GutCheck® Highly reflective Arrow Wrap allows you to quickly and easily find your arrow or bolt in dark or dim lighting. </strong></p>\r\n<p>Just shine a flashlight in the direction of the arrow.</p>\r\n<p>The bundle comes in yellow, red, silver and green.</p>\r\n<p>Great way to find your arrow or bolt in low light conditions.</p>'),(644486,76,1,184875,'<p><strong>Complete with three broadheads per package. </strong></p>\r\n<p>• 100-grain field tested and tuned</p>\r\n<p>• Includes safety carrying case</p>'),(643333,75,1,184962,'<p><strong>The Wicked Ridge Range 360 is a premier-level crossbow that comes with everything needed to enter the crossbow shooting sport. </strong></p>\r\n<p>A fully integrated ACUdraw cocking device decreases the pulling power required to cock the Wicked Ridge Range 360 by up to 50%.</p>\r\n<p>With the ability to shoot up to 360 feet per second, the Wicked Ridge Range also includes a state-of-the-art shooting scope with fully coated lenses, 3x optics, and multiple lines to increase accuracy.</p>\r\n<p>In addition, each bow includes integrated safety wings that serve as a shooting safety.</p>'),(643334,76,1,184962,'<p><strong>The Rampage 360 Crossbow comes with TenPoint’s 3x Multi-Line Scope, our built-in ACUdraw 50 Cocking Device, three XX75 Aluminum Arrows &amp; a 3-Arrow Quiver. </strong></p>\r\n<p>• Economic and user friendly crossbow that includes everything needed to enter the shooting sport</p>\r\n<p>• Advanced Optics - the 3x optics feature a compact but ultra accurate 8.5\" shooting scope with calibrated crosshairs at 20, 30, and 40 yards</p>'),(678105,75,0,185010,'<p>This nut fits our extension tubes and is designed to fit your shotgun. Matte black.</p>'),(643213,75,1,185051,'<p><strong>The Carbon Express Piledriver Crossbolts are built for outdoorsmen looking to take their archery hunt to the next level. </strong></p>\r\n<p>Prepare to shoot hard, fast, and straight with Carbon Express thanks to the incredible takedown power delivered from an arrow carrying a heaping pile of kinetic energy.</p>\r\n<p>The 20\" arrows are carbon constructed, expertly tuned, and tested to maintain optimal shooting performance.</p>\r\n<p>Lighted nocks come in three packs allowing hunters to fill the quiver.</p>\r\n<p>Each arrow is fletched with a four-inch vane that maintains a straight, hard-hitting shooting performance.</p>'),(643214,76,1,185051,'<p><strong>Designed for the outdoors person looking for the ultimate hunting arrow  </strong></p>\r\n<p>• Constructed from carbon which increases flight path and target impact</p>\r\n<p>• Fletched with four inch shooting vanes</p>\r\n<p>• Lighted nocks that stay secure to the bow string</p>\r\n<p>• Arrows can have light turned off and on easily</p>');
